values
  ('908624607066364708', 'Togo', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Adrián Caetano, Juan Manuel Apolo, Federico Moreira', 'Adrián Caetano', 'Diego Alonso, Tito Prieto, Catalina Arrillaga, Luis Alberto Acosta, Marcos Da Costa, José Pagano, Sabrina Valiente, Federico Morosini', null, 'Togo just wants to watch his neighbors'' homes, wash their cars and clean up their sidewalks. But the drug traffickers want more from him.', 'Togo just wants to watch his neighbors'' homes, wash their cars and clean up their sidewalks. But the drug traffickers want more from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBvHFU97cmep48zbl5X85gvXCn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:884363'),
  ('828206865863681746', 'Toilet', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Naoko Ogigami', 'Naoko Ogigami', 'Masako Motai, Alex House, Tatiana Maslany, David Rendall, Stefanie Drummond, Fuad Ahmed, Elena Juatco, Nicole Stamp', null, 'A 30-something Gundam fan and engineer is forced to live with his recluse brother Maury and younger sister Lisa to take care of their Japanese grandmother after their mother''s funeral.', 'A 30-something Gundam fan and engineer is forced to live with his recluse brother Maury and younger sister Lisa to take care of their Japanese grandmother after their mother''s funeral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4scaqGOzwXPqKag6IuInN7oah1p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90992'),
  ('754145373353046036', 'Toilet', 2022, 'Drama', 'Gabriele Pignotta, Francisco Gaete Vega', 'Gabriele Pignotta', 'Gabriele Pignotta, Vanessa Incontrada, Francesco Pannofino', null, 'Flavio Bretagna has the most important business meeting of his life. Between client calls, his secretary''s voicemails, and his ex-wife''s calls, Flavio drives toward the opportunity he''s been waiting for. Caught up in a barrage of phone calls, he doesn''t realize he''s taken the wrong turn and stops at a small rest stop. Still on the phone, frantically distracted, he goes to the bathroom, but when he tries to leave, the door is locked. He screams for help, but no one answers. There''s not a soul around. Flavio Bretagna is alone, locked in the bathroom of a remote rest stop, and has no idea where he is. Outside, his life goes on without him: the job opportunity he''s been waiting for, his daughter''s birthday, with whom he''s trying to rekindle his relationship. Time passes, but the situation remains unchanged. Will Flavio manage not to lose everything?', 'Flavio Bretagna has the most important business meeting of his life. Between client calls, his secretary''s voicemails, and his ex-wife''s calls, Flavio drives toward the opportunity he''s been waiting for. Caught up in a barrage of phone calls, he doesn''t realize he''s taken the wrong turn and stops at a small rest stop. Still on the phone, frantically distracted, he goes to the bathroom, but when he tries to leave, the door is locked. He screams for help, but no one answers. There''s not a soul around. Flavio Bretagna is alone, locked in the bathroom of a remote rest stop, and has no idea where he is. Outside, his life goes on without him: the job opportunity he''s been waiting for, his daughter''s birthday, with whom he''s trying to rekindle his relationship. Time passes, but the situation remains unchanged. Will Flavio manage not to lose everything?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/claUw0I9D487md0Lm6fNTZFF3K1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:992016'),
  ('726381071535874201', 'Toilet: A Love Story', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Shree Narayan Singh, Anshuman Mahaley', 'Garima Wahal', 'Akshay Kumar, Bhumi Pednekar, Anupam Kher, Sudhir Pandey, Rajesh Sharma, Shubha Khote, Sachin Khedekar, Sana Khaan', null, 'A woman threatens to leave her husband unless he installs a toilet in their home. To win back her love and respect, he heads out on a journey to fight against the backward society.', 'A woman threatens to leave her husband unless he installs a toilet in their home. To win back her love and respect, he heads out on a journey to fight against the backward society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YUBka56t4HcHLVMGnGA1WizpMV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441875'),
  ('900790721614856189', 'Tokatçı', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Natuk Baytan, Kamil Renklidere, Zuhal Üstüntaş', 'Suphi Tekniker', 'Kemal Sunal, Şevket Altuğ, Ali Şen, Ünal Gürel, Nazan Saatçi, Şeref Çokşeker, Selahattin Fırat, Zeki Sezer', null, 'A tragicomedy dramatizing how an innocent villager is driven into the crime world only to collect enough cash to make his biggest dream come true: Return to his village home and marry the girl next door.', 'A tragicomedy dramatizing how an innocent villager is driven into the crime world only to collect enough cash to make his biggest dream come true: Return to his village home and marry the girl next door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k06pQoVEKr9sOC8N63ECLXcB8gF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123611'),
  ('514195329837693510', 'Tokio Jokio', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Norm McCabe', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'A "captured" Japanese newsreel. Civilian defense shows an aircraft spotter painting spots on aircraft and a fire prevention HQ that already burned down. Kitchen Hints shows the construction of a sandwich from bread and meat ration cards. Poisonalities in the News shows Yamamoto walking on stilts and boasting of plans for the White House, contrasted with the room reserved for him: an electric chair. A submarine, launched 3 weeks ahead of schedule, is still being built. A plane''s new landing gear is a little man on a tricycle. A minesweeper uses a giant broom.', 'A "captured" Japanese newsreel. Civilian defense shows an aircraft spotter painting spots on aircraft and a fire prevention HQ that already burned down. Kitchen Hints shows the construction of a sandwich from bread and meat ration cards. Poisonalities in the News shows Yamamoto walking on stilts and boasting of plans for the White House, contrasted with the room reserved for him: an electric chair. A submarine, launched 3 weeks ahead of schedule, is still being built. A plane''s new landing gear is a little man on a tricycle. A minesweeper uses a giant broom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AOUA1IGYg3VRxZ58SdBgNgKr17.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47463'),
  ('100824564159816881', 'Tokumei Sentai Go-Busters VS Kaizoku Sentai Gokaiger: The Movie', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Takayuki Shibasaki', 'Kento Shimoyama', 'Katsuhiro Suzuki, Arisa Komiya, Ryoma Baba, Hiroya Matsumoto, Ryota Ozawa, Kazuki Shimizu, Mao Ichimichi, Yui Koike', null, 'The Gokaigers were captured by the Zangyack remnants after departing to the Zangyack homeworld to destroy the empire once and for all. The Gokaigers, now working for the newly reformed Zangyack empire, return to Earth with a black Gokai Galleon and attack the Go-Busters in search of five phantom Ranger Keys which will unlock the "Greatest Power in the Universe". During the fight with the Gokaigers, the Go-Busters are able capture Navi, who tells them that the Zangyack are also working with Vaglass and that they must go back in time to save the other members of the Super Sentai Teams and defeat the alliance of Zangyack and Vaglass.', 'The Gokaigers were captured by the Zangyack remnants after departing to the Zangyack homeworld to destroy the empire once and for all. The Gokaigers, now working for the newly reformed Zangyack empire, return to Earth with a black Gokai Galleon and attack the Go-Busters in search of five phantom Ranger Keys which will unlock the "Greatest Power in the Universe". During the fight with the Gokaigers, the Go-Busters are able capture Navi, who tells them that the Zangyack are also working with Vaglass and that they must go back in time to save the other members of the Super Sentai Teams and defeat the alliance of Zangyack and Vaglass.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDZfBBhjuj8oUewB1MkIamAzJS3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178966'),
  ('1046533903210206166', 'Tòkunbọ̀', 2024, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Ramsey Nouah, Muhammad Atta Ahmed', 'Todimu Adegoke, Thecla Uzozie', 'Gideon Okeke, Chidi Mokeme, Funlola Aofiyebi-Raimi, Adunni Ade, Nobert Young, Darasimi Nadi, Ivie Okujaye, Majid Michel', 'R', 'An ex-car smuggler is given three hours to deliver a government official''s daughter to her captor — or else his family will suffer the consequences.', 'An ex-car smuggler is given three hours to deliver a government official''s daughter to her captor — or else his family will suffer the consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3xGOKXBXDux0cKOwjUT96hI8AP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1322982'),
  ('869455077836967304', 'Tokusou Sentai Dekaranger THE MOVIE: Full Blast Action', 2004, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Crime', 'Katsuya Watanabe, Noboru Takemoto, Hirofumi Ishigaki', 'Naruhisa Arakawa', 'Ryuji Sainei, Tsuyoshi Hayashi, Yosuke Ito, Ayumi Kinoshita, Mika Kikuchi, Tomokazu Yoshida, Tetsu Inada, Mako Ishino', null, 'The Dekarangers must deal with a mysterious undercover agent from another planet while trying to save her world and Earth from one of the universe''s toughest Alienizer gangs.', 'The Dekarangers must deal with a mysterious undercover agent from another planet while trying to save her world and Earth from one of the universe''s toughest Alienizer gangs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4o0yHKSy6HR7ZZNPBsAovso2IRS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200565'),
  ('162752823628167768', 'Tokusou Sentai Dekaranger VS Abaranger', 2005, 'Crime, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Tarou Sakamoto, Shingo Osawa, Shojiro Nakazawa', 'Naruhisa Arakawa', 'Ryuji Sainei, Tsuyoshi Hayashi, Yosuke Ito, Ayumi Kinoshita, Mika Kikuchi, Tomokazu Yoshida, Tetsu Inada, Mako Ishino', null, 'The Dekarangers respond to a disturbance in the city. On arriving, they find the area under attack from three brightly-coloured people. They fight them but they steal Machine Bull to chase a crow, which is apparently their enemy. They crash and are arrested by the Dekarangers. At DekaBase, the Dekarangers discover that their prisoners are Bakuryuu Sentai Abaranger.', 'The Dekarangers respond to a disturbance in the city. On arriving, they find the area under attack from three brightly-coloured people. They fight them but they steal Machine Bull to chase a crow, which is apparently their enemy. They crash and are arrested by the Dekarangers. At DekaBase, the Dekarangers discover that their prisoners are Bakuryuu Sentai Abaranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4QCA9DvgtmT3M8ugwn0DrVs0fk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200560'),
  ('285102635582712298', 'Tokyo 1958', 1958, 'Documentary', 'Hiroshi Teshigahara, Kanzaburo Mushanokoji, Kyushiro Kusakabe', 'Susumu Hani, Ryuichiro Sakisaka, Hiroshi Teshigahara', 'Donald Richie', null, 'A collaborative, newsreel-style portrait of Tokyo in 1957–58, blending photography, animation, and historical imagery to capture the city’s labor, rituals, and nightlife at the moment it became the world’s largest metropolis.', 'A collaborative, newsreel-style portrait of Tokyo in 1957–58, blending photography, animation, and historical imagery to capture the city’s labor, rituals, and nightlife at the moment it became the world’s largest metropolis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xk2fwHdFKz4jytM2OEu8Rt996fs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105581'),
  ('414515065322261208', 'Tokyo Chorus', 1931, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Hideo Shigehara, Kenkichi Hara', 'Kōgo Noda', 'Tokihiko Okada, Emiko Yagumo, Hideo Sugawara, Hideko Takamine, Tatsuo Saitō, Chōko Iida, Takeshi Sakamoto, Reikō Tani', null, 'In Depression-era Tokyo, a young man struggles to provide for his family after he is fired from his job.', 'In Depression-era Tokyo, a young man struggles to provide for his family after he is fired from his job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koagfZhAbaphDG4nkFbzw0Axo0i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112882'),
  ('852372691386521625', 'Tokyo Drifter', 1966, 'Thriller, Crime, Action', 'Seijun Suzuki, Shigeyoshi Mine, Masami Kuzū', 'Kōhan Kawauchi', 'Tetsuya Watari, Chieko Matsubara, Hideaki Nitani, Tamio Kawachi, Eiji Gō, Tomoko Hamakawa, Takeshi Yoshida, Isao Tamagawa', null, 'After yakuza boss Kurata dissolves his own criminal empire, a rival kingpin offers a position to Kurata''s top operative, Tetsuya "Phoenix Tetsu" Hondo. When the fiercely loyal Tetsu declines, Otsuka taps unstoppable Tatsuzo the "Viper", a ruthless gun-for-hire, to assassinate him. As the Viper trails his target through the countryside, the agile Phoenix Tetsu grows concerned that one of his former associates has betrayed him.', 'After yakuza boss Kurata dissolves his own criminal empire, a rival kingpin offers a position to Kurata''s top operative, Tetsuya "Phoenix Tetsu" Hondo. When the fiercely loyal Tetsu declines, Otsuka taps unstoppable Tatsuzo the "Viper", a ruthless gun-for-hire, to assassinate him. As the Viper trails his target through the countryside, the agile Phoenix Tetsu grows concerned that one of his former associates has betrayed him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkscSldTB6FGUMMLnInUfKYLfPR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45706'),
  ('797252980103751264', 'Tokyo Eyes', 1998, 'Romance, Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-Pierre Limosin, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Jean-Pierre Limosin, Santiago Amigorena, Yuji Sakamoto', 'Shinji Takeda, Hinano Yoshikawa, Kaori Mizushima, Tetta Sugimoto, Ren Osugi, Masayuki Yui, Moro Morooka, Ken Mitsuishi', null, 'The police are tracking a man who shoots at people. But the young sister of a detective finds that he''s not the mad vigilante portrayed in newspapers.', 'The police are tracking a man who shoots at people. But the young sister of a detective finds that he''s not the mad vigilante portrayed in newspapers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VR0pPwqu7yliYJbtbouXkjAF0J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49918'),
  ('6075760021848484', 'Tokyo Family', 2013, 'Drama', 'Yoji Yamada, Masashi Chikamori', 'Yoji Yamada, Emiko Hiramatsu', 'Isao Hashizume, Kazuko Yoshiyuki, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Yu Aoi, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Masahiko Nishimura, Yui Natsukawa, Tomoko Nakajima', null, 'An elderly couple journey to Tokyo to visit their grown children, only to find them preoccupied and self-involved.', 'An elderly couple journey to Tokyo to visit their grown children, only to find them preoccupied and self-involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1AoAAyO4LuIu89WCJF6SzNpw8bI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187662'),
  ('878790040508462193', 'Tokyo Fiancée', 2014, 'Romance', 'Stefan Liberski, Asako Furukata, Valérie Wery', 'Stefan Liberski', 'Pauline Étienne, Taichi Inoue, Julie Le Breton, Alice de Lencquesaing, Akimi Ota, Hiroki Kageyama, Tokio Yokoi, Hiromi Asai', null, 'A Japanophile young Belgian woman in Tokyo falls into a whirlwind romance with a Francophile Japanese student, in this charming and tender tale of young love and cultural discovery.', 'A Japanophile young Belgian woman in Tokyo falls into a whirlwind romance with a Francophile Japanese student, in this charming and tender tale of young love and cultural discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIhxwwVQWvtx4B8Xbfnk4g0W7kr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287509'),
  ('573456877965328321', 'Tokyo Fist', 1995, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Shinya Tsukamoto, Kiyohide Otani', 'Shinya Tsukamoto', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Kaori Fujii, Kôji Tsukamoto, Naomasa Musaka, Koichi Wajima, Tomorowo Taguchi, Nobu Kanaoka, Naoto Takenaka', null, 'A businessman, Tsuda, runs into a childhood friend, Kojima, on the subway. Kojima is working as a semiprofessional boxer. Tsuda soon begins to suspect that Kojima might be having an affair with his fiancée Hizuru. After an altercation, Tsuda begins training rigorously himself, leading to an extremely bloody, violent confrontation.', 'A businessman, Tsuda, runs into a childhood friend, Kojima, on the subway. Kojima is working as a semiprofessional boxer. Tsuda soon begins to suspect that Kojima might be having an affair with his fiancée Hizuru. After an altercation, Tsuda begins training rigorously himself, leading to an extremely bloody, violent confrontation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKkY3FrYcAVOfXyGLj66NUXN5I8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41577'),
  ('308693510776745641', 'Tokyo Ghoul ''S''', 2019, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Takuya Kawasaki, Kazuhiko Hiramaki, Makoto Yokoyama', 'Chuji Mikasano', 'Masataka Kubota, Shota Matsuda, Maika Yamamoto, Shunya Shiraishi, Kai Ogasawara, Hiyori Sakurada, Nobuyuki Suzuki, Minosuke Bando', null, 'Now a member of Anteiku, Ken Kaneki grows closer to the ghouls around him. Determined to protect his new home against anti-ghoul forces, he trains his powers in secret. But when the infamous gourmet, Shū Tsukiyama, wishes to savour some half-ghoul flavour, Kaneki''s training is put to test of a lifetime.', 'Now a member of Anteiku, Ken Kaneki grows closer to the ghouls around him. Determined to protect his new home against anti-ghoul forces, he trains his powers in secret. But when the infamous gourmet, Shū Tsukiyama, wishes to savour some half-ghoul flavour, Kaneki''s training is put to test of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMTiDEye1BwnQP8J1hM3G16EEmX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549787'),
  ('563052937486306211', 'Tokyo Ghoul: Jack', 2015, 'Horror, Action, Animation, Drama', 'Soichi Shimada, Teruyuki Kawase, Atsuko Nakajima', 'Chuji Mikasano', 'Saori Hayami, Daisuke Namikawa, Ryohei Kimura, Rumi Okubo, Tatsuhisa Suzuki', null, 'Who needs school, who needs baseball, and who needs friends? That''s the attitude of high school delinquent, Taishi Fura, who became a loner after falling out with his peers. One day, he witnesses the brutal attack of a ghoul, which left one of his former friends in the hospital and the other dead. Determined to avenge them, Fura decides to pursue the man-eating monster. His efforts allow him to cross paths with Kishou Arima, a quiet student who also attends his high school. Arima, however, is no ordinary student. Despite his young age, he is a full-fledged investigator of the CCG, a government task force that strives to deal with the ghoul threat. Together, Fura and Arima hunt down the ghoul, known as Lantern, but it soon becomes apparent the monster may be closer than anyone suspects. In this side story, Tokyo Ghoul: "Jack" offers a glimpse into the past of Kishou Arima, well before he ever became the CCG''s feared God of Death.', 'Who needs school, who needs baseball, and who needs friends? That''s the attitude of high school delinquent, Taishi Fura, who became a loner after falling out with his peers. One day, he witnesses the brutal attack of a ghoul, which left one of his former friends in the hospital and the other dead. Determined to avenge them, Fura decides to pursue the man-eating monster. His efforts allow him to cross paths with Kishou Arima, a quiet student who also attends his high school. Arima, however, is no ordinary student. Despite his young age, he is a full-fledged investigator of the CCG, a government task force that strives to deal with the ghoul threat. Together, Fura and Arima hunt down the ghoul, known as Lantern, but it soon becomes apparent the monster may be closer than anyone suspects. In this side story, Tokyo Ghoul: "Jack" offers a glimpse into the past of Kishou Arima, well before he ever became the CCG''s feared God of Death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JjfOrZQAmdsR9bPKlwmL6u0eaG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483685'),
  ('219021700789180822', 'Tokyo Gore Police', 2008, 'Horror, Action, Science Fiction', 'Yoshihiro Nishimura, Shu G. Momose', 'Yoshihiro Nishimura, Kengo Kaji, Maki Mizui', 'Eihi Shiina, Itsuji Itao, Yukihide Benny, Jiji Bû, Ikuko Sawada, Cay Izumi, Keisuke Horibe, Shun Sugata', 'NR', 'In a futuristic Tokyo where police have been privatized and bitter self-mutilation is so casual that advertising is often specially geared to the ''cutter'' demographic, Ruka is on a mission to avenge her father''s assassination. Ruka is a cop from a squad whose goal is to destroy homicidal mutant humans known as ''engineers'', that possess the ability to transform any injury to a weapon in and of itself.', 'In a futuristic Tokyo where police have been privatized and bitter self-mutilation is so casual that advertising is often specially geared to the ''cutter'' demographic, Ruka is on a mission to avenge her father''s assassination. Ruka is a cop from a squad whose goal is to destroy homicidal mutant humans known as ''engineers'', that possess the ability to transform any injury to a weapon in and of itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smQV5DgyUVho8d1R67XnU1BkJAV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16061'),
  ('1139267396214754163', 'Tokyo Idols', 2017, 'Music, Documentary', 'Van Royko, Kyoko Miyake', 'Kyoko Miyake', 'Rio Hiiragi, Yuzuha Oda, Masayoshi Sakai', null, 'This exploration of Japan''s fascination with girl bands and their music follows an aspiring pop singer and her fans, delving into the cultural obsession with young female sexuality and the growing disconnect between men and women in hypermodern societies.', 'This exploration of Japan''s fascination with girl bands and their music follows an aspiring pop singer and her fans, delving into the cultural obsession with young female sexuality and the growing disconnect between men and women in hypermodern societies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2U9zEqSO7ulORWjNRr3RbgoJgLb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433092'),
  ('927040461164173088', 'Tokyo Joe', 1949, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Charles Lawton Jr., Stuart Heisler, Morris Stoloff', 'Cyril Hume, Bertram Millhauser', 'Humphrey Bogart, Alexander Knox, Florence Marly, Sessue Hayakawa, Jerome Courtland, Gordon Jones, Teru Shimada, Hideo Mori', 'NR', 'An American veteran returns to Tokyo to try to pick up the threads of his pre-World War II life there, but finds himself squeezed between criminals and the authorities.', 'An American veteran returns to Tokyo to try to pick up the threads of his pre-World War II life there, but finds himself squeezed between criminals and the authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXHcILigqhV3y1NxwAyGFcIaGNm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70113'),
  ('260458291907296335', 'Tokyo Living Dead Idol', 2018, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Yûki Kumagai', 'Yûki Kumagai', 'Nana Asakawa, Yumeri Abe, Lunar Ozawa, Asami, Sana Hoshimori, Yuki Izawa, Shogen, Tatsumaru Tachibana', null, 'One day an idol is bitten by a zombie and before she is taken into custody, she runs away. She only has 72 hours left until she becomes one, so she tries to find the zombie serum, but high school girl zombie hunter and zombies attack her. Will she make it to the destination within the time limit?', 'One day an idol is bitten by a zombie and before she is taken into custody, she runs away. She only has 72 hours left until she becomes one, so she tries to find the zombie serum, but high school girl zombie hunter and zombies attack her. Will she make it to the destination within the time limit?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28mjEQ5bByHK3o1TnL4jsFGRb90.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526159'),
  ('1087367837363717181', 'Tokyo March', 1929, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Tatsuyuki Yokota, 松沢又男', 'Chiio Kimura', 'Shizue Natsukawa, 一木札二, Eiji Takagi, Isamu Kosugi, Takako Irie, Taeko Sakuma, Hisako Takihana, 神田俊二', null, 'A classic melodramatic love tragedy addressing social inequality in Taishō-era Japan, The nostalgic scenes of 1920s Tokyo provides a valuable visual experience set against the background of the title song, "Tokyo March." (Sadly, less than a half hour of the footage has been recovered and restored.)', 'A classic melodramatic love tragedy addressing social inequality in Taishō-era Japan, The nostalgic scenes of 1920s Tokyo provides a valuable visual experience set against the background of the title song, "Tokyo March." (Sadly, less than a half hour of the footage has been recovered and restored.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4r9rmIhfsx4Qepa4R0jb6EPqZxA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36894'),
  ('609416155673892207', 'Tokyo Marigold', 2001, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jun Ichikawa, Tatsuhiko Kobayashi', 'Mariko Hayashi', 'Rena Tanaka, Yukiyoshi Ozawa, Kirin Kiki, Yoichiro Saito, Akira Terao, Hikari Ishida, Sayoko Kobayashi, Yoko Chosokabe', null, 'Eriko – lonely, aimless and self-absorbed – falls for Tamura. Despite knowing that he is waiting for his girlfriend to return from overseas, she requests to enter into a relationship with him for just one year.', 'Eriko – lonely, aimless and self-absorbed – falls for Tamura. Despite knowing that he is waiting for his girlfriend to return from overseas, she requests to enter into a relationship with him for just one year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acY8Rl5AmEvk5Zbvdf2N204yQN8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255727'),
  ('966802588313088667', 'Tokyo Mater', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'John Lasseter, Rob Gibbs, Victor Navone', 'Bobby Rubio, Rob Gibbs, John Lasseter', 'Larry the Cable Guy, Keith Ferguson, Elissa Knight, Guido Quaroni, Lori Alan, Mickie McGowan, Danny Mann, Bob Scott', null, 'A routine tow lands Mater in Tokyo, where he is challenged to a drift-style race against a nefarious gang leader and his posse of ninjas. With the help of his friend, ''Dragon'' Lightning McQueen, and some special modifications, Mater attempts to drift to victory and become Tow-ke-O Mater, King of all Drifters.', 'A routine tow lands Mater in Tokyo, where he is challenged to a drift-style race against a nefarious gang leader and his posse of ninjas. With the help of his friend, ''Dragon'' Lightning McQueen, and some special modifications, Mater attempts to drift to victory and become Tow-ke-O Mater, King of all Drifters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGwVl4R4RD2rV8NHWthpjemA1zU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24328'),
