  ('244964344704991922', 'Tokyo Oasis', 2011, 'Drama', 'Kayo Nakamura, Kana Matsumoto, Hitoshi Ohashi', 'Kayo Nakamura, Tomoko Shiroki, Kana Matsumoto', 'Satomi Kobayashi, Ryo Kase, Tomoyo Harada, Haru Kuroki, Mikako Ichikawa, Masako Motai, Ken Mitsuishi', null, 'In Tokyo, actress Touko leaves the filming set of her latest project and comes across three people by random chance: she gives a ride to a man named Nagano, whom she has never met before; at a small theater, runs into Kikuchi, a former screenwriter; lastly, meets Yasuko at the zoo.', 'In Tokyo, actress Touko leaves the filming set of her latest project and comes across three people by random chance: she gives a ride to a man named Nagano, whom she has never met before; at a small theater, runs into Kikuchi, a former screenwriter; lastly, meets Yasuko at the zoo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6Lu3LmysFkuoPhjrOKDfB787FK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112135'),
  ('379162285103790184', 'Tokyo Olympiad', 1965, 'Documentary', 'Kon Ichikawa, Sachio Tomizawa, Tadashi Tanaka', 'Kon Ichikawa, Yoshio Shirasaka, Natto Wada', 'Abebe Bikila, Ahmed Issa, Yoshinori Sakai, Joe Frazier, Emperor Hirohito of Japan', null, 'This impressionistic portrait of the 1964 Tokyo Summer Olympics pays as much attention to the crowds and workers as it does to the actual competitive events. Highlights include an epic pole-vaulting match between West Germany and America, and the final marathon race through Tokyo''s streets. Two athletes are highlighted: Ethiopian marathon runner Abebe Bikila, who receives his second gold medal, and runner Ahamed Isa from Chad, representing a country younger than he is.', 'This impressionistic portrait of the 1964 Tokyo Summer Olympics pays as much attention to the crowds and workers as it does to the actual competitive events. Highlights include an epic pole-vaulting match between West Germany and America, and the final marathon race through Tokyo''s streets. Two athletes are highlighted: Ethiopian marathon runner Abebe Bikila, who receives his second gold medal, and runner Ahamed Isa from Chad, representing a country younger than he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjN7zlN5vq6bgvetojjM82qWwLE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43618'),
  ('396401529103621977', 'Tokyo Park', 2011, 'Drama', 'Shinji Aoyama, Yuta Tsukinaga', 'Norihiko Goda, Masaaki Uchida, Shinji Aoyama', 'Haruma Miura, Nana Eikura, Manami Konishi, Haruka Igawa, Yo Takahashi, Shota Sometani, Satomi Nagano, Takashi Kobayashi', null, 'Koji, a university student and budding photographer, is asked by a man to secretly take pictures of his wife Yurika. As a result, his relationships with a girl who visits his part-time workplace called Tominaga and his step-sister Misaki begin to change subtly.', 'Koji, a university student and budding photographer, is asked by a man to secretly take pictures of his wife Yurika. As a result, his relationships with a girl who visits his part-time workplace called Tominaga and his step-sister Misaki begin to change subtly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjsTAMWybfxXhDpHbBgdfayjyIt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202885'),
  ('1076744111279723913', 'Tokyo Pop', 1988, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Fran Rubel Kuzui, James Hayman, Shinichiro Nakata', 'Fran Rubel Kuzui, Lynn Grossman', 'Carrie Hamilton, Diamond Yukai, Taiji Tonoyama, Tetsuro Tamba, Masumi Harukawa, Toki Shiozawa, Hiroshi Mikami, Michael Cerveris', null, 'A young rock singer is not appreciated by her band, and gets a postcard from Japan saying "wish you were here". She takes what little money she has including ex-boyfriend''s rent money and goes to Tokyo. She has numerous cross-cultural adventures and ends up singing with a Japanese rock group looking for a gaijin gimmick.', 'A young rock singer is not appreciated by her band, and gets a postcard from Japan saying "wish you were here". She takes what little money she has including ex-boyfriend''s rent money and goes to Tokyo. She has numerous cross-cultural adventures and ends up singing with a Japanese rock group looking for a gaijin gimmick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v254GL7NRJFKNyEuEoVPTYEZTen.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186379'),
