  ('709524110344346845', 'Tokyo Revengers', 2021, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Tsutomu Hanabusa, Yuta Morokaji, Tomoo Ezaki', 'Izumi Takahashi', 'Takumi Kitamura, Ryo Yoshizawa, Yuki Yamada, Yosuke Sugino, Mio Imada, Hayato Isomura, Nobuyuki Suzuki, Shotaro Mamiya', 'PG-13', 'An unemployed man learns that his ex-girlfriend was murdered. He suddenly finds himself travelling through time to his middle school years and has chance to change the future and save the girl. He aims to rise to the top of the most brutal delinquent gang.', 'An unemployed man learns that his ex-girlfriend was murdered. He suddenly finds himself travelling through time to his middle school years and has chance to change the future and save the girl. He aims to rise to the top of the most brutal delinquent gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8Q2VBt3rP0cSG3hNerIQuogLAH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:698201'),
  ('190477736516732292', 'Tokyo Revengers 2 Part 1: Bloody Halloween - Destiny', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Tsutomu Hanabusa, Tomoo Ezaki, Yuta Morokaji', 'Izumi Takahashi', 'Takumi Kitamura, Ryo Yoshizawa, Yuki Yamada, Nijiro Murakami, Kento Nagayama, Mahiro Takasugi, Mio Imada, Hiroya Shimizu', null, 'Hinata is murdered again by the Tokyo Manjikai Gang in front of Takemichi. In order to save Hinata, Takemichi travels 10 years back in time again. Takemichi has to change a key case that can save Hinata. The key case involves a sad incident that occurred to 6 men, who later formed the Tokyo Manjikai Gang.', 'Hinata is murdered again by the Tokyo Manjikai Gang in front of Takemichi. In order to save Hinata, Takemichi travels 10 years back in time again. Takemichi has to change a key case that can save Hinata. The key case involves a sad incident that occurred to 6 men, who later formed the Tokyo Manjikai Gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0ff6LqAqzD3Ecdy6xPSJJj8TRb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1057872'),
