  ('750503193857326750', 'Tokyo Serendipity', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Akiko Ohku, Yutaka Yamazaki', 'Akiko Ohku', 'Yui Aragaki, Ryuhei Matsuda, Rinko Kikuchi, Manabu Nakanishi, Pierre Taki, Noriko Eguchi, Taro Yabe, Tomona Hirota', null, 'Yui, a college student, moves in to her first own apartment, where she begins her new independent life in a big city. Soon after, the upstairs neighbor Takashi sparks her interest.', 'Yui, a college student, moves in to her first own apartment, where she begins her new independent life in a big city. Soon after, the upstairs neighbor Takashi sparks her interest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnHHIQCN7d1uCI2COEpa6BwxYNB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155895'),
  ('147189965809317215', 'Tokyo Shaking', 2021, 'Drama', 'Tatum Drouilhat, Richard Elmosnino, Grégoire Jeudy', 'Olivier Peyon, Cyril Brody', 'Karin Viard, Stéphane Bak, Yumi Narita, Charlie Dupont, Jean-François Cayrey, Philippe Uchan, Émilie Gavois-Kahn, Simon Ayache', null, 'March 11, 2011. The biggest tsunami Japan has ever experienced triggers the Fukushima disaster. Risks are being downplayed but the foreign community in Tokyo is terrified by this tragic event and the fact that no one is capable of assessing its scope. Among them, Alexandra, a French executive newly arrived from Hong Kong to work in a bank, has to face this nuclear crisis. Torn apart between fol- lowing the company’s instructions and going back to her husband and children who are still in Hong Kong, she will find herself defending honor and given word, despite the pervading terror and chaos.', 'March 11, 2011. The biggest tsunami Japan has ever experienced triggers the Fukushima disaster. Risks are being downplayed but the foreign community in Tokyo is terrified by this tragic event and the fact that no one is capable of assessing its scope. Among them, Alexandra, a French executive newly arrived from Hong Kong to work in a bank, has to face this nuclear crisis. Torn apart between fol- lowing the company’s instructions and going back to her husband and children who are still in Hong Kong, she will find herself defending honor and given word, despite the pervading terror and chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cF3DiUX4DYRbNtbRrUuX8WTmm9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785199'),
  ('1129578726866441756', 'Tokyo Slaves', 2014, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Sakichi Sato', 'Sakichi Sato, Hidehiro Ito', 'Sayaka Akimoto, Kanata Hongo, Hikaru Osawa, Yuki Yamada, Yuki Kubota, Miyuki Torii, Yousuke Saito, Yusuke Makio', null, 'Brother and sister are drawn into a thrilling game of survival, in which they use a bizarre device called SCM to turn others into their slaves.', 'Brother and sister are drawn into a thrilling game of survival, in which they use a bizarre device called SCM to turn others into their slaves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqGRmJK6UQHmuzxJOowj4xdSnUw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313263'),
