  ('210162586285106564', 'Tokyo Strangler', 2006, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Yutaka Ikejima, Yōichi Shiga', 'Kyoko Godai', 'Mayuko Sasaki, Yuria Hidaka, Kikujiro Honda, Taishi Takemoto, Kazu Itsuki, Ken''ichi Kanbe, Yutaka Ikejima, Kyoko Godai', null, 'Danger lurks around every corner. A psychopathic serial killer is tying up, raping and murdering Tokyo''s sexy young women! Kathy is trying to divorce her husband, all the while conducting a hot affair with her divorce attorney, Sean. As she walks through the park one day, she witnesses the killer disposing of the dead body of his latest victim. The killer begins stalking her, throwing her otherwise normal life into a paranoid frenzy.Mr. Pink (Yutaka Ikejima) masterfully directs this suspenseful Pink-Film retelling of Alfred Hitchcock''s Frenzy.', 'Danger lurks around every corner. A psychopathic serial killer is tying up, raping and murdering Tokyo''s sexy young women! Kathy is trying to divorce her husband, all the while conducting a hot affair with her divorce attorney, Sean. As she walks through the park one day, she witnesses the killer disposing of the dead body of his latest victim. The killer begins stalking her, throwing her otherwise normal life into a paranoid frenzy.Mr. Pink (Yutaka Ikejima) masterfully directs this suspenseful Pink-Film retelling of Alfred Hitchcock''s Frenzy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4v2TChkrzcWNlXKlmoOeaiRxo06.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321013'),
  ('810396748812012767', 'Tokyo Stray Girls', 2010, 'Drama', 'Hisayasu Satō, Kazuhiro Suzuki', 'Naoko Nishida', 'Norie Yasui, Mayu Sakuma, Hirofumi Arai, Makiko Watanabe, Minoru Torihada, Tomori Abe, Ryunosuke Kawai, Aya Kiguchi', null, 'A timid young woman who lives with her domineering mother accepts an Adult Video scout''s offer to "become somebody else" by performing in porn videos. As she rises in popularity, the boundaries between her two lives begin to disintegrate.', 'A timid young woman who lives with her domineering mother accepts an Adult Video scout''s offer to "become somebody else" by performing in porn videos. As she rises in popularity, the boundaries between her two lives begin to disintegrate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7KKcZmKeAYmOArmhFr3gzr469a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125493'),
  ('649904290859922074', 'Tokyo Towers: Mom and Me, and Sometimes Dad', 2007, 'Drama', 'Jōji Matsuoka, Norimichi Kasamatsu', 'Suzuki Matsuo', 'Joe Odagiri, Kirin Kiki, Yayako Uchida, Takako Matsu, Kaoru Kobayashi, Satoshi Tomiura, Shohei Tanaka, Kanato Tanihata', null, 'Adapted from the bestselling Japanese autobiography of the same title, this gentle coming-of-age drama concerns an adolescent boy, Boku - Masaya, torn between the inherited recklessness of his father Oton and the inherited responsibility, wisdom and emotional strength of his mother Okan. Following a period of intensely rebellious behavior, Boku learns that his mom has contracted cancer; suddenly, his mother comes to live with him in Tokyo the entire emotional landscape of his life is altered.', 'Adapted from the bestselling Japanese autobiography of the same title, this gentle coming-of-age drama concerns an adolescent boy, Boku - Masaya, torn between the inherited recklessness of his father Oton and the inherited responsibility, wisdom and emotional strength of his mother Okan. Following a period of intensely rebellious behavior, Boku learns that his mom has contracted cancer; suddenly, his mother comes to live with him in Tokyo the entire emotional landscape of his life is altered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FCU8tCmTqANYn2yv2JCCkg9DMz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40079'),
