  ('427001048689403041', 'Tokyo Train Girls 4: Young Wife''s Desires', 2006, 'Drama', 'Tadashi Kyouya, Yoshito Kimura', 'Heitaro Han', 'An Nanba, Kentaro Katsura, Meika Kitagawa, Yoji Suezaki, Sayaka Kitagawa', null, 'Akiko is the heiress of a lumber business family that spans many generations. She married Hiroshi, a company man, and was leading a plain and happy life. But dark clouds overcast Akiko’s happy life when Hiroshi starts an affair with Michiyo, an underclassman from the school Akiko attended. Then Shinji, who used to work in the family lumber business, enters her life the turmoil of men-women relationships becomes tempestuous.', 'Akiko is the heiress of a lumber business family that spans many generations. She married Hiroshi, a company man, and was leading a plain and happy life. But dark clouds overcast Akiko’s happy life when Hiroshi starts an affair with Michiyo, an underclassman from the school Akiko attended. Then Shinji, who used to work in the family lumber business, enters her life the turmoil of men-women relationships becomes tempestuous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6RzweMyL6nTgzjht6pbKDa6CO5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157526'),
  ('560986271292876687', 'Tokyo Train Girls: Private Lessons', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tadashi Kyouya', 'Han Heitard', 'Meguri Fujiura, Jiro Tanaka, Takahiro Nomura, Mina Saeki', null, 'New teacher Chihiro has been on the job for three months. She does her job with great enthusiasm, but she has a secret that nobody must know. As a student, she accumulated debt in order to keep up with her well-to-do friends. She can’t pay it back on the wages of a teacher so she started working part-time as a Chat-Lady. In front of a web camera that hides her face, she shakes her breasts and hips. By chance, her student, Kazuaki discovers the web site.', 'New teacher Chihiro has been on the job for three months. She does her job with great enthusiasm, but she has a secret that nobody must know. As a student, she accumulated debt in order to keep up with her well-to-do friends. She can’t pay it back on the wages of a teacher so she started working part-time as a Chat-Lady. In front of a web camera that hides her face, she shakes her breasts and hips. By chance, her student, Kazuaki discovers the web site.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbYbXdhQwYHBzXbI3CXjqicaxyn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65199'),
  ('1073305106418590812', 'Tokyo Trash Baby', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Ryuichi Hiroki, Masahide Iioka, Kazuhiro Suzuki', 'Shôtarô Oikawa', 'Mami Nakamura, Kazuma Suzuki, Ko Shibasaki, Tomorowo Taguchi, Sayuri Oyamada, Masahiro Toda', 'NR', 'Miyuki doesn''t need to stalk the man she''s crazy about, because he lives one floor down. Rather than approach him, she digs through his trash.', 'Miyuki doesn''t need to stalk the man she''s crazy about, because he lives one floor down. Rather than approach him, she digs through his trash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ddiSmSXaegLXPn0lnJzNtd5gCU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15496'),
  ('35969931250517775', 'Tokyo Tribe', 2014, 'Music, Science Fiction, Action, Drama, Crime', 'Sion Sono, Daisuke Soma, Go KINOMOTO', 'Sion Sono', 'Ryohei Suzuki, YOUNG DAIS, Nana Seino, Ryuta Sato, Shota Sometani, Denden, Yosuke Kubozuka, Riki Takeuchi', null, 'In an alternate Japan, territorial street gangs form opposing factions collectively known as the Tokyo Tribes. Merra, leader of the Wu-Ronz tribe of Bukuro, joins forces with heavy-hitting gangster Buppa of Buppa Town. With Buppa''s support, Merra aims to initiate a gang war between the Wu-Ronz and the Musashino Saru, and in a confrontation between the two attempts to kill Kai of the Musashino Saru. The inadvertent murder of Kai''s friend Tera (a Musashino Saru member beloved by all Tribes since before their formation) leads to the joining of forces between all of the Tribes in an all-out war against Merra and Buppa.', 'In an alternate Japan, territorial street gangs form opposing factions collectively known as the Tokyo Tribes. Merra, leader of the Wu-Ronz tribe of Bukuro, joins forces with heavy-hitting gangster Buppa of Buppa Town. With Buppa''s support, Merra aims to initiate a gang war between the Wu-Ronz and the Musashino Saru, and in a confrontation between the two attempts to kill Kai of the Musashino Saru. The inadvertent murder of Kai''s friend Tera (a Musashino Saru member beloved by all Tribes since before their formation) leads to the joining of forces between all of the Tribes in an all-out war against Merra and Buppa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpvQrnZwGvzG0moL4oMdmKMYKDB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240566'),
  ('1121828200919668225', 'Tokyo Twilight', 1957, 'Drama', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Yûharu Atsuta, Masahiro Shinoda', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Kōgo Noda', 'Setsuko Hara, Ineko Arima, Chishū Ryū, Isuzu Yamada, Teiji Takahashi, Masami Taura, Haruko Sugimura, So Yamamura', 'R', 'Two sisters find out the existence of their long-lost mother, but the younger cannot accept the fact that she was abandoned as a child.', 'Two sisters find out the existence of their long-lost mother, but the younger cannot accept the fact that she was abandoned as a child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0jpAoS01fMQDccZGS97piaNnSS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55192'),
  ('561143992993592665', 'Tokyo Vampire Hotel', 2017, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Tadashi Kuwabara, Tomoaki Iwakura, Maki Ito', 'Sion Sono', 'Kaho, Ami Tomite, Shinnosuke Mitsushima, Megumi Kagurazaka, Yumi Adachi, Joey Iwanaga, Lorena Koto, Sayaka Kotani', null, 'Manami is captured by blood thirsty trigger happy vampires, and taken to their hotel, where they keep prisoners as future meals. They are all instructed to find a partner to survive, when a vampire clan from Transylvania interferes.', 'Manami is captured by blood thirsty trigger happy vampires, and taken to their hotel, where they keep prisoners as future meals. They are all instructed to find a partner to survive, when a vampire clan from Transylvania interferes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kjos3VxBYWLAHKIMQzYhIumIqq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582394'),
  ('676637813252042176', 'Tokyo Woes', 1945, 'Animation', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Sara Berner, Mel Blanc, Frank Graham, Arthur Lake', null, 'Created for the US Navy in World War II. The Mr. Hook character was created by Hank Ketcham while at Walter Lantz Studios, where the first- and only color- Mr. Hook cartoon was produced. A wartime propaganda film about Japan and war bonds. The loudspeaker grille is in the shape of a peace sign as it shouts at Mr. Hook.', 'Created for the US Navy in World War II. The Mr. Hook character was created by Hank Ketcham while at Walter Lantz Studios, where the first- and only color- Mr. Hook cartoon was produced. A wartime propaganda film about Japan and war bonds. The loudspeaker grille is in the shape of a peace sign as it shouts at Mr. Hook.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uytCm9A5qHDWIPFfX5TfIWsOnrB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237002'),
  ('198593590204434706', 'Tokyo X Erotica', 2001, 'Drama', 'Takahisa Zeze, Kōichi Saitō', 'Takahisa Zeze', 'Yûji Ishikawa, Yumeka Sasaki, Mayuko Sasaki, Takeshi Itō, Yohta Kawase, Kazuhiro Sano, Mariko Naka, Mikio Sato', null, 'What lasts longer, the time before birth or the time after death? In the 1990''s, Kenjo dies in a terrorist gas attack. His girlfriend Haruka is killed by a man she meets as a street prostitute. In 2002, Kenji and Haruka who should already be dead, meet again and a new story begins.', 'What lasts longer, the time before birth or the time after death? In the 1990''s, Kenjo dies in a terrorist gas attack. His girlfriend Haruka is killed by a man she meets as a street prostitute. In 2002, Kenji and Haruka who should already be dead, meet again and a new story begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxxwTA7mzwCLraMDGmhOVknr97H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30570'),
  ('605376600565323426', 'Tokyo Zombie', 2005, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Sakichi Sato, Isao Ishii', 'Sakichi Sato', 'Tadanobu Asano, Show Aikawa, Erika Okuda, Hina Matsuoka, Arata Furuta, Masaki Miura, Yoshiyuki Morishita, Yasuhi Nakamura', 'NR', 'Two Japanese friends accidentally kill their boss and dump his remains in Black Fuji, a mountain/landfill hybrid. This leads to poor results when the chemicals of the landfill mix with the corpse (and many other corpses) to give rise to a zombie infestation in Tokyo.', 'Two Japanese friends accidentally kill their boss and dump his remains in Black Fuji, a mountain/landfill hybrid. This leads to poor results when the chemicals of the landfill mix with the corpse (and many other corpses) to give rise to a zombie infestation in Tokyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egyTHTGRyke8gTH7eYoEloqGADM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27843'),
  ('428228544981288563', 'Tokyo-Ga', 1985, 'Documentary', 'Wim Wenders, Edward Lachman', 'Wim Wenders', 'Chishū Ryū, Yûharu Atsuta, Werner Herzog, Chris Marker', 'NR', 'German director Wim Wenders tries to explore the Tokyo that was depicted in the films of Yasujiro Ozu and finds a very different city.', 'German director Wim Wenders tries to explore the Tokyo that was depicted in the films of Yasujiro Ozu and finds a very different city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNH1TqJPFuoxW0YZmwBuiZqSBU1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76406'),
  ('328117747639204253', 'Tokyo: The Last Megalopolis', 1988, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Akio Jissoji, Rintaro, Masao Nakabori', 'Kaizo Hayashi', 'Shintarō Katsu, Kyūsaku Shimada, Mieko Harada, Junichi Ishida, Tamasaburō Bandō V, Haruka Sugata, Bunshi Katsura VI, Shiro Sano', null, 'A demonic reincarnation of a Japanese general from the 10th century appears in the early 20th century Tokyo with a mission to destroy the blooming city.', 'A demonic reincarnation of a Japanese general from the 10th century appears in the early 20th century Tokyo with a mission to destroy the blooming city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebFPd3OwThqeJO1PKn7PDHmcYYx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74576'),
  ('526348344696918140', 'Tokyo!', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Bong Joon Ho, Leos Carax, Michel Gondry', 'Leos Carax, Bong Joon Ho, Michel Gondry', 'Ayako Fujitani, Ryo Kase, Ayumi Ito, Nao Omori, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Denden, Denis Lavant, Jean-François Balmer', 'NR', 'Three distinct tales unfold in the bustling city of Tokyo. Merde, a bizarre sewer-dweller, emerges from a manhole and begins terrorizing pedestrians. After his arrest, he stands trial and lashes out at a hostile courtroom. A man who has resigned himself to a life of solitude reconsiders after meeting a charming pizza delivery woman. And finally, a happy young couple find themselves undergoing a series of frightening metamorphoses.', 'Three distinct tales unfold in the bustling city of Tokyo. Merde, a bizarre sewer-dweller, emerges from a manhole and begins terrorizing pedestrians. After his arrest, he stands trial and lashes out at a hostile courtroom. A man who has resigned himself to a life of solitude reconsiders after meeting a charming pizza delivery woman. And finally, a happy young couple find themselves undergoing a series of frightening metamorphoses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xbq2EBAOwy0V7bzd1um3sJX1jd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8938'),
  ('142651403211999963', 'tokyo.sora', 2002, 'Drama', 'Hiroshi Ishikawa, Yukihiro Onodera, Shôichi Atô', 'Hiroshi Ishikawa', 'Yuka Itaya, Haruka Igawa, Ayano Nakamura, Ikuno Takagi, Flora Sun, Manami Honjo, Keishi Nagatsuka, Hidetoshi Nishijima', null, 'Six women attempt to make it in current day Tokyo, living their everyday lives the best and worst they can. For them, every little moment becomes a ritual of the ordinary and the exciting, a balancing act for their dreams and hopes as the days perpetually tug on their heartstrings.', 'Six women attempt to make it in current day Tokyo, living their everyday lives the best and worst they can. For them, every little moment becomes a ritual of the ordinary and the exciting, a balancing act for their dreams and hopes as the days perpetually tug on their heartstrings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVTGIJYk8znyhBLb7Hy7lMnEAsC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125858'),
  ('155182465342560459', 'Tol''able David', 1921, 'Drama', 'Henry King, Henry Cronjager', 'Henry King, Edmund Goulding', 'Richard Barthelmess, Gladys Hulette, Ernest Torrence, Marion Abbott, Forrest Robinson, Laurence Eddinger, Walter P. Lewis, Ralph Yearsley', 'NR', 'Young David Kinemon is a good-natured, easy-going lad in a mountain village. Circumstances force him to take his brother''s place as mail carrier for the community, and this brings him into deadly contact with the vicious Hatburn brothers.', 'Young David Kinemon is a good-natured, easy-going lad in a mountain village. Circumstances force him to take his brother''s place as mail carrier for the community, and this brings him into deadly contact with the vicious Hatburn brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKhaX0KRDmnQSfZB8AqS24H8a6J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71436'),
  ('384499408078444689', 'Tolerância', 2000, 'Drama', 'Carlos Gerbase', 'Giba Assis Brasil, Jorge Furtado', 'Maitê Proença, Roberto Bomtempo, Maria Ribeiro, Ana Maria Mainieri, Nelson Diniz, Werner Schünemann, Márcio Kieling, Eduardo Fachal', null, 'Julius is a photographer working as a men''s magazine photo retoucher. His wife, Marcia, is a criminal lawyer who defends Teodoro, a squatter accused of murder. For years they had a quiet wedlock. However, Marcia gets involved with her client, and as revenge, Julius sleeps with Ana Maria, a friend of their daughter Guida. From this episode on, their lives are no longer the same.', 'Julius is a photographer working as a men''s magazine photo retoucher. His wife, Marcia, is a criminal lawyer who defends Teodoro, a squatter accused of murder. For years they had a quiet wedlock. However, Marcia gets involved with her client, and as revenge, Julius sleeps with Ana Maria, a friend of their daughter Guida. From this episode on, their lives are no longer the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGLBKlDHpHvfk1me8gbeaLRD0HD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254981'),
  ('790386969123170948', 'Tolkien', 2019, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Kerry-Ellen Maxwell, Ben Clements, Emma Dorward', 'David Gleeson, Stephen Beresford', 'Nicholas Hoult, Lily Collins, Colm Meaney, Derek Jacobi, Harry Gilby, Mimi Keene, Anthony Boyle, Adam Bregman', 'PG-13', 'England, early 20th century. The future writer and philologist John Ronald Reuel Tolkien (1892-1973) and three of his schoolmates create a strong bond between them as they share the same passion for literature and art, a true fellowship that strengthens as they grow up, but the outbreak of World War I threatens to shatter it.', 'England, early 20th century. The future writer and philologist John Ronald Reuel Tolkien (1892-1973) and three of his schoolmates create a strong bond between them as they share the same passion for literature and art, a true fellowship that strengthens as they grow up, but the outbreak of World War I threatens to shatter it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7eYO3t7oZQdfJj5KlJBI7GhT9H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468224'),
  ('491233085309616642', 'Toll', 2023, 'Drama', 'Luis Armando Arteaga, Daniel Chaia, Renata Racy', 'Carolina Markowicz', 'Maeve Jinkings, Kauan Alvarenga, Thomás Aquino, Aline Marta Maia, Caio Macedo, Isac Graça, Fabrício Araújo, Rosana Maris', null, 'Suellen is a toll booth attendant who starts using her job to help a gang of thieves steal watches from people driving to the coast. But only for a noble cause: to send her son to an expensive gay conversion workshop.', 'Suellen is a toll booth attendant who starts using her job to help a gang of thieves steal watches from people driving to the coast. But only for a noble cause: to send her son to an expensive gay conversion workshop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giKTcr49cj5D7aZwKDU5FaUbYmw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:925113'),
  ('474308903182726501', 'Toll Booth', 2011, 'Drama', 'Tolga Karaçelik, Ercan Özkan', 'Tolga Karaçelik', 'Serkan Ercan, Zafer Diper, Nur Fettahoğlu, Nergis Öztürk, Sermet Yeşil, Büşra Pekin, Ruhi Sarı, Nadir Sarıbacak', null, 'Quiet and introverted toll booth clerk Kenan''s life, a humdrum routine between the Tavsancik toll booth plaza and his home, will change the day the new operations chief comes to inspect Tavsancik.', 'Quiet and introverted toll booth clerk Kenan''s life, a humdrum routine between the Tavsancik toll booth plaza and his home, will change the day the new operations chief comes to inspect Tavsancik.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/goUG9dsxnJFld6PWwsD6KFjvBvT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66574'),
  ('906121945029383474', 'Tolo Tolo', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Alessandro Pascuzzo, Adriano Sacco, Giulia Emiliani', 'Paolo Virzì, Checco Zalone', 'Checco Zalone, Manda Touré, Nassor Said Birya, Souleymane Sylla, Giovanni D''Addario, Barbara Bouchet, Alexis Michalik, Jean Marie Godet', null, 'Checco is a young Apulian entrepreneur dreamer who has opened a sushi restaurant in his Apulia. However, after one month, the restaurant went bankrupt and he chose to emigrate to Africa to escape from debt. Here he adapts to being a waiter in a resort in Kenya, but at the outbreak of a civil war he decides to embark on a stowaway trip on a boat for migrants to Europe and chooses to do it with his African friends. However, he would not like to return to Italy, but rather to go to Liechtenstein where banking secrecy is in force and there is a lower tax burden than in Italy.', 'Checco is a young Apulian entrepreneur dreamer who has opened a sushi restaurant in his Apulia. However, after one month, the restaurant went bankrupt and he chose to emigrate to Africa to escape from debt. Here he adapts to being a waiter in a resort in Kenya, but at the outbreak of a civil war he decides to embark on a stowaway trip on a boat for migrants to Europe and chooses to do it with his African friends. However, he would not like to return to Italy, but rather to go to Liechtenstein where banking secrecy is in force and there is a lower tax burden than in Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CqUxog8F6aaK97RYh8YXhv3NDL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593402'),
  ('82145398926677144', 'Tom & Jerry', 2021, 'Comedy, Family, Animation', 'Gayle Dickie, William Dodds, Tim Story', 'Kevin Costello', 'Chloë Grace Moretz, Michael Peña, Colin Jost, Rob Delaney, Ken Jeong, Pallavi Sharda, Jordan Bolger, Patsy Ferran', 'PG', 'Tom the cat and Jerry the mouse get kicked out of their home and relocate to a fancy New York hotel, where a scrappy employee named Kayla will lose her job if she can’t evict Jerry before a high-class wedding at the hotel. Her solution? Hiring Tom to get rid of the pesky mouse.', 'Tom the cat and Jerry the mouse get kicked out of their home and relocate to a fancy New York hotel, where a scrappy employee named Kayla will lose her job if she can’t evict Jerry before a high-class wedding at the hotel. Her solution? Hiring Tom to get rid of the pesky mouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XZI9QZ7Pm3fVkigWJPbrXCMzjq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587807'),
  ('632313763446906451', 'Tom & Thomas', 2002, 'Drama, Family', 'Esmé Lammers, Marc Felperlaan', 'Esmé Lammers', 'Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Sean Bean, Ravin J. Ganatra, Inday Ba, Sean Harris, Bill Stewart, Derek de Lint, Geraldine James', null, 'A young boy thinks he''s got a lookalike around him, but nobody believes him. Then, he meets Thomas and they switch homes.', 'A young boy thinks he''s got a lookalike around him, but nobody believes him. Then, he meets Thomas and they switch homes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NXeOv9enVzqUd8aKZBfvDhxLTB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48770'),
  ('243430365569530379', 'Tom & Viv', 1994, 'Drama, Romance', 'Brian Gilbert, Martin Fuhrer', 'Michael Hastings, Adrian Hodges', 'Willem Dafoe, Miranda Richardson, Rosemary Harris, Tim Dutton, Nickolas Grace, Geoffrey Bayldon, Clare Holman, Philip Locke', 'PG-13', 'The story of the marriage of the poet T. S. Eliot to socialite Vivienne Haigh-Wood, which had to cope with her gynaecological and emotional problems and his growing fame.', 'The story of the marriage of the poet T. S. Eliot to socialite Vivienne Haigh-Wood, which had to cope with her gynaecological and emotional problems and his growing fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iw4ofGbX2AbJ4p17CixwnMjuoJ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46797'),
  ('1032022996224690838', 'Tom and Chérie', 1955, 'Comedy, Animation', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Francoise Brun-Cottan', 'NR', 'Mousketeer Jerry has a love letter to deliver to darling Lilli. He gives it to his young pupil, who has a hard time getting past Tom to deliver it, but he does. They send a few more letters back and forth, at great pain to the youngster.', 'Mousketeer Jerry has a love letter to deliver to darling Lilli. He gives it to his young pupil, who has a hard time getting past Tom to deliver it, but he does. They send a few more letters back and forth, at great pain to the youngster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9vd6NWQp1kVwvxa4bnMHhb9ZYR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93007'),
  ('1077313161131071878', 'Tom and Huck', 1995, 'Family, Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Peter Hewitt, Gail Levin, Keith P. Cunningham', 'Stephen Sommers, David Loughery', 'Jonathan Taylor Thomas, Brad Renfro, Eric Schweig, Charles Rocket, Amy Wright, Michael McShane, Marian Seldes, Rachael Leigh Cook', 'PG', 'A mischievous young boy, Tom Sawyer, witnesses a murder by the deadly Injun Joe. Tom becomes friends with Huckleberry Finn, a boy with no future and no family. Tom has to choose between honoring a friendship or honoring an oath because the town alcoholic is accused of the murder. Tom and Huck go through several adventures trying to retrieve evidence.', 'A mischievous young boy, Tom Sawyer, witnesses a murder by the deadly Injun Joe. Tom becomes friends with Huckleberry Finn, a boy with no future and no family. Tom has to choose between honoring a friendship or honoring an oath because the town alcoholic is accused of the murder. Tom and Huck go through several adventures trying to retrieve evidence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMY31ikEOIPOHqQwhPhII8UVBln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45325'),
  ('96651175577692248', 'Tom and Jerry & The Wizard of Oz', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Spike Brandt, Tony Cervone, Maria Estrada', 'Gene Grillo', 'Grey DeLisle, Joe Alaskey, Michael Gough, Rob Paulsen, Todd Stashwick, Frances Conroy, Laraine Newman, Stephen Root', 'NR', 'After a deadly storm, Tom and Jerry find themselves stranded on an unknown island ruled by the evil Wizard of Oz. As they try to find their way back home, they worry for their master Dorothy''s safety.', 'After a deadly storm, Tom and Jerry find themselves stranded on an unknown island ruled by the evil Wizard of Oz. As they try to find their way back home, they worry for their master Dorothy''s safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFlwbp47uh6F1p203RQOaxYThzX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72972'),
  ('189918658074470937', 'Tom and Jerry Blast Off to Mars!', 2005, 'Animation, Family', 'Bill Kopp', 'Bill Kopp', 'Jeff Bennett, Corey Burton, Kathryn Fiore, Brad Garrett, Jess Harnell, Tom Kenny, Bill Kopp, Rob Paulsen', 'G', 'While carrying on their usual hi-jinks, they inadvertantly stow-away on a spaceship bound for Mars. They meet up with the local Martian residents and cause them to invade the Earth, aided by the "Invincitron", a vacuum-wielding giant robot. Tom, Jerry and their Martian ally, Peep, save the day.', 'While carrying on their usual hi-jinks, they inadvertantly stow-away on a spaceship bound for Mars. They meet up with the local Martian residents and cause them to invade the Earth, aided by the "Invincitron", a vacuum-wielding giant robot. Tom, Jerry and their Martian ally, Peep, save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uoxssMLAdwFZ44o7n5BNptrQBNQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21078'),
  ('701228298487476175', 'Tom and Jerry Cowboy Up!', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Western', 'Darrell Van Citters', null, 'George Ackles, Sean Burgos, Trevor Devall, Chris Edgerly, Georgie Kidder, Justin Michael, Kaitlyn Robrock, Isaac Robinson-Smith', 'G', 'This time, the rivals team up to help a cowgirl and her brother save their homestead from a greedy land-grabber, and they’re going to need some help! Jerry’s three precocious nephews are all ready for action, and Tom is rounding up a posse of prairie dogs. But can a ragtag band of varmints defeat a deceitful desperado determined to deceive a damsel in distress? No matter what happens with Tom and Jerry in the saddle, it’ll be a rootin’ tootin’ good time!', 'This time, the rivals team up to help a cowgirl and her brother save their homestead from a greedy land-grabber, and they’re going to need some help! Jerry’s three precocious nephews are all ready for action, and Tom is rounding up a posse of prairie dogs. But can a ragtag band of varmints defeat a deceitful desperado determined to deceive a damsel in distress? No matter what happens with Tom and Jerry in the saddle, it’ll be a rootin’ tootin’ good time!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muIaHotSaSUQr0KZCIJOYQEe7y2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892153'),
  ('889809929154988691', 'Tom and Jerry Meet Sherlock Holmes', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery, Family', 'Jeff Siergey, Spike Brandt, Kevin M. O''Neil', 'Earl Kress', 'Michael York, Malcolm McDowell, John Rhys-Davies, Billy West, Grey DeLisle, Phil LaMarr, Kath Soucie, Jeff Bergman', null, 'Tom and Jerry need to learn to work together in order to help Sherlock Holmes with an investigation of a jewel theft. But still, they are cat and mouse!', 'Tom and Jerry need to learn to work together in order to help Sherlock Holmes with an investigation of a jewel theft. But still, they are cat and mouse!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YLgPSsiDrZMO4yxycMZNcdE5iW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43956'),
  ('302689288735307972', 'Tom and Jerry: A Nutcracker Tale', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Spike Brandt, Tony Cervone', 'Spike Brandt', 'Kathleen Barr, Garry Chalk, Ian James Corlett, Trevor Devall, Richard Newman, Mark Oliver, Chantal Strand, Tara Strong', 'G', 'Christmas is never so spirited as when Tom and Jerry lock horns for the holidays in their new original movie--Tom & Jerry: A Nutcracker Tale In an empty opera house, Jerry wishes for a chance to perform -- and magically his dream comes true. The little mouse is whisked away to an enchanted kingdom where anything is possible: candy forests, singing snowflakes, even the toys spring to life! Jerry has a great time with his new friends, and when Jerry dances with the music box ballerina, he is as happy as happy can be. Unfortunately, alley cats led by Tom crash Jerry''s party, kidnap the music box ballerina and wreak havoc in the holiday kingdom. It''s up to Jerry to set things right -- and with help from a fellow mouse named Tuffy and more newfound friends, Jerry just may win the day!', 'Christmas is never so spirited as when Tom and Jerry lock horns for the holidays in their new original movie--Tom & Jerry: A Nutcracker Tale In an empty opera house, Jerry wishes for a chance to perform -- and magically his dream comes true. The little mouse is whisked away to an enchanted kingdom where anything is possible: candy forests, singing snowflakes, even the toys spring to life! Jerry has a great time with his new friends, and when Jerry dances with the music box ballerina, he is as happy as happy can be. Unfortunately, alley cats led by Tom crash Jerry''s party, kidnap the music box ballerina and wreak havoc in the holiday kingdom. It''s up to Jerry to set things right -- and with help from a fellow mouse named Tuffy and more newfound friends, Jerry just may win the day!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9klAPAt6SdGuAyh4zMOveYXyg0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24696'),
  ('387929643960238184', 'Tom and Jerry: Back to Oz', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Spike Brandt, Tony Cervone', 'Paul Dini', 'Grey DeLisle, Joe Alaskey, Michael Gough, Rob Paulsen, Todd Stashwick, Frances Conroy, Stephen Root, Kath Soucie', 'G', 'After capturing the good witch, the villainous King Gnome creates havoc throughout Oz as he needs Dorothy''s ruby slippers to take control of the Emerald City. So, it is up to Tom and Jerry to save the land of Oz!', 'After capturing the good witch, the villainous King Gnome creates havoc throughout Oz as he needs Dorothy''s ruby slippers to take control of the Emerald City. So, it is up to Tom and Jerry to save the land of Oz!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kilE7AJV1gEecTzW51XNi8YHBvs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403510'),
  ('814745979274820740', 'Tom and Jerry: Forbidden Compass', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Zhang Gang', 'Zhang Gang', 'Jiang Wen, Shun Zi, Lan Long, Tu Xiongfei, Li Baixin, Li Hanlin, Zhang Wenjie, Bai Weiche', 'PG', 'During a chase inside a museum, Tom and Jerry find a magical object and end up being transported through time. Lost in a distant era, they will need to work together to find a way back home.', 'During a chase inside a museum, Tom and Jerry find a magical object and end up being transported through time. Lost in a distant era, they will need to work together to find a way back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/albjgHkWubnva9WpfHDowmShAJ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1497970'),
  ('737151372667413689', 'Tom and Jerry: Robin Hood and His Merry Mouse', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Spike Brandt, Tony Cervone', 'Michael Ryan, Earl Kress', 'Jamie Bamber, Charles Shaughnessy, John Michael Higgins, Grey DeLisle, John DiMaggio, Joe Alaskey, Phil LaMarr, Greg Ellis', 'NR', 'Robin Hood steals from the rich and give to the poor, and needs the help of Tom and Jerry! Your favorite daring duo aims to beloved medieval tale in a new film is all for one and one for all!', 'Robin Hood steals from the rich and give to the poor, and needs the help of Tom and Jerry! Your favorite daring duo aims to beloved medieval tale in a new film is all for one and one for all!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVFVRLNrccHdPHqrrqtKT0L6oWs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134623'),
  ('914100100362328722', 'Tom and Jerry: Shiver Me Whiskers', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Scott Jeralds', 'Christopher Painter', 'William Hanna, Mark Hamill, Kathy Najimy, Charles Nelson Reilly, Kevin Michael Richardson, Wallace Shawn', 'G', 'Dueling cat-and-mouse team Tom and Jerry hit the high seas on a hunt for buried treasure in this pirate adventure. The tale begins when crew member Tom sets sail with an infamous pirate and finds a treasure map along with stowaway Jerry. The furry swashbucklers race to a deserted island where X marks the spot, but along with battling each other, they must outwit ruthless buccaneers, angry monkeys and a giant octopus to strike it rich.', 'Dueling cat-and-mouse team Tom and Jerry hit the high seas on a hunt for buried treasure in this pirate adventure. The tale begins when crew member Tom sets sail with an infamous pirate and finds a treasure map along with stowaway Jerry. The furry swashbucklers race to a deserted island where X marks the spot, but along with battling each other, they must outwit ruthless buccaneers, angry monkeys and a giant octopus to strike it rich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8kJT2PQXBdLvT7jimzgxQFWXPBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60293'),
  ('274393348236549978', 'Tom and Jerry: Snowman''s Land', 2022, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'Darrell Van Citters, Kent Reimer', null, 'Carlos Alazraqui, Kimberly Brooks, Joey D''Auria, Regi Davis, Laraine Newman, Kevin Michael Richardson, Kath Soucie, Stephen Stanton', 'G', 'It’s time to chase that holiday spirit with Tom and Jerry! With magic in the air, Jerry and his nephew, Tuffy, make a snow mouse that miraculously comes to life! To keep their new friend, Larry the snow mouse from melting, Tuffy and Jerry must race him to the fabled Snowman’s Village. In hot pursuit, Tom and devious Dr. Doublevay have their own plans for Larry’s magic.', 'It’s time to chase that holiday spirit with Tom and Jerry! With magic in the air, Jerry and his nephew, Tuffy, make a snow mouse that miraculously comes to life! To keep their new friend, Larry the snow mouse from melting, Tuffy and Jerry must race him to the fabled Snowman’s Village. In hot pursuit, Tom and devious Dr. Doublevay have their own plans for Larry’s magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/memqWrs4zmLgMBfzTfebrOXbytG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1018403'),
  ('333058169320435326', 'Tom and Jerry: Spy Quest', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Spike Brandt, Tony Cervone', null, 'Reese Hartwig, James Hong, Grey DeLisle, Tim Matheson, Jess Harnell, Richard McGonagle, Tia Carrere, Joe Alaskey', null, 'Two groups of classic cartoon characters come together in this fun-filled crossover with the popular action-adventure series Jonny Quest. Fans of all ages won''t want to miss this heart-stopping romp as Tom and Jerry join Jonny Quest and his pal Hadji and embark on a dangerous spy mission in order to save the world.', 'Two groups of classic cartoon characters come together in this fun-filled crossover with the popular action-adventure series Jonny Quest. Fans of all ages won''t want to miss this heart-stopping romp as Tom and Jerry join Jonny Quest and his pal Hadji and embark on a dangerous spy mission in order to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tCVbv0OlEdhBSnK0f7xO39uLwn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343977'),
  ('40314026029080117', 'Tom and Jerry: The Fast and the Furry', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Bill Kopp', 'Bill Kopp', 'Charlie Adler, Jeff Bennett, John DiMaggio, Jess Harnell, Tom Kenny, Bill Kopp, Tress MacNeille, Rob Paulsen', 'G', 'After being evicted from their old house by Tom''s owner for causing major damage, cat and mouse Tom and Jerry enter a race entitled the "Fabulous Super Race" to win a mansion.', 'After being evicted from their old house by Tom''s owner for causing major damage, cat and mouse Tom and Jerry enter a race entitled the "Fabulous Super Race" to win a mansion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pQhh5bU1KcUeXqPOteWsCkNZPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42246'),
  ('201056422807923061', 'Tom and Jerry: The Lost Dragon', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Spike Brandt, Tony Cervone', 'Brian Swenlin', 'Kelly Stables, Vicki Lewis, Jim Cummings, Laraine Newman, Greg Ellis, Jess Harnell, Richard McGonagle, Wayne Knight', 'G', 'Tom and Jerry find a dragon egg, and help the baby dragon find its mother.', 'Tom and Jerry find a dragon egg, and help the baby dragon find its mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2Tegfa5IOUkFx988FgTFZth189.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287233'),
  ('553781067962486351', 'Tom and Jerry: The Magic Ring', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'James T. Walker', 'Timothy Cahill, Julie McNally Cahill', 'Jeff Bennett, Frank Welker, Charlie Schlatter, Jim Cummings, Maile Flanagan, Jess Harnell, Maurice LaMarche, Tress MacNeille', null, 'The Oscar-winning cat-and-mouse twosome--Tom and Jerry--returns with another adventure. When Tom and Jerry''s irrepressible curiosity gets the best of them, the mysterious magic ring that Tom guards with his life ends up stuck over Jerry''s head. Now, Jerry must find a way to free himself of the ring while fleeing Tom, who wants to remove the ring any way he can! Find out if the pair can conjure up a solution in this fur-raising, madcap escapade.', 'The Oscar-winning cat-and-mouse twosome--Tom and Jerry--returns with another adventure. When Tom and Jerry''s irrepressible curiosity gets the best of them, the mysterious magic ring that Tom guards with his life ends up stuck over Jerry''s head. Now, Jerry must find a way to free himself of the ring while fleeing Tom, who wants to remove the ring any way he can! Find out if the pair can conjure up a solution in this fur-raising, madcap escapade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fF6I48WGKktHfGYYSVKPTVildWE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14787'),
  ('536323744744456992', 'Tom and Jerry: The Movie', 1992, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Music', 'Phil Roman, Jay Jackson, Jane Jenkins', 'Dennis Marks', 'Richard Kind, Dana Hill, Anndi McAfee, Tony Jay, Rip Taylor, Henry Gibson, Michael Bell, Ed Gilbert', 'G', 'The popular cartoon cat and mouse are thrown into a feature film. The story has the twosome trying to help an orphan girl who is being berated and exploited by a greedy guardian.', 'The popular cartoon cat and mouse are thrown into a feature film. The story has the twosome trying to help an orphan girl who is being berated and exploited by a greedy guardian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k68ZB5trRKcEJSQdPiY6jtxVq14.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22582'),
  ('1032767776195728759', 'Tom and Jerry: Willy Wonka & the Chocolate Factory', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Spike Brandt', 'Gene Grillo', 'JP Karliak, Jess Harnell, Lincoln Melcher, Mick Wingert, Lori Alan, Jeff Bergman, Spike Brandt, Rachel Butera', 'G', 'The classic Roald Dahl tale gets a modern twist when Tom and Jerry enter the amazing world of Willy Wonka''s Chocolate Factory.', 'The classic Roald Dahl tale gets a modern twist when Tom and Jerry enter the amazing world of Willy Wonka''s Chocolate Factory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzWt8ECED9kGm4LSXLSkPGBWpjE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455411'),
  ('791206903007972541', 'Tom and Jerry''s Giant Adventure', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Spike Brandt, Tony Cervone', 'Paul Dini', 'Garrison Keillor, Paul Reubens, Grey DeLisle, Jacob Bertrand, Thomas F. Wilson, Phil LaMarr, John DiMaggio, Kath Soucie', 'G', 'Tom And Jerry are among the last animals living in Storybook Town, a fairy tale-inspired theme park "where dreams come true, if you believe."', 'Tom And Jerry are among the last animals living in Storybook Town, a fairy tale-inspired theme park "where dreams come true, if you believe."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwMfAavFAysc9cQELGerQErmQhE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199753'),
  ('921036902394744522', 'Tom and Lola', 1990, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Bertrand Arthuys, François Catonné', 'Bertrand Arthuys, Christian de Chalonge, Muriel Téodori', 'Neil Stubbs, Mélodie Collin, Catherine Frot, Cécile Magnet, Marc Berman, Celian Varini', null, 'Born with their immune systems damaged, Tom and Lola are doomed to live their lives in isolation, sealed in separate plastic bubbles. However, neither cold urethane nor chillier hospital technicians can keep down the beguiling spirit of these indomitable siblings.', 'Born with their immune systems damaged, Tom and Lola are doomed to live their lives in isolation, sealed in separate plastic bubbles. However, neither cold urethane nor chillier hospital technicians can keep down the beguiling spirit of these indomitable siblings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNiJsDJ0PlfkEgS2D9gLTgB35wp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94470'),
  ('259894356752417239', 'Tom at the Farm', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Xavier Dolan, André Turpin, Laurence Mercier', 'Michel Marc Bouchard, Xavier Dolan', 'Xavier Dolan, Pierre-Yves Cardinal, Lise Roy, Evelyne Brochu, Manuel Tadros, Jacques Lavallée, Anne Caron, Olivier Morin', 'NR', 'A young man travels to an isolated farm for his lover''s funeral where he''s quickly drawn into a twisted, sexually charged game by his lover''s aggressive brother.', 'A young man travels to an isolated farm for his lover''s funeral where he''s quickly drawn into a twisted, sexually charged game by his lover''s aggressive brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/df7pp0jSs4wRxfWHtdgCaDPelmm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184352'),
  ('579529999821542554', 'Tom Brown''s School Days', 1940, 'Drama, Family', 'Robert Stevenson, Nicholas Musuraca', 'Walter Ferris, Frank Cavett, Gene Towne', 'Cedric Hardwicke, Freddie Bartholomew, Jimmy Lydon, Josephine Hutchinson, Billy Halop, Polly Moran, Hughie Green, Ernest Cossart', null, 'When private tutor Thomas Arnold becomes headmaster at an English preparatory school for boys, he puts into place a policy of strict punishment against unruliness and bullying. Arnold finds an ally in Tom Brown, a new student who is secretly subjected to abuse by a group of older boys. He eventually plucks up the courage to lead his fellow classmates in an underground rebellion against their tormentors.', 'When private tutor Thomas Arnold becomes headmaster at an English preparatory school for boys, he puts into place a policy of strict punishment against unruliness and bullying. Arnold finds an ally in Tom Brown, a new student who is secretly subjected to abuse by a group of older boys. He eventually plucks up the courage to lead his fellow classmates in an underground rebellion against their tormentors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrlt6ribkNHPyNuDRCPdCDTo68d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43823'),
  ('318209809408127663', 'Tom Clancy''s Without Remorse', 2021, 'Action, Thriller, War', 'J.J. Perry, Doug Coleman, Stefano Sollima', 'Will Staples, Taylor Sheridan', 'Michael B. Jordan, Jamie Bell, Guy Pearce, Jodie Turner-Smith, Lauren London, Brett Gelman, Jacob Scipio, Jack Kesy', 'R', 'An elite Navy SEAL uncovers an international conspiracy while seeking justice for the murder of his pregnant wife.', 'An elite Navy SEAL uncovers an international conspiracy while seeking justice for the murder of his pregnant wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GCOpT8QcNzup09TAMmvvk22LTR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567189'),
  ('212164141489385673', 'Tom Cruise: An Eternal Youth', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Régis Brochier', 'Régis Brochier', 'Dany Benedito, Tom Cruise, Nicole Kidman', 'NR', 'After 40 years, Tom Cruise continues to push the envelope in film. Exposing one''s heart to the world through their work is not only risky business, as far as Cruise is concerned, it is the only way to achieve an end that feels complete.', 'After 40 years, Tom Cruise continues to push the envelope in film. Exposing one''s heart to the world through their work is not only risky business, as far as Cruise is concerned, it is the only way to achieve an end that feels complete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MQwWS1iBzUkpyjNFV8Je6dFoIU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:765522'),
  ('580270416783058484', 'Tom Goes to the Bar', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Dean Parisot, Yuri Neyman, Carol Dysinger', 'Michael Taav', 'Tom Noonan, Billy Bastiani, Laurie Roome, Jim Henning, Gary M. Steele, Peter Henning, Jim Thorne, Michael Taav', null, 'It''s business as usual at the bar. Suddenly, a man drops down from the top of the screen and hangs upside down at the bar. The bartender reacts as if it was normal and hands him a drink. Tom sips it quietly until mayhem ensues.', 'It''s business as usual at the bar. Suddenly, a man drops down from the top of the screen and hangs upside down at the bar. The bartender reacts as if it was normal and hands him a drink. Tom sips it quietly until mayhem ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZlbUJ6947J3Ibb6t0tUmpWmSEJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651073'),
  ('464282525806646508', 'Tom Horn', 1980, 'Western, Action, Drama', 'William Wiard, John A. Alonzo', 'Bud Shrake, Thomas McGuane', 'Steve McQueen, Linda Evans, Richard Farnsworth, Billy Green Bush, Slim Pickens, Peter Canon, Elisha Cook Jr., Roy Jenson', 'R', 'A renowned former army scout is hired by ranchers to hunt down rustlers but finds himself on trial for the murder of a boy when he carries out his job too well. Tom Horn finds that the simple skills he knows are of no help in dealing with the ambitions of ranchers and corrupt officials as progress marches over him and the old west.', 'A renowned former army scout is hired by ranchers to hunt down rustlers but finds himself on trial for the murder of a boy when he carries out his job too well. Tom Horn finds that the simple skills he knows are of no help in dealing with the ambitions of ranchers and corrupt officials as progress marches over him and the old west.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2psanhsRyBxZOlg9zg9uE54M32w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5917'),
  ('542463819926808724', 'Tom Jones', 1963, 'Comedy, Romance, History', 'Walter Lassally, Tony Richardson, Gerry O''Hara', 'John Osborne', 'Albert Finney, Susannah York, Hugh Griffith, Edith Evans, Joan Greenwood, Diane Cilento, David Tomlinson, Freda Jackson', 'NR', 'Tom loves Sophie and Sophie loves Tom. But Tom and Sophie are of differering classes. Can they find a way through the mayhem to be true to love?', 'Tom loves Sophie and Sophie loves Tom. But Tom and Sophie are of differering classes. Can they find a way through the mayhem to be true to love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKuZKLMhe74PJzaxYLh2s8h4P2P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5769'),
  ('19659955308710842', 'Tom of Finland', 2017, 'Drama', 'Dome Karukoski, Lasse Frank Johannessen, Melissa Markki', 'Aleksi Bardy', 'Pekka Strang, Lauri Tilkanen, Jessica Grabowsky, Taisto Oksanen, Seumas F. Sargent, Jakob Oftebro, Niklas Hogner, Chris Myland', null, 'Touko Laaksonen, a decorated officer, returns home after a harrowing and heroic experience serving his country in World War II, but life in Finland during peacetime proves equally distressing. He finds peace-time Helsinki rampant with persecution of the homosexual and men around him even being pressured to marry women and have children. Touko finds refuge in his liberating art, specialising in homoerotic drawings of muscular men, free of inhibitions. His work – made famous by his signature ‘Tom of Finland’ – became the emblem of a generation of men and fanned the flames of a gay revolution.', 'Touko Laaksonen, a decorated officer, returns home after a harrowing and heroic experience serving his country in World War II, but life in Finland during peacetime proves equally distressing. He finds peace-time Helsinki rampant with persecution of the homosexual and men around him even being pressured to marry women and have children. Touko finds refuge in his liberating art, specialising in homoerotic drawings of muscular men, free of inhibitions. His work – made famous by his signature ‘Tom of Finland’ – became the emblem of a generation of men and fanned the flames of a gay revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VsyYMo3A8z0iHR0Hfuj0ZFtIQJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405204'),
  ('77862908003324942', 'Tom Papa: You''re Doing Great!', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Gregory Jacobs', 'Tom Papa', 'Tom Papa', null, 'Comedian Tom Papa takes on body image issues, social media, pets, Staten Island, the "old days" and more in a special from his home state of New Jersey.', 'Comedian Tom Papa takes on body image issues, social media, pets, Staten Island, the "old days" and more in a special from his home state of New Jersey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ba7sfo3MU2DuvxJg6DmlThSYmg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661728'),
  ('872650134227462354', 'Tom Petty and the Heartbreakers: Runnin'' Down a Dream', 2007, 'Documentary, Music', 'Peter Bogdanovich, Ted Hayash', null, 'Tom Petty, Ron Blair, Mike Campbell, George Drakoulias, Johnny Cash, Bob Dylan, George Harrison, Roy Orbison', 'NR', 'Directed by Peter Bogdanovich and packed with rare concert footage and home movies, this documentary explores the history of Tom Petty and the Heartbreakers, including Petty''s famous collaborations and notorious clashes with the record industry. Interviews with musical luminaries including Jackson Browne, George Harrison, Eddie Vedder, Roger McGuinn, Jeff Lynne, Dave Stewart and Petty himself shed some revelatory vision.', 'Directed by Peter Bogdanovich and packed with rare concert footage and home movies, this documentary explores the history of Tom Petty and the Heartbreakers, including Petty''s famous collaborations and notorious clashes with the record industry. Interviews with musical luminaries including Jackson Browne, George Harrison, Eddie Vedder, Roger McGuinn, Jeff Lynne, Dave Stewart and Petty himself shed some revelatory vision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mdIZkWQ1rGy3pTTDOHzx6DhY5X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31147'),
  ('540241045841701004', 'Tom Sawyer', 1973, 'Family, Music, Adventure', 'Don Taylor, Frank Stanley', 'Robert B. Sherman, Richard M. Sherman', 'Johnny Whitaker, Celeste Holm, Warren Oates, Jeff East, Jodie Foster, Lucille Benson, Henry Jones, Noah Keen', 'G', 'Tom Sawyer and his pal Huckleberry Finn have great adventures on the Mississippi River, pretending to be pirates, attending their own funeral, and witnessing a murder.', 'Tom Sawyer and his pal Huckleberry Finn have great adventures on the Mississippi River, pretending to be pirates, attending their own funeral, and witnessing a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/In4e2cLbkemK8t2bBfisgT0iqU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42473'),
  ('1049757761455598268', 'Tom Sawyer', 2000, 'Family, Animation, Adventure', 'Paul Sabella, Phil Mendez, Dave Brain', 'Patricia Jones, Donald Reiker', 'Rhett Akins, Mark Wills, Hynden Walch, Lee Ann Womack, Clea Lewis, Alecia Elliott, Betty White, Dean Haglund', 'PG', 'Get ready for a magical, fun-filled journey of adventure, fantasy and friendship! Tom Sawyer and his best buddy Huck Finn love going fishing, daydreaming about pirates and stolen gold, and thinking about Becky Thatcher - the pretty new girl at school. But when these pals set out on a quest for buried treasure, they end up face to face with the town''s most "grizzly" bear, Injurin'' Joe. Giving Joe the slip, they find themselves in the middle of a fantastic adventure that takes them from the mighty Mississippi to the mysterious caverns of a secret hideout where they discover fun, excitement... and a fortune beyond their wildest dreams! Featuring the voices of Don Knotts, Betty White, and country music superstars Rhett Akins, Mark Wills, Lee Ann Womack, Hank Williams Jr. and more, Tom Sawyer is an enchanting, music-filled family adventure.', 'Get ready for a magical, fun-filled journey of adventure, fantasy and friendship! Tom Sawyer and his best buddy Huck Finn love going fishing, daydreaming about pirates and stolen gold, and thinking about Becky Thatcher - the pretty new girl at school. But when these pals set out on a quest for buried treasure, they end up face to face with the town''s most "grizzly" bear, Injurin'' Joe. Giving Joe the slip, they find themselves in the middle of a fantastic adventure that takes them from the mighty Mississippi to the mysterious caverns of a secret hideout where they discover fun, excitement... and a fortune beyond their wildest dreams! Featuring the voices of Don Knotts, Betty White, and country music superstars Rhett Akins, Mark Wills, Lee Ann Womack, Hank Williams Jr. and more, Tom Sawyer is an enchanting, music-filled family adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFab8MwNldV5ZaIuvDdro3HKXnq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42313'),
  ('1014845973614286057', 'Tom Sawyer', 2011, 'Adventure, Family', 'Hermine Huntgeburth, The Chau Ngo', 'Sebastian Wehlings, Sascha Arango, Peer Klehmet', 'Louis Hofmann, Heike Makatsch, Benno Fürmann, Joachim Król, Peter Lohmeyer, Hinnerk Schönemann, Sylvester Groth, Leon Seidel', null, 'Tom Sawyer has a head full of pranks and drives when he invents is not just a new adventure, preferably around with his best buddy Huck Finn - much to the chagrin of his Aunt Polly with Tom and his half-brother Sid in the town of St. Petersburg on the Mississippi river.', 'Tom Sawyer has a head full of pranks and drives when he invents is not just a new adventure, preferably around with his best buddy Huck Finn - much to the chagrin of his Aunt Polly with Tom and his half-brother Sid in the town of St. Petersburg on the Mississippi river.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/et5eN5AxCpNHxKxCn4I1cYGTQgH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104711'),
  ('247716191110444421', 'Tom Segura: Ball Hog', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Rami Hachache, Samuel Brownfield', 'Tom Segura', 'Tom Segura', null, 'Tom Segura scores laughs with uncomfortably candid stories about mothers, fathers, following your dreams — and other things you''d rather not think about.', 'Tom Segura scores laughs with uncomfortably candid stories about mothers, fathers, following your dreams — and other things you''d rather not think about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjRt6PYRGXNvvxJLgbZaX0Xf1LA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:676601'),
  ('377205376155728415', 'Tom Segura: Disgraceful', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Jay Karas, Samuel Brownfield', 'Tom Segura', 'Tom Segura', 'PG-13', 'Tom Segura gives voice to the sordid thoughts you''d never say out loud, with blunt musings on porn, parking lot power struggles, parenthood and more.', 'Tom Segura gives voice to the sordid thoughts you''d never say out loud, with blunt musings on porn, parking lot power struggles, parenthood and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ll5QVhDsp6MbNWWZAGXc8vFu6Y9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497520'),
  ('235609062888954895', 'Tom Segura: Mostly Stories', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Jay Karas, Rami Hachache, Jackson Hunt', 'Tom Segura', 'Tom Segura, Davis Choh', null, 'The bearded, bawdy, and comically bitter Tom Segura gets real about body piercings, the "Area 51" of men''s bodies, and the lie he told Mike Tyson.', 'The bearded, bawdy, and comically bitter Tom Segura gets real about body piercings, the "Area 51" of men''s bodies, and the lie he told Mike Tyson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wELcQAA77XLqYL09wZH5FAMkmnU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376482'),
