  ('197709160769963616', 'Tom Sweep', 1992, 'Animation', 'Michael Dudok de Wit', 'Michael Dudok de Wit', null, null, 'A cute little guy is trying to do the right thing and clean up his neighborhood. However, when he approaches a garbage can to empty it, one thoughtless person after another come by and make an even bigger mess.', 'A cute little guy is trying to do the right thing and clean up his neighborhood. However, when he approaches a garbage can to empty it, one thoughtless person after another come by and make an even bigger mess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mAwSJBHsXlsrHybZTgRb30hwNf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246988'),
  ('367098632899435637', 'Tom Thumb', 1958, 'Music, Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'David Middlemas, Muir Mathieson, George Pal', 'Ladislas Fodor', 'Russ Tamblyn, Alan Young, June Thorburn, Terry-Thomas, Peter Sellers, Bernard Miles, Jessie Matthews, Ian Wallace', 'G', 'A boy, no bigger than a thumb, manages to outwit two thieves determined to make a fortune from him.', 'A boy, no bigger than a thumb, manages to outwit two thieves determined to make a fortune from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUQYLx8tD3DFKMXW1wrlvHavO4L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56931'),
  ('42561719304608080', 'Tom Thumb', 2001, 'Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Olivier Dahan, Alex Lamarque, Mathias Honoré', 'Charles Perrault, Agnès Fustier-Dahan, Olivier Dahan', 'Romane Bohringer, Élodie Bouchez, Pierre Berriau, Dominique Hulin, Samy Naceri, Catherine Deneuve, Nils Hugon, Raphaël Fuchs-Willig', null, 'Poucet is a kid from a family of numerous children. The parents, too poor to feed them, decide to abandon them in the forest. Their, the brothers try to find their way out making fantastic encounters. This film is based on the French fairy tale "Le petit poucet" by Charles Perrault.', 'Poucet is a kid from a family of numerous children. The parents, too poor to feed them, decide to abandon them in the forest. Their, the brothers try to find their way out making fantastic encounters. This film is based on the French fairy tale "Le petit poucet" by Charles Perrault.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBT1yO5miN8T18p70eVSkYuJbJD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47437'),
  ('483682653053747605', 'Tom Turk and Daffy', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Billy Bletcher', null, 'It''s Thanksgiving, and Tom Turk is trying to avoid become the main attraction on Porky Pig''s dinner table. Fellow bird Daffy Duck is willing to help him, until he realizes that he''ll miss out on a delicious meal. Hilarity ensues as each tries to get the other caught by Porky.', 'It''s Thanksgiving, and Tom Turk is trying to avoid become the main attraction on Porky Pig''s dinner table. Fellow bird Daffy Duck is willing to help him, until he realizes that he''ll miss out on a delicious meal. Hilarity ensues as each tries to get the other caught by Porky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nl2j0yzPA2UfKSJ5csEihave6f9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205650'),
  ('991279864955695596', 'Tom Waits: Big Time', 1988, 'Documentary, Music', 'Chris Blum, Daniel Hainey, Liz Gazzano', 'Kathleen Brennan, Tom Waits', 'Tom Waits, Michael L. Blair, Ralph Carney, Greg Cohen, Marc Ribot, Willie Schwarz, Miss Keiko, Gerty the Monkey', 'PG', 'Bringing his unique sense of humor to this bizarre and original piece of moviemaking, Tom Waits takes the audience through a musical journey with his jazzy, quirky, bluesy tunes presented as you would never, ever, ever expect.', 'Bringing his unique sense of humor to this bizarre and original piece of moviemaking, Tom Waits takes the audience through a musical journey with his jazzy, quirky, bluesy tunes presented as you would never, ever, ever expect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPYWVf2wJWFgfsU63CbR4Q7KjNv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44694'),
  ('372265514392898', 'Tom-ic Energy', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Essentially one long chase scene, in an urban setting; at the end, a dog joins in, to Jerry''s annoyance.', 'Essentially one long chase scene, in an urban setting; at the end, a dog joins in, to Jerry''s annoyance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1FXXQAnrTsFFIAc2xxofJXaHVp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220278'),
  ('1062063554612745162', 'Tom, Dick and Harry', 1941, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Garson Kanin, Merritt B. Gerstad, Mark-Lee Kirk', 'Paul Jarrico', 'Ginger Rogers, George Murphy, Alan Marshal, Burgess Meredith, Joe Cunningham, Jane Seymour, Lenore Lonergan, Vickie Lester', null, 'Janie is a telephone operator who is caught up in the lines of love of three men: car salesman Tom, Chicago millionaire Dick and auto mechanic Harry. But Janie just can''t seem to make up her mind between them. While fantasizing about her futures with each of the men, Janie spends her time desperately trying to juggle between them until she can make a decision.', 'Janie is a telephone operator who is caught up in the lines of love of three men: car salesman Tom, Chicago millionaire Dick and auto mechanic Harry. But Janie just can''t seem to make up her mind between them. While fantasizing about her futures with each of the men, Janie spends her time desperately trying to juggle between them until she can make a decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZnucljYes0E8NkzH3Bg5jWiQg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86604'),
  ('768690399498450121', 'Tom, Tom, the Piper''s Son', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Ken Jacobs', null, null, null, 'An experimental feature made by rephotographing the 1905 Biograph short Tom, Tom, the Piper''s Son.', 'An experimental feature made by rephotographing the 1905 Biograph short Tom, Tom, the Piper''s Son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qB5PfgjyBGeWkFPGJB5nb4NRnF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126863'),
  ('741847369014390059', 'Tom''s Midnight Garden', 1999, 'Family, Mystery, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Gavin Finney, Willard Carroll', 'Willard Carroll', 'Anthony Way, Nigel Le Vaillant, Marlene Sidaway, Serena Gordon, Greta Scacchi, James Wilby, Alfie Lawrence, Mel Martin', null, 'When Tom''s brother Peter gets measles, he is sent to stay with his Uncle Alan and Aunt Gwen in a flat with no garden and an elderly landlady, Mrs Bartholomew, living upstairs. Because he may be infectious, he is not allowed to play outside and feels lonely. Without exercise he is less sleepy at night and when he hears the communal grandfather clock strangely strike 13, he investigates and finds the small back yard is now a large sunlit garden.', 'When Tom''s brother Peter gets measles, he is sent to stay with his Uncle Alan and Aunt Gwen in a flat with no garden and an elderly landlady, Mrs Bartholomew, living upstairs. Because he may be infectious, he is not allowed to play outside and feels lonely. Without exercise he is less sleepy at night and when he hears the communal grandfather clock strangely strike 13, he investigates and finds the small back yard is now a large sunlit garden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9flBPLbXqiU6VyDsYUvF9Lp4c4H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77945'),
  ('760486683357827907', 'Tom''s Photo Finish', 1957, 'Comedy, Animation', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Daws Butler, June Foray', 'NR', 'Tom has a chunk of the leftover chicken just before his owner George goes to look at the fridge. He threatens to take care of whichever animal did it. Tom frames Spike the dog, but Jerry snaps a photo of him in the act, prints up dozens of copies, and then battles Tom to get George to see one of them.', 'Tom has a chunk of the leftover chicken just before his owner George goes to look at the fridge. He threatens to take care of whichever animal did it. Tom frames Spike the dog, but Jerry snaps a photo of him in the act, prints up dozens of copies, and then battles Tom to get George to see one of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMnmDSI2Zf4gRORf3nTr2Uz2mta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93266'),
  ('766086393931515122', 'Toma', 2021, 'Drama, Music, History', 'Dragan Bjelogrlić, Zoran Lisinac', 'Nikola Pejaković, Dragan Bjelogrlić', 'Milan Marić, Milena Radulović, Radomir Nikolić, Milan Kolak, Petar Benčina, Tamara Dragičević, Denis Murić, Olivera Bacić', null, 'Biopic about Serbian folk singer Toma Zdravković, the man who is remembered not only for his songs and unique way he was singing them, but also as a bohemian, both in his behavior and his soul.', 'Biopic about Serbian folk singer Toma Zdravković, the man who is remembered not only for his songs and unique way he was singing them, but also as a bohemian, both in his behavior and his soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w80MOoF0ec5jLXOFpqWV77pzpxO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:729679'),
  ('119106369004645713', 'Tomahawk', 1951, 'Western', 'George Sherman, Charles P. Boyle, Jesse Hibbs', 'Silvia Richards, Maurice Geraghty', 'Van Heflin, Yvonne De Carlo, Alex Nicol, Preston Foster, Jack Oakie, Tom Tully, John War Eagle, Rock Hudson', 'NR', 'In 1866, a new gold discovery and an inconclusive conference force the U.S. Army to build a road and fort in territory ceded by previous treaty to the Sioux...to the disgust of frontier scout Jim Bridger, whose Cheyenne wife led him to see the conflict from both sides. The powder-keg situation needs only a spark to bring war, and violent bigots like Lieut. Rob Dancy are all too likely to provide this. Meanwhile, Bridger''s chance of preventing catastrophe is dimmed by equally wrenching personal conflicts. Unusually accurate historically.', 'In 1866, a new gold discovery and an inconclusive conference force the U.S. Army to build a road and fort in territory ceded by previous treaty to the Sioux...to the disgust of frontier scout Jim Bridger, whose Cheyenne wife led him to see the conflict from both sides. The powder-keg situation needs only a spark to bring war, and violent bigots like Lieut. Rob Dancy are all too likely to provide this. Meanwhile, Bridger''s chance of preventing catastrophe is dimmed by equally wrenching personal conflicts. Unusually accurate historically.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnGomJATrts0A4TKhBEZqyqlIzR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39018'),
  ('388535483533947920', 'Tomahawk Trail', 1957, 'Western', 'Lesley Selander', 'David Chandler', 'Chuck Connors, John Smith, Susan Cummings, Lisa Montell, George N. Neise, Robert Knapp, Eddie Little Sky, Harry Dean Stanton', 'NR', 'Led by an incompetent Lieutenant, a troop of soldiers is on the Tomahawk Trail in Apache territory. When he lets the Indians steal their horses and gets slightly wounded in a skirmish, Sergeant McCoy takes over command. McCoy successfully gets them to the fort only to find all the soldiers have been murdered by the Apaches. He prepares the troops for an attack knowing if they survive the Lieutenant plans to have him court marshaled.', 'Led by an incompetent Lieutenant, a troop of soldiers is on the Tomahawk Trail in Apache territory. When he lets the Indians steal their horses and gets slightly wounded in a skirmish, Sergeant McCoy takes over command. McCoy successfully gets them to the fort only to find all the soldiers have been murdered by the Apaches. He prepares the troops for an attack knowing if they survive the Lieutenant plans to have him court marshaled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SOmA1Y9RJcKR4qfM10aCoDiHcX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151392'),
  ('508413019228187320', 'Tomatos Another Day', 1934, 'Drama, Comedy', 'James Sibley Watson, James Sibley Watson', 'Alec Wilder', 'Jack Lee, Frances Alexander Miller', 'NR', 'Watson’s avant-garde film is a unique example of dadaist aesthetics in early sound cinema. A minimalist and virtually expressionless acting style on a claustrophobic set characterizes the melodramatic love triangle. Watson considered the film a failure, though it appears extremely modern today, and suppressed its existence. - Jan-Christopher Horak', 'Watson’s avant-garde film is a unique example of dadaist aesthetics in early sound cinema. A minimalist and virtually expressionless acting style on a claustrophobic set characterizes the melodramatic love triangle. Watson considered the film a failure, though it appears extremely modern today, and suppressed its existence. - Jan-Christopher Horak', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zzFYkeiugL0n4Pxt05Ql41IIto.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165967'),
  ('668989965559115611', 'Tomb Invader', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Pedja Radenkovic, James Thomas', 'Nick Zephyrin', 'Gina Vitori, Tammy Klein, Lindsay Sawyer, John Wusah, Samantha Bowling, Andrew J Katers, Evan Sloan, Shawn McConnell', null, 'Archaeologist Alabama Channing sets off to uncover the ancient tomb of Quin Shi Haung, which promises riches and answers to family mysteries.', 'Archaeologist Alabama Channing sets off to uncover the ancient tomb of Quin Shi Haung, which promises riches and answers to family mysteries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7v3zIxllgISAEqKviE0fWUsbbCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511343'),
  ('573114839430733096', 'Tomb of the River', 2021, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Yun Ju-hwan, Jeon Byeong-yun, Yoon Young-bin', 'Yoon Young-bin', 'Jang Hyuk, Yu Oh-seong, Han Seon-hwa, Kim Joon-bae, Park Seong-geun, Oh Dae-hwan, Lee Hyun-kyun, Choi Ki-seob', null, 'An action film about the ambitions, conspiracy, and betrayal of different organizations surrounding the life-changing project of building the largest resort in Gangneung.', 'An action film about the ambitions, conspiracy, and betrayal of different organizations surrounding the life-changing project of building the largest resort in Gangneung.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YAqHsbeprubh3nBSL4cAosWeu7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:752886'),
  ('740357759624885465', 'Tomb Raider', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'G.A. Aguilar, Roar Uthaug, George Richmond', 'Geneva Robertson-Dworet, Alastair Siddons', 'Alicia Vikander, Dominic West, Walton Goggins, Daniel Wu, Kristin Scott Thomas, Derek Jacobi, Alexandre Willaume, Tamer Burjaq', 'PG-13', 'Lara Croft, the fiercely independent daughter of a missing adventurer, must push herself beyond her limits when she finds herself on the island where her father disappeared.', 'Lara Croft, the fiercely independent daughter of a missing adventurer, must push herself beyond her limits when she finds herself on the island where her father disappeared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4Qn5LF6OwK4rIifmthIDtbqDSs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338970'),
  ('352999584692559320', 'Tomb Watcher', 2025, 'Drama, Horror', 'Vathanyu Ingkawiwat, Suwikron Nimon, Terawada Waroonsirin', 'Nut Nualpang, Nattamol Peanthanom, Nattapot Potchumnean', 'Woranuch Bhirombhakdi, Thanavate Siriwattanakul, Arachaporn Pokinpakorn, Kampanath Ruangkittivilas, Pornchanok Sintanaporn, Nungruthai Chaioata, Wanna Namkrong, Aphicha Tinnachotradsami', null, 'When Lunthom passed away, her husband and his mistress seized the opportunity to live openly as a couple. However, when moved into their villa, they discovering a glass coffin containing Lunthom''s body in the house. Leading to a terrifying path of revenge.', 'When Lunthom passed away, her husband and his mistress seized the opportunity to live openly as a couple. However, when moved into their villa, they discovering a glass coffin containing Lunthom''s body in the house. Leading to a terrifying path of revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3rqVVrLVQGJZAfgaEDgjAkFR2F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1418305'),
  ('455232604223997349', 'Tómbola', 1962, 'Romance', 'Luis Lucia', 'Luis Lucia, José Luis Colina', 'Marisol, Rafael Alonso, Enrique Ávila, José Marco Davó, Guillermo Marín, Joëlle Rivero, José María Caffarel, Mercedes Borqué', null, 'Marisol is a young girl with a vivid imagination and a heart of gold who witnesses a picture robbery in a museum...', 'Marisol is a young girl with a vivid imagination and a heart of gold who witnesses a picture robbery in a museum...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q87zn71G8xoeAS8VFR0aTrQ33zD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104616'),
  ('863850714433051074', 'Tomboy', 1985, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Daniel Yarussi, Herb Freed, Stephen Mann', 'Ben Zelig', 'Betsy Russell, Gerard Christopher, Kristi Somers, Richard Erdman, Philip Sterling, Eric Douglas, Paul Gunning, Toby Iland', 'R', 'A budding female race-car driver finally meets her racing idol and unbelievably they fall in love...a love that''s quickly put to the test when, having received the chance to show her racing talents, the two find themselves in a race for a multi-million dollar sponsorship contract.', 'A budding female race-car driver finally meets her racing idol and unbelievably they fall in love...a love that''s quickly put to the test when, having received the chance to show her racing talents, the two find themselves in a race for a multi-million dollar sponsorship contract.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apxNcHNOgUe4uMgmRTMg8zEkVyv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2189'),
  ('1007539999285668611', 'Tomboy', 2011, 'Drama', 'Céline Sciamma, Crystel Fournier, Valérie Roucher', 'Céline Sciamma', 'Zoé Héran, Malonn Lévana, Jeanne Disson, Sophie Cattani, Mathieu Demy, Rayan Boubekri, Yohan Vero, Noah Vero', 'NR', 'Ten-year-old Laure isn''t like most girls. She prefers football to dolls and sweaters to dresses. When Laure and her family move to a new neighbourhood, local girl Lisa mistakes Laure for a boy. Indulging in this exciting new identity, Laure becomes Mickaël, and so begins a summer of long sunny afternoons, playground games and first kisses. Yet with the school term fast approaching, and with suspicions arising amongst friends and family, Laure must face up to an uncertain future.', 'Ten-year-old Laure isn''t like most girls. She prefers football to dolls and sweaters to dresses. When Laure and her family move to a new neighbourhood, local girl Lisa mistakes Laure for a boy. Indulging in this exciting new identity, Laure becomes Mickaël, and so begins a summer of long sunny afternoons, playground games and first kisses. Yet with the school term fast approaching, and with suspicions arising amongst friends and family, Laure must face up to an uncertain future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plEV1Q5u5caYASlG3pq3ON7acN7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65229'),
  ('1046264931747984922', 'Tombs of the Blind Dead', 1972, 'Horror', 'Amando de Ossorio, Pablo Ripoll', 'Amando de Ossorio', 'Lone Fleming, César Burner, María Elena Arpón, José Thelman, Rufino Inglés, Simón Arriaga, Francisco Sanz, Juan Cortés', 'PG', 'In 13th century Berzano, a legion of knights known as the Templar were executed for conducting black magic rituals and committing human sacrifices in a quest for eternal life. 700 years later, they rise from the dead and attack a group of vacationing college students who visit the remains of their abandoned monastery.', 'In 13th century Berzano, a legion of knights known as the Templar were executed for conducting black magic rituals and committing human sacrifices in a quest for eternal life. 700 years later, they rise from the dead and attack a group of vacationing college students who visit the remains of their abandoned monastery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8JGJojd01EHKuKvYsgZ1aPCrZfS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37601'),
  ('669227832606123982', 'Tombstone', 1993, 'Western, Action', 'William A. Fraker, George P. Cosmatos, Matthew Feitshans', 'Kevin Jarre', 'Kurt Russell, Val Kilmer, Michael Biehn, Powers Boothe, Robert John Burke, Dana Delany, Sam Elliott, Stephen Lang', 'R', 'Legendary marshal Wyatt Earp, now a weary gunfighter, joins his brothers Morgan and Virgil to pursue their collective fortune in the thriving mining town of Tombstone. But Earp is forced to don a badge again and get help from his notorious pal Doc Holliday when a gang of renegade brigands and rustlers begins terrorizing the town.', 'Legendary marshal Wyatt Earp, now a weary gunfighter, joins his brothers Morgan and Virgil to pursue their collective fortune in the thriving mining town of Tombstone. But Earp is forced to don a badge again and get help from his notorious pal Doc Holliday when a gang of renegade brigands and rustlers begins terrorizing the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGFCvylul8iEQhJOKfwZGGvXMzA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11969'),
  ('711403771276187807', 'Tombstone of the Fireflies', 2008, 'Drama, War', 'Taro Hyugaji, Koichi Kawakami, Takeo Kimura', 'Takuya Nishioka', 'Reo Yoshitake, Rina Hatakeyama, Keiko Matsuzaka, Seiko Matsuda, Chizuru Ikewaki, Yoshio Harada, Hiromi Chino, Jun Etoh', null, 'Set during World War II, the film follows a young brother and sister as they attempt to survive the aftermath of the firebombing of Kobe City.', 'Set during World War II, the film follows a young brother and sister as they attempt to survive the aftermath of the firebombing of Kobe City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQ29Tp6L43o1hVbyXxdtxAtLtZ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38473'),
  ('122908915029278044', 'Tomcat', 2016, 'Drama', 'Julia Niemann, Klaus Händl, Gerald Kerkletz', 'Klaus Händl', 'Lukas Turtur, Philipp Hochmair, Thomas Stipsits, Manuel Rubey, Gabriela Hegedüs, Gerald Votava', 'NR', 'Andreas and Stefan lead a happy and passionate life: Together with their beloved tomcat Moses, they live in a beautiful old house in Vienna''s vineyards. They work as a musician and as a scheduler in the same orchestra and they love their large circle of friends. An unexpected and inexplicable outburst of violence suddenly shakes up the relationship and calls everything into question - the blind spot that resides in all of us.', 'Andreas and Stefan lead a happy and passionate life: Together with their beloved tomcat Moses, they live in a beautiful old house in Vienna''s vineyards. They work as a musician and as a scheduler in the same orchestra and they love their large circle of friends. An unexpected and inexplicable outburst of violence suddenly shakes up the relationship and calls everything into question - the blind spot that resides in all of us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plJL1DBjZafNl4IhD6PY9KKqIK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383559'),
  ('176928652299262750', 'Tomcats', 1977, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Harry Kerwin, William G. Randall', 'Andrew Lane, Wayne Crawford', 'Chris Mulkey, Polly King, Wayne Crawford, Daniel Schweitzer, Sam Moree, Melisande Conaway, William Kerwin, Rich DeMott', 'R', 'When four degenerate thugs rape and murder a young waitress in part of their rape and murder spree, they are arrested, but get away with though a legal technicality. The brother of one of the rape/murder victims decides to become vigilante and kill the four degenerates by himself.', 'When four degenerate thugs rape and murder a young waitress in part of their rape and murder spree, they are arrested, but get away with though a legal technicality. The brother of one of the rape/murder victims decides to become vigilante and kill the four degenerates by himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFwczTHAhYrMzKFnCFTustWzjuF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89728'),
  ('381361031138566027', 'Tomcats', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gregory Poirier, Charles Minsky', 'Gregory Poirier', 'Jerry O''Connell, Shannon Elizabeth, Jake Busey, Horatio Sanz, Bernie Casey, Jaime Pressly, David Ogden Stiers, Travis Fine', 'R', 'College buddies chip in and promise that the group''s last unmarried man will collect a cash pot. Seven years later, the kitty is worth $500,000 -- money Michael needs to pay a gambling debt. Problem is, the only other single guy is a hopeless womanizer!', 'College buddies chip in and promise that the group''s last unmarried man will collect a cash pot. Seven years later, the kitty is worth $500,000 -- money Michael needs to pay a gambling debt. Problem is, the only other single guy is a hopeless womanizer!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAHD3TfoDJX6jCPVhICBNLBxnBH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10646'),
  ('401490731682794371', 'Tomie', 1998, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Ataru Oikawa, Akira Sako, Kazuhiro Suzuki', 'Ataru Oikawa', 'Mami Nakamura, Yoriko Doguchi, Kōta Kusano, Kenji Mizuhashi, Tomorowo Taguchi, Miho Kanno, Rumi, Ikko Suzuki', null, 'Following some trauma in her past that has since been repressed, a young woman is trying to recover her memories with the help of a psychiatrist. During her hypnosis sessions, she repeats the name "Tomie" but is unable to recall where she knows it from. Meanwhile, a police detective is investigating a string of brutal murders, where he also runs across the name "Tomie." How are the two connected?', 'Following some trauma in her past that has since been repressed, a young woman is trying to recover her memories with the help of a psychiatrist. During her hypnosis sessions, she repeats the name "Tomie" but is unable to recall where she knows it from. Meanwhile, a police detective is investigating a string of brutal murders, where he also runs across the name "Tomie." How are the two connected?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfHdSceORPkzKUs7sjUQPK8dcov.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37726'),
  ('522824607652289217', 'Tomie vs Tomie', 2007, 'Horror', 'Tomohiro Kubo, Atsushi Unno', 'Tomohiro Kubo', 'Yû Abiru, Chika Arakawa, Emiko Matsuoka, Natsuki Kasa, Tôru Hachinohe, Masaki Miura, Daikichi Sugawara, Hidekazu Nagae', null, 'A young, depressed man is trying to move on with his life after his girlfriend''s bizarre death. One day, a mysterious woman notices him at work and convinces his coworkers to introduce him to her.', 'A young, depressed man is trying to move on with his life after his girlfriend''s bizarre death. One day, a mysterious woman notices him at work and convinces his coworkers to introduce him to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWaF0SfiiAS2q6tI2t56siIb6D8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139396'),
  ('740313311436453811', 'Tomie: Another Face', 1999, 'Horror, Romance', 'Toshirô Inomata', 'Shôtarô Oikawa', 'Runa Nagai, Chie Tanaka, Akira Hirai, Mitsuaki Kaneko, Mayumi Yoshida, Atsushi Okuno, Eriko Odaira, Takara Harada', null, 'Tomie is a mysterious, beautiful girl you just can''t get rid of. She will come to your life from nowhere, and whatever you do, kill her or love her, she will come back to you in the end.', 'Tomie is a mysterious, beautiful girl you just can''t get rid of. She will come to your life from nowhere, and whatever you do, kill her or love her, she will come back to you in the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6Rx15seHOTSzLY8nyAuGsJxDsE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52404'),
  ('1151030362010408018', 'Tomie: Beginning', 2005, 'Horror', 'Ataru Oikawa', null, 'Rio Matsumoto, Asami Imajuku, Kenji Mizuhashi, Akifumi Miura, Yoshiyuki Morishita, Takashi Sugiuchi, Yuka Iwasaki, Nahana', null, 'Within days after the mysterious new student Kawakami Tomie joins a high school classroom, all hell literally breaks loose. Simple in-fighting between boys and girls over Tomie''s oppressive shadow soon gives way to mind-breaking violence, culminating in a grizzly dissection that ultimately leads to suicide, insanity, and even more violence.', 'Within days after the mysterious new student Kawakami Tomie joins a high school classroom, all hell literally breaks loose. Simple in-fighting between boys and girls over Tomie''s oppressive shadow soon gives way to mind-breaking violence, culminating in a grizzly dissection that ultimately leads to suicide, insanity, and even more violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XTSCom1omOieCff3l8MXzeFLiN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52405'),
  ('454202671496475302', 'Tomie: Forbidden Fruit', 2002, 'Horror', 'Shun Nakahara', 'Yoshinobu Fujioka', 'Nozomi Ando, Aoi Miyazaki, Jun Kunimura, Yuka Fujimoto, Ayaka Ninomiya, Chiaki Ōta, Tetsu Watanabe', null, 'When a lonely high school girl befriends a strange, mysterious and beautiful girl, it is soon becomes clear that the two girls'' meeting was not purely accidental.', 'When a lonely high school girl befriends a strange, mysterious and beautiful girl, it is soon becomes clear that the two girls'' meeting was not purely accidental.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qx46HD5gdd5fGT1USXK9VOqy7Rf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52407'),
  ('807305575627457459', 'Tomie: Rebirth', 2001, 'Horror', 'Takashi Shimizu, Yōichi Shiga', 'Yoshinobu Fujioka', 'Miki Sakai, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Kumiko Endo, Masaya Kikawada, Shugo Oshinari, Yutaka Nakajima, Yuri Hachisu, Tarō Suwa', null, 'Young art student Hideo paints an unnerving portrait of Tomie, who whispers that she loves him. Inexplicably, he reacts by stabbing her to death with a painting trowel. Two friends, Takumi and Shunichi, arrive on the scene and help him dispose of the body. To cheer him up, the boys take the unwitting murderer to the nearest bar for a party... but a mysterious girl named Tomie shows up, bearing a few odd physical resemblances to the dead girl in the ground.', 'Young art student Hideo paints an unnerving portrait of Tomie, who whispers that she loves him. Inexplicably, he reacts by stabbing her to death with a painting trowel. Two friends, Takumi and Shunichi, arrive on the scene and help him dispose of the body. To cheer him up, the boys take the unwitting murderer to the nearest bar for a party... but a mysterious girl named Tomie shows up, bearing a few odd physical resemblances to the dead girl in the ground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJ16L8nW2ouQmV0DQ2yebICIPy6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52408'),
  ('195599104591853441', 'Tomie: Replay', 2000, 'Horror', 'Fujirō Mitsuishi, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Satoru Tamaki', 'Sayaka Yamaguchi, Mai Hosho, Yosuke Kubozuka, Kenichi Endo, Makoto Togashi, Moro Morooka, Yoshiko Yura, Kumija Kim', null, 'Infected with Tomie''s blood, a surgeon disappears, leaving his daughter, Yumi, to try to discover Tomie''s identity and to solve the mystery of her father''s disappearance.', 'Infected with Tomie''s blood, a surgeon disappears, leaving his daughter, Yumi, to try to discover Tomie''s identity and to solve the mystery of her father''s disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qS13y5jhxwX6XABFJs6mEbLjun1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52409'),
  ('1022330633305736623', 'Tomie: Revenge', 2005, 'Horror', 'Ataru Oikawa', 'Ataru Oikawa', 'Hisako Shirata, Minami, Anri Ban, Kyūsaku Shimada, Hitoshi Kato, Shoji Shibuya, Itsuko Suzuki, Hideo Nakaizumi', null, 'A young woman named Kazue runs over a naked girl on a mountain road. When she stops to help, the girl runs off into an old abandoned house in the middle of the woods.', 'A young woman named Kazue runs over a naked girl on a mountain road. When she stops to help, the girl runs off into an old abandoned house in the middle of the woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aiS2JG8F8O58RHpzM3GMi8rTlrY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46313'),
  ('436788434514906273', 'Tomie: Unlimited', 2011, 'Horror', 'Noboru Iguchi, Yasutaka Nagano', 'Noboru Iguchi, Jun Tsugita', 'Moe Arai, Miu Nakamura, Aika Ota, Kensuke Owada, Koichi Ohori, Maiko Kawakami, Yui Murata, Maki Mizui', null, 'Tsukiko is part of the photography club at school, but has always felt less than her sister Tomie. She''s cute and very popular among boys. However, one day, Tomie dies in a horrible accident, triggering endless nightmares for Tsukiko. One year later, right when Tomie was supposed to turn 18, someone knocks on the door. Tomie is back.', 'Tsukiko is part of the photography club at school, but has always felt less than her sister Tomie. She''s cute and very popular among boys. However, one day, Tomie dies in a horrible accident, triggering endless nightmares for Tsukiko. One year later, right when Tomie was supposed to turn 18, someone knocks on the door. Tomie is back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogTfgx79VtGnSAmPaYu15SYqXRI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85349'),
  ('118321120206775246', 'Tomka and His Friends', 1977, 'Drama, Family, War', 'Xhanfise Keko, Faruk Basha', 'Nasho Jorgaqi', 'Sotiraq Çili, Pavlina Oça, Enea Zhegu, Zehrudin Dokle, Xhelal Tafaj, Herion Mustafaraj, Genci Mosha, Artan Puto', null, 'Tomka is a boy who likes playing football with his friends. When the German army captures his town, the German soldiers establish their camp in the town stadium. Tomka with help from his friends and their parents organizes sabotage actions against the soldiers.', 'Tomka is a boy who likes playing football with his friends. When the German army captures his town, the German soldiers establish their camp in the town stadium. Tomka with help from his friends and their parents organizes sabotage actions against the soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7VpjAPHTTSjCQyetkSLAhF3Lzc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263014'),
  ('574362770918726173', 'Tommaso', 2016, 'Drama', 'Gian Filippo Corticelli, Kim Rossi Stuart', 'Kim Rossi Stuart, Federico Starnone', 'Kim Rossi Stuart, Jasmine Trinca, Cristiana Capotondi, Camilla Diana, Dagmar Lassander, Serra Yılmaz, Edoardo Pesce, Renato Scarpa', null, 'Tommaso has just left his first wife but he will meet a new person who will change everything in his life.', 'Tommaso has just left his first wife but he will meet a new person who will change everything in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXxozBvCS0GJ8wb7Iw1xPJqbHl3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411861'),
  ('1073398018745433936', 'Tommaso', 2020, 'Drama', 'Abel Ferrara, Peter Zeitlinger, Giulio Donato', 'Abel Ferrara', 'Willem Dafoe, Cristina Chiriac, Anna Ferrara, Alessandra Scarci, Maricla Amoriello, Luciano Sovena, Sofia Rania, Anastasia Balan', null, 'Tommaso is an American expat film director living in Rome with his young wife and their daughter. Disoriented by his past misgivings and subsequent unexpected blows to his self-esteem, Tommaso wades through this late chapter of his life with an increasingly impaired grasp on reality as he prepares for his next film.', 'Tommaso is an American expat film director living in Rome with his young wife and their daughter. Disoriented by his past misgivings and subsequent unexpected blows to his self-esteem, Tommaso wades through this late chapter of his life with an increasingly impaired grasp on reality as he prepares for his next film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLRp3j8KVlk2LI0pw9M1OFUJzKQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575426'),
  ('889418342963506505', 'Tommy', 1975, 'Drama, Music', 'Ken Russell, Dick Bush, Ronnie Taylor', 'Ken Russell', 'Oliver Reed, Ann-Margret, Roger Daltrey, Elton John, Eric Clapton, John Entwistle, Keith Moon, Paul Nicholas', 'PG', 'After a series of traumatic childhood events, a psychosomatically deaf, dumb and blind boy becomes a master pinball player and the object of a religious cult.', 'After a series of traumatic childhood events, a psychosomatically deaf, dumb and blind boy becomes a master pinball player and the object of a religious cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAImVnqBJwoFAKrcpAe17JjLGUs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11326'),
  ('370802116650962355', 'Tommy and the Wildcat', 1998, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Raimo O. Niemi, Kari Sohlberg, Ville Suhonen', 'Martin Daniel, Ville Suhonen', 'Konsta Hietanen, Risto Tuorila, Jarmo Mäkinen, Antti Virmavirta, Kristiina Halttu, Rauno Ahonen, Jussi Puhakka, Markku Huhtamo', null, 'Twelve-year-old Tommy reluctantly moves with his father from the big city to a small Lapp village - the childhood home of his mother, who has recently died. The village is close to the northernmost wildlife reserve in the world, where Tommy''s father will be working on a project to release a captive lynx into the wild. The boy gradually falls under the spell of his new surroundings, and discovers that his mother was involved in protecting the local lynx, and, when his father''s project fails, and the lynx is about to be sold, he decides to set it free himself. A dramatic series of events ensues, and Tommy, through his brave actions, regains the trust and respect of his family and the village.', 'Twelve-year-old Tommy reluctantly moves with his father from the big city to a small Lapp village - the childhood home of his mother, who has recently died. The village is close to the northernmost wildlife reserve in the world, where Tommy''s father will be working on a project to release a captive lynx into the wild. The boy gradually falls under the spell of his new surroundings, and discovers that his mother was involved in protecting the local lynx, and, when his father''s project fails, and the lynx is about to be sold, he decides to set it free himself. A dramatic series of events ensues, and Tommy, through his brave actions, regains the trust and respect of his family and the village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzhimUBz7LSHZrLklInctBS5U9k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234850'),
  ('1045730234144636857', 'Tommy Boy', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Peter Segal, Victor J. Kemper', 'Terry Turner', 'Chris Farley, David Spade, Brian Dennehy, Julie Warner, Bo Derek, Rob Lowe, Dan Aykroyd, Sean McCann', 'PG-13', 'To save the family business, two ne’er-do-well traveling salesmen hit the road with disastrously funny consequences.', 'To save the family business, two ne’er-do-well traveling salesmen hit the road with disastrously funny consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeEM8v1OA9u6F5NC2lzXD04Ls1U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11381'),
  ('760673993583378446', 'Tommy Tricker and the Stamp Traveller', 1988, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Michael Rubbo, Andreas Poulsson', 'Michael Rubbo', 'Anthony Rogers, Lucas Evans, Jill Stanley, Andrew Whitehead, Paul Popowich, Han Yun, Chen Yuan Tao, Catherine Wright', null, 'When the joker Tommy Tricker plays some practical jokes on some of his friends, his best friend Ralph, a stamp collector, discovers the secret of "stamp travel" to make him travel around the world on a stamp to bring back the mysterious Charles Merriweather, who never returned on a stamp for 75 years.', 'When the joker Tommy Tricker plays some practical jokes on some of his friends, his best friend Ralph, a stamp collector, discovers the secret of "stamp travel" to make him travel around the world on a stamp to bring back the mysterious Charles Merriweather, who never returned on a stamp for 75 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lmyqrYZrSG78RgtMDNm72AtnvQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32038'),
  ('732180274261981282', 'Tommy Tucker''s Tooth', 1922, 'Comedy, Documentary, Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Jack Records', null, 'Tommy Tucker''s Tooth is a live-action short film by Walt Disney at his short-lived Laugh-O-Grams studio in Kansas City from 1922. The film was one of two commissioned by Kansas City Dentist Thomas B. McCrum. It earned the Laugh-O-Gram studio $500.', 'Tommy Tucker''s Tooth is a live-action short film by Walt Disney at his short-lived Laugh-O-Grams studio in Kansas City from 1922. The film was one of two commissioned by Kansas City Dentist Thomas B. McCrum. It earned the Laugh-O-Gram studio $500.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FPEM7vORYc8K0QOqLdWmgXBfAc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175518'),
  ('504649201820452149', 'Tomorrow', 1972, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joseph Anthony, Alan Hopkins, Allan Green', 'Horton Foote', 'Robert Duvall, Olga Bellin, Sudie Bond, Richard McConnell, Peter Masterson, William Hawley, James Franks, Johnny Mask', null, 'A lonely farmer takes in a pregnant woman and looks after her. After she gives birth, tragedy strikes.', 'A lonely farmer takes in a pregnant woman and looks after her. After she gives birth, tragedy strikes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sq43h42ZATUMaJzRiLYZQMYnfVQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83135'),
  ('642758216218418202', 'Tomorrow', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Mélanie Laurent, Cyril Dion, Alexandre Léglise', 'Cyril Dion', 'Cyril Dion, Mélanie Laurent, Pierre Rabhi, Vandana Shiva, Jeremy Rifkin, Anthony Barnosky, Elizabeth Hadly, Olivier De Schutter', null, 'Climate is changing. Instead of showing all the worst that can happen, this documentary focuses on the people suggesting solutions and their actions.', 'Climate is changing. Instead of showing all the worst that can happen, this documentary focuses on the people suggesting solutions and their actions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6GBWqZXrZyXwGzY5O4mUc3rAjB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371492'),
  ('759395261610878611', 'Tomorrow and Thereafter', 2017, 'Drama', 'Noémie Lvovsky, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Florence Seyvos, Noémie Lvovsky', 'Luce Rodriguez, Noémie Lvovsky, Mathieu Amalric, Micha Lescot, Anaïs Demoustier, Elsa Amiel, India Hair, Julie-Marie Parmentier', null, 'Mathilde is nine years old. Her parents have separated. She lives with her mother, a fragile person who hovers at the edge of madness. It is a story of a unique love between a daughter and her mother.', 'Mathilde is nine years old. Her parents have separated. She lives with her mother, a fragile person who hovers at the edge of madness. It is a story of a unique love between a daughter and her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wP1dbZxixNiDKlTLm8uKRvtdro9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458807'),
  ('917775633046273306', 'Tomorrow at Dawn', 2009, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Denis Dercourt, Rémy Chevrin', 'Denis Dercourt, Jacques Sotty', 'Vincent Perez, Jérémie Renier, Anne Marivin, Gabriella Wright, Aurélien Recoing, Gérald Laroche, Françoise Lebrun, Jérôme Bertin', null, 'Mathieu, a piano virtuoso, goes home to help his brother Paul to take care of their sick mother. Paul is into reenacting old battles, dressing up and getting into character, even dueling if necessary. Mathieu gets involved in this world and play becomes real.', 'Mathieu, a piano virtuoso, goes home to help his brother Paul to take care of their sick mother. Paul is into reenacting old battles, dressing up and getting into character, even dueling if necessary. Mathieu gets involved in this world and play becomes real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WQg4TqzIc2fmevKYnrTopKXPs2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33913'),
