  ('77764482254896080', 'Top Dog', 1978, 'Drama', 'Feliks Falk, Hanna Kosinska, Zbigniew Gruz', 'Feliks Falk', 'Jerzy Stuhr, Sława Kwaśniewska, Wiktor Sadecki, Michał Tarkowski, Jana Švandová, Ewa Kolasińska-Szramel, Jerzy Kryszak, Ryszard Kotys', null, 'An ironic look at a climber who decides to do anything to get a job he thinks will launch him into a better career.', 'An ironic look at a climber who decides to do anything to get a job he thinks will launch him into a better career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTlxTYrELSSF6DrQnhpP1V3dbWl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258392'),
