  ('378382945530286985', 'Top Dogs', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Julien Guetta, Euric Allaire, Nina Boussad', 'Julien Guetta, Lionel Dutemple', 'Jean-Paul Rouve, Grégoire Ludig, Marie Gillain, Michel Blanc, Satya Dusaugey, Yves Heck, Aurore Broutin, Nils Hamel Brochen', null, 'Antoine and Christian, two long-estranged brothers from Normandy, couldn’t be more different from each other: while the former is happily married with two kids and a successful boat driver, the latter is a facetious globe-trotting hustler who likes to engage in bar fights. But when Antoine starts getting involved in sleazy activities, Christian flies to his rescue. In an unexpected bonding-adventure they take upon themselves to defend the family they thought they’d never be.', 'Antoine and Christian, two long-estranged brothers from Normandy, couldn’t be more different from each other: while the former is happily married with two kids and a successful boat driver, the latter is a facetious globe-trotting hustler who likes to engage in bar fights. But when Antoine starts getting involved in sleazy activities, Christian flies to his rescue. In an unexpected bonding-adventure they take upon themselves to defend the family they thought they’d never be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIloaO60kkxgBNjFFulST4LKTwv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860469'),
  ('574895415624836697', 'Top Fighter', 1995, 'Documentary, Action', 'Toby Russell', 'George Tan', 'Jackie Chan, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Dorian Tan Tao-Liang, Joe Lewis, Jim Kelly, Jesse Glover, Don Wilson, Tony Liu Tian-jue', 'NR', 'Welcome to the world of the martial arts. A voyage for the times of the martial arts cinema, from the beginning in China in the 6th Century A.C. by a Buddhist monk, Bodhidharma, until the actual time and the influence in the world, with interviews to actors and historians, and a review to the most important movies of all times and to the most famous action movies actors. A magnificent jewel of this genre what nobody wouldn''t lose.', 'Welcome to the world of the martial arts. A voyage for the times of the martial arts cinema, from the beginning in China in the 6th Century A.C. by a Buddhist monk, Bodhidharma, until the actual time and the influence in the world, with interviews to actors and historians, and a review to the most important movies of all times and to the most famous action movies actors. A magnificent jewel of this genre what nobody wouldn''t lose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ox6gdXTuyJi0sQCBP1VFCJCg8r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50151'),
  ('1134916541321272289', 'Top Five', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Chris Rock, Manuel Alberto Claro, Adam Escott', 'Chris Rock', 'Chris Rock, Rosario Dawson, JB Smoove, Gabrielle Union, Romany Malco, Anders Holm, Cedric the Entertainer, Kevin Hart', 'R', 'Though he began in stand-up comedy, Andre Allen hit the big-time as the star of a trilogy of action-comedies about a talking bear but now he wants to be taken seriously. His passion project about the Haitian Revolution, a movie called Uprize, was panned by the NY Times film critic. A couple days before the wedding to his reality star fiancée, he''s forced to spend the day with Chelsea Brown, a profile writer for the New York Times. Unexpectedly, he opens up to her, and as they wind their way across New York, he tries to get back in touch with his comedic roots.', 'Though he began in stand-up comedy, Andre Allen hit the big-time as the star of a trilogy of action-comedies about a talking bear but now he wants to be taken seriously. His passion project about the Haitian Revolution, a movie called Uprize, was panned by the NY Times film critic. A couple days before the wedding to his reality star fiancée, he''s forced to spend the day with Chelsea Brown, a profile writer for the New York Times. Unexpectedly, he opens up to her, and as they wind their way across New York, he tries to get back in touch with his comedic roots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nM5zWv6zpWHsrKNMrPKg23UHZCA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284296'),
  ('704831281249302772', 'Top Floor Left Wing', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Angelo Cianci', 'Angelo Cianci', 'Hippolyte Girardot, Mohamed Fellag, Aymen Saïdi, Judith Henry, Michel Vuillermoz, Julie-Anne Roth, Georges Siatidis, Thierry Godard', null, 'Like every morning, François Echeveria, a bailiff, should have been able to make a seizure in a suburban city, then quietly return home. But that day, fate decided otherwise. Due to a misunderstanding, he is taken hostage by an impoverished father and his wild son...', 'Like every morning, François Echeveria, a bailiff, should have been able to make a seizure in a suburban city, then quietly return home. But that day, fate decided otherwise. Due to a misunderstanding, he is taken hostage by an impoverished father and his wild son...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IpaxOzmdqRWfGiiNbbDvqthjEi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162374'),
  ('1116947402773763211', 'Top Gear: Polar Special', 2007, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Nigel Simpkiss', null, 'Jeremy Clarkson, Richard Hammond, James May, Ranulph Fiennes', null, 'Clarkson and May, in a seriously modified Toyota, take on Hammond and his dog sled in a 450 mil race to the North pole as they drive over thin ice to face in-tent hostilities, polar bear fear and desperate food fantasies.', 'Clarkson and May, in a seriously modified Toyota, take on Hammond and his dog sled in a 450 mil race to the North pole as they drive over thin ice to face in-tent hostilities, polar bear fear and desperate food fantasies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHCKk3TKgtEBeO9yyqdly3ebb9O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436511'),
  ('111633153118746015', 'Top Gear: The Perfect Road Trip', 2013, 'TV Movie, Action, Adventure, Documentary', 'Phil Churchward', null, 'Jeremy Clarkson, Richard Hammond, Ben Collins', 'NR', 'The aim: to select the ideal mode of transport for each leg of a pilgrimage from Venice, Italy to Pau in France – home to a legendary street circuit and the origins of Grand Prix racing. On the way we prepare by taking to the track at Monza – the home of Italian Formula One. We try to get noticed on the road course in Monaco in a Bugatti, a Lamborghini and a Model T Ford. After cruising the canals in Venice we take to the tarmac and things look good - thanks to the Ferrari F12 Berlinetta and Mercedes SLS Black. Throw in a Pagani Huayra, Porsche Cayman S and a GT3 as well as the Aston Martin Vanquish centenary edition, Bentley V8 convertible, Rolls Royce Phantom coupe and the face-bending BAC Mono all seems pretty perfect to us.', 'The aim: to select the ideal mode of transport for each leg of a pilgrimage from Venice, Italy to Pau in France – home to a legendary street circuit and the origins of Grand Prix racing. On the way we prepare by taking to the track at Monza – the home of Italian Formula One. We try to get noticed on the road course in Monaco in a Bugatti, a Lamborghini and a Model T Ford. After cruising the canals in Venice we take to the tarmac and things look good - thanks to the Ferrari F12 Berlinetta and Mercedes SLS Black. Throw in a Pagani Huayra, Porsche Cayman S and a GT3 as well as the Aston Martin Vanquish centenary edition, Bentley V8 convertible, Rolls Royce Phantom coupe and the face-bending BAC Mono all seems pretty perfect to us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqgjNxenML4ISLuXZMKMKqd1Tnf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238234'),
  ('307571002478386516', 'Top Gun', 1955, 'Western', 'Ray Nazarro, Lester White', 'Steve Fisher, Richard Schayer', 'Sterling Hayden, William Bishop, Karin Booth, James Millican, Regis Toomey, Hugh Sanders, John Dehner, Rod Taylor', null, 'A gunslinger returns to his hometown to warn of an impending outlaw gang attack, but he''s met with hatred and fear for his previous killings.', 'A gunslinger returns to his hometown to warn of an impending outlaw gang attack, but he''s met with hatred and fear for his previous killings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRfQNdS3PoOe2Uq7ZYFQV9qs6Cd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243655'),
  ('1087778489181231858', 'Top Gun', 1986, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Jeffrey L. Kimball, Sharon Mann, Patrick Cosgrove', 'Jim Cash, Jack Epps Jr.', 'Tom Cruise, Kelly McGillis, Val Kilmer, Anthony Edwards, Tom Skerritt, Michael Ironside, John Stockwell, Barry Tubb', 'PG', 'For Lieutenant Pete ''Maverick'' Mitchell and his friend and co-pilot Nick ''Goose'' Bradshaw, being accepted into an elite training school for fighter pilots is a dream come true. But a tragedy, as well as personal demons, will threaten Pete''s dreams of becoming an ace pilot.', 'For Lieutenant Pete ''Maverick'' Mitchell and his friend and co-pilot Nick ''Goose'' Bradshaw, being accepted into an elite training school for fighter pilots is a dream come true. But a tragedy, as well as personal demons, will threaten Pete''s dreams of becoming an ace pilot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUuHj3CgmZQ9P2cMaqQs4J0d4Zc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744'),
  ('416491193560705912', 'Top Gun: Maverick', 2022, 'Action, Drama', 'Scott Robertson, Andrew Stahl, Robert E. Kay', 'Ehren Kruger, Eric Warren Singer, Christopher McQuarrie', 'Tom Cruise, Val Kilmer, Miles Teller, Jennifer Connelly, Bashir Salahuddin, Jon Hamm, Charles Parnell, Monica Barbaro', 'PG-13', 'After more than thirty years of service as one of the Navy’s top aviators, and dodging the advancement in rank that would ground him, Pete “Maverick” Mitchell finds himself training a detachment of TOP GUN graduates for a specialized mission the likes of which no living pilot has ever seen.', 'After more than thirty years of service as one of the Navy’s top aviators, and dodging the advancement in rank that would ground him, Pete “Maverick” Mitchell finds himself training a detachment of TOP GUN graduates for a specialized mission the likes of which no living pilot has ever seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62HCnUTziyWcpDaBO2i1DX17ljH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361743'),
  ('575372491855091358', 'Top Gunner', 2020, 'Action', 'Daniel Lusko, Philip Seeger', 'Geoff Meed', 'Eric Roberts, Carol Anne Watts, Ignacyo Matynia, Julian Cavett, Sarah H. Wilkinson, Reavis Dorsey, Buck Burns, Shayne Hartigan', null, 'Recent graduates of a secluded U.S. Air Force base must protect a gene-editing bioweapon from the Russian military—who are desperate to seize the deadly viral agent at any cost.', 'Recent graduates of a secluded U.S. Air Force base must protect a gene-editing bioweapon from the Russian military—who are desperate to seize the deadly viral agent at any cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3pYxiYHcPlEIW44RYdQgNQESvE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714351'),
  ('1054147792859868639', 'Top Gunner: Danger Zone', 2022, 'Action', 'Xavier DuBose, Glenn Miller', 'Marc Gottlieb', 'Michael Paré, Jack Pearson, Alex Herrald, Gina Daidone, Edwin Modlin II, David Thomas Newman, Torrey Richardson, Chandler Dunman', null, 'An airliner filled with 800 passengers is forced to fly fast and low, above farmlands, suburbs and skyscraper-packed cities or the tons of explosives aboard will detonate. When an elite unit of US Air Force fighter jets is sent to provide escort, they find themselves facing a squadron of unidentifiable warplanes which ignites a deadly air battle that threatens to destroy all life above and below.', 'An airliner filled with 800 passengers is forced to fly fast and low, above farmlands, suburbs and skyscraper-packed cities or the tons of explosives aboard will detonate. When an elite unit of US Air Force fighter jets is sent to provide escort, they find themselves facing a squadron of unidentifiable warplanes which ignites a deadly air battle that threatens to destroy all life above and below.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29UCk1nvPzn2XubLk5rKDMlHBRu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:980083'),
  ('1067491916739684350', 'Top Hat', 1935, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Mark Sandrich, David Abel, Max Steiner', 'Allan Scott, Dwight Taylor', 'Fred Astaire, Ginger Rogers, Edward Everett Horton, Erik Rhodes, Eric Blore, Helen Broderick, Lucille Ball, Gino Corrado', 'NR', 'Showman Jerry Travers is working for producer Horace Hardwick in London. Jerry demonstrates his new dance steps late one night in Horace''s hotel room, much to the annoyance of sleeping Dale Tremont below. She goes upstairs to complain and the two are immediately attracted to each other. Complications arise when Dale mistakes Jerry for Horace.', 'Showman Jerry Travers is working for producer Horace Hardwick in London. Jerry demonstrates his new dance steps late one night in Horace''s hotel room, much to the annoyance of sleeping Dale Tremont below. She goes upstairs to complain and the two are immediately attracted to each other. Complications arise when Dale mistakes Jerry for Horace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoPBiN6PBs2NsP7BNOJGCnmwruG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3080'),
  ('632797502553322546', 'Top Line', 1988, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Horror, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Nello Rossati, Guglielmo Mancori', 'Roberto Gianviti, Nello Rossati', 'Franco Nero, Deborah Moore, Mary Stavin, William Berger, Shirley Hernandez, George Kennedy, Rodrigo Obregón, Larry Dolgin', null, 'A down-on-his-luck author makes the find of a lifetime in the remote Columbian jungle, in the form of an alien spacecraft . He sets off to announce his find to the world, but finds that a mishmash of government agents, organized crime members, neo-Nazi extremists and extraterrestrials are all out to prevent him from revealing his discovery.', 'A down-on-his-luck author makes the find of a lifetime in the remote Columbian jungle, in the form of an alien spacecraft . He sets off to announce his find to the world, but finds that a mishmash of government agents, organized crime members, neo-Nazi extremists and extraterrestrials are all out to prevent him from revealing his discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGQY8Osn5vYMcSmdotIFXwyMKuc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113159'),
  ('317635392219408424', 'Top Managers', 1987, 'Adventure, Comedy, Mystery', 'Claude Zidi', 'Michel Fabre, Didier Kaminka, Simon Michaël', 'François Cluzet, Christophe Malavoy, Claire Nebout, Jean-Claude Leguay, Gérard Lecaillon, Ana Padrão, Roger Dumas, Bruno Journée', null, 'While his three former college friends - Thierry, Gérard and Francis have made successful careers for themselves in business, Daniel has yet to make the grade. Tired of Daniel''s frequent attempts to drag them into ill-considered ventures, Thierry and Gérard decide to play a cruel trick on him by making him think he has won the national lottery.', 'While his three former college friends - Thierry, Gérard and Francis have made successful careers for themselves in business, Daniel has yet to make the grade. Tired of Daniel''s frequent attempts to drag them into ill-considered ventures, Thierry and Gérard decide to play a cruel trick on him by making him think he has won the national lottery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9YhwHO6NLtMB9VEFOdnyslhU5f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64080'),
  ('502567126292811262', 'Top Model', 1987, 'Thriller', 'Mario Gariazzo', 'Mario Gariazzo', 'Florence Guérin, Marino Masé, Martine Brochard, Ann Margaret Hughes, Stefano Sabelli, Adriana Giuffrè, Cristian Lindgreen, Marta Petrilli', null, 'Nadine is a breathtaking and astonishingly sensual fashion photographer who gets lured into accepting a lingerie photo-shoot in the villa of the mysterious Victor Schneider. After the models and the crew leave the villa, only Nadine and Victor stay behind. As the night shrouds the villa with its thick shadows, Victor offers Nadine a weird proposal. Would she dare to put her own life at stake in a chess game? If he wins, she loses every right over her body and life. If Nadine does, Victor will kill himself. Thus begins a long night of sex, lust, desire, fear and. death.', 'Nadine is a breathtaking and astonishingly sensual fashion photographer who gets lured into accepting a lingerie photo-shoot in the villa of the mysterious Victor Schneider. After the models and the crew leave the villa, only Nadine and Victor stay behind. As the night shrouds the villa with its thick shadows, Victor offers Nadine a weird proposal. Would she dare to put her own life at stake in a chess game? If he wins, she loses every right over her body and life. If Nadine does, Victor will kill himself. Thus begins a long night of sex, lust, desire, fear and. death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJ5X7ax6oBqVumIiFT06jYH0aUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384171'),
  ('86285406233563861', 'Top Model', 1988, 'Drama', 'Joe D''Amato, Rubina Michettoni', 'Rossella Drudi', 'Jessica Moore, James Sutterfield, Ale Dugas, Laura Gemser, Jason Saucier, Lin Gathright, Richard Douvillier, Mark Shannon', 'R', 'Gloria works as a top nude model and prostitute, but she has a secret. In reality she is writer and social critic Sarah Asproon researching her new book. Peter finds out and blackmails her by demanding sex for his silence. Meanwhile Sarah develops feelings for computer whiz Cliff, who struggles to resolve his own sexual orientation.', 'Gloria works as a top nude model and prostitute, but she has a secret. In reality she is writer and social critic Sarah Asproon researching her new book. Peter finds out and blackmails her by demanding sex for his silence. Meanwhile Sarah develops feelings for computer whiz Cliff, who struggles to resolve his own sexual orientation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4zHGClSi7XNHSSFoJSI83jKWkw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30494'),
  ('263105003026565096', 'Top of the Food Chain', 1999, 'Horror, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'John Paizs, Bill Wong Chung-Piu, Kelly Groh', 'Phil Bedard, Larry LaFond', 'Campbell Scott, Fiona Loewi, Tom Everett Scott, Nigel Bennett, Hardee T. Lineham, James Allodi, Bernard Behrens, Elisa Moolecherry', null, 'An isolated Canadian town (populated by the weirdest group of people this side of Saturn) has seen its share of problems. First the nut factory closed, then the CATV antenna stopped broadcasting, and now something is gruesomely devouring the townsfolk! Can visiting atomic scientist (and expert on "cool fusion") Dr. Karel Lamonte solve the mystery before everyone disappears?', 'An isolated Canadian town (populated by the weirdest group of people this side of Saturn) has seen its share of problems. First the nut factory closed, then the CATV antenna stopped broadcasting, and now something is gruesomely devouring the townsfolk! Can visiting atomic scientist (and expert on "cool fusion") Dr. Karel Lamonte solve the mystery before everyone disappears?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlugDKVFAeXB7n6LRHZVepDUub0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8464'),
  ('267184707054889140', 'Top of the Heap', 1972, 'Crime, Drama', 'Christopher St. John, Richard A. Kelley', 'Christopher St. John', 'Christopher St. John, Paula Kelly, Florence St. Peter, Ingeborg Sørensen, Almeria Quinn, Allen Garfield, Marilyn Wirt, Anne Mason', 'R', 'A Black cop is pushed over the edge when he is passed over for a promotion, leading him on a violent personal crusade against criminals punctuated by feverish psychedelic dream visions.', 'A Black cop is pushed over the edge when he is passed over for a promotion, leading him on a violent personal crusade against criminals punctuated by feverish psychedelic dream visions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cKGFUMrAaydM7QjK6K7Oim3jFA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96127'),
  ('275881157931736002', 'Top of the World', 1997, 'Action, Thriller', 'Sidney J. Furie, Alan Caso', 'Bart Madison', 'Peter Weller, Dennis Hopper, Tia Carrere, Joe Pantoliano, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Peter Coyote, Martin Kove, Michael Delano', null, 'In Las Vegas for a quicky divorce, a just-paroled ex-cop and his wife wander into the Top of the World Casino, run by the shady Charles Atlas. They win big, right as the casino is being robbed. The police believe their big win was a staged diversion, and the two of them become suspects. Over the course of the evening and next morning, the two attempt to escape to surrounded casino, and to prove their innocence, as well as to save their marriage.', 'In Las Vegas for a quicky divorce, a just-paroled ex-cop and his wife wander into the Top of the World Casino, run by the shady Charles Atlas. They win big, right as the casino is being robbed. The police believe their big win was a staged diversion, and the two of them become suspects. Over the course of the evening and next morning, the two attempt to escape to surrounded casino, and to prove their innocence, as well as to save their marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/so7Rwz66AQ1Rn1jx2KqpS3i3aWz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38162'),
  ('906186332341730422', 'Top Secret!', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Jim Abrahams, David Zucker, Jerry Zucker', 'Jim Abrahams, David Zucker, Jerry Zucker', 'Val Kilmer, Lucy Gutteridge, Peter Cushing, Jeremy Kemp, Christopher Villiers, Warren Clarke, Harry Ditson, Jim Carter', 'PG', 'Popular and dashing American singer Nick Rivers travels to East Germany to perform in a music festival. When he loses his heart to the gorgeous Hillary Flammond, he finds himself caught up in an underground resistance movement. Rivers joins forces with Agent Cedric and Flammond to attempt the rescue of her father, Dr. Paul, from the Germans, who have captured the scientist in hopes of coercing him into building a new naval mine.', 'Popular and dashing American singer Nick Rivers travels to East Germany to perform in a music festival. When he loses his heart to the gorgeous Hillary Flammond, he finds himself caught up in an underground resistance movement. Rivers joins forces with Agent Cedric and Flammond to attempt the rescue of her father, Dr. Paul, from the Germans, who have captured the scientist in hopes of coercing him into building a new naval mine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRTbfR27xghnVMs3ZJ3EhK3zzud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8764'),
  ('245677667446570972', 'Top Stripper', 1982, 'Drama', 'Nobumasa Mizunoo, Yoshimitsu Morita, Hiroyuki Nasu', 'Yoshimitsu Morita', 'Kaori Okamoto, Ken Miyawaki, Nami Misaki, Ayako Ota, Jun Ueno, Yudo Yoshikawa, Akio Kaneda, Noriko Ohtaka', null, 'A naive delivery boy becomes infatuated with a girl who works at a local strip joint. Despite his daily attendance and attempts to get her attention she remains indifferent until one day she invites him onstage.', 'A naive delivery boy becomes infatuated with a girl who works at a local strip joint. Despite his daily attendance and attempts to get her attention she remains indifferent until one day she invites him onstage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4rjr5asg4HVNQyL87wQTJBiY4D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315401'),
  ('957477586718765303', 'Topaz', 1969, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Jack Hildyard, Douglas Green', 'Samuel A. Taylor', 'Frederick Stafford, Dany Robin, John Vernon, Karin Dor, Michel Piccoli, Philippe Noiret, Claude Jade, Michel Subor', null, 'Copenhagen, Denmark, 1962. When a high-ranking Soviet official decides to change sides, a French intelligence agent is caught up in a cold, silent and bloody spy war in which his own family will play a decisive role.', 'Copenhagen, Denmark, 1962. When a high-ranking Soviet official decides to change sides, a French intelligence agent is caught up in a cold, silent and bloody spy war in which his own family will play a decisive role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8u7vxykCVZoaxNocLbpstv3IFNK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2370'),
  ('391435428138857830', 'Topaze', 1933, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Harry d''Abbadie d''Arrast, Lucien N. Andriot, Doran Cox', 'Ben Hecht', 'John Barrymore, Myrna Loy, Reginald Mason, Jobyna Howland, Jackie Searl, Albert Conti, Frank Reicher, Luis Alberni', 'NR', 'An honest and naive schoolteacher gets a lesson in how the world works outside the classroom, when a rich Baron and his mistress use the teacher''s name and outstanding reputation in a crooked business scheme.', 'An honest and naive schoolteacher gets a lesson in how the world works outside the classroom, when a rich Baron and his mistress use the teacher''s name and outstanding reputation in a crooked business scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmpXT2T2Qi8WW7eP0BSU9mftAFC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200574'),
  ('194797648693794716', 'Topaze', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Marcel Pagnol, François Gir', 'Marcel Pagnol, Marcel Pagnol', 'Fernandel, Hélène Perdrière, Jacques Morel, Marcel Vallée, Jacqueline Pagnol, Jacques Castelot, Milly Mathis, Yvette Etiévant', null, 'Albert Topaze, sincere schoolteacher addicted to "rote" morality, works at a private school run by supremely money-grubbing M. Muche, whose daughter, also a teacher, makes cynical use of the knowledge that Topaze loves her. Alas, Topaze''s naive honesty brings him unjust dismissal...and makes him fair game for the "aunt" of his private pupil, really the mistress of crooked politician Regis, who needs an honest-seeming "front man." Can artful Suzy Courtois keep Topaze on the string? With steadily escalating disillusion comes moral crisis...', 'Albert Topaze, sincere schoolteacher addicted to "rote" morality, works at a private school run by supremely money-grubbing M. Muche, whose daughter, also a teacher, makes cynical use of the knowledge that Topaze loves her. Alas, Topaze''s naive honesty brings him unjust dismissal...and makes him fair game for the "aunt" of his private pupil, really the mistress of crooked politician Regis, who needs an honest-seeming "front man." Can artful Suzy Courtois keep Topaze on the string? With steadily escalating disillusion comes moral crisis...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/miswT07xQ7BMl3SGwdqau5Z86Uf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67756'),
  ('293490282465823292', 'Topkapi', 1964, 'Comedy, Crime, Adventure', 'Jules Dassin, Henri Alekan, Tom Pevsner', 'Monja Danischewsky', 'Melina Mercouri, Peter Ustinov, Maximilian Schell, Robert Morley, Jess Hahn, Gilles Ségal, Akim Tamiroff, Titos Vandis', 'NR', 'Arthur Simon Simpson is a small-time crook biding his time in Greece. One of his potential victims turns out to be a gentleman thief planning to steal the emerald-encrusted dagger of the Mehmed II from Istanbul''s Topkapi Museum.', 'Arthur Simon Simpson is a small-time crook biding his time in Greece. One of his potential victims turns out to be a gentleman thief planning to steal the emerald-encrusted dagger of the Mehmed II from Istanbul''s Topkapi Museum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Q5psd2bvCMWFdQp4RvRDgxSiwg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5052'),
  ('1128855508147728831', 'Topless', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Takahiro Hyakusoku, Eiji Uchida', 'Pudding Watanabe, Eiji Uchida', 'Erika Okuda, Mina Shimizu, Akifumi Uchida, Ryunosuke Kawai, Aya Omasa, Maki Sawa', null, 'The ever-lively and upbeat Natsuko tries to mend a broken heart by carrying on with a string of short-lived affairs after her break-up with Tomomi. But when Tomomi announces her plans to marry - a man - Natsuko becomes inconsolable.', 'The ever-lively and upbeat Natsuko tries to mend a broken heart by carrying on with a string of short-lived affairs after her break-up with Tomomi. But when Tomomi announces her plans to marry - a man - Natsuko becomes inconsolable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNXRdAwiUANnShrzPXKYTGitd6P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281984'),
  ('885077375444727705', 'Topless Women Talk About Their Lives', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Dale Elena McCready, Harry Sinclair', 'Harry Sinclair', 'Danielle Cormack, Joel Tobeck, Willa O''Neill, Ian Hughes, Shimpal Lelisi, Andrew Robertt, Frances Edmond, Josephine Davison', null, 'Liz has missed an appointment to have an abortion. She has to keep her child, and neither her boyfriend Geoff nor child''s father Neil are too happy about it. She can not decide which partner is better for her, and Neil makes a proposal to her when they attend the wedding of her best friend Prue and Mike. She probably prefers Geoff, but he is preoccupied with his girlfriend Bryony, who returned from abroad. Another friend, Ant, has written a script for documentary film, which is directed by a German and in which topless women, well, talk about their lives.', 'Liz has missed an appointment to have an abortion. She has to keep her child, and neither her boyfriend Geoff nor child''s father Neil are too happy about it. She can not decide which partner is better for her, and Neil makes a proposal to her when they attend the wedding of her best friend Prue and Mike. She probably prefers Geoff, but he is preoccupied with his girlfriend Bryony, who returned from abroad. Another friend, Ant, has written a script for documentary film, which is directed by a German and in which topless women, well, talk about their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wl8TxeA7eaQ8PmvxgKFHRBmOXSd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126139'),
  ('946508088008391346', 'Topper', 1937, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Norman Z. McLeod, Norbert Brodine', 'Eric Hatch, Jack Jevne, Eddie Moran', 'Constance Bennett, Cary Grant, Roland Young, Billie Burke, Alan Mowbray, Eugene Pallette, Arthur Lake, Hedda Hopper', 'PG-13', 'Madcap couple George and Marion Kerby are killed in an automobile accident. They return as ghosts to try and liven up the regimented lifestyle of their friend and bank president, Cosmo Topper. When Topper starts to live it up, it strains relations with his stuffy wife.', 'Madcap couple George and Marion Kerby are killed in an automobile accident. They return as ghosts to try and liven up the regimented lifestyle of their friend and bank president, Cosmo Topper. When Topper starts to live it up, it strains relations with his stuffy wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4HEIYO1WVb1fYOBaHnfWrSJnPHm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23101'),
  ('60457107923255240', 'Topper Returns', 1941, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Roy Del Ruth, Norbert Brodine, Bernard Carr', 'Jonathan Latimer, Gordon Douglas', 'Joan Blondell, Roland Young, Carole Landis, Billie Burke, Dennis O''Keefe, Patsy Kelly, H.B. Warner, Eddie ''Rochester'' Anderson', null, 'Topper is once again tormented by a fun-loving spirit. This time, it''s Gail Richards, accidentally murdered while vacationing at the home of her wealthy friend, Ann Carrington, the intended victim. With Topper''s help, Gail sets out to find her killer with the expected zany results.', 'Topper is once again tormented by a fun-loving spirit. This time, it''s Gail Richards, accidentally murdered while vacationing at the home of her wealthy friend, Ann Carrington, the intended victim. With Topper''s help, Gail sets out to find her killer with the expected zany results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lmk672uN88lT8W8wCD6xeWiUdX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44875'),
  ('525663870442044207', 'Topper Takes a Trip', 1938, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Norman Z. McLeod, Norbert Brodine', 'Eddie Moran, Jack Jevne, Corey Ford', 'Constance Bennett, Roland Young, Billie Burke, Alan Mowbray, Verree Teasdale, Franklin Pangborn, Alexander D''Arcy, Paul Hurst', null, 'Mrs. Topper''s friend Mrs. Parkhurst has convinced Mrs Topper to file for a divorce from Cosmo due to the strange circumstances of his trip with ghost Marion Kirby. Marion comes back from heaven''s door to help Cosmo again, this time only with dog Mr. Atlas. Due to a strange behavior of Cosmo, the judge refuses to divorce them, so Mrs. Parkhurst takes Mrs. Topper on a trip to France where she tries to arrange the final reasons for the divorce. With help of a gold-digging French baron, Marion takes Cosmo to the same hotel to bring them back together and to get her own final ticket to heaven, but the whole thing turns out to be not too easy.', 'Mrs. Topper''s friend Mrs. Parkhurst has convinced Mrs Topper to file for a divorce from Cosmo due to the strange circumstances of his trip with ghost Marion Kirby. Marion comes back from heaven''s door to help Cosmo again, this time only with dog Mr. Atlas. Due to a strange behavior of Cosmo, the judge refuses to divorce them, so Mrs. Parkhurst takes Mrs. Topper on a trip to France where she tries to arrange the final reasons for the divorce. With help of a gold-digging French baron, Marion takes Cosmo to the same hotel to bring them back together and to get her own final ticket to heaven, but the whole thing turns out to be not too easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7eNvEGuEIgnn1dwuVBpoQRYfhxH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54430'),
  ('373898778122271207', 'Tops with Pops', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Daws Butler', 'NR', 'Tom is chasing Jerry again. In a panic, the mouse runs into the doghouse of little Tyke, the bulldog. Right next to the sleeping Tyke sleeps Spike, his father. Tom unthinkingly snatches the puppy out of his house. When Spike wakes up and sees this, he delivers a stern warning: Stay away from my boy, or else. Jerry realizes that sticking close to the boy is the best way to repel his feline tormentor, but Tom is not about to let the mouse evade him so easily.', 'Tom is chasing Jerry again. In a panic, the mouse runs into the doghouse of little Tyke, the bulldog. Right next to the sleeping Tyke sleeps Spike, his father. Tom unthinkingly snatches the puppy out of his house. When Spike wakes up and sees this, he delivers a stern warning: Stay away from my boy, or else. Jerry realizes that sticking close to the boy is the best way to repel his feline tormentor, but Tom is not about to let the mouse evade him so easily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LdF71UeTjzErOHS4drr1soJLP3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93619'),
  ('374576554596230173', 'Topside', 2022, 'Drama', 'Celine Held, Logan George, Lowell A. Meyer', 'Celine Held, Logan George', 'Celine Held, Zhalia Farmer, FatLip, Jared Abrahamson, Gino Vento, Tonye Patano, Lorrie Odom, Cynthia Tombros', null, 'Deep in the underbelly of New York City, a five year-old girl and her mother live among a community that has claimed the abandoned subway tunnels as their home. After a sudden police-mandated eviction, the pair are forced to flee aboveground into a brutal winter night. Determined to return home, they fight to find shelter as their world is thrown into chaos.', 'Deep in the underbelly of New York City, a five year-old girl and her mother live among a community that has claimed the abandoned subway tunnels as their home. After a sudden police-mandated eviction, the pair are forced to flee aboveground into a brutal winter night. Determined to return home, they fight to find shelter as their world is thrown into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcDGQ2nBftKijYVNFcm0rWsaPiU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665899'),
  ('839649890979272880', 'Topsy Turvy, or Egg Nogg 2', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Roman Załuski, Jacek Mierosławski', 'Roman Załuski, Ilona Łepkowska', 'Grażyna Błęcka-Kolska, Dariusz Siatkowski, Katarzyna Łaniewska, Jerzy Turek, Zdzisław Wardejn, Stanisława Celińska, Paweł Nowisz, Jolanta Nowak', 'PG-13', 'Kasia and Pawel, having got married, live in the village of Brzozki, 10 kilometres from Grabow. Kasia wants to return to her pedagogical studies, so she does not want to have children yet. Pawel announces that he wants to break away from the traditional village farm and focus on specialised sheep breeding, which causes a family argument. Kasia''s parents anxiously await the birth of their grandchildren. Things get even more complicated when the Wolanskis arrive in Grabow. They offer to help Kasia go back to university, but in return Kasia has to look after little Piotr as the docent is leaving for London where he has received a month-long study grant.', 'Kasia and Pawel, having got married, live in the village of Brzozki, 10 kilometres from Grabow. Kasia wants to return to her pedagogical studies, so she does not want to have children yet. Pawel announces that he wants to break away from the traditional village farm and focus on specialised sheep breeding, which causes a family argument. Kasia''s parents anxiously await the birth of their grandchildren. Things get even more complicated when the Wolanskis arrive in Grabow. They offer to help Kasia go back to university, but in return Kasia has to look after little Piotr as the docent is leaving for London where he has received a month-long study grant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBKLIt73RbFxzDZ7BENoKLPEiEJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57723'),
  ('915905008160693107', 'Topsy-Turvy', 1999, 'Drama, Music, Comedy, History', 'Mike Leigh, Dick Pope, Gary Yershon', 'Mike Leigh', 'Jim Broadbent, Allan Corduner, Timothy Spall, Lesley Manville, Ron Cook, Wendy Nottingham, Kevin McKidd, Shirley Henderson', 'R', 'For nearly a decade, Gilbert and Sullivan’s collaborations have delighted the English people. But in 1884, as a London heat wave cuts into the theater trade, their latest work, "Princess Ida", receives lukewarm press. In an effort to reconcile their creative differences and drawing inspiration from Japanese culture, they went on to create the hit opera "The Mikado", one of the duo''s greatest successes.', 'For nearly a decade, Gilbert and Sullivan’s collaborations have delighted the English people. But in 1884, as a London heat wave cuts into the theater trade, their latest work, "Princess Ida", receives lukewarm press. In an effort to reconcile their creative differences and drawing inspiration from Japanese culture, they went on to create the hit opera "The Mikado", one of the duo''s greatest successes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxHjVAVOFgWbD2RptBBCLVO6SIR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46435'),
  ('1043661692010715845', 'Tora-san of Goto', 2016, 'Documentary, Drama, Family', 'Masaru Oura', null, 'Toru Inuzuka, Masayo Inuzuka, Kokoro Inuzuka, Hanae Inuzuka, Takuro Inuzuka, Sebun Inuzuka, Ken Matsudaira', null, 'This documentary film follows for 22 years a nine-member family involved in the manufacturing of Udon in the Goto Islands, Nagasaki prefecture. Mr. Toru Inuzuka called by nickname "Tora-san" is making famous ''Goto Udon'' and natural salt on the island on which the depopulation is progressing. Seven children get up at 5 o''clock every morning, helping to make udon, and go to school. Children''s help is recorded on the time card, and it is pocket money for children. The film talks about children''s growth, marriage, childbirth, homecoming, and parting. The 22 years of familiarity of the family is drawn.', 'This documentary film follows for 22 years a nine-member family involved in the manufacturing of Udon in the Goto Islands, Nagasaki prefecture. Mr. Toru Inuzuka called by nickname "Tora-san" is making famous ''Goto Udon'' and natural salt on the island on which the depopulation is progressing. Seven children get up at 5 o''clock every morning, helping to make udon, and go to school. Children''s help is recorded on the time card, and it is pocket money for children. The film talks about children''s growth, marriage, childbirth, homecoming, and parting. The 22 years of familiarity of the family is drawn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whua0x6CWoaus3MuB0MDmOP75k1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485228'),
  ('37396035475598821', 'Tora-san, Our Lovable Tramp', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Yoji Yamada, Tetsuo Takaha', 'Azuma Morisaki, Yoji Yamada', 'Kiyoshi Atsumi, Chieko Baisho, Sachiko Mitsumoto, Chishū Ryū, Takashi Shimura, Shin Morikawa, Gin Maeda, Taisaku Akino', null, 'Tora-san, an itinerant peddler who is thrown out of his father''s house twenty years before but reconnects with his aunt, uncle and sister Sakura. Tora wreaks some havoc in their lives, like getting drunk and silly at a marriage meeting and ruining Sakura''s chance to marry someone, as well as just being a real pain to those around him. There is a sentimental side to him also, and the best way to describe him is that he grows on you.', 'Tora-san, an itinerant peddler who is thrown out of his father''s house twenty years before but reconnects with his aunt, uncle and sister Sakura. Tora wreaks some havoc in their lives, like getting drunk and silly at a marriage meeting and ruining Sakura''s chance to marry someone, as well as just being a real pain to those around him. There is a sentimental side to him also, and the best way to describe him is that he grows on you.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9ytzAM7onmINsxF02nOVnVmBRz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125271'),
  ('1059122519472482437', 'Tora! Tora! Tora!', 1970, 'War, History, Drama', 'Toshio Masuda, Kinji Fukasaku, Richard Fleischer', 'Ryuzo Kikushima, Hideo Oguni, Larry Forrester', 'Martin Balsam, So Yamamura, Jason Robards, Joseph Cotten, Tatsuya Mihashi, E.G. Marshall, Takahiro Tamura, James Whitmore', 'G', 'In the summer of 1941, the United States and Japan seem on the brink of war after constant embargos and failed diplomacy come to no end. "Tora! Tora! Tora!", named after the code words used by the lead Japanese pilot to indicate they had surprised the Americans, covers the days leading up to the attack on Pearl Harbor, which plunged America into the Second World War.', 'In the summer of 1941, the United States and Japan seem on the brink of war after constant embargos and failed diplomacy come to no end. "Tora! Tora! Tora!", named after the code words used by the lead Japanese pilot to indicate they had surprised the Americans, covers the days leading up to the attack on Pearl Harbor, which plunged America into the Second World War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c311sN931DixuZRer0JGYCwpx9N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11165'),
  ('474418350758392403', 'Torbaaz', 2020, 'Drama', 'Arfaz Ayub, Girish Malik, Javed Karim', 'Bharti Jakhar', 'Sanjay Dutt, Rahul Dev, Nargis Fakhri, Gavie Chahal', null, 'At an Afghanistan refugee camp, an ex-army doctor seeks to bring children joy through cricket and soon realizes that the stakes go beyond the sport.', 'At an Afghanistan refugee camp, an ex-army doctor seeks to bring children joy through cricket and soon realizes that the stakes go beyond the sport.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yj44DlUalvtEKXI9Py6Xz8WypBZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681235'),
  ('1151588980721821730', 'Torch Song', 1953, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Charles Walters, Robert H. Planck', 'I.A.R. Wylie, John Michael Hayes, Jan Lustig', 'Joan Crawford, Michael Wilding, Gig Young, Marjorie Rambeau, Harry Morgan, Dorothy Patrick, James Todd, Eugene Loring', null, 'Jenny Stewart is a tough Broadway musical star who doesn''t take criticism from anyone. Yet there is one individual, Tye Graham, a blind pianist who may be able to break through her tough exterior.', 'Jenny Stewart is a tough Broadway musical star who doesn''t take criticism from anyone. Yet there is one individual, Tye Graham, a blind pianist who may be able to break through her tough exterior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9U6griHNqNi6AhuKwj2E54vfLR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133119'),
  ('496508457956675242', 'Torch Song Trilogy', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Paul Bogart, Mikael Salomon, J. Tom Archuleta', 'Harvey Fierstein', 'Harvey Fierstein, Matthew Broderick, Anne Bancroft, Brian Kerwin, Eddie Castrodad, Lorry Goldman, Ken Page, Karen Young', 'R', 'Arnold Beckoff is looking for love and acceptance, but as a gay man working as a female impersonator in 1970s New York City, neither come easily. After a series of heartaches, Arnold believes he has found the love of his life in Alan, and the couple make plans to adopt. But when tragedy strikes, Arnold''s life is shaken to its very core, leading to a confrontation with his overbearing mother, who has never approved of her son''s lifestyle.', 'Arnold Beckoff is looking for love and acceptance, but as a gay man working as a female impersonator in 1970s New York City, neither come easily. After a series of heartaches, Arnold believes he has found the love of his life in Alan, and the couple make plans to adopt. But when tragedy strikes, Arnold''s life is shaken to its very core, leading to a confrontation with his overbearing mother, who has never approved of her son''s lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uoMiWYfycupTa7PxJ1XUwqnN6gO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8463'),
  ('32845947439796049', 'Torero!', 1957, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Carlos Velo', 'Hugo Butler', 'Luis Procuna, Consuelo Procuna, Manolete, Carlos Arruza, Angel Procuna, Paco Malgesto, Luis Briones, Manuel Dos Santos', null, 'The life of the famed Mexican bullfighter Luis Procuna, from his boyhood through his training and the triumphs that followed as Procuna rose to the peak of his profession. Written by Jim Beaver', 'The life of the famed Mexican bullfighter Luis Procuna, from his boyhood through his training and the triumphs that followed as Procuna rose to the peak of his profession. Written by Jim Beaver', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJkSXA4q39qtEDE5wREoEFoI4MF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116498'),
  ('624129330064099355', 'Tori and Lokita', 2022, 'Drama', 'Luc Dardenne, Jean-Pierre Dardenne, Benoît Dervaux', 'Jean-Pierre Dardenne, Luc Dardenne', 'Pablo Schils, Joely Mbundu, Alban Ukaj, Tijmen Govaerts, Charlotte De Bruyne, Nadège Ouedraogo, Marc Zinga, Claire Bodson', null, 'In Belgium today, a young boy and an adolescent girl who have travelled alone from Africa pit their invincible friendship against the difficult conditions of their exile.', 'In Belgium today, a young boy and an adolescent girl who have travelled alone from Africa pit their invincible friendship against the difficult conditions of their exile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJCedM9kp6k491Gb4cCj7R5n1il.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:914203'),
  ('667329142211987108', 'Tori Girl!', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Tsutomu Hanabusa', 'Izumi Takahashi', 'Tao Tsuchiya, Shotaro Mamiya, Mahiro Takasugi, Elaiza Ikeda, Yuma Yamoto, Macaulay J Lee', null, 'Toriyama Yukina is finally in at the university of her choice to major in science. She studied hard to get in. The school is not exactly as she had imagined however. She has a crush on Kei and is motivated to join the man-flight club as a result, which competes in the contest of that same name. Obviously Yukina wants to buddy up with Kei, alas it may not be happening.', 'Toriyama Yukina is finally in at the university of her choice to major in science. She studied hard to get in. The school is not exactly as she had imagined however. She has a crush on Kei and is motivated to join the man-flight club as a result, which competes in the contest of that same name. Obviously Yukina wants to buddy up with Kei, alas it may not be happening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geyb2YuW9Vv7sNcFrNsrbGeW5u2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449136'),
  ('1045836923940807953', 'Toriko: Jump Super Anime Tour 2009 Special', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Fantasy', 'Yuichi Terao, Seiji Matsuda, Mitsuru Obunai', 'Masaki Hiramatsu', 'Takashi Kondo, Daisuke Kishio, Keiji Fujiwara', null, 'Special shown at the Jump Super Anime Tour in 2009. In a world where the taste and texture of food is extremely important, there exist individuals known as Bishoku-ya (luxury food providers) who specialize in the acquisition of rare ingredients and animals. Toriko is one of these hunters and it is his dream to find the most precious foods in the world and create the ultimate dinner course. As one of the most skilled hunters in the world he is regularly hired by restaurants and the rich to seek out new ingredients and rare animals. A man with inhuman ability, he utilizes his incredible strength and knowledge of the animal kingdom to capture ferocious, evasive and rare beasts to further his final goal, the ultimate dinner course composed of the most delicious food in the world. He is currently accompanied by a weak and timid chef who, inspired by Toriko''s ambition, travels with him to improve his culinary skills and find rare ingredients.', 'Special shown at the Jump Super Anime Tour in 2009. In a world where the taste and texture of food is extremely important, there exist individuals known as Bishoku-ya (luxury food providers) who specialize in the acquisition of rare ingredients and animals. Toriko is one of these hunters and it is his dream to find the most precious foods in the world and create the ultimate dinner course. As one of the most skilled hunters in the world he is regularly hired by restaurants and the rich to seek out new ingredients and rare animals. A man with inhuman ability, he utilizes his incredible strength and knowledge of the animal kingdom to capture ferocious, evasive and rare beasts to further his final goal, the ultimate dinner course composed of the most delicious food in the world. He is currently accompanied by a weak and timid chef who, inspired by Toriko''s ambition, travels with him to improve his culinary skills and find rare ingredients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88hdYeGnh0G89Kosw9uNZR4zkCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:719756'),
  ('69809360971206443', 'Toril', 2016, 'Thriller', 'Laurent Teyssier, Lionel Corsini', 'Laurent Teyssier, Guillaume Grosse', 'Vincent Rottiers, Sabrina Ouazani, Bernard Blancan, Tim Seyfi, Karim Leklou', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8uqgbiKlaY1TpQG01vroA27CpI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409155'),
  ('463003736152264035', 'Torment', 1944, 'Drama', 'Alf Sjöberg, Martin Bodin, Ingmar Bergman', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Stig Järrel, Alf Kjellin, Mai Zetterling, Olof Winnerstrand, Gösta Cederlund, Hugo Björne, Olav Riégo, Märta Arbin', null, 'Jan-Erik Widgren meets the lonely Bertha Olsson, a woman struggling with alcoholism. Though Bertha is already linked to Caligula, Jan-Erik''s heartless teacher, she begins a relationship with the boy anyway. When Caligula learns that Jan-Erik is having an affair with Bertha, he begins to torture his student psychologically. He reserves his cruelest behavior for Bertha, however, which results in a tragic turn of events.', 'Jan-Erik Widgren meets the lonely Bertha Olsson, a woman struggling with alcoholism. Though Bertha is already linked to Caligula, Jan-Erik''s heartless teacher, she begins a relationship with the boy anyway. When Caligula learns that Jan-Erik is having an affair with Bertha, he begins to torture his student psychologically. He reserves his cruelest behavior for Bertha, however, which results in a tragic turn of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ZyQouoMZm0M0ERUGBKYZR0M8PN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51144'),
  ('676273063121394337', 'Torment', 1994, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Claude Chabrol, Cécile Maistre-Chabrol, Bernard Zitzermann', 'Claude Chabrol, José-André Lacour, Jean Ferry', 'Emmanuelle Béart, François Cluzet, Nathalie Cardone, André Wilms, Marc Lavoine, Christiane Minazzoli, Dora Doll, Mario David', 'NR', 'Working extremely hard to keep his hotel afloat, Paul begins hearing voices in his head. Convinced that his wife has been unfaithful, he begins to see every male guest as a potential threat. What follows is Paul''s downward spiral into the madness of deranged jealousy where he finally discovers that hell is not a state of mind – hell is himself.', 'Working extremely hard to keep his hotel afloat, Paul begins hearing voices in his head. Convinced that his wife has been unfaithful, he begins to see every male guest as a potential threat. What follows is Paul''s downward spiral into the madness of deranged jealousy where he finally discovers that hell is not a state of mind – hell is himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cW9BUIVQacmt58hcI6RrSLl2QGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17961'),
  ('613163253271658219', 'Torment', 2013, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Boris Mojsovski, Jordan Barker', 'Thomas Pound, Michael Foster', 'Katharine Isabelle, Robin Dunne, Peter DaCunha, Stephen McHattie, Noah Dalton Danby, Amy Forsyth, Asim Wali, Bill Colgate', 'R', 'Newlyweds Cory and Sarah Morgan take Cory''s 7-year-old son Liam up to the country for some much needed family time. When it appears as if Liam has run away, psychological suspense becomes straight-out horror, as Sarah and Cory must now confront a sadistic cult-like family who have been hiding in the house all along and have taken Liam for themselves.', 'Newlyweds Cory and Sarah Morgan take Cory''s 7-year-old son Liam up to the country for some much needed family time. When it appears as if Liam has run away, psychological suspense becomes straight-out horror, as Sarah and Cory must now confront a sadistic cult-like family who have been hiding in the house all along and have taken Liam for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d65LSiq6UzqCE6DC7Bh5uiYIjZq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227877'),
  ('1009506161800639052', 'Torment', 2025, 'Horror', 'Olallo Rubio', 'Olallo Rubio', 'Natalia Solián, Hoze Meléndez, Fernando Banda', null, 'An exhausted security guard is transferred to a morgue and, on their first night, discovers that the shadows and silences hide a torment from which there may be no return.', 'An exhausted security guard is transferred to a morgue and, on their first night, discovers that the shadows and silences hide a torment from which there may be no return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9v6DEfjYQpmSuMXatAbQDQ9WgZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1575535'),
  ('309714352100494498', 'Tormented', 1960, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Bert I. Gordon, Ernest Laszlo, William Forsyth', 'George Worthing Yates', 'Richard Carlson, Susan Gordon, Lugene Sanders, Juli Reding, Joe Turkel, Lillian Adams, Gene Roth, Vera Marshe', 'NR', 'A jazz pianist is haunted by his dead ex-lover''s crawling hand and floating head.', 'A jazz pianist is haunted by his dead ex-lover''s crawling hand and floating head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sGHAZVgizrAO2ixNliGVLDgZwg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28586'),
  ('376848354680227109', 'Tormented', 2009, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Jon Wright, Trevor Forrest', 'Stephen Prentice', 'Alex Pettyfer, April Pearson, Dimitri Leonidas, Calvin A. Dean, Tuppence Middleton, Georgia King, Mary Nighy, Olly Alexander', 'R', 'Darren Mullet, a bullied asthmatic, is driven to suicide by his tormented life - ignored by his parents, ridiculed by his teachers and bullied at school. He returns from the dead to pay his teenage tormentors a final visit.', 'Darren Mullet, a bullied asthmatic, is driven to suicide by his tormented life - ignored by his parents, ridiculed by his teachers and bullied at school. He returns from the dead to pay his teenage tormentors a final visit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPaZJjxfJM4cIHeDS9Isfqyat6l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23173'),
  ('801852782720009020', 'Tormento', 1950, 'Drama', 'Raffaello Matarazzo, Rometta Pietrostefani, Francesco Rosi', 'Aldo De Benedetti', 'Amedeo Nazzari, Yvonne Sanson, Annibale Betrone, Mario Ferrari, Teresa Franchini, Tina Lattanzi, Aldo Nicodemi, Giuditta Rissone', null, 'Anna flees her home, where she has been victimized for years by her spineless father’s mean-spirited second wife, to be with her lover, an honest businessman yet to make his fortune. When he is accused of a murder he didn’t commit, the couple’s domestic tranquillity is upended, and a desperate Anna must rely on her cruel stepmother to help support their child.', 'Anna flees her home, where she has been victimized for years by her spineless father’s mean-spirited second wife, to be with her lover, an honest businessman yet to make his fortune. When he is accused of a murder he didn’t commit, the couple’s domestic tranquillity is upended, and a desperate Anna must rely on her cruel stepmother to help support their child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/df8JhZDKqkTsDAjbIYgsRH1BJvO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149190'),
  ('567065124692858866', 'Torn', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Logan Schneider, Max Lowe', null, 'Alex Lowe, Max Lowe, Sam Lowe, Isaac Lowe, Jennifer Lowe, Conrad Anker, Jimmy Chin', null, 'When world renowned climber Alex Lowe was tragically lost in a deadly avalanche, his best friend and climbing partner went on to marry his widow and help raise his three sons. This profoundly intimate film from eldest son Max, captures the family''s intense personal journey toward understanding as they finally lay him to rest.', 'When world renowned climber Alex Lowe was tragically lost in a deadly avalanche, his best friend and climbing partner went on to marry his widow and help raise his three sons. This profoundly intimate film from eldest son Max, captures the family''s intense personal journey toward understanding as they finally lay him to rest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2FQq9rXzIp9uMLnhB15686Y6uJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:730057'),
  ('252289721676344916', 'Torn Curtain', 1966, 'Thriller', 'Alfred Hitchcock, John F. Warren, Donald A. Baer', 'Brian Moore', 'Paul Newman, Julie Andrews, Lila Kedrova, Hansjörg Felmy, Tamara Toumanova, Ludwig Donath, Wolfgang Kieling, Günter Strack', 'PG', 'During the Cold War, an American scientist appears to defect to East Germany as part of a cloak and dagger mission to find the formula for a resin solution—but the plan goes awry when his fiancee, unaware of his motivation, follows him across the border.', 'During the Cold War, an American scientist appears to defect to East Germany as part of a cloak and dagger mission to find the formula for a resin solution—but the plan goes awry when his fiancee, unaware of his motivation, follows him across the border.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7XC1l9eP2TBYMEdA4KRUqKAFmbm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5780'),
  ('744435087521569457', 'Torn Hearts', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Brea Grant, Yaron Levy', 'Rachel Koller Croft', 'Katey Sagal, Abby Quinn, Alexxis Lemire, Joshua Leonard, Shiloh Fernandez, Alon McKlveen, Tadasay Young, Trina LaFargue', 'NR', 'A promising up-and-coming country duo seek out the secluded mansion of their idol Harper Dutch, a former country music star and Nashville royalty turned recluse. What starts out as a friendly visit devolves into a twisted series of horrors forcing the friends to confront the lengths they will go to in pursuit of their dreams.', 'A promising up-and-coming country duo seek out the secluded mansion of their idol Harper Dutch, a former country music star and Nashville royalty turned recluse. What starts out as a friendly visit devolves into a twisted series of horrors forcing the friends to confront the lengths they will go to in pursuit of their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8dSAuMHUgx0lYSB6wAAURStcGM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852830'),
  ('695843312084963321', 'Tornado', 2025, 'Drama, Action, Western', 'Robbie Ryan, Morris Milne, John Maclean', 'John Maclean', 'Kōki, Tim Roth, Jack Lowden, Takehiro Hira, Rory McCann, Raphaël Thiéry, Alex Macqueen, Jack Morris', 'R', 'When her father''s puppet samurai show gets ambushed by a notorious gang, Tornado vows to seek vengeance and forge her own destiny by stealing their ill-gotten gold.', 'When her father''s puppet samurai show gets ambushed by a notorious gang, Tornado vows to seek vengeance and forge her own destiny by stealing their ill-gotten gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iow3KuKBJN2Hfqi7i7Tq3pZUbAa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1126915'),
  ('459976321068507528', 'Tornado Girl', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Hitoshi One, Wataru Miyamoto', 'Hitoshi One', 'Satoshi Tsumabuki, Kiko Mizuhara, Suzuki Matsuo, Hirofumi Arai, Sakura Ando, Lily Franky', null, 'Koroki is a 35-year old man who admires Japanese singer-songwriter Tamio Okuda and aspires to live like him. He works as an editor at the lifestyle magazine "Mare," where he meets Akari Amami, a mischievous fashion press writer, and falls in love with her at first sight.', 'Koroki is a 35-year old man who admires Japanese singer-songwriter Tamio Okuda and aspires to live like him. He works as an editor at the lifestyle magazine "Mare," where he meets Akari Amami, a mischievous fashion press writer, and falls in love with her at first sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AhMITLQnS83vUs0XL3nOjaBgQwh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459530'),
  ('1042993370643852199', 'Tornado Valley', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Andrew C. Erin, Mahlon Todd Williams', 'Andrew C. Erin, Aaron Kim Johnston', 'Meredith Monroe, Cameron Bancroft, Pascale Hutton, Rachel Pattee, Duncan Fraser, Ashley Michaels, Christine Chatelain, Shaun Benson', null, 'Liz McAdams is haunted by the memories of a tornado that destroyed her home 25 years ago. Now a professional storm tracker, she and her family are in danger once again as another devastating twister rapidly gains momentum. Caught in the path of destruction, Liz and her estranged husband struggle to save those they love...', 'Liz McAdams is haunted by the memories of a tornado that destroyed her home 25 years ago. Now a professional storm tracker, she and her family are in danger once again as another devastating twister rapidly gains momentum. Caught in the path of destruction, Liz and her estranged husband struggle to save those they love...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHxI3P72yg1o7Wn4EVwal4CLbDL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38669'),
