  ('415114549971628252', 'Tornare', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Cristina Comencini', 'Giulia Calenda, Cristina Comencini, Ilaria Macchia', 'Giovanna Mezzogiorno, Vincenzo Amato, Beatrice Grannò, Clelia Rossi Marcelli, Marco Valerio Montesano, Trevor White, Carla Carfagna, Astrid Meloni', null, 'Cristina Comencini defines the film as a "thriller of the soul." It''s the story of a woman who returns to Italy from the US to attend the funeral of her late father, an American admiral living in Naples. Here she meets a man who seems to know too many things about her.', 'Cristina Comencini defines the film as a "thriller of the soul." It''s the story of a woman who returns to Italy from the US to attend the funeral of her late father, an American admiral living in Naples. Here she meets a man who seems to know too many things about her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PzUfilXblGqeqbIxbjKf9AjJoU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:607197'),
