  ('935007805357535049', 'Torrente 2: Mission in Marbella', 2001, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Santiago Segura, Guillermo Granillo, Falele Ygueravide', 'Santiago Segura', 'Santiago Segura, Gabino Diego, Tony Leblanc, José Luis Moreno, Inés Sastre, Arturo Valls, Juanito Navarro, Eloi Yebra', null, 'For this second film in the cult comedy series Torrente takes our fat police officer from Madrid to Marbella in Spain to investigate a villain’s plot to destroy the city with a missile. This James Bond style slapstick comedy became the most successful box-office film in Spanish film history beating out only the first Torrente film.', 'For this second film in the cult comedy series Torrente takes our fat police officer from Madrid to Marbella in Spain to investigate a villain’s plot to destroy the city with a missile. This James Bond style slapstick comedy became the most successful box-office film in Spanish film history beating out only the first Torrente film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qu0svJv5dgclrHh0GFQMLyC04R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1284'),
