  ('269928558925966578', 'Torture Me But Kill Me with Kisses', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Dino Risi, Francesco Massaro, Renzo Genta', 'Furio Scarpelli, Agenore Incrocci', 'Nino Manfredi, Ugo Tognazzi, Pamela Tiffin, Moira Orfei, Livio Lorenzon, Gigi Ballista, Pietro Tordi, Samson Burke', null, 'When Marino goes to Rome for an event, he certainly does not imagine meeting Marisa, who will become the love of his life. But once love is found, it is a matter of spreading it and here the difficulties begin: first the father who opposes it; then, after the death of his father, the gossips who make Marino believe that Marisa was a little good, so much so that Marisa runs away. Repentant, Marino searches in vain and then, almost by accident, finds her again, Mrs. Ciceri. But love admits no obstacles, not even that of a deaf and dumb husband.', 'When Marino goes to Rome for an event, he certainly does not imagine meeting Marisa, who will become the love of his life. But once love is found, it is a matter of spreading it and here the difficulties begin: first the father who opposes it; then, after the death of his father, the gossips who make Marino believe that Marisa was a little good, so much so that Marisa runs away. Repentant, Marino searches in vain and then, almost by accident, finds her again, Mrs. Ciceri. But love admits no obstacles, not even that of a deaf and dumb husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSjQiQu1ZALFlfLayEU8k9Wlyh2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56369'),
