  ('211713192300393667', 'Toshimaen: Haunted Park', 2019, 'Horror', 'Junichiro Hayashi, Hiroshi Takahashi', 'Hiroshi Takahashi', 'Rie Kitahara, Fujiko Kojima, Nana Asakawa, Ruka Matsuda, Nari Saitô, Arisa Komiya, Naoki Kunishima, Seina Suzuki', null, 'Saki, Anju, Chiaki, Ami, and Kaya reunite for the first time in years. The five of them excitedly decide to go Toshimaen Amusement Park, a place that was very important to them when they were younger. None of them know that they''re about to enter a nightmare…', 'Saki, Anju, Chiaki, Ami, and Kaya reunite for the first time in years. The five of them excitedly decide to go Toshimaen Amusement Park, a place that was very important to them when they were younger. None of them know that they''re about to enter a nightmare…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBLZP6M0axjzMCm1jcl7HLNPOrB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585774'),
  ('421076537438311360', 'Toss Me a Dime', 1958, 'Documentary', 'Oscar Kopp, Enrique Urteaga, Fernando Birri', 'Fernando Birri, Juan Carlos Cabello, María Domínguez', 'Guillermo Cervantes Luro, María Rosa Gallo, Francisco Petrone', null, 'Everyday the children of the neighborhood known as "Tire Dié", in the city of Santa Fe, wait for the train to ask for money, shouting "Tire dié!" (toss me a dime!) to the passengers. Considered the first survey-on-film in Latin America.', 'Everyday the children of the neighborhood known as "Tire Dié", in the city of Santa Fe, wait for the train to ask for money, shouting "Tire dié!" (toss me a dime!) to the passengers. Considered the first survey-on-film in Latin America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1SQDSG2faqhjX4pMjnuxTG80FX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151441'),
  ('5071912022245320', 'Toss-Up', 2004, 'Drama', 'Renda Güner, Uğur Yücel', 'Uğur Yücel', 'Kenan İmirzalıoğlu, Olgun Şimşek, Engin Günaydın, Settar Tanrıöğen, Erkan Can, Bahri Beyat, Teoman Kumbaracıbaşı, Eli Mango', null, 'Two soldiers return home from their military service in southeastern Turkey with disabilities.', 'Two soldiers return home from their military service in southeastern Turkey with disabilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsMKbjSdxgBKgarYbQdD0EzIdsd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53301'),
  ('141660769991592571', 'Tosun Pasha', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Kartal Tibet, Sami Güçlü', 'Yavuz Turgul', 'Kemal Sunal, Şener Şen, Müjde Ar, Adile Naşit, Ayşen Gruda, Gunfer Feray, Zihni Göktay, Ergin Orbey', null, 'Late 19th century in Alexandria. Two traditionally rival Turkish families, "Seferoglu"s and "Tellioglu"s are competing for the "Green Valley". The winner will be determined by Daver Bey, who has a beautiful young daughter, Leyla. Both families try to arrange a marriage between a man from their family and Leyla, so that Daver Bey will be inclined to give the green valley to his "relatives". Tellioglus, who are behind in the race, desperately find a final solution: They will fake their idiotic butler, Saban, as the highest ranked Ottoman soldier in Egypt: Tosun Pasha.', 'Late 19th century in Alexandria. Two traditionally rival Turkish families, "Seferoglu"s and "Tellioglu"s are competing for the "Green Valley". The winner will be determined by Daver Bey, who has a beautiful young daughter, Leyla. Both families try to arrange a marriage between a man from their family and Leyla, so that Daver Bey will be inclined to give the green valley to his "relatives". Tellioglus, who are behind in the race, desperately find a final solution: They will fake their idiotic butler, Saban, as the highest ranked Ottoman soldier in Egypt: Tosun Pasha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqgB6E4yynfxkzzOurzC0VRObxf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38794'),
  ('894221456377197986', 'Tot Watchers', 1958, 'Comedy, Animation', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Daws Butler, Janet Waldo, Bill Thompson', 'NR', 'The lady of the house has gone out for a few hours, leaving her baby in the care of a teen babysitter. Tom and Jerry must call a truce to their constant chases as the baby, unsupervised, continually gets loose.', 'The lady of the house has gone out for a few hours, leaving her baby in the care of a teen babysitter. Tom and Jerry must call a truce to their constant chases as the baby, unsupervised, continually gets loose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XHXfyjZBpZcGhLiZtJLIglRC32.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93628'),
  ('1040349247464970600', 'Total Balalaika Show', 1994, 'Music, Documentary', 'Aki Kaurismäki, Heikki Ortamo, Erkki Astala', 'Aki Kaurismäki', 'Twist-Twist Erkinharju, Ben Granfelt, Sakke Järvenpää, Sakari Kuosmanen, Jore Marjaranta, Ekke Niiva, Jyri Närvänen, Pemo Ojala', null, 'A 57-minute documentary of a Helsinki concert featuring the Leningrad Cowboys and the Alexandrov Red Army Choir and Ballet, who collaborate on a number of US Rock songs sung in English (like "Sweet Home, Alabama") as well as more traditional Russian songs like the "Volga Boatman."', 'A 57-minute documentary of a Helsinki concert featuring the Leningrad Cowboys and the Alexandrov Red Army Choir and Ballet, who collaborate on a number of US Rock songs sung in English (like "Sweet Home, Alabama") as well as more traditional Russian songs like the "Volga Boatman."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hm8dgzPUbzrR7Q0ZVezVMGc6tAq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109485'),
  ('694510557571839474', 'Total Dhamaal', 2019, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Indra Kumar, Amit Singh Rajput, Shrey Mathur', 'Paritosh Painter', 'Ajay Devgn, Riteish Deshmukh, Arshad Warsi, Javed Jaffrey, Sanjay Mishra, Anil Kapoor, Madhuri Dixit, Pitobash', null, 'Con-artists Guddu and Johnny, a bickering couple Avinash and Bindu who are on a verge of divorce, a fireman Lallan and his side-kick siblings Adi and Manav and a cunning police commissioner set out on a mad chase for a hidden booty of Rs 50 crores in a zoo in Janakpur.', 'Con-artists Guddu and Johnny, a bickering couple Avinash and Bindu who are on a verge of divorce, a fireman Lallan and his side-kick siblings Adi and Manav and a cunning police commissioner set out on a mad chase for a hidden booty of Rs 50 crores in a zoo in Janakpur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZeE0hQSVMNjkRCqyxkBrvnmzsr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576121'),
  ('761428408994507454', 'Total Eclipse', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Agnieszka Holland, Giorgos Arvanitis', 'Christopher Hampton', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, David Thewlis, Romane Bohringer, Dominique Blanc, Nita Klein, Félicie Pasotti, James Thierrée, Emmanuelle Oppo', 'R', 'Young, wild poet Arthur Rimbaud and his mentor Paul Verlaine engage in a fierce, forbidden romance while feeling the effects of a hellish artistic lifestyle.', 'Young, wild poet Arthur Rimbaud and his mentor Paul Verlaine engage in a fierce, forbidden romance while feeling the effects of a hellish artistic lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ihmgsX9aDXZmwjvgrzJgH8FxNa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36834'),
  ('791404067395851360', 'Total Reality', 1997, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Phillip J. Roth, Andrés Garretón', 'Phillip J. Roth', 'David Bradley, Ely Pouget, Thomas Kretschmann, Misa Koprova, Brian Faker, Melik Malkasian, Geof Prysirr, Michael Mendelson', null, 'David Bradley, stars as the roguish soldier Anthony Rand, who follows a ruthless general back through time in a last ditch attempt to save the universe.', 'David Bradley, stars as the roguish soldier Anthony Rand, who follows a ruthless general back through time in a last ditch attempt to save the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfNxUtcP2R8aBKZ8MjlzyIa2UpZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66741'),
  ('217728748164021045', 'Total Recall', 1990, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Paul Verhoeven, Jost Vacano, Judy Cammer', 'Dan O''Bannon, Ronald Shusett, Gary Goldman', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Rachel Ticotin, Sharon Stone, Ronny Cox, Michael Ironside, Marshall Bell, Mel Johnson Jr., Michael Champion', 'R', 'Construction worker Douglas Quaid''s obsession with the planet Mars leads him to visit Rekall, a virtual vacation company that manufactures memories. When something goes wrong during Quaid''s memory implant procedure, his life turns upside down, leading him to question what is reality and what isn''t.', 'Construction worker Douglas Quaid''s obsession with the planet Mars leads him to visit Rekall, a virtual vacation company that manufactures memories. When something goes wrong during Quaid''s memory implant procedure, his life turns upside down, leading him to question what is reality and what isn''t.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVbeL6fkbTKSmNfalj4VoAUUqJv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:861'),
  ('870353535520841598', 'Total Recall', 2012, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Len Wiseman, Paul Cameron, Brandt Gordon', 'Mark Bomback, Kurt Wimmer', 'Colin Farrell, Jessica Biel, Kate Beckinsale, Bill Nighy, John Cho, Bryan Cranston, Dylan Smith, Cam Clarke', 'PG-13', 'Factory worker Doug Quaid takes a virtual mind-trip vacation with the Rekall company, opting for implanted memories of being a spy. When the procedure goes wrong, Quaid becomes a wanted man by the police and joins forces with a rebel fighter to stop the evil Chancellor Cohaagen.', 'Factory worker Doug Quaid takes a virtual mind-trip vacation with the Rekall company, opting for implanted memories of being a spy. When the procedure goes wrong, Quaid becomes a wanted man by the police and joins forces with a rebel fighter to stop the evil Chancellor Cohaagen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVUxVVzZ0WvvPIpKwsMPMDOQyqi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64635'),
  ('169489798826921232', 'Total Siyapaa', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Eeshwar Nivas', 'Neeraj Pandey', 'Ali Zafar, Yami Gautam Dhar, Anupam Kher, Kirron Kher, Anuj Pandit, Vic Waghorn, Carol McFadden, Steve Keefe', null, 'Aman, a Pakistani man living in London, falls in love with Asha, an Indian woman. But he must convince her parents to let them get married, despite their different nationalities.', 'Aman, a Pakistani man living in London, falls in love with Asha, an Indian woman. But he must convince her parents to let them get married, despite their different nationalities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3xZxCa3Vn2ypE7jXLbLwWmom3U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255580'),
  ('957377614746153914', 'Total Western', 2000, 'Action, Thriller', 'Éric Rochant, Camille Lipmann, Laurent Lemarchand', 'Éric Rochant, Laurent Chalumeau', 'Samuel Le Bihan, Jean-François Stévenin, Jean-Pierre Kalfon, Youssef Diawara, Kahena Saighi, Alexia Stresi, Jo Prestia, Marco Prince', null, 'After a drug deal gone wrong, Bédé goes into hiding in the countryside at a reformative school for criminal youth. His location is found out, and he and the pupils have to protect themselves with whatever means they have.', 'After a drug deal gone wrong, Bédé goes into hiding in the countryside at a reformative school for criminal youth. His location is found out, and he and the pupils have to protect themselves with whatever means they have.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVE9VrmyFwVvxu9CKJRTaqDI6dy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52622'),
  ('136121499096391534', 'Totally Awesome', 2006, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Neal Brennan, Todd Elyzen', 'Michael Schur, Neal Brennan', 'Mikey Day, Dominique Swain, Trevor Heins, Chris Kattan, Brittany Daniel, Nicki Clyne, James Hong, Teryl Rothery', 'NR', 'Do you prefer to wax on or wax off? Preacher won''t let you dance? Well then, put Baby in the corner and come on down, ''cause VH1 is bringing back more of the ''80s you love in this feature-length film, Totally Awesome. The Gundersons have just moved across the country and the kids - Charlie, Lori, and Max - are trying their best to acclimate themselves into a new school and all kinds of dilemmas therein: the need to dance, the pitfalls of young love, the quest for popularity, scientific genius and of course the quirky but loveable Japanese gardener. Totally Awesome takes all your favorite ''80s-flick mainstays and weaves them into the biggest and baddest plotline ever conceived. Tot say it is radical would be an understatement.', 'Do you prefer to wax on or wax off? Preacher won''t let you dance? Well then, put Baby in the corner and come on down, ''cause VH1 is bringing back more of the ''80s you love in this feature-length film, Totally Awesome. The Gundersons have just moved across the country and the kids - Charlie, Lori, and Max - are trying their best to acclimate themselves into a new school and all kinds of dilemmas therein: the need to dance, the pitfalls of young love, the quest for popularity, scientific genius and of course the quirky but loveable Japanese gardener. Totally Awesome takes all your favorite ''80s-flick mainstays and weaves them into the biggest and baddest plotline ever conceived. Tot say it is radical would be an understatement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OGYEK2Jl5E520LHJ51a2IryVDw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23134'),
  ('1095938125947691156', 'Totally Bill Hicks', 1998, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Rupert Edwards, Richard Numeroff', 'Bill Hicks', 'Bill Hicks, Richard Belzer, Eric Bogosian, Kevin Booth, George H. W. Bush, Brett Butler, William Cook, Allan Havey', null, 'Consisting of two parts: ‘Revelations’, Bill Hicks’ last live performance in the United Kingdom made at the Dominion Theatre; and a documentary about Hicks’ life ‘Just a Ride’ featuring interviews with friends, admirers, and family.', 'Consisting of two parts: ‘Revelations’, Bill Hicks’ last live performance in the United Kingdom made at the Dominion Theatre; and a documentary about Hicks’ life ‘Just a Ride’ featuring interviews with friends, admirers, and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AuXb2BlrHaT8wyJAME75CSdriP6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23802'),
  ('80821244809587752', 'Totally F***ed Up', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gregg Araki, Gregg Araki', 'Gregg Araki', 'James Duval, Gilbert Luna, Susan Behshid, Lance May, Jenee Gill, Roko Belic, Alan Boyce, Craig Gilmore', 'NR', 'Gay, alienated Los Angeles teens have a hard time as their parents kick them out of their homes, they don’t have money, their lovers cheat, and they are harassed by gay-bashers.', 'Gay, alienated Los Angeles teens have a hard time as their parents kick them out of their homes, they don’t have money, their lovers cheat, and they are harassed by gay-bashers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZBtSTEhlXy0aNTZ40umWLpJr2T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33560'),
  ('291316854061963913', 'Totally Innocent', 2012, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Rodrigo Bittencourt, Fabio Burtin, Rodrigo Bittencourt', 'Rodrigo Bittencourt, Carolina Castro, Rafael Dragaud', 'Fábio Assunção, Mariana Rios, Ingrid Guimarães, Felipe Neto, Leandro Firmino, Fábio Porchat, Fábio Lago, Vivianne Pasmanter', null, 'Da Fé is hopelessly in love with Gildinha, sister of Bracinho, his best friend. He dreams of winning it, despite competition with Do Morro, the new owner of the DDC, who took over the post after handing the Diaba Loura to the police. To impress Gildinha, Da Fé decides to enter the world of crime. At the same time, she tries to get an exclusive interview with Do Morro for Wanderlei, who works with her in Taras & Tiros magazine.', 'Da Fé is hopelessly in love with Gildinha, sister of Bracinho, his best friend. He dreams of winning it, despite competition with Do Morro, the new owner of the DDC, who took over the post after handing the Diaba Loura to the police. To impress Gildinha, Da Fé decides to enter the world of crime. At the same time, she tries to get an exclusive interview with Do Morro for Wanderlei, who works with her in Taras & Tiros magazine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ae7IAVbeIbdE4fyGqTBLdgqqzQe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129707'),
  ('436169781697906127', 'Totally Killer', 2023, 'Horror, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Judd Overton, Simon Burnett, Nahnatchka Khan', 'Jen D''Angelo, Sasha Perl-Raver, David Matalon', 'Kiernan Shipka, Olivia Holt, Troy Leigh-Anne Johnson, Lochlyn Munro, Charlie Gillespie, Kelcey Mawema, Jonathan Potts, Stephi Chin-Salvo', 'R', 'When the infamous "Sweet Sixteen Killer" returns 35 years after his first murder spree to claim another victim, 17-year-old Jamie accidentally travels back in time to 1987, determined to stop the killer before he can start.', 'When the infamous "Sweet Sixteen Killer" returns 35 years after his first murder spree to claim another victim, 17-year-old Jamie accidentally travels back in time to 1987, determined to stop the killer before he can start.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52YBwGJ3cJs54fpBzwnT1lnqgTo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974931'),
  ('929721098186074812', 'Totally Minnie', 1988, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Richard Kooris, Scott Garen', 'Joie Albrecht, Scott Garen, Jack Weinstein', 'Russi Taylor, Wayne Allwine, Will Ryan, Tony Anselmo, Suzanne Somers, Robert Carradine, Elton John, Vanna White', null, 'The film centers on nerd Maxwell Dweeb (Robert Carradine), who is a loner with no friends. While watching television, he sees an advertisement for the Minnie Mouse Center for the Totally Unhip, named after its owner, Minnie Mouse. Dweeb, in an effort to improve himself, decides to attend. After being welcomed by the director (Suzanne Somers), Dweeb is taken on a tour of the centre, where other Disney characters run various courses: Goofy is a fitness instructor, Donald Duck is a wardrobe manager, and Pluto is a messenger boy. After finally meeting Minnie Mouse, Dweeb is taken on by the director, whom he eventually falls in love with, and dates once he has passed his training. The film is intershot with various musical numbers (including the duet "Don''t Go Breaking My Heart" by Minnie Mouse and Elton John) and excerpts from early Disney shorts.', 'The film centers on nerd Maxwell Dweeb (Robert Carradine), who is a loner with no friends. While watching television, he sees an advertisement for the Minnie Mouse Center for the Totally Unhip, named after its owner, Minnie Mouse. Dweeb, in an effort to improve himself, decides to attend. After being welcomed by the director (Suzanne Somers), Dweeb is taken on a tour of the centre, where other Disney characters run various courses: Goofy is a fitness instructor, Donald Duck is a wardrobe manager, and Pluto is a messenger boy. After finally meeting Minnie Mouse, Dweeb is taken on by the director, whom he eventually falls in love with, and dates once he has passed his training. The film is intershot with various musical numbers (including the duet "Don''t Go Breaking My Heart" by Minnie Mouse and Elton John) and excerpts from early Disney shorts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocZvbSFDBol6Pfscoy61r0XQeSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281112'),
  ('297899942783843253', 'Totally Spies! The Movie', 2009, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Pascal Jardin', 'Robert Lamoreaux, Michelle Lamoreaux', 'Fily Keita, Claire Guyot, Céline Mauge, Jean-Claude Donda, Karl Lagerfeld, Perrette Pradier, Emmanuel Garijo, Antoine Tomé', 'G', 'An origin story of how three high school girls became, like, totally spies.', 'An origin story of how three high school girls became, like, totally spies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNeDQeTUubvMrpoQnsFsGkuwpuW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74785'),
  ('791404376642480263', 'Totem', 1999, 'Horror', 'David DeCoteau, Howard Wexler, Brian Mastrianna', 'Neal Marshall Stevens', 'Jason Faunt, Marissa Tait, Eric W. Edwards, Sacha Spencer, Tyler Anderson, Alicia Lagano', 'R', 'Six people find themselves inexplicably transported to a remote cabin that is surrounded by an invisible barrier. In a nearby graveyard, they discover an ancient, carved stone monument that they dub a "totem pole." Soon, they find themselves trapped in a murderous plot by malevolent forces that can control and manipulate their actions with the ultimate goal being to unleash three demonic entities from the monument.', 'Six people find themselves inexplicably transported to a remote cabin that is surrounded by an invisible barrier. In a nearby graveyard, they discover an ancient, carved stone monument that they dub a "totem pole." Soon, they find themselves trapped in a murderous plot by malevolent forces that can control and manipulate their actions with the ultimate goal being to unleash three demonic entities from the monument.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1wDB2zrOIyOYBEdqrhDVlzFwMe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134136'),
  ('97060331452259422', 'Totem', 2017, 'Horror', 'Harry Lipnick, Marcel Sarmiento', 'Evan Dickson', 'Kerris Dorsey, Ahna O''Reilly, James Tupper, Lia McHugh, Braeden Lemasters, Lawrence Pressman, Jocelyn Ayanna, Evan Dickson', 'PG-13', 'A teen must resort to extreme measures to protect her family from a supernatural entity.', 'A teen must resort to extreme measures to protect her family from a supernatural entity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2eMZjYxEGXS6xj4hRtxBmaPPi3z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483737'),
  ('828894073974941156', 'Totem', 2021, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Fred de Loof, Philippe Therasse', 'Fred de Loof, François Neycken', 'Fred de Loof, Xavier Seron, Quentin Marteau, François Neycken, Pablo Andres, Céline Peret, Jules Barbason, Arthur Lefère', null, 'The wolf patrol finds itself on the site of their last scout camp. Where Ludovic, the new boy, had disappeared twenty years earlier. They have all gathered in the middle of this Ardennes forest because Etienne aka “Buffalo” sees an evil giant rat. And to make it disappear, his shrink had the good idea to undertake a kind of group therapy. Because apparently, this bad rat would have a link with the scout who disappeared… But everything will go to hell when at the bottom of their toilets, they will discover a temporal passage…', 'The wolf patrol finds itself on the site of their last scout camp. Where Ludovic, the new boy, had disappeared twenty years earlier. They have all gathered in the middle of this Ardennes forest because Etienne aka “Buffalo” sees an evil giant rat. And to make it disappear, his shrink had the good idea to undertake a kind of group therapy. Because apparently, this bad rat would have a link with the scout who disappeared… But everything will go to hell when at the bottom of their toilets, they will discover a temporal passage…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7NvuPFW5grpDyanoBvFVMbKUJX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:870929'),
  ('838381003009119929', 'Tótem', 2023, 'Drama', 'Lila Avilés, Mariana Lavaniegos Puebla, Carmiña Carballal', 'Lila Avilés', 'Naíma Sentíes, Montserrat Marañon, Marisol Gasé, Saori Gurza, Mateo García Elizondo, Teresa Sánchez, Iazua Larios, Alberto Amador', null, 'In a bustling Mexican household, seven-year-old Sol is swept up in a whirlwind of preparations for the birthday party for her father, Tona, led by her mother, aunts, and other relatives. As the day goes on, building to an event both anticipated and dreaded, Sol begins to understand the gravity of the celebration this year and watches as her family does the same.', 'In a bustling Mexican household, seven-year-old Sol is swept up in a whirlwind of preparations for the birthday party for her father, Tona, led by her mother, aunts, and other relatives. As the day goes on, building to an event both anticipated and dreaded, Sol begins to understand the gravity of the celebration this year and watches as her family does the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBIQrOpneWqOYA1ZBIvaClm8zuH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958186'),
  ('178740537755681250', 'Totò all''inferno', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Leopoldo Savona, Aldo Tonti, Camillo Mastrocinque', 'Mario Mangini, Totò, Francesco Nelli', 'Totò, Maria Frau, Fulvia Franco, Dante Maggio, Franca Faldini, Ubaldo Lay, Nerio Bernardi, Mario Castellani', null, 'After several attempts at suicide, depressed thief Antonio Marchi accidentally drowns in a river and ends up in hell.', 'After several attempts at suicide, depressed thief Antonio Marchi accidentally drowns in a river and ends up in hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxZSSKzwHeZuOTcLvFlNDcrVzvz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71132'),
