  ('597715460349027460', 'Toto and Cleopatra', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Fernando Cerchio, Mario Castellani, Alvaro Mancori', 'Giovanni Grimaldi, Fernando Cerchio, Bruno Corbucci', 'Totò, Magali Noël, Moira Orfei, Franco Sportelli, Lia Zoppelli, Gianni Agus, Toni Ucci, Mario Castellani', null, 'Mark Antony has a brother-lookalike, Totonno, a sinister slave trader. Totonno secretly replaces Mark Antony in the most delicate moments.', 'Mark Antony has a brother-lookalike, Totonno, a sinister slave trader. Totonno secretly replaces Mark Antony in the most delicate moments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEEAUbtUDw3Ad7yfP8pyXvdBUKz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81908'),
