  ('127325254841683699', 'Toto and the Women', 1952, 'Comedy', 'Mario Monicelli, Steno, Tonino Delli Colli', 'Agenore Incrocci, Mario Monicelli, Furio Scarpelli', 'Totò, Peppino De Filippo, Lea Padovani, Franca Faldini, Ave Ninchi, Giovanna Pala, Clelia Matania, Olga Villi', null, 'Antonio Scaparro (Toto) is obsessed for women. He invents his own way to hide from them - in the attic of his house.', 'Antonio Scaparro (Toto) is obsessed for women. He invents his own way to hide from them - in the attic of his house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toUjgcZtNqhimUPd0dHBwwAAq1R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48252'),
  ('364993292943244972', 'Toto at Night', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Mario Amendola, Bitto Albertini', 'Bruno Corbucci, Giovanni Grimaldi', 'Totò, Erminio Macario, Helmut Zacharias, Mac Ronay, Dodo'' D''Amburg, Caroline Lecerf, Margaret Lee, Moa Tahi', null, 'Nini and Mimi are strolling musicians-bassist. For days they are playing on the streets of Rome. One day Nini announced that he has one million and one thousand pounds, having inherited from her grandmother died. Now world belongs only to them, and they can do everything! Ahead of them are Paris, Madrid, England, Scotland, Hong Kong, the United States ....', 'Nini and Mimi are strolling musicians-bassist. For days they are playing on the streets of Rome. One day Nini announced that he has one million and one thousand pounds, having inherited from her grandmother died. Now world belongs only to them, and they can do everything! Ahead of them are Paris, Madrid, England, Scotland, Hong Kong, the United States ....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpfdhyiNrsw96aMv2JzuD14KQ9P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81427'),
  ('736089568830837038', 'Totò d''Arabia', 1965, 'Comedy', 'José Antonio de la Loma, Aldo Nascimbene, Mario Castellani', 'Giovanni Grimaldi, Bruno Corbucci, José Antonio de la Loma', 'Totò, Nieves Navarro, George Rigaud, Fernando Sancho, José Luis López Vázquez, Mario Castellani, Luis Cuenca, Monika Kolpek', null, 'Toto, a former Italian military servant who works as a servant at the British Intelligence Service, is promoted to secret agent with the name of Agent 00Ø8 to convince the ruler of Shamara, Sheikh Ali El Buzur, to yield oil to UK.', 'Toto, a former Italian military servant who works as a servant at the British Intelligence Service, is promoted to secret agent with the name of Agent 00Ø8 to convince the ruler of Shamara, Sheikh Ali El Buzur, to yield oil to UK.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hX3sxTW5FDcXDR6qMocfAtZX1n4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63181'),
  ('371314702212766346', 'Totò diabolicus', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Steno, Mariano Laurenti, Mario Castellani', 'Vittorio Metz, Roberto Gianviti, Marcello Fondato', 'Totò, Raimondo Vianello, Nadia Sanders, Luigi Pavese, Mario Castellani, Peppino De Martino, Giulio Marchetti, Franco Giacobini', null, 'The marquis Galeazzo di Torre Alta is murdered by a mysterious killer who calls himself Diabolicus. His heirs are his three brothers and a sister, but all of them, with the exception of Monsignor Antonino di Torre Alta, are killed by Diabolicus. The police are unable to solve the case, but when Antonino gives his inheritance to Pasquale Bonocore, illegitimate son of his father and Pasquale is in prison and therefore can''t be the killer, all the clues are in the hand of the police.', 'The marquis Galeazzo di Torre Alta is murdered by a mysterious killer who calls himself Diabolicus. His heirs are his three brothers and a sister, but all of them, with the exception of Monsignor Antonino di Torre Alta, are killed by Diabolicus. The police are unable to solve the case, but when Antonino gives his inheritance to Pasquale Bonocore, illegitimate son of his father and Pasquale is in prison and therefore can''t be the killer, all the clues are in the hand of the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMFarI2PQTXbVBPhPzC3u8ydYGP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56920'),
  ('162913991016463973', 'Totò Double or Nothing?', 1956, 'Comedy', 'Camillo Mastrocinque, Mario Fioretti, Alfredo Angeli', 'Marcello Marchesi, Vittorio Metz', 'Totò, Mike Bongiorno, Dorian Gray, Valeria Moriconi, Gabriele Tinti, Carlo Croccolo, Rosanna Schiaffino, Edy Campagnoli', null, 'The penniless Duke decides to participate in "Lascia o raddoppia", a TV quiz show, in order to win five million lira. Then two gangsters bet between themselves on his success and, alas, the Duke is kidnapped.', 'The penniless Duke decides to participate in "Lascia o raddoppia", a TV quiz show, in order to win five million lira. Then two gangsters bet between themselves on his success and, alas, the Duke is kidnapped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/maVXJMUz4bBzlF4yaDgPuSdBjma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66177'),
  ('140761935515930565', 'Totò e Peppino divisi a Berlino', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Giorgio Bianchi, Michele Lupo, Mario Castellani', 'Dino De Palma, Sandro Continenza', 'Totò, Peppino De Filippo, Nadia Sanders, Luigi Pavese, Peter Dane, Dante Maggio, Carlo Pisacane, Robert Alda', null, 'Antonio goes to West Berlin and meets Giuseppe. But Antonio looks like Canarinis, a wanted war criminal, So the daughter of the criminal pays Antonio to impersonate him.', 'Antonio goes to West Berlin and meets Giuseppe. But Antonio looks like Canarinis, a wanted war criminal, So the daughter of the criminal pays Antonio to impersonate him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZy5i0hvin7mSJo21inQwBH86dM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75966'),
  ('1146949189635442164', 'Totó in color', 1952, 'Comedy', 'Steno, Tonino Delli Colli, Lucio Fulci', 'Furio Scarpelli, Steno, Mario Monicelli', 'Totò, Isa Barzizza, Fulvia Franco, Rocco D''Assunta, Vittorio Caprioli, Virgilio Riento, Alberto Bonucci, Luigi Pavese', null, 'In the first Italian film to be shot in color, Totò portrays a musician named Antonio Scannagatti who strongly hopes to sell his composition, "Epopea italiana", to Tiscordi, who is one of the most important Italian impresarios.', 'In the first Italian film to be shot in color, Totò portrays a musician named Antonio Scannagatti who strongly hopes to sell his composition, "Epopea italiana", to Tiscordi, who is one of the most important Italian impresarios.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIq9Xo3pyBR3qoHYccKDz3HERpB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63178'),
  ('191632236446865898', 'Toto in Madrid', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Steno, Mariano Laurenti, Alvaro Mancori', 'Vittorio Metz, Roberto Gianviti', 'Totò, Abbe Lane, Mario Carotenuto, Louis de Funès, Giacomo Furia, José Guardiola, Pilar Gómez Ferrer, Ricardo Valle', null, 'When the swindler La Spada and his accomplice José come out of jail in Madrid, they decide to pull a really great swindle: nothing less than to discover and sell a third picture of the famous Goya''s Maya. They engage the renowed Scorcelletti who can imitate any picture and who lives in Rome. Afterwards, with the help of the beautiful Eva, they convince the celebrated art critic Francisco Montiel of the existance of a third Maya and let him find the picture. When the swindlers are on the point of selling the faked maya to an American millionaire, Scorcelli comes back from Rome to sell one of his six other maya pictures.', 'When the swindler La Spada and his accomplice José come out of jail in Madrid, they decide to pull a really great swindle: nothing less than to discover and sell a third picture of the famous Goya''s Maya. They engage the renowed Scorcelletti who can imitate any picture and who lives in Rome. Afterwards, with the help of the beautiful Eva, they convince the celebrated art critic Francisco Montiel of the existance of a third Maya and let him find the picture. When the swindlers are on the point of selling the faked maya to an American millionaire, Scorcelli comes back from Rome to sell one of his six other maya pictures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wl7Dl8eBk52FmcXYfZZOxJbjEC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63270'),
  ('108256273809459695', 'Toto in Paris', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Camillo Mastrocinque, Alvaro Mancori, Leonardo Scavino', 'Vittorio Metz, René Barjavel, Roberto Gianviti', 'Totò, Sylva Koscina, Fernand Gravey, Philippe Clay, Lauretta Masiero, Paul Guers, Luigi Pavese, Peppino De Martino', null, 'Duclos''s son, a worldly gangster, is compromised in a case of which he is innocent. The proof of this innocence is in the hands of a "competitor", the Marquis de Chemantel de Beauvoiron, a misguided aristocrat. He asked for $ 10 million to cede the document. Duclos will then imagine Chemantel contracting $ 10 million in life insurance for his son. As he discovered in Rome a tramp, a look-alike of the marquis, he will bring this man to Paris and arrange for him to die accidentally.', 'Duclos''s son, a worldly gangster, is compromised in a case of which he is innocent. The proof of this innocence is in the hands of a "competitor", the Marquis de Chemantel de Beauvoiron, a misguided aristocrat. He asked for $ 10 million to cede the document. Duclos will then imagine Chemantel contracting $ 10 million in life insurance for his son. As he discovered in Rome a tramp, a look-alike of the marquis, he will bring this man to Paris and arrange for him to die accidentally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oIOTNJN0SSYdpem7iQFUgUrqpfW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64041'),
  ('356991089392634131', 'Totò in the Moon', 1958, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Steno, Mariano Laurenti, Marco Scarpelli', 'Steno, Ettore Scola, Sandro Continenza', 'Totò, Sylva Koscina, Ugo Tognazzi, Luciano Salce, Sandra Milo, Richard McNamara, Agostino Salvietti, Renato Tontini', null, 'Two men embarks upon a space race. Their efforts are hampered by aliens who clone the heroes to keep them from exploring further.', 'Two men embarks upon a space race. Their efforts are hampered by aliens who clone the heroes to keep them from exploring further.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55FT8zIR4zfTz6BXmUFTRslx7EI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71777'),
  ('538457252757210853', 'Totò le Mokò', 1949, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Ludovico Bragaglia, Sergio Pesce, Roberto Cinquini', 'Vittorio Metz, Sandro Continenza, Furio Scarpelli', 'Totò, Carla Calò, Gianna Maria Canale, Luigi Pavese, Enzo Garinei, Franca Marzi, Elena Altieri, Mario Castellani', null, 'Mobster Pepé Le Mokò dies during a shootout with the police. His gang decide that his successor will be a relative of his from Naples: Antonio Lumaconi (Totò Le Mokò), a street musician.', 'Mobster Pepé Le Mokò dies during a shootout with the police. His gang decide that his successor will be a relative of his from Naples: Antonio Lumaconi (Totò Le Mokò), a street musician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6H3X0CevrAD442SuuLoe0PIUcjh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74341'),
  ('257170928138970750', 'Totò Looking for a House', 1949, 'Comedy', 'Steno, Mario Monicelli, Giuseppe Caracciolo', 'Steno, Mario Monicelli, Agenore Incrocci', 'Totò, Alda Mangini, Lia Molfesi, Mario Castellani, Aroldo Tieri, Folco Lulli, Enzo Biliotti, Giacomo Furia', null, 'Beniamino and his family have lived inside a school since the end of the war. After five years they have to move, but in Rome it''s not easy to find an apartment.', 'Beniamino and his family have lived inside a school since the end of the war. After five years they have to move, but in Rome it''s not easy to find an apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9GQexeYSHCcRW2L65CC2JYQXiB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49930'),
  ('325204008881795156', 'Totò Looking for Wife', 1950, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Ludovico Bragaglia, Mario Albertelli, Roberto Cinquini', 'Agenore Incrocci, Sandro Continenza, Vittorio Metz', 'Totò, Ave Ninchi, Marisa Merlini, Aroldo Tieri, Paul Müller, Mario Castellani, Nerio Bernardi, Elvi Lissiak', null, 'Aunt Agatha writes to Toto, informing him that she won''t send him another penny until he is married.', 'Aunt Agatha writes to Toto, informing him that she won''t send him another penny until he is married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PWQIqX0Pz0fBydPoibDcM6Vc4N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135530'),
  ('575011243456888282', 'Totò nella fossa dei leoni', 1943, 'Comedy', 'Giorgio Simonelli, Aldo Quinti, Ugo Lombardi', 'Vincenzo Rovi, Ákos Tolnay, Steno', 'Totò, Vera Carmi, Enrico Glori, Nando Bruno, Egilda Cecchini, Enzo Biliotti, Primo Carnera, Claudio Ermelli', null, 'The explorer Smith leaves with Laura, a beautiful but naive girl, in search of Professor Berti, who mysteriously disappeared in Africa in the midst of one of his researches.', 'The explorer Smith leaves with Laura, a beautiful but naive girl, in search of Professor Berti, who mysteriously disappeared in Africa in the midst of one of his researches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1FbUonvGZvmXSbJaz7zBwhcsip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154598'),
  ('535877608044664336', 'Totò Sapore and the Magical Story of Pizza', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure, Music, Romance', 'Maurizio Forestieri', 'Umberto Marino, Paolo Cananzi', 'Eugenio Bennato, Marco Vivio, Pietra Montecorvino, Mario Merola, Lello Arena, Saba Anglana, Tino Cervi, Francesco Paolantoni', null, 'Naples, 18th century. Salvatore "Totò" Sapore, an unemployed minstrel, always manages to cheer up the hungry with his songs about good food, always upsetting Vesuvia, a magma witch who lives inside the Vesuvius.', 'Naples, 18th century. Salvatore "Totò" Sapore, an unemployed minstrel, always manages to cheer up the hungry with his songs about good food, always upsetting Vesuvia, a magma witch who lives inside the Vesuvius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sARJMq4T4ftHxr1oZOhUcbR0pEX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71571'),
  ('71491547790498022', 'Totò Seeks Peace', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Mario Mattoli, Roberto Cinquini, Riccardo Pallottini', 'Emilio Caglieri, Ruggero Maccari, Vincenzo Talarico', 'Totò, Isa Barzizza, Ave Ninchi, Enzo Turco, Gina Amendola, Paolo Ferrari, Corrada De Mayo, Giovanni Nannini', null, 'Two widowers decide to get married but their decision is continually hampered by their grandchildren, who are just interested in their inheritance.', 'Two widowers decide to get married but their decision is continually hampered by their grandchildren, who are just interested in their inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UEsZh5j9LzLtiyXv33FEy7SbVI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80365'),
