  ('997080029380872318', 'Totò Story', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Mario Mattoli', null, 'Totò, Aldo Fabrizi, Peppino De Filippo, Giacomo Furia', null, 'A hilarious anthology of scenes from some of the most famous films starring the great Totò, the prince of Italian comedy.', 'A hilarious anthology of scenes from some of the most famous films starring the great Totò, the prince of Italian comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZhNA28jRUyj9tvDzb7p9kQhYuj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135535'),
  ('1087818253076266019', 'Toto the Hero', 1991, 'Drama, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jaco Van Dormael, Walther van den Ende', 'Laurette Vankeerberghen, Pascal Lonhay, Didier De Neck', 'Michel Bouquet, Thomas Godet, Gisela Uhlen, Jo De Backer, Mireille Perrier, Sandrine Blancke, Peter Böhlke, Didier Ferney', null, '80-year-old Thomas recounts his childhood and middle age through a series of flashbacks and dream sequences. Thomas believes he’s been taken away from a better life at birth; following a hospital fire, he vividly recalls being swapped with another new-born, and subsequently grows up in a poorer neighbouring household.', '80-year-old Thomas recounts his childhood and middle age through a series of flashbacks and dream sequences. Thomas believes he’s been taken away from a better life at birth; following a hospital fire, he vividly recalls being swapped with another new-born, and subsequently grows up in a poorer neighbouring household.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxIzSyOMrOFxwCIWIW4bwtgMpds.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56321'),
  ('1071675235970958826', 'Toto the Sheik', 1950, 'Comedy', 'Mario Mattoli, Rudy Bauer, Mario Albertelli', 'Furio Scarpelli, Vittorio Metz, Marcello Marchesi', 'Totò, Aroldo Tieri, Ada Dondini, Tamara Lees, Laura Gore, Arnoldo Foà, Mario Castellani, Carlo Croccolo', null, 'Antonio is the humble servant of a rich family governed by the Marquis Gastone. He is a young man madly in love with Lulu, but she betrays him, and he desperately enlist in the foreign legion.', 'Antonio is the humble servant of a rich family governed by the Marquis Gastone. He is a young man madly in love with Lulu, but she betrays him, and he desperately enlist in the foreign legion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSQH0xrDyjA5JLrc7XIw1R6cDjv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63179'),
  ('465002802713488176', 'Toto the Third Man', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Mario Mattoli, Luciana Pedrosi, Tonino Delli Colli', 'Furio Scarpelli, Agenore Incrocci, Marcello Marchesi', 'Totò, Elli Parvo, Franca Marzi, Fulvia Mammi, Ada Dondini, Diana Dei, Bice Valori, Aroldo Tieri', null, 'In a small village two twin brothers are of opposite characters. One is mayor of the town, gruff and precise. The other is totally different from his brother and loves the good life and beautiful women.', 'In a small village two twin brothers are of opposite characters. One is mayor of the town, gruff and precise. The other is totally different from his brother and loves the good life and beautiful women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gkhPLeiYTdotzt43zoQc63y09T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74443'),
  ('764134920228174221', 'Toto Tours Italy', 1948, 'Comedy', 'Tino Santoni, Mario Mattoli, Leo Catozzo', 'Marcello Marchesi, Steno, Vittorio Metz', 'Totò, Isa Barzizza, Walter Chiari, Carlo Micheluzzi, Mario Castellani, Carlo Ninchi, Mario Riva, Luigi Pavese', null, 'A professor was appointed member of the jury of a beauty contest and falls for a beautiful contestant. In order to get the girl he must win the "Tour of Italy", so professor sells his soul to the devil to get the winning and the girl.', 'A professor was appointed member of the jury of a beauty contest and falls for a beautiful contestant. In order to get the girl he must win the "Tour of Italy", so professor sells his soul to the devil to get the winning and the girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6q5u4NC4jAo2ZyKDRsS0ERAi14Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67176'),
  ('935348486496723917', 'Totò versus Maciste', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Mario Castellani, Angelo Lotti, Fernando Cerchio', 'Giovanni Grimaldi, Ugo Liberatore, Gastone Da Venezia', 'Totò, Nino Taranto, Samson Burke, Nadine Sanders, Nerio Bernardi, Gabriella Andreini, Luigi Pavese, Nino Marchetti', null, 'Totokamen is an entertainer and an illusionist who performs in various Egyptian nightclubs assisted by his manager, Tarantenkamen. Taking advantage of cheesy tricks, Totokamen pretends to be the son of the god Amun.', 'Totokamen is an entertainer and an illusionist who performs in various Egyptian nightclubs assisted by his manager, Tarantenkamen. Taking advantage of cheesy tricks, Totokamen pretends to be the son of the god Amun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7Wq2T3aCpr8J8W4YNyksDA4zzC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58399'),
  ('956856044637375785', 'Totò versus the Black Pirate', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Fernando Cerchio, Mario Castellani, Giancarlo Romitelli', 'Nino Stresa, Francesco Luzi', 'Totò, Mario Petri, Maria Grazia Spina, Aldo Giuffrè, Mario Castellani, Pietro Carloni, Giacomo Furia, Franco Ressel', null, 'José is a Neapolitan petty thief who escapes from the guards and hides himself in a barrel of Jamaican rum on the quay of the port of Naples.', 'José is a Neapolitan petty thief who escapes from the guards and hides himself in a barrel of Jamaican rum on the quay of the port of Naples.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2Dyey4ZHf4lWWsrTeCdhG4AE1j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80373'),
  ('784823417678884719', 'Totò vs the Four', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Steno, Roberto Arata, Aldo Grimaldi', 'Bruno Corbucci, Giovanni Grimaldi', 'Totò, Peppino De Filippo, Aldo Fabrizi, Nino Taranto, Erminio Macario, Rossella Como, Mario Castellani, Ivy Holzer', null, 'The day of Chief Constable Saracino begins badly when his new car is stolen. Then, in his office, he meets Alfredo Fiori who believes that his wife and her lover, a veterinary, are trying to murder him.', 'The day of Chief Constable Saracino begins badly when his new car is stolen. Then, in his office, he meets Alfredo Fiori who believes that his wife and her lover, a veterinary, are trying to murder him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MoC5XWv0WagweZKFKpI1MtsGh8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65479'),
  ('993593761112615798', 'Toto Who Lived Twice', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Luca Bigazzi, Daniele Ciprì, Franco Maresco', 'Daniele Ciprì, Franco Maresco, Lillo Iacolino', 'Salvatore Gattuso, Marcello Miranda, Carlo Giordano, Angelo Prollo', null, 'The film has three stories. First is about local village idiot Paletta, who can not afford the services of a whore and so steals a locket from a holy shrine belonging to local mafia don. Second shows the story of betrayal of Pitrinu (who''s dead now) by his lover Fefe. Final episode is about lowlife Lazarus. He is killed by mob boss Toto, but raised from the dead by a local messiah, who is also known as Toto (and is played by same actor).', 'The film has three stories. First is about local village idiot Paletta, who can not afford the services of a whore and so steals a locket from a holy shrine belonging to local mafia don. Second shows the story of betrayal of Pitrinu (who''s dead now) by his lover Fefe. Final episode is about lowlife Lazarus. He is killed by mob boss Toto, but raised from the dead by a local messiah, who is also known as Toto (and is played by same actor).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8civ3RmxP4KXUABChIfTYBoDTAU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61213'),
  ('467918306989708272', 'Toto, Fabrizi and the Young People Today', 1960, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Mario Mattoli, Michele Lupo, Gabriele Palmieri', 'Castellano, Pipolo', 'Totò, Aldo Fabrizi, Christine Kaufmann, Geronimo Meynier, Luigi Pavese, Liana Del Balzo, Nando Angelini, Carlo Pisacane', null, 'A boy and a girl fall in love but their fathers take a strong dislike to each other, clashing repeatedly during the preparations for the upcoming marriage.', 'A boy and a girl fall in love but their fathers take a strong dislike to each other, clashing repeatedly during the preparations for the upcoming marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7jKYUY6yxkdDmp9MnQRD0kcdac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56260'),
  ('366612830006887496', 'Totò, Peppino and... the Sweet Life', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Corbucci, Nino Zanchin, Alvaro Mancori', 'Bruno Corbucci, Giovanni Grimaldi, Mario Guerra', 'Totò, Peppino De Filippo, Francesco Mulè, Mara Berni, Rosalba Neri, Antonio Pierfederici, Gloria Paul, Peppino De Martino', null, 'Antonio goes to Rome to represent his fellow peasants, to request a highway that will be built in their region. But the guy is mastered by ''la dolce vita'' and wastes the money entrusted to him for his mission. When Peppino is sent to to find out what happened, he lets himself be trapped by the gentle grip of ''la dolce vita''', 'Antonio goes to Rome to represent his fellow peasants, to request a highway that will be built in their region. But the guy is mastered by ''la dolce vita'' and wastes the money entrusted to him for his mission. When Peppino is sent to to find out what happened, he lets himself be trapped by the gentle grip of ''la dolce vita''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6a2Bmz4wGkEyb29QSk5M8OZjyn9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71133'),
  ('1085330090933031117', 'Totò, Peppino e i fuorilegge', 1956, 'Comedy', 'Camillo Mastrocinque, Mario Albertelli, Michele Lupo', 'Ruggero Maccari, Mario Amendola, Edoardo Anton', 'Totò, Peppino De Filippo, Titina De Filippo, Teddy Reno, Franco Interlenghi, Dorian Gray, Maria Pia Casilio, Memmo Carotenuto', null, 'Antonio and Peppino live in a small town in central Italy: Peppino is the barber, Totò is maintained by the rich but avaricious wife Teresa.', 'Antonio and Peppino live in a small town in central Italy: Peppino is the barber, Totò is maintained by the rich but avaricious wife Teresa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6OitXFpCOjyNjfnADy99vwnSjt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58074'),
  ('590132095966113298', 'Totò, Peppino e le fanatiche', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Mario Mattoli, Anchise Brizzi, Mariano Laurenti', 'Ruggero Maccari, Furio Scarpelli, Steno', 'Totò, Peppino De Filippo, Johnny Dorelli, Alessandra Panaro, Mario Riva, Aroldo Tieri, Diana Dei, Peppino De Martino', null, 'A psychiatric-clinic medical director runs some tests on two patients, the Ragionier Antonio Vignanelli and Cavalier Peppino Caprioli, so they must retrieve some memories of family life in order to understand their mental illness.', 'A psychiatric-clinic medical director runs some tests on two patients, the Ragionier Antonio Vignanelli and Cavalier Peppino Caprioli, so they must retrieve some memories of family life in order to understand their mental illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bfHpLZokeVHfY3UsUk0bmVI2bx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64958'),
  ('554140788341454863', 'Totò, Vittorio and the Doctor', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Camillo Mastrocinque, Gábor Pogány, Alvaro Mancori', 'Vittorio Metz, Marcello Marchesi', 'Totò, Vittorio De Sica, Abbe Lane, Titina De Filippo, Germán Cobos, Agostino Salvietti, Rafael Bardem, Franco Coop', null, 'The fake private detective Mike Spillone is hired by two old ladies to find out if Brigitte, the wife of their nephew Otello Bellomo, has a lover. Brigitte is a physician but the two aunts are unaware of the fact. While investigating, Mike and his assistant Johnny discover Brigitte with a prospective patient, the marquis De Vitti who was shot by the husband of the woman he tried to seduce. Afterwards Spillone finds her with her husband who he believes to be her lover.', 'The fake private detective Mike Spillone is hired by two old ladies to find out if Brigitte, the wife of their nephew Otello Bellomo, has a lover. Brigitte is a physician but the two aunts are unaware of the fact. While investigating, Mike and his assistant Johnny discover Brigitte with a prospective patient, the marquis De Vitti who was shot by the husband of the woman he tried to seduce. Afterwards Spillone finds her with her husband who he believes to be her lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hw4teBNxCfMlLMxuDV7c6if95if.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67178'),
  ('26582124600480046', 'Tototarzan', 1950, 'Comedy', 'Mario Mattoli, Leo Catozzo, Giuseppe La Torre', 'Mario Mattoli, Vittorio Metz, Marcello Marchesi', 'Totò, Marilyn Buferd, Bianca Maria Fusari, Alba Arnova, Adriana Serra, Vira Silenti, Luisa Poselli, Galeazzo Benti', null, 'Roaming the vast jungles of Congo with his best friend, Bongo the gorilla, Antonio della Buffas, a mysterious man whom the natives call the "white monkey", is utterly unaware that he is the long-lost son of a wealthy explorer. Then, three opportunists manage to capture and bring the white savage to civilisation, bent on getting their hands on his immense fortune.', 'Roaming the vast jungles of Congo with his best friend, Bongo the gorilla, Antonio della Buffas, a mysterious man whom the natives call the "white monkey", is utterly unaware that he is the long-lost son of a wealthy explorer. Then, three opportunists manage to capture and bring the white savage to civilisation, bent on getting their hands on his immense fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nobWSa86JmSbXGzzjbuQKZ5X4ma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74445'),
  ('1134569842021905355', 'Totòtruffa ''62', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Nino Zanchin, Camillo Mastrocinque, Mario Fioretti', 'Castellano, Pipolo', 'Totò, Nino Taranto, Lia Zoppelli, Geronimo Meynier, Estella Blain, Luigi Pavese, Ernesto Calindri, Mario Castellani', null, 'Antonio, a former variety actor, keeps his daughter in an excellent boarding school by organizing small scams with his friend and colleague Felice. Commissioner Malvasia good-naturedly persecuted him. When their respective unsuspecting children fall in love, the two fathers make peace.', 'Antonio, a former variety actor, keeps his daughter in an excellent boarding school by organizing small scams with his friend and colleague Felice. Commissioner Malvasia good-naturedly persecuted him. When their respective unsuspecting children fall in love, the two fathers make peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVmynlDhwKDgpzIwnk1C8RGE5Mm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57998'),
  ('463183157588756500', 'Totto-chan: The Little Girl at the Window', 2023, 'Animation, Drama, Family', 'Yoji Shimizu, Kentaro Minegishi, Yoshihiro Osugi', 'Yosuke Suzuki', 'Liliana Ohno, Koji Yakusho, Shun Oguri, Anne Watanabe, Karen Takizawa', null, 'This engaging series of childhood recollections tells of an unconventional school in Tokyo during World War II that combined learning with fun, freedom, and love. The school had old railroad cars for classrooms and was run by an extraordinary man – its founder and headmaster, Sōsaku Kobayashi – who deeply valued children''s independence, and who was a firm believer in freedom of expression and activity.', 'This engaging series of childhood recollections tells of an unconventional school in Tokyo during World War II that combined learning with fun, freedom, and love. The school had old railroad cars for classrooms and was run by an extraordinary man – its founder and headmaster, Sōsaku Kobayashi – who deeply valued children''s independence, and who was a firm believer in freedom of expression and activity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irzCGOpy1iohurWfPKk2tTkfPG2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1106904'),
  ('969970997224495349', 'Toubab', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Florian Dietrich, Max Preiss, Rafael Grigoletto', 'Florian Dietrich, Arne Dechow', 'Farba Dieng, Julius Nitschkoff, Seyneb Saleh, Valerie Koch, Michael Maertens, Burak Yiğit, Nina Gummich, Uwe Preuss', null, 'Matured through two years in prison, Babtou is looking forward to a new beginning with his buddy Dennis. A free man in a free world! But of all things, his welcome party where all the boys from the block are gathered ends in a police operation. Babtou has his hands cuffed again and is confronted with dramatic news. He will soon be deported to his “home country” of Senegal. To prevent a deportation, Babtou and Dennis are willing to do anything, including marriage.', 'Matured through two years in prison, Babtou is looking forward to a new beginning with his buddy Dennis. A free man in a free world! But of all things, his welcome party where all the boys from the block are gathered ends in a police operation. Babtou has his hands cuffed again and is confronted with dramatic news. He will soon be deported to his “home country” of Senegal. To prevent a deportation, Babtou and Dennis are willing to do anything, including marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4efGW5TEzU1NlrMKZDZbXxo9dfB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743115'),
  ('1061684625280194524', 'Touch', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Paul Schrader, Andrew Laws, David Cass Jr.', 'Paul Schrader', 'Bridget Fonda, Christopher Walken, Skeet Ulrich, Tom Arnold, Gina Gershon, Lolita Davidovich, Paul Mazursky, Janeane Garofalo', 'R', 'At the discovery of his ability to work miracles, Juvenal becomes a media sensation, but now he''s prone to those who want to exploit him.', 'At the discovery of his ability to work miracles, Juvenal becomes a media sensation, but now he''s prone to those who want to exploit him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KEkCiId2lhKgSM6sAGSuG9BjdH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61563'),
