  ('23122815547448483', 'Touch', 2024, 'Romance, Drama', 'Baltasar Kormákur, Bergsteinn Björgúlfsson', 'Ólafur Jóhann Ólafsson, Baltasar Kormákur', 'Egill Ólafsson, Kōki, Pálmi Kormákur Baltasarsson, Masahiro Motoki, Yoko Narahashi, Ruth Sheen, Masatoshi Nakamura, Meg Kubota', 'R', 'Soon after the break of the pandemic and realizing that his clock is ticking, Kristofer gets the urge to embark on a journey to try to find out what really happened when his Japanese girlfriend mysteriously vanished without a trace from London fifty years earlier.', 'Soon after the break of the pandemic and realizing that his clock is ticking, Kristofer gets the urge to embark on a journey to try to find out what really happened when his Japanese girlfriend mysteriously vanished without a trace from London fifty years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNXfG1CBVzffksd2EkEpJ9NXFOT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032472'),
  ('837894907130764093', 'Touch and Go', 1955, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Douglas Slocombe, Michael Truman, David Middlemas', 'William Rose', 'Jack Hawkins, Margaret Johnston, June Thorburn, Roland Culver, John Fraser, James Hayter, Alison Leggatt, Margaret Halstan', null, 'When Jim Fletcher is told by his firm that his new furniture designs are not in keeping with the firm''s image he threatens to resign, and decides to uproot his family and emigrate to Australia - but his problems are only just beginning.', 'When Jim Fletcher is told by his firm that his new furniture designs are not in keeping with the firm''s image he threatens to resign, and decides to uproot his family and emigrate to Australia - but his problems are only just beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ThQYzcXaxMDHYYpo9LQDTiBnS7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65487'),
  ('1086918463828921556', 'Touch and Go', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Philippe de Broca, René Mathelin', 'Philippe de Broca, Jean-Loup Dabadie', 'Marlène Jobert, Michel Piccoli, Michael York, Louis Velle, Amidou, Didi Perego, Jean Bouise, Gene Moyle', null, 'North Africa, December 1942. Valentin, a professional gardener ruined by the bombings of 1940, has fled to Tunis, where he traffics stolen goods, transporting them from Libya to Tunisia on an old boat.', 'North Africa, December 1942. Valentin, a professional gardener ruined by the bombings of 1940, has fled to Tunis, where he traffics stolen goods, transporting them from Libya to Tunisia on an old boat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oXKeXVlsBBwnBV0fxBD7o0HvBE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359684'),
  ('22964666013725654', 'Touch and Go', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Mandel', 'Bob Sand, Harry Colomby, Alan Ormsby', 'Michael Keaton, María Conchita Alonso, Ajay Naidu, John Reilly, Maria Tucci, Richard Venture, Lara Jill Miller, D.V. DeVincentis', 'R', 'A Chicago hockey star is accosted by a youth gang who attempt to rob him; after he chases them off he catches the youngest member and gives him a ride home, where he meets the boy''s mother.', 'A Chicago hockey star is accosted by a youth gang who attempt to rob him; after he chases them off he catches the youngest member and gives him a ride home, where he meets the boy''s mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGn1AIsnbwMaP9q5mvvEXirUuxv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57204'),
  ('662276449999544390', 'Touch and Go', 1991, 'Action, Drama', 'Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Andy Lam Kwok-Wah, Victor Tam Long-Cheong', 'Chow Jan-Wing, Nam Yin', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Teresa Mo Shun-Kwan, Irene Wan, Vincent Wan Yeung-Ming, Tommy Wong, Ann Mui Oi-Fong, Billy Chow Bei-Lei, Helena Law Lan', null, 'A clumsy, easy-going but tough restaurant chef witnesses a murder of a cop. This leads him to a world of trouble, as the killer seeks to silence him. Luckily, the vengeful partner of the dead cop is there to help him.', 'A clumsy, easy-going but tough restaurant chef witnesses a murder of a cop. This leads him to a world of trouble, as the killer seeks to silence him. Luckily, the vengeful partner of the dead cop is there to help him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6DEYwbb9VI5ELjW0koH8eDuQV6Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119339'),
  ('150141559769361346', 'Touch Me', 2026, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Addison Heimann, Dustin Supencheck', 'Addison Heimann', 'Olivia Taylor Dudley, Lou Taylor Pucci, Jordan Gavaris, Marlene Forte, Paget Brewster, Ashley Lauren Nedd, JJ Phillips, Yumarie Morales', 'NR', 'Two codependent best friends become addicted to the heroin-like touch of an alien narcissist who may or may not be trying to take over the world.', 'Two codependent best friends become addicted to the heroin-like touch of an alien narcissist who may or may not be trying to take over the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/drcloenCH7ZautM7hnd9r9WScNV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1400763'),
  ('1053415409693082445', 'Touch of Death', 1988, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Lucio Fulci, Silvano Tessicini', 'Lucio Fulci', 'Brett Halsey, Zora Kerova, Al Cliver, Sacha Darwin, Ria De Simone, Marco Di Stefano, Maurice Poli', null, 'The financially strained and increasingly desperate, Lester Parsons concocts a brilliant get-rich-quick scheme; cruise the lonely hearts ads for rich women to fleece. Too bad then, that Lester’s also a psychotic cannibal who enjoys mutilating these lovelorn souls, via his trusty chainsaw, and using their flesh for his dinner. When a copycat killer threatens to bring him down, Lester must do all he can to prevent this new killer’s sloppy work from ruining them both.', 'The financially strained and increasingly desperate, Lester Parsons concocts a brilliant get-rich-quick scheme; cruise the lonely hearts ads for rich women to fleece. Too bad then, that Lester’s also a psychotic cannibal who enjoys mutilating these lovelorn souls, via his trusty chainsaw, and using their flesh for his dinner. When a copycat killer threatens to bring him down, Lester must do all he can to prevent this new killer’s sloppy work from ruining them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9up6E73szBetrXjTMIDW73pbaSG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28848'),
  ('279638277999351705', 'Touch of Pink', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ian Iqbal Rashid, David A. Makin', 'Ian Iqbal Rashid', 'Jimi Mistry, Kyle MacLachlan, Suleka Mathew, Kristen Holden-Ried, Veena Sood, Brian George, Liisa Repo-Martell, Dean McDermott', 'R', 'Alim is a gay man living in London to escape the domineering eye of his conservative Muslim mother, Nuru, back in Canada. Alim keeps his homosexuality secret from his mother, so when she comes for a surprise visit, he and his boyfriend, Giles, must put on a straight facade to hide the truth.', 'Alim is a gay man living in London to escape the domineering eye of his conservative Muslim mother, Nuru, back in Canada. Alim keeps his homosexuality secret from his mother, so when she comes for a surprise visit, he and his boyfriend, Giles, must put on a straight facade to hide the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FIovz3tPvxXvBY0bySbuo6cbwD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55177'),
  ('33714961138611495', 'Touch of the Light', 2012, 'Drama', 'Chang Jung-Chi', null, 'Huang Yu-Siang, Sandrine Pinna, Lee Lieh, Harry Chang, Ko Shu-Chin, Ivy Yin, Sheu Fang-Yi, Na-Do', null, 'The story revolves around a blind music student who excels at piano but faces hardships due to his disability, and an aspiring dancer who works at a bubble tea store. Their friendship becomes mutually uplifting as they pursue their dreams.', 'The story revolves around a blind music student who excels at piano but faces hardships due to his disability, and an aspiring dancer who works at a bubble tea store. Their friendship becomes mutually uplifting as they pursue their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwbPTPR9xfzPblf0ocfTyt3etu6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134990'),
  ('43510878385886257', 'Touchback', 2011, 'Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Don Handfield, David Rush Morrison', 'Don Handfield', 'Brian Presley, Kurt Russell, Melanie Lynskey, Marc Blucas, Christine Lahti, Sarah Wright, Drew Powell, Steve Turner', 'PG-13', 'A former high-school football star loses his shot at a college scholarship due to a devastating gridiron injury, but gets a second chance at living his dream.', 'A former high-school football star loses his shot at a college scholarship due to a devastating gridiron injury, but gets a second chance at living his dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tc4S4UJzAUtZJPHFpq2Weaa1bA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75074'),
  ('1075462456929400890', 'Touchdown Mickey', 1932, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Walt Disney', 'NR', 'Mickey''s Manglers get a couple of last-quarter touchdowns and tie the football game with the Alley Cats, 96 to 96. Can Mickey score the winning touchdown at the last second? An early Goofy is the radio announcer; Pluto is the water-dog.', 'Mickey''s Manglers get a couple of last-quarter touchdowns and tie the football game with the Alley Cats, 96 to 96. Can Mickey score the winning touchdown at the last second? An early Goofy is the radio announcer; Pluto is the water-dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bVeujEDZ6ziF8uwVbTHNg4T1pn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156461'),
  ('972735282114026779', 'Touché and Go', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'The amorous skunk, Pepé le Pew, chases a female cat by the seaside, under the sea and finally on a desert island.', 'The amorous skunk, Pepé le Pew, chases a female cat by the seaside, under the sea and finally on a desert island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npvxzPgNMIjvaU00NDUiNCQgJOG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234996'),
  ('782413016159793793', 'Touché, Pussy Cat!', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Francoise Brun-Cottan', 'NR', 'A young mouse arrives at the Parisian headquarters of the King''s Mouseketeers with a letter from his father, François Mouse, asking Jerry to teach the lad to be a Mouseketeer. Lessons begin for the French-speaking boy, but although he''s charming, he''s hopeless and when he gets into a scrape with Tom, Jerry sends the garçon packing. As the boy is leaving Paris, he hears the noise of fighting, and he returns to find Jerry in a fight for his life with Tom. Champagne corks, a paint brush, and a barrel of wine are props in the lad''s attack. But has he lost all his clumsiness?', 'A young mouse arrives at the Parisian headquarters of the King''s Mouseketeers with a letter from his father, François Mouse, asking Jerry to teach the lad to be a Mouseketeer. Lessons begin for the French-speaking boy, but although he''s charming, he''s hopeless and when he gets into a scrape with Tom, Jerry sends the garçon packing. As the boy is leaving Paris, he hears the noise of fighting, and he returns to find Jerry in a fight for his life with Tom. Champagne corks, a paint brush, and a barrel of wine are props in the lad''s attack. But has he lost all his clumsiness?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eC8lPa3nGziJTa8RBF4Aayo6st.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93653'),
  ('552472421423134194', 'Touched in the Head', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jacques Doillon, Yves Lafaye', 'Philippe Defrance, Jacques Doillon', 'Christophe Soto, Olivier Bousquet, Roselyne Vuillaume, Ann Zacharias, Martin Trévières, Pierre Fabien, Gabriel Bernard, Maryline Even', null, 'Baker''s apprentice Chris is sacked from his job for being late. Unwilling to give up the flat that goes with the job, he and his friends resort to squatting. Liv, a Swedish girl moves in and is soon followed by Léon the car mechanic and Rosette, a girl from the bakery.', 'Baker''s apprentice Chris is sacked from his job for being late. Unwilling to give up the flat that goes with the job, he and his friends resort to squatting. Liv, a Swedish girl moves in and is soon followed by Léon the car mechanic and Rosette, a girl from the bakery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXGJ8AAZuXIQiMMnvuVRXfIW243.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63173'),
  ('1032294461692596365', 'Touched with Fire', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kristina Nikolova, Alexander Stanishev, Paul Dalio', 'Paul Dalio', 'Katie Holmes, Luke Kirby, Griffin Dunne, Bruce Altman, Annie Golden, Chaske Spencer, Maryann Urbano, Christine Lahti', null, 'Two young poets with bipolar disorder begin a highly passionate, volatile relationship that threatens both their futures.', 'Two young poets with bipolar disorder begin a highly passionate, volatile relationship that threatens both their futures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjjQHksWmTF0npPIOZ2fKsucizq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324289'),
  ('542833127947911328', 'Touchées', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama', 'Alexandra Lamy', 'Solen Roy-Pagenault', 'Mélanie Doutey, Claudia Tagbo, Chloé Jouannet, Olivier Serwar, Elsa Lepoivre, Andréa Bescond', null, 'Lucie has just moved to Anduze with her son Léo to get away from her violent ex-husband. In the hope of rebuilding her life, she enrolls in a fencing-based therapy program offered by a local association. There, she meets other women who have been sexually abused and develops a sincere friendship with Tamara and Nicole. Little by little, the participants regain their self-confidence. When Lucie''s ex-husband resurfaces, she is no longer alone in facing her fears and her past.', 'Lucie has just moved to Anduze with her son Léo to get away from her violent ex-husband. In the hope of rebuilding her life, she enrolls in a fencing-based therapy program offered by a local association. There, she meets other women who have been sexually abused and develops a sincere friendship with Tamara and Nicole. Little by little, the participants regain their self-confidence. When Lucie''s ex-husband resurfaces, she is no longer alone in facing her fears and her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbqhrEYgIGyxUMIcm0jFJSAJcKR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:943023'),
  ('919796936185213354', 'Touchez Pas au Grisbi', 1954, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Jacques Becker, Marc Maurette, Jean Becker', 'Jacques Becker, Maurice Griffe, Albert Simonin', 'Jean Gabin, Jeanne Moreau, René Dary, Lino Ventura, Paul Frankeur, Michel Jourdan, Paul Oettly, Dora Doll', 'NR', 'Gentleman gangster Max and his partner, Riton, pull off their last, most successful heist and find themselves comfortable enough to retire in the style they enjoy. However, Max confides the details of the theft to his younger mistress, Josey -- who has secretly taken up with ambitious young rival gangster Angelo. Angelo then has Riton kidnapped and demands the stash of gold as ransom, which threatens Max''s dreams of the perfect retirement.', 'Gentleman gangster Max and his partner, Riton, pull off their last, most successful heist and find themselves comfortable enough to retire in the style they enjoy. However, Max confides the details of the theft to his younger mistress, Josey -- who has secretly taken up with ambitious young rival gangster Angelo. Angelo then has Riton kidnapped and demands the stash of gold as ransom, which threatens Max''s dreams of the perfect retirement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svG2UuJ3SPrCp8O0RGPaKbECilq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27430'),
  ('215097446203640537', 'Touching the Skin of Eeriness', 2013, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ryusuke Hamaguchi, Yasuyuki Sasaki, Tadashi Nohara', 'Tomoyuki Takahashi', 'Shota Sometani, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Hoshi Ishida, Natsumi Seto, Ayumi Mizukoshi, Osamu Jareo, Toshiki Fujikawa, Eita Okuno', null, 'After his parents die, a teenager goes to live with his older brother. As his loneliness grows, he becomes engrossed in practicing modern dance with his classmate.', 'After his parents die, a teenager goes to live with his older brother. As his loneliness grows, he becomes engrossed in practicing modern dance with his classmate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIhQdzkQ5ZtDGkkT1f8a8r464Vq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381920'),
  ('23366370647973995', 'Touching the Void', 2003, 'Documentary, Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Keith Partridge, Kevin Macdonald, Mike Eley', null, 'Brendan Mackey, Nicholas Aaron, Ollie Ryall, Joe Simpson, Richard Hawking, Simon Yates', 'R', 'The true story of Joe Simpson and Simon Yates'' disastrous and nearly-fatal mountain climb of 6,344m Siula Grande in the Cordillera Huayhuash in the Peruvian Andes in 1985.', 'The true story of Joe Simpson and Simon Yates'' disastrous and nearly-fatal mountain climb of 6,344m Siula Grande in the Cordillera Huayhuash in the Peruvian Andes in 1985.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsydA5H8FSDaYlYWddfMpMpDUX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11194'),
  ('826993529139645564', 'Touchless', 2013, 'Drama', 'Matěj Chlupáček, Lucie Doležalová, Alexander Šurkala', 'Jan Mazanec', 'Tereza Vítů, Adrian Jastraban, Marian Roden, Petra Lustigová, Kryštof Hádek, Ondřej Malý, Hana Vagnerová, Marika Šoposká', null, 'Jolana (18) is an object of her step-father''s desire. She is unable to cope, especially when her own mother turns a blind eye. Those events are heavily paid for when she finds herself working in a brothel. Her inability to cope raise a question: What is it she actually wants? Are her dreams of escaping really better than the reality she finds herself in?', 'Jolana (18) is an object of her step-father''s desire. She is unable to cope, especially when her own mother turns a blind eye. Those events are heavily paid for when she finds herself working in a brothel. Her inability to cope raise a question: What is it she actually wants? Are her dreams of escaping really better than the reality she finds herself in?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0IBEfaDyU9k8E9UIQdOwUlOGJ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240206'),
  ('590641704463793003', 'Touchy Feely', 2013, 'Drama', 'Lynn Shelton, Benjamin Kasulke', 'Lynn Shelton', 'Rosemarie DeWitt, Allison Janney, Ron Livingston, Scoot McNairy, Tomo Nakayama, Elliot Page, Josh Pais, Amber Wolfe Wollam', 'R', 'Abby is a sought after massage therapist and a free spirit, while her brother Paul thrives on routine, running a failing dental practice with his assistant and daughter Jenny. Suddenly, Abby develops an aversion to bodily contact, which not only makes her unable to do her job, but also severely affects her relationship with her boyfriend. As Abby navigates her way through an identity crisis, her brother''s dental practice receives new life when clients seek out his “healing touch.”', 'Abby is a sought after massage therapist and a free spirit, while her brother Paul thrives on routine, running a failing dental practice with his assistant and daughter Jenny. Suddenly, Abby develops an aversion to bodily contact, which not only makes her unable to do her job, but also severely affects her relationship with her boyfriend. As Abby navigates her way through an identity crisis, her brother''s dental practice receives new life when clients seek out his “healing touch.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngGBnTcBKHJznsI7PvFiRnp4IjC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154282'),
  ('43312244588474521', 'Tough and Deadly', 1995, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Steve Cohen, James W. Roberson', 'Otto C. Pozzo, Steve Cohen', 'Billy Blanks, Roddy Piper, Richard Norton, Charles Kahlenberg, James Karen, Gary Kasper, Sal Landi, Phil Morris', 'R', 'A private eye helps an amnesiac CIA agent elude mobsters who don''t want him to regain his memory of their drug operation.', 'A private eye helps an amnesiac CIA agent elude mobsters who don''t want him to regain his memory of their drug operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozqhRWXkNavtxWVk04bOQPgf5CZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80350'),
  ('1020215755135277937', 'Tough as Iron', 2013, 'Drama, Action', 'Ahn Kwon-tae, Lee Hyung-deok, Park Cheong-woo', 'Ahn Kwon-tae', 'Yoo Ah-in, Kim Hae-sook, Kim Jung-tae, Kim Seung-o, Jung Yu-mi, Lee Si-eon, Shin Jung-keun, Bae Seul-ki', null, 'Gang-cheol is a legendary street fighter in Busan who cleaned up his act to care for his sick mother. Knowing he''s desperate for money for his mother''s operation, Sang-gon proposes that Gang-cheol works for him.', 'Gang-cheol is a legendary street fighter in Busan who cleaned up his act to care for his sick mother. Knowing he''s desperate for money for his mother''s operation, Sang-gon proposes that Gang-cheol works for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzUAJc9YFNlsZTYpWsE4JYmspE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227336'),
  ('1124821265439282740', 'Tough Enough', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Kolja Brandt, Detlev Buck', 'Gregor Tressnow, Zoran Drvenkar', 'David Kross, Jenny Elvers, Erhan Emre, Oktay Özdemir, Kida Khodr Ramadan, Arnel Taci, Kai Michael Müller, Hans Löw', null, 'From the youth directed novel of the same name by Greogor Tressnow comes a film by Detlev Buck that is a realistic portrait of life in the section of Berlin called Neukölln. It’s about power and weakness, delinquents and victims, and the difficulties a 15-year-old faces in a poor and criminal environment.', 'From the youth directed novel of the same name by Greogor Tressnow comes a film by Detlev Buck that is a realistic portrait of life in the section of Berlin called Neukölln. It’s about power and weakness, delinquents and victims, and the difficulties a 15-year-old faces in a poor and criminal environment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HcEEKSNs2m4k8ghZ9cgTaSfyoF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434'),
  ('55577517593695159', 'Tough Guys', 1986, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jeff Kanew, King Baggot, Ed Milkovich', 'James Orr, Jim Cruickshank', 'Burt Lancaster, Kirk Douglas, Charles Durning, Alexis Smith, Dana Carvey, Eli Wallach, Billy Barty, Darlanne Fluegel', 'PG', 'Harry Doyle and Archie Lang are two old-time train robbers, who held up a train in 1956 and have been incarcerated for thirty years. After serving their time, they are released from jail and have to adjust to a new life of freedom. and soon realize that they still have the pizzazz when, picking up their prison checks at a bank, they foil a robbery attempt.', 'Harry Doyle and Archie Lang are two old-time train robbers, who held up a train in 1956 and have been incarcerated for thirty years. After serving their time, they are released from jail and have to adjust to a new life of freedom. and soon realize that they still have the pizzazz when, picking up their prison checks at a bank, they foil a robbery attempt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDp0MPUSCeXrIziaZC65iUHISLs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11038'),
  ('1138323835499240574', 'Tough Guys Don''t Dance', 1987, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Norman Mailer, John Bailey', 'Norman Mailer', 'Ryan O''Neal, Isabella Rossellini, Debra Stipe, Wings Hauser, John Bedford Lloyd, Lawrence Tierney, Penn Jillette, Frances Fisher', null, 'Tim Madden awakens one morning to discover a fresh tattoo on his arm, his car covered in blood, his girlfriend in bed with the town sheriff, and a woman''s severed head in his weed stash. Sensing a setup and in desperate need to clear his name, he begins an investigation that soon begins to expose a web of corruption in the small coastal community of Provincetown.', 'Tim Madden awakens one morning to discover a fresh tattoo on his arm, his car covered in blood, his girlfriend in bed with the town sheriff, and a woman''s severed head in his weed stash. Sensing a setup and in desperate need to clear his name, he begins an investigation that soon begins to expose a web of corruption in the small coastal community of Provincetown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gK01a3u2W3AFa2RFC6LZpReb2t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78146'),
  ('345122112295016580', 'Tough Kids', 1983, 'Drama', 'Dinara Asanova, Yuriy Veksler', 'Yuri Klepikov', 'Valeriy Priyomykhov, Olga Mashnaya, Yekaterina Vasilyeva, Zinoviy Gerdt, Marina Levtova, Vladimir Gusev, Yuriy Moroz, Andrei Zykov', null, 'A former athlete runs a camp dedicated to reforming juvenile criminals, a tough job with no quick payoffs.', 'A former athlete runs a camp dedicated to reforming juvenile criminals, a tough job with no quick payoffs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igom9AX9nMLcQei3x1RTXaNmZgb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87786'),
