  ('272320789848450147', 'Tour de Force', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Laurent Tuel, Gilles Porte', 'Romain Protat, Lyes Belaïdouni, Yohan Levy', 'Clovis Cornillac, Bouli Lanners, Ary Abittan, Bruno Lochet, Élodie Bouchez, André Marcon, Philippe Lacheau, Rose Caprais', null, 'François decides to participate in the Tour de France alone, inspiring a wave of media enthusiasm, much to the chagrin of the Tour''s pros.', 'François decides to participate in the Tour de France alone, inspiring a wave of media enthusiasm, much to the chagrin of the Tour''s pros.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saAth3sdRt1T7xG3Tt2o3HpMAFp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197629'),
  ('644763744621182087', 'Tour de Force', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Christian Zübert, The Chau Ngo', 'Ariane Schröder', 'Florian David Fitz, Julia Koschitz, Jürgen Vogel, Miriam Stein, Volker Bruch, Victoria Mayer, Johannes Allmayer, Hannelore Elsner', null, 'Belgium, of all places. What''s Belgium got besides chocolates and fries? No matter, this year it was Hannes'' and Kiki''s turn to choose the destination of their annual bike tour with their closest friends. They all looks forward to the adventure, after all they know that what counts the most is the time they spend together. It''s only after the tour has begun that Hannes tells his friends that he''s suffering from an incurable disease. The trip is to be his last. At first, the group is shocked and helpless, but after they hit the road again, they embark on a wild and one-of-a-kind adventure. Through Hannes, they realize how precious life is. Equipped with a list of things that still remain to do, and aware that nothing will be the same after this trip, they celebrate life as they never did before.', 'Belgium, of all places. What''s Belgium got besides chocolates and fries? No matter, this year it was Hannes'' and Kiki''s turn to choose the destination of their annual bike tour with their closest friends. They all looks forward to the adventure, after all they know that what counts the most is the time they spend together. It''s only after the tour has begun that Hannes tells his friends that he''s suffering from an incurable disease. The trip is to be his last. At first, the group is shocked and helpless, but after they hit the road again, they embark on a wild and one-of-a-kind adventure. Through Hannes, they realize how precious life is. Equipped with a list of things that still remain to do, and aware that nothing will be the same after this trip, they celebrate life as they never did before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Q5lEK3QJ6EyRCMJWArHweMtBs3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285025'),
