  ('925885085764783387', 'Tourist Family', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Abishan Jeevinth, Arvind Viswanathan, Harish Durairaj', 'Abishan Jeevinth', 'M. Sasikumar, Simran, Mithun Jai Sankar, Kamalesh Jegan, Yogi Babu, Bagavathi Perumal, M. S. Bhaskar, Elango Kumaravel', 'NR', 'A quirky Sri Lankan family seeking a fresh start in India transforms a disconnected neighborhood into a vibrant community with their infectious love and kindness.', 'A quirky Sri Lankan family seeking a fresh start in India transforms a disconnected neighborhood into a vibrant community with their infectious love and kindness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEffPihtdQXiXfRdfq7pPM5JDqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1398359'),
  ('261510579279217851', 'Tourist Ömer Among the Cannibals', 1970, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Hulki Saner', 'Hulki Saner', 'Sadri Alışık, Feri Cansel, Aziz Basmacı, Mualla Sürer, Cevat Kurtuluş, Cemil Şahbaz, Kudret Karadağ, Orhan Çoban', null, 'Ömer, a clumsy tourist, finds himself captured by a cannibal tribe led by the imposing Chief Faruk. His bumbling antics soon charm the defiant Zeynep, turning his peril into a riotous clash of cultures and unexpected camaraderie.', 'Ömer, a clumsy tourist, finds himself captured by a cannibal tribe led by the imposing Chief Faruk. His bumbling antics soon charm the defiant Zeynep, turning his peril into a riotous clash of cultures and unexpected camaraderie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqjFQi2dCaHdD1MPVXPiEgBGVrD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452573'),
  ('574107836228748182', 'Tourist Train', 1933, 'Comedy', 'Marcello Caccialupi, Domenico Scala, Raffaello Matarazzo', 'Gino Mazzucchi', 'Marcello Spada, Lina Gennari, Carlo Petrangeli, Jone Frigerio, Cesare Zoppetti, Maria Denis, Giuseppe Pierozzi, Gino Viotti', null, 'The film portrays the comic adventures of a group of summertime travellers. Produced at the height of the fascist era, Treno popolare was nonetheless free of propaganda, and featured the first film score by the legendary composer Nino Rota.', 'The film portrays the comic adventures of a group of summertime travellers. Produced at the height of the fascist era, Treno popolare was nonetheless free of propaganda, and featured the first film score by the legendary composer Nino Rota.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ioEFXGZEY1jUVUjiJC2sdywzHQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117569'),
  ('936794071271146915', 'Tourist Trap', 1979, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'David Schmoeller, Nicholas Josef von Sternberg, Mary Church', 'David Schmoeller, J. Larry Carroll', 'Chuck Connors, Jocelyn Jones, Jon Van Ness, Robin Sherwood, Tanya Roberts, Dawn Jeffory, Keith McDermott, Arlecchino', 'PG', 'After their car breaks down, a group of young travelers find themselves stranded at a roadside museum run by the enigmatic Mr. Slausen and populated by his collection of life-like wax mannequins.', 'After their car breaks down, a group of young travelers find themselves stranded at a roadside museum run by the enigmatic Mr. Slausen and populated by his collection of life-like wax mannequins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c19pSkUfNElrmVn0iYtiJys5dK8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13570'),
  ('845937436815792083', 'Tous Inconnus', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy', 'Nicolas Hourès', null, 'Didier Bourdon, Bernard Campan, Pascal Légitimus, Élie Semoun, Pascal Elbé, Jhon Rachid, Medi Sadoun, Claudio Capéo', null, 'The three "Unknown" are back in this movie where they wake up in a world where they really are unknown! They''ll eventually find out that their career, films, sketches & songs do exist but from someone else!', 'The three "Unknown" are back in this movie where they wake up in a world where they really are unknown! They''ll eventually find out that their career, films, sketches & songs do exist but from someone else!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51iEvDgBwNkiJt8a7f1WS81Sh2f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1040325'),
  ('308256902351449370', 'Tous les soleils', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Philippe Claudel', 'Philippe Claudel', 'Stefano Accorsi, Neri Marcorè, Clotilde Courau, Lisa Cipriani, Anouk Aimée, José Luis Roig, Xavier Boulanger, Aude Koegler', null, 'Alessandro teaches musicology at the university of Strasbourg. He is also a volunteer reader in hospitals. He shares his apartment with his daughter, 15-year-old Irina, and his anarchist brother Luigi. Life is not always rosy at Alessandro''s for three main reasons : he is a widower and has never really recovered from the death of his young wife ; his brother is some kind of parasite who refuses to sell his paintings to capitalist speculators and so to contribute to the cost of the household ; Irina, whom he has raised alone since she was five months old and always felt close to, is rapidly changing from little girl to teenager and wishes to be treated as such. One day, Florence, a beautiful young woman, gets into Alessandro''s life. Will he eventually take his chances with her? And will he manage to stop stifling Irina? And will he finally get on with Luigi?', 'Alessandro teaches musicology at the university of Strasbourg. He is also a volunteer reader in hospitals. He shares his apartment with his daughter, 15-year-old Irina, and his anarchist brother Luigi. Life is not always rosy at Alessandro''s for three main reasons : he is a widower and has never really recovered from the death of his young wife ; his brother is some kind of parasite who refuses to sell his paintings to capitalist speculators and so to contribute to the cost of the household ; Irina, whom he has raised alone since she was five months old and always felt close to, is rapidly changing from little girl to teenager and wishes to be treated as such. One day, Florence, a beautiful young woman, gets into Alessandro''s life. Will he eventually take his chances with her? And will he manage to stop stifling Irina? And will he finally get on with Luigi?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncEFK0DEDnqiUJAuaabygdzvIZG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60650'),
