  ('964087955220614431', 'Tout contre elle', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Jean-Marie Dreujou, Gabriel Le Bomin', 'Gabriel Le Bomin, Gilles Taurand', 'Astrid Whettnall, Sophie Quinton, Patrick Timsit, Lucy Ryan, Nicolas Robin, Aurélia Petit, Véronique Kapoyan, Jean-Luc Porraz', null, 'Girlfriend or enemy? Does the young cleaning lady Alice really want to protect the well-heeled Hélène from a scandal or rather blackmail her? In any case, Alice not only found her lifeless body and Hélène''s wallet in her employer Svende Petersen''s home, but also video footage that weighed heavily on Hélène. Because the married to a budding Member Hélène has fled without help from the apartment of her lover, when she became aware that Svende no longer breathes. But now Alice knows her secret. It becomes Hélène''s menacing shadow ...', 'Girlfriend or enemy? Does the young cleaning lady Alice really want to protect the well-heeled Hélène from a scandal or rather blackmail her? In any case, Alice not only found her lifeless body and Hélène''s wallet in her employer Svende Petersen''s home, but also video footage that weighed heavily on Hélène. Because the married to a budding Member Hélène has fled without help from the apartment of her lover, when she became aware that Svende no longer breathes. But now Alice knows her secret. It becomes Hélène''s menacing shadow ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkQEyqsm1WLfEYTKn8shSW7eIUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592555'),
