  ('807444822189247575', 'Toute une nuit', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'Chantal Akerman, Caroline Champetier, Liria Bégéja', 'Chantal Akerman', 'Aurore Clément, Natalia Akerman, Paul Allio, Angelo Abazoglou, Frank Aendenboom, Véronique Alain, Jacques Bauduin, François Beukelaers', null, 'Following over two dozen different individuals in the almost wordless atmosphere of a dark night in a Brussels town, acceptance and rejection in the realm of romance is examined.', 'Following over two dozen different individuals in the almost wordless atmosphere of a dark night in a Brussels town, acceptance and rejection in the realm of romance is examined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruXSiqpZCWeq1KBNxAWPC0OrnAt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63215'),
  ('405425234873001239', 'Tove', 2020, 'Drama', 'Linda Wassberg, Zaida Bergroth, Essi Alamattila', 'Eeva Putro', 'Alma Pöysti, Krista Kosonen, Shanti Roney, Joanna Haartti, Kajsa Ernst, Robert Enckell, Jakob Öhrman, Eeva Putro', null, 'Helsinki, 1945. The end of the war brings a new sense of artistic and social freedom for painter Tove Jansson. While focusing her artistic dreams on painting, the enchanting tales of the ‘Moomin’ creatures she told to scared children in bomb shelters, rapidly take on a life of their own, bringing international fame.', 'Helsinki, 1945. The end of the war brings a new sense of artistic and social freedom for painter Tove Jansson. While focusing her artistic dreams on painting, the enchanting tales of the ‘Moomin’ creatures she told to scared children in bomb shelters, rapidly take on a life of their own, bringing international fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BBT3SeNz4OM3HYa8CqjPpsiCeb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608232'),
  ('942290714762081407', 'Tow', 2026, 'Drama', 'Stephanie Laing, Vanja Černjul', 'Brent Boivin, Jonathan Keasey, Annie Weisman', 'Dominic Sessa, Simon Rex, Corbin Bernsen, Elsie Fisher, Katie Lee Hill', 'R', 'Amanda Ogle is a woman living in her aging Toyota Camry on the streets of Seattle. When her car — her only lifeline — is stolen and impounded, Amanda is thrust into a relentless legal battle against an indifferent system. What begins as a fight to reclaim her car evolves into a deeply human story of resilience, dignity, and the power of one woman’s voice in the face of systemic failure.', 'Amanda Ogle is a woman living in her aging Toyota Camry on the streets of Seattle. When her car — her only lifeline — is stolen and impounded, Amanda is thrust into a relentless legal battle against an indifferent system. What begins as a fight to reclaim her car evolves into a deeply human story of resilience, dignity, and the power of one woman’s voice in the face of systemic failure.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fb%2Fgracenote%2Fb3d2f19eca85ad8207cbfd0acbfe786a.jpg', 'plex:movie:tow-2026'),
  ('439870514141474355', 'Towa no Quon 1: The Ephemeral Petals', 2011, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Tsuyoshi Yoshioka, Umanosuke Iida, Takeshi Mori', 'Toshizo Nemoto', 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Kaori Nazuka, Ryoko Shiraishi, Jouji Nakata, Miyu Irino, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Tomoyuki Shimura, Kenta Miyake', 'PG-13', 'This story follows a boy named Quon and his friends, who are "Attractors". Attractors are human beings who have awakened and have supernatural powers. Quon is determined to save them all. But a secret organization is hunting them...', 'This story follows a boy named Quon and his friends, who are "Attractors". Attractors are human beings who have awakened and have supernatural powers. Quon is determined to save them all. But a secret organization is hunting them...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNFuoyJm5X0LTfLZN4VRFwBmabd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179923'),
