  ('631651058388098888', 'Toward the Terra', 1980, 'Animation, Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'Hideo Onchi, Masami Suda', 'Chigusa Shioda, Hideo Onchi', 'Junichi Inoue, Masaya Oki, Kumiko Akiyoshi, Tarō Shigaki, Hiroko Yakushimaru, Toru Furuya, Akira Kamiya, Banjo Ginga', null, 'A young boy learns he is part of a powerful race of psionic humans who must fight the normal humans determined to keep them from Earth.', 'A young boy learns he is part of a powerful race of psionic humans who must fight the normal humans determined to keep them from Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owNyTrZDbQS797bcXeLZovKPcCQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66628'),
  ('277380799117412773', 'Toward the Unknown', 1956, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Harold Rosson, Russell Saunders', 'Beirne Lay Jr.', 'William Holden, Lloyd Nolan, Virginia Leith, Charles McGraw, Murray Hamilton, Paul Fix, James Garner, L.Q. Jones', 'NR', 'Tortured into a false confession while a POW in Korea, Major Lincoln Bond returns to active service as a test pilot. Determined to clear his name, Bond battles a hard-nosed base commander, prejudiced officers and his own insecurities.', 'Tortured into a false confession while a POW in Korea, Major Lincoln Bond returns to active service as a test pilot. Determined to clear his name, Bond battles a hard-nosed base commander, prejudiced officers and his own insecurities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/406rdQYfRBNjSyM4reTvC1PNpsp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148021'),
  ('551719197749216911', 'Towards Evening', 1990, 'Drama', 'Francesca Archibugi, Paolo Carnera, Rinaldo Ricci', 'Claudia Sbarigia, Francesca Archibugi, Gloria Malatesta', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Sandrine Bonnaire, Zoe Incrocci, Giorgio Tirabassi, Victor Cavallo, Antonella Attili, Veronica Lazăr, Lara Pranzoni', null, 'Italy, 1977. Professor Bruschi is a retired widower who lives according to a strict routine he set for himself. An ardent old-style communist, he has always been at odds with the unconventional lifestyle led by his son and his hippieish girlfriend Stella. When their four-year-old daughter is left in his care out of the blue after the two break up, the old professor becomes a sort of father figure to the girl, growing fond of her. However he''s once again challenged when Stella also arrives for a stay in his elegant villa, reclaiming custody of her daughter.', 'Italy, 1977. Professor Bruschi is a retired widower who lives according to a strict routine he set for himself. An ardent old-style communist, he has always been at odds with the unconventional lifestyle led by his son and his hippieish girlfriend Stella. When their four-year-old daughter is left in his care out of the blue after the two break up, the old professor becomes a sort of father figure to the girl, growing fond of her. However he''s once again challenged when Stella also arrives for a stay in his elegant villa, reclaiming custody of her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jD0y2mzrzRjwKU8ESDVFRtGMaqX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82116'),
  ('505706690929464694', 'Towards Tenderness', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Liza Alster, Pauline Coudurier, Alice Diop', 'Alice Diop', 'Modibo Diarra, Samake Diarra, Nidhal Majdoub, Maher Bouffera, Rebecca Louis, Patrick Zingile, Anis Rhali, Thaniat Satirou', null, 'An intimate exploration of the masculine territory of the high-rise projects at the edges of Paris. By following a group of young men, we wander through a world where female bodies are nothing more than ghostly and virtual silhouettes. The characters lead us inside everyday places where we hunt down the staging of their virility. Off-screen, narrated personal tales openly reveal the unexpected side to the characters'' histories and personalities.', 'An intimate exploration of the masculine territory of the high-rise projects at the edges of Paris. By following a group of young men, we wander through a world where female bodies are nothing more than ghostly and virtual silhouettes. The characters lead us inside everyday places where we hunt down the staging of their virility. Off-screen, narrated personal tales openly reveal the unexpected side to the characters'' histories and personalities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTg1BPzP7CC0QeAl5mQGnNXIICI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448469'),
  ('743111194535947275', 'Towards the Battle', 2019, 'Adventure, Western, Drama', 'Aurélien Vernhes-Lermusiaux', 'Aurélien Vernhes-Lermusiaux, Olivier Demangel', 'Malik Zidi, Leynar Gomez, Thomas Chabrol, Olivier Chantreau, Sébastien Chassagne, Cosme Castro, Maxence Tual, Andrew Leland Rogers', null, 'The story unfolds around the year 1860. Louis, a photographer, convinces the general of the French Army to send him to Mexico to photograph the colonial war that is ravaging the country. Once he is there, nothing goes as planned. Never in the right place at the right time to see the battles, Louis can''t snap a single picture of the war. But his encounter with Pinto, a Mexican peasant, changes his destiny. It leads him to discover neither glory nor wealth, but a way to confront the ghosts of his past.', 'The story unfolds around the year 1860. Louis, a photographer, convinces the general of the French Army to send him to Mexico to photograph the colonial war that is ravaging the country. Once he is there, nothing goes as planned. Never in the right place at the right time to see the battles, Louis can''t snap a single picture of the war. But his encounter with Pinto, a Mexican peasant, changes his destiny. It leads him to discover neither glory nor wealth, but a way to confront the ghosts of his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dm5cJrYOXfYiZeRkmeZbb0GMhx7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592693'),
  ('402764259171250052', 'Towards Zero', 2007, 'Thriller', 'Pascal Thomas, Olivier Petitjean, Renan Pollès', 'Roland Duval, Clémence de Biéville, Nathalie Lafaurie', 'François Morel, Danielle Darrieux, Melvil Poupaud, Laura Smet, Chiara Mastroianni, Alessandra Martines, Jacques Sereys, Héloïse Wagner', null, 'Inviting the ex-wife to a family reunion when the none-too-secure new wife will be there hardly seems to be a recipe for success, and true to form, bodies have begun to stack up by the end of this cinematic update of a classic Agatha Christie tale. Luckily for the extended clan gathered at a sumptuous waterfront estate in Northern France, Inspector Martin Bataille is on hand to find out not only "who done it" but why.', 'Inviting the ex-wife to a family reunion when the none-too-secure new wife will be there hardly seems to be a recipe for success, and true to form, bodies have begun to stack up by the end of this cinematic update of a classic Agatha Christie tale. Luckily for the extended clan gathered at a sumptuous waterfront estate in Northern France, Inspector Martin Bataille is on hand to find out not only "who done it" but why.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qr5XXlIZ1egIBqmESkCmNCsrJmk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15340'),
  ('572985045318892505', 'Towed in a Hole', 1932, 'Comedy', 'George Marshall, Art Lloyd, Lloyd French', 'Charley Rogers, Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Billy Gilbert', 'NR', 'Although they are successful fishmongers, Stan convinces Ollie that they should become fishermen too, but making a boat seaworthy isn''t an easy task.', 'Although they are successful fishmongers, Stan convinces Ollie that they should become fishermen too, but making a boat seaworthy isn''t an easy task.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGiSl2seDxgpkNo7rftQml5xHDk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50914'),
  ('125727548487034646', 'Towelhead', 2008, 'Drama', 'Alan Ball, Newton Thomas Sigel, Jeff Mossa', 'Alan Ball', 'Summer Bishil, Aaron Eckhart, Toni Collette, Maria Bello, Peter Macdissi, Eugene Jones III, Lynn Collins, Chase Ellison', 'R', 'A young Arab-American girl struggles with her sexual obsession, a bigoted Army reservist, and her strict father during the Gulf War.', 'A young Arab-American girl struggles with her sexual obsession, a bigoted Army reservist, and her strict father during the Gulf War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2j8CNzvRzdICkwRXojdrDyT65J1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10190'),
  ('188975340151812430', 'Tower', 2016, 'Animation, Crime, Documentary', 'Keith Maitland', 'Keith Maitland, Sarah Wilson', 'Violett Beane, Chris Doubek, Blair Jackson, Louie Arnette, Josephine McAdam, Aldo Ordoñez, Seamus Bolivar-Ochoa, Monty Muir', null, 'Combining archival footage with rotoscopic animation, Tower reveals the action-packed untold stories of the witnesses, heroes and survivors of America’s first mass school shooting, when the worst in one man brought out the best in so many others.', 'Combining archival footage with rotoscopic animation, Tower reveals the action-packed untold stories of the witnesses, heroes and survivors of America’s first mass school shooting, when the worst in one man brought out the best in so many others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYau8BFtkQUMWDyRbpACru4cS6G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381028'),
  ('519558727467243458', 'Tower Block', 2012, 'Thriller, Action', 'Ronnie Thompson, James Nunn, Ben Moulden', 'James Moran', 'Sheridan Smith, Ralph Brown, Russell Tovey, Jack O''Connell, Jill Baker, Julie Graham, Christopher Fulford, Steven Cree', 'R', 'A year after witnessing a murder, residents of Tower Block 31 find themselves being picked off by a sniper, pitting those lucky enough to be alive into a battle for survival.', 'A year after witnessing a murder, residents of Tower Block 31 find themselves being picked off by a sniper, pitting those lucky enough to be alive into a battle for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikUmaaOMbyeszWnyaIXye3f1GFe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128876'),
  ('191837690728618043', 'Tower Heist', 2011, 'Action, Comedy', 'Brett Ratner, Dante Spinotti, James M. Freitag', 'Ted Griffin, Jeff Nathanson', 'Ben Stiller, Eddie Murphy, Casey Affleck, Alan Alda, Matthew Broderick, Stephen McKinley Henderson, Judd Hirsch, Téa Leoni', 'PG-13', 'A luxury condo manager leads a staff of workers to seek payback on the Wall Street swindler who defrauded them. With only days until the billionaire gets away with the perfect crime, the unlikely crew of amateur thieves enlists the help of petty crook Slide to steal the $20 million they’re sure is hidden in the penthouse.', 'A luxury condo manager leads a staff of workers to seek payback on the Wall Street swindler who defrauded them. With only days until the billionaire gets away with the perfect crime, the unlikely crew of amateur thieves enlists the help of petty crook Slide to steal the $20 million they’re sure is hidden in the penthouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQrroNwP8hbFiUlNMs20emauwPE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59108'),
  ('508585377684832956', 'Tower of Evil', 1972, 'Horror', 'Jim O''Connolly, Desmond Dickinson', 'Jim O''Connolly', 'Bryant Haliday, Jill Haworth, Anna Palk, William Lucas, Anthony Valentine, Gary Hamilton, Jack Watson, Mark Edwards', 'R', 'A group of experienced archeologists are searching for an old and mystic Phoenician treasure when they are surprised by a series of mysterious murders...', 'A group of experienced archeologists are searching for an old and mystic Phoenician treasure when they are surprised by a series of mysterious murders...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jA87R0qusg35M8kIXhfIoPesYI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30934'),
  ('529120878121258965', 'Tower of London', 1939, 'Drama, History, Horror', 'Rowland V. Lee, George Robinson, Fred Frank', 'Robert N. Lee', 'Basil Rathbone, Boris Karloff, Barbara O''Neil, Ian Hunter, Vincent Price, Nan Grey, Ernest Cossart, John Sutton', null, 'In the 15th century Richard Duke of Gloucester, aided by his club-footed executioner Mord, eliminates those ahead of him in succession to the throne, then occupied by his brother King Edward IV of England. As each murder is accomplished he takes particular delight in removing small figurines, each resembling one of the successors, from a throne-room dollhouse, until he alone remains. After the death of Edward he becomes Richard III, King of England, and need only defeat the exiled Henry Tudor to retain power.', 'In the 15th century Richard Duke of Gloucester, aided by his club-footed executioner Mord, eliminates those ahead of him in succession to the throne, then occupied by his brother King Edward IV of England. As each murder is accomplished he takes particular delight in removing small figurines, each resembling one of the successors, from a throne-room dollhouse, until he alone remains. After the death of Edward he becomes Richard III, King of England, and need only defeat the exiled Henry Tudor to retain power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glEWt92HOIq7uUoyMyO3JWyzH6K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28365'),
  ('511074390250413549', 'Tower of London', 1962, 'History, Horror', 'Roger Corman, Archie R. Dalzell, Jack Bohrer', 'Leo Gordon, F. Amos Powell, Robert E. Kent', 'Vincent Price, Michael Pate, Joan Freeman, Robert Brown, Bruce Gordon, Joan Camden, Richard Hale, Sandra Knight', null, 'The twisted Richard III is haunted by the ghosts of those he has murdered in his attempt to become the King of England.', 'The twisted Richard III is haunted by the ghosts of those he has murdered in his attempt to become the King of England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcEHgUyuMe20JlyoYM7eNHWcwIu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43014'),
  ('958140667669013474', 'Tower of Lust', 1955, 'History, Drama', 'Abel Gance, Giacomo Pozzi-Bellini, Michel Boisrond', 'Abel Gance, Fernand Rivers', 'Silvana Pampanini, Pierre Brasseur, Paul Guers, Jacques Toja, Constant Rémy, Michel Etcheverry, Michel Bouquet, Cristina Grado', null, 'France, the beginning of the XIV century. Every night, Queen Margaret of Burgundy and her two sisters arrange orgies, to which beautiful nobles are invited. The young men were brought blindfolded, and after a night of love they were killed and their corpses thrown into the river, because the queen was afraid that her husband would learn about her adventures. One of her lovers managed to escape death. He knows the secrets of the queen, knows that she once gave birth to a son from him, claims that he has evidence that Margarita wanted to kill her father and blackmails her.', 'France, the beginning of the XIV century. Every night, Queen Margaret of Burgundy and her two sisters arrange orgies, to which beautiful nobles are invited. The young men were brought blindfolded, and after a night of love they were killed and their corpses thrown into the river, because the queen was afraid that her husband would learn about her adventures. One of her lovers managed to escape death. He knows the secrets of the queen, knows that she once gave birth to a son from him, claims that he has evidence that Margarita wanted to kill her father and blackmails her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3X9jmW5oa4XwpQQbMSnUPwQavK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79892'),
  ('726168547045717559', 'Tower of Terror', 1999, 'Comedy, Family, Horror', 'D.J. MacHale, Richard Feld, Richard Peter Schroer', 'D.J. MacHale', 'Steve Guttenberg, Kirsten Dunst, Nia Peeples, Michael McShane, Amzie Strickland, Melora Hardin, Alastair Duncan, Lindsay Ridgeway', 'NR', 'A disgraced reporter investigates an abandoned luxury hotel where five people mysteriously disappeared sixty years earlier.', 'A disgraced reporter investigates an abandoned luxury hotel where five people mysteriously disappeared sixty years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZ17PwwacUBMMGWiQUGjwkag5sy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43274'),
  ('751784784857935741', 'Towers of Silence', 1975, 'Drama', 'Jamil Dehlavi, Jamil Dehlavi, Shakernaz Massood', 'Jamil Dehlavi', 'Judy Van Hook, Jalal Khan, Jamil Dehlavi, Ajaz Ahmed, Zahoor Ahmad, Zakir Changezi, Abdul Abid, Akbar Chalcal', null, 'A Pakistani boy develops into a young revolutionary and confronts love, religious conflict, and his own death through Zoroastrian rituals of purification.', 'A Pakistani boy develops into a young revolutionary and confronts love, religious conflict, and his own death through Zoroastrian rituals of purification.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gqhjObbGvhYZEeeTKxmmzb3zRmZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490225'),
  ('727098286518165258', 'Towers Open Fire', 1963, 'Science Fiction', 'Antony Balch', 'William S. Burroughs', 'William S. Burroughs, Alexander Trocchi, Antony Balch, Bachoo Sen, David Jacobs', null, 'Antony Balch tackles key themes and ideas from the writing of William S. Burroughs in a unique, cinematic style.', 'Antony Balch tackles key themes and ideas from the writing of William S. Burroughs in a unique, cinematic style.', null, 'tmdb:movie:143496'),
  ('1028953871417717950', 'Town & Country', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Peter Chelsom, William A. Fraker', 'Buck Henry, Michael Laughlin', 'Warren Beatty, Diane Keaton, Goldie Hawn, Garry Shandling, Andie MacDowell, Jenna Elfman, Nastassja Kinski, Charlton Heston', 'R', 'Porter Stoddard is a well-known New York architect who is at a crossroads... a nexus where twists and turns lead to myriad missteps, some with his wife Ellie, others with longtime friends Mona and her husband Griffin. Deciding which direction to take often leads to unexpected encounters with hilarious consequences.', 'Porter Stoddard is a well-known New York architect who is at a crossroads... a nexus where twists and turns lead to myriad missteps, some with his wife Ellie, others with longtime friends Mona and her husband Griffin. Deciding which direction to take often leads to unexpected encounters with hilarious consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ckfJA1zqdXG7ttBqGZ2A91YHQs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24113'),
  ('144967667864007221', 'Town Bloody Hall', 1979, 'Documentary', 'Chris Hegedus, D. A. Pennebaker, Jim Desmond', null, 'Norman Mailer, Jacqueline Ceballos, Germaine Greer, Jill Johnston, Diane Trilling, Susan Sontag, Betty Friedan, Elizabeth Hardwick', null, 'Norman Mailer and a panel of feminists — Jacqueline Ceballos, Germaine Greer, Jill Johnston, and Diana Trilling — debate the issue of Women''s Liberation.', 'Norman Mailer and a panel of feminists — Jacqueline Ceballos, Germaine Greer, Jill Johnston, and Diana Trilling — debate the issue of Women''s Liberation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77w5IsUbapWrJJ3XB3Bo5OlB5Ie.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274381'),
  ('1048953425395216439', 'Town on Trial', 1957, 'Mystery, Crime', 'John Guillermin, Basil Emmott', 'Robert Westerby, Ken Hughes', 'John Mills, Charles Coburn, Barbara Bates, Derek Farr, Alec McCowen, Fay Compton, Geoffrey Keen, Margaretta Scott', 'NR', 'When an attractive young girl is murdered, suspicion falls on several members of the local tennis club. It falls to Police Inspector Halloran to sort out all the red herrings, and finally after a confrontation at the top of the local church spire, arrest the culprit. Another fascinating look at what life was like in Britain during the 50''s.', 'When an attractive young girl is murdered, suspicion falls on several members of the local tennis club. It falls to Police Inspector Halloran to sort out all the red herrings, and finally after a confrontation at the top of the local church spire, arrest the culprit. Another fascinating look at what life was like in Britain during the 50''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueJfqnxtspZI3vCrLrskM8HvIrh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104451'),
  ('718584080796560698', 'Town Tamer', 1965, 'Western, Action', 'Lesley Selander, W. Wallace Kelley', 'Frank Gruber', 'Dana Andrews, Terry Moore, Pat O''Brien, Lon Chaney Jr., Bruce Cabot, Lyle Bettger, Richard Arlen, Barton MacLane', 'NR', 'A gunfighter is hired to clean up a wild frontier town, but there are forces afoot who want to keep the town as wide-open as it is. Lyle Bettger, Bruce Cabot and Richard Jaeckel co-star as the lawless bad guys in this Western based on a novel by Frank Gruber.', 'A gunfighter is hired to clean up a wild frontier town, but there are forces afoot who want to keep the town as wide-open as it is. Lyle Bettger, Bruce Cabot and Richard Jaeckel co-star as the lawless bad guys in this Western based on a novel by Frank Gruber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iXj9QyANAHFOkj6L8c29jJJnPj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169828'),
  ('431872277159010153', 'Town Without Pity', 1961, 'Drama', 'Gottfried Reinhardt, Kurt Hasse', 'Dalton Trumbo', 'Kirk Douglas, Barbara Rütting, Christine Kaufmann, E.G. Marshall, Hans Nielsen, Ingrid van Bergen, Robert Blake, Richard Jaeckel', null, 'Four American soldiers stationed near a German village face death in the rape of a local girl and are defended by outside counsel Major Steve Grant.', 'Four American soldiers stationed near a German village face death in the rape of a local girl and are defended by outside counsel Major Steve Grant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJ7YsfTPQHE0PnbLa80GlBhxtHT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93427'),
  ('718100511213427298', 'Toxic', 2008, 'Action, Thriller', 'Alan Pao, Roger Chingirian', 'Kyle Kramer, Alan Pao', 'Susan Ward, Corey Large, Master P, Dominique Swain, Charity Shea, Danny Trejo, Costas Mandylor, Tom Sizemore', null, 'The lives of a nightclub owner, a crime boss, a stripper, a bartender, two hitmen, a prostitute and a psychic take a turn for the worse when they are trapped in an escaped mental patient''s sinister path of madness and destruction.', 'The lives of a nightclub owner, a crime boss, a stripper, a bartender, two hitmen, a prostitute and a psychic take a turn for the worse when they are trapped in an escaped mental patient''s sinister path of madness and destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pgXHemrcs5UI6Usay7FD1g3ShB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13902'),
  ('543715794444304966', 'Toxic', 2020, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Ariel Martínez Herrera, Martín Garabal, Vicente Basili', 'Ariel Martínez Herrera, Santiago La Rosa, Santiago Podestá', 'Jazmín Stuart, Agustín Rittano, Alejandro Jovic, Martín Garabal, Lucila Mangone, Marcelo D''Andrea, Jorge Prado, Marcelo Minnino', null, 'In the middle of a mysterious insomnia epidemic that slowly takes on catastrophic dimensions, Laura (39) and Augusto (42) flee the city in their motorhome to get away from the chaos. As they move down the route, the world becomes an increasingly strange and dangerous place. Finally, Laura reveals a story that changes everything. The road is depopulating, the silence grows and it is increasingly difficult to differentiate the reality from the dream.', 'In the middle of a mysterious insomnia epidemic that slowly takes on catastrophic dimensions, Laura (39) and Augusto (42) flee the city in their motorhome to get away from the chaos. As they move down the route, the world becomes an increasingly strange and dangerous place. Finally, Laura reveals a story that changes everything. The road is depopulating, the silence grows and it is increasingly difficult to differentiate the reality from the dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWL4lyP4DhEkg73rjUoALXguIXh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:687149'),
  ('457972267916862090', 'Toxic', 2025, 'Drama', 'Saulė Bliuvaitė, Vytautas Katkus, Ugnė Šiaučiūnaitė', 'Saulė Bliuvaitė', 'Vesta Matulytė, Ieva Rupeikaitė, Eglė Gabrėnaitė, Giedrius Savickas, Vilma Raubaitė, Jekaterina Makarova, Jokūbas Paškevičius, Tadas Baranauskas', null, 'Dreaming of an escape from the bleakness of their hometown, two teens form a unique bond at a local modeling school, where the promise of a better life pushes girls to violate their bodies in increasingly extreme ways.', 'Dreaming of an escape from the bleakness of their hometown, two teens form a unique bond at a local modeling school, where the promise of a better life pushes girls to violate their bodies in increasingly extreme ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knG84vSv8kRMeopgIcrTpsYYHSs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1315091'),
  ('1034724694652872190', 'Toxic', 2026, 'Action, Thriller', 'Geethu Mohandas, Rajeev Ravi', 'Geethu Mohandas, Yash', 'Yash, Kiara Advani, Huma Qureshi, Nayanthara, Tara Sutaria, Rukmini Vasanth, Sudev Nair, Akshay Oberoi', null, 'Set in a bygone era, this gripping tale unfolds in the coastal paradise of Goa, wherea powerful drug cartel pulls the strings behind a facade of sun-soaked beaches and vibrant culture.', 'Set in a bygone era, this gripping tale unfolds in the coastal paradise of Goa, wherea powerful drug cartel pulls the strings behind a facade of sun-soaked beaches and vibrant culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZ8eSBXbza96vzCYeVTG9RBJ78E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1213243'),
  ('349084452719425967', 'Toxic Desire: Addiction', 2014, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Yoon Yeo-chang', 'Jeong Tae-seong', 'Kim Sun-young, Hong Kyung-in, Lee Jeong-woo, Park Se-jin, Lee Seol-gu, Lee Hyun-ji, Kim Young-woong, Kang Seung-beom', null, 'Psychiatrist Joon-sang is a well-known doctor. He is level-headed with his patients, but he''s got a painful past. He''d witnessed his wife kill herself because she was raped. He''d suffered insomnia along with guilt and sadness until a beautiful girl Ji-soo comes along. She tells him every man who''s loved her died and that someone was watching her. She seduces Joon-sang. A detective suspects Ji-soo to be involved with a recent murder case and asks Joon-sang for her medical records... Falling in love with something dangerous and the end of which is unknown!', 'Psychiatrist Joon-sang is a well-known doctor. He is level-headed with his patients, but he''s got a painful past. He''d witnessed his wife kill herself because she was raped. He''d suffered insomnia along with guilt and sadness until a beautiful girl Ji-soo comes along. She tells him every man who''s loved her died and that someone was watching her. She seduces Joon-sang. A detective suspects Ji-soo to be involved with a recent murder case and asks Joon-sang for her medical records... Falling in love with something dangerous and the end of which is unknown!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fExG9lgSbCRpW9E74LYFXta2Ruj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383045'),
  ('330590642793272793', 'Toxic Love', 1983, 'Drama, Crime', 'Claudio Caligari, Dario Di Palma, Stefano Oddi', 'Guido Blumir, Claudio Caligari', 'Cesare Ferretti, Michela Mioni, Enzo Di Benedetto, Roberto Stani, Clara Memoria, Dario Trombetta, Loredana Ferrara, Mario Afeltra', null, 'The alienating and repetitive life of a group of heroin junkies in 1980s Rome.', 'The alienating and repetitive life of a group of heroin junkies in 1980s Rome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQwo0Nwek1kH9QE4ZOO0TN7XAgU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59037'),
  ('1044810012949536911', 'Toxic Love', 2025, 'Drama, Romance', 'Francesca Schirru, Filippo Silvestris', 'Francesca Schirru, Cesare Fragnelli', 'Giulia Schiavo, Simone Susinna, Antonella Carone, Antonio Orlando, Simon Grechi, Domenico Fortunato', null, 'In southern Italy, Mary, a young woman bound to criminal Nunzio, wants out of their toxic relationship but fears the repercussions. Her love affair with Giulio, a new riding instructor, drives her to find courage. Despite warnings from Michele, her childhood friend and Nunzio’s partner, Mary chooses love with Giulio. Nunzio, feeling betrayed, plots revenge. A story of love and blood where the real subversive and renewing elements seem to be love and friendship.', 'In southern Italy, Mary, a young woman bound to criminal Nunzio, wants out of their toxic relationship but fears the repercussions. Her love affair with Giulio, a new riding instructor, drives her to find courage. Despite warnings from Michele, her childhood friend and Nunzio’s partner, Mary chooses love with Giulio. Nunzio, feeling betrayed, plots revenge. A story of love and blood where the real subversive and renewing elements seem to be love and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUWcfnctca89YR6Q7kGdeiGZD2k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1186715'),
  ('735146774210307005', 'Toxic Shark', 2017, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Rafael Leyva, Cole Sharpe', 'Ashley O''Neil', 'Kabby Borders, Christina Masterson, Michelle Cortés, Bryce Durfee, Sean Samuels, Quinn Bozza, Cristina Jayo, Eric Etebari', null, 'A tropical singles retreat takes a terrifying turn when guests realize a poisonous shark is infesting the surrounding water. Not only will it rip apart its victims, but it also uses projectile acid to hunt - in and out of the water.', 'A tropical singles retreat takes a terrifying turn when guests realize a poisonous shark is infesting the surrounding water. Not only will it rip apart its victims, but it also uses projectile acid to hunt - in and out of the water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZx7JcVyfgh2OpfbUlZru23BX0a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461108'),
  ('549053946913767953', 'Toxic Skies', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Andrew C. Erin, Mahlon Todd Williams', 'Kyle Hart, Andrew C. Erin', 'Anne Heche, James Tupper, Kevin McNulty, Laura Bertram, Tobias Slezak, Daniel Bacon, Barclay Hope, Nicola Anderson', null, 'A doctor must find a cure for a viral epidemic that is spreading through vapors from jets.', 'A doctor must find a cure for a viral epidemic that is spreading through vapors from jets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QWTbgNrKeuPqBgOjRvyAhjY6Ol.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24917'),
  ('567818630363251445', 'Toxicity', 2026, 'Drama', 'Felix Jordan', 'Felix Jordan', 'Zae Diggs, Timmeria Baltimore, Iroko Anyogu, Latotsy Jackson, Julian Horton', null, 'A man who created a growingly successful app navigates stressors from work, a new relationship, and a past that continues to impact his perception and functioning - flashbacks to a difficult childhood paint the picture of a troubled man.', 'A man who created a growingly successful app navigates stressors from work, a new relationship, and a past that continues to impact his perception and functioning - flashbacks to a difficult childhood paint the picture of a troubled man.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fckpx9ynvy9FPwbRvNkpGNW0HK0r.jpg', 'plex:movie:toxicity-2026'),
  ('283268289897526318', 'Toy Guardians', 2017, 'Animation, Family', 'Yu Shen, Huang Yan', null, 'Lizhen Yan, Heng Wang, Li Chuanying', 'G', 'Childhood gives life to toys, and so toys safeguard it. The new range of digital entertainment means toys are being left behind. When Laura get obsessed with her new video-game, Minitiger, her favorite toy, goes digital to help her.', 'Childhood gives life to toys, and so toys safeguard it. The new range of digital entertainment means toys are being left behind. When Laura get obsessed with her new video-game, Minitiger, her favorite toy, goes digital to help her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Tt1jS6ozVJEYeTDSkZatBrS1UX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615960'),
  ('620287428797308260', 'Toy Guns', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Adolfo López Campaña, Rafael Altamira', 'Adolfo López Campaña', 'Rafael Angulo, Esmeralda Cervantes, Luis Fernando Peña, Raymundo Medina, Liz Díaz, Memo Bolco, Ricardo Bravo, Eric Flo', null, 'After losing his job, Leo is also losing his breath at his girlfriend''s demands. In his closet, he finds a toy gun, so he looks for his good old friend DJ Canas, and proposes him the business of their lives: to become armed robbers. This is how they begin a journey full of funny adventures where Leo looks for money and DJ Canas seeks the adrenaline.', 'After losing his job, Leo is also losing his breath at his girlfriend''s demands. In his closet, he finds a toy gun, so he looks for his good old friend DJ Canas, and proposes him the business of their lives: to become armed robbers. This is how they begin a journey full of funny adventures where Leo looks for money and DJ Canas seeks the adrenaline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sFI2nMUNVdoz1qaRhfuxiLCUS8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385246'),
  ('369310466507490009', 'Toy Soldiers', 1984, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'David Fisher', 'Walter Fox, David Fisher', 'Jason Miller, Cleavon Little, Terri Garber, Tim Robbins, Tracy Scoggins, Rodolfo de Anda, Douglas Warhit, Willard E. Pugh', 'R', 'While on a vacation in Central America, some American teenagers are kidnapped by terrorists. A rescue mission is sent after them, but they manage to escape and join up with a mercenary fighting the terrorists.', 'While on a vacation in Central America, some American teenagers are kidnapped by terrorists. A rescue mission is sent after them, but they manage to escape and join up with a mercenary fighting the terrorists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymT2V8w547T8RChg91uQkORdPwC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119540'),
  ('521814463966876779', 'Toy Soldiers', 1991, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Daniel Petrie Jr., Thomas Burstyn, Michael D. Moore', 'Daniel Petrie Jr., David Koepp', 'Sean Astin, Wil Wheaton, Keith Coogan, Andrew Divoff, R. Lee Ermey, Mason Adams, Denholm Elliott, Louis Gossett Jr.', 'R', 'After federal agents arrest a drug czar and put him on trial, the cartel leader''s vicious son storms a prep school and takes its students hostage. They rebel against the armed intruders and try to take back their academy by any means necessary.', 'After federal agents arrest a drug czar and put him on trial, the cartel leader''s vicious son storms a prep school and takes its students hostage. They rebel against the armed intruders and try to take back their academy by any means necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nL3ccvqU1Wq1j31feHWAydzpbr2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10750'),
  ('234600748371762606', 'Toy Story', 1995, 'Family, Comedy, Animation, Adventure', 'John Lasseter, Ash Brannon, Rich Quade', 'Alec Sokolow, Joel Cohen, Joss Whedon', 'Tom Hanks, Tim Allen, Don Rickles, Jim Varney, Wallace Shawn, John Ratzenberger, Annie Potts, John Morris', 'G', 'Led by Woody, Andy''s toys live happily in his room until Andy''s birthday brings Buzz Lightyear onto the scene. Afraid of losing his place in Andy''s heart, Woody plots against Buzz. But when circumstances separate Buzz and Woody from their owner, the duo eventually learns to put aside their differences.', 'Led by Woody, Andy''s toys live happily in his room until Andy''s birthday brings Buzz Lightyear onto the scene. Afraid of losing his place in Andy''s heart, Woody plots against Buzz. But when circumstances separate Buzz and Woody from their owner, the duo eventually learns to put aside their differences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXDfjJbdP4ijW5hWSBrPrlKpxab.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:862'),
  ('341555257494415963', 'Toy Story 2', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'John Lasseter, Sharon Calahan, Dylan Brown', 'Andrew Stanton, Doug Chamberlin, Rita Hsiao', 'Tom Hanks, Tim Allen, Joan Cusack, Kelsey Grammer, Don Rickles, Jim Varney, Wallace Shawn, John Ratzenberger', 'G', 'Andy heads off to Cowboy Camp, leaving his toys to their own devices. Things shift into high gear when an obsessive toy collector named Al McWhiggen, owner of Al''s Toy Barn kidnaps Woody. Andy''s toys mount a daring rescue mission, Buzz Lightyear meets his match and Woody has to decide where he and his heart truly belong.', 'Andy heads off to Cowboy Camp, leaving his toys to their own devices. Things shift into high gear when an obsessive toy collector named Al McWhiggen, owner of Al''s Toy Barn kidnaps Woody. Andy''s toys mount a daring rescue mission, Buzz Lightyear meets his match and Woody has to decide where he and his heart truly belong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rbcp3ng8n1MKHjpeqW0L7Fnpzz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:863'),
  ('1124673863509541007', 'Toy Story 3', 2010, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Lee Unkrich, Jeremy Lasky, Robert H. Russ', 'Michael Arndt', 'Tom Hanks, Tim Allen, Joan Cusack, Don Rickles, Wallace Shawn, John Ratzenberger, Estelle Harris, Blake Clark', 'G', 'Woody, Buzz, and the rest of Andy''s toys haven''t been played with in years. With Andy about to go to college, the gang find themselves accidentally left at a nefarious day care center. The toys must band together to escape and return home to Andy.', 'Woody, Buzz, and the rest of Andy''s toys haven''t been played with in years. With Andy about to go to college, the gang find themselves accidentally left at a nefarious day care center. The toys must band together to escape and return home to Andy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbbXspMOwdvwWZgVN0nabZq03Ec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10193'),
  ('506284719376082515', 'Toy Story 4', 2019, 'Family, Comedy, Animation, Adventure', 'Josh Cooley, Patrick Lin, Jean-Claude Kalache', 'Stephany Folsom, Andrew Stanton', 'Tom Hanks, Tim Allen, Annie Potts, Tony Hale, Keegan-Michael Key, Madeleine McGraw, Christina Hendricks, Jordan Peele', 'G', 'Woody has always been confident about his place in the world, devoted to taking care of his kid—whether that''s Andy or Bonnie. But after Bonnie creates a reluctant new toy called "Forky", a road trip adventure alongside old and new friends challenges everything Woody believes about loyalty, purpose, and what it truly means to be a toy.', 'Woody has always been confident about his place in the world, devoted to taking care of his kid—whether that''s Andy or Bonnie. But after Bonnie creates a reluctant new toy called "Forky", a road trip adventure alongside old and new friends challenges everything Woody believes about loyalty, purpose, and what it truly means to be a toy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9kR8qbmQ01HwnvK4alvnQ2ca0L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301528'),
  ('1035499508490693804', 'Toy Story 5', 2026, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'Andrew Stanton, McKenna Jean Harris, Matt Aspbury', 'Andrew Stanton, McKenna Jean Harris', 'Tom Hanks, Tim Allen, Joan Cusack, Greta Lee, Conan O''Brien, Craig Robinson, Shelby Rabara, Tony Hale', null, 'When Bonnie receives a Lilypad tablet as a gift and becomes obsessed, Buzz, Woody, Jessie and the rest of the gang''s jobs become exponentially harder when they have to go head to head with the all-new threat to playtime.', 'When Bonnie receives a Lilypad tablet as a gift and becomes obsessed, Buzz, Woody, Jessie and the rest of the gang''s jobs become exponentially harder when they have to go head to head with the all-new threat to playtime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWIAOC9EKFehGs3CYvDQih3hxaG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084244'),
  ('247689128246293419', 'Toy Story of Terror!', 2013, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Angus MacLane', 'Angus MacLane', 'Joan Cusack, Carl Weathers, Tom Hanks, Tim Allen, Stephen Tobolowsky, Don Rickles, Wallace Shawn, Timothy Dalton', 'G', 'What starts out as a fun road trip for the Toy Story gang takes an unexpected turn for the worse when the trip detours to a roadside motel. After one of the toys goes missing, the others find themselves caught up in a mysterious sequence of events that must be solved before they all suffer the same fate in this Toy Story of Terror.', 'What starts out as a fun road trip for the Toy Story gang takes an unexpected turn for the worse when the trip detours to a roadside motel. After one of the toys goes missing, the others find themselves caught up in a mysterious sequence of events that must be solved before they all suffer the same fate in this Toy Story of Terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPBEnNP4Fg4gv9c0KBhchmtoG4H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213121'),
  ('238371524419722604', 'Toy Story That Time Forgot', 2014, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Steve Purcell', 'Steve Purcell', 'Kristen Schaal, Kevin McKidd, Tom Hanks, Tim Allen, Emily Hahn, Steve Purcell, R.C. Cope, Emma Hudak', 'G', 'During a post-Christmas play date, the gang find themselves in uncharted territory when the coolest set of action figures ever turn out to be dangerously delusional. It''s all up to Trixie, the triceratops, if the gang hopes to return to Bonnie''s room in this Toy Story That Time Forgot.', 'During a post-Christmas play date, the gang find themselves in uncharted territory when the coolest set of action figures ever turn out to be dangerously delusional. It''s all up to Trixie, the triceratops, if the gang hopes to return to Bonnie''s room in this Toy Story That Time Forgot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVOaFo8RaYQceHfTqbZGmV9R80q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256835'),
  ('745930061925396480', 'Toy Tinkers', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, James MacDonald, Dessie Flynn', 'NR', 'When Donald Duck chops a Christmas tree, the inquisitive chipmunks Chip and Dale follow and see him decorate it with nuts and sweets. So they sneak in his home, determined to ''harvest'' it all, using the toys for the Duck nephews, as if Christmas came early for them, so to say. Donald puts up an equally ''playful'' yet grim defense, so it all rapidly escalates into a bitter miniature two-to-one-giant war over the Christmas-treats.', 'When Donald Duck chops a Christmas tree, the inquisitive chipmunks Chip and Dale follow and see him decorate it with nuts and sweets. So they sneak in his home, determined to ''harvest'' it all, using the toys for the Duck nephews, as if Christmas came early for them, so to say. Donald puts up an equally ''playful'' yet grim defense, so it all rapidly escalates into a bitter miniature two-to-one-giant war over the Christmas-treats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YbEmLfVC8wzYIcBryGgKXmku01.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67697'),
  ('437977712160751595', 'Toying with the Holidays', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Bradley Walsh', 'Buddy Baron, Emily Moss Wilson', 'Chad Michael Murray, Cindy Busby, Kate Trotter, Callum Shoniker, Paulino Nunes, Izaak Smith, Hanneke Talbot, Donno Mitoma', null, 'Kevin, a model train enthusiast reconnects with a former classmate Danielle who is home for the holidays with her young son and try to get their town''s old North Pole Express train line running.', 'Kevin, a model train enthusiast reconnects with a former classmate Danielle who is home for the holidays with her young son and try to get their town''s old North Pole Express train line running.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Ns4y5FWDxZhmXlou9Ixq0MLlP1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:878384'),
  ('642366142318644771', 'Toyland', 2007, 'Drama, War', 'Jochen Alexander Freydank', 'Jochen Alexander Freydank, Johann A. Bunners', 'Julia Jäger, Cedric Eich, David C. Bunners, Torsten Michaelis, Claudia Hübschmann, Gregor Weber, Jürgen Trott, Klaus-Jürgen Steinmann', null, 'On a winter morning, a mother goes to waken her son Heinrich; his bed is empty. She leaves her flat to find him. The neighbors'' door, with a Star of David painted on it, is ajar, the furnishings in disarray, the family gone. She asks passersby, runs to the police then on to the rail yard. Flashbacks show that Heinrich and the neighbors'' son Paul are six years old and best friends. Paul''s family''s deportation is expected soon; Heinrich''s mother tells her son that they''re going to Toyland. Heinrich wants to go with them, has a bag packed, and listens for their departure. His mother realizes he''s joined them, and her resolve becomes more urgent. Will she arrive in time to save Heinrich?', 'On a winter morning, a mother goes to waken her son Heinrich; his bed is empty. She leaves her flat to find him. The neighbors'' door, with a Star of David painted on it, is ajar, the furnishings in disarray, the family gone. She asks passersby, runs to the police then on to the rail yard. Flashbacks show that Heinrich and the neighbors'' son Paul are six years old and best friends. Paul''s family''s deportation is expected soon; Heinrich''s mother tells her son that they''re going to Toyland. Heinrich wants to go with them, has a bag packed, and listens for their departure. His mother realizes he''s joined them, and her resolve becomes more urgent. Will she arrive in time to save Heinrich?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xfx5frpOZD63LSjMRpCkx1yhhN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23764'),
  ('270496716890189448', 'Toys', 1992, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Barry Levinson, Adam Greenberg, Peter Giuliano', 'Valerie Curtin, Barry Levinson', 'Robin Williams, Michael Gambon, Joan Cusack, Robin Wright, LL Cool J, Donald O''Connor, Arthur Malet, Jack Warden', 'PG-13', 'Leslie Zevo is a fun-loving inventor who must save his late father''s toy factory from his evil uncle, Leland, a war-mongering general who rules the operation with an iron fist and builds weapons disguised as toys.', 'Leslie Zevo is a fun-loving inventor who must save his late father''s toy factory from his evil uncle, Leland, a war-mongering general who rules the operation with an iron fist and builds weapons disguised as toys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0YBVvOvOxoOkggTZ70tNGvGQo4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11597'),
  ('981136243992872910', 'Toys Are Not for Children', 1972, 'Drama', 'Stanley H. Brassloff, Rolph Laube', 'Macs McAree', 'Marcia Forbes, Harlan Cary Poe, Evelyn Kingsley, Luis Arroyo, Fran Warren, Peter Lightstone, Tiberia Mitri, N.J. Osrag', 'R', 'Emotionally stunted child-like woman Jamie Godard not only suffers from an unhealthy fixation on her long absent father, but also has an obsession with all the toys he gave her as a little girl. After getting a job at a toy store, Jamie decides to marry co-worker Charlie Belmond. When the marriage doesn''t work out, Jamie runs away to New York City and becomes a prostitute who specializes in servicing perverted old men who want to play daddy with her.', 'Emotionally stunted child-like woman Jamie Godard not only suffers from an unhealthy fixation on her long absent father, but also has an obsession with all the toys he gave her as a little girl. After getting a job at a toy store, Jamie decides to marry co-worker Charlie Belmond. When the marriage doesn''t work out, Jamie runs away to New York City and becomes a prostitute who specializes in servicing perverted old men who want to play daddy with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrL8nkjVOJ7S9Zg84N2of9iVY9A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88368'),
  ('95577704914589985', 'Toys in the Attic', 1963, 'Drama', 'George Roy Hill, Joseph F. Biroc, Emmett Emerson', 'James Poe', 'Dean Martin, Geraldine Page, Yvette Mimieux, Wendy Hiller, Gene Tierney, Frank Silvera, Larry Gates, Nan Martin', 'NR', 'Julian Berniers returns from Illinois with his young bride Lily Prine to the family in New Orleans. His spinster sisters Carrie and Anna welcome the couple, who arrive with expensive gifts. The sisters hope Julian will help with their expenses, and he tells them that while his profitable factory went out of business, he did manage to save money. It turns out that Julian pulled off a real estate scam and took off with the money. Carrie is obsessed with her brother. Her jealousy of Lily pushes her to discover the shady land deal for herself and she does everything she can to wreck their marriage.', 'Julian Berniers returns from Illinois with his young bride Lily Prine to the family in New Orleans. His spinster sisters Carrie and Anna welcome the couple, who arrive with expensive gifts. The sisters hope Julian will help with their expenses, and he tells them that while his profitable factory went out of business, he did manage to save money. It turns out that Julian pulled off a real estate scam and took off with the money. Carrie is obsessed with her brother. Her jealousy of Lily pushes her to discover the shady land deal for herself and she does everything she can to wreck their marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOHcs1gn6DBoz2QIEb1uVBFEMdS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108869'),
  ('170505101563567197', 'Toys in the Attic', 2009, 'Thriller, Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Jiří Barta, Ivan Vít, Zdeněk Pospíšil', 'Edgar Dutka, Jiří Barta', 'Jiří Lábus, Lucie Pernetová, Boris Hybner, Ivan Trojan, Vladimír Javorský, Barbora Hrzánová, Naďa Konvalinková, Petr Nárožný', null, 'In an attic full of discarded junk, a pretty doll called Buttercup lives in an old trunk together with her friends, the marionette Prince Charming, lazy Teddy Bear and the plasticine creature Schubert. When Buttercup is snatched and taken off to the Land of Evil, her pals set out to rescue her.', 'In an attic full of discarded junk, a pretty doll called Buttercup lives in an old trunk together with her friends, the marionette Prince Charming, lazy Teddy Bear and the plasticine creature Schubert. When Buttercup is snatched and taken off to the Land of Evil, her pals set out to rescue her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjNfQkKDNkZzPKftgQSICBFQb3i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60949'),
  ('934628809794682683', 'Toys of Terror', 2021, 'Horror', 'Nicholas Verso, Paul Suderman', 'Dana Gould', 'Kyana Teresa, Georgia Waters, Dayo Ade, Saul Elias, Zoe Fish, Verity Marks, Ernie Pitts, Lauren Mary Marshall', 'R', 'A big family moves into a dusty old house in the snowy woods of Washington with hopes of it being a nice holiday escape. But the kids soon discover a stash of old toys that just so happen to belong to a creepy ghost boy. As stranger and stranger things start to happen, some of the kids begin to sense that something in the house is not quite right…', 'A big family moves into a dusty old house in the snowy woods of Washington with hopes of it being a nice holiday escape. But the kids soon discover a stash of old toys that just so happen to belong to a creepy ghost boy. As stranger and stranger things start to happen, some of the kids begin to sense that something in the house is not quite right…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gd5zv9V6MOaLOOVSN5RoZmF8a5Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:753926'),
  ('755833897749453915', 'TPB AFK: The Pirate Bay - Away from Keyboard', 2013, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Simon Klose, Simon Klose', 'Simon Klose', 'Gottfrid Svartholm, Fredrik Neij, Peter Sunde, Rasmus Fleischer, Håkan Roswall, Henrik Pontén, Monique Wadsted, Per Sundin', 'NR', 'TPB AFK is a documentary about three computer addicts who redefined the world of media distribution with their hobby homepage The Pirate Bay. How did Tiamo, a beer crazy hardware fanatic, Brokep a tree hugging eco activist and Anakata – a paranoid hacker libertarian – get the White House to threaten the Swedish government with trade sanctions? TPB AFK explores what Hollywood’s most hated pirates go through on a personal level.', 'TPB AFK is a documentary about three computer addicts who redefined the world of media distribution with their hobby homepage The Pirate Bay. How did Tiamo, a beer crazy hardware fanatic, Brokep a tree hugging eco activist and Anakata – a paranoid hacker libertarian – get the White House to threaten the Swedish government with trade sanctions? TPB AFK explores what Hollywood’s most hated pirates go through on a personal level.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTgeYhe5V7tF3gV7ZPwgsTqVDfO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50275'),
  ('94952726789083442', 'Trace of Stones', 1966, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Frank Beyer', 'Frank Beyer, Karl Georg Egel', 'Manfred Krug, Krystyna Stypułkowska, Eberhard Esche, Johannes Wieke, Walter Richter-Reinick, Hans-Peter Minetti, Walter Jupé, Ingeborg Schuhmacher', null, 'Bad planning and shortages prevail on an East German construction site. Foreman Hannes Balla uses unconventional methods to overcome the problems. New Socialist Unity Party secretary Werner Horrath is charged with bringing the rough-and-ready builder crew into line. The task seems doomed to fail as the two men compete for the affections of young engineer Kati Klee. But when she gets pregnant by married man Horrath, he is in danger of being expelled from the party, and Balla takes his side...', 'Bad planning and shortages prevail on an East German construction site. Foreman Hannes Balla uses unconventional methods to overcome the problems. New Socialist Unity Party secretary Werner Horrath is charged with bringing the rough-and-ready builder crew into line. The task seems doomed to fail as the two men compete for the affections of young engineer Kati Klee. But when she gets pregnant by married man Horrath, he is in danger of being expelled from the party, and Balla takes his side...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pIthpAYE9DQV3AnPRN3Cu6YIQp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35620'),
  ('375934262518784828', 'Traceless', 2010, 'Crime', 'Grégoire Vigneron, Laurent Dailland', 'Laurent Tirard, Grégoire Vigneron', 'Benoît Magimel, François-Xavier Demaison, Julie Gayet, Léa Seydoux, Jean-Marie Winling, Dominique Labourier, André Wilms, Stéphane De Groodt', null, 'Étienne Meunier (Benoît Magimel) is a young executive who has everything going for him. His career is skyrocketing and he is about to become #1 at work, he is married to a picture-perfect wife, has a dream home and money. To top it off, he''s charming, healthy and everyone likes him and seems to consider him "a great guy". But beneath the surface, not everything is perfect. Meunier feels some pressure at work, knowing others eye his future position and he and his wife have been unable to have children so far. One day, Meunier bumps into a childhood friend, Patrick Chambon (François-Xavier Demaison) and the two resume their friendship, despite Chambon having struggled as a petty criminal.', 'Étienne Meunier (Benoît Magimel) is a young executive who has everything going for him. His career is skyrocketing and he is about to become #1 at work, he is married to a picture-perfect wife, has a dream home and money. To top it off, he''s charming, healthy and everyone likes him and seems to consider him "a great guy". But beneath the surface, not everything is perfect. Meunier feels some pressure at work, knowing others eye his future position and he and his wife have been unable to have children so far. One day, Meunier bumps into a childhood friend, Patrick Chambon (François-Xavier Demaison) and the two resume their friendship, despite Chambon having struggled as a petty criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUPEoTiqewsoQL9fhWTRjvoOl7M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43409'),
  ('939155144890224646', 'Tracers', 2015, 'Action', 'Derek Peterson, Joshua A. Friedman, Logan Wolfe Edler', 'Matt Johnson', 'Taylor Lautner, Marie Avgeropoulos, Adam Rayner, Rafi Gavron, Sam Medina, Luciano Acuna Jr., Johnny M. Wu, Wai Ching Ho', 'PG-13', 'Wanted by the mafia, a New York City bike messenger escapes into the world of parkour after meeting a beautiful stranger.', 'Wanted by the mafia, a New York City bike messenger escapes into the world of parkour after meeting a beautiful stranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2XoazCkD4gRlqkJK7q6TOTUx1ta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290764'),
  ('514986639050923494', 'Traces of Love', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'Pedro Antônio, Pedro Faerstein, Zaga Martelletto', 'Luanna Guimarães, Alvaro Campos, Pedro Antônio', 'Fábio Porchat, Sandy, Evelyn Castro, Larissa Luz, Samya Pascotto, Norma Blum, Augusto Zacchi, Fernanda Paes Leme', null, 'On a random night, Marco and Laura meet at a karaoke bar and sing the song "Evidências" together. Since then, they fell in love and formed a couple that seemed perfect, until the moment they said “yes”. Without understanding what happened, now, every time this song plays, Marco will travel through his memories with Laura.', 'On a random night, Marco and Laura meet at a karaoke bar and sing the song "Evidências" together. Since then, they fell in love and formed a couple that seemed perfect, until the moment they said “yes”. Without understanding what happened, now, every time this song plays, Marco will travel through his memories with Laura.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrMYACPK3t6EWlUAydK1wOYlxsh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1109778'),
  ('27511514178405550', 'Traces of Red', 1992, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Andy Wolk, Tim Suhrstedt', 'Jim Piddock', 'Jim Belushi, Lorraine Bracco, Tony Goldwyn, William Russ, Faye Grant, Jim Piddock, Michelle Joyner, Ed Amatrudo', 'R', 'Jack, a Palm Beach detective, becomes involved in a case of multiple murders. All the women can be linked to Jack in some way. Jack and his partner have no leads, but numerous suspects. The murders continue, along with anonymous letters from the killer.', 'Jack, a Palm Beach detective, becomes involved in a case of multiple murders. All the women can be linked to Jack in some way. Jack and his partner have no leads, but numerous suspects. The murders continue, along with anonymous letters from the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVXINR2g71f6qvWKwsdbe9bBkMr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103299'),
  ('643842862589338404', 'Traces of Sin', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Kei Ishikawa, Hirofumi Kawaguchi', 'Kosuke Mukai', 'Satoshi Tsumabuki, Hikari Mitsushima, Keisuke Koide, Asami Usuda, Yui Ichikawa, Tomoya Nakamura, Wakana Matsumoto, Hidekazu Mashima', null, 'Tanaka is going through a tough time trying to support his younger sister Mitsuko, recently arrested and hold up in jail. As an investigative reporter, he immerses himself into a story about a shocking murder case gone cold; a family was brutally murdered a year ago and the case remains unsolved.', 'Tanaka is going through a tough time trying to support his younger sister Mitsuko, recently arrested and hold up in jail. As an investigative reporter, he immerses himself into a story about a shocking murder case gone cold; a family was brutally murdered a year ago and the case remains unsolved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fp4Rmt5bJHlpEuGyVCLTpTFDYcn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412692'),
  ('287552240813136116', 'Tracing Jake', 2004, 'Animation', 'Koji Yamamura, Isshin Inudo', 'Isshin Inudo', 'Ren Osugi, Jun Murakami, Mikako Ichikawa, Shinya Tsukamoto, Susumu Terajima, Mari Hoshino, Reiko Kataoka, Atsushi Ito', null, 'Inuyama is intrigued by the existence of "Jake," a mysterious crocodile that has been sighted in many countries around the world. He continues to travel around the world, listening to the testimonies of various people of different ages, nationalities, and sighting situations who have seen "Jake".', 'Inuyama is intrigued by the existence of "Jake," a mysterious crocodile that has been sighted in many countries around the world. He continues to travel around the world, listening to the testimonies of various people of different ages, nationalities, and sighting situations who have seen "Jake".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWOEqRv7lmXCNgrs5O3xLPtpTL5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319168'),
  ('725078401614473545', 'Tracing Shadow', 2009, 'Action, Comedy', 'Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Marco Mak Chi-Sin', 'Wei Junzi', 'Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Pace Wu Pui-Tsi, Xie Na, Jaycee Chan, Dang Haoyu, Ma Jing, Du Yiheng, He Gang', null, 'Five kung-fu masters from different regions are fighting ruthlessly for a mysterious treasure map inside the Ming Palace; while they are all tangled in wild combat, the precious map unexpectedly disappears.', 'Five kung-fu masters from different regions are fighting ruthlessly for a mysterious treasure map inside the Ming Palace; while they are all tangled in wild combat, the precious map unexpectedly disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t752jP6OaByZUJIl9otseE1yHJs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26582'),
  ('891911647149223258', 'Track 29', 1988, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Nicolas Roeg, Alex Thomson', 'Dennis Potter', 'Theresa Russell, Gary Oldman, Christopher Lloyd, Colleen Camp, Sandra Bernhard, Seymour Cassel, Leon Rippy, Vance Colvig', 'R', 'Years after a desperate teenage Linda gives up her baby for adoption, she finds herself face-to-face with Martin, a young man claiming to be her long-lost son. Linda embraces Martin and in him finds a welcome reprieve from her unhappy marriage to the neglectful Henry. But soon Martin grows violent and becomes obsessed with Henry -- a philandering man whose only offspring is an expansive model train set that devours his waking hours.', 'Years after a desperate teenage Linda gives up her baby for adoption, she finds herself face-to-face with Martin, a young man claiming to be her long-lost son. Linda embraces Martin and in him finds a welcome reprieve from her unhappy marriage to the neglectful Henry. But soon Martin grows violent and becomes obsessed with Henry -- a philandering man whose only offspring is an expansive model train set that devours his waking hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cix86lEZ6vXMj5Pzy0huF4nfRyH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41974'),
  ('1119120715774970163', 'Track of the Cat', 1954, 'Drama, Western', 'William A. Wellman, William H. Clothier, Andrew V. McLaglen', 'A.I. Bezzerides', 'Robert Mitchum, Diana Lynn, Tab Hunter, Teresa Wright, Beulah Bondi, Philip Tonge, William Hopper, Carl Switzer', 'NR', 'A family saga: In a stunning mountain valley ranch setting near Aspen, complex and dangerous family dynamics play out against the backdrop of the first big snowstorm of winter and an enormous panther with seemingly mythical qualities which is killing cattle.', 'A family saga: In a stunning mountain valley ranch setting near Aspen, complex and dangerous family dynamics play out against the backdrop of the first big snowstorm of winter and an enormous panther with seemingly mythical qualities which is killing cattle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRIbBdsERc0yGvHWc5aM81Eyn6O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86608'),
  ('610850420832098768', 'Track of the Moon Beast', 1976, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Richard Ashe, R. Kent Evans', 'Bill Finger, Charles Sinclair', 'Chase Cordell, Leigh Drake, Gregorio Sala, Patrick Wright, Francine Kessler, Timothy Wayne Brown, Crawford MacCallum, Alan Swain', 'PG', 'Professor "Johnny Longbow" Salina, a man who really knows his stews, introduces Paul Carlson to the practical-joking Kathy Nolan. Paul and Kathy seem to hit it off rather well but, during a meteor storm, a meteorite fragment strikes Paul, burying itself deep in his skull, which has the unpleasant side-effect of causing Paul to mutate into a giant reptilian monster at night and go on murderous rampages. It turns out that this sort of thing has happened before, when Professor Salina rediscovers ancient Native American paintings detailing a similar event many centuries ago. Kathy, however, still loves Paul, and tries to save him.', 'Professor "Johnny Longbow" Salina, a man who really knows his stews, introduces Paul Carlson to the practical-joking Kathy Nolan. Paul and Kathy seem to hit it off rather well but, during a meteor storm, a meteorite fragment strikes Paul, burying itself deep in his skull, which has the unpleasant side-effect of causing Paul to mutate into a giant reptilian monster at night and go on murderous rampages. It turns out that this sort of thing has happened before, when Professor Salina rediscovers ancient Native American paintings detailing a similar event many centuries ago. Kathy, however, still loves Paul, and tries to save him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nB9N0WegYbEAEoSZKrHWv5RkuEY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31134'),
  ('403378256669491620', 'Tracker', 2010, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Adventure', 'Ian Sharp, Harvey Harrison', 'Nicolas Van Pallandt', 'Ray Winstone, Temuera Morrison, Andy Anderson, Gareth Reeves, Mark Mitchinson, Dan Musgrove, Tim McLachlan, Jed Brophy', 'R', 'A guerilla fighter from the South African Boer war called Arjan (Winstone) takes on a manhunt in New Zealand for Maori seaman Kereama (Morrison), who is accused of murdering a British soldier. What follows is a cat and mouse pursuit through the varied landscape of New Zealand with both hunter and huntee testing their bushcraft and wits against that of the other. Gradually they grow to know and respect one another but a posse, led by the British Commanding officer is close behind and his sole intention is to see the Maori hang.', 'A guerilla fighter from the South African Boer war called Arjan (Winstone) takes on a manhunt in New Zealand for Maori seaman Kereama (Morrison), who is accused of murdering a British soldier. What follows is a cat and mouse pursuit through the varied landscape of New Zealand with both hunter and huntee testing their bushcraft and wits against that of the other. Gradually they grow to know and respect one another but a posse, led by the British Commanding officer is close behind and his sole intention is to see the Maori hang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPPLs4SFP4Pk3SCJbQfhp9vtbL8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62255'),
  ('991197248653971446', 'Tracks', 1976, 'Drama', 'Henry Jaglom, Paul Glickman', 'Henry Jaglom', 'Dennis Hopper, Taryn Power, Dean Stockwell, Topo Swope, Alfred Ryder, Zack Norman, Michael Emil, Nate Esformes', 'R', 'A soldier returns from Vietnam on special assignment, accompanying the body of his friend by train to California for burial. During the trip, he falls in love with a gentle college student. But their relationship is shattered by his flashbacks to combat.', 'A soldier returns from Vietnam on special assignment, accompanying the body of his friend by train to California for burial. During the trip, he falls in love with a gentle college student. But their relationship is shattered by his flashbacks to combat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hzdbJS5WNMzCY7sV6qSmOaOT10.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108322'),
  ('464601499065662834', 'Tracks', 2013, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Mandy Walker, John Curran, Jason Ellson', 'Marion Nelson', 'Mia Wasikowska, Adam Driver, Emma Booth, Jessica Tovey, Lily Pearl, Robert Coleby, Bryan Probets, John Flaus', 'PG-13', 'Accompanied only by her faithful dog and four camels, an Australian satisfies her craving for solitude by embarking on a solo trip across the desert from Alice Springs to the Indian Ocean.', 'Accompanied only by her faithful dog and four camels, an Australian satisfies her craving for solitude by embarking on a solo trip across the desert from Alice Springs to the Indian Ocean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDSA80DC8BmBrErQsiL23qwoeCw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203819'),
  ('892877307840061283', 'Tractor Drivers', 1939, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Ivan Pyryev, Aleksandr Galperin, Vyacheslav Leshchyov', 'Evgeniy Pomeshchikov', 'Marina Ladynina, Nikolay Kryuchkov, Stepan Kayukov, Pyotr Aleynikov, Vladimir Kolchin, Olga Borovikova, Aleksey Dolinin, Pyotr Savin', null, 'The story takes place in a Soviet placed in what is now Ukraine. A mechanic arrives in the Soviet, lead by a young independent woman driving tractors and, between many comedy sketches and propaganda mottoes, a love comes to light.', 'The story takes place in a Soviet placed in what is now Ukraine. A mechanic arrives in the Soviet, lead by a young independent woman driving tractors and, between many comedy sketches and propaganda mottoes, a love comes to light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Lqut7Lg73LsdSMRkzcuPwDslF6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292656'),
  ('603823254877498058', 'Trade', 2007, 'Thriller', 'Daniel Gottschalk, Marco Kreuzpaintner', 'Jose Rivera', 'Kevin Kline, Cesar Ramos, Paulina Gaitán, Alicja Bachleda-Curuś, Marco Pérez, Linda Emond, Zack Ward, Kate del Castillo', 'R', 'A Texas cop, whose own daughter might have been forced into sexual slavery, joins forces with a Mexican youth to find the boy''s sister, who was abducted and forced into prostitution. Meanwhile, a Polish woman who was promised a better life in America also becomes a victim.', 'A Texas cop, whose own daughter might have been forced into sexual slavery, joins forces with a Mexican youth to find the boy''s sister, who was abducted and forced into prostitution. Meanwhile, a Polish woman who was promised a better life in America also becomes a victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2ckiEGoYz2AomOeviEPqnhrw7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4170'),
  ('899844099950683670', 'Trade Tattoo', 1937, 'Animation', 'Len Lye', null, null, null, 'Trade Tattoo went even further than Rainbow Dance in its manipulation of the Gasparcolor process. The original black and white footage consisted of outtakes from GPO Film Unit documentaries such as Night Mail. Lye transformed this footage in what has been described as the most intricate job of film printing and color grading ever attempted. Animated words and patterns combine with the live-action footage to create images as complex and multi-layered as a Cubist painting. Music was provided by the Cuban Lecuona Band. With its dynamic rhythms, the film seeks (in Lye’s words) to convey “a romanticism about the work of the everyday in all walks of life."', 'Trade Tattoo went even further than Rainbow Dance in its manipulation of the Gasparcolor process. The original black and white footage consisted of outtakes from GPO Film Unit documentaries such as Night Mail. Lye transformed this footage in what has been described as the most intricate job of film printing and color grading ever attempted. Animated words and patterns combine with the live-action footage to create images as complex and multi-layered as a Cubist painting. Music was provided by the Cuban Lecuona Band. With its dynamic rhythms, the film seeks (in Lye’s words) to convey “a romanticism about the work of the everyday in all walks of life."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcnYXzBKDnhFGEicxmBCI04rZ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146211'),
  ('1111200480908900326', 'Traded', 2016, 'Western', 'Josh Tessier, Timothy Woodward Jr.', 'Mark Esslinger', 'Michael Paré, Trace Adkins, Kris Kristofferson, Tom Sizemore, Martin Kove, Constance Brenneman, Brittany Elizabeth Williams, Angelique Kenney', null, 'In the 1880s western "Traded", a father must leave his ranch for Dodge City to save his daughter from an old enemy, putting his reputation as the fastest draw in the west to the test.', 'In the 1880s western "Traded", a father must leave his ranch for Dodge City to save his daughter from an old enemy, putting his reputation as the fastest draw in the west to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUEX2vXWGnevzBD8NZQ3pBHfbio.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398265'),
  ('1110741608038613529', 'Trader Games', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Fabrice Genestal', 'Fabrice Genestal, Paul Besson', 'Gilles Lellouche, Vahina Giocante, Charles Berling, Michael Madsen, Lisa Ray, Joffrey Verbruggen, François Damiens, Qamar Khokhar', null, 'A hot young Wall Street trader finds a formula based on climatology to play the market and win big... but at what cost?', 'A hot young Wall Street trader finds a formula based on climatology to play the market and win big... but at what cost?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3s4Unebt8NIieVcO9rfznpe6IOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53389'),
  ('883273886898069846', 'Trader Horn', 1931, 'Action, Adventure', 'W.S. Van Dyke, Clyde De Vinna', 'Dale Van Every', 'Harry Carey, Edwina Booth, Duncan Renaldo, Mutia Omoolu, Olive Carey, C. Aubrey Smith, Riano Tindama', 'NR', 'While on safari in an unexplored area of Africa, Trader Horn and Peru find missionary Edith Trent killed by natives. They decide to carry on her quest for her lost daughter Nina. They find her as the queen of a particularly savage tribe, and try to bring her back to civilization.', 'While on safari in an unexplored area of Africa, Trader Horn and Peru find missionary Edith Trent killed by natives. They decide to carry on her quest for her lost daughter Nina. They find her as the queen of a particularly savage tribe, and try to bring her back to civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBzzjMMOXUKWglfGsSZDxIbavjk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84296'),
  ('758251768648338504', 'Trader Hornee', 1970, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Paul Hipp, Jonathan Lucas', 'David F. Friedman', 'Buddy Pantsari, Julie Conners, John Alderman, Luanne Roberts, Elizabeth Knowles, Fletcher Davies, Brainerd Duffield, Deek Sills', 'R', 'A private detective journeys to Africa to find a legenday white gorilla. The gorilla turns out to be an escaped Nazi war criminal.', 'A private detective journeys to Africa to find a legenday white gorilla. The gorilla turns out to be an escaped Nazi war criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFgW0NdNwriE54FIyPyoy8yNHAe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5776'),
  ('1087686497575395860', 'Trader Mickey', 1932, 'Animation, Comedy', 'David Hand', null, 'Walt Disney, Pinto Colvig', null, 'Mickey Mouse and Pluto are traveling up an African river with a cargo of goods (including several musical instruments). They hit land and are captured by cannibals who plan to eat them. As soon as Mickey starts playing on a saxophone, they all start jamming to "The Darktown Strutter''s Ball."', 'Mickey Mouse and Pluto are traveling up an African river with a cargo of goods (including several musical instruments). They hit land and are captured by cannibals who plan to eat them. As soon as Mickey starts playing on a saxophone, they all start jamming to "The Darktown Strutter''s Ball."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDvuFb9FzW1i7IuabzJ60dosxLC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156456'),
  ('926724737202948847', 'Trading Mom', 1994, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Buzz Feitshans IV, Tia Brelis', 'Tia Brelis', 'Sissy Spacek, Anna Chlumsky, Aaron Michael Metchik, Asher Metchik, Merritt Yohnka, André Roussimoff, Maureen Stapleton, Sean MacLaughlin', 'PG', 'The Martin kids learn of a magic spell that will take them to the ''mommy market'' so they can get a more user friendly model. After giving a few other moms a try, they want their own back. But that is not so easy.', 'The Martin kids learn of a magic spell that will take them to the ''mommy market'' so they can get a more user friendly model. After giving a few other moms a try, they want their own back. But that is not so easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/coR9bSS5xHts2fBLEou1X7XTkXi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41589'),
  ('900516900674983081', 'Trading Paint', 2019, 'Action, Drama', 'Karzan Kader, Allan Aguilar, Jeremy Phoenix', 'Craig R. Welch, Gary Gerani', 'John Travolta, Shania Twain, Michael Madsen, Margaret Bowman, Toby Sebastian, Jonathan Aidan Cockrell, Barry Corbin, Jen Baker', 'R', 'A stock car racing legend is drawn back to the dirt track when his son, an aspiring driver, joins a rival racing team.', 'A stock car racing legend is drawn back to the dirt track when his son, an aspiring driver, joins a rival racing team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yV9G1nO6YxEWzXblqMUFoS19R9v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474214'),
  ('457113240284142644', 'Trading Places', 1983, 'Comedy', 'John Landis, Robert Paynter, Linda Conaway-Parsloe', 'Timothy Harris, Herschel Weingrod', 'Dan Aykroyd, Eddie Murphy, Ralph Bellamy, Don Ameche, Denholm Elliott, Jamie Lee Curtis, Paul Gleason, Frank Oz', 'R', 'A snobbish investor and a wily street con-artist find their positions reversed as part of a bet by two callous millionaires.', 'A snobbish investor and a wily street con-artist find their positions reversed as part of a bet by two callous millionaires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mBuLCOcpWnmYtZc4aqtvDXslv6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1621'),
  ('140037534603868710', 'Traffic', 1998, 'Comedy', 'João Botelho, Olivier Guéneau', 'João Botelho', 'Joaquim Oliveira, Rita Blanco, Adriano Luz, Branca de Camargo, João Perry, Alexandra Lencastre, Maria Emília Correia, Canto e Castro', null, 'Young Jesus is taken on a vacation by his parents (Rita Blanco, Adriano Luz) to a deserted beach resort. They accidentally fall into overnight wealth after Jesus digs in the sand, uncovering a large drug stash. Others characters intersecting here include an alcoholic actress, a philandering banker, a general trafficking in arms, priests who close their church and head north as hitchhikers, politicians who watch an all-girl production of Julius Caesar, and beggars who recite a children''s story in a huge heap of trash.', 'Young Jesus is taken on a vacation by his parents (Rita Blanco, Adriano Luz) to a deserted beach resort. They accidentally fall into overnight wealth after Jesus digs in the sand, uncovering a large drug stash. Others characters intersecting here include an alcoholic actress, a philandering banker, a general trafficking in arms, priests who close their church and head north as hitchhikers, politicians who watch an all-girl production of Julius Caesar, and beggars who recite a children''s story in a huge heap of trash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmoVssSo5rZ1dA7Ex7eVJGrJej2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50118'),
  ('999729136624431262', 'Traffic', 2000, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Steven Soderbergh, Steven Soderbergh, Blair Huizingh', 'Simon Moore', 'Michael Douglas, Benicio del Toro, Catherine Zeta-Jones, Erika Christensen, Don Cheadle, Jacob Vargas, Miguel Ferrer, Luis Guzmán', 'R', 'An exploration of the United States of America''s war on drugs from multiple perspectives. For the new head of the Office of National Drug Control Policy, the war becomes personal when he discovers his well-educated daughter is abusing cocaine within their comfortable suburban home. In Mexico, a flawed, but noble policeman agrees to testify against a powerful general in league with a cartel, and in San Diego, a drug kingpin''s sheltered trophy wife must learn her husband''s ruthless business after he is arrested, endangering her luxurious lifestyle.', 'An exploration of the United States of America''s war on drugs from multiple perspectives. For the new head of the Office of National Drug Control Policy, the war becomes personal when he discovers his well-educated daughter is abusing cocaine within their comfortable suburban home. In Mexico, a flawed, but noble policeman agrees to testify against a powerful general in league with a cartel, and in San Diego, a drug kingpin''s sheltered trophy wife must learn her husband''s ruthless business after he is arrested, endangering her luxurious lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbccmnqE4oAPI67bApgt2JiRPz8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1900'),
  ('11579736724579101', 'Traffic', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Rajesh Pillai, Santosh Thundiyil, Subodh Desai', 'Bobby', 'Manoj Bajpayee, Jimmy Shergill, Divya Dutta, Parambrata Chatterjee, Prosenjit Chatterjee, Sachin Khedekar, Kitu Gidwani, Nikita Thukral', null, 'An emotional thriller based on a road trip from Mumbai to Pune. Inspired from the real events that happened in Chennai.', 'An emotional thriller based on a road trip from Mumbai to Pune. Inspired from the real events that happened in Chennai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmufUYUXRapulEBNyn744oejb0A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396488'),
  ('856898673518741326', 'Traffic Cop Varvara', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Omiros Efstratiadis', 'Giannis Sklavos', 'Giannis Gionakis, Stathis Psaltis, Jenny Zaharopoulou, Mari Karavia, Maria Andrioti, Makis Demiris, Lefteris Giftopoulos, Mimis Fotopoulos', null, 'Much to his surprise and not a moment too soon, the young long-term unemployed, Achilleas Taleporos, realises that his striking resemblance to his twin sister and traffic officer, Varvara, will finally land him a steady job, provided that he went the extra mile to succeed. Suddenly, his sister''s uniform, a pair of black almond-toe pumps, a flaxen wig and a little bit of make-up will open the doors to the Police Academy, where "Varvara", amidst an all-female class, gets a rigorous training. But, now that the new recruit in disguise is finally accepted, what are the chances of finding true love in the most unusual of places?', 'Much to his surprise and not a moment too soon, the young long-term unemployed, Achilleas Taleporos, realises that his striking resemblance to his twin sister and traffic officer, Varvara, will finally land him a steady job, provided that he went the extra mile to succeed. Suddenly, his sister''s uniform, a pair of black almond-toe pumps, a flaxen wig and a little bit of make-up will open the doors to the Police Academy, where "Varvara", amidst an all-female class, gets a rigorous training. But, now that the new recruit in disguise is finally accepted, what are the chances of finding true love in the most unusual of places?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhmtKbV1IejTnbvINBQ48LHXap1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:545133'),
  ('908742354895442415', 'Traffic Crossing Leeds Bridge', 1888, 'Documentary', 'Louis Aimé Augustin Le Prince', null, null, null, 'A film by Louis Aimé Augustin Le Prince, shot in late October 1888, showing pedestrians and carriages crossing Leeds Bridge.', 'A film by Louis Aimé Augustin Le Prince, shot in late October 1888, showing pedestrians and carriages crossing Leeds Bridge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cw7uvqK3orqVUlULmA8OfkecMRY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16464'),
  ('1043409851829618083', 'Traffic Department', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'Piotr Sobociński Jr., Wojtek Smarzowski', 'Wojtek Smarzowski', 'Bartłomiej Topa, Arkadiusz Jakubik, Julia Kijowska, Robert Wabich, Eryk Lubos, Jacek Braciak, Marcin Dorociński, Marian Dziędziel', null, 'Seven policemen, seven deadly sins, a murder case, secrets and the filth of everyday police work: Traffic Department transports the viewer into the darkest Warsaw streets.', 'Seven policemen, seven deadly sins, a murder case, secrets and the filth of everyday police work: Traffic Department transports the viewer into the darkest Warsaw streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNULbWYSYVqAISvJJmcCbb7uQGn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167179'),
  ('612788554252592774', 'Traffic Jam', 1979, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ricky Tognazzi, Luigi Comencini, Angelo Filippini', 'Ruggero Maccari, Bernardino Zapponi, Luigi Comencini', 'Alberto Sordi, Annie Girardot, Fernando Rey, Patrick Dewaere, Ángela Molina, Harry Baer, Marcello Mastroianni, Stefania Sandrelli', null, 'A tremendous congestion hits the Rome highway ring. The biggest traffic jam ever seen lasts more than 36 hours. At the beginning the people blocked in their cars react normally. But as more time passes, the more we witness personal dramas, hysteric reactions and other grotesque situations. All the episodes are linked as if in a single plot. Cars and their hosts are a microcosm of stories part of a larger universe: the congestion.', 'A tremendous congestion hits the Rome highway ring. The biggest traffic jam ever seen lasts more than 36 hours. At the beginning the people blocked in their cars react normally. But as more time passes, the more we witness personal dramas, hysteric reactions and other grotesque situations. All the episodes are linked as if in a single plot. Cars and their hosts are a microcosm of stories part of a larger universe: the congestion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHIHwdcYy2cdb1aveOgaMecZ5dw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74080'),
  ('884846135585615062', 'Traffic Officer', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eldor Urazbaev, Mikhail Rogovoy, Leonard Bukhov', 'Aleksandr Borodyanskiy', 'Sergey Nikonenko, Nikita Mikhalkov, Oleg Efremov, Raisa Ryazanova, Marina Levtova, Nikolai Parfyonov, Viktor Ilichyov, Yuriy Kuzmenkov', null, 'A comic drama about a permanently going duel between Traffic Officer and powerful businessman.', 'A comic drama about a permanently going duel between Traffic Officer and powerful businessman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZGWNiFEa1zzF5i9h19WA9Slhac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191098'),
  ('418668239413032057', 'Traffic Signal', 2007, 'Drama', 'Madhur Bhandarkar', 'Sachin Yardi', 'Kunal Khemu, Neetu Chandra, Konkona Sen Sharma, Ranvir Shorey, Upendra Limaye, Sudhir Mishra, Nassar Abdulla', null, 'Silsila is the "manager" of one traffic signal, that is he collects the "hafta" (protection tax) from each signal squatter plying his trade. There''s Tsunami, a little scavenger boy, there''s Rani - a Gujrati girl selling ethnic clothes on the sidewalk, and there''s Dominic - a drug addict and the prostitute who feels for him...', 'Silsila is the "manager" of one traffic signal, that is he collects the "hafta" (protection tax) from each signal squatter plying his trade. There''s Tsunami, a little scavenger boy, there''s Rani - a Gujrati girl selling ethnic clothes on the sidewalk, and there''s Dominic - a drug addict and the prostitute who feels for him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xA7cF9oz6JWYrEJXCIsstG1f0z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46426'),
  ('139877781751939980', 'Traffic Troubles', 1931, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Burt Gillett', null, null, null, 'Mickey is driving a taxi. His first fare is a very large gentleman. Mickey stops traffic and gets a tongue-lashing from the officer. The cab runs into some bad road, bounces the fare down to almost nothing, then bounces the customer right out of the cab. Mickey pulls up to the curb and picks up his second passenger, Minnie. She plays her accordion while they ride. The cab gets a flat tire, and Mickey uses a pig to pump it up.', 'Mickey is driving a taxi. His first fare is a very large gentleman. Mickey stops traffic and gets a tongue-lashing from the officer. The cab runs into some bad road, bounces the fare down to almost nothing, then bounces the customer right out of the cab. Mickey pulls up to the curb and picks up his second passenger, Minnie. She plays her accordion while they ride. The cab gets a flat tire, and Mickey uses a pig to pump it up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLiX2VmVxxIKTE3veBQgQHt6sxO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162285'),
