  ('789017225524648042', 'Tragic Jungle', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Yulene Olaizola, Sofia Oggioni', 'Yulene Olaizola, Rubén Imaz', 'Indira Andrewin, Gilberto Barraza, Mariano Tun Xool, Gabino Rodríguez, Eligio Meléndez, Eliseo Mancilla de la Cruz, Dale Carley, Shantai Obispo', 'NR', 'Deep in the jungle, a group of Mexican gum workers crosses their path with Agnes, a mysterious Belizean woman. Her presence enlivens the fantasies and desires of those men, without knowing that they have woken up an ancient Mayan legend.', 'Deep in the jungle, a group of Mexican gum workers crosses their path with Agnes, a mysterious Belizean woman. Her presence enlivens the fantasies and desires of those men, without knowing that they have woken up an ancient Mayan legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZVuB2IhHTBo7LTGTPs0Pzfb6H8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618746'),
