  ('1077342434598318729', 'Trail Mix-Up', 1993, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Barry Cook', null, 'Charles Fleischer, Kathleen Turner, April Winchell, Lou Hirsch, Corey Burton, Frank Welker', 'G', 'During a picnic, Baby Herman follows a beaver into a perilous sawmill - with Roger Rabbit in frantic pursuit.', 'During a picnic, Baby Herman follows a beaver into a perilous sawmill - with Roger Rabbit in frantic pursuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4OSOn1sAZekhPzJrgmidXOOAUH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83203'),
  ('561638107963861328', 'Trail of the Falcon', 1968, 'Drama, Western, Adventure', 'Gottfried Kolditz, Otto Hanisch, Eva Seemann', 'Günter Karl', 'Gojko Mitić, Hannjo Hasse, Barbara Brylska, Lali Meskhi, Rolf Hoppe, Hartmut Beer, Helmut Schreiber, Fred Delmare', null, 'In the latter half of the 19th century, gold is discovered in the Black Hills, sacred land of the Lakota people. Gold diggers, profiteers and adventurers flock to the region. Among them is the hard-hearted land speculator Bludgeon, who tries to expel the Lakota using brutal methods. Lakota warriors retaliate, and soon the gold diggers'' town becomes a battlefield.', 'In the latter half of the 19th century, gold is discovered in the Black Hills, sacred land of the Lakota people. Gold diggers, profiteers and adventurers flock to the region. Among them is the hard-hearted land speculator Bludgeon, who tries to expel the Lakota using brutal methods. Lakota warriors retaliate, and soon the gold diggers'' town becomes a battlefield.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m623vnBmpwL1lYtT3QAFdEP9XJX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3545'),
  ('1135278634676438974', 'Trail of the Panda', 2009, 'Family', 'Yu Zhong', 'Jennifer L. Liu', 'Daichi Harashima, Li Feng, Ke Jian Qi, Yu Zhong', null, 'From the Disney World Cinema Collection, Trail of the Panda is a heart-warming story about enduring friendship between a boy and a panda cub.', 'From the Disney World Cinema Collection, Trail of the Panda is a heart-warming story about enduring friendship between a boy and a panda cub.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGX5e2TVFje9sW6QvC8pcfQG7Z1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146650'),
  ('61929992551953353', 'Trail of the Pink Panther', 1982, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Blake Edwards, Dick Bush', 'Blake Edwards, Geoffrey Edwards, Tom Waldman', 'David Niven, Peter Sellers, Capucine, Herbert Lom, Richard Mulligan, Joanna Lumley, Julie Andrews, Robert Loggia', 'PG', 'The Pink Panther diamond is stolen once again from Lugash and the authorities call in Chief Inspector Clouseau from France. His plane disappears en-route. This time, famous French TV reporter Marie Jouvet sets out to solve the mystery and starts to interview everybody connected to Clouseau.', 'The Pink Panther diamond is stolen once again from Lugash and the authorities call in Chief Inspector Clouseau from France. His plane disappears en-route. This time, famous French TV reporter Marie Jouvet sets out to solve the mystery and starts to interview everybody connected to Clouseau.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2Gv4I8CN28aflcqecPgb0NKh63.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9699'),
  ('196694276792465109', 'Trail Street', 1947, 'Western', 'Ray Enright, J. Roy Hunt, Grayson Rogers', 'Gene Lewis, Norman Houston', 'Randolph Scott, Robert Ryan, Anne Jeffreys, George ''Gabby'' Hayes, Madge Meredith, Steve Brodie, Billy House, Virginia Sale', 'NR', 'Bat Masterson''s old friend Billy Burns convinces him to become marshal of Liberal, Kansas and help the residents fight drought and a destructive range war.', 'Bat Masterson''s old friend Billy Burns convinces him to become marshal of Liberal, Kansas and help the residents fight drought and a destructive range war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/puIU4XkKi6qVh58HTjjDMUzmkUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103422'),
  ('312161057368779596', 'Trailer for a Remake of Gore Vidal''s Caligula', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Francesco Vezzoli', 'Gore Vidal', 'Milla Jovovich, Helen Mirren, Gerard Butler, Benicio del Toro, Barbara Bouchet, Karen Black, Gore Vidal, Michelle Phillips', null, 'This is a short film based on the 1979 film of the same name. The film is stylized with the actors wearing modernized robes and Roman jewelry and females playing male characters and vice-versa.', 'This is a short film based on the 1979 film of the same name. The film is stylized with the actors wearing modernized robes and Roman jewelry and females playing male characters and vice-versa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYmwDM6Jvp9uP71adAmfIsY8kVH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308783'),
  ('559498486223466222', 'Trailer Horn', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, James MacDonald, Dessie Flynn', 'G', 'Donald and the chipmunks, Chip and Dale, are after each other again, this time when they come upon Donald vacationing in a trailer. When he goes swimming, they fool him by moving the diving board and end up wrecking his car.', 'Donald and the chipmunks, Chip and Dale, are after each other again, this time when they come upon Donald vacationing in a trailer. When he goes swimming, they fool him by moving the diving board and end up wrecking his car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69KiQCPavpFD78t8tfm7DWDvrt4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67698'),
  ('22909124582171538', 'Trailer of a Film That Will Never Exist: Phony Wars', 2023, null, 'Fabrice Aragno, Jean-Luc Godard', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Jean-Paul Battaggia, Nicole Brenez', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Jean-Paul Battaggia', null, 'Rejecting the billions of alphabetic diktats to liberate the incessant metamorphoses and metaphors of a necessary and true language by re-turning to the locations of past film shoots, while keeping track of modern times.', 'Rejecting the billions of alphabetic diktats to liberate the incessant metamorphoses and metaphors of a necessary and true language by re-turning to the locations of past film shoots, while keeping track of modern times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtryd4dechwVs9fsMWUTZmm7MAj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1065727'),
  ('51691374425050537', 'Tráiler para amantes de lo prohibido!', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Rafael Moleón, Pedro Almodóvar', 'Pedro Almodóvar', 'Josele Román, Bibiana Fernández, Sonia Hohmann, Carmen Espada, Poch, Ángel Alcázar, Chus Lampreave, Charo López', null, 'Abandoned by her husband, a woman takes to the streets in search of money to feed her children. (Promotional short for the film What Have I Done to Deserve This?, directed by Pedro Almodóvar.)', 'Abandoned by her husband, a woman takes to the streets in search of money to feed her children. (Promotional short for the film What Have I Done to Deserve This?, directed by Pedro Almodóvar.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iICFw1J0JSvEboAZDXqCSxP3tPc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108451'),
  ('744346886044576920', 'Trailer Park Boys', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Mike Clattenburg', 'John Paul Tremblay, Robb Wells, Mike Clattenburg', 'John Paul Tremblay, Robb Wells, Lucy Decoutere, Jeanna Harrison, John Dunsworth, Patrick Roach, Michael Jackson, Cory Bowles', null, 'After a psychic predicts his death, a small-time hoodlum named Julian hires a cheap documentary film crew to document the last few days of his mis-spent life. This is the film that pioneered the show of the same name.', 'After a psychic predicts his death, a small-time hoodlum named Julian hires a cheap documentary film crew to document the last few days of his mis-spent life. This is the film that pioneered the show of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sB2JGcgznErnf9lCm8cZjhV2W4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38674'),
  ('8481680561730186', 'Trailer Park Boys: Countdown to Liquor Day', 2009, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Mike Clattenburg, Rob Cotterill, Lara Cassidy', 'John Paul Tremblay, Timm Hannebohm, Robb Wells', 'John Paul Tremblay, Robb Wells, Mike Smith, John Dunsworth, Lucy Decoutere, Patrick Roach, Jonathan Torrens, Sarah Dunsworth', 'R', 'Ricky, Julian and Bubbles are about to get out of jail, and this time, Julian vows to go straight, even open a legit business. Soon the Boys will all be rich. At least that''s what they''ve told the parole board. But when they arrive back at the park, they find it''s not the same old Sunnyvale - and it''s not the same old Jim Lahey, Trailer Park Supervisor.', 'Ricky, Julian and Bubbles are about to get out of jail, and this time, Julian vows to go straight, even open a legit business. Soon the Boys will all be rich. At least that''s what they''ve told the parole board. But when they arrive back at the park, they find it''s not the same old Sunnyvale - and it''s not the same old Jim Lahey, Trailer Park Supervisor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Lah6OK2sOPuJc5NsUc443PrHE4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27561'),
  ('1090073182064592045', 'Trailer Park Boys: Don''t Legalize It', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Mike Clattenburg', 'Mike Clattenburg', 'John Paul Tremblay, Robb Wells, Mike Smith, John Dunsworth, Patrick Roach, Jonathan Torrens, Sarah Dunsworth, Lucy Decoutere', 'NR', 'Out of jail and broke, Julian concocts an outrageously greasy scheme to get rich and, to make it even greasier, he will have to deliver his product to his arch-enemy, Cyrus, who’s waiting in Montreal to close the dirty deal. Meanwhile, Ricky’s dope growing business is under a major threat when the government announces a plan to legalize marijuana. Bubbles reluctantly joins them on his own quest to claim an inheritance left to him by his long-lost parents.', 'Out of jail and broke, Julian concocts an outrageously greasy scheme to get rich and, to make it even greasier, he will have to deliver his product to his arch-enemy, Cyrus, who’s waiting in Montreal to close the dirty deal. Meanwhile, Ricky’s dope growing business is under a major threat when the government announces a plan to legalize marijuana. Bubbles reluctantly joins them on his own quest to claim an inheritance left to him by his long-lost parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDuumBFDh8Pz3OyuGycw3Hu9rHh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257451'),
  ('322074773277190705', 'Trailer Park Boys: Say Goodnight to the Bad Guys', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Mike Clattenburg, Rob Cotterill, Rob Cotterill', 'Mike Clattenburg, Timm Hannebohm', 'John Paul Tremblay, Robb Wells, Mike Smith, John Dunsworth, Patrick Roach, Lucy Decoutere, Sarah Dunsworth, Barrie Dunn', 'R', '"Say goodnight to the bad guys" picks up where "A Sh*t river runs through it" left off. it''s a year after the events of A.S.R.R.T.I and Ricky, Julian, and bubbles are rich with cash, but Julian sits on the money for a year claiming "movies like casino prove that waving money around right away is a bad idea." and then hides it in his newly purchased Delorean (AKA car from back to the future)', '"Say goodnight to the bad guys" picks up where "A Sh*t river runs through it" left off. it''s a year after the events of A.S.R.R.T.I and Ricky, Julian, and bubbles are rich with cash, but Julian sits on the money for a year claiming "movies like casino prove that waving money around right away is a bad idea." and then hides it in his newly purchased Delorean (AKA car from back to the future)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nznQFidJnm9SBMs5MMaQ1APG9Fl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26461'),
  ('140240833603980403', 'Trailer Park Boys: The Movie', 2006, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Mike Clattenburg, Mirosław Baszak, Rob Cotterill', 'Mike Clattenburg, Robb Wells', 'Robb Wells, John Paul Tremblay, Mike Smith, John Dunsworth, Patrick Roach, Lucy Decoutere, Sarah Dunsworth, Lydia Lawson-Baird', 'R', 'The boys get arrested for robbing an ATM machine and spend 18 months in jail, upon release they decide to pull off "The Big Dirty", a plan to steal a large amount of coins because they are untraceable and quit their life of crime forever.', 'The boys get arrested for robbing an ATM machine and spend 18 months in jail, upon release they decide to pull off "The Big Dirty", a plan to steal a large amount of coins because they are untraceable and quit their life of crime forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBmoxMfxxIepgpoByFr78ygnjrZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9958'),
  ('594470682707706593', 'Trailer Park of Terror', 2008, 'Horror', 'Steven Goldmann, Jeff Venditti', 'Timothy Dolan', 'Nichole Hiltz, Lew Temple, Jeanette Brox, Myk Watford, Michelle Lee, Ed Corbin, Ricky Mabe, Cody McMains', 'R', 'Six troubled high school students and their chaperon, an optimistic youth ministries Pastor, return from an outdoor character building retreat in the mountains. During a raging storm, their bus crashes, hopelessly stranding them in the middle of the Trucker''s Triangle, a forgotten locus of consummate evil in the middle of nowhere.', 'Six troubled high school students and their chaperon, an optimistic youth ministries Pastor, return from an outdoor character building retreat in the mountains. During a raging storm, their bus crashes, hopelessly stranding them in the middle of the Trucker''s Triangle, a forgotten locus of consummate evil in the middle of nowhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wipDrSAa6xXLGREzZBfyLauFxq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20016'),
  ('260358988256634159', 'Trails', 1978, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'João César Monteiro, Acácio de Almeida', 'Carlos D''Oliveira, Carlos de Oliveira, José Gomes Ferreira', 'Carmen Duarte, Manuela de Freitas, Virgilio Branco, Luís de Sousa Costa, Francisco Domingues, Margarida Gil, Sílvia Gomes Ferreira, João Guedes', null, 'Parallel tales of young couples desperately escaping cruel false fathers, each couple on the run across different regions of the country and during increasingly contemporary time periods.', 'Parallel tales of young couples desperately escaping cruel false fathers, each couple on the run across different regions of the country and during increasingly contemporary time periods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kYHmiIgR46Ka7k0nwd9g57k8d8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83230'),
  ('630600964551571248', 'Train', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Martina Radwan, Gideon Raff', 'Gideon Raff', 'Thora Birch, Gideon Emery, Gloria Votsis, Derek Magyar, Todd Jensen, Mike Straub, Matthew Tibbs, Ivan Barnev', 'R', 'After a night of wild partying and missing their train, the group of students is invited to board another which happens to be heading their way. Once on board, members of the team begin to go missing, and their would-be saviors claim to have no idea what could have happened to them... When they discover the truth, it is too late to escape and they must fight for their lives against their captors to put an end to their ride to hell.', 'After a night of wild partying and missing their train, the group of students is invited to board another which happens to be heading their way. Once on board, members of the team begin to go missing, and their would-be saviors claim to have no idea what could have happened to them... When they discover the truth, it is too late to escape and they must fight for their lives against their captors to put an end to their ride to hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inKMwh99qmVlMaO0spQ11DH2HdC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22007'),
  ('314146493017762374', 'Train Again', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Peter Tscherkassky', 'Peter Tscherkassky', null, null, 'Peter Tscherkassky condenses the long history of railways in the movies into a rousing blast for the senses in a heartfelt tribute to another legend of experimental cinema Kurt Kren.', 'Peter Tscherkassky condenses the long history of railways in the movies into a rousing blast for the senses in a heartfelt tribute to another legend of experimental cinema Kurt Kren.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPDnghlYepaui4TMRXiiB7mLXZA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838152'),
  ('829766169109379439', 'Train Birds', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Peter Lichtefeld, Frank Griebe', 'Peter Lichtefeld', 'Joachim Król, Outi Mäenpää, Peter Lohmeyer, Jochen Nickel, Nina Petri, Charlie Hendricks, Johannes Herrschmann, Dagmar Sachse', null, 'Hannes is a beer truck driver in Dortmund. His biggest dream is to win the first prize at the International Timetable Contest in Inari (Finland). When his new boss cancels his extra holidays to go there, Hans goes mad… On his journey to Finland by train, followed by the police, he meets lot of folks and the love of his life.', 'Hannes is a beer truck driver in Dortmund. His biggest dream is to win the first prize at the International Timetable Contest in Inari (Finland). When his new boss cancels his extra holidays to go there, Hans goes mad… On his journey to Finland by train, followed by the police, he meets lot of folks and the love of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muDWaAemVZzl4F4fpvwdKGDafus.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743'),
  ('666200180613668165', 'Train Dreams', 2025, 'Drama', 'Clint Bentley, Adolpho Veloso, Cédric Chabloz', 'Clint Bentley, Greg Kwedar', 'Joel Edgerton, Felicity Jones, Nathaniel Arcand, Clifton Collins Jr., John Diehl, Paul Schneider, Kerry Condon, William H. Macy', 'PG-13', 'A logger leads a life of quiet grace as he experiences love and loss during an era of monumental change in early 20th-century America.', 'A logger leads a life of quiet grace as he experiences love and loss during an era of monumental change in early 20th-century America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHTNNQzoWUUnswz8F0bwZetEKgj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1241983'),
  ('1063803328889474862', 'Train for Hollywood', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Radosław Piwowarski, Jerzy Matula', 'Radosław Piwowarski', 'Katarzyna Figura, Piotr Siwkiewicz, Rafał Węgrzyniak, Jerzy Stuhr, Eugeniusz Priwieziencew, Krystyna Feldman, Barbara Grochmalska, Józef Lipski', null, 'A young woman is bitten by the acting bug after seeing Marilyn Monroe in "Some Like It Hot". She patterns herself after MM and after finishing high school goes for screen tests to the Film Academy. Rejected because of her crooked teeth she takes a job of selling beer on a train and starts writing to Billy Wilder, trying to be casted in his next movie. At the trains station she meets a would-be cinematographer who is color blind. They become friends sharing their dreams of going to Hollywood. One day she finds a goldfish trapped in a beer bottle: she sets her free and makes three wishes, not for herself but for her friends. To her surprise all of them come true. As a reward she gets a long awaited call from Billy Wilder. Written by Polish Cinema Database', 'A young woman is bitten by the acting bug after seeing Marilyn Monroe in "Some Like It Hot". She patterns herself after MM and after finishing high school goes for screen tests to the Film Academy. Rejected because of her crooked teeth she takes a job of selling beer on a train and starts writing to Billy Wilder, trying to be casted in his next movie. At the trains station she meets a would-be cinematographer who is color blind. They become friends sharing their dreams of going to Hollywood. One day she finds a goldfish trapped in a beer bottle: she sets her free and makes three wishes, not for herself but for her friends. To her surprise all of them come true. As a reward she gets a long awaited call from Billy Wilder. Written by Polish Cinema Database', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLUxi14KnVQve30FvitSYChz5kr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146718'),
  ('1016057779414176418', 'Train From Romashkovo', 1967, 'Family, Animation', 'Vladimir Degtyarev, Mikhail Druyan', 'Gennadiy Tsyferov, Genrikh Sapgir', 'Klara Rumyanova, Garri Bardin, Anatoliy Papanov, Georgiy Vitsin, Mariya Vinogradova', null, 'A little train is always late.', 'A little train is always late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpSC2UmuYUqMyWxDFr9JQLQplpe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321096'),
  ('656640944785963734', 'Train in the Snow', 1976, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Mate Relja, Slavko Andreš, Tonka Duplančić', 'Mate Relja', 'Slavko Štimac, Gordana Inkret, Željko Malčić, Edo Peročević, Ratko Buljan, Antun Nalis, Branko Matić, Vojkan Pavlović', null, 'One class of school children from a small village make the trip to Zagreb. One of the boys gets sick and the class is forced to go home. During their journey the train gets stuck in a snowstorm.', 'One class of school children from a small village make the trip to Zagreb. One of the boys gets sick and the class is forced to go home. During their journey the train gets stuck in a snowstorm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/F2mpkkU12tQN4Qp3F0THgZ6cU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38817'),
  ('697264288738779482', 'Train Man', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Shosuke Murakami, Hideaki Murakami', 'Hitori Nakano', 'Takayuki Yamada, Miki Nakatani, Ryoko Kuninaka, Eita Nagayama, Kuranosuke Sasaki, Tae Kimura, Yoshinori Okada, Ren Osugi', null, 'The purportedly true story of a 23-year-old otaku (Japanese geek) who intervened when a drunk man was harassing a woman on a train. The otaku ultimately started dating with her and chronicled his event and his dates with the woman (who became known as "Hermès") on the Japanese mega-BBS 2channel.', 'The purportedly true story of a 23-year-old otaku (Japanese geek) who intervened when a drunk man was harassing a woman on a train. The otaku ultimately started dating with her and chronicled his event and his dates with the woman (who became known as "Hermès") on the Japanese mega-BBS 2channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggENax2S0G5QKxlKvj2pXsqPaGU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13299'),
  ('941268394024647850', 'Train of Events', 1949, 'Drama', 'Sidney Cole, Charles Crichton, Lionel Banes', 'Basil Dearden, Ronald Millar, Angus MacPhail', 'Jack Warner, Gladys Henson, Patric Doonan, Valerie Hobson, Joan Dowling, Olga Lindo, Susan Shaw, Philip Dale', null, 'A train disaster is told in four short stories to give character studies of the people involved, how it will affect them and how they deal with it.', 'A train disaster is told in four short stories to give character studies of the people involved, how it will affect them and how they deal with it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7JR9lljjQVoNUTTIrdJt6Uk0ed.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157330'),
  ('160341245659677004', 'Train of Life', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy, War', 'Radu Mihăileanu, Giorgos Arvanitis, Laurent Dailland', 'Radu Mihăileanu', 'Lionel Abelanski, Rufus, Clément Harari, Agathe de La Fontaine, Michel Muller, Johan Leysen, Bruno Abraham-Kremer, Gad Elmaleh', null, 'In 1941, the inhabitants of a small Jewish village in Central Europe organize a fake deportation train so that they can escape the Nazis and flee to Palestine.', 'In 1941, the inhabitants of a small Jewish village in Central Europe organize a fake deportation train so that they can escape the Nazis and flee to Palestine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/anUwgyVrC7kUwN5OliazbC5qBfr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8056'),
  ('465849324741765053', 'Train of Shadows', 1997, 'Drama', 'José Luis Guerín, Tomàs Pladevall', 'José Luis Guerín', 'Juliette Gautier, Ivon Orvain, Anne Céline Auche, Jessica Andrieu, Carles Romagosa, Lola Bessis, René Flory, Marc Montserrat', null, 'Experimental silent homage to the origins of cinema, recreating the apparent disappearance of a French photographer in the 1920s.', 'Experimental silent homage to the origins of cinema, recreating the apparent disappearance of a French photographer in the 1920s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bREFqgEzr0gRMuaegM4CQTmllPa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32934'),
  ('276751444678410365', 'Train of the Dead', 2007, 'Horror, Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Sukhum Mathawanit, Vichian Raungvichayakul', 'Sukhum Mathawanit', 'Khets Thunthup, Savika Chaiyadej, Sura Theerakon, Lakana Wattanawongsiri, Phoomjai Tangsanga, Warot Pitakanonda, Chaleumpol Tikumpornteerawong, Saowaluck Siriaran', null, 'Five teenagers on the run from police officers hide in a train carriage. However, its occupants are ghosts on their way to hell and they intend to take them along.', 'Five teenagers on the run from police officers hide in a train carriage. However, its occupants are ghosts on their way to hell and they intend to take them along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtITnVI1SAwQmbbsTzY70vwc4Rt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286570'),
  ('151344062084697457', 'Train Station Pickups', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Walter Boos', 'George Elmer', 'Katja Bienert, Marco Kröger, Benjamin Völz, Tobias Meister, Wolfgang Plumhoff, Dagmar von Thomas, Evelyn Gutkind-Bienert, Otto Retzer', null, 'A film about drug addiction and prostitution in Berlin that focuses exclusively on "show values" and mixes its completely implausible story with plot elements from relevant sex films. A lurid mixture of schoolgirl report and smear melodrama from the Karl Spiehs smithy.', 'A film about drug addiction and prostitution in Berlin that focuses exclusively on "show values" and mixes its completely implausible story with plot elements from relevant sex films. A lurid mixture of schoolgirl report and smear melodrama from the Karl Spiehs smithy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVinmpXCv9ts2brNQLuTciB7Imc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213992'),
  ('288568605205813496', 'Train to Busan', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller, Action, Adventure', 'Yeon Sang-ho, Lee Hyung-deok, Park Cheong-woo', 'Park Joo-suk', 'Gong Yoo, Kim Su-an, Jung Yu-mi, Don Lee, Choi Woo-shik, An So-hee, Kim Eui-sung, Ye Su-jeong', 'NR', 'When a zombie virus pushes Korea into a state of emergency, those trapped on an express train to Busan must fight for their own survival.', 'When a zombie virus pushes Korea into a state of emergency, those trapped on an express train to Busan must fight for their own survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNVFt6dtcqnI7hqa6LFBUibuFiw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396535'),
  ('779687574849505586', 'Trainer!', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Aljoscha Pause, Sebastian Uthoff', 'Aljoscha Pause', 'Frank Schmidt, André Schubert, Stephan Schmidt, Frank Wormuth, Jürgen Klopp, Hans Meyer, Armin Veh, Mirko Slomka', null, 'This behind-the-scenes sports documentary follows the careers of three young German professional soccer coaches over the course of a single season.', 'This behind-the-scenes sports documentary follows the careers of three young German professional soccer coaches over the course of a single season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1MuViw9h3LG4gBMg9GdQASuiw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199262'),
  ('242364256157725644', 'Training Day', 2001, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Antoine Fuqua, Don Wilkerson, Ime Etuk', 'David Ayer', 'Denzel Washington, Ethan Hawke, Scott Glenn, Tom Berenger, Harris Yulin, Raymond J. Barry, Cliff Curtis, Dr. Dre', 'R', 'On his first day on the job as a narcotics officer, a rookie cop works with a rogue detective who isn''t what he appears.', 'On his first day on the job as a narcotics officer, a rookie cop works with a rogue detective who isn''t what he appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUeiwBQdupBLQthMCHKV7zv56uv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2034'),
  ('121763726676210742', 'Training Wheels', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Régis Schuller, Eric Favela', 'Brett Hoffman', 'Pierre Coffin, Miranda Cosgrove, Elsie Fisher, Dana Gaier, Dave Rosenbaum, Régis Schuller, Steve Carell', 'G', 'When Margo, Edith, and Agnes chase after an ice cream truck, little Agnes struggles to keep up and takes a tumble while pedaling her bike. Seeing her disappointment, the Minions spring into action to lift her spirits. Using their quirky ingenuity, they construct a unicorn-themed motorcycle to help Agnes ride in style. With her new wheels, Agnes embarks on a whimsical and heartwarming ride through town, showcasing the Minions’ unwavering dedication to bringing joy to the girls’ lives. This short captures the charm of teamwork, creativity, and pure delight.', 'When Margo, Edith, and Agnes chase after an ice cream truck, little Agnes struggles to keep up and takes a tumble while pedaling her bike. Seeing her disappointment, the Minions spring into action to lift her spirits. Using their quirky ingenuity, they construct a unicorn-themed motorcycle to help Agnes ride in style. With her new wheels, Agnes embarks on a whimsical and heartwarming ride through town, showcasing the Minions’ unwavering dedication to bringing joy to the girls’ lives. This short captures the charm of teamwork, creativity, and pure delight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5irlpcx6tmpQ5sq42nojwICZrHN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229408'),
  ('606447505128762875', 'Trainspotting', 1996, 'Drama, Crime', 'Brian Tufano, Danny Boyle, Niki Longmuir', 'John Hodge', 'Ewan McGregor, Ewen Bremner, Jonny Lee Miller, Kevin McKidd, Robert Carlyle, Kelly Macdonald, Peter Mullan, James Cosmo', 'R', 'Heroin addict Mark Renton stumbles through bad ideas and sobriety attempts with his unreliable friends --Sick Boy, Begbie, Spud and Tommy. He also has an underage girlfriend, Diane, along for the ride. After cleaning up and moving from Edinburgh to London, Mark finds he can''t escape the life he left behind as Begbie and Sick Boy come knocking.', 'Heroin addict Mark Renton stumbles through bad ideas and sobriety attempts with his unreliable friends --Sick Boy, Begbie, Spud and Tommy. He also has an underage girlfriend, Diane, along for the ride. After cleaning up and moving from Edinburgh to London, Mark finds he can''t escape the life he left behind as Begbie and Sick Boy come knocking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0HmDV0bZDTtXWHqqYYbT9XoshB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:627'),
  ('460239986843046392', 'Trainwreck', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Amy Lauritsen, Matt Rebenkoff, Judd Apatow', 'Amy Schumer', 'Amy Schumer, Bill Hader, Brie Larson, LeBron James, Colin Quinn, Mike Birbiglia, Evan Brinkman, John Cena', 'R', 'Ever since her father drilled into her head that monogamy isn''t realistic, magazine writer Amy has made promiscuity her credo. As much as she enjoys an uninhibited life free of commitment, Amy is really in a rut. While writing a profile about charming and successful sports doctor Aaron Conners, she finds herself actually falling in love for the first time -- and what''s more, Aaron seems to really like her too. Amy starts to wonder if it''s time to clean up her act and face her fears.', 'Ever since her father drilled into her head that monogamy isn''t realistic, magazine writer Amy has made promiscuity her credo. As much as she enjoys an uninhibited life free of commitment, Amy is really in a rut. While writing a profile about charming and successful sports doctor Aaron Conners, she finds herself actually falling in love for the first time -- and what''s more, Aaron seems to really like her too. Amy starts to wonder if it''s time to clean up her act and face her fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrY629UTCUAKLJ4CxQXz6DCE7pr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271718'),
