  ('736426479261042300', 'Trance', 2006, 'Drama', 'Teresa Villaverde, João Ribeiro', 'Teresa Villaverde', 'Ana Moreira, Viktor Rakov, Robinson Stévenin, Iaia Forte, Andrey Chadov, Filippo Timi, Io Appolloni, Pedro Giestas', null, 'Sonia, a girl from St. Petersburg, decides to seek a better life in Western Europe. She first gets a job at a car dealer in Germany. But she is suddenly kidnapped and sold into sexual slavery. She will be dragged from country to country and resistance will only bring her misery and humiliation.', 'Sonia, a girl from St. Petersburg, decides to seek a better life in Western Europe. She first gets a job at a car dealer in Germany. But she is suddenly kidnapped and sold into sexual slavery. She will be dragged from country to country and resistance will only bring her misery and humiliation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tqEo3uatKboduKk5fJ4w6lC6PUi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99668'),
  ('240144491424406850', 'Trance', 2013, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Danny Boyle, Anthony Dod Mantle, Denis Schnegg', 'John Hodge, Joe Ahearne', 'James McAvoy, Vincent Cassel, Rosario Dawson, Danny Sapani, Matt Cross, Wahab Sheikh, Mark Poltimore, Tuppence Middleton', 'R', 'A violent gang enlists the help of a hypnotherapist in an attempt to locate a painting which somehow vanished in the middle of a heist.', 'A violent gang enlists the help of a hypnotherapist in an attempt to locate a painting which somehow vanished in the middle of a heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MVYuyVknNA9yC0Gy6z3zDAiWfX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68727'),
  ('896938471126718361', 'Trance', 2020, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Anwar Rasheed, Amal Neerad, Suku Damodar', 'Vincent Vadakkan', 'Fahadh Faasil, Nazriya Nazim, Dileesh Pothan, Gautham Vasudev Menon, Chemban Vinod Jose, Vinayakan, Soubin Shahir, Sreenath Bhasi', null, 'A disheartened motivational speaker gets hired by a corporate to become a preacher until his live stint on television puts him and his service under the scanner.', 'A disheartened motivational speaker gets hired by a corporate to become a preacher until his live stint on television puts him and his service under the scanner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jur8vAsFMtwxqyAngXeXKZnqMSe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590077'),
  ('1087442146429149279', 'Trancers', 1984, 'Science Fiction, Crime', 'Charles Band, Mac Ahlberg, Robert Roda', 'Danny Bilson, Paul De Meo', 'Tim Thomerson, Helen Hunt, Biff Manard, Michael Stefani, Art LaFleur, Telma Hopkins, Richard Herd, Anne Seymour', 'PG-13', 'Angel City trooper Jack Deth is sent back in time from 2247 to 1985 L.A. to inhabit the body of his ancestor. Deth''s assignment is to find his archenemy, Whistler, who turns people into zombies, before the fiend is able to kill all the ancestors of the future''s governing council.', 'Angel City trooper Jack Deth is sent back in time from 2247 to 1985 L.A. to inhabit the body of his ancestor. Deth''s assignment is to find his archenemy, Whistler, who turns people into zombies, before the fiend is able to kill all the ancestors of the future''s governing council.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Qx4KrimPXFNw8yRUBaZldcN8Ma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5677'),
  ('215920224167455120', 'Trancers 4: Jack of Swords', 1994, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'David Nutter, Adolfo Bartoli', 'Peter David', 'Tim Thomerson, Stacie Randall, Ty Miller, Terri Ivens, Mark Arnold, Clabe Hartley, Alan Oppenheimer, Lochlyn Munro', 'R', 'Jack is now back in the future. He had since lost Lena, and finds out that he''s lost his other wife Alice to none other than Harris. While heading out for another assignment, something goes awry with the TCL chamber. Jack finds himself in a whole new dimension. He also runs across a different version of trancers. These guys seem to be in control of this planet. Jack manages to assist a rebel group known as the "Tunnel Rats" crush the rule of the evil Lord Calaban.', 'Jack is now back in the future. He had since lost Lena, and finds out that he''s lost his other wife Alice to none other than Harris. While heading out for another assignment, something goes awry with the TCL chamber. Jack finds himself in a whole new dimension. He also runs across a different version of trancers. These guys seem to be in control of this planet. Jack manages to assist a rebel group known as the "Tunnel Rats" crush the rule of the evil Lord Calaban.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ec081IWKkRalPO14KAmqJ2vWeYB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47662'),
  ('123336711039784612', 'Trancers 5: Sudden Deth', 1994, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'David Nutter, Adolfo Bartoli', 'Peter David', 'Tim Thomerson, Stacie Randall, Ty Miller, Terri Ivens, Mark Arnold, Clabe Hartley, Alan Oppenheimer, Jeff Moldovan', 'R', 'Jack Deth is back for one more round with the trancers. Jack must attempt to find his way home from the other-dimensional world of Orpheus, where magic works and the trancers were the ruling class (before Trancers IV, that is). Unfortunately, Jack''s quest to find the mystical Tiamond in the Castle of Unrelenting Terror may be thwarted by the return of Caliban, king of the trancers who was thought dead.', 'Jack Deth is back for one more round with the trancers. Jack must attempt to find his way home from the other-dimensional world of Orpheus, where magic works and the trancers were the ruling class (before Trancers IV, that is). Unfortunately, Jack''s quest to find the mystical Tiamond in the Castle of Unrelenting Terror may be thwarted by the return of Caliban, king of the trancers who was thought dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GAZiudrdVhMaHeAhsvhqqZJoDU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47663'),
  ('551270752006220943', 'Trancers 6: Life After Deth', 2002, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Jay Woelfel, Paul Deng', 'C. Courtney Joyner', 'Zette Sullivan, Jennifer Capo, Robert Donavan, Timothy Prindle, Jere Jon, Jennifer Cantrell, Ben Bar, James R. Hilton', 'R', 'In a return to the groundbreaking original film''s premise, Jack Deth is back - traveling back in time and into the body of his own daughter, Josephine, on a mission to save her life and save the world from the most lethal Trancers yet. Jack/Jo must adapt and survive being a girl while avoiding many assassination attempts by more powerful and dangerous zombie-like Trancers than he''s ever faced before.', 'In a return to the groundbreaking original film''s premise, Jack Deth is back - traveling back in time and into the body of his own daughter, Josephine, on a mission to save her life and save the world from the most lethal Trancers yet. Jack/Jo must adapt and survive being a girl while avoiding many assassination attempts by more powerful and dangerous zombie-like Trancers than he''s ever faced before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arpgihe24QgB7Co5qa6sG6BZt6m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50699'),
  ('476312727736082424', 'Trancers II', 1991, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Adolfo Bartoli, Charles Band, Scott Thomson', 'Jackson Barr', 'Tim Thomerson, Helen Hunt, Megan Ward, Biff Manard, Martine Beswick, Jeffrey Combs, Alyson Croft, Telma Hopkins', 'R', 'Once again someone from the future has come back to create an army of Trancers, human zombies who do what they''re told without question or pause. Now officer Jack Deth, a cop from the future stranded in the past, must once again go forth to stop them. This sci-fi action sequel chronicles his courageous actions as he struggles to save the future. His difficulties are compounded when his boss sends his first wife back from the future to help Deth who has unfortunately, married a 20th-century girl.', 'Once again someone from the future has come back to create an army of Trancers, human zombies who do what they''re told without question or pause. Now officer Jack Deth, a cop from the future stranded in the past, must once again go forth to stop them. This sci-fi action sequel chronicles his courageous actions as he struggles to save the future. His difficulties are compounded when his boss sends his first wife back from the future to help Deth who has unfortunately, married a 20th-century girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3AHzdaXN3kZHXJtZdeC8Uyr3DuU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40740'),
  ('846518830902712532', 'Trancers III', 1992, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'C. Courtney Joyner, Adolfo Bartoli, Chris Ciaffa', 'C. Courtney Joyner', 'Tim Thomerson, Melanie Smith, Andrew Robinson, Tony Pierce, Dawn Ann Billings, Ed Beechner, Helen Hunt, Megan Ward', 'R', 'A time traveling cop, Jack Deth, from the future is taken back to the past to be given the task of destroying the Trancer program before it has a chance to get out of control, sending the world into a state of chaos and war.', 'A time traveling cop, Jack Deth, from the future is taken back to the past to be given the task of destroying the Trancer program before it has a chance to get out of control, sending the world into a state of chaos and war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xj9PAfC2axx7vGXveNu0KyaCrz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47628'),
  ('401114101174465045', 'Trancers: City of Lost Angels', 1988, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Crime', 'Charles Band, Mac Ahlberg', 'Paul De Meo, Danny Bilson', 'Tim Thomerson, Helen Hunt, Art LaFleur, Telma Hopkins, Grace Zabriskie, Velvet Rhodes, Alyson Croft', null, 'Jack Deth, the super cop from the future, has put away three centuries worth of time traveling criminals. But Deth''s most dangerous collar, the ultraviolent assassin Edlin Shock, has escaped from her maximum security holding cell and won''t rest until she''s exacted revenge. Meanwhile, Deth is trying to make a life for himself as a private eye in 1988 Los Angeles with his hot-blooded girlfriend Lena. Relationship troubles are just the beginning of Deth''s problems when he learns that Edlin Shock has followed him back in time.', 'Jack Deth, the super cop from the future, has put away three centuries worth of time traveling criminals. But Deth''s most dangerous collar, the ultraviolent assassin Edlin Shock, has escaped from her maximum security holding cell and won''t rest until she''s exacted revenge. Meanwhile, Deth is trying to make a life for himself as a private eye in 1988 Los Angeles with his hot-blooded girlfriend Lena. Relationship troubles are just the beginning of Deth''s problems when he learns that Edlin Shock has followed him back in time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTqtj2I2FfCbRM5yWA3Cq9y12Z2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285633'),
  ('166043086934401110', 'Trances', 1982, 'Documentary, Music', 'Ahmed El Maânouni, Ahmed El Maânouni', 'Ahmed El Maânouni', 'Nass El Ghiwane, Larbi Batma, Omar Sayed, Abderrahman Paco, Allal Yaala', 'NR', 'A portrait of the groundbreaking Moroccan band Nass El Ghiwane, documenting a series of electrifying live performances in Tunisia, Morocco, and France; on the streets of Casablanca; and in intimate conversations. Storytellers through song and traditional instruments, and with connections to political theatre, the band became a local phenomenon and an international sensation, thanks to their rebellious lyrics and sublime, fully acoustic sound, which draws on Berber rhythms, Malhun sung poetry, and Gnawa dances.', 'A portrait of the groundbreaking Moroccan band Nass El Ghiwane, documenting a series of electrifying live performances in Tunisia, Morocco, and France; on the streets of Casablanca; and in intimate conversations. Storytellers through song and traditional instruments, and with connections to political theatre, the band became a local phenomenon and an international sensation, thanks to their rebellious lyrics and sublime, fully acoustic sound, which draws on Berber rhythms, Malhun sung poetry, and Gnawa dances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYKjLc1EFsjCqt2FcS2N7BkrAtc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215407'),
  ('58549292582441444', 'Tranquility: Aeterna', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Alexander Geil', 'Alexander Geil', 'Keith R. Beck, Brianna D''Ambra, Emma Rose, Erin Gannon, Mena Alayan', '16+', 'A covert agent is confronted by two god-like beings that have the potential to destroy everything.', 'A covert agent is confronted by two god-like beings that have the potential to destroy everything.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FnSFPRmzSSa0i5y5Ts4EgaZsAJwK.jpg', 'plex:movie:tranquility-aeterna'),
  ('450781839100088881', 'Trans-Europ-Express', 1966, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Alain Robbe-Grillet, Willy Kurant', 'Alain Robbe-Grillet', 'Jean-Louis Trintignant, Marie-France Pisier, Christian Barbier, Charles Millot, Daniel Emilfork, Henri Lambert, Alain Robbe-Grillet, Catherine Robbe-Grillet', null, 'A movie producer, director and assistant take the Trans-Europ-Express from Paris to Antwerp. They get the idea for a movie about a drug smuggler on their train and visualize it while taping the script.', 'A movie producer, director and assistant take the Trans-Europ-Express from Paris to Antwerp. They get the idea for a movie about a drug smuggler on their train and visualize it while taping the script.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1obuqweg5lipvB3GiS7FV15ciTZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90908'),
  ('367924187061668502', 'Transamerica', 2005, 'Drama, Adventure, Comedy', 'Duncan Tucker, Stephen Kazmierski, Justin Ritson', 'Duncan Tucker', 'Felicity Huffman, Kevin Zegers, Fionnula Flanagan, Burt Young, Carrie Preston, Elizabeth Peña, Graham Greene, Venida Evans', 'R', 'A transgender woman takes an unexpected journey when she learns that she had a son, now a teenage runaway hustling on the streets of New York.', 'A transgender woman takes an unexpected journey when she learns that she had a son, now a teenage runaway hustling on the streets of New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LGWKXxYGTr2wJE0AdthPzzlczt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:546'),
  ('469707945066424743', 'Transatlantic', 1931, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'William K. Howard, James Wong Howe', 'Lynn Starling, Guy Bolton', 'Edmund Lowe, Lois Moran, John Halliday, Greta Nissen, Myrna Loy, Jean Hersholt, Earle Foxe, Billy Bevan', 'NR', 'As a luxurious ocean liner makes its way across the Atlantic Ocean, the audience is made privy to the travails of several of its passengers. Edmund Lowe heads the cast as Monty Greer, a suave gambler who falls in love with Judy, the daughter of immigrant lens grinder Rudolph Kramer. In trying to recover some valuable securities stolen from banker Henry Graham, Greer finds himself in the middle of a fierce gun battle in the ship''s engine room. Meanwhile, Graham, who has been cheating on his wife Kay with sexy dancer Sigrid Carline, is murdered by person or persons unknown.', 'As a luxurious ocean liner makes its way across the Atlantic Ocean, the audience is made privy to the travails of several of its passengers. Edmund Lowe heads the cast as Monty Greer, a suave gambler who falls in love with Judy, the daughter of immigrant lens grinder Rudolph Kramer. In trying to recover some valuable securities stolen from banker Henry Graham, Greer finds himself in the middle of a fierce gun battle in the ship''s engine room. Meanwhile, Graham, who has been cheating on his wife Kay with sexy dancer Sigrid Carline, is murdered by person or persons unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWrJf037i48KD84F83oys5rNHrw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87306'),
  ('472993991380005623', 'Transcendence', 2014, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Drama, Mystery', 'Wally Pfister, Jess Hall, Scott Robertson', 'Jack Paglen', 'Johnny Depp, Rebecca Hall, Paul Bettany, Cillian Murphy, Kate Mara, Cole Hauser, Morgan Freeman, Clifton Collins Jr.', 'PG-13', 'Two leading computer scientists work toward their goal of Technological Singularity, as a radical anti-technology organization fights to prevent them from creating a world where computers can transcend the abilities of the human brain.', 'Two leading computer scientists work toward their goal of Technological Singularity, as a radical anti-technology organization fights to prevent them from creating a world where computers can transcend the abilities of the human brain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmOKJWl3wnXDcLhjtJHnCCCvAiO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157353'),
  ('947410891524891293', 'Transcendent Man', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Robert Barry Ptolemy', null, 'Tom Abate, Hugo De Garis, Peter Diamandis, Ray Kurzweil, Kevin Kelly', 'NR', 'The compelling feature-length documentary film, by director Barry Ptolemy, chronicles the life and controversial ideas of luminary Ray Kurzweil. For more than three decades, inventor, futures, and New York Times best-selling author Ray Kurzweil has been one of the most respected and provocative advocates of the role of technology in our future.', 'The compelling feature-length documentary film, by director Barry Ptolemy, chronicles the life and controversial ideas of luminary Ray Kurzweil. For more than three decades, inventor, futures, and New York Times best-selling author Ray Kurzweil has been one of the most respected and provocative advocates of the role of technology in our future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofAPeHbGrggoRUdOQwU8DNOzb1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58261'),
  ('370018988926278825', 'Transfer', 1966, 'Drama', 'David Cronenberg, David Cronenberg', 'David Cronenberg', 'Rafe Macpherson, Mort Ritts', null, 'A psychiatrist and his patient discuss their relationship in a snow-covered field.', 'A psychiatrist and his patient discuss their relationship in a snow-covered field.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghbcTtbrW97uvn7irHMZJ09Srjr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237730'),
  ('405306782586177989', 'Transfer', 2010, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Damir Lukacevic', 'Damir Lukacevic, Gabi Blauert', 'Regine Nehy, Ingrid Andree, Hans-Michael Rehberg, Mehmet Kurtuluş, B.J. Britt, Eric P. Caspar, Jeanette Hain', null, 'In the near future, the company, "Menzana" succeeds with the crucial step of transferring personalities for eternal youth. For the aged Hermann and his seriously ill wife, Anna, they both fear the day that death will separate them. At Menzana, they commit to purchasing the bodies of Apolain and Sarah. Under the conditions of the transfer, Hermann and Anna have use of their new bodies for 20 hours a day. When they sleep, their hosts Apolain and Sarah return to consciousness are able to use their own bodies for a period of four hours.', 'In the near future, the company, "Menzana" succeeds with the crucial step of transferring personalities for eternal youth. For the aged Hermann and his seriously ill wife, Anna, they both fear the day that death will separate them. At Menzana, they commit to purchasing the bodies of Apolain and Sarah. Under the conditions of the transfer, Hermann and Anna have use of their new bodies for 20 hours a day. When they sleep, their hosts Apolain and Sarah return to consciousness are able to use their own bodies for a period of four hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wsnGDAJDudTXydSjNsPB4J5WfT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73283'),
  ('5684747949503436', 'Transfert', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Massimiliano Russo, Simone Raeli, Massimiliano Russo', 'Massimiliano Russo', 'Rossella Cardaci, Giuseppe di Noto, Giulio Fodale, Paola Roccuzzo, Alberto Mica, Matteo Martorana, Massimiliano Russo, Viviana Militello', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pv18zmwuA4IihEsWYrTNeG3OXlg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:563953'),
  ('610929861319086173', 'Transfixed', 2001, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Francis Girod, Thierry Jault, Vincent Bell', 'Francis Girod, Philippe Cougrand', 'Robinson Stévenin, Stéphane Metzger, Richard Bohringer, William Nadylam, Frédéric Pellegeay, Ginette Garcin, Stéphane De Groodt, Charlie Dupont', 'NR', 'Bo is a transexual prostitute in Brussels who left home after being abused by her father. She''s infuatuated with a neighbor and suspected by the police in a series of transexual murders. In order to clear herself she must turn detective.', 'Bo is a transexual prostitute in Brussels who left home after being abused by her father. She''s infuatuated with a neighbor and suspected by the police in a series of transexual murders. In order to clear herself she must turn detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2AuYdCgCoDsgeLtGIfG9zzBFqG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27149'),
  ('1080898209430427750', 'Transformation by Hats', 1895, 'Comedy', 'Louis Lumière', null, 'Félicien Trewey', null, 'Félicien Trewey uses a basic prop to create comical hats and their accompanying caricatures.', 'Félicien Trewey uses a basic prop to create comical hats and their accompanying caricatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXpoDvaVuTGah5X00ohKjiqV4dr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144396'),
  ('1096525369427668224', 'Transformations', 1988, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Jay Kamen, Sergio Salvati', 'Mitch Brian', 'Rex Smith, Lisa Langlois, Patrick Macnee, Christopher Neame, Michael Hennessy, Cec Verrell, Ann Margaret Hughes, Donald Hodson', 'R', 'Wolfgang is traveling in outer space when a monster, which he sees as a beautiful woman, appears in his spaceship and makes love with him. Then the ship is forced to land on a planet which is a penal colony. Here he meets Miranda who falls in love with him. A group of prisoners uses him and his spaceship to fly away from the planet. But the monster which is by now inside Wolfgang arouses and only Miranda''s love can save him.', 'Wolfgang is traveling in outer space when a monster, which he sees as a beautiful woman, appears in his spaceship and makes love with him. Then the ship is forced to land on a planet which is a penal colony. Here he meets Miranda who falls in love with him. A group of prisoners uses him and his spaceship to fly away from the planet. But the monster which is by now inside Wolfgang arouses and only Miranda''s love can save him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mikYbyRLbyr2hI9hpk4xTC51aWp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28800'),
  ('695937474062830694', 'Transformers', 2007, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Action', 'Michael Bay, Mitchell Amundsen, Geoff Hubbard', 'Roberto Orci, Alex Kurtzman', 'Shia LaBeouf, Megan Fox, Mark Ryan, Peter Cullen, Hugo Weaving, Josh Duhamel, Tyrese Gibson, Charlie Adler', 'PG-13', 'Young teenager Sam Witwicky becomes involved in the ancient struggle between two extraterrestrial factions of transforming robots – the heroic Autobots and the evil Decepticons. Sam holds the clue to unimaginable power and the Decepticons will stop at nothing to retrieve it.', 'Young teenager Sam Witwicky becomes involved in the ancient struggle between two extraterrestrial factions of transforming robots – the heroic Autobots and the evil Decepticons. Sam holds the clue to unimaginable power and the Decepticons will stop at nothing to retrieve it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4N4sipl8T72tNE4earcctQa2Kw2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1858'),
  ('558440381853928771', 'Transformers One', 2024, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Adventure, Family', 'Josh Cooley, Christopher Batty', 'Andrew Barrer, Gabriel Ferrari, Eric Pearson', 'Chris Hemsworth, Brian Tyree Henry, Scarlett Johansson, Keegan-Michael Key, Jon Hamm, Steve Buscemi, Laurence Fishburne, Vanessa Liguori', 'PG', 'The untold origin story of Optimus Prime and Megatron, better known as sworn enemies, but once were friends bonded like brothers who changed the fate of Cybertron forever.', 'The untold origin story of Optimus Prime and Megatron, better known as sworn enemies, but once were friends bonded like brothers who changed the fate of Cybertron forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRCgqpdVE4wyLQvGYU3ZP7pAtUc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:698687'),
  ('470041741927916692', 'Transformers Prime: Beast Hunters - Predacons Rising', 2013, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Vinton Heuck, Todd Waterman, Scooter Tidwell', 'Steven Melching, Roberto Orci, Marsha Griffin', 'Peter Cullen, Frank Welker, Steve Blum, Jeffrey Combs, Will Friedle, James Horan, Michael Ironside, Peter Mensah', 'G', 'Autobots, Decepticons, Predaking and Predacons form an unlikely alliance to battle a resurrected Unicron.', 'Autobots, Decepticons, Predaking and Predacons form an unlikely alliance to battle a resurrected Unicron.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArjRF3ov2uZXsc3jCMBF388B4Kg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268092'),
  ('602294673599290463', 'Transformers: Age of Extinction', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Michael Bay, Amir Mokri, Mark W. Mansbridge', 'Ehren Kruger', 'Mark Wahlberg, Peter Cullen, Stanley Tucci, Kelsey Grammer, Nicola Peltz Beckham, Jack Reynor, Frank Welker, Sophia Myles', 'PG-13', 'As humanity picks up the pieces after the battle of Chicago, a shadowy group reveals itself in an attempt to control the direction of history…while an ancient, powerful new menace sets Earth in its crosshairs. With help from Cade Yeager, Optimus Prime and the Autobots rise to meet their most fearsome challenge yet.', 'As humanity picks up the pieces after the battle of Chicago, a shadowy group reveals itself in an attempt to control the direction of history…while an ancient, powerful new menace sets Earth in its crosshairs. With help from Cade Yeager, Optimus Prime and the Autobots rise to meet their most fearsome challenge yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyzrfx2WaeY60kYZpPYepSjGz4S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91314'),
  ('733253044947484888', 'Transformers: Beginnings', 2007, 'Animation, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Harold Hayes Jr., Craig Phillips, Michael White Jr.', null, 'Peter Cullen, Frank Welker, Mark Ryan, Patrick Hallahan, Brian Stepanek, Kevin Dunn, Patrick Viall, Justin Foley', 'NR', 'On their home planet of Cybertron, the Autobots and Decepticons are involved in an explosive battle over the coveted AllSpark. With the fate of the universe at stake, the Autobots send it far from the reaches of the ruthless Megatron, leader of the Decepticons. But there are even more surprises in store when it crash-lands on Earth.', 'On their home planet of Cybertron, the Autobots and Decepticons are involved in an explosive battle over the coveted AllSpark. With the fate of the universe at stake, the Autobots send it far from the reaches of the ruthless Megatron, leader of the Decepticons. But there are even more surprises in store when it crash-lands on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q61s5H2DRHSJYx75adOtTL3aFuY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25565'),
  ('605594838365361616', 'Transformers: Dark of the Moon', 2011, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Michael Bay, Amir Mokri, Richard L. Johnson', 'Ehren Kruger', 'Shia LaBeouf, Rosie Huntington-Whiteley, Peter Cullen, Leonard Nimoy, John Turturro, Frances McDormand, Josh Duhamel, Tyrese Gibson', 'PG-13', 'The Autobots continue to work for NEST, now no longer in secret. But after discovering a strange artifact during a mission in Chernobyl, it becomes apparent to Optimus Prime that the United States government has been less than forthright with them.', 'The Autobots continue to work for NEST, now no longer in secret. But after discovering a strange artifact during a mission in Chernobyl, it becomes apparent to Optimus Prime that the United States government has been less than forthright with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28YlCLrFhONteYSs9hKjD1Km0Cj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38356'),
  ('1129997719718617261', 'Transformers: Revenge of the Fallen', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Michael Bay, Ben Seresin, Jon Billington', 'Roberto Orci, Alex Kurtzman, Ehren Kruger', 'Shia LaBeouf, Megan Fox, Peter Cullen, Hugo Weaving, Tony Todd, Josh Duhamel, Tyrese Gibson, John Turturro', 'PG-13', 'Sam Witwicky leaves the Autobots behind for a normal life. But when his mind is filled with cryptic symbols, the Decepticons target him and he is dragged back into the Transformers'' war.', 'Sam Witwicky leaves the Autobots behind for a normal life. But when his mind is filled with cryptic symbols, the Decepticons target him and he is dragged back into the Transformers'' war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLBb0whOzVDtJvyD4DPeQyQNOqp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8373'),
  ('381522435468506162', 'Transformers: Rise of the Beasts', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Enrique Chediak, Esteban Sánchez, Michele Laliberte', 'Darnell Metayer, Josh Peters, Erich Hoeber', 'Anthony Ramos, Dominique Fishback, Peter Cullen, Ron Perlman, Peter Dinklage, Michelle Yeoh, Pete Davidson, Liza Koshy', 'PG-13', 'When a new threat capable of destroying the entire planet emerges, Optimus Prime and the Autobots must team up with a powerful faction known as the Maximals. With the fate of humanity hanging in the balance, humans Noah and Elena will do whatever it takes to help the Transformers as they engage in the ultimate battle to save Earth.', 'When a new threat capable of destroying the entire planet emerges, Optimus Prime and the Autobots must team up with a powerful faction known as the Maximals. With the fate of humanity hanging in the balance, humans Noah and Elena will do whatever it takes to help the Transformers as they engage in the ultimate battle to save Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPbM0MK8CP8A174rmUwGsADNYKD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:667538'),
  ('805541616046213976', 'Transformers: The Last Knight', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Michael Bay, Jonathan Sela, Jason Knox-Johnston', 'Ken Nolan, Matt Holloway, Art Marcum', 'Mark Wahlberg, Laura Haddock, Peter Cullen, Anthony Hopkins, Erik Aadahl, Josh Duhamel, Gemma Chan, Jim Carter', 'PG-13', 'Humans and Transformers are at war. Optimus Prime is gone. The key to saving our future lies buried in the secrets of the past, in the hidden history of Transformers on Earth. Saving our world falls upon the shoulders of an unlikely alliance: Cade Yeager; Bumblebee; an English Lord; and an Oxford Professor.', 'Humans and Transformers are at war. Optimus Prime is gone. The key to saving our future lies buried in the secrets of the past, in the hidden history of Transformers on Earth. Saving our world falls upon the shoulders of an unlikely alliance: Cade Yeager; Bumblebee; an English Lord; and an Oxford Professor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5HQf2Gb3lIO2cRcFwNL9sn1o1o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335988'),
  ('349378453916816973', 'Transformers: Titans Return', 2017, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Yuuzou Satou', 'Eric S. Calderon, F.J. DeSanto, Adam Beechen', 'Peter Cullen, Kari Wahlgren, Tay Zonday, Wil Wheaton, Nolan North, Michael Dorn, Lana McKissack, Rob Gavagan', null, 'After the Combiner Wars ended, Cybertron started to be rebuilt. However, an undead Starscream has been reincarnated as Trypticon, wreaking havoc around him. To combat this menace, Windblade gathers up a ragtag team of Transformers, including Optimus Prime and Megatron, to resurrect an ancient ally. And while some may be forever changed by the events, others may not emerge with their sparks intact.', 'After the Combiner Wars ended, Cybertron started to be rebuilt. However, an undead Starscream has been reincarnated as Trypticon, wreaking havoc around him. To combat this menace, Windblade gathers up a ragtag team of Transformers, including Optimus Prime and Megatron, to resurrect an ancient ally. And while some may be forever changed by the events, others may not emerge with their sparks intact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nP4nfW0E1cl1dAy6j8iKHsJRyQ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521494'),
  ('589212824576983949', 'Transfusion', 2023, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Matt Nable, Jennifer Gal, Stevie Ray', 'Matt Nable', 'Sam Worthington, Matt Nable, Phoebe Tonkin, Edward Carmody, Susie Porter, Jeremy Lindsay Taylor, Sam Parsonson, Sam Cotton', 'R', 'Ryan Logan, a former Special Forces operative, is battling to cope with life after the loss of his wife. He is thrusted into the criminal underworld to keep his only son from being taken from him.', 'Ryan Logan, a former Special Forces operative, is battling to cope with life after the loss of his wife. He is thrusted into the criminal underworld to keep his only son from being taken from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxh5xCCW9Ynfg6EZJWUkc1zqTnr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842544'),
  ('547375561263647823', 'Transistor Love Story', 2001, 'Comedy, Music, Drama, Romance', 'Pen-Ek Ratanaruang, Chankit Chamnivikaipong, Sukumapon Suthisrisinlpa', 'Pen-Ek Ratanaruang', 'Suppakorn Kitsuwan, Siriyakorn Pukkavesh, Black Phomtong, Somlek Sakdikul, Porntip Papanai, Ampon Rattanawong, Prasit Wongrakthai, Chartchai Hamnuansak', null, 'An aspiring singer leaves his pregnant bride a radio for company when he is drafted into the army; unfit for military life, the man goes AWOL and joins a pop music troupe but soon after his wife tracks him down his life spirals out of control.', 'An aspiring singer leaves his pregnant bride a radio for company when he is drafted into the army; unfit for military life, the man goes AWOL and joins a pop music troupe but soon after his wife tracks him down his life spirals out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dsuJ6qkFiHN59ZGw9HIWShgeR6w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109048'),
  ('949083714624788435', 'Transit', 2012, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Antonio Negret, Yaron Levy', 'Michael Gilvary', 'Jim Caviezel, Elisabeth Röhm, James Frain, Diora Baird, Harold Perrineau, Sterling Knight, Beau Brasseaux, Jake Cherry', 'R', 'Nate takes his family for a camping trip to reconnect. When they pull off at a rest stop, a gang of thieves hides their stash from an armored car robbery among the family belongings. They soon find themselves on the run and the gang will stop at nothing to get their money back.', 'Nate takes his family for a camping trip to reconnect. When they pull off at a rest stop, a gang of thieves hides their stash from an armored car robbery among the family belongings. They soon find themselves on the run and the gang will stop at nothing to get their money back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NmsF4LgWTefgEbigUE86O0kIr2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82485'),
  ('104660805509586041', 'Transit', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ires Jung, Andreas Meszaros, Maria Ochs', 'Christian Petzold', 'Franz Rogowski, Paula Beer, Godehard Giese, Lilien Batman, Barbara Auer, Matthias Brandt, Sebastian Hülk, Àlex Brendemühl', null, 'In an attempt to flee Nazi-occupied France, Georg assumes the identity of a dead author but soon finds himself stuck in Marseilles, where he falls in love with Maria, a young woman searching for her missing husband.', 'In an attempt to flee Nazi-occupied France, Georg assumes the identity of a dead author but soon finds himself stuck in Marseilles, where he falls in love with Maria, a young woman searching for her missing husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YLOCnokMMSIOCvA0kCnkhpTD79.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471853'),
  ('709267357784221838', 'Transmitzvah', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Daniel Burman, Rolo Pulpeiro, Sabrina García', 'Daniel Burman, Ariel Gurevich', 'Penélope Guerrero, Juan Minujín, Alejandra Flechner, Gustavo Bassani, Alejandro Awada, Matías Peccia, Gonzalo Gerber, Nicolás Chávez', 'R', 'After embracing her female identity, Rubén rejects her Bar Mitzvah. When tragedy strikes years later, she returns as Mumy Singer to celebrate it her way.', 'After embracing her female identity, Rubén rejects her Bar Mitzvah. When tragedy strikes years later, she returns as Mumy Singer to celebrate it her way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIytaofTcCgGT5RU1Mg3v1DIC30.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1280465'),
  ('1139182573069549967', 'Transmorphers', 2007, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Steven Parker, Leigh Scott, Justin Jones', 'Leigh Scott', 'Matthew Wolf, Amy Weber, Shaley Scott, Eliza Swenson, Griff Furst, Michael Tower, Sarah Hall, Erin Evans', 'R', 'About a race of alien robots that have conquered Earth and forced humanity underground. After 400 years, a small group of humans develop a plan to defeat the mechanical invaders in the ultimate battle between man and machine.', 'About a race of alien robots that have conquered Earth and forced humanity underground. After 400 years, a small group of humans develop a plan to defeat the mechanical invaders in the ultimate battle between man and machine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1RUXejgCj74eRwCxA4S7CNQzslJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25055'),
  ('692790555912035003', 'Transmorphers: Fall of Man', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Scott D. Wheeler, Mark Atkins', 'Shane van Dyke', 'Bruce Boxleitner, Jennifer Rubin, Shane van Dyke, Silvy Kas, Iona Thonger, Alana DiMaria, Debra Harrison-Lowe, Russ Kingston', 'R', 'In this prequel to Transmorphers -- a sci-fi thriller that borrows heavily from the plot of Transformers -- planet Earth is in peril thanks to a rogue army of alien robots, and it''s up to a small group of humans to mount a crippling counterattack. Can Sheriff Hadley Ryan (Bruce Boxleitner), a doctor (Jennifer Rubin) and an ex-Marine (Shane Van Dyke) find the automatons'' Achilles'' heel before they conquer the planet?', 'In this prequel to Transmorphers -- a sci-fi thriller that borrows heavily from the plot of Transformers -- planet Earth is in peril thanks to a rogue army of alien robots, and it''s up to a small group of humans to mount a crippling counterattack. Can Sheriff Hadley Ryan (Bruce Boxleitner), a doctor (Jennifer Rubin) and an ex-Marine (Shane Van Dyke) find the automatons'' Achilles'' heel before they conquer the planet?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQFaVhX13I8RhunMB87F9zY4aI6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20205'),
  ('970022961863231095', 'Transmorphers: Mech Beasts', 2023, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Michael Su, Justin Giffen, Tucker Phillips', 'Joe Roche', 'Tom Arnold, Tania Fox, Jolene Anderson, Andrew Rogers, Mica Javier, Chad Ridgely, Anthony Jensen, Mark Justice', null, '20 years after the events of Transmorphers, a newer, more advanced species of alien robot descends on a rebuilt Earth, threatening once again to destroy the planet.', '20 years after the events of Transmorphers, a newer, more advanced species of alien robot descends on a rebuilt Earth, threatening once again to destroy the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqhaffnQqSzdLrYAQA5W4IdAoCX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1144962'),
  ('819454420776803642', 'Transmutations', 1985, 'Horror, Action, Science Fiction, Adventure, Thriller', 'George Pavlou, Paul Frift, Peter Freeman', 'Clive Barker, James Caplin', 'Denholm Elliott, Steven Berkoff, Nicola Cowper, Larry Lamb, Irina Brook, Art Malik, Brian Croucher, Ingrid Pitt', 'R', 'When high class hooker Nicole is kidnapped from her brothel, Rich businessman Hugo Motherskille hires her ex love Roy Bain to find her. Investigating the disappearance, he eventually finds traces that lead to Dr. Savary, who has produced a strange white powder that''s coveted by a race of deformed human beings who live in the underworld in the sewers below the city.', 'When high class hooker Nicole is kidnapped from her brothel, Rich businessman Hugo Motherskille hires her ex love Roy Bain to find her. Investigating the disappearance, he eventually finds traces that lead to Dr. Savary, who has produced a strange white powder that''s coveted by a race of deformed human beings who live in the underworld in the sewers below the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXx5ByHcqqArMKsPSwCSFCE7shb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92766'),
  ('87191164392922856', 'Transpecos', 2016, 'Thriller', 'Greg Kwedar, Jeffrey Waldron', 'Clint Bentley, Greg Kwedar', 'Gabriel Luna, Clifton Collins Jr., Johnny Simmons, Lora Martinez-Cunningham, Will Brittain, Luis Bordonada, Alma Martinez, Alex Knight', 'NR', 'For three US Border Patrol agents, the contents of one car reveal an insidious plot within their own ranks. The next 24 hours may cost them their lives.', 'For three US Border Patrol agents, the contents of one car reveal an insidious plot within their own ranks. The next 24 hours may cost them their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GglkPWXxHTqf7H2ptPLUb7p3Fb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381018'),
  ('472183109872983328', 'Transport of a Turret by a Team of 60 Horses', 1897, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'A very heavy turret is transported on a truck drawn by a long line of horses. The inscription “Charlemagne 53790K” readable on the turret suggests that this view was shot in the vicinity of Saint-Chamond, a town where there are factories specializing in the construction of heavy steel. It is certainly a turret intended for the battleship “Charlemagne”. In addition, a view projected by the Aléthorama on January 20, 1898 in Saint-Étienne, and entitled “Transportation of the armored turret of Saint-Chamond by a team of 80 horses”, could represent the same event.', 'A very heavy turret is transported on a truck drawn by a long line of horses. The inscription “Charlemagne 53790K” readable on the turret suggests that this view was shot in the vicinity of Saint-Chamond, a town where there are factories specializing in the construction of heavy steel. It is certainly a turret intended for the battleship “Charlemagne”. In addition, a view projected by the Aléthorama on January 20, 1898 in Saint-Étienne, and entitled “Transportation of the armored turret of Saint-Chamond by a team of 80 horses”, could represent the same event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bqqEMl5v5a0Y7x0IiwNDweI5lGU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195073'),
  ('982086217475210615', 'Transporter 2', 2005, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Louis Leterrier, Mitchell Amundsen, Mehdi Sayah', 'Luc Besson, Robert Mark Kamen', 'Jason Statham, Amber Valletta, Alessandro Gassmann, Kate Nauta, Matthew Modine, Jason Flemyng, Keith David, Hunter Clary', 'PG-13', 'Professional driver, and former Special Forces officer, Frank Martin is living in Miami, where he is temporarily filling in for a friend as the chauffeur for a government narcotics control policy director and his family. The young boy in the family is targeted for kidnapping, and Frank immediately becomes involved in protecting the child and exposing the kidnappers.', 'Professional driver, and former Special Forces officer, Frank Martin is living in Miami, where he is temporarily filling in for a friend as the chauffeur for a government narcotics control policy director and his family. The young boy in the family is targeted for kidnapping, and Frank immediately becomes involved in protecting the child and exposing the kidnappers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdm17vK8PxHfTi7ayZf6WKbOgUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9335'),
  ('1046837215434046968', 'Transporter 3', 2008, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Olivier Megaton, Giovanni Fiore Coltellacci, David Campi-Lemaire', 'Robert Mark Kamen, Luc Besson', 'Jason Statham, Natalya Rudakova, François Berléand, Robert Knepper, Jeroen Krabbé, Alex Kobold, David Atrakchi, Yann Sundberg', 'PG-13', 'Frank Martin puts the driving gloves on to deliver Valentina, the kidnapped daughter of a Ukrainian government official, from Marseilles to Odessa on the Black Sea. En route, he has to contend with thugs who want to intercept Valentina''s safe delivery and not let his personal feelings get in the way of his dangerous objective.', 'Frank Martin puts the driving gloves on to deliver Valentina, the kidnapped daughter of a Ukrainian government official, from Marseilles to Odessa on the Black Sea. En route, he has to contend with thugs who want to intercept Valentina''s safe delivery and not let his personal feelings get in the way of his dangerous objective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4R9Le2jYW2XB2QxbUeu74jJQ5D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13387'),
  ('775575306252495190', 'TransSiberian', 2008, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Xavi Giménez, Brad Anderson', 'Brad Anderson, Will Conroy', 'Woody Harrelson, Emily Mortimer, Kate Mara, Eduardo Noriega, Thomas Kretschmann, Ben Kingsley, Etienne Chicot, Mac McDonald', 'R', 'A TransSiberian train journey from China to Moscow becomes a thrilling chase of deception and murder when an American couple encounters a mysterious pair of fellow travelers.', 'A TransSiberian train journey from China to Moscow becomes a thrilling chase of deception and murder when an American couple encounters a mysterious pair of fellow travelers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhTOda5CLp9tEdDzQZiqBTdv5lR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6687'),
  ('501881550750074802', 'Transylmania', 2009, 'Comedy, Horror', 'David Hillenbrand, Scott Hillenbrand, Viorel Sergovici', 'Patrick Casey, Josh Miller', 'Patrick Cavanaugh, James DeBello, Tony Denman, Irena Violette, Paul Kim Jr., Jennifer Lyons, Oren Skoog, David Steinberg', 'R', 'Spoof horror in which a group of college kids do a semester abroad in Romania and realise that if the partying doesn''t kill them, the vampires just might!', 'Spoof horror in which a group of college kids do a semester abroad in Romania and realise that if the partying doesn''t kill them, the vampires just might!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qup755rk1zDeNmQrYOJg3B45ik.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37190'),
  ('96944188135110317', 'Transylvania', 2006, 'Drama', 'Tony Gatlif, Céline Bozon', 'Tony Gatlif', 'Asia Argento, Amira Casar, Alexandra Beaujard, Birol Ünel, Morgan, Bea Palya', null, 'Zingarina arrives in Transylavania, accompanied by her close friend Marie and her guide and interpreter Luminitsa. She is not there only to visit this region of Romania but to trace her lover Milan, a musician who has made her pregnant and who left her without a word of explanation. When she finds him back, he brutally rejects her and Zingarina is terribly upset. She leaves her two companions and having become a wreck she hardly survives by following a wandering little girl. Her destiny changes for the best when she meets Tchangalo, a traveling trader...', 'Zingarina arrives in Transylavania, accompanied by her close friend Marie and her guide and interpreter Luminitsa. She is not there only to visit this region of Romania but to trace her lover Milan, a musician who has made her pregnant and who left her without a word of explanation. When she finds him back, he brutally rejects her and Zingarina is terribly upset. She leaves her two companions and having become a wreck she hardly survives by following a wandering little girl. Her destiny changes for the best when she meets Tchangalo, a traveling trader...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6FJHhhi1sHtimPTLdaC4c2gNUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32604'),
  ('154108279906037697', 'Transylvania 6-5000', 1963, 'Animation, Comedy, Horror', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, 'Mel Blanc, Ben Frommer, Julie Bennett', 'G', 'Bugs is given a room for the night at the castle of Count Bloodcount in Transylvania.', 'Bugs is given a room for the night at the castle of Count Bloodcount in Transylvania.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3A4sVoAdOJFmxmxxwyc5dvQHOSt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84604'),
  ('1045874061528093589', 'Transylvania 6-5000', 1985, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Rudy De Luca, Tomislav Pinter', 'Rudy De Luca', 'Jeff Goldblum, Joseph Bologna, Ed Begley Jr., Carol Kane, Jeffrey Jones, John Byner, Geena Davis, Michael Richards', 'PG', 'Two reporters travel to a strange castle in Transylvania to investigate the apparent reappearance of Frankenstein, and encounter the sensitive Wolfman, the Vampiress Odette and a whole cast of other weirdos.', 'Two reporters travel to a strange castle in Transylvania to investigate the apparent reappearance of Frankenstein, and encounter the sensitive Wolfman, the Vampiress Odette and a whole cast of other weirdos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Avsb4cCfGdPrd6gt94EOG4pLgr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25133'),
  ('688825045637989736', 'Transylvania Twist', 1989, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Horror', 'Jim Wynorski, Zoran Hochstätter', 'R.J. Robertson, Jim Wynorski', 'Robert Vaughn, Teri Copley, Steve Altman, Ace Mask, Angus Scrimm, Steve Franken, Monique Gabrielle, Howard Morris', 'PG', 'The nephew of a librarian must go collect a 200 year old book, "The Book of Ulthar." that should have never been checked out by the Evil Count Orlock cause one of the spells in it could bring about the end of the world. During his trip to the castle, he meets Marissa, a gorgeous rock star and heir to the castle''s fortune. There they must confront the only other heir to the fortune and the book, Uncle Byron; and Uncle Byron and his 3 adopted nieces all have very, very, very broad smile.', 'The nephew of a librarian must go collect a 200 year old book, "The Book of Ulthar." that should have never been checked out by the Evil Count Orlock cause one of the spells in it could bring about the end of the world. During his trip to the castle, he meets Marissa, a gorgeous rock star and heir to the castle''s fortune. There they must confront the only other heir to the fortune and the book, Uncle Byron; and Uncle Byron and his 3 adopted nieces all have very, very, very broad smile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3I1aw7fevBGx3F4h94mMhmW4Gk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92787'),
  ('321046977114194116', 'Trap', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Bong Man-dae', 'Bong Man-dae', 'Yu Ha-jun, Kang Yong-Kyu, Jo Soo-jung, Jung Min-gyeol, Na Sang-Gyoo, Lee Sa-gang', null, 'Jeong-min, a scenario writer, was recently dumped by his girlfriend who left for another man. No matter how much he begs she never seems to return to him. To forget everything and concentrate on his scenario, Jeong-min stays in a small inn in a remote country town. There he meets an attractive teenage girl, Yoo-mi who lives with the mysterious landlord.', 'Jeong-min, a scenario writer, was recently dumped by his girlfriend who left for another man. No matter how much he begs she never seems to return to him. To forget everything and concentrate on his scenario, Jeong-min stays in a small inn in a remote country town. There he meets an attractive teenage girl, Yoo-mi who lives with the mysterious landlord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RcPQi0oMnmLbEaS54m7K6AvyNS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400823'),
  ('105881384986315602', 'Trap', 2024, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'M. Night Shyamalan, Sayombhu Mukdeeprom, Tyler Delben', 'M. Night Shyamalan', 'Josh Hartnett, Ariel Donoghue, Saleka Night Shyamalan, Alison Pill, Hayley Mills, Jonathan Langdon, Mark Bacolcol, Marnie McPhail', 'PG-13', 'A father and teen daughter attend a pop concert, where they realize they''re at the center of a dark and sinister event.', 'A father and teen daughter attend a pop concert, where they realize they''re at the center of a dark and sinister event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwoaKYVqPgYemFpaANL941EF94R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032823'),
  ('99033644166132202', 'Trap Happy', 1946, 'Comedy, Animation', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'William Hanna', 'NR', 'Tom calls the exterminators, but they send a cat, who despite his various tools, doesn''t fare much better than Tom usually does.', 'Tom calls the exterminators, but they send a cat, who despite his various tools, doesn''t fare much better than Tom usually does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kck80r7FSp0EpBO7ffpL6toEd4j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40250'),
  ('284343960961111046', 'Trap Happy Porky', 1945, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Porky can''t sleep because mice demolish his plates. A cat offers help and gets the mice out, but invites some friends so Porky still can''t sleep.', 'Porky can''t sleep because mice demolish his plates. A cat offers help and gets the mice out, but invites some friends so Porky still can''t sleep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MnirtkaaUopebEk2eM8aC17fkZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236972'),
  ('119459257734007345', 'Trap House', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Michael Dowse, Matt Flannery', 'Gary Scott Thompson, Tom O''Connor', 'Dave Bautista, Jack Champion, Sophia Lillis, Whitney Peak, Bobby Cannavale, Kate del Castillo, Tony Dalton, Inde Navarrette', 'R', 'An undercover DEA agent and his partner embark on a game of cat and mouse with an audacious, and surprising group of thieves – their own rebellious teenagers, who have begun robbing from a dangerous cartel, using their parents'' tactics and top-secret intel to do it.', 'An undercover DEA agent and his partner embark on a game of cat and mouse with an audacious, and surprising group of thieves – their own rebellious teenagers, who have begun robbing from a dangerous cartel, using their parents'' tactics and top-secret intel to do it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tpAPeuuqbVnYWWPoOLEDLSBU7a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:628847'),
  ('1120915095845934414', 'Trap Street', 2013, 'Drama', 'Vivian Qu', 'Vivian Qu', 'Lü Yulai, He Wenchao, Zhao Xiaofei, Hou Yong', null, 'Qiuming is a trainee at a digital mapping company. His job is to survey the streets of the ever-changing city and keep the mapping system up to date. Typical of his generation, Qiuming is upbeat, energetic, and totally immersed in the world of Internet and video games. To make ends meet, he installs video cameras at public venues, but hides his side job from his strict father who is a senior editor of a government-run magazine. One day while out surveying, Qiuming has a brief encounter with an attractive woman who disappears into a secluded alley. He soon learns that the data he collected of this alley cannot register in his company''s mapping system. He goes back to the area for a second survey...', 'Qiuming is a trainee at a digital mapping company. His job is to survey the streets of the ever-changing city and keep the mapping system up to date. Typical of his generation, Qiuming is upbeat, energetic, and totally immersed in the world of Internet and video games. To make ends meet, he installs video cameras at public venues, but hides his side job from his strict father who is a senior editor of a government-run magazine. One day while out surveying, Qiuming has a brief encounter with an attractive woman who disappears into a secluded alley. He soon learns that the data he collected of this alley cannot register in his company''s mapping system. He goes back to the area for a second survey...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kxfumrX18soXy5DIR1MePjTaPj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217427'),
  ('1150245929788346715', 'Trap.com', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'José Alvarenga Jr., Rafael Salgado, Nonato Estrela', 'Bruno Mazzeo, Rosana Ferrão', 'Bruno Mazzeo, Fernanda Paes Leme, Carol Castro, Fabiula Nascimento, Luis Miranda, Serjão Loroza, Augusto Madeira, Fúlvio Stefanini', null, 'Exposed by his girlfriend through a video on the Internet, Bruno tries to revive his reputation, but all he can do is get into a series of traps (Cilada, in Portuguese). Cilada.com is a comedy about love and betrayal that shows the power of the Internet to transform small intimacies and slips in fame and constraints globalized.', 'Exposed by his girlfriend through a video on the Internet, Bruno tries to revive his reputation, but all he can do is get into a series of traps (Cilada, in Portuguese). Cilada.com is a comedy about love and betrayal that shows the power of the Internet to transform small intimacies and slips in fame and constraints globalized.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCTh6jL9fd39Zu65Af5lnlHg0uw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69938'),
  ('943306220799460162', 'Trapeze', 1956, 'Drama, Romance', 'Carol Reed, Robert Krasker, Michel Romanoff', 'Ben Hecht, Wolf Mankowitz', 'Burt Lancaster, Tony Curtis, Gina Lollobrigida, Katy Jurado, Thomas Gomez, Johnny Puleo, Minor Watson, Gérard Landry', 'NR', 'A pair of men try to perform the dangerous "triple" in their trapeze act. Problems arise when the duo is made into a trio following the addition of a sexy female performer.', 'A pair of men try to perform the dangerous "triple" in their trapeze act. Problems arise when the duo is made into a trio following the addition of a sexy female performer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3EZKz21OMvvyYg3UqZ3BBzHjWiq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40494'),
  ('1049534154495227782', 'Trapezium', 2024, 'Animation, Drama, Music', 'Masahiro Shinohara, Katsuaki Miyaji, Kerorira', 'Yuko Kakihara', 'Asaki Yuikawa, Hina Youmiya, Reina Ueda, Haruka Aikawa, Syoya Kimata, Teruyoshi Uchimura, Kazumi Takayama, Nanase Nishino', 'NR', 'High school student Yu Azuma will do whatever it takes to become an idol. Ready to make her dream a reality, she recruits three girls from the four corners of her prefecture. But the road to stardom hides unexpected trials.', 'High school student Yu Azuma will do whatever it takes to become an idol. Ready to make her dream a reality, she recruits three girls from the four corners of her prefecture. But the road to stardom hides unexpected trials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZCmOxnnwrQjEU5s0CGZHUOqkLV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1216623'),
  ('174725675045134427', 'Trapito', 1975, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Manuel García Ferré', 'Manuel García Ferré', 'Pelusa Suero, Enrique Conlazo, Marcelo Chimento, Susana Sisto, Norma Esteban, Mario Gian, Néstor D''Alessandro, Liliana Mamone', null, 'On a stormy night, Trapito the scarecrow saves Salapin the sparrow''s life. Salapin is very grateful and makes Trapito believe that he can move from his place. Together they go to the patriarch of birds who ascertains that Trapito has no fantasy. Therefore Salapin will be his fantasy. After that, they meet Largirucho, a clumsy farmer. They become friends and go to the city to sell cheese. From the money they''re going to eat in a restaurant. When Largirucho discovers his money is stolen and can''t pay, the cook keeps his pig. He must pay within 7 days or the cook will slaughter the pig. Their adventures start when they''re finding a job.', 'On a stormy night, Trapito the scarecrow saves Salapin the sparrow''s life. Salapin is very grateful and makes Trapito believe that he can move from his place. Together they go to the patriarch of birds who ascertains that Trapito has no fantasy. Therefore Salapin will be his fantasy. After that, they meet Largirucho, a clumsy farmer. They become friends and go to the city to sell cheese. From the money they''re going to eat in a restaurant. When Largirucho discovers his money is stolen and can''t pay, the cook keeps his pig. He must pay within 7 days or the cook will slaughter the pig. Their adventures start when they''re finding a job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFKLGKMIPQVPi6entlTnubx9OPD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65544'),
  ('496549489131616993', 'Trapped', 1949, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Richard Fleischer, Guy Roe, Irving Friedman', 'George Zuckerman, Earl Felton', 'Lloyd Bridges, Barbara Payton, John Hoyt, James Todd, Russ Conway, Robert Karnes, Jay C. Flippen, Lucille Barkley', null, 'Secret Service agents make a deal with a counterfeiting inmate to be released on early parole if he will help them recover some bogus moneymaking plates, but he plans to double-cross them.', 'Secret Service agents make a deal with a counterfeiting inmate to be released on early parole if he will help them recover some bogus moneymaking plates, but he plans to double-cross them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LWy5kjUhBGH1sN4CLQCVq9IjhF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29260'),
  ('267267927142181670', 'Trapped', 1974, 'Action, Drama, TV Movie', 'Frank De Felitta, Fred Mandl', 'Frank De Felitta', 'James Brolin, Susan Clark, Earl Holliman, Robert Hooks, Bob Hastings, Ivy Jones, Tammy Harrington, Marco López', null, 'A man is accidentally locked in a department store overnight and finds himself held at bay by six vicious Doberman guard dogs.', 'A man is accidentally locked in a department store overnight and finds himself held at bay by six vicious Doberman guard dogs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwkOhN9NqTtSoerNPBvtAGkEiNJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133174'),
  ('441115311970948444', 'Trapped', 1982, 'Crime, Adventure, Thriller, Horror, Action', 'William Fruet, Mark Irwin, David Bailey', 'John Beaird', 'Henry Silva, Nicholas Campbell, Barbara Gordon, Gina Dick, Joy Thompson, Ralph Benmergui, Sam Malkin, Stuart Culpepper', 'R', 'A group of college students accidentally see a local redneck kill his wife''s lover. A deadly game of cat-and-mouse ensues, with the students trying to escape the area while the killer sets out to eliminate the witnesses who can tie him to the murder.', 'A group of college students accidentally see a local redneck kill his wife''s lover. A deadly game of cat-and-mouse ensues, with the students trying to escape the area while the killer sets out to eliminate the witnesses who can tie him to the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gxaBCqX1eADOHcrauT9LdkZ6gg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47410'),
  ('624317713386978554', 'Trapped', 1989, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Fred Walton, George Koblasa', 'Fred Walton, Steve Feke', 'Kathleen Quinlan, Bruce Abbott, Katy Boyer, Ben Loggins, Tyrees Allen, Miles Mutchler, Wirt Cain, Bill Whitehead', null, 'A businesswoman and a corporate spy, locked in a high-rise building after dark, must outwit a murderous intruder.', 'A businesswoman and a corporate spy, locked in a high-rise building after dark, must outwit a murderous intruder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUjhyRBh2tp8c2DcUpha8ThwIB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86793'),
  ('1039685694618697666', 'Trapped', 2002, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Luis Mandoki, Piotr Sobociński, Frederick Elmes', 'Greg Iles', 'Charlize Theron, Courtney Love, Stuart Townsend, Kevin Bacon, Pruitt Taylor Vince, Dakota Fanning, Steve Rankin, Garry Chalk', 'R', 'When their daughter is abducted by experienced kidnappers, the Jennings turn the tables on their seemingly fool-proof plan.', 'When their daughter is abducted by experienced kidnappers, the Jennings turn the tables on their seemingly fool-proof plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sujD0KP5O90TXAWrTjqDPBTnfQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9039'),
  ('1118302649075104738', 'Trapped', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Vikramaditya Motwane, Siddharth Diwan', 'Amit Joshi, Vikramaditya Motwane', 'Rajkummar Rao, Geetanjali Thapa, Khushboo Upadhyay', null, 'A man gets stuck in an empty high rise without food, water or electricity.', 'A man gets stuck in an empty high rise without food, water or electricity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bkavKb2CIIJJqOx6Ta1QwBwUKqu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431892'),
  ('363666338383081909', 'Trapped', 2025, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Zhang Qi, Wang Jiehong, Li Junting', 'Sun Yue, Zhang Qi', 'White-K, Xin Baiqing, Lang Yueting, Geng Le, Sun Ning, Li Xiaochuan, Zhang Benyu, Zhuo Jie Zeren', null, 'In 1995, the year before the comprehensive gun ban policy was implemented, the tranquility of Mangya Town was shattered. A notorious bandit leader, who had hidden a massive treasure, broke out of prison. Forty-three ruthless outlaws gathered from all directions, joining their leader, Beishan, in blockading Mangya by force. The entire town was plunged into a desperate crisis—cut off from fuel and communication! The bandits wanted both money and lives. Gunfire erupted across Mangya as a massive sandstorm loomed on the horizon. Facing impossible odds—one gun against eighty-eight—the gang also turned on each other in a brutal "dog-eat-dog" power struggle. Surrounded by enemies, with sandstorms blotting out the sun and death hanging by a thread—how can they turn the tide?', 'In 1995, the year before the comprehensive gun ban policy was implemented, the tranquility of Mangya Town was shattered. A notorious bandit leader, who had hidden a massive treasure, broke out of prison. Forty-three ruthless outlaws gathered from all directions, joining their leader, Beishan, in blockading Mangya by force. The entire town was plunged into a desperate crisis—cut off from fuel and communication! The bandits wanted both money and lives. Gunfire erupted across Mangya as a massive sandstorm loomed on the horizon. Facing impossible odds—one gun against eighty-eight—the gang also turned on each other in a brutal "dog-eat-dog" power struggle. Surrounded by enemies, with sandstorms blotting out the sun and death hanging by a thread—how can they turn the tide?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmIqkyXhlgcaSb1S8zJsLQwGBls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1454800'),
  ('274495216557445709', 'Trapped Alive', 1988, 'Drama, Horror', 'Leszek Burzynski, Nancy Schreiber', 'Leszek Burzynski, Julian Weaver', 'Alex Kubik, Elizabeth Kent, Cameron Mitchell, Mark Witsken, Sullivan Hester, Michael Nash, Laura Kalison, Paul Dean', null, 'A sheriff''s deputy, some escaped prisoners and two young girls find themselves trapped in a mine shaft where a cannibalistic mutant is hunting them for food.', 'A sheriff''s deputy, some escaped prisoners and two young girls find themselves trapped in a mine shaft where a cannibalistic mutant is hunting them for food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DCtNZN60WjrmqH7OPlS2KDcs8C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83821'),
