  ('151113697137787510', 'Trapped by Fear', 1960, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jacques Dupont', 'Roger Ribadeau-Dumas, Jean Bassan', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Alexandra Stewart, Claude Brasseur, Sylva Koscina, Eva Damien, Sady Rebbot, Jacques Jouanneau, Yves Brainville', null, 'Paul, a reporter and photographer, comes to the rescue of Laurent, his old army companion in Algeria, who while being pursued in a stolen car has accidentally killed a police officer on a motorcycle.', 'Paul, a reporter and photographer, comes to the rescue of Laurent, his old army companion in Algeria, who while being pursued in a stolen car has accidentally killed a police officer on a motorcycle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fr7BMvxQUVNoe3NXmo5Vph1o384.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133845'),
  ('221433865347640410', 'Trapped in Paradise', 1994, 'Comedy, Crime, Adventure, Romance', 'George Gallo, Jack N. Green, Martin Walters', 'George Gallo', 'Nicolas Cage, Jon Lovitz, Dana Carvey, Mädchen Amick, Florence Stanley, Donald Moffat, Angela Paton, John Ashton', 'PG-13', 'Residents of a friendly Pennsylvania town foil three brothers'' plan to rob a bank on Christmas Eve.', 'Residents of a friendly Pennsylvania town foil three brothers'' plan to rob a bank on Christmas Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8SyaIUq9d83ZNAwsvVo6TrOA2U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23719'),
  ('859460347599354920', 'Trapped in Space', 1994, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Arthur Allan Seidelman, Nino Gaetano Martinetti', null, 'Jack Wagner, Jack Coleman, Craig Wasson, Sigrid Thornton, Kay Lenz, Kevin Colson, Mark Lee, Kevin Copeland', null, 'After an accident during a routine trip to Venus, a spaceship has only enough oxygen left for three people... out of five on board.', 'After an accident during a routine trip to Venus, a spaceship has only enough oxygen left for three people... out of five on board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lFOR2cp0dSqoeshkzyOLCZPZee.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47412'),
  ('839131738093761723', 'Traps', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Věra Chytilová, Štěpán Kučera, Bohdan Sláma', 'Eva Kačírková', 'Zuzana Stivínová, Miroslav Donutil, Tomáš Hanák, Milan Lasica, Kateřina Hajná, Eva Holubová, Luboš Svoboda, Daniela Třebická', null, 'After two troubled but powerful men rape a young hitchhiker who happens to be a vet, she drugs them and removes their testicles.', 'After two troubled but powerful men rape a young hitchhiker who happens to be a vet, she drugs them and removes their testicles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sclZgTwsyvDEmFmzNsENYLiamOc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49975'),
  ('984495691615743339', 'Tras-os-Montes', 1976, 'Documentary', 'Margarida Cordeiro, António Reis, Acácio de Almeida', null, 'Albino S. Pedro, Carlos Margarido, Mariana Margarido, Luís Felipe Ferreira, Armando Manuel, Rosalía Comba, Rui Ferreira, Natalia Soeiro', null, 'The first feature in António Reis and Margarida Cordeiro’s trilogy is a journey through this almost mythical region of north-east Portugal, a tapestry of micronarratives where past, present and future become intertwined.', 'The first feature in António Reis and Margarida Cordeiro’s trilogy is a journey through this almost mythical region of north-east Portugal, a tapestry of micronarratives where past, present and future become intertwined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SpExnhCADsKa5q6y4GeCojP4kH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186967'),
  ('86970958481836027', 'Trash', 1970, 'Drama', 'Paul Morrissey, Paul Morrissey', 'Paul Morrissey', 'Joe Dallesandro, Holly Woodlawn, Geri Miller, Andrea Feldman, John Putnam, Jane Forth, Bruce Pecheur, Diane Podel', 'NR', 'The movie follows Joe, a heroin addict, throughout his quest to score more drugs. The episodic plot occurs over a single day and centers on Joe''s problematic relationship with his on-off, sexually frustrated girlfriend. During the course of the day, Joe overdoses in front of an upper-class couple, attempts to fool Welfare into approving his methadone treatment by having Holly fake a pregnancy, and frustrates the women in his life with his drug-induced impotence.', 'The movie follows Joe, a heroin addict, throughout his quest to score more drugs. The episodic plot occurs over a single day and centers on Joe''s problematic relationship with his on-off, sexually frustrated girlfriend. During the course of the day, Joe overdoses in front of an upper-class couple, attempts to fool Welfare into approving his methadone treatment by having Holly fake a pregnancy, and frustrates the women in his life with his drug-induced impotence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQAICaVkVQoeCAQLNbrVng6WVt0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89199'),
  ('773422455731713929', 'Trash', 2014, 'Adventure, Crime, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Stephen Daldry, Adriano Goldman, Christian Duurvoort', 'Richard Curtis', 'Rickson Tevez, Eduardo Luís, Gabriel Weinstein, Wagner Moura, Selton Mello, Rooney Mara, Martin Sheen, Maria Eduarda Lima Botelho', 'R', 'Set in Brazil, three kids who make a discovery in a garbage dump soon find themselves running from the cops and trying to right a terrible wrong.', 'Set in Brazil, three kids who make a discovery in a garbage dump soon find themselves running from the cops and trying to right a terrible wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31iTD5hlbcRpPonuxSp77GxRGQf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206563'),
  ('1152457088276169061', 'Trash Fire', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Richard Bates Jr., Shane Daly', 'Richard Bates Jr.', 'Adrian Grenier, Angela Trimbur, Fionnula Flanagan, AnnaLynne McCord, Sally Kirkland, Matthew Gray Gubler, Ray Santiago, Ezra Buzzington', 'R', 'Owen and Isabel''s love story simmers with spiteful rage and unfortunately for everyone, Isabel is pregnant with Owen''s child. To prove to her that he can become a stable father, Owen agrees to reconnect with his only living relatives at Isabel''s request. The couple take a trip to visit his perversely devoted grandmother and his sister Pearl, who was severely burned in a fire, to finally bury the hatchet. But sometimes the ties that bind can cut off all circulation.', 'Owen and Isabel''s love story simmers with spiteful rage and unfortunately for everyone, Isabel is pregnant with Owen''s child. To prove to her that he can become a stable father, Owen agrees to reconnect with his only living relatives at Isabel''s request. The couple take a trip to visit his perversely devoted grandmother and his sister Pearl, who was severely burned in a fire, to finally bury the hatchet. But sometimes the ties that bind can cut off all circulation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JH49NYwWTV2U1foK06KKXYllmm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362409'),
  ('971144685694684253', 'Trash Humpers', 2010, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Harmony Korine, Michael Carter, Ryan Za', 'Harmony Korine', 'Rachel Anna Simon, Brian Kotzur, Travis Nicholson, Harmony Korine, Seth Petterson, Charlie Ezell, Crystal Paige, Jennifer Paige', 'NR', 'Follow a small group of elderly “Peeping Toms” through the shadows and margins of an unfamiliar world. Crudely documented by the participants themselves, we follow the debased and shocking actions of a group of true sociopaths the likes of which have never been seen before. Inhabiting a world of broken dreams and beyond the limits of morality, they crash against a torn and frayed America.', 'Follow a small group of elderly “Peeping Toms” through the shadows and margins of an unfamiliar world. Crudely documented by the participants themselves, we follow the debased and shocking actions of a group of true sociopaths the likes of which have never been seen before. Inhabiting a world of broken dreams and beyond the limits of morality, they crash against a torn and frayed America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atHje2Vx9Ibp2HT7bAGOAPyyJ1T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46788'),
  ('1104457020262937571', 'Trash: La Leggenda Della Piramide Magica', 2020, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Luca Della Grotta, Davide Pagliaro, Francesco Dafano', 'Francesco Dafano, Andrea Nobile', 'Christian Iansante, Roberto Stocchi, Alessandro Carloni, Luca Dal Fabbro, Giò Giò Rapattoni, Pasquale Anselmo, Emanuela Rossi, Dario Penne', null, 'Even trash has a soul and deserves a second chance. This is what the legend of the Magic Pyramid promises: a legendary place where trash can have a second chance and become Carriers, useful objects once again. Slim, a cardboard box, has finally given up and no longer believes that people like him are given another chance, until an unexpected event changes his fate.', 'Even trash has a soul and deserves a second chance. This is what the legend of the Magic Pyramid promises: a legendary place where trash can have a second chance and become Carriers, useful objects once again. Slim, a cardboard box, has finally given up and no longer believes that people like him are given another chance, until an unexpected event changes his fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rsVvneSdja3zoQx45p9jdBkooA3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:673748'),
  ('405902103672367425', 'Trauma', 1978, 'Horror, Drama', 'León Klimovsky, Andrés Vich, Pablo Ripoll', 'Juan José Porto, Carlos Puerto', 'Ágata Lys, Heinrich Starhemberg, Isabel Pisano, Antonio Mayans, Ricardo Merino, Sandra Alberti, Irene Foster, Aparicio Rivero', 'NR', 'Daniel, a writer seeking seclusion to work on his new book, finds himself stranded at a rural bed and breakfast run by a strange and prudish young woman and her ailing, wheelchair-bound husband who remains shut in his room all day. As night falls, a psychotic, razor-wielding killer begins stalking the bed and breakfast, brutally slashing the throats of its most sex-crazed guests, whose bodies and luggage then mysteriously disappear the following morning...', 'Daniel, a writer seeking seclusion to work on his new book, finds himself stranded at a rural bed and breakfast run by a strange and prudish young woman and her ailing, wheelchair-bound husband who remains shut in his room all day. As night falls, a psychotic, razor-wielding killer begins stalking the bed and breakfast, brutally slashing the throats of its most sex-crazed guests, whose bodies and luggage then mysteriously disappear the following morning...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kO1gKeYWN5ziMFy3ka94fxSDwx9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28487'),
  ('109957869154405670', 'Trauma', 1980, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Gianni Martucci, Angelo Bevilacqua', 'Alessandro Capone, Gaetano Russo', 'Gaetano Russo, Domitilla Cavazza, Roberto Posse, Timothy Wood, Franco Diogene, Per Holgher, Silvia Mauri, Anna Maria Chiatante', null, 'A couple invites some friends to spend a weekend together in an isolated cabin surrounded by woods and fields. But... there''s a killer lurking around.... And... someone is monitoring him.', 'A couple invites some friends to spend a weekend together in an isolated cabin surrounded by woods and fields. But... there''s a killer lurking around.... And... someone is monitoring him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYy3BhrqrKK7vBFz3IgiaKyV6gE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85180'),
  ('966535816375915877', 'Trauma', 1993, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Dario Argento, Rod Smith, Raffaele Mertes', 'Dario Argento, T.E.D. Klein', 'Christopher Rydell, Asia Argento, Piper Laurie, Frederic Forrest, Laura Johnson, Dominique Serrand, James Russo, Brad Dourif', 'R', 'A young Romanian woman and a recovering drug addict launch an unlikely investigation after her parents are murdered by a vicious serial killer known as The Headhunter.', 'A young Romanian woman and a recovering drug addict launch an unlikely investigation after her parents are murdered by a vicious serial killer known as The Headhunter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9lheNDXPb4HS0g2RQu2rUD98V5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44435'),
  ('176892359938689254', 'Trauma', 2004, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Marc Evans, John Mathieson', 'Richard Smith', 'Colin Firth, Mena Suvari, Naomie Harris, Sean Harris, Neil Edmond, Kenneth Cranham, Martin Hancock, Tommy Flanagan', null, 'Awaking from a coma to discover his wife has been killed in a car accident, Ben''s world may as well have come to an end. A few weeks later, Ben''s out of hospital and, attempting to start a new life, he moves home and is befriended by a beautiful young neighbour Charlotte. His life may be turning around but all is not what it seems and, haunted by visions of his dead wife, Ben starts to lose his grip on reality.', 'Awaking from a coma to discover his wife has been killed in a car accident, Ben''s world may as well have come to an end. A few weeks later, Ben''s out of hospital and, attempting to start a new life, he moves home and is befriended by a beautiful young neighbour Charlotte. His life may be turning around but all is not what it seems and, haunted by visions of his dead wife, Ben starts to lose his grip on reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9uFGgQYmyhGFhwRM9jZuIlYAiu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20357'),
  ('144424091195855574', 'Trauma', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Lucio A. Rojas, Sebastián Ballek, Diego Escobar', 'Lucio A. Rojas', 'Catalina Martin, Macarena Carrere, Daniel Antivilo, Ximena del Solar, Dominga Bofill, Felipe Ríos, Eduardo Paxeco, Claudio Riveros', 'R', 'Four friends visit a rural locality of Chile, are brutally attacked by a man and his son. After not finding help in the town, they decide to confront these men with the help of a pair of policemen. But in this way, they will discover that their attackers have in their blood the direct legacy of the darkest period of Chilean history and will have to face the most brutal enemy.', 'Four friends visit a rural locality of Chile, are brutally attacked by a man and his son. After not finding help in the town, they decide to confront these men with the help of a pair of policemen. But in this way, they will discover that their attackers have in their blood the direct legacy of the darkest period of Chilean history and will have to face the most brutal enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbtU44cXUa57LV4rCIVuFBSBRql.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469722'),
  ('184165266327095552', 'Trauma Center', 2019, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jonathan Southard, Lucía Castellano Vega, Matt Eskandari', 'Paul J. Da Silva', 'Nicky Whelan, Bruce Willis, Steve Guttenberg, Tito Ortiz, Texas Battle, Roman Mitichyan, Tyler Jon Olson, Catherine Davis', 'R', 'Lt. Wakes is a vengeful police detective determined to solve the murders of his partner and an informant, and joins forces with a witness injured during the shootings. After the killers pursue the witness across the abandoned floor of a hospital, she confirms Wakes''s worst fears.', 'Lt. Wakes is a vengeful police detective determined to solve the murders of his partner and an informant, and joins forces with a witness injured during the shootings. After the killers pursue the witness across the abandoned floor of a hospital, she confirms Wakes''s worst fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8K73wvCTBA3XKgZTtOZWgENUnis.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:641790'),
  ('560154763334845478', 'Trauzeugen', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Finn Christoph Stroeks', null, 'Edin Hasanović, Cristina do Rego, Almila Bağrıaçık, László Branko Breiding, Luise Schnittert, Thomas Bartling, Sarina Radomski, Stefan Wendel', null, 'A divorce lawyer and a couples therapist, both completely different, must, as witnesses, save their best friends'' wedding at all costs.', 'A divorce lawyer and a couples therapist, both completely different, must, as witnesses, save their best friends'' wedding at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qEKarvqSloh0oVD2UuuOkxXpZl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005003'),
  ('957156217047975435', 'Travelers', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Koichi Sakamoto', 'Sotaro Hayashi', 'Kenji Ebisawa, Sanae Hitomi, Ayumi Kinoshita, Nao Nagasawa, Koji Nakamura, Kentarō Shimazu, Yuko Takayama, Kohei Yamamoto', null, 'Ten years have passed since the discovery of inter-cosmic travel. The existence of three parallel worlds have been confirmed. What happens in one cosmos, even the slightest incident, can create a “butterfly effect” that influences events in the other worlds. In response to these discoveries, the “Dimension Police” and “Space Guardian Academy” are formed. The beautiful female investigator Ai is the Space Guardian Academy’s top agent. Along with her trusted android partner, Bridge, she has been assigned to eliminate the inter-cosmic terrorist group DOUBT. Amidst the struggle, Ai finds herself challenged like she never has been before when allies become enemies, enemies become allies, and the mastermind behind the evil plot is revealed.', 'Ten years have passed since the discovery of inter-cosmic travel. The existence of three parallel worlds have been confirmed. What happens in one cosmos, even the slightest incident, can create a “butterfly effect” that influences events in the other worlds. In response to these discoveries, the “Dimension Police” and “Space Guardian Academy” are formed. The beautiful female investigator Ai is the Space Guardian Academy’s top agent. Along with her trusted android partner, Bridge, she has been assigned to eliminate the inter-cosmic terrorist group DOUBT. Amidst the struggle, Ai finds herself challenged like she never has been before when allies become enemies, enemies become allies, and the mastermind behind the evil plot is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/li0Q8JSIL3AIWhYsMMmmzy79U0Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219887'),
  ('224235093364267013', 'Travelin'' Band: Creedence Clearwater Revival at the Royal Albert Hall', 2022, 'Documentary, Music', 'Bob Smeaton', null, 'Jeff Bridges, John Fogerty, Tom Fogerty, Stu Cook, Doug Clifford', null, 'Featuring never-before-seen concert footage and narration by Jeff Bridges, this documentary explores CCR''s humble origins and meteoric rise. It includes the entire set recorded at the Royal Albert Hall on April 14th, 1970.', 'Featuring never-before-seen concert footage and narration by Jeff Bridges, this documentary explores CCR''s humble origins and meteoric rise. It includes the entire set recorded at the Royal Albert Hall on April 14th, 1970.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1GRQ4m3yJlsC6i5Yb0waqbSPAH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1025029'),
  ('1088205695225382358', 'Traveling Companion', 1996, 'Drama', 'Peter Del Monte', 'Claudia Sbarigia, Gloria Malatesta', 'Asia Argento, Michel Piccoli, Lino Capolicchio, Silvia Cohen, Max Malatesta, Chantal Ughi, Patrizia Pezza', null, 'In Rome, Cora is a waitress at a club, walks people''s dogs, sleeps with various men, kips with pals, and has a salty tongue.', 'In Rome, Cora is a waitress at a club, walks people''s dogs, sleeps with various men, kips with pals, and has a salty tongue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJabisikceAzfCMNhmit8dWGOZS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239567'),
  ('735319253687905479', 'Traveller', 1997, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jack N. Green, Donald Murphy, Jim Flowers', 'Jim McGlynn', 'Bill Paxton, Mark Wahlberg, Julianna Margulies, James Gammon, Nikki DeLoach, Luke Askew, Danielle Keaton, Andrew Porter', 'R', 'A young man, Pat, visits the clan of gypsy-like grifters (Irish Travellers) in rural North Carolina from whom he is descended. He is at first rejected, but cousin Bokky takes him on as an apprentice. Pat learns the game while Bokky falls in love and desires a different life.', 'A young man, Pat, visits the clan of gypsy-like grifters (Irish Travellers) in rural North Carolina from whom he is descended. He is at first rejected, but cousin Bokky takes him on as an apprentice. Pat learns the game while Bokky falls in love and desires a different life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgRravjx1m3guWa9otsizIbEJXx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31465'),
  ('996000511387617631', 'Travellers and Magicians', 2003, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Khyentse Norbu, Alan Kozlowski', 'Khyentse Norbu', 'Tshewang Dendup, Sonam Lhamo, Dasho Adab Sangye, Ap Dochu, Sonam Kinga, Dechen Dorjee, Lhakpa Dorji, Deki Yangzom', null, 'A young government official, named Dondup, who is smitten with America (he even has a denim gho) dreams of escaping there while stuck in a beautiful but isolated village. He hopes to connect in the U.S. with a visa out of the country. He misses the one bus out of town to Thimphu, however, and is forced to hitchhike and walk along the Lateral Road to the west, accompanied by an apple seller, a Buddhist monk with his ornate, dragon-headed dramyin, a drunk, a widowed rice paper maker, and his beautiful daughter, Sonam.', 'A young government official, named Dondup, who is smitten with America (he even has a denim gho) dreams of escaping there while stuck in a beautiful but isolated village. He hopes to connect in the U.S. with a visa out of the country. He misses the one bus out of town to Thimphu, however, and is forced to hitchhike and walk along the Lateral Road to the west, accompanied by an apple seller, a Buddhist monk with his ornate, dragon-headed dramyin, a drunk, a widowed rice paper maker, and his beautiful daughter, Sonam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVXiPoXzeoyExzepxdv4eQQMERa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37232'),
  ('359002588067418793', 'Travelling Hawkers in Frankfurt am Main', 1932, 'Documentary', 'Ella Bergmann-Michel, Ella Bergmann-Michel', 'Ella Bergmann-Michel', null, null, 'A documentary about unemployed people who bought fruit and vegetables at moderate prices at the wholesale market and sold these in the streets of Frankfurt. Since they had no permits they were constantly with their bulky carts on the run from the police. One part of the film was shot at the fairgrounds in front of the wholesale market. Newspaper and lottery ticket vendors, propagandists offering their ware for a few pfennigs, all convey the mood of a time when need made people inventive.', 'A documentary about unemployed people who bought fruit and vegetables at moderate prices at the wholesale market and sold these in the streets of Frankfurt. Since they had no permits they were constantly with their bulky carts on the run from the police. One part of the film was shot at the fairgrounds in front of the wholesale market. Newspaper and lottery ticket vendors, propagandists offering their ware for a few pfennigs, all convey the mood of a time when need made people inventive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plh8vIWSsI4tgyOSu5yz8ZusQCw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379726'),
  ('1100870729027305337', 'Travels of Lord Mito Pt.10: Demon Naruto', 1956, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Masamitsu Igayama', 'Michihei Muramatsu', 'Ryūnosuke Tsukigata, Kunio Kaga, Tetsunosuke Tsukigata, Chizuru Kitagawa, Harumi Urazato, Hideki Tôgû, Sōji Kiyokawa, Chiaki Yamamoto', null, '10th film in the series about Lord Mito. This time, Lord Mito uncovers a conspiracy in Naruto.', '10th film in the series about Lord Mito. This time, Lord Mito uncovers a conspiracy in Naruto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JpotUv1hd5Wph5sDj9qYhrDLha.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:906367'),
