  ('908211714177836032', 'Travels with My Aunt', 1972, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'George Cukor, Douglas Slocombe, Michael Stevenson', 'Hugh Wheeler, Jay Presson Allen', 'Maggie Smith, Alec McCowen, Louis Gossett Jr., Robert Stephens, Cindy Williams, Robert Flemyng, José Luis López Vázquez, Raymond Gérôme', 'PG', 'At his mother''s funeral, stuffy bank clerk Henry Pulling meets his Aunt Augusta, an elderly eccentric with more-than-shady dealings who pulls him along on a whirlwind adventure as she attempts to rescue an old lover.', 'At his mother''s funeral, stuffy bank clerk Henry Pulling meets his Aunt Augusta, an elderly eccentric with more-than-shady dealings who pulls him along on a whirlwind adventure as she attempts to rescue an old lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bycdsCdZ7oqZsLbViWRp2fnHEg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5183'),
