  ('946979664249083828', 'Treasure', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Julia von Heinz, Daniela Knapp', 'Julia von Heinz, John Quester', 'Lena Dunham, Stephen Fry, Zbigniew Zamachowski, Iwona Bielska, Maria Mamona, Wenanty Nosul, Klara Bielawka, Magdalena Celówna-Janikowska', 'R', 'A music journalist accompanies her father, a charmingly stubborn Holocaust survivor, on a journey to his homeland. While she''s eager to make sense of her family''s past, her dad has an agenda of his own.', 'A music journalist accompanies her father, a charmingly stubborn Holocaust survivor, on a journey to his homeland. While she''s eager to make sense of her family''s past, her dad has an agenda of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDMrdPAQHjvbSxFiYrWWVE3dYrD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1220515'),
  ('289167815833117372', 'Treasure Buddies', 2012, 'Adventure, Family', 'Robert Vince, Kamal Derkaoui', 'Anna McRoberts, Robert Vince', 'Skyler Gisondo, Charles Henry Wyson, Ty Panitz, Genevieve Hannelius, Tucker Albrizzi, Richard Riehle, Edward Herrmann, Mason Cook', 'G', 'In a race against a devious cat, the Buddies and their new friends, Cammy and Babi, must avoid booby traps, solve puzzles and explore a mysterious tomb - all in search of the greatest treasure known to animalkind!', 'In a race against a devious cat, the Buddies and their new friends, Cammy and Babi, must avoid booby traps, solve puzzles and explore a mysterious tomb - all in search of the greatest treasure known to animalkind!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wNGZzH3gTmrf7k7CdQ2aQrAeOM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78047'),
  ('124300530982751232', 'Treasure Guards', 2011, 'Adventure, TV Movie', 'Iain B. MacDonald, Trevor Michael Brown, Edward Brett', 'Bev Doyle, Richard Kurti', 'Anna Friel, Raoul Bova, Florentine Lahme, Volker Bruch, André Jacobs, David Sherwood', null, 'On a dig in the remote Jordanian desert, maverick archaeologist Victoria Carter (Anna Friel) discovers an ancient scroll buried in the ruins of an old temple. It is encrypted with the location of the long lost Seal of Solomon, which, according to legend, was given to King Solomon by God himself. But this mighty treasure is also being sought by, amongst others, Victoria’s estranged father, renowned archaeologist Teddy Carter, who’s soon hot on its trail.', 'On a dig in the remote Jordanian desert, maverick archaeologist Victoria Carter (Anna Friel) discovers an ancient scroll buried in the ruins of an old temple. It is encrypted with the location of the long lost Seal of Solomon, which, according to legend, was given to King Solomon by God himself. But this mighty treasure is also being sought by, amongst others, Victoria’s estranged father, renowned archaeologist Teddy Carter, who’s soon hot on its trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oA8PBPjkEukrHad5tqbPog8z3qC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75713'),
  ('116151836185963874', 'Treasure Hunt', 1994, 'Romance, Action, Fantasy', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Jacklyn Wu Chien-Lien, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Ronald Chin Han, Choi Yue, Phillip Kwok Chui, Roy Chiao, Michael Wong', null, 'A C.I.A. agent is assigned to go to Beijing to look for a hidden "treasure," which turns out to be a woman who has supernatural powers, and is the National Treasure of China.', 'A C.I.A. agent is assigned to go to Beijing to look for a hidden "treasure," which turns out to be a woman who has supernatural powers, and is the National Treasure of China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8235MQGnG24yNvSyGuv5eK4RBB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45442'),
  ('627879110153186601', 'Treasure Hunters: On the Tracks of Khufu', 2025, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Barbara Schulz, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Jérôme Tonnerre', 'Fabrice Luchini, Julia Piaton, Gavril Dartevelle, Johann Dionnet, Camille Japy, Sam Louwyck, Vincent Heneine, Meriem Serbah', null, 'An eccentric archaeologist goes on an unexpected journey to find King Khufu''s lost treasure with his daughter and grandson.', 'An eccentric archaeologist goes on an unexpected journey to find King Khufu''s lost treasure with his daughter and grandson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLjf2OvU72F1KzJikplVgmOqWPP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1217483'),
  ('468486839417675056', 'Treasure Island', 1934, 'Adventure, Family', 'Victor Fleming, Edwin B. Willis, Douglas Shearer', 'John Lee Mahin', 'Wallace Beery, Jackie Cooper, Lionel Barrymore, Otto Kruger, Lewis Stone, Nigel Bruce, Charles ''Chic'' Sale, William V. Mong', 'NR', 'In this early film adaptation of the classic novel by Robert Louis Stevenson, young Jim Hawkins is caught up with the pirate Long John Silver in search of buccaneer Captain Flint''s buried treasure.', 'In this early film adaptation of the classic novel by Robert Louis Stevenson, young Jim Hawkins is caught up with the pirate Long John Silver in search of buccaneer Captain Flint''s buried treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gagTpKHWd9DiDtSb6hIFTAuXi0k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43605'),
  ('338091678772726858', 'Treasure Island', 1950, 'Adventure, Family', 'Byron Haskin, Freddie Young, Mark Evans', 'Lawrence Edward Watkin', 'Bobby Driscoll, Robert Newton, Basil Sydney, Walter Fitzgerald, Denis O''Dea, Finlay Currie, Ralph Truman, Geoffrey Keen', null, 'Enchanted by the idea of locating treasure buried by Captain Flint, Squire Trelawney, Dr. Livesey and Jim Hawkins charter a sailing voyage to a Caribbean island. Unfortunately, a large number of Flint''s old pirate crew are aboard the ship, including Long John Silver.', 'Enchanted by the idea of locating treasure buried by Captain Flint, Squire Trelawney, Dr. Livesey and Jim Hawkins charter a sailing voyage to a Caribbean island. Unfortunately, a large number of Flint''s old pirate crew are aboard the ship, including Long John Silver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zPzBsQZ2EhSmO9FLvQQtWVkJqRu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6646'),
  ('827871189084898902', 'Treasure Island', 1972, 'Adventure, Family', 'John Hough, Andrea Bianchi', 'Robert Louis Stevenson, Orson Welles', 'Orson Welles, Kim Burfield, Walter Slezak, Ángel del Pozo, Rik Battaglia, Lionel Stander, Maria Rohm, Paul Müller', 'G', 'Young Jim Hawkins finds himself serving with pirate captain Long John Silver in search of a buccaneer''s treasure, in this short adaptation of Robert Louis Stevenson''s classic tale.', 'Young Jim Hawkins finds himself serving with pirate captain Long John Silver in search of a buccaneer''s treasure, in this short adaptation of Robert Louis Stevenson''s classic tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37sldJSCJGJeDKo5i5C99JWD0vR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22376'),
  ('501573475056078234', 'Treasure Island', 1982, 'Adventure, Family', 'Vladimir Vorobyov, Aleksandr Chechulin', null, 'Fyodor Stukov, Vladislav Strzhelchik, Oleg Borisov, Valeriy Zolotukhin, Nikolai Karachentsov, Viktor Kostetsky, Georgiy Shtil, Konstantin Grigorev', null, 'Young Jim Hawkins is caught up with the pirate Long John Silver in search of the buried treasure of the buccaneer Captain Flint, in this adaptation of the classic novel by Robert Louis Stevenson.', 'Young Jim Hawkins is caught up with the pirate Long John Silver in search of the buried treasure of the buccaneer Captain Flint, in this adaptation of the classic novel by Robert Louis Stevenson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJo5UEVCcrmxsZMYLCP3O5u9GaQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207720'),
  ('433141052335541282', 'Treasure Island', 1986, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Raúl Ruiz, Acácio de Almeida, Philippe Grandrieux', 'Raúl Ruiz', 'Vic Tayback, Martin Landau, Anna Karina, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Sheila, Lou Castel, Jean-François Stévenin, Yves Afonso', null, 'Jim is a small child who lives in an inn run by his parents. The arrival of a strange captain to the Island they live will trouble his existence and tip him into an universe of adventures.', 'Jim is a small child who lives in an inn run by his parents. The arrival of a strange captain to the Island they live will trouble his existence and tip him into an universe of adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYsTsTJOs5Bt0BNQj5Orabfbbm9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262802'),
  ('401432232949571791', 'Treasure Island', 1990, 'Adventure, Family, TV Movie', 'Fraser Clarke Heston, Michael Stevenson, Adam Somner', 'Fraser Clarke Heston', 'Charlton Heston, Christian Bale, Oliver Reed, Christopher Lee, Richard Johnson, Julian Glover, Isla Blair, James Cosmo', 'G', 'Young Jim Hawkins, while running the Benbow Inn with his mother, meets Captain Billy Bones, who dies at the inn while it is beseiged by buccaneers led by Blind Pew. Jim and his mother fight off the attackers and discover Billy Bones'' treasure map for which the buccaneers had come. Jim agrees to sail on the S.S. Espaniola with Squire Trelawney and Dr. Livesey to find the treasure on a mysterious isiand. Upon arriving at the island, ship''s cook and scaliwag Long John Silver leads a mutiny of crew members who want the treasure for themselves. Jim helps the Squire and Espaniola officers to survive the mutiny and fight back against Silver''s men, who have taken over the Espaniola.', 'Young Jim Hawkins, while running the Benbow Inn with his mother, meets Captain Billy Bones, who dies at the inn while it is beseiged by buccaneers led by Blind Pew. Jim and his mother fight off the attackers and discover Billy Bones'' treasure map for which the buccaneers had come. Jim agrees to sail on the S.S. Espaniola with Squire Trelawney and Dr. Livesey to find the treasure on a mysterious isiand. Upon arriving at the island, ship''s cook and scaliwag Long John Silver leads a mutiny of crew members who want the treasure for themselves. Jim helps the Squire and Espaniola officers to survive the mutiny and fight back against Silver''s men, who have taken over the Espaniola.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIj8UjP9qYxQd1pLeudjmrV3PFv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26612'),
  ('565822638064414795', 'Treasure Island', 1999, 'Adventure, Family, Action', 'Peter Rowe, Marc Charlebois', 'Peter Rowe, Robert Louis Stevenson', 'Jack Palance, Kevin Zegers, Sarah Holland, Pax Lohan, Anthony Booth, Christopher Benjamin, David Robb, Patrick Bergin', 'PG-13', 'Young Jim Hawkins and peg-legged Long John Silver set sail for adventure in Robert Louis Stevenson''s classic tale of dastardly pirates, swashbuckling heroes, buried treasure and a young boy''s amazing courage. The narrative diverges from that of the novel in that Captain Smollett convinces Squire Trelawney and Doctor Livesey to cut Jim out of his rightful share of the treasure and so Jim then teams up with Silver.', 'Young Jim Hawkins and peg-legged Long John Silver set sail for adventure in Robert Louis Stevenson''s classic tale of dastardly pirates, swashbuckling heroes, buried treasure and a young boy''s amazing courage. The narrative diverges from that of the novel in that Captain Smollett convinces Squire Trelawney and Doctor Livesey to cut Jim out of his rightful share of the treasure and so Jim then teams up with Silver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgLwBnRIXpj4f7Yz1cQp7He0ZQB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128979'),
  ('798014788019652177', 'Treasure Island', 2007, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Alain Berbérian', 'Fabrice Roger-Lacan, Sion Marciano, William Solal', 'Gérard Jugnot, Alice Taglioni, Jean-Paul Rouve, Vincent Rottiers, François Levantal, Cyrille Eldin, Chiké Okonkwo, Stéphane Metzger', null, 'A treasure buried on an island of the Antilles. A pirate without a straight leg, without a boat, treacherous and bloodthirsty and without the treasure map. A baroness flamboyant, unscrupulous, praying mantis, penniless, but with a boat. A young man without fear and without brains, but with the treasure map engraved somewhere in his failing memory. A doctor without drinking, providential specialist of failing memories and other atypical amnesia ... It is this dream team that sails anchor one morning in the year of grace a thousand and seven hundred and a few, towards the treasure island and its coves of pink sand.', 'A treasure buried on an island of the Antilles. A pirate without a straight leg, without a boat, treacherous and bloodthirsty and without the treasure map. A baroness flamboyant, unscrupulous, praying mantis, penniless, but with a boat. A young man without fear and without brains, but with the treasure map engraved somewhere in his failing memory. A doctor without drinking, providential specialist of failing memories and other atypical amnesia ... It is this dream team that sails anchor one morning in the year of grace a thousand and seven hundred and a few, towards the treasure island and its coves of pink sand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i02oRvMfF5j2MX5NSR0pi2aSwta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49885'),
  ('771700242175194193', 'Treasure Island', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Fatima Kaci, Guillaume Brac, Martin Rit', null, null, null, 'A summer on an island of leisure in the Paris region. Land of Adventures, dredge and transgression for some, place of refuge and escape for the other. Its pay range to its hidden nooks, the exploration of a Kingdom of childhood, in resonance with the bustle of the world.', 'A summer on an island of leisure in the Paris region. Land of Adventures, dredge and transgression for some, place of refuge and escape for the other. Its pay range to its hidden nooks, the exploration of a Kingdom of childhood, in resonance with the bustle of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMYrSaJMMhtNqVcZrVVWn9Ix3jr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525894'),
  ('654273614122276829', 'Treasure Island: Part I – Captain Flint''s Map', 1987, 'Animation, Adventure, TV Movie, Family, Music', 'Davyd Cherkaskyi, Vladimir Belorussov, Viktor Hruzdiev', 'Davyd Cherkaskyi, Yurii Alikov', 'Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Viktor Andriienko, Valeriy Bessarab, Borys Vozniuk, Heorhii Kyshko, Yevhen Papernyi, Grigoriy Tolchinskiy, Aleksandr Levit', null, 'A Soviet Ukrainian made violent farcical yet quite faithful adaptation of the famous Robert Louis Stevenson''s book that combines animated sequences with live action parts. This movie covers the first half of the book.', 'A Soviet Ukrainian made violent farcical yet quite faithful adaptation of the famous Robert Louis Stevenson''s book that combines animated sequences with live action parts. This movie covers the first half of the book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/898uPP5WAhtvtl2bD6FPf8oP3Jb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377004'),
  ('517563735529083758', 'Treasure Island: Part II - Captain Flint''s Treasure', 1987, 'Animation, Adventure, TV Movie, Family, Music', 'Viktor Hruzdiev, Davyd Cherkaskyi, Vladimir Belorussov', 'Yurii Alikov, Davyd Cherkaskyi', 'Viktor Andriienko, William De Vital, Vyacheslav Dubinin, Anatoliy Dyachenko, Aleksandr Levit, Yuri Nevgamonny, Valerii Chyhliaiev, Mikhail Tserishenko', null, 'A Soviet Ukrainian made violent farcical yet quite faithful adaptation of the famous Robert Louis Stevenson''s book that combines animated sequences with live action parts. This film covers the second half of the book.', 'A Soviet Ukrainian made violent farcical yet quite faithful adaptation of the famous Robert Louis Stevenson''s book that combines animated sequences with live action parts. This film covers the second half of the book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eV9mxfAAOD0Wdl9EErKzMqtoeTK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316842'),
