  ('736834803939000785', 'Treasure of the Moon Goddess', 1987, 'Adventure, Drama', 'José Luis García Agraz', 'Asher Brauner', 'Linnea Quigley, Don Calfa, Asher Brauner, Joann Ayers', null, 'Pop singer Lu, who''s touring Central America, her sleazy manager Harold, a rugged boat captain and their guide, Sam, and Sam''s girl Brandy, are targeted by a gang and a local tribe over Lu''s resemblance to the natives'' moon goddess.', 'Pop singer Lu, who''s touring Central America, her sleazy manager Harold, a rugged boat captain and their guide, Sam, and Sam''s girl Brandy, are targeted by a gang and a local tribe over Lu''s resemblance to the natives'' moon goddess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVob9STe7INsghKLSv4SH4DzvdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219156'),
  ('730238613364925486', 'Treasure Planet', 2002, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Ron Clements, John Musker', 'Ron Clements, John Musker, Rob Edwards', 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Brian Murray, Emma Thompson, David Hyde Pierce, Martin Short, Dane A. Davis, Michael Wincott, Laurie Metcalf', 'PG', 'When space galleon cabin boy Jim Hawkins discovers a map to an intergalactic "loot of a thousand worlds," a cyborg cook named John Silver teaches him to battle supernovas and space storms on their journey to find treasure.', 'When space galleon cabin boy Jim Hawkins discovers a map to an intergalactic "loot of a thousand worlds," a cyborg cook named John Silver teaches him to battle supernovas and space storms on their journey to find treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNhZkR3UNbXfvESQo7mJpOi4tGd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9016'),
  ('40933889069498085', 'Treat Me Like Fire', 2018, 'Drama', 'Marie Monge, Paul Guilhaume', 'Romain Compingt, Marie Monge, Julien Guetta', 'Tahar Rahim, Stacy Martin, Bruno Wolkowitch, Karim Leklou, Marie Denarnaud, Jean-Michel Correia, Henri-Noël Tabary, Jonathan Couzinié', null, 'Revolves around the relationship between a gambling addict and a young woman who falls madly in love with him and will stop at nothing to win his heart.', 'Revolves around the relationship between a gambling addict and a young woman who falls madly in love with him and will stop at nothing to win his heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3uyriJk8YKUA9nN0XHC3aAbh3xe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485098'),
  ('971058400737820965', 'Treat or Trick', 2021, 'Action, Comedy, Horror, Crime', 'Hsu Fu-hsiang, Déjà Fu, Chen Bolin', 'Lin Yu-Chen, Hsu Fu-hsiang, Chang-Yu Ting', 'Chen Bolin, Chen Yi-wen, Liu Kuan-ting, Huang Shang-ho, Lin He-hsuan, Phil Hou, Ralf Chiu, Bai Jing-yi', null, 'Feng, a corrupted police officer, ordered to retrieve the diamonds within 48hrs, arrives at a remote village, following the mobile signal of his partner Chiang who stole the diamonds from the gang. While Feng and his men try to find Chiang in the village, they encounter the locals who seem naive but suspicious, and a ghost full of stories. Remake of a renowned Korean film To Catch A Virgin Ghost (2004).', 'Feng, a corrupted police officer, ordered to retrieve the diamonds within 48hrs, arrives at a remote village, following the mobile signal of his partner Chiang who stole the diamonds from the gang. While Feng and his men try to find Chiang in the village, they encounter the locals who seem naive but suspicious, and a ghost full of stories. Remake of a renowned Korean film To Catch A Virgin Ghost (2004).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chbXxeDXt3NMX3gXtqMSq9qIQhN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:841569'),
  ('756794355288832681', 'Tree for Two', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Stan Freberg', null, 'A rough and tough bulldog named Spike sets out with his admirer, a small dog named Chester, to rough up a cat. They encounter Sylvester and chase him into a junkyard, where a black panther that escaped from a zoo just happens to be hiding out. Every time Spike goes into the junkyard to thrash Sylvester, he is clawed into pieces by the panther, which he, in a dark maze of crates, thinks is Sylvester. Chester has no problem pummelling Sylvester before Spike''s eyes, which convinces Spike that Chester must be tougher than him.', 'A rough and tough bulldog named Spike sets out with his admirer, a small dog named Chester, to rough up a cat. They encounter Sylvester and chase him into a junkyard, where a black panther that escaped from a zoo just happens to be hiding out. Every time Spike goes into the junkyard to thrash Sylvester, he is clawed into pieces by the panther, which he, in a dark maze of crates, thinks is Sylvester. Chester has no problem pummelling Sylvester before Spike''s eyes, which convinces Spike that Chester must be tougher than him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6UdovbTuOi8kfD8X69bIlc3qxDc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235945'),
  ('586866949264562905', 'Tree of Knowledge', 1981, 'Drama', 'Nils Malmros, Jan Weincke, Søren Kjær', 'Frederick Cryer, Nils Malmros', 'Eva Gram Schjoldager, Jan Johansen, Line Arlien-Søborg, Marian Wendelbo, Gitte Iben Andersen, Brian Theibel, Erno Müller, Merete Voldstedlund', null, 'As a group of Danish children pass into adolescence, gradually the most popular girl becomes an outcast, for trivial reasons that she never understands.', 'As a group of Danish children pass into adolescence, gradually the most popular girl becomes an outcast, for trivial reasons that she never understands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qD6Apcx7h2EescAIgQP1CljiN0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16029'),
  ('193095532516034735', 'Treehouse', 2015, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Michael G. Bartlett, J. Christopher Campbell', 'Alex Child, Miles Harrington', 'J. Michael Trautmann, Dana Melanie, Daniel Fredrick, Clint James, Victoria Spencer Smith, Darren Kennedy, Shannon Knopke, Caleb Cox', null, 'A teenage boy discovers the perpetrators of several brutal kidnappings in his home town.', 'A teenage boy discovers the perpetrators of several brutal kidnappings in his home town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kOvkJDDi9qghFrQEkYlv2MDksq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286372'),
  ('838753575708839679', 'Treehouse', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'James Roday Rodriguez', 'James Roday Rodriguez', 'Jimmi Simpson, Mary McCormack, Shaunette Renée Wilson, Maggie Lawson, Stephanie Beatriz, Julianna Guill, Michael Weston, Amanda Walsh', 'NR', 'Celebu-chef Peter Rake escapes a scandal for a weekend at his family’s isolated vacation home, but there are debts to repay and Peter has to learn the lesson that a woman’s place is anywhere that she chooses to be… if he survives.', 'Celebu-chef Peter Rake escapes a scandal for a weekend at his family’s isolated vacation home, but there are debts to repay and Peter has to learn the lesson that a woman’s place is anywhere that she chooses to be… if he survives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ww1PxKHZlBXAZVc4hSGiPPVQRLX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:580944'),
  ('950687848031249152', 'Treehouse Hostage', 1999, 'Comedy, Family', 'Sean McNamara, Jody Spilkoman', 'Scot Lewis, Jeff Phillips', 'Jim Varney, Todd Bosley, Mark Moses, Joey Zimmerman, Kristopher Kachurak, Debby Boone, Richard Kline, Jack McGee', 'PG', 'Timmy Taylor and his two friends, Stevie and Buddy capture escaped convict Carl Banks (Jim Varney) and hold him hostage in their treehouse over the weekend so that Timmy can use Carl as his current event project at school on Monday. The boys then find that Carl is mixed up in a counterfeiting ring that could spell trouble for them too.', 'Timmy Taylor and his two friends, Stevie and Buddy capture escaped convict Carl Banks (Jim Varney) and hold him hostage in their treehouse over the weekend so that Timmy can use Carl as his current event project at school on Monday. The boys then find that Carl is mixed up in a counterfeiting ring that could spell trouble for them too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4KwytadQuUzfWwIyCH6kfojjUH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258574'),
  ('28728954281912050', 'Treeless Mountain', 2009, 'Drama', 'So Yong Kim, Anne Misawa', 'So Yong Kim', 'Kim Hee-yeon, Kim Seong-hee, Kim Mi-hyang, Lee Soo-ah', null, 'A Korean woman leaves her two young daughters with her sister-in-law to search for their estranged father.', 'A Korean woman leaves her two young daughters with her sister-in-law to search for their estranged father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epSzJxPsus49o1W2eRz4uNc1OpL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25695'),
  ('935422029167931850', 'Trees', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Michelangelo Frammartino, Giuseppe Briglia, Bruno Di Lecce', 'Michelangelo Frammartino', null, null, 'Wrapping the audience in waves of sound, Alberi takes us on a circular journey through the Italian countryside. The marvelous natural music at the tops of the eponymous trees makes way for the rhythmic cadence of civilization—men baring axes and the natural clatter of daily life—before their unforgettable return home from the forest. The singular artistry of director Michelangelo Frammartino (Le quatro volte) is beautifully displayed in this mesmerizing homage to nature.', 'Wrapping the audience in waves of sound, Alberi takes us on a circular journey through the Italian countryside. The marvelous natural music at the tops of the eponymous trees makes way for the rhythmic cadence of civilization—men baring axes and the natural clatter of daily life—before their unforgettable return home from the forest. The singular artistry of director Michelangelo Frammartino (Le quatro volte) is beautifully displayed in this mesmerizing homage to nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LLFVJSq4JvBlTpNIe82f2we2mF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174684'),
  ('308481854028220580', 'Trees Grow on the Stones Too', 1985, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Stanislav Rostotsky, Knut Andersen, Vyacheslav Shumskiy', 'Aleksandr Aleksandrov, Stanislav Rostotsky, Gennadi Shumsky', 'Aleksandr Timoshkin, Petronella Barker, Mikhail Gluzskiy, Valentina Titova, Tor Stokke, Nikolay Karpov, Aleksandr Abramov, Nikolay Ryabkov', null, 'Vikings attack Kuksja''s village, and end up bringing him along on their ship because they believe he is good luck. After proving himself in a battle against the dreaded Danes, chief Torir bestows upon him the name of Einar and takes him in as his son. Back home in Norway the men are received as heros, but new trouble arises when Kuksja falls in love with the beautiful Signy, who is already betroth to the vicious Sigurd.', 'Vikings attack Kuksja''s village, and end up bringing him along on their ship because they believe he is good luck. After proving himself in a battle against the dreaded Danes, chief Torir bestows upon him the name of Einar and takes him in as his son. Back home in Norway the men are received as heros, but new trouble arises when Kuksja falls in love with the beautiful Signy, who is already betroth to the vicious Sigurd.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ak9BL2oCK2sbrDOp8eDenqKvmmx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101197'),
  ('735715502232004449', 'Trees Lounge', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lisa Rinzler, Steve Buscemi', 'Steve Buscemi', 'Steve Buscemi, Chloë Sevigny, Carol Kane, Mark Boone Junior, Bronson Dudley, Anthony LaPaglia, Michael Buscemi, Elizabeth Bracco', 'R', 'Tommy has lost his job, his love and his life. He lives in a small apartment above the Trees Lounge, a bar which he frequents along with a few other regulars without lives. He gets a job driving an ice cream truck and ends up getting involved with the seventeen-year-old niece of his ex-girlfriend. This gets him into serious trouble with her father.', 'Tommy has lost his job, his love and his life. He lives in a small apartment above the Trees Lounge, a bar which he frequents along with a few other regulars without lives. He gets a job driving an ice cream truck and ends up getting involved with the seventeen-year-old niece of his ex-girlfriend. This gets him into serious trouble with her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DtoVhI9RkArGbzkvctGxY578QN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27845'),
  ('116287686018764657', 'Trees of Peace', 2021, 'Drama', 'Alanna Brown, Michael Rizzi', 'Alanna Brown', 'Charmaine Bingwa, Eliane Umuhire, Ella Cannon, Bola Koleosho, Tongayi Chirisa, Evan Alex, Omono Okojie', 'R', 'Four women from different backgrounds forge an unbreakable sisterhood while trapped and in hiding during the genocide in Rwanda.', 'Four women from different backgrounds forge an unbreakable sisterhood while trapped and in hiding during the genocide in Rwanda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2McwkzqZ5uOZsBOGEjCDRni8Qf7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763073'),
  ('1066495787842905004', 'Treevenge', 2008, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Jason Eisener, Jeff Wheaton, Jason Shipley', 'Rob Cotterill, Jason Eisener', 'Jonathan Torrens, Sarah Dunsworth, Maris Morgan, Jayden Taylor, Lex Gigeroff, Mike Cleven, Jason Collins, Timothy Dunn', null, 'Treevenge details the experiences and horrifying reality of the lives of Christmas trees. Clearly, for trees, Christmas isn’t the exciting “peace on earth” that is experienced by most. After being hacked down, and shipped away from their homes, they quickly become strung up, screwed into an upright position for all to see, exposed in a humiliation of garish decorations. But this Christmas will be different, this Christmas the trees have had enough, this Christmas the trees will fight back. Treevenge could be a short film about the end of days for Christmas trees, or perhaps, the end of humanity?', 'Treevenge details the experiences and horrifying reality of the lives of Christmas trees. Clearly, for trees, Christmas isn’t the exciting “peace on earth” that is experienced by most. After being hacked down, and shipped away from their homes, they quickly become strung up, screwed into an upright position for all to see, exposed in a humiliation of garish decorations. But this Christmas will be different, this Christmas the trees have had enough, this Christmas the trees will fight back. Treevenge could be a short film about the end of days for Christmas trees, or perhaps, the end of humanity?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6CSUFegpqyvG7k5y3pUnpikAH1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79329'),
  ('1007774723443293851', 'Trekkies', 1997, 'Documentary', 'Roger Nygard, Harris Done', null, 'Denise Crosby, Barbara Adams, Majel Barrett, James Doohan, DeForest Kelley, Leonard Nimoy, Michael Dorn, LeVar Burton', 'PG', 'Denise Crosby takes a first look at the huge fans of "Star Trek" from around America and how the series has affected and shaped their lives.', 'Denise Crosby takes a first look at the huge fans of "Star Trek" from around America and how the series has affected and shaped their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6MYZAcI2A7VfJkcIvCDbFPISLP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15800'),
