  ('837341777118017984', 'Trenchcoat', 1983, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Michael Tuchner, Tonino Delli Colli', 'Jeffrey Price, Peter S. Seaman', 'Margot Kidder, Robert Hays, David Suchet, Ronald Lacey, Gila von Weitershausen, P.G. Stephens, Pauline Delaney, Daniel Faraldo', 'PG', 'An aspiring mystery writer becomes accidently embroiled in an international plot during a two-week stay in Malta.', 'An aspiring mystery writer becomes accidently embroiled in an international plot during a two-week stay in Malta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqHQRT0TZkDaLgJerIyK6qhOmwg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84831'),
