  ('509365780186915805', 'Trenk, the Little Knight', 2015, 'Animation, Family', 'Anthony Power', 'Gerrit Hermans', 'Georg Sulzer, Axel Prahl, Johannes Zeiler, Denis Lyons', null, 'Ten-year-old Trenk, peasant and property of evil Sir Wertolt, wants to become a knight and free his family. His sword may be heavier than himself, but with unflagging practice, he''s soon ready to take on terrifying dragons and save damsels in distress - before conquering their hearts! "Trenk, the Little Knight'' is the highly anticipated new animated feature from the producers of "Lilly The Witch." Set in the Middle Ages, it features marvelously drawn and colored backdrops along with storylines whose castles, tournaments and courtly society convey a realistic, authentic depiction of medieval life. It tells the deeply moving story of a young boy who must learn what heroism and courage are before he rises from lowly peasant to shining knight. Based on the bestselling books by Kirsten Boie.', 'Ten-year-old Trenk, peasant and property of evil Sir Wertolt, wants to become a knight and free his family. His sword may be heavier than himself, but with unflagging practice, he''s soon ready to take on terrifying dragons and save damsels in distress - before conquering their hearts! "Trenk, the Little Knight'' is the highly anticipated new animated feature from the producers of "Lilly The Witch." Set in the Middle Ages, it features marvelously drawn and colored backdrops along with storylines whose castles, tournaments and courtly society convey a realistic, authentic depiction of medieval life. It tells the deeply moving story of a young boy who must learn what heroism and courage are before he rises from lowly peasant to shining knight. Based on the bestselling books by Kirsten Boie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhMjA9MetWql9jsp6Wun3NkpIzM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362343'),
  ('56717291457480909', 'Trenque Lauquen', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'Agustín Mendilaharzu, Inés Duacastella, Soledad Rodríguez', 'Laura Citarella, Laura Paredes', 'Laura Paredes, Ezequiel Pierri, Rafael Spregelburd, Elisa Carricajo, Juliana Muras, Verónica Llinás, Cecilia Rainero, Walter Jakob', null, 'With the strange disappearance of Laura, two colleagues, her older boyfriend, Rafael, and Ezequiel, learn of their recent discoveries, which may help them locate her. However, the story is bigger and stranger than they could imagine.', 'With the strange disappearance of Laura, two colleagues, her older boyfriend, Rafael, and Ezequiel, learn of their recent discoveries, which may help them locate her. However, the story is bigger and stranger than they could imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSxqQpy0IbmVwzUNMGnoTVRg7f0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:715742'),
  ('85946158761231933', 'Trent''s Last Case', 1952, 'Mystery', 'Herbert Wilcox, Mutz Greenbaum, Frank Hollands', 'Pamela Bower', 'Michael Wilding, Margaret Lockwood, Orson Welles, John McCallum, Miles Malleson, Hugh McDermott, Jack McNaughton, Sam Kydd', 'NR', 'When a wealthy business man is found dead reporter Philip Trent is sent to investigate. Against the police conclusions, he suspects the assumed suicide is really a murder, and becomes highly interested in the young widow and the dead man''s private secretary.', 'When a wealthy business man is found dead reporter Philip Trent is sent to investigate. Against the police conclusions, he suspects the assumed suicide is really a murder, and becomes highly interested in the young widow and the dead man''s private secretary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvXjKU5c15iV7G8E7v3jQIYHVKp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55381'),
  ('574267594697827348', 'Tres de la Cruz Roja', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Fernando Palacios, Alejandro Ulloa', 'Vicente Coello', 'Tony Leblanc, José Luis López Vázquez, Manolo Gómez Bur, Mara Cruz, Jesús Puente, Miguel Ángel Rodríguez, Alfonso Cuadros, María Jesús Balenciaga', null, 'Three friends who are football fans discover one day that using the uniform of the Red Cross they can have access to football fields. The next day, they are volunteering at the headquarters of the institution.', 'Three friends who are football fans discover one day that using the uniform of the Red Cross they can have access to football fields. The next day, they are volunteering at the headquarters of the institution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AwBnFzgwVN2BGAWpIPlgJmEmkcp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111652'),
  ('1139038561876028661', 'Tres lancheros muy picudos', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Adolfo Martínez Solares', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares, Adolfo Martínez Solares', 'Alfonso Zayas, Hugo Stiglitz, Lina Santos, José René Ruiz, César Bono, Roberto Ballesteros, Claudio Báez, Rosario Escobar', null, 'Son las emocionantes aventuras de tres lancheros holgazanes en Acapulco. Cada uno de ellos se ve involucrado en diferentes problemas y tienen que salir huyendo a la ciudad de México. Ahí se esconden en la casa de unas amigas para evadir a los gangsters que los buscan solo que las muchachas resultan ser prostitutas y todo se complica. The exciting adventures of three men who drive boats in Acapulco. Each gets involved in different problems and all have to run away to Mexico City to elude the gangsters who are after them. They hide in the house of some lady friends who turn out to be "working girls" and things get really wild.', 'Son las emocionantes aventuras de tres lancheros holgazanes en Acapulco. Cada uno de ellos se ve involucrado en diferentes problemas y tienen que salir huyendo a la ciudad de México. Ahí se esconden en la casa de unas amigas para evadir a los gangsters que los buscan solo que las muchachas resultan ser prostitutas y todo se complica. The exciting adventures of three men who drive boats in Acapulco. Each gets involved in different problems and all have to run away to Mexico City to elude the gangsters who are after them. They hide in the house of some lady friends who turn out to be "working girls" and things get really wild.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DNTQYQUgXJPtWDKe186uqIGJhL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85925'),
  ('229280595897551029', 'Tres Mexicanos ardientes', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares', null, 'Alfonso Zayas, Alberto Rojas, José René Ruiz ''Tun-Tun'', Ana Luisa Peluffo, Patricia Rivera, Rossy Mendoza, Ana De Sade, Gerardo Zepeda', null, 'A creative commercial director falls in love with a beautiful model and proposes a torrid romance. She agrees as long as he buys her a car, a luxurious apartment, jewelry, and a new wardrobe as part of the love deal.', 'A creative commercial director falls in love with a beautiful model and proposes a torrid romance. She agrees as long as he buys her a car, a luxurious apartment, jewelry, and a new wardrobe as part of the love deal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJnVknBtRRB0DqhGi8OQu4LmkK8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204960'),
  ('252625425497950518', 'Tresor', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Claude Berri, François Dupeyron', 'Claude Berri', 'Alain Chabat, Mathilde Seigner, Fanny Ardant, Isabelle Nanty, Hélène Vincent, Stéphane Freiss, Laurent Spielvogel', null, 'Nathalie and Jean-Pierre have been together for five years, to celebrate their anniversary, Jean-Pierre prepare a surprise present for his girlfriend: a cute four month english bullgod. Nathalie loves her present and calls the puppy "Tresor"; her relationship with the dog is close and strong since the begining but causes problems in the couple.', 'Nathalie and Jean-Pierre have been together for five years, to celebrate their anniversary, Jean-Pierre prepare a surprise present for his girlfriend: a cute four month english bullgod. Nathalie loves her present and calls the puppy "Tresor"; her relationship with the dog is close and strong since the begining but causes problems in the couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uw1YSzDNd2Z9k1XBmWEelMO0Qwj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36598'),
  ('1070932469161854341', 'Trespass', 1992, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Walter Hill, Allan Graf, Lloyd Ahern II', 'Bob Gale, Robert Zemeckis', 'Bill Paxton, Ice-T, William Sadler, Ice Cube, Art Evans, De''voreaux White, Bruce A. Young, Glenn Plummer', 'R', 'Two Arkansas firemen, Vince and Don, get hold of a map that leads to a cache of stolen gold in an abandoned factory in East St. Louis. What they don''t know is that the factory is on the turf of a local gang, who come by to execute one of their enemies. Vince sees the shooting, the gang spots Vince, and extended mayhem ensues. As Vince and Don try to escape, gang leader King James argues with his subordinate Savon about how to get rid of the trespassers.', 'Two Arkansas firemen, Vince and Don, get hold of a map that leads to a cache of stolen gold in an abandoned factory in East St. Louis. What they don''t know is that the factory is on the turf of a local gang, who come by to execute one of their enemies. Vince sees the shooting, the gang spots Vince, and extended mayhem ensues. As Vince and Don try to escape, gang leader King James argues with his subordinate Savon about how to get rid of the trespassers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GSeicpK571uoM2ZCRb1YyW2YMG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22004'),
  ('481094875002027870', 'Trespass', 2011, 'Thriller', 'Scott August, Nilo Otero, Joel Schumacher', 'Karl Gajdusek', 'Nicolas Cage, Nicole Kidman, Ben Mendelsohn, Liana Liberato, Cam Gigandet, Jordana Spiro, Dash Mihok, Emily Meade', 'R', 'Kyle and Sarah Miller have it all: a huge gated house on the water, fancy cars, and the potential for romance in their relationship. He''s just back from a business trip and their teen daughter Avery is sneaking out to a party, when four thugs in security uniforms and ski masks stage a home invasion. They want what''s in the safe: cash and diamonds. As Kyle stalls them, trying to negotiate for Sarah''s freedom, the fault lines in Kyle and Sarah''s marriage and the pasts of the four robbers come into play. Is there room here for heroism?', 'Kyle and Sarah Miller have it all: a huge gated house on the water, fancy cars, and the potential for romance in their relationship. He''s just back from a business trip and their teen daughter Avery is sneaking out to a party, when four thugs in security uniforms and ski masks stage a home invasion. They want what''s in the safe: cash and diamonds. As Kyle stalls them, trying to negotiate for Sarah''s freedom, the fault lines in Kyle and Sarah''s marriage and the pasts of the four robbers come into play. Is there room here for heroism?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yP60huMcPTWOJfplRLi4FQAEQxX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70578'),
  ('398358162598338383', 'Trespass Against Us', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Adam Smith, Adrian Moat, Heidi Gower', 'Alastair Siddons', 'Michael Fassbender, Brendan Gleeson, Lyndsey Marshal, Rory Kinnear, Sean Harris, Kingsley Ben-Adir, Gerard Kearns, Tony Way', 'R', 'Three generations of the rowdy Cutler family live as outlaws in some of Britain''s richest countryside – hunting hares, ram-raiding stately homes, and taunting the police. Struggling to retain a way of life fast becoming extinct, Chad Cutler ends up caught between his father''s archaic principles and trying to do right by his kids, whilst the full force of the law is finally catching up with him.', 'Three generations of the rowdy Cutler family live as outlaws in some of Britain''s richest countryside – hunting hares, ram-raiding stately homes, and taunting the police. Struggling to retain a way of life fast becoming extinct, Chad Cutler ends up caught between his father''s archaic principles and trying to do right by his kids, whilst the full force of the law is finally catching up with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrzFIhudK8sjigTFVlCpYJXwjOt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256569'),
  ('805793489600490880', 'Trespassers', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'Orson Oblowitz, Dave Halls, Mark Jopling', 'Corey Deshon', 'Angela Trimbur, Janel Parrish, Jonathan Howard, Zach Avery, Fairuza Balk, Carlo Rota, Joey Abril, Sebastian Sozzi', null, 'Two dysfunctional couples rent a modern luxury desert home for the weekend hoping to sort out their messed-up lives. Just as they are about to settle in for a fun night, a neighbor turns up at their front door saying she has car trouble. But soon they discover the person they let into their home may have nefarious intents.', 'Two dysfunctional couples rent a modern luxury desert home for the weekend hoping to sort out their messed-up lives. Just as they are about to settle in for a fun night, a neighbor turns up at their front door saying she has car trouble. But soon they discover the person they let into their home may have nefarious intents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkzondKEBsrYt25CFVqOUCAHfZy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532647'),
