  ('770929167709276131', 'Triad Wars', 2008, 'Action, Crime', 'Herman Yau, Dennis Law Sau-Yiu', 'Dennis Law Sau-Yiu', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Simon Yam, Tien Niu, Danny Lee Sau-Yin, Wu Jing, Eddie Cheung Siu-Fai, Maggie Shiu, Lam Suet', null, 'In the midst of a violent gang war, a series of misfortunes threaten the fate of a gang boss and his mob.', 'In the midst of a violent gang war, a series of misfortunes threaten the fate of a gang boss and his mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7q0o1Noha3COSXhycGox8cvvzOo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25655'),
  ('239191591658819841', 'Triads: The Inside Story', 1989, 'Drama, Crime', 'Taylor Wong Tai-Loi, Herman Yau, Lam Moon-Wa', 'Nam Yin', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Roy Cheung Yiu-Yeung, Michael Chan Wai-Man, Shing Fui-On, Tien Feng, Lam Kau, Kenneth Tsang, Connie Mak Git-Man', null, 'Li Man-Ho comes to Hong Kong after his father''s death following a double crossed peace meeting at the hands of a rival gang. The family''s business begins to crumble as rival organizations stir violence and trouble in acknowledgment of this weakness. Li Man-Ho reluctantly agrees after pressure from other members to temporarily act as leader in order to restore stability and order. But he is soon faced with violence, betrayal and confusion, in this world he tried so long to avoid.', 'Li Man-Ho comes to Hong Kong after his father''s death following a double crossed peace meeting at the hands of a rival gang. The family''s business begins to crumble as rival organizations stir violence and trouble in acknowledgment of this weakness. Li Man-Ho reluctantly agrees after pressure from other members to temporarily act as leader in order to restore stability and order. But he is soon faced with violence, betrayal and confusion, in this world he tried so long to avoid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEkqDScQbYrAMPseQGJJCtEXgll.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147498'),
