  ('800239156799519728', 'Triassic Attack', 2010, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie, Fantasy', 'Colin Ferguson, Lorenzo Senatore', 'Tripp Reed', 'Steven Brand, Kirsty Mitchell, Emilia Clarke, Raoul Max Trujillo, Gabriel Womack, Jazz Lintott, Christopher Villiers, Nathalie Buscombe', 'NR', 'A Native American owner of a kitschy roadside museum accidentally brings to life three dinosaur fossils. Now really annoyed, the giant dinos wreak havoc on the small town and the local university.', 'A Native American owner of a kitschy roadside museum accidentally brings to life three dinosaur fossils. Now really annoyed, the giant dinos wreak havoc on the small town and the local university.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29ySLiWzuPVFMZqhXX4JPgZHe5V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95547'),
