  ('1059828814102556469', 'Trick ''r Treat', 2007, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Michael Dougherty, Cindy Smith, Pete Whyte', 'Michael Dougherty', 'Brian Cox, Quinn Lord, Anna Paquin, Dylan Baker, Leslie Bibb, Tahmoh Penikett, Rochelle Aytes, Britt McKillip', 'R', 'Four interwoven stories that occur on Halloween: an everyday high school principal has a secret life as a serial killer; a college virgin might have just met the one guy for her; a group of teenagers pull a mean prank, and a bitter old recluse receives an uninvited guest.', 'Four interwoven stories that occur on Halloween: an everyday high school principal has a secret life as a serial killer; a college virgin might have just met the one guy for her; a group of teenagers pull a mean prank, and a bitter old recluse receives an uninvited guest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0nmol4g7n6MFfhfphV7GzHHYjB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23202'),
  ('551045094507216080', 'Trick Baby', 1972, 'Crime, Drama', 'Larry Yust, Isidore Mankofsky', 'T. Raewyn, A. Neuberg, Larry Yust', 'Kiel Martin, Mel Stewart, Dallas Edward Hayes, Beverly Ballard, Vernee Watson, Donald Symington, Don Fellows, Thomas Anderson', 'R', 'Two Philadelphia con men try to evade gangsters they have conned and cops who are trying to put them in jail.', 'Two Philadelphia con men try to evade gangsters they have conned and cops who are trying to put them in jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4WrDzyeEdTVrSUJDoEjacywo3l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83222'),
  ('842355778215380862', 'Trick or Treat', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, June Foray, Thurl Ravenscroft, Ken Darby', 'NR', 'When the nephews come to Donald''s house in their Halloween costumes he dumps water on them and laughs at his trick. A witch sees this and decides to help the kids. By magic she gives Donald a bad time and the kids finally get their treats.', 'When the nephews come to Donald''s house in their Halloween costumes he dumps water on them and laughs at his trick. A witch sees this and decides to help the kids. By magic she gives Donald a bad time and the kids finally get their treats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4HCyLpbJo3O1OvB116a6gKl3in.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67699'),
  ('351328257853775177', 'Trick or Treat', 1986, 'Horror, Comedy, Music', 'Charles Martin Smith, Robert Elswit', 'Rhet Topham, Michael S. Murphey, Joel Soisson', 'Marc Price, Tony Fields, Lisa Orgolini, Doug Savant, Elaine Joyce, Glen Morgan, Gene Simmons, Ozzy Osbourne', 'R', 'Eddie Weinbauer, a metalhead teen who is bullied at school, looks to his heavy metal superstar idol, Sammi Curr, for guidance. When Curr is killed in a hotel fire, Eddie becomes the recipient of the only copy of Curr''s unreleased album, which, when played backwards, brings Sammi back to life. As Halloween approaches, Eddie begins to realize that this isn''t only rock ''n roll...it''s life and death.', 'Eddie Weinbauer, a metalhead teen who is bullied at school, looks to his heavy metal superstar idol, Sammi Curr, for guidance. When Curr is killed in a hotel fire, Eddie becomes the recipient of the only copy of Curr''s unreleased album, which, when played backwards, brings Sammi back to life. As Halloween approaches, Eddie begins to realize that this isn''t only rock ''n roll...it''s life and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycCrGbfuOEcKSCwxQeKA1VEPs7O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25438'),
  ('791296547999685940', 'Trick or Treat Scooby-Doo!', 2022, 'Adventure, Mystery, Comedy, Animation, Family', 'Audie Harrison, Dennis Tomacruz', null, 'Frank Welker, Grey DeLisle, Matthew Lillard, Kate Micucci, Myrna Velasco, Dee Bradley Baker, Jeff Bennett, Anthony Carrigan', 'G', 'Mystery Inc. has cracked the case to top all cases! They’ve tracked down Coco Diablo, the head of a notorious costume crime syndicate. With Coco and her kitty in prison, Mystery Inc. thinks that they can finally enjoy a break. Wrong! Suddenly, menacing doppelgänger ghosts of the Scooby crew and favorite classic foes show up in Coolsville to threaten Halloween. Now it’s up to the meddling kids to unmask the latest scoundrel and save Halloween!', 'Mystery Inc. has cracked the case to top all cases! They’ve tracked down Coco Diablo, the head of a notorious costume crime syndicate. With Coco and her kitty in prison, Mystery Inc. thinks that they can finally enjoy a break. Wrong! Suddenly, menacing doppelgänger ghosts of the Scooby crew and favorite classic foes show up in Coolsville to threaten Halloween. Now it’s up to the meddling kids to unmask the latest scoundrel and save Halloween!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZccw4Hj9ZF1yimnfPsX9rl3HvB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1015724'),
  ('361248331602742044', 'Trick or Treaters', 2007, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Hayo Freitag', 'Achim von Borries, Bettine von Borries', 'Joachim Król, Bela B., Charly Hübner, Katharina Thalbach, Elena Kreil, Konstantin Seldenstücker, Maximilian Roca Jungfer, Erwin Leder', null, 'Three robbers pilfer from the countryside until they are charmed by a young orphan girl.', 'Three robbers pilfer from the countryside until they are charmed by a young orphan girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3cwdekWcYROnRBNrFGiZqtdZkU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31444'),
  ('792481296791513699', 'Trick or Treats', 1982, 'Horror', 'Gary Graver, Gary Graver', 'Gary Graver', 'Jacqueline Giroux, Peter Jason, Chris Graver, David Carradine, Carrie Snodgress, Steve Railsback, Jillian Kesner, Dan Pastorini', 'R', 'A baby sitter is stuck watching over a young brat on Halloween night who keeps playing vicious pranks on her. To add to her trouble the boy''s deranged father has escaped from an asylum and is planning on making a visit.', 'A baby sitter is stuck watching over a young brat on Halloween night who keeps playing vicious pranks on her. To add to her trouble the boy''s deranged father has escaped from an asylum and is planning on making a visit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5C2d9EqVe0Rn8zyx0YE9ACKZA3O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85202'),
  ('597652116508295405', 'Trick the Movie: Last Stage', 2014, 'Mystery, Comedy', 'Yukihiko Tsutsumi, Tomoyuki Fujiwara, Jun Shiozaki', 'Mitsuharu Makita', 'Yukie Nakama, Hiroshi Abe, Noriyuki Higashiyama, Katsuhisa Namase, Yoko Nogiwa, Kazuki Kitamura, Kiko Mizuhara, Ikuji Nakamura', null, 'Trade company employee Shinichi recommends to Naoko and Jiro to go to a beautiful place abroad. There, Naoko and Jiro meets tribal shaman and sees through her tricks. The shaman has refused to leave her place.', 'Trade company employee Shinichi recommends to Naoko and Jiro to go to a beautiful place abroad. There, Naoko and Jiro meets tribal shaman and sees through her tricks. The shaman has refused to leave her place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCzcPjW7yf8L0NK9yF9PborhLOp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283017'),
  ('24828989772089383', 'Trick the Movie: Psychic Battle Royale', 2010, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Hisashi Kimura, Rei Asakura, Akira Kou', 'Hisashi Kimura', 'Yukie Nakama, Hiroshi Abe, Katsuhisa Namase, Takeru Satoh, Yoko Nogiwa, Nana Katase, Kaho', null, 'Naoko Yamada (Yukie Nakama), a female magician, and Jiro Ueda (Hiroshi Abe), a genius physicist, are back again to solve the mystery of supernatural happenings. In a village where people are cured, a battle royale is held to find the successor for shamen Kamahaeri. Naoko attempts to gain big money by participating in the battle royale, while Jiro is invited to the village to stop this custom. Naoko and Ueda then challenges this amazing trick ..', 'Naoko Yamada (Yukie Nakama), a female magician, and Jiro Ueda (Hiroshi Abe), a genius physicist, are back again to solve the mystery of supernatural happenings. In a village where people are cured, a battle royale is held to find the successor for shamen Kamahaeri. Naoko attempts to gain big money by participating in the battle royale, while Jiro is invited to the village to stop this custom. Naoko and Ueda then challenges this amazing trick ..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nYBLOLf7fu0YxIpM8tDeXtuTIX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71485'),
  ('1107426548092091637', 'Trick: The Movie', 2002, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Yukihiko Tsutsumi', 'Koji Makita', 'Yukie Nakama, Hiroshi Abe, Katsuhisa Namase, Kazuki Maehara, Yoko Nogiwa, Naoto Takenaka, Bengal, Renji Ishibashi', null, 'Disaster befalls a village''s inhabitants every 300 years. A popular self-styled magician named Naoko (Yukie Nakama) is summoned as a deity to rid the people of their anxiety. But there are many would-be deities there, each posing as a god. When a series of bizarre incidents occur, Naoko is cornered with a genius physicist (Hiroshi Abe) and Detective Yabe (Katsuhisa Namase). Do deities actually exist, or are they charlatans?', 'Disaster befalls a village''s inhabitants every 300 years. A popular self-styled magician named Naoko (Yukie Nakama) is summoned as a deity to rid the people of their anxiety. But there are many would-be deities there, each posing as a god. When a series of bizarre incidents occur, Naoko is cornered with a genius physicist (Hiroshi Abe) and Detective Yabe (Katsuhisa Namase). Do deities actually exist, or are they charlatans?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/su7YdgfAZndwQsbNi2u0J9uDCpg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72092'),
  ('178572809038243132', 'Trick: The Movie 2', 2006, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Yukihiko Tsutsumi', 'Mitsuharu Makita', 'Yukie Nakama, Hiroshi Abe, Yuta Hiraoka, Maki Horikita, Tetsuhiro Ikeda, Nagisa Katahira, Yukiya Kitamura, Katsuhisa Namase', null, 'Ueda employes Yamada to go a mysterious island in search of a girl (played by Maki Horikita) that disappeared 10 years ago. They discover the island is run by Kobako Sachiko, who can appear and disappear via boxes, among other strange powers.', 'Ueda employes Yamada to go a mysterious island in search of a girl (played by Maki Horikita) that disappeared 10 years ago. They discover the island is run by Kobako Sachiko, who can appear and disappear via boxes, among other strange powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzRVLXTwagmOBoEVUtIMOJZ9nZl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207711'),
  ('646654990612147223', 'Tricked', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paul Verhoeven, Richard Van Oosterhout, Lennert Hillege', 'Kim van Kooten, Paul Verhoeven, Robert Alberdingk Thijm', 'Peter Blok, Gaite Jansen, Robert de Hoog, Sallie Harmsen, Ricky Koole, Carolien Spoor, Jochum ten Haaf, Pieter Tiddens', null, 'During his 50th birthday party thrown by his wife, Remco''s life takes a turn for the worse. His business partners are scheming behind his back to sell him and his former mistress shows up pregnant.', 'During his 50th birthday party thrown by his wife, Remco''s life takes a turn for the worse. His business partners are scheming behind his back to sell him and his former mistress shows up pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkQ3x5yTQcVnuh6z7K6SNNBWaAW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140894'),
  ('66645946301160768', 'Tricked: The Documentary', 2013, 'Documentary', 'John-Keith Wasson, Jane Wells, John-Keith Wasson', null, null, null, 'This character-driven film considers the evolving sex trafficking landscape as seen by the main players: the exploited, the pimps, the johns that fuel the business, and the cops who fight to stop it.', 'This character-driven film considers the evolving sex trafficking landscape as seen by the main players: the exploited, the pimps, the johns that fuel the business, and the cops who fight to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejVgXkD61Slgd9SOAcpwy4T6UuD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241553'),
  ('137523303816749489', 'Tricks', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andrzej Jakimowski, Adam Bajerski', 'Andrzej Jakimowski', 'Damian Ul, Ewelina Walendziak, Tomasz Sapryk, Rafal Guzniczak, Iwona Fornalczyk, Joanna Liszowska, Andrzej Golejewski, Grzegorz Stelmaszewski', null, 'Six-year-old Stefek challenges fate. He believes that setting a chain of events in motion will help him get closer to his father who left his mother. His sister helps him bribe fate with small sacrifices, but things go wrong and then Stefek tries a very risky trick.', 'Six-year-old Stefek challenges fate. He believes that setting a chain of events in motion will help him get closer to his father who left his mother. His sister helps him bribe fate with small sacrifices, but things go wrong and then Stefek tries a very risky trick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xK9o1KHVfm0dTKoSkl8vQ7FXg8Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69214'),
  ('521928922387671639', 'Trickster', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Natuk Baytan, Rafet Şiriner', 'Natuk Baytan', 'Kemal Sunal, Ali Şen, Turgut Özatay, Ülkü Özen, Reha Yurdakul, Necdet Kökeş, Nizam Ergüden, Yadigar Ejder', null, 'Rıfkı, who lives in Germany, returns to his village, which he left years ago, to sell the properties inherited from his late father. A few coincidences that occur upon his arrival in the village lead to his name being associated with the ''Saint'' title.', 'Rıfkı, who lives in Germany, returns to his village, which he left years ago, to sell the properties inherited from his late father. A few coincidences that occur upon his arrival in the village lead to his name being associated with the ''Saint'' title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2roppgmY6lhTPaMc7Dg1voKquk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148723'),
  ('2225737783318511', 'Tricky Brains', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Wong Jing, Peter Pau Tak-Hai', 'Wong Jing, Albert Mak Kai-Kwong', 'Andy Lau, Stephen Chow, Rosamund Kwan Chi-Lam, Chingmy Yau Suk-Ching, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Wong Jing, Bau Hon-Lam', null, 'A trickster-for-hire, known as the Tricky Expert, is hired to ruin the lives of a father and son by making them think that he''s a part of the family.', 'A trickster-for-hire, known as the Tricky Expert, is hired to ruin the lives of a father and son by making them think that he''s a part of the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zehVfzyp4r4FXgYT7TPZhe1P3o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41364'),
  ('449180715270945523', 'Tricky Old Dogs', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Christophe Duthuron', 'Christophe Duthuron', 'Pierre Richard, Roland Giraud, Eddy Mitchell, Alice Pol, Henri Guybet, Méliane Marcaggi, Myriam Boyer, Rebecca Azan', null, 'Two septuagenarians go to Tuscany to prevent their old friend from killing the man who cuckolded him fifty years ago.', 'Two septuagenarians go to Tuscany to prevent their old friend from killing the man who cuckolded him fifty years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jdVhl8M0PG17bomIcHpGbd8s7S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514239'),
  ('310621730118587509', 'Tricky Old Dogs 2', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Ivan Rousseau, Christophe Duthuron', 'Christophe Duthuron, Wilfrid Lupano, Paul Cauuet', 'Pierre Richard, Eddy Mitchell, Bernard Le Coq, Alice Pol, Claire Nadeau, Myriam Boyer, Mohamad Malas, Jean Sarrus', null, 'To come to the aid of migrants he was hiding in Paris, Pierrot takes them to the South-West to Antoine, who himself is already welcoming Mimile, in the midst of reconquering love for Berthe. Expecting to find calm and voluptuousness in the countryside, the six refugees will taste above all the legendary hospitality of a French village. The perfect opportunity to shake up fears and prejudices for Sophie and our three Old Furnaces, promoted to unexpected consultants of an electoral campaign that Larquebuse, the mayor of Montcoeur is not about to forget.', 'To come to the aid of migrants he was hiding in Paris, Pierrot takes them to the South-West to Antoine, who himself is already welcoming Mimile, in the midst of reconquering love for Berthe. Expecting to find calm and voluptuousness in the countryside, the six refugees will taste above all the legendary hospitality of a French village. The perfect opportunity to shake up fears and prejudices for Sophie and our three Old Furnaces, promoted to unexpected consultants of an electoral campaign that Larquebuse, the mayor of Montcoeur is not about to forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7AfaAbrRro8c2N99JTIbEFSrra.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:884453'),
  ('923908174505133871', 'Tridev', 1989, 'Crime, Action', 'Anandji Veerji Shah, Kalyanji Veerji Shah, Romesh Bhalla', 'Rajiv Rai', 'Naseeruddin Shah, Sunny Deol, Jackie Shroff, Madhuri Dixit, Sonam, Sangeeta Bijlani, Amrish Puri, Raza Murad', null, 'A honest but disgraced Police Inspector''s attempts to clear his name pits him against terrorists and the brother of his sweetheart. Starring: Naseeruddin Shah, Sunny Deol, Jackie Shroff, Madhuri Dixit, Sangeeta Bijlani, Sonam, Anupam Kher and Amrish Puri.', 'A honest but disgraced Police Inspector''s attempts to clear his name pits him against terrorists and the brother of his sweetheart. Starring: Naseeruddin Shah, Sunny Deol, Jackie Shroff, Madhuri Dixit, Sangeeta Bijlani, Sonam, Anupam Kher and Amrish Puri.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytxwoZLN9F2JAcnsSE3ABgMWEWs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27641'),
  ('70194276201510284', 'Trigger', 2023, 'Drama', 'Valeriy Petrov, Alla Petelina, Ekaterina Lobanova', 'Elena Voytovich, Aleksandra Remizova', 'Maksim Matveev, Irina Starshenbaum, Viktoriya Maslova, Irina Martsinkevich, Anatoliy Rudenko, Polina Malikova, Mark Yusef, Igor Kostolevskiy', null, 'Artyom Streletski, a therapist known for his non-conventional approach to solving patients'' problems, has lost almost everything: his family, his friends, his practice, and the ability to trust the people around him. In a desperate attempt to escape from everything that hurts he moves away and settles on the outskirts of the country, in a small town filled with his sweet childhood memories. He starts a brand new career and finds new love but the past is catching up with him, and to regain the happiness Artyom has to face his troubles and stop running away from them once and for all.', 'Artyom Streletski, a therapist known for his non-conventional approach to solving patients'' problems, has lost almost everything: his family, his friends, his practice, and the ability to trust the people around him. In a desperate attempt to escape from everything that hurts he moves away and settles on the outskirts of the country, in a small town filled with his sweet childhood memories. He starts a brand new career and finds new love but the past is catching up with him, and to regain the happiness Artyom has to face his troubles and stop running away from them once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHiOH4Ldd21EPqBqCFs2LGMKFOf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1087179'),
