  ('178156283510292824', 'Trigger Warning', 2024, 'Action', 'Zoë White, Lauren Slatten, Mouly Surya', 'Halley Wegryn Gross, Josh Olson, John Brancato', 'Jessica Alba, Anthony Michael Hall, Tone Bell, Mark Webber, Jake Weary, Gabriel Basso, Kaiwi Lyman, Hari Dhillon', 'R', 'A Special Forces commando uncovers a dangerous conspiracy when she returns to her hometown looking for answers into her beloved father''s death.', 'A Special Forces commando uncovers a dangerous conspiracy when she returns to her hometown looking for answers into her beloved father''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XJM3C47iGOK9nFU6yLFCSf4U5c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:704673'),
  ('85890211774919420', 'Triggered', 2020, 'Horror, Action', 'Alastair Orr, Brendan Barnes', 'David D. Jones, Alastair Orr', 'Liesl Ahlers, Reine Swart, Sean Cameron Michael, Suraya-Rose Santos, Steven John Ward, Cameron Scott, Paige Bonnin, Kayla Privett', 'R', 'Nine friends, all harboring a dark secret, go camping in the woods. After a wild night of partying, they wake up with suicide bombs strapped to their chests, all with varying times on their countdown clocks. They decide to work out how to disarm the bombs or find help - until they discover they can ''take'' one another''s time by killing each other.', 'Nine friends, all harboring a dark secret, go camping in the woods. After a wild night of partying, they wake up with suicide bombs strapped to their chests, all with varying times on their countdown clocks. They decide to work out how to disarm the bombs or find help - until they discover they can ''take'' one another''s time by killing each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqcCIyvVYa5BnmtCL7NVB2Ifn2C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:715239'),
  ('324852149469410216', 'Trigun: Badlands Rumble', 2010, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Kazumi Inadome, Satoshi Nishimura, Cindy H. Yamauchi', 'Yasuko Kobayashi', 'Masaya Onosaka, Satsuki Yukino, Hiromi Tsuru, Maaya Sakamoto, Show Hayami, Tsutomu Isobe', 'PG-13', 'In a quicksand surrounded town called Makka, rumors spread of a legendary robber named Gasback is after the town. To protect it, Mayor Kepler has hired bounty hunters. These hunters have been following Gasback from town to town in hopes of getting the bounty. Vash the Stampede is in town, along with Meryl and Milly, along with the female bounty hunter Amelia and Nicholas D. Wolfwood.', 'In a quicksand surrounded town called Makka, rumors spread of a legendary robber named Gasback is after the town. To protect it, Mayor Kepler has hired bounty hunters. These hunters have been following Gasback from town to town in hopes of getting the bounty. Vash the Stampede is in town, along with Meryl and Milly, along with the female bounty hunter Amelia and Nicholas D. Wolfwood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JYK0FBs2nX6ikqeT6rDzEZRM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51859'),
  ('790650075695423108', 'Trijya - Radius', 2026, 'Drama', 'Akshay Indikar, Swapnil Rishikant Shete', 'Akshay Indikar, Kshama Padalkar', 'Abhay Mahajan, Girish Kulkarni, Adwaita Jadhav, Arya Rothe, Mahesh Bhosale', null, 'A village artist works as a Pune reporter but feels increasingly lost. Avdhut Kale retreats to the countryside to reconnect with himself through quiet reflection and spiritual discovery.', 'A village artist works as a Pune reporter but feels increasingly lost. Avdhut Kale retreats to the countryside to reconnect with himself through quiet reflection and spiritual discovery.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FdzSVEvxZkChmfovjmG1apCxaPuP.jpg', 'plex:movie:trijya-radius'),
  ('668149494267802568', 'Trilogy of Lust II', 1996, 'Crime, Horror', 'Julie Lee, Jiro Ishimura', 'Julie Lee', 'Julie Lee, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Ho Kei-Yung, Chin Gwan', null, 'The second part of the "Trilogy of Lust"-series tells the story about a woman who suffers from a childhood trauma when she was brutally raped by her uncle and his stinky booze companions. Now as an adult she leads two different lives: during the day she´s the upright manager of a firm, but at night she goes on murderous sprees, dressed in sexy rubber and latex costumes, to have sex with unsuspecting men. After the sexual intercourse she kills them violently and collects body parts like ears or noses as her trophies..', 'The second part of the "Trilogy of Lust"-series tells the story about a woman who suffers from a childhood trauma when she was brutally raped by her uncle and his stinky booze companions. Now as an adult she leads two different lives: during the day she´s the upright manager of a firm, but at night she goes on murderous sprees, dressed in sexy rubber and latex costumes, to have sex with unsuspecting men. After the sexual intercourse she kills them violently and collects body parts like ears or noses as her trophies..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMJPhKwdllETX9pmzpf5opBPMKT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140378'),
  ('645794338840764501', 'Trilogy of Terror', 1975, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Dan Curtis, Art Levinson, Paul Lohmann', 'Richard Matheson', 'Karen Black, Robert Burton, John Karlen, George Gaynes, Jim Storm, Kathryn Reynolds, Orin Cannon, Gregory Harrison', null, 'A horror anthology containing three stories: a female college professor is aggressively pursued by one of her students; a prudish brunette determines that her free-spirited blonde sister is evil; and a woman''s night turns upside down after she purchases an ancient Zuni fetish doll.', 'A horror anthology containing three stories: a female college professor is aggressively pursued by one of her students; a prudish brunette determines that her free-spirited blonde sister is evil; and a woman''s night turns upside down after she purchases an ancient Zuni fetish doll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nE4ih0nzpqz0x154Vig0QJUc6Sr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38783'),
  ('1029030736190447747', 'Trilogy of Terror II', 1996, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Dan Curtis, Elemér Ragályi, Eric Allard', 'William F. Nolan, Dan Curtis', 'Lysette Anthony, Geraint Wyn Davies, Matt Clark, Geoffrey Lewis, Blake Heron, Richard Fitzpatrick, Thomas Mitchell, Gerry Quigley', 'R', 'Three tales of terror: in "The Graveyard Rats" lovers murder the woman''s older husband and encounter horror when they attempt to rob his grave; "Bobby" is the story of a woman who summons her son back from the dead; and in "He Who Kills" an African doll goes on a murderous rampage.', 'Three tales of terror: in "The Graveyard Rats" lovers murder the woman''s older husband and encounter horror when they attempt to rob his grave; "Bobby" is the story of a woman who summons her son back from the dead; and in "He Who Kills" an African doll goes on a murderous rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QFPqKCyYMIKvujRIJzFJ5LlwNs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45875'),
