  ('1084983126295300616', 'Trimurti', 1995, 'Action, Drama', 'Mukul Anand, Ashok Mehta', null, 'Shah Rukh Khan, Anil Kapoor, Jackie Shroff, Saeed Jaffrey, Priya Tendulkar, Mohan Agashe, Tinnu Anand, Gautami Tadimalla', null, 'Entrapped by notorious gangster Khokha Singh, honest police inspector Satyadevi Singh gets a life sentence in jail. She hopes to get her three sons Shakti, Anand and Romi to avenge this carnage.', 'Entrapped by notorious gangster Khokha Singh, honest police inspector Satyadevi Singh gets a life sentence in jail. She hopes to get her three sons Shakti, Anand and Romi to avenge this carnage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6Pmeu0tcw3YKNHLdYw7IrNNdNq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102358'),
  ('873379383064643870', 'Trinity and Beyond: The Atomic Bomb Movie', 1995, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Barbu Marian, Peter Kuran', 'Don Pugsley, Scott Narrie', 'William Shatner, Edward Teller, W.H.P. Blandy, Frank H. Shelton, Dwight D. Eisenhower, Adlai Stevenson, Randall William Cook, Nikolai Bulganin', 'NR', '"Trinity and Beyond" is an unsettling yet visually fascinating documentary presenting the history of nuclear weapons development and testing between 1945-1963. Narrated by William Shatner and featuring an original score performed by the Moscow Symphony Orchestra, this award-winning documentary reveals previously unreleased and classified government footage from several countries.', '"Trinity and Beyond" is an unsettling yet visually fascinating documentary presenting the history of nuclear weapons development and testing between 1945-1963. Narrated by William Shatner and featuring an original score performed by the Moscow Symphony Orchestra, this award-winning documentary reveals previously unreleased and classified government footage from several countries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkLY0SC2cBF3lE6bv3W0V4muJ4Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21846'),
