  ('512430591931179202', 'Trinity Seven: Eternity Library & Alchemic Girl', 2017, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Yasunori Ebina, Hiroshi Nishikiori, Megumi Enomoto', 'Kenji Saitō', 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Yumi Hara, Rina Hidaka, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Mao Ichimichi, Ryoka Yuzuki, Aya Uchida, Ayane Sakura', 'R', 'The film''s story begins when Arata inadvertently touches "Hermes Apocrypha," Lilith''s Grimoire. Suddenly, he is enveloped by a bright white light, and a girl appears before him. She calls herself Lilim, and treats both Arata and Lilith as her parents. At the same time she appears, something changes in the world. The forbidden Eternal Library awakens. In the Library is sealed the ultimate culmination of Alchemy, the White Demon Lord. The White Demon Lord plots to eliminate Arata and the Trinity Seven to usurp the position of Demon Lord. Bristling with untold power, the White Demon Lord attacks Arata, and triggers a desperate crisis where Arata and the Trinity Seven must save the world in this last battle.', 'The film''s story begins when Arata inadvertently touches "Hermes Apocrypha," Lilith''s Grimoire. Suddenly, he is enveloped by a bright white light, and a girl appears before him. She calls herself Lilim, and treats both Arata and Lilith as her parents. At the same time she appears, something changes in the world. The forbidden Eternal Library awakens. In the Library is sealed the ultimate culmination of Alchemy, the White Demon Lord. The White Demon Lord plots to eliminate Arata and the Trinity Seven to usurp the position of Demon Lord. Bristling with untold power, the White Demon Lord attacks Arata, and triggers a desperate crisis where Arata and the Trinity Seven must save the world in this last battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2KEIR1u6ehaYMDaeZ3PMjC4tyj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428292'),
  ('882994158424345535', 'Trinity Seven: Heaven''s Library & Crimson Lord', 2019, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Yasunori Ebina, Mami Goto, Hiroshi Nishikiori', 'Kenji Saitō', 'Aya Uchida, Ayane Sakura, Yumi Hara, Ryoka Yuzuki, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Rie Murakawa, Nao Toyama, Yoko Hikasa', 'R', 'The series focuses on the adventures of Arata Kasuga, a high school student, who is targeted by Lilith, a teacher at a mystical school. Given three choices in an effort to help save the breakdown phenomenon of the world by evil forces and while attempting to solve the mystery of his beloved cousin and childhood friend, Hijiri, who disappeared to a difference space.', 'The series focuses on the adventures of Arata Kasuga, a high school student, who is targeted by Lilith, a teacher at a mystical school. Given three choices in an effort to help save the breakdown phenomenon of the world by evil forces and while attempting to solve the mystery of his beloved cousin and childhood friend, Hijiri, who disappeared to a difference space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlgrBVlXCXf72rYPxKOnzH0eZ59.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570269'),
  ('648648340056746685', 'Trinta', 2013, 'Drama', 'Paulo Machline', 'Paulo Machline, Mauricio Zacharias, Felipe Sholl', 'Matheus Nachtergaele, Mariana Nunes, Paolla Oliveira, Paulo Tiefenthaler, Milhem Cortaz, Fabrício Boliveira, Marco Ricca, Augusto Madeira', null, 'Biopic about the late Joãozinho Trinta, a self-taught classical dancer who turned Rio''s Carnival into an international phenomenon in the 1970s and ''80s by directing parades for samba schools and putting focus on costumes and decor.', 'Biopic about the late Joãozinho Trinta, a self-taught classical dancer who turned Rio''s Carnival into an international phenomenon in the 1970s and ''80s by directing parades for samba schools and putting focus on costumes and decor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gyphJoliLaPWEFQrxOcTmF0zNer.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228210'),
