  ('1127577847130460065', 'Trip with the Teacher', 1975, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Earl Barton, Ray Dennis Steckler', 'Earl Barton', 'Zalman King, Brenda Fogarty, Cathy Worthington, Dina Ousley, Jill Voight, Susan Russell, Robert Gribbin, Edward Cross', 'R', 'A high-school field trip takes a nightmarish turn when the students'' bus breaks down and thugs come to their aid.', 'A high-school field trip takes a nightmarish turn when the students'' bus breaks down and thugs come to their aid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKFvVM0Fj0iGnI8Dp72M7Y18475.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40065'),
  ('796331433272800955', 'Triple 9', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Adventure, Thriller', 'John Hillcoat, Amir R. Khan, Doug Torres', 'Matt Cook', 'Casey Affleck, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Anthony Mackie, Kate Winslet, Woody Harrelson, Aaron Paul, Clifton Collins Jr., Norman Reedus', 'R', 'A gang of criminals and corrupt cops plan the murder of a police officer in order to pull off their biggest heist yet across town.', 'A gang of criminals and corrupt cops plan the murder of a police officer in order to pull off their biggest heist yet across town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2kIq9yzEkOVhl1aeo0alJHtdfz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146198'),
  ('482855958250519084', 'Triple Agent', 2004, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Éric Rohmer, Diane Baratier', 'Éric Rohmer', 'Katerina Didaskalou, Serge Renko, Cyrielle Clair, Grigori Manoukov, Dimitri Rafalsky, Nathalia Krougly, Amanda Langlet, Emmanuel Salinger', null, 'The Popular Front wins elections, the Spanish Civil War begins, and Hitler and Stalin are manipulating and spying. The brilliant exile, Fiodor Voronin, a general at 20, is the deputy at the White Russian Military Union, probably slated to replace the aging Général Dobrinsky soon. Fiodor''s Greek wife, Arsinoé, paints and stays away from politics, befriending Communist neighbors. Her health declines; the attentive Fiodor arranges care and, against the backdrop of Stalin''s Great Purge, considers his options. He plays a chess game in which love of country, love of Arsinoé, ideology, petty jealousies, and the machinations of power roil in matters of life and death.', 'The Popular Front wins elections, the Spanish Civil War begins, and Hitler and Stalin are manipulating and spying. The brilliant exile, Fiodor Voronin, a general at 20, is the deputy at the White Russian Military Union, probably slated to replace the aging Général Dobrinsky soon. Fiodor''s Greek wife, Arsinoé, paints and stays away from politics, befriending Communist neighbors. Her health declines; the attentive Fiodor arranges care and, against the backdrop of Stalin''s Great Purge, considers his options. He plays a chess game in which love of country, love of Arsinoé, ideology, petty jealousies, and the machinations of power roil in matters of life and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oelyn9Xx8NRnKAt5oIKRC6XxwIQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65041'),
  ('903167775324905899', 'Triple Cross', 1966, 'Adventure, War, Action', 'Henri Alekan, Terence Young, Christian Raoux', 'René Hardy', 'Christopher Plummer, Romy Schneider, Trevor Howard, Gert Fröbe, Claudine Auger, Yul Brynner, Harry Meyen, Georges Lycan', null, 'Safecracker Eddie Chapman is languishing in prison on the island of Jersey when the Nazis arrive. An adept manipulator of situations, Chapman convinces the Germans to use him to spy on the British. And when the would-be traitor arrives home, he convinces the English to use him as a double agent -- in exchange for a full pardon.', 'Safecracker Eddie Chapman is languishing in prison on the island of Jersey when the Nazis arrive. An adept manipulator of situations, Chapman convinces the Germans to use him to spy on the British. And when the would-be traitor arrives home, he convinces the English to use him as a double agent -- in exchange for a full pardon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoGvqzc66h533Ncxjx3pSjy7Xmf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4375'),
  ('1094334777679823714', 'Triple Dog', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller', 'George Campbell, Pascal Franchot, Greg Rousseaux', 'Barbara Marshall', 'Britt Robertson, Scout Taylor-Compton, Alexia Fast, Janel Parrish, Emily Tennant, Carly McKillip, Aubrey Mozino, Brett Davern', 'R', 'On the night of a sleepover, a group of teenage girls venture out in a competitive game of challenging dares. As the antics escalate, and the dares become more extreme, the girls unravel the truth behind a former student''s rumored suicide.', 'On the night of a sleepover, a group of teenage girls venture out in a competitive game of challenging dares. As the antics escalate, and the dares become more extreme, the girls unravel the truth behind a former student''s rumored suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqnTnSDrFb5rkzIFNWCkEgQgimj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46665'),
  ('70493041407306665', 'Triple Frontier', 2019, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Adventure', 'Christina Fong, J.C. Chandor, Roman Vasyanov', 'Mark Boal, J.C. Chandor', 'Ben Affleck, Oscar Isaac, Charlie Hunnam, Garrett Hedlund, Pedro Pascal, Adria Arjona, Jeovanny Rodriguez, Juan Camilo Castillo', 'R', 'Struggling to make ends meet, former special ops soldiers reunite for a high-stakes heist: stealing $75 million from a South American drug lord.', 'Struggling to make ends meet, former special ops soldiers reunite for a high-stakes heist: stealing $75 million from a South American drug lord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBw8zYuAljVM1FeK5bZKITPH8ZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399361'),
  ('90964096782397485', 'Triple Tap', 2010, 'Action, Thriller, Mystery, Adventure', 'Derek Yee, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming, Albert Mak Kai-Kwong', 'Chun Tin-Nam, Lau Ho-Leung, Derek Yee', 'Louis Koo, Daniel Wu, Charlene Choi Chuek-Yin, Li Bingbing, Chapman To Man-Chat, Lam Suet, Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Andrew Lin Hoi', null, 'Champion competitive marksman Ken comes across an armored van robbery. He sees a policeman held hostage and shoots and kills four of the robbers. One of the robbers escapes and the policeman survives. The case is handled by Jerry Chang, whom Ken knows from having recently beaten him in a shooting match. Ken is found not guilty in court. Soon after, Ken is attacked by the escaped robber Pang Tao. Their confrontation reveals a very different background story and brings about a myriad of lies and traps and changes in relationships as Jerry and Ken try to outsmart each other.', 'Champion competitive marksman Ken comes across an armored van robbery. He sees a policeman held hostage and shoots and kills four of the robbers. One of the robbers escapes and the policeman survives. The case is handled by Jerry Chang, whom Ken knows from having recently beaten him in a shooting match. Ken is found not guilty in court. Soon after, Ken is attacked by the escaped robber Pang Tao. Their confrontation reveals a very different background story and brings about a myriad of lies and traps and changes in relationships as Jerry and Ken try to outsmart each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbadh24XaGEdqmxNVqIsyuRbqd0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44245'),
  ('919793181012559850', 'Triple Threat', 2019, 'Thriller, Action', 'Jonathan Hall, Jesse V. Johnson', 'Joey O''Bryan, Fangjin Song, Paul Staheli', 'Tony Jaa, Tiger Chen Hu, Iko Uwais, Scott Adkins, Michael Jai White, Michael Bisping, Celina Jade, JeeJa Yanin', 'R', 'A crime syndicate places a hit on a billionaire''s daughter, making her the target of an elite assassin squad. A small band of down-and-out mercenaries protects her, fighting tooth and nail to stop the assassins from reaching their target.', 'A crime syndicate places a hit on a billionaire''s daughter, making her the target of an elite assassin squad. A small band of down-and-out mercenaries protects her, fighting tooth and nail to stop the assassins from reaching their target.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSpM3QxmoSLp4O1WAMQpUDcaB7R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449985'),
  ('574693022942450846', 'Triplet Trouble', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Lillian Randolph', 'NR', 'Someone drops off three cute little kittens; Tom is put in charge of them while Mammy goes shopping. But behind her back, the three little angels are real devils.', 'Someone drops off three cute little kittens; Tom is put in charge of them while Mammy goes shopping. But behind her back, the three little angels are real devils.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ylFlwmQghOGhOgptomz2BkLuZmK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94177'),
  ('14454779928593495', 'Trippin''', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Raynr, John B. Aronson', 'Gary Hardwick', 'Deon Richmond, Donald Faison, Guy Torry, Maia Campbell, Anthony Anderson, Aloma Wright, Natashia Williams, Stoney Jackson', 'R', 'Greg is near the end of his senior year in high school, wanting to go to the prom, eyeing Cinny (the school''s beauty with brains) from afar, and regularly trippin'', daydreaming about being a big success as a poet, a student, a lover. His mom wants him to apply to colleges, but Greg hasn''t a clue. One of his teachers, Mr. Shapic, tries to inspire him, too. He finally figures out he can get close to Cinny if he asks her for help with college applications. But friendship isn''t enough, he wants romance and a prom date. So, he tells a few lies and, for awhile, it seems to be working. Then, things fall apart and Greg has to figure out how to put the trippin aside and get real.', 'Greg is near the end of his senior year in high school, wanting to go to the prom, eyeing Cinny (the school''s beauty with brains) from afar, and regularly trippin'', daydreaming about being a big success as a poet, a student, a lover. His mom wants him to apply to colleges, but Greg hasn''t a clue. One of his teachers, Mr. Shapic, tries to inspire him, too. He finally figures out he can get close to Cinny if he asks her for help with college applications. But friendship isn''t enough, he wants romance and a prom date. So, he tells a few lies and, for awhile, it seems to be working. Then, things fall apart and Greg has to figure out how to put the trippin aside and get real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKdbdPg6Ye8TOpGGDFQ0NeVVSSI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53862'),
  ('1078710690857481355', 'Trippin’ with the Kandasamys', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jayan Moodley', 'Jayan Moodley, Rory Booth', 'Jailoshini Naidoo, Koobeshan Naidoo, Maeshni Naicker, Mishqah Parthiephal, Mariam Bassa, Ugan Naidoo, Madhushan Singh, Rushil Juglall', 'NR', 'To rekindle their marriages, best friends-turned-in-laws Shanthi and Jennifer plan a couples'' getaway. But it comes with all kinds of surprises.', 'To rekindle their marriages, best friends-turned-in-laws Shanthi and Jennifer plan a couples'' getaway. But it comes with all kinds of surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tpuwM9fZFcMNkkGU0WwqPAEaFz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:834500'),
  ('1080484299268460663', 'Tripping the Rift: The Movie', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Bernie Denk', null, 'Gayle Garfinkle, Rick Jones, Maurice LaMarche, Jenny McCarthy, John Melendez, Stephen Root, Bruce Dinsmore', 'NR', 'What begins for Chode and crew as a routine mission to protect a pissed-off princess will soon become a filth- splattered saga of dismembered royalty, indestructible clown assassins and desperately horny housewives.', 'What begins for Chode and crew as a routine mission to protect a pissed-off princess will soon become a filth- splattered saga of dismembered royalty, indestructible clown assassins and desperately horny housewives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bJRzRynwtwTe7JtIgIpryPZglt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14850'),
  ('209146000365702278', 'Tripping with Nils Frahm', 2020, 'Music, Documentary', 'Benoit Toulemonde, Thomas Lallier', null, 'Nils Frahm', null, 'An illustration of Nils Frahm’s lauded ability as a composer and passionate live artist as well as the enchanting atmosphere of his already legendary Funkhaus shows.', 'An illustration of Nils Frahm’s lauded ability as a composer and passionate live artist as well as the enchanting atmosphere of his already legendary Funkhaus shows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDQ2TGDHyUaQ0ARGnAk0rFfZWtn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:766159'),
  ('875515923747209233', 'Triptych on Matter and Death', 1960, 'Drama', 'Živojin Pavlović', 'Živojin Pavlović', 'Jelena Crnobrnja', null, 'A young woman, injured and alone, desperately seeks refuge in an empty house before finding an abandoned train car. Haunted by surreal visions, she repeatedly collapses. At dawn, her motionless form draws the curiosity of local children, leaving her fate uncertain.', 'A young woman, injured and alone, desperately seeks refuge in an empty house before finding an abandoned train car. Haunted by surreal visions, she repeatedly collapses. At dawn, her motionless form draws the curiosity of local children, leaving her fate uncertain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJ95ck5NZ0uCr0aWVwR6FyeNMAk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284804'),
  ('429220598373875435', 'Trishna', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Winterbottom, Marcel Zyskind', 'Michael Winterbottom', 'Freida Pinto, Riz Ahmed, Mita Vashisht, Harish Khanna, Roshan Seth, Leela Madhauram, Chanchal Sharma, Shweta Tripathi Sharma', 'R', 'When her father is killed in a road accident, Trishna''s family expect her to provide for them. The rich son of an entrepreneur starts to restlessly pursue her affections, but are his intentions as pure as they seem?', 'When her father is killed in a road accident, Trishna''s family expect her to provide for them. The rich son of an entrepreneur starts to restlessly pursue her affections, but are his intentions as pure as they seem?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFCJeLJDXYhrX6Z4bHbdiDeVUgm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85542'),
  ('920938719266897824', 'Trishul', 1978, 'Action, Drama, Family', 'Yash Chopra, K.G. Koregaonkar', 'Salim Khan, Javed Akhtar', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Shashi Kapoor, Sanjeev Kumar, Hema Malini, Rakhee Gulzar, Waheeda Rehman, Prem Chopra, Poonam Dhillon', null, 'Vijay Kumar is the illegitimate son of a construction baron, Raj Kumar Gupta and his first love, Shanti, whom Raj had given up in order to marry a wealthy heiress. Raj does not know of this son, who grows up and after his mother''s death comes to Delhi to take revenge on the Gupta family by destroying the family''s business and their relation with each other.', 'Vijay Kumar is the illegitimate son of a construction baron, Raj Kumar Gupta and his first love, Shanti, whom Raj had given up in order to marry a wealthy heiress. Raj does not know of this son, who grows up and after his mother''s death comes to Delhi to take revenge on the Gupta family by destroying the family''s business and their relation with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmxAyMFJRYDambW54HnSs5lqfpY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108016'),
  ('465598894945671438', 'Tristan', 2003, 'Thriller', 'Philippe Harel, Matthieu Poirot-Delpech, Brieuc Vanderswalm', 'Olivier Dazat', 'Mathilde Seigner, Nicole Garcia, Jean-Louis Loca, Jean-Jacques Vanier, Adina Cartianu, Daniel Cohen, Marie-Claude Mestral, Michel Duchaussoy', null, 'A killer has found a way to kill women without committing the crime. He gets them to fall in love with him, like Isolde falls for Tristan in the epic poem, and then he leaves them. Heartbroken they choose suicide, just like Isolde.', 'A killer has found a way to kill women without committing the crime. He gets them to fall in love with him, like Isolde falls for Tristan in the epic poem, and then he leaves them. Heartbroken they choose suicide, just like Isolde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xHkouHoKrqPnow43fAo9OuTScP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65957'),
  ('128612880779635639', 'Tristan & Isolde', 2002, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Romance', 'Thierry Schiel', 'Mike Carey, Thierry Schiel', 'Louis Wright, Ciara Barker, Derek Kueter', null, 'Who''s afraid of giants and dragons when you''ve got love and a couple of magical mischief-makers on your side? In a magical land, the brave knight Tristan and the beautiful Princess Isolde meet and fall in love. The evil schemes of envious Baron Ganelon threaten their love, but they''ll get by with a little help from their friends-the wiley, wood-sprite Puck and a feisty fairy called Teazle.', 'Who''s afraid of giants and dragons when you''ve got love and a couple of magical mischief-makers on your side? In a magical land, the brave knight Tristan and the beautiful Princess Isolde meet and fall in love. The evil schemes of envious Baron Ganelon threaten their love, but they''ll get by with a little help from their friends-the wiley, wood-sprite Puck and a feisty fairy called Teazle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVQURMbCVMd5i3vmCqL5KP8wTlP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67813'),
  ('37110611460472902', 'Tristan & Isolde', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kevin Reynolds, Artur Reinhart, Rory Bruen', 'Dean Georgaris', 'James Franco, Sophia Myles, Rufus Sewell, David O''Hara, Mark Strong, Henry Cavill, Bronagh Gallagher, Ronan Vibert', 'PG-13', 'An affair between the second in line to Britain''s throne and the princess of the feuding Irish spells doom for the young lovers.', 'An affair between the second in line to Britain''s throne and the princess of the feuding Irish spells doom for the young lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7TpY5hJ4jQGH7c8yzJgBnTwPH6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9044'),
  ('736299635218746575', 'Tristana', 1970, 'Drama', 'Luis Buñuel, José F. Aguayo, Pierre Lary', 'Julio Alejandro', 'Catherine Deneuve, Fernando Rey, Franco Nero, Lola Gaos, Antonio Casas, Jesús Fernández, Vicente Soler, José Calvo', 'PG-13', 'As a young woman, Tristana is orphaned and taken under the guardianship of Don Lope, a respected member of the community, who takes advantage of his innocent charge. When Tristana falls in love with artist Horacio, she must learn to be more assertive in order to achieve independence from her nefarious guardian, or her blossoming relationship with Horatio is doomed.', 'As a young woman, Tristana is orphaned and taken under the guardianship of Don Lope, a respected member of the community, who takes advantage of his innocent charge. When Tristana falls in love with artist Horacio, she must learn to be more assertive in order to achieve independence from her nefarious guardian, or her blossoming relationship with Horatio is doomed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zs695dsih9HRlj0YF4rujHTRya5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35838'),
  ('925964668658219956', 'Triumph', 2021, 'Drama', 'Brett Leonard', 'Michael D. Coffey', 'RJ Mitte, Terrence Howard, Johnathon Schaech, Colton Haynes, Grace Victoria Cox, Rob Gough, John Newberg, Allee Sutton Hethcoat', 'PG-13', 'A bright and determined teen who has mild cerebral palsy strives to be a wrestler on his high school''s team and to win over the heart of a classmate, the girl of his dreams.', 'A bright and determined teen who has mild cerebral palsy strives to be a wrestler on his high school''s team and to win over the heart of a classmate, the girl of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZJGjvoXXvE76lFilVjleAIOKSi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:809910'),
  ('783467592354656849', 'Triumph of the Spirit', 1989, 'Drama, War, History', 'Robert M. Young, Curtis Clark', 'Andrzej Krakowski, Laurence Heath', 'Willem Dafoe, Edward James Olmos, Robert Loggia, Wendy Gazelle, Kelly Wolf, Costas Mandylor, Kario Salem, Edward Żentara', 'R', 'During World War II, Salamo Arouch, a passionate boxer, is arrested and sent to a concentration camp. Soon, he is forced to box against his fellow prisoners for the sake of entertainment.', 'During World War II, Salamo Arouch, a passionate boxer, is arrested and sent to a concentration camp. Soon, he is forced to box against his fellow prisoners for the sake of entertainment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxaSARmpCiFOCaxwGvjYAXMYPE4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56179'),
  ('772083422446066793', 'Triumph of the Will', 1935, 'Documentary', 'Leni Riefenstahl, Sepp Allgeier, Karl Attenberger', 'Leni Riefenstahl, Walter Ruttmann, Eberhard Taubert', 'Adolf Hitler, Max Amann, Hermann Göring, Martin Bormann, Hans Frank, Sepp Dietrich, Joseph Goebbels, Erich Raeder', null, 'A showcase of German chancellor and Nazi Party leader Adolf Hitler at the 1934 Nuremberg Rally.', 'A showcase of German chancellor and Nazi Party leader Adolf Hitler at the 1934 Nuremberg Rally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyXCugoQzJ85mdrdz4dboqP8FoX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39266'),
  ('69131623323662065', 'Triumph Over Violence', 1965, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Mikhail Romm, German Lavrov, Lev Indenbom', 'Maya Turovskaya, Mikhail Romm, Yuriy Khaniutin', 'Mikhail Romm, Marlene Dietrich, Joseph Goebbels, Adolf Hitler, Benito Mussolini, Oswald Mosley, Martin Bormann, Willy Brandt', null, 'Romm pulls out all the stops in its selection of documentary material to draw the viewer not only into absolute horror about fascism and nazism in the 1920s–1940s Europe, but also to a firm conviction that nothing of the sort should be allowed to happen again anywhere in the world.', 'Romm pulls out all the stops in its selection of documentary material to draw the viewer not only into absolute horror about fascism and nazism in the 1920s–1940s Europe, but also to a firm conviction that nothing of the sort should be allowed to happen again anywhere in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbgMTTwF7gefKNEFMTkOQHR57KQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53194'),
  ('463164662786701902', 'Triumphs of a Man Called Horse', 1983, 'Western', 'John Hough, John Cabrera, John Alcott', 'Carlos Aured, Ken Blackwell', 'Richard Harris, Michael Beck, Ana De Sade, Vaughn Armstrong, Anne Seymour, Buck Taylor, Lautaro Murúa, Simón Andreu', 'PG', 'Shunka Wakan, formerly Lord John, helps his Dakota son defend their tribe against gold rushers.', 'Shunka Wakan, formerly Lord John, helps his Dakota son defend their tribe against gold rushers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CcgAuVN9XtrvGf5fpnbDn8YZz7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124721'),
  ('995363268298453850', 'Trivial', 2007, 'Thriller', 'Sophie Marceau, Laurent Dailland', 'Gianguido Spinelli, Sophie Marceau, Jacques Deschamps', 'Sophie Marceau, Christopher Lambert, Nicolas Briançon, Simon Abkarian, Robert Hossein, Marie-Christine Barrault, Judith Magre, Marilou Berry', null, 'An inspector who just suffered a family tragedy is looking for a missing older man. Man''s family is of no help, or are they hiding something? He is helped by a ghost of an actress who died 30 years ago, or is he slowly going insane?', 'An inspector who just suffered a family tragedy is looking for a missing older man. Man''s family is of no help, or are they hiding something? He is helped by a ghost of an actress who died 30 years ago, or is he slowly going insane?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sLGZx6D78OLUrbCRuAY4lm2zDx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10524'),
  ('959603410068217314', 'Trivisa', 2016, 'Drama, Crime', 'Frank Hui, Jevons Au Man-Kit, Kiwi Chow Kwun-Wai', 'Lung Man-Hong, Thomas Ng Ki Wai, Mak Tin-Shu', 'Richie Jen, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, To Yin-Gor, Zhang Kai, Le Zi-Long, Philip Keung Ho-Man, Thimjapo Chattida', null, 'Hong Kong''s three notorious thieves who have never met one another before appear in the same restaurant. This leads to a rumour that they are joining forces to pull off something big before the Handover, though this is not something that any of them.', 'Hong Kong''s three notorious thieves who have never met one another before appear in the same restaurant. This leads to a rumour that they are joining forces to pull off something big before the Handover, though this is not something that any of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhsLDrUx1Oc22daT5GBnhsD53CJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380762'),
  ('88656750793347746', 'Trixie', 2000, 'Action, Comedy, Mystery, Thriller', 'Alan Rudolph, Allan Harmon, Ali Salamati', 'Alan Rudolph', 'Emily Watson, Dermot Mulroney, Nick Nolte, Nathan Lane, Brittany Murphy, Lesley Ann Warren, Will Patton, Stephen Lang', 'R', 'Passed over at work and numbed after she witnesses a colleague''s murder, security guard Trixie Zurbo takes a relatively easy job at a lakefront casino, working undercover keeping an eye out for pickpockets. Trixie meets an assortment of colorful regulars: Kirk Stans, the casino''s lounge act who drinks too much and is a dead-on mimic; Ruby Pearli , a glamorous, young and knowledgeable barfly; and Dex Lang, a raffish ladies'' man who pays attention to Trixie in a way that''s hard for her to ignore.', 'Passed over at work and numbed after she witnesses a colleague''s murder, security guard Trixie Zurbo takes a relatively easy job at a lakefront casino, working undercover keeping an eye out for pickpockets. Trixie meets an assortment of colorful regulars: Kirk Stans, the casino''s lounge act who drinks too much and is a dead-on mimic; Ruby Pearli , a glamorous, young and knowledgeable barfly; and Dex Lang, a raffish ladies'' man who pays attention to Trixie in a way that''s hard for her to ignore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWNoZeG9GYj1uCBWIAlE5BRL7ad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31610'),
  ('793033534199700716', 'Trixie Mattel: Moving Parts', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Nicholas Zeig-Owens, Ezequiel Casares, Nicholas Zeig-Owens', null, 'Trixie Mattel, BenDeLaCreme, Bob the Drag Queen, Jaymes Mansfield, Jinkx Monsoon, Katya Zamolodchikova, Kennedy Davenport, Latrice Royale', null, 'Trixie charmed audiences and judges as winner of RuPaul''s Drag Race All Stars. But the grind of performing and the pressure of the title proves that heavy is the head that wears the tiara.', 'Trixie charmed audiences and judges as winner of RuPaul''s Drag Race All Stars. But the grind of performing and the pressure of the title proves that heavy is the head that wears the tiara.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dRP8bHtrV2lTITjSpFKptuqR2Gq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589367'),
  ('571760545266497776', 'Trog', 1970, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Freddie Francis, Desmond Dickinson', 'Aben Kandel', 'Joan Crawford, Michael Gough, Bernard Kay, Kim Braden, David Griffin, John Hamill, Thorley Walters, Jack May', null, 'Anthropologist Dr Brockton unearths a primitive troglodyte — an Ice Age ''missing link'': half-caveman, half-ape — in a local cave. Through experimentation, she manages to communicate with and domesticate him before he''s released by an irate land developer and goes on a rampage, terrorising the local citizenry.', 'Anthropologist Dr Brockton unearths a primitive troglodyte — an Ice Age ''missing link'': half-caveman, half-ape — in a local cave. Through experimentation, she manages to communicate with and domesticate him before he''s released by an irate land developer and goes on a rampage, terrorising the local citizenry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGSYOU7ozwVTjutl9T8SshPTzPd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44000'),
  ('173286196279890727', 'Trojan War', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Huang, Dean Semler, Jeff Dashnaw', 'Scott Myers, Andy Burg', 'Will Friedle, Jennifer Love Hewitt, Marley Shelton, Danny Masterson, Jason Marsden, Eric Balfour, Jennie Kwan, Charlotte Ayanna', 'PG-13', 'Brad is about to hook up with the girl of his dreams, but runs into a problem, no condom. So Brad sets out into the night to find one, running into many obstacles along the way, while not knowing his best friend, Leah is in love with him.', 'Brad is about to hook up with the girl of his dreams, but runs into a problem, no condom. So Brad sets out into the night to find one, running into many obstacles along the way, while not knowing his best friend, Leah is in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSvcgwbuWZXRPjqU8lYFtyuj8s6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14330'),
  ('430081062284743041', 'Troll', 1986, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'John Carl Buechler, Romano Albani', 'Ed Naha', 'Noah Hathaway, Jenny Beck, Phil Fondacaro, Michael Moriarty, Shelley Hack, Julia Louis-Dreyfus, June Lockhart, Anne Lockhart', 'PG-13', 'When a family moves into a San Francisco apartment, an opportunistic troll decides to make his move and take possession of little Wendy, thereby paving the way for new troll recruits, the first in his army that will take eventual control of the planet. We soon discover Torok is the ex-husband of Eunice St. Clair, a resident in the building who was married to Torok.', 'When a family moves into a San Francisco apartment, an opportunistic troll decides to make his move and take possession of little Wendy, thereby paving the way for new troll recruits, the first in his army that will take eventual control of the planet. We soon discover Torok is the ex-husband of Eunice St. Clair, a resident in the building who was married to Torok.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqU0HnCty94ds8e4At4TzEH3CcY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33061'),
  ('1124339348205274296', 'Troll', 2022, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Jallo Faber, Sascha Marden, Roar Uthaug', 'Espen Aukan', 'Ine Marie Wilmann, Kim S. Falck-Jørgensen, Mads Sjøgård Pettersen, Gard B. Eidsvold, Anneke von der Lippe, Fridtjov Såheim, Dennis Storhøi, Karoline Viktoria Sletteng Garvang', 'PG-13', 'When an explosion in the Norwegian mountains awakens an ancient troll, officials appoint a fearless paleontologist to stop it from wreaking deadly havoc.', 'When an explosion in the Norwegian mountains awakens an ancient troll, officials appoint a fearless paleontologist to stop it from wreaking deadly havoc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulgKdif3ubMACDltr8VZy6fyVjW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:736526'),
  ('993363123217330055', 'Troll 2', 1990, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Claudio Fragasso, Giancarlo Ferrando', 'Claudio Fragasso, Rossella Drudi', 'Michael Stephenson, George Hardy, Margo Prey, Connie Young, Robert Ormsby, Deborah Reed, Jason Wright, Darren Ewing', 'PG-13', 'When young Joshua learns that he will be going on vacation with his family to a small town called Nilbog, he protests adamantly. He is warned by the spirit of his deceased grandfather that goblins populate the town. His parents, Michael and Diana, dismiss his apprehensions, but soon learn to appreciate their son''s warnings. Guided by his grandfather''s ghost, will Joshua and his family stand a chance in fighting off these evil beings?', 'When young Joshua learns that he will be going on vacation with his family to a small town called Nilbog, he protests adamantly. He is warned by the spirit of his deceased grandfather that goblins populate the town. His parents, Michael and Diana, dismiss his apprehensions, but soon learn to appreciate their son''s warnings. Guided by his grandfather''s ghost, will Joshua and his family stand a chance in fighting off these evil beings?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFth6zw4PEInzr2Y64mYVN1zbBi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26914'),
  ('950476887141001251', 'Troll 2', 2025, 'Action, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Roar Uthaug, Jallo Faber, Marcell Bajor', 'Espen Aukan', 'Ine Marie Wilmann, Kim S. Falck-Jørgensen, Mads Sjøgård Pettersen, Sara Khorami, Karoline Viktoria Sletteng Garvang, Anne Krigsvoll, Duc Mai-The, Jon Ketil Johnsen', 'PG-13', 'When a dangerous new troll unleashes devastation across their homeland, Nora, Andreas and Major Kris embark on their most perilous mission yet.', 'When a dangerous new troll unleashes devastation across their homeland, Nora, Andreas and Major Kris embark on their most perilous mission yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6xAExLNFbHcLfvSuvLPoM8aqZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180831'),
  ('39676112473794107', 'Troll Factory', 2024, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ahn Gooc-jin, Cho Hyoung-rae, Lee Gil-gyu', 'Ahn Gooc-jin', 'Son Suk-ku, Kim Dong-hwi, Kim Sung-cheol, Hong Kyung, Lee Seo-hwan, Choi Deok-moon, Lee Sun-hee, David Lee', null, 'Journalist Sang-jin uncovers the existence of the so-called ''Troll Factory'' while investigating an online public sentiment manipulation story, and is confronted with an unbelievable truth.', 'Journalist Sang-jin uncovers the existence of the so-called ''Troll Factory'' while investigating an online public sentiment manipulation story, and is confronted with an unbelievable truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1joLg8gwVTZe7tarh0isaWntdhQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1007127'),
  ('948698436911970765', 'Troll Hunter', 2010, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'André Øvredal, Hallvard Bræin, Nina Bergström', 'André Øvredal', 'Otto Jespersen, Glenn Erland Tosterud, Johanna Mørck, Tomas Alf Larsen, Hans Morten Hansen, Urmila Berg-Domaas, Knut Nærum, Robert Stoltenberg', 'PG-13', 'A group of students investigates a series of mysterious bear killings, but learns that there are much more dangerous things going on. They start to follow a mysterious hunter, learning that he is actually a troll hunter.', 'A group of students investigates a series of mysterious bear killings, but learns that there are much more dangerous things going on. They start to follow a mysterious hunter, learning that he is actually a troll hunter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2W5NEz0p9jPFzbbYt0dP86gsOX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46146'),
  ('403317308063320096', 'Trolley Troubles', 1927, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Walt Disney', null, null, null, 'Oswald, the trolley conductor gets stopped in the tracks by a cow who refuses to move. He then faces a steep hill, which the trolley has trouble with. When it finally gets over the hill, the trolley speeds wildly out of control. Can Oswald''s lucky rabbit''s foot save him?', 'Oswald, the trolley conductor gets stopped in the tracks by a cow who refuses to move. He then faces a steep hill, which the trolley has trouble with. When it finally gets over the hill, the trolley speeds wildly out of control. Can Oswald''s lucky rabbit''s foot save him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urGfVjp2iM8gKzNJH45WRDXCqWI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106555'),
  ('577609666813475253', 'Trollhunters: Rise of the Titans', 2021, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family, Action, Adventure', 'Johane Matte, Francisco Ruiz Velasco, Andrew L. Schmidt', 'Guillermo del Toro, Dan Hageman, Kevin Hageman', 'Emile Hirsch, Lexi Medrano, Charlie Saxton, Kelsey Grammer, Alfred Molina, Steven Yeun, Nick Frost, Colin O''Donoghue', 'PG', 'The Guardians of Arcadia reunite to battle the nefarious Arcane Order, who''ve reawakened the primordial Titans.', 'The Guardians of Arcadia reunite to battle the nefarious Arcane Order, who''ve reawakened the primordial Titans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvUNFeTz0Sssb210wSiIiHRjA4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:730840'),
  ('151222504458503528', 'Trolls', 2016, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy, Music', 'Yong Duk Jhun, Mike Mitchell, Walt Dohrn', 'Jonathan Aibel, Glenn Berger', 'Anna Kendrick, Justin Timberlake, Zooey Deschanel, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, Christine Baranski, Russell Brand, James Corden, Jeffrey Tambor', 'PG', 'After the monstrous Bergens invade Troll Village, Princess Poppy, the happiest Troll ever born, and overly-cautious, curmudgeonly outcast Branch set off on a journey to rescue her friends. Their mission is full of adventure and mishaps, as this mismatched duo try to tolerate each other long enough to get the job done.', 'After the monstrous Bergens invade Troll Village, Princess Poppy, the happiest Troll ever born, and overly-cautious, curmudgeonly outcast Branch set off on a journey to rescue her friends. Their mission is full of adventure and mishaps, as this mismatched duo try to tolerate each other long enough to get the job done.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VlK2j0THZWzhQPq0W3Oc0IIdBB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136799'),
  ('712133496221317017', 'Trolls Band Together', 2023, 'Animation, Family, Music, Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure', 'Walt Dohrn, Tim Heitz', 'Elizabeth Tippet', 'Anna Kendrick, Justin Timberlake, Camila Cabello, Eric André, Amy Schumer, Andrew Rannells, Daveed Diggs, Troye Sivan', 'PG', 'When Branch''s brother, Floyd, is kidnapped for his musical talents by a pair of nefarious pop-star villains, Branch and Poppy embark on a harrowing and emotional journey to reunite the other brothers and rescue Floyd from a fate even worse than pop-culture obscurity.', 'When Branch''s brother, Floyd, is kidnapped for his musical talents by a pair of nefarious pop-star villains, Branch and Poppy embark on a harrowing and emotional journey to reunite the other brothers and rescue Floyd from a fate even worse than pop-culture obscurity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ySgD2xwasTHOK6R9bNZiEwKgYo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:901362'),
  ('720018066657045395', 'Trolls Holiday', 2017, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Joel Crawford, Lisa Curtis Saunders', 'Jonathan Fener, Josh Bycel', 'Anna Kendrick, Justin Timberlake, Zooey Deschanel, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, James Corden, Ron Funches, Kunal Nayyar, Caroline Hjelt', 'PG', 'When the eternally optimistic Poppy, queen of the Trolls, learns that the Bergens no longer have any holidays on their calendar, she enlists the help of Branch and the rest of the gang on a delightfully quirky mission to fix something that the Bergens don''t think is broken.', 'When the eternally optimistic Poppy, queen of the Trolls, learns that the Bergens no longer have any holidays on their calendar, she enlists the help of Branch and the rest of the gang on a delightfully quirky mission to fix something that the Bergens don''t think is broken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJV03Etqdv9mJSixgIVn7dstoNc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484510'),
  ('1112893827719015117', 'Trolls Holiday in Harmony', 2021, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family, Comedy', 'Sean Charmatz, Tim Heitz, Chris Stover', 'Sean Charmatz, Tim Heitz', 'Anna Kendrick, Justin Timberlake, Kenan Thompson, Travis Scott, Carol Burnett, Rachel Bloom, Ron Funches, Kunal Nayyar', 'PG', 'Queen Poppy plans the first annual Trolls Kingdom Secret Holiday Gift Swap, but things don''t go quite as expected.', 'Queen Poppy plans the first annual Trolls Kingdom Secret Holiday Gift Swap, but things don''t go quite as expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApI9VK7pq3Bo32Psg0PoRadraWs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:896221'),
  ('841465596456833661', 'Trolls World Tour', 2020, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure, Music', 'Kathryn Rumohr, Walt Dohrn, David P. Smith', 'Glenn Berger, Wallace Wolodarsky, Jonathan Aibel', 'Anna Kendrick, Justin Timberlake, Ron Funches, Rachel Bloom, James Corden, Kelly Clarkson, Anderson .Paak, Sam Rockwell', 'PG', 'Queen Poppy and Branch make a surprising discovery — there are other Troll worlds beyond their own, and their distinct differences create big clashes between these various tribes. When a mysterious threat puts all of the Trolls across the land in danger, Poppy, Branch, and their band of friends must embark on an epic quest to create harmony among the feuding Trolls to unite them against certain doom.', 'Queen Poppy and Branch make a surprising discovery — there are other Troll worlds beyond their own, and their distinct differences create big clashes between these various tribes. When a mysterious threat puts all of the Trolls across the land in danger, Poppy, Branch, and their band of friends must embark on an epic quest to create harmony among the feuding Trolls to unite them against certain doom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7W0G3YECgDAfnuiHG91r8WqgIOe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446893'),
  ('221920669509215528', 'Troma''s War', 1988, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Michael Herz, Lloyd Kaufman, Denis Hahn', 'Lloyd Kaufman, Mitchell Dana', 'Carolyn Beauchamp, Sean Bowen, Rick Washburn, Patrick Weathers, Jessica Dublin, Steven Crossley, Lorayn Lane Deluca, Charles Kay-Hune', 'R', 'A small group of typical Tromaville citizens find themselves in the path of a terrorist army controlled by the power elite...', 'A small group of typical Tromaville citizens find themselves in the path of a terrorist army controlled by the power elite...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5juN2j8A2IJo34YrleEMvCJimDz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28173'),
  ('1075011214081831211', 'Trombone Trouble', 1944, 'Animation', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, Billy Bletcher, John McLeish', 'NR', 'Pegleg Pete is practicing his trombone, badly. So badly, it''s annoying the gods Jupiter and Vulcan and neighbor Donald. Only Donald has the temerity to confront him. He does, and Pete kicks him back home. The gods see this, and decide to give Donald a little bit of power which instantly goes to his head.', 'Pegleg Pete is practicing his trombone, badly. So badly, it''s annoying the gods Jupiter and Vulcan and neighbor Donald. Only Donald has the temerity to confront him. He does, and Pete kicks him back home. The gods see this, and decide to give Donald a little bit of power which instantly goes to his head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KexNnyK3wGjV0XgrwFTb4nADkD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67702'),
  ('179020897881992368', 'Tromeo & Juliet', 1996, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lloyd Kaufman, James Gunn, Brendan Flynt', 'Lloyd Kaufman, James Gunn', 'Jane Jensen, Will Keenan, Valentine Miele, William Beckwith, Steve Gibbons, Sean Gunn, Debbie Rochon, Lemmy Kilmister', null, 'All the body-piercing, kinky sex, and car crashes that Shakespeare wanted but never had! Join Tromeo and Juliet as they travel through Manhattan''s underground in search of climactic love, violence and the American Way.', 'All the body-piercing, kinky sex, and car crashes that Shakespeare wanted but never had! Join Tromeo and Juliet as they travel through Manhattan''s underground in search of climactic love, violence and the American Way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqLSSp1PEzOeCQsLxzlySQUPZrK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16233'),
  ('722609598783515484', 'Tron', 1982, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Steven Lisberger, Bruce Logan', 'Steven Lisberger', 'Jeff Bridges, Bruce Boxleitner, David Warner, Cindy Morgan, Barnard Hughes, Dan Shor, Peter Jurasik, Tony Stephano', 'PG', 'When brilliant video game maker Flynn hacks the mainframe of his ex-employer, he is beamed inside an astonishing digital world and becomes part of the very game he is designing. In his mission through cyberspace, Flynn matches wits with a maniacal Master Control Program and teams up with Tron, a security measure created to bring balance to the digital environment.', 'When brilliant video game maker Flynn hacks the mainframe of his ex-employer, he is beamed inside an astonishing digital world and becomes part of the very game he is designing. In his mission through cyberspace, Flynn matches wits with a maniacal Master Control Program and teams up with Tron, a security measure created to bring balance to the digital environment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jigY9B6TKz4qlfikZcd18qtzTK4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97'),
  ('873040846442185399', 'TRON: Ares', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Joachim Rønning, Jeff Cronenweth, Donald Sparks', 'Jesse Wigutow', 'Jared Leto, Greta Lee, Evan Peters, Gillian Anderson, Jodie Turner-Smith, Jeff Bridges, Hasan Minhaj, Arturo Castro', 'PG-13', 'A highly sophisticated Program called Ares is sent from the digital world into the real world on a dangerous mission, marking humankind''s first encounter with A.I. beings.', 'A highly sophisticated Program called Ares is sent from the digital world into the real world on a dangerous mission, marking humankind''s first encounter with A.I. beings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chpWmskl3aKm1aTZqUHRCtviwPy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:533533'),
  ('261672136393361049', 'TRON: Legacy', 2010, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'Joseph Kosinski, Claudio Miranda, Bruce Franklin', 'Edward Kitsis, Adam Horowitz, Brian Klugman', 'Garrett Hedlund, Olivia Wilde, Jeff Bridges, Bruce Boxleitner, James Frain, Beau Garrett, Michael Sheen, Anis Cheurfa', 'PG', 'Sam Flynn, the tech-savvy and daring son of Kevin Flynn, investigates his father''s disappearance and is pulled into The Grid. With the help of a mysterious program named Quorra, Sam quests to stop evil dictator Clu from crossing into the real world.', 'Sam Flynn, the tech-savvy and daring son of Kevin Flynn, investigates his father''s disappearance and is pulled into The Grid. With the help of a mysterious program named Quorra, Sam quests to stop evil dictator Clu from crossing into the real world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Nc6R8k7bG8frSiDJo0oLucF7dN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20526'),
  ('585710165485921149', 'TRON: The Next Day', 2011, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Kurt Mattila, Keith Dunkerley, Keoni Chock', 'Robert Auten, Kurt Mattila', 'Bruce Boxleitner, Jeff Bridges, Paul Dzenkiw, Garrett Hedlund, Dan Shor, David Warner, Mary Kate Wiles, Michael Noyes', 'G', 'TRON: The Next Day is a 10-minute short film, released on the Blu-ray edition of TRON: Legacy in April 2011, that fills in the backstory between TRON and TRON: Legacy. It features scenes from the real-world Flynn Lives ARG as well as purely in-universe content. The short film also reveals the full chronology of the Flynn Lives Organization, naming Roy Kleinberg as the secret figure heading up the operation and Alan Bradley as its financial backer. Some scenes in the short also set up the story for a potential third film.', 'TRON: The Next Day is a 10-minute short film, released on the Blu-ray edition of TRON: Legacy in April 2011, that fills in the backstory between TRON and TRON: Legacy. It features scenes from the real-world Flynn Lives ARG as well as purely in-universe content. The short film also reveals the full chronology of the Flynn Lives Organization, naming Roy Kleinberg as the secret figure heading up the operation and Alan Bradley as its financial backer. Some scenes in the short also set up the story for a potential third film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rttPiOhkk3mnVuU4a8jeeZvC8Zh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73362'),
  ('448375425191802431', 'Troop Beverly Hills', 1989, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Jeff Kanew, Donald E. Thorin, Jack Frost Sanders', 'Margaret Oberman, Pamela Norris', 'Shelley Long, Craig T. Nelson, Betty Thomas, Mary Gross, Carla Gugino, Kellie Martin, Jenny Lewis, Karen Kopins', 'PG', 'A Beverly Hills housewife in the middle of a divorce tries to find focus in her life by taking over her daughter''s Wilderness Girls troop.', 'A Beverly Hills housewife in the middle of a divorce tries to find focus in her life by taking over her daughter''s Wilderness Girls troop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HOzh7t2THdZ3r9BaDucEjfzLlL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22102'),
