  ('128019550898206143', 'Tropic Thunder', 2008, 'Action, Comedy, Adventure, War', 'Ben Stiller, John Toll, Dieter Busch', 'Etan Cohen, Ben Stiller, Justin Theroux', 'Ben Stiller, Robert Downey Jr., Jack Black, Jay Baruchel, Brandon T. Jackson, Brandon Soo Hoo, Matthew McConaughey, Tom Cruise', 'R', 'A group of self-absorbed actors set out to make the most expensive war film ever. After ballooning costs force the studio to cancel the movie, the frustrated director refuses to stop shooting, leading his cast into the jungles of Southeast Asia, where they encounter real bad guys.', 'A group of self-absorbed actors set out to make the most expensive war film ever. After ballooning costs force the studio to cancel the movie, the frustrated director refuses to stop shooting, leading his cast into the jungles of Southeast Asia, where they encounter real bad guys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAurB9mNxfYRoVrVjAJJwGV3sPg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7446'),
