  ('146163697968829452', 'Tropical Fish', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Chen Yu-hsun, Liao Pen-jung', 'Chen Yu-hsun', 'Lin Chia-Hung, Shi Ching-Luen, Wen Ying, Akio Chen, Lin Cheng-sheng, Lien Pi-tung, Lang Tsu-Yun, Fan Hsiao-Fan', null, 'Young boy, Ah-Jiang, a school failure and day dreamer witnesses the kidnapping of a child. After being taken hostage by a corrupt family, he begins an unusual adventure away from home.', 'Young boy, Ah-Jiang, a school failure and day dreamer witnesses the kidnapping of a child. After being taken hostage by a corrupt family, he begins an unusual adventure away from home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKpiLL6sgxoO6TnebxKRwkhcwUC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83195'),
  ('548449820500908652', 'Tropical Malady', 2004, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Apichatpong Weerasethakul, Suchada Sirithanawuddhi, Sompot Chidgasornpongse', 'Apichatpong Weerasethakul', 'Banlop Lomnoi, Sakda Kaewbuadee, Siriwej Jareornchon, Udom Promma, Huey Deesom, Saritpong Boonyadison, Arna Rattapan, Donruedee Chana', 'NR', 'The passionate relationship between two men with unusual consequences. The film is divided in two parts. The first half charts the modest attraction between two men in the sunny, relaxing countryside and the second half charts the confusion and terror of an unknown menace lurking deep within the jungle shadows.', 'The passionate relationship between two men with unusual consequences. The film is divided in two parts. The first half charts the modest attraction between two men in the sunny, relaxing countryside and the second half charts the confusion and terror of an unknown menace lurking deep within the jungle shadows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WJ8ZSZp2NC7jSvweFLskldpzzg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11534'),
  ('95711907000528990', 'Tropical Rainforest', 1992, 'Documentary', 'Ben Shedd, Timothy Housel', 'Simon Campbell-Jones', 'Geoffrey Holder', null, 'The story of the evolution of tropical rain forests, their recent and rapid destruction, and the intense efforts of scientists to understand them even as they disappear. This film gives viewers a better appreciation of the importance of tropical rain forests on a global scale.', 'The story of the evolution of tropical rain forests, their recent and rapid destruction, and the intense efforts of scientists to understand them even as they disappear. This film gives viewers a better appreciation of the importance of tropical rain forests on a global scale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mq1NJ6Ry3nQJVB6P7KaMktdSepG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17705'),
  ('74646877936208591', 'Tropicália', 2012, 'Music, Documentary', 'Marcelo Machado', 'Di Moretti', 'Rogério Duarte, Gilberto Gil, Caetano Veloso, Tom Zé, Sérgio Dias, Arnaldo Baptista, Sidney Miller, Nara Leão', null, 'Set against the turbulent atmosphere of the 1960s, Tropicália is a feature length documentary exploring the Brazilian artistic movement known as Tropicália, and the struggle its artists endured to protect their right to freely express revolutionary thought against the traditional Brazilian music of that time.', 'Set against the turbulent atmosphere of the 1960s, Tropicália is a feature length documentary exploring the Brazilian artistic movement known as Tropicália, and the struggle its artists endured to protect their right to freely express revolutionary thought against the traditional Brazilian music of that time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4LPjoQ1FXtWT5ezahuQzAZy5lU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164120'),
