  ('465706017007546350', 'Trouble', 2005, 'Thriller', 'Harry Cleven', 'Harry Cleven, Isabelle Coudrier-Kleist', 'Benoît Magimel, Natacha Régnier, Nathan Lacroix, Olivier Gourmet, Patrick Descamps, Christian Crahay, Hanna Novak, Benjamin Engelman', null, 'The photographer and family man Matyas is married and has a happy life with his beloved wife Claire, who is pregnant and near the delivery, and his young son Pierre. Matyas was raised in an orphanage, and he believes his mother died when he was six. However, he receives a correspondence and discovers that his mother has just passed away and that he has a twin brother, Thomas. Matyas does not recall his childhood with his mother and brother and has problems with blood. When Thomas visits his family, Matyas becomes paranoid, believing that his sibling wishes to takeover his family.', 'The photographer and family man Matyas is married and has a happy life with his beloved wife Claire, who is pregnant and near the delivery, and his young son Pierre. Matyas was raised in an orphanage, and he believes his mother died when he was six. However, he receives a correspondence and discovers that his mother has just passed away and that he has a twin brother, Thomas. Matyas does not recall his childhood with his mother and brother and has problems with blood. When Thomas visits his family, Matyas becomes paranoid, believing that his sibling wishes to takeover his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXAiINDAxEzBT4kuQmYYjt2PCwb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48431'),
  ('995801343346587437', 'Trouble', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy, Music', 'Kevin Johnson', 'Judah Miller, Rob Muir, John Paul Murphy', 'Big Sean, Pamela Adlon, Lucy Hale, Marissa Jaret Winokur, Joel McHale, Wilmer Valderrama, Kevin Chamberlin, Colby Lopez', 'G', 'A pampered dog named Trouble must learn to live in the real world while trying to escape from his former owner''s greedy children and must learn how to survive on the big-city streets.', 'A pampered dog named Trouble must learn to live in the real world while trying to escape from his former owner''s greedy children and must learn how to survive on the big-city streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfTXk9T3iNxuOcnA72AirzueLxL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570480'),
  ('951385362118529315', 'Trouble', 2024, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Jon Holmberg, Erik Persson', 'Tapio Leopold, Jon Holmberg', 'Filip Berg, Amy Deasismont, Joakim Sällquist, Eva Melander, Måns Nathanaelson, Dejan Čukić, Björn Skifs, Sissela Benn', 'R', 'Wrongfully convicted of murder, a clumsy electronics salesman faces police corruption and criminal conspiracies in an attempt to prove his innocence.', 'Wrongfully convicted of murder, a clumsy electronics salesman faces police corruption and criminal conspiracies in an attempt to prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ildbg7ho14EHbt1fZWAkgqIyPqy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1210794'),
  ('680246813890927892', 'Trouble Along the Way', 1953, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Curtiz, Archie Stout, David Curtiz', 'Jack Rose, Melville Shavelson', 'John Wayne, Donna Reed, Chuck Connors, Charles Coburn, Tom Tully, Sherry Jackson, Marie Windsor, Tom Helmore', null, 'Struggling to retain custody of his daughter following his divorce, football coach Steve Williams finds himself embroiled in a recruiting scandal at the tiny Catholic college he is trying to bring back to football respectability.', 'Struggling to retain custody of his daughter following his divorce, football coach Steve Williams finds himself embroiled in a recruiting scandal at the tiny Catholic college he is trying to bring back to football respectability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIIWtP5oAEvVUkB61TooDUgY2mC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40686'),
  ('680104568777363953', 'Trouble at Timpetill', 2008, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Nicolas Bary, Axel Cosnefroy, Gilles Pointeau', 'Nicolas Bary, Nicolas Peufaillit, Fabrice Roger-Lacan', 'Raphaël Katz, Adèle Exarchopoulos, Léo Legrand, Carole Bouquet, Gérard Depardieu, Armelle, Baptiste Bétoulaud, Martin Jobert', null, 'The children of a small European mountain village end up being its only residents, soon after the adults cannot take their behavior any longer.', 'The children of a small European mountain village end up being its only residents, soon after the adults cannot take their behavior any longer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpM57XnYSWwUk4Xvkx8KLBJ0ESR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21788'),
  ('681024009389925944', 'Trouble Bound', 1993, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jeffrey Reiner, Janusz Kamiński, Rod Smith', 'Francis Delia, Darrell Fetty', 'Michael Madsen, Patricia Arquette, Darren Epton, Gregory Sporleder, Paul Ben-Victor, Billy Bob Thornton, Florence Stanley, Seymour Cassel', 'R', 'Upon getting out of prison, a man who took the rap for some thief buddies gets together with them again, and tells them he''s not interested in doing things with them any more. They stick a dead body in his trunk, unbeknownst to him, and he roars off to find his future. Unfortunately, they forgot to get the key they need off the body, so they''re chasing him. Meanwhile, a mafia kingpin''s daughter is trying to kill the hitman that killed her father, but her grandmother is trying to make peace with the family that hired the hitman, so she and her thugs are trying to stop the daughter. The guy and the daughter get together and experience mayhem on the run from two directions.', 'Upon getting out of prison, a man who took the rap for some thief buddies gets together with them again, and tells them he''s not interested in doing things with them any more. They stick a dead body in his trunk, unbeknownst to him, and he roars off to find his future. Unfortunately, they forgot to get the key they need off the body, so they''re chasing him. Meanwhile, a mafia kingpin''s daughter is trying to kill the hitman that killed her father, but her grandmother is trying to make peace with the family that hired the hitman, so she and her thugs are trying to stop the daughter. The guy and the daughter get together and experience mayhem on the run from two directions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57Je6PAxyW6EKf2sV4qIyfc1uhB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54845'),
  ('561622915471380755', 'Trouble Every Day', 2001, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Claire Denis, Agnès Godard, Gabriel Julien-Laferrière', 'Claire Denis, Jean-Pol Fargeau', 'Vincent Gallo, Tricia Vessey, Béatrice Dalle, Alex Descas, Florence Loiret Caille, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Raphaël Neal, José Garcia', 'NR', 'Newlyweds Shane and June arrive in Paris for their honeymoon. In the process of trying to find a cure for his strange, bloodthirsty disease, Shane stumbles upon the story of a doctor and his flesh eating wife.', 'Newlyweds Shane and June arrive in Paris for their honeymoon. In the process of trying to find a cure for his strange, bloodthirsty disease, Shane stumbles upon the story of a doctor and his flesh eating wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jn4799m6uB5P6ZUarlnxvZEZDFp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40723'),
  ('299785559144398017', 'Trouble in Mind', 1985, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Alan Rudolph, Toyomichi Kurita', 'Alan Rudolph', 'Kris Kristofferson, Keith Carradine, Lori Singer, Geneviève Bujold, Joe Morton, George Kirby, Divine, John Considine', 'R', 'The lives of an ex-con, a coffee-shop owner, and a young couple looking to make it rich intersect in the hypnotic Rain City.', 'The lives of an ex-con, a coffee-shop owner, and a young couple looking to make it rich intersect in the hypnotic Rain City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qyepsmFJ8tYFwk1FImAtsJmmXk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31694'),
  ('1055121057069180707', 'Trouble in Paradise', 1932, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Ernst Lubitsch, Victor Milner', 'Samson Raphaelson', 'Herbert Marshall, Kay Francis, Miriam Hopkins, Edward Everett Horton, Charles Ruggles, C. Aubrey Smith, Robert Greig, Luis Alberni', null, 'Thief Gaston Monescu and pickpocket Lily are partners in crime and love. Working for perfume company executive Mariette Colet, the two crooks decide to combine their criminal talents to rob their employer. Under the alias of Monsieur Laval, Gaston uses his position as Mariette''s personal secretary to become closer to her. However, he takes things too far when he actually falls in love with Mariette, and has to choose between her and Lily.', 'Thief Gaston Monescu and pickpocket Lily are partners in crime and love. Working for perfume company executive Mariette Colet, the two crooks decide to combine their criminal talents to rob their employer. Under the alias of Monsieur Laval, Gaston uses his position as Mariette''s personal secretary to become closer to her. However, he takes things too far when he actually falls in love with Mariette, and has to choose between her and Lily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FBxuoLRD3Biyul14unT5m3PYNS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195'),
  ('292624303056127568', 'Trouble in Store', 1953, 'Comedy, Family', 'John Paddy Carstairs', 'Ted Willis, Maurice Cowan, John Paddy Carstairs', 'Norman Wisdom, Margaret Rutherford, Moira Lister, Derek Bond, Lana Morris, Jerry Desmonde, Megs Jenkins, Joan Sims', null, 'Norman is working in the stock room of a large London department store, but he has ambition (doesn''t he always !!), he wants to be a window dresser making up the public displays. Whilst trying to fulfill his ambition, he falls in love (doesn''t he always !!), with one of the shopgirls. Together they discover a plot to rob the store and, somehow, manage to foil the robbers.', 'Norman is working in the stock room of a large London department store, but he has ambition (doesn''t he always !!), he wants to be a window dresser making up the public displays. Whilst trying to fulfill his ambition, he falls in love (doesn''t he always !!), with one of the shopgirls. Together they discover a plot to rob the store and, somehow, manage to foil the robbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlBlowWA83mgVZW95uRkRCTjJ5V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38388'),
  ('377782242688774216', 'Trouble Man', 1972, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Ivan Dixon, Michel Hugo', 'John D. F. Black', 'Robert Hooks, William Smithers, Paul Winfield, Ralph Waite, Paula Kelly, Gordon Jump, Jeannie Bell, Stack Pierce', 'R', 'It seems that masked men are knocking over the floating crap games of Chalky and Pete. Chalky and Pete hire the cool, loose, elegant Mr. T to fix things. Then, the masked manipulators set up the death of a collector for a rival gang lord. It looks like it''s up to T to hold a gang war from breaking out, keep the police off his back, and earn his fee from Chalky and Pete.', 'It seems that masked men are knocking over the floating crap games of Chalky and Pete. Chalky and Pete hire the cool, loose, elegant Mr. T to fix things. Then, the masked manipulators set up the death of a collector for a rival gang lord. It looks like it''s up to T to hold a gang war from breaking out, keep the police off his back, and earn his fee from Chalky and Pete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJPPdWX6ghQVaYDnVE7txw1Zb4i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21949'),
  ('563912440480650491', 'Trouble on Wheels', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Türksoy Gölebeyi, Burak Aksak', 'Burak Aksak', 'Cengiz Bozkurt, Seda Bakan, Erkan Kolçak Köstendil, Cihan Ercan, Berat Yenilmez, İştar Gökseven, Erdal Tosun, Hakan Salınmış', null, 'After the death of his wife and father, Kudret, who has always lived by the book, decides to go on a road trip to save a girl.', 'After the death of his wife and father, Kudret, who has always lived by the book, decides to go on a road trip to save a girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPcg1ebvvQOFry39XtspQAeY7Zj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361181'),
  ('583808421750936129', 'Trouble the Water', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Carl Deal, Tia Lessin, Kimberly Rivers Roberts', null, 'Scott Rogers, George W. Bush, Michael Brown, Julie Chen, Ray Nagin, Brian Nobles, Wink Rivers, Scott Roberts', null, '"Trouble the Water" takes you inside Hurricane Katrina in a way never before seen on screen. The film opens the day before the storm makes landfall--just blocks away from the French Quarter but far from the New Orleans that most tourists knew. Kimberly Rivers Roberts, an aspiring rap artist, is turning her new video camera on herself and her Ninth Ward neighbors trapped in the city. Weaving an insider''s view of Katrina with a mix of verité and in-your-face filmmaking, it is a redemptive tale of self-described street hustlers who become heroes--two unforgettable people who survive the storm and then seize a chance for a new beginning.', '"Trouble the Water" takes you inside Hurricane Katrina in a way never before seen on screen. The film opens the day before the storm makes landfall--just blocks away from the French Quarter but far from the New Orleans that most tourists knew. Kimberly Rivers Roberts, an aspiring rap artist, is turning her new video camera on herself and her Ninth Ward neighbors trapped in the city. Weaving an insider''s view of Katrina with a mix of verité and in-your-face filmmaking, it is a redemptive tale of self-described street hustlers who become heroes--two unforgettable people who survive the storm and then seize a chance for a new beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yRFpcdRnq2ixzb0pAig7ALURKJH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22319'),
  ('548119890507531133', 'Trouble with the Curve', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Robert Lorenz, Tom Stern, David M. Bernstein', 'Randy Brown', 'Clint Eastwood, Amy Adams, Justin Timberlake, Matthew Lillard, Jack Gilpin, John Goodman, Robert Patrick, Scott Eastwood', 'PG-13', 'Slowed by age and failing eyesight, crack baseball scout Gus Lobel takes his grown daughter along as he checks out the final prospect of his career. Along the way, the two renew their bond, and she catches the eye of a young player-turned-scout.', 'Slowed by age and failing eyesight, crack baseball scout Gus Lobel takes his grown daughter along as he checks out the final prospect of his career. Along the way, the two renew their bond, and she catches the eye of a young player-turned-scout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLZQVmxOj5kICbS5Pq7rB1cbPvP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87825'),
  ('301766179048704277', 'Troubled Water', 2008, 'Drama', 'Erik Poppe, John Christian Rosenlund, Ingeborg Klyve', 'Harald Rosenløw-Eeg', 'Pål Sverre Hagen, Trine Dyrholm, Ellen Dorrit Petersen, Fredrik Grøndahl, Trond Espen Seim, Angelou Garcia, Henriette Garcia, Terje Strømdahl', null, 'A man with a troubled past is released on parole. He finds work as a church organist and develops a rewarding relationship with a priest and her young son. However, his past soon catches up with him.', 'A man with a troubled past is released on parole. He finds work as a church organist and develops a rewarding relationship with a priest and her young son. However, his past soon catches up with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cIjQCJn1L31sssAtoNg8F6AdLAu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16095'),
  ('734223493262796058', 'Troubled Waters', 2019, 'Crime, TV Movie, Drama, Thriller', 'Christian Faure', 'Franck Thilliez, Mikael Ollivier', 'Nicolas Gob, Thomas Jouannet, Éva Darlan, Michel Cordes, Aude Legastelois, Elise Tielrooy, Folco Marchi, Claire-Aurore Bartolo', null, 'Off the coast of Montpellier, a diver exploring a wreck uncovers a highly sought-after treasure: a golden statuette of Medusa, the monster from Greek mythology. The day after his discovery, the young man''s boat is found adrift, with no one on board. Has the curse surrounding the legendary statue struck again? Or is a rival treasure hunter behind the diver''s disappearance? - It''s up to Police Captain Guillaume Le Guen of Montpellier''s regional crime squad and his brother, Gendarmerie Captain Damien Le Guen, to solve the mystery. There''s no time to waste and they''ll need all their investigative skills, particularly because the victim is none other than Thibault Gagneur, Guillaume''s son-in-law, whose daughter Emilie is expecting his grandchild.', 'Off the coast of Montpellier, a diver exploring a wreck uncovers a highly sought-after treasure: a golden statuette of Medusa, the monster from Greek mythology. The day after his discovery, the young man''s boat is found adrift, with no one on board. Has the curse surrounding the legendary statue struck again? Or is a rival treasure hunter behind the diver''s disappearance? - It''s up to Police Captain Guillaume Le Guen of Montpellier''s regional crime squad and his brother, Gendarmerie Captain Damien Le Guen, to solve the mystery. There''s no time to waste and they''ll need all their investigative skills, particularly because the victim is none other than Thibault Gagneur, Guillaume''s son-in-law, whose daughter Emilie is expecting his grandchild.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDHSK15MBFKqjQmVBjFggmCGYS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:619396'),
  ('31288245989674344', 'Troublemaker Hüsnü', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Natuk Baytan, İsmail Güneş, Zuhal Üstüntaş', 'Ahmet Üstel', 'Kemal Sunal, Oya Aydoğan, Şevket Altuğ, Nermin Denizci, Ali Şen, Atilla Ergün, Rıza Pekkutsal, Süheyl Eğriboz', null, 'Hüsnü is a lovestruck young man determined to win the heart of his neighborhood’s beauty, Hüsniye, and enlists his friend’s dubious tactics to no avail. When a thug seizes the neighborhood deeds and forces everyone to flee, Hüsnü tries to become the local tough guy to save his community and impress Hüsniye, but his bravado draws the attention of a hired killer.', 'Hüsnü is a lovestruck young man determined to win the heart of his neighborhood’s beauty, Hüsniye, and enlists his friend’s dubious tactics to no avail. When a thug seizes the neighborhood deeds and forces everyone to flee, Hüsnü tries to become the local tough guy to save his community and impress Hüsniye, but his bravado draws the attention of a hired killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oyjtzHkyeigMz2NsnRCM1K4cMYI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123612'),
  ('919221667640840196', 'Troublemakers', 1994, 'Western, Comedy, Romance', 'Carlo Tafani, Terence Hill, Daniela Giovannoni', 'Jess Hill', 'Terence Hill, Bud Spencer, Boots Southerland, Ruth Buzzi, Neil Summers, Michael Huddleston, Anne Kasprik, Eva Haßmann', 'PG', 'Two brothers who hate themselves are going to spend Christmas with their mother. She tries to get them together.', 'Two brothers who hate themselves are going to spend Christmas with their mother. She tries to get them together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZbP807sIDkBvDKBMEeLfPo7jbg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9287'),
  ('152993087315200340', 'Troubles of a Grass Widower', 1908, 'Comedy', 'Max Linder', null, 'Max Linder', null, 'A housewife tires of her husband''s annoying behavior and returns to her mother. At first, the husband is quite pleased to have the house all to himself. But he quickly discovers that even the most basic domestic chores can be fraught with difficulty.', 'A housewife tires of her husband''s annoying behavior and returns to her mother. At first, the husband is quite pleased to have the house all to himself. But he quickly discovers that even the most basic domestic chores can be fraught with difficulty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99YTIQmEozMDzQ3Me8EPrtUOBz3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263860'),
  ('616641400102276719', 'Troubleshooter', 2010, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Kwon Hyeok-jae, Jeong Seok-won, Kim Seong-hun', 'Ryoo Seung-wan, Kim Jeong-min, Kwon Hyeok-jae', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Lee Jung-jin, Oh Dal-su, Ju Jin-mo, Lee Sung-min, Moon Jeong-hee, Song Sae-byuk, Lee Young-hoon', null, 'Kang Tae-sik is a private detective who would do anything for money. One day, he gets framed for a murder by a ruthless boss of the criminal underworld and a mysterious caller watches and controls his every move. He must use a wide array of techno-gadgetry at his disposal to clear himself and exact revenge within 24 hours given to him.', 'Kang Tae-sik is a private detective who would do anything for money. One day, he gets framed for a murder by a ruthless boss of the criminal underworld and a mysterious caller watches and controls his every move. He must use a wide array of techno-gadgetry at his disposal to clear himself and exact revenge within 24 hours given to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fu0fjfpICxqHfshCFBeCZ9lgd17.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56578'),
  ('1020809155276406452', 'Troubleshooters', 1971, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Georges Lautner, Maurice Fellous', 'Bertrand Blier', 'Jean Yanne, Mireille Darc, Bernard Blier, Michel Constantin, Rufus, Nanni Loy, Paul Préboist, Philippe Castelli', null, 'The day he is released from jail, Serge is expected by four killers sent by Count Charles Varèse assigned to make him confess where he has hidden the jewels stolen during his last stickup. On the other hand the police inspector who arrested him offers him protection on condition he gives him the same piece of information. Serge refuses and is about to be tortured by Varèse''s henchmen when Michel, a friendly hood, comes to his rescue. His friendship will result in... a heap of corpses! —Guy Bellinger', 'The day he is released from jail, Serge is expected by four killers sent by Count Charles Varèse assigned to make him confess where he has hidden the jewels stolen during his last stickup. On the other hand the police inspector who arrested him offers him protection on condition he gives him the same piece of information. Serge refuses and is about to be tortured by Varèse''s henchmen when Michel, a friendly hood, comes to his rescue. His friendship will result in... a heap of corpses! —Guy Bellinger', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BqfOOpVol6q7heEsApewt2HPcF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71056'),
  ('994439034634411703', 'Troublesome Night', 1997, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Herman Yau, Steve Cheng Wai-Man, Victor Tam Long-Cheong', 'Kenneth Lau Hau-Wai, Yeung Woon-Choi, Chau Ting', 'Simon Lui Yu-Yeung, Louis Koo, Allen Ting Chi-Chun, Jason Chu Wing-Tong, Ada Choi Siu-Fan, Teresa Mak Ka-Kei, Bak Ka-Sin, Helena Law Lan', null, 'Tales of the supernatural include encounters with ghosts and a man''s communication with his dead wife.', 'Tales of the supernatural include encounters with ghosts and a man''s communication with his dead wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/li2y00YSJY8RhIj4Erby2mj583S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171704'),
  ('565412968058297233', 'Troublesome Night 4', 1998, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Herman Yau, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung, Bosco Lam Tsz-Ho', 'Tsang Kwok-Chi, Kenneth Lau Hau-Wai', 'Louis Koo, Paulyn Sun, Simon Lui Yu-Yeung, Cheung Tat-Ming, Marianne Chan, Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, Emily Kwan Bo-Wai, Timmy Hung Tin-Ming', null, 'A group of tourists from Hong Kong visit the Philippines on holiday and run into ghosts.', 'A group of tourists from Hong Kong visit the Philippines on holiday and run into ghosts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZEvceIMhLsmCkJpvMTFdEmDtnK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293883'),
  ('664584085384262796', 'Troubling Love', 1995, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Costanza Boccardi, Alessandro Dionisio, Andrea De Rosa', 'Mario Martone', 'Anna Bonaiuto, Angela Luce, Gianni Cajafa, Peppe Lanzetta, Licia Maglietta, Anna Calato, Italo Celoro, Carmela Pecoraro', null, 'When her elderly mother is found dead under sordid circumstances, Delia returns to her native Naples for the first time in years to attend the funeral. Trying to piece together her estranged parent''s secret life, she''ll face the hidden memories that shaped her family history.', 'When her elderly mother is found dead under sordid circumstances, Delia returns to her native Naples for the first time in years to attend the funeral. Trying to piece together her estranged parent''s secret life, she''ll face the hidden memories that shaped her family history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcliwsyf2CQgWdnSiDalrkiZjBD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49726'),
  ('624909206866976881', 'Trout', 1978, 'Comedy', 'José Luis García Sánchez, Magí Torruella', 'Luis Megino, Manuel Gutiérrez Aragón, José Luis García Sánchez', 'Héctor Alterio, Juan Amigo, Ofelia Angélica, Lautaro Murúa, Carmen Arévalo, Walter Vidarte, Luis Politti, Maria Teresa Arteche', null, 'In a restaurant they''re preparing a grand banquet in honor of a sports association of anglers, but several circumstances seem to have conspired to boycott the event.', 'In a restaurant they''re preparing a grand banquet in honor of a sports association of anglers, but several circumstances seem to have conspired to boycott the event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hzEG7NJnKYAurCl9jQMZEpIXiO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162438'),
  ('379110378430844838', 'Troy', 2004, 'War, Action, History', 'Wolfgang Petersen, Roger Pratt, John King', 'David Benioff', 'Brad Pitt, Orlando Bloom, Eric Bana, Brian Cox, Sean Bean, Brendan Gleeson, Diane Kruger, Peter O''Toole', 'R', 'In year 1250 B.C. during the late Bronze age, two emerging nations begin to clash. Paris, the Trojan prince, convinces Helen, Queen of Sparta, to leave her husband Menelaus, and sail with him back to Troy. After Menelaus finds out that his wife was taken by the Trojans, he asks his brother Agamemnon to help him get her back. Agamemnon sees this as an opportunity for power. They set off with 1,000 ships holding 50,000 Greeks to Troy.', 'In year 1250 B.C. during the late Bronze age, two emerging nations begin to clash. Paris, the Trojan prince, convinces Helen, Queen of Sparta, to leave her husband Menelaus, and sail with him back to Troy. After Menelaus finds out that his wife was taken by the Trojans, he asks his brother Agamemnon to help him get her back. Agamemnon sees this as an opportunity for power. They set off with 1,000 ships holding 50,000 Greeks to Troy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51auXjXepW1zblzhaN7CAhwvf5i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:652'),
  ('1136450051661093489', 'Tru Confessions', 2002, 'TV Movie, Family, Drama', 'Paul Hoen, Rudolf Blahacek, Andrew Shea', 'Janet Tashjian', 'Clara Bryant, Shia LaBeouf, Mare Winningham, William Francis McGuire, Nicole Dicker, Kevin Duhaney, Yani Gellman, Craig Eldridge', 'G', 'Trudy Walker hated her life. She thought it was totally messed up until she found out about a contest that could change everything...', 'Trudy Walker hated her life. She thought it was totally messed up until she found out about a contest that could change everything...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VHgWZG8LNpe9ZoKwdbJSA8vtec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71886'),
  ('684166257513068984', 'Tru Loved', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Stewart Wade', 'Stewart Wade', 'Najarra Townsend, Matthew Thompson, Jake Abel, Tye Olson, Alexandra Paul, Jasmine Guy, Nichelle Nichols, Bruce Vilanch', 'R', 'Recently relocated from San Francisco to conservative suburbia by her lesbian mothers, Tru struggles like all teens to fit in and find love, but her quest is complicated by sexual politics, closed minds, and closeted friends as she seeks to establish her school''s first Gay-Straight Alliance.', 'Recently relocated from San Francisco to conservative suburbia by her lesbian mothers, Tru struggles like all teens to fit in and find love, but her quest is complicated by sexual politics, closed minds, and closeted friends as she seeks to establish her school''s first Gay-Straight Alliance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yc0G4MTuLjTTS5aehLHYzqYdXGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30124'),
  ('172942899832303543', 'Truant Officer Donald', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald catches his nephews swimming on a school day. He thinks he''s made an easy catch, but the boys are much more resourceful than that. When he tries to smoke them out of their clubhouse, they put three roast turkeys in their bed and dress one boy as an angel.', 'Donald catches his nephews swimming on a school day. He thinks he''s made an easy catch, but the boys are much more resourceful than that. When he tries to smoke them out of their clubhouse, they put three roast turkeys in their bed and dress one boy as an angel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDo5QWEUzDhwrffUll25uJelmWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94181'),
  ('670691470851569918', 'Truant School', 1949, 'Drama, Comedy', 'André Dumaître, Marc Fossard, Maurice Pecqueux', 'Jean-Paul Le Chanois', 'Bernard Blier, Juliette Faber, Édouard Delmont, Edmond Ardisson, Henri Arius, Gaston Modot, Jean-Louis Allibert, Bréols', null, '1920, in a small village in Provence. Monsieur Pascal, a young schoolteacher, is faced with a lack of interest from his pupils. He decides to radically change the methods employed by his predecessor. He listens to the children, draws inspiration from their discoveries and takes them out into nature. The pupils will rediscover the pleasure of learning, and he will rediscover the pleasure of teaching. But some parents and notables don''t take kindly to this little revolution.', '1920, in a small village in Provence. Monsieur Pascal, a young schoolteacher, is faced with a lack of interest from his pupils. He decides to radically change the methods employed by his predecessor. He listens to the children, draws inspiration from their discoveries and takes them out into nature. The pupils will rediscover the pleasure of learning, and he will rediscover the pleasure of teaching. But some parents and notables don''t take kindly to this little revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YFo5Akbkl8tnnBx3yTYUmsvO0m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47797'),
  ('639668606995486709', 'Truants', 1996, 'Drama', 'Nikos Grammatikos, Agnes Sklavos', 'Nikos Grammatikos, Nikos Panayotopoulos', 'Nikos Georgakis, Yorgos Evgenikos, Vangelis Mourikis, Tasos Nousias, Aimilios Heilakis, Vivi Koka, Kostas Staridas, Antonis Antoniou', null, 'The story follows the sporadic reunions of six friends during the seven year period of their integration into society. The reunions take place on their ancestral island, the setting of their common past. Every time they return "home" they carry with them the results of their personal choices. They also carry with them the effects of modern Greek society, a society the slowly but surely changes them, weathering their relationships, until they gradually lose contact with each other. The end of this epoch, will find them dispersed, confronting the dawn of an era where the pursuit of individual ambitions reigns.', 'The story follows the sporadic reunions of six friends during the seven year period of their integration into society. The reunions take place on their ancestral island, the setting of their common past. Every time they return "home" they carry with them the results of their personal choices. They also carry with them the effects of modern Greek society, a society the slowly but surely changes them, weathering their relationships, until they gradually lose contact with each other. The end of this epoch, will find them dispersed, confronting the dawn of an era where the pursuit of individual ambitions reigns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpvSaB3x4eb64yyHZqnlHjh5TUe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326338'),
  ('739730527740947905', 'Truck Rascals: No One Can Stop Me', 1975, 'Romance, Action, Comedy', 'Norifumi Suzuki, Hanjirō Nakazawa', 'Shinichiro Sawai', 'Bunta Sugawara, Kin''ya Aikawa, Yutaka Nakajima, Junko Natsu, Masayuki Yuhara, Makoto Satō, Masumi Harukawa, Yūsuke Natsu', null, 'The first of many movies featuring the lighthearted adventures of two truck drivers. Momojiro and his best friend Kinzo take to the road on their cargo trucks impressing each other with their skills in driving fast and evading the police while transporting commodities throughout the country. Chance encounters with people along the way help them to come to terms with events clouding their past and offer them a shot at redemption.', 'The first of many movies featuring the lighthearted adventures of two truck drivers. Momojiro and his best friend Kinzo take to the road on their cargo trucks impressing each other with their skills in driving fast and evading the police while transporting commodities throughout the country. Chance encounters with people along the way help them to come to terms with events clouding their past and offer them a shot at redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlKf5ysfdxEn2cvyUS9sK9nB09p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163340'),
  ('693931293215809976', 'Truck Stop Women', 1974, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Mark L. Lester, John Arthur Morrill, Mark Levinson', 'Mark L. Lester, Paul Deason', 'Claudia Jennings, Lieux Dressler, John Martino, Paul Carr, Dennis Fimple, Gene Drew, Jennifer Burton, Dolores Dorn', 'R', 'A mother and daughter who run a brothel for truckers fight back when the Mafia tries to take over their operation.', 'A mother and daughter who run a brothel for truckers fight back when the Mafia tries to take over their operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFtgTw8HGDXNFZBre20gn3zxxge.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92722'),
  ('403750873677380523', 'Truck Turner', 1974, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Charles F. Wheeler, Jonathan Kaplan, Anthony Brand', 'Michael Allin, Oscar Williams', 'Isaac Hayes, Yaphet Kotto, Alan Weeks, Annazette Chase, Nichelle Nichols, Sam Laws, Paul Harris, Charles Cyphers', 'R', 'Truck Turner and his partner Jerry, who make their living as bounty hunters in Los Angeles, are hired to hunt down Gator, a pimp who has skipped bail.', 'Truck Turner and his partner Jerry, who make their living as bounty hunters in Los Angeles, are hired to hunt down Gator, a pimp who has skipped bail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMB0WY73s8AOns9cUmdAT3USreo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22121'),
  ('964149884737175929', 'Trucker', 2008, 'Drama', 'James Mottern, Lawrence Sher', 'James Mottern', 'Michelle Monaghan, Nathan Fillion, Benjamin Bratt, Joey Lauren Adams, Jimmy Bennett, Bryce Johnson, Brandon Hanson, Matthew Lawrence', 'R', 'Loner Diane Ford is a truck driver with an 11-year-old son, Peter, whom she never sees, and that''s fine with her. But, when Peter''s father, Len, falls ill, he asks Diane to take care of their son for a while. Eventually, Diane reluctantly agrees, but she quickly realizes that caring for a child interferes with her independent lifestyle - and Peter isn''t all that thrilled with the arrangement, either.', 'Loner Diane Ford is a truck driver with an 11-year-old son, Peter, whom she never sees, and that''s fine with her. But, when Peter''s father, Len, falls ill, he asks Diane to take care of their son for a while. Eventually, Diane reluctantly agrees, but she quickly realizes that caring for a child interferes with her independent lifestyle - and Peter isn''t all that thrilled with the arrangement, either.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiOEBjIsTiGtYBDfaoaCwwXGIFP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29406'),
  ('810675279017025951', 'Truckers Ride Again', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Milo Đukanović', 'Gordan Mihić', 'Miodrag Petrović ''Čkalja'', Pavle Vuisić, Svetislav ''Bule'' Goncić, Sonja Savić, Bogdan Diklić, Branko Cvejić, Dragan Zarić, Branko Vidaković', null, 'New adventures of truck drivers Jare and Paja, long-time fellow associates and close friends. Jare is forced to pay off his debt for the loans he was raising to build a house for his numerous family. He must find heaps of money as soon as possible, or let tax gatherers to take everything. Paja tries to help him in this impossible task, but on their way they face bunch of obstacles, losses and misfortunes, encountering all sorts of people, only to end up in serious problems.', 'New adventures of truck drivers Jare and Paja, long-time fellow associates and close friends. Jare is forced to pay off his debt for the loans he was raising to build a house for his numerous family. He must find heaps of money as soon as possible, or let tax gatherers to take everything. Paja tries to help him in this impossible task, but on their way they face bunch of obstacles, losses and misfortunes, encountering all sorts of people, only to end up in serious problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRHUMAXuVFofLLHKQvFuN5UVgWY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263964'),
  ('614497466579554415', 'Trucks', 1997, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller, Action, TV Movie', 'Chris Thomson, Don Granbery, Ron Oxley', 'Brian Taggert', 'Timothy Busfield, Brenda Bakke, Aidan Devine, Jay Brazeau, Brendan Fletcher, Amy Stewart, Roman Podhora, Victor Cowie', 'R', 'A group of seemingly humanistic trucks takeover a truck stop and starts killing everything in sight. The remaining townsfolk must band together and come up with a way to murder the inanimate objects, a seemingly difficult task considering the abnormal circumstances.', 'A group of seemingly humanistic trucks takeover a truck stop and starts killing everything in sight. The remaining townsfolk must band together and come up with a way to murder the inanimate objects, a seemingly difficult task considering the abnormal circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJN2BNCUSfrOftshzSginQNILPk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17100'),
  ('340495156561925444', 'True', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Frank Griebe, Tom Tykwer', 'Tom Tykwer', 'Natalie Portman, Melchior Beslon', null, 'While he''s receiving an enigmatic phone call from his girlfriend Francine, Thomas remembers the milestones of their relationship, from the very moment they met in a really strange way. A segment of “Paris, je t''aime” (2006).', 'While he''s receiving an enigmatic phone call from his girlfriend Francine, Thomas remembers the milestones of their relationship, from the very moment they met in a really strange way. A segment of “Paris, je t''aime” (2006).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFw28bNtsM5SnD8ROYNETIhOJQd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11193'),
  ('1150854584715941370', 'True Adolescents', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Craig Johnson, Kat Westergaard', 'Craig Johnson', 'Mark Duplass, Bret Loehr, Carr Thompson, Melissa Leo, Emma Dumont, Lilly Perreault, Linas Phillips, Davie-Blue', null, 'At 34, struggling Seattle musician Sam finds himself broke, jobless and losing touch with the person he wants to become. When his girlfriend kicks him out, he''s forced to crash with his aunt Sharon and is reluctantly enlisted to take her teenage son and his friend camping.', 'At 34, struggling Seattle musician Sam finds himself broke, jobless and losing touch with the person he wants to become. When his girlfriend kicks him out, he''s forced to crash with his aunt Sharon and is reluctantly enlisted to take her teenage son and his friend camping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIANqZLA6QtI8VtYP1CKOODHvSS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73424'),
  ('937347667297533555', 'True Beauty: The Movie - Part 1', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Hoshino Kazunari', 'Lee Si-eun', 'Kōki, Keisuke Watanabe, Keito Tsuna, Jiro Sato, Yuuka Sugai, Karen Miyama, Amu Fukao, Rei Maruyama', null, 'Reina, who feels insecure about her looks, masters the art of makeup and transforms into a "goddess". Her makeover sparks a sweet, heart-throbbing love triangle with the enigmatic Shun and warm Yu, where secrets and tender emotions could change everything.', 'Reina, who feels insecure about her looks, masters the art of makeup and transforms into a "goddess". Her makeover sparks a sweet, heart-throbbing love triangle with the enigmatic Shun and warm Yu, where secrets and tender emotions could change everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZLsjQUQuMpfNGAIq5TtuWTpZnu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1363899'),
  ('498894905900636409', 'True Believer', 1989, 'Crime, Drama', 'Joseph Ruben, John Lindley', 'Wesley Strick', 'James Woods, Robert Downey Jr., Margaret Colin, Yuji Okumoto, Kurtwood Smith, Tom Bower, Luis Guzmán, Graham Beckel', 'R', 'Eddie Dodd is a burnt out former civil rights lawyer who now specializes in defending drug dealers. Roger Baron, newly graduated from law school, has followed Eddie''s great cases and now wants to learn at his feet. With Roger''s idealistic prodding, Eddie reluctantly takes on a case of a young Korean man who, according to his mother, has been in jail for eight years for a murder he didn''t commit.', 'Eddie Dodd is a burnt out former civil rights lawyer who now specializes in defending drug dealers. Roger Baron, newly graduated from law school, has followed Eddie''s great cases and now wants to learn at his feet. With Roger''s idealistic prodding, Eddie reluctantly takes on a case of a young Korean man who, according to his mother, has been in jail for eight years for a murder he didn''t commit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouL2ibaIdTMobM1CUlZxKauJBaM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31863'),
  ('442746399801453584', 'True Blood', 1989, 'Action, Drama', 'Mark Morris, Frank Kerr, Katarina Wittich', 'Frank Kerr', 'Jeff Fahey, Chad Lowe, Sherilyn Fenn, James Tolkan, Billy Drago, Ken Foree, Brodie Greer, John Capodice', 'R', 'Teenager Ray Trueblood is wrongfully accused of murdering a police officer after his fellow gang member Billy Masters does the deed. Hoping to elude the police, he flees Brooklyn, NY and joins the U.S. Marines. Returning 10 years later, Trueblood is dismayed to learn that his younger brother Donny is now running with a gang led by Masters. Trueblood soon finds himself depending on his military training & experience to protect his friends and family from the ruthless Masters.', 'Teenager Ray Trueblood is wrongfully accused of murdering a police officer after his fellow gang member Billy Masters does the deed. Hoping to elude the police, he flees Brooklyn, NY and joins the U.S. Marines. Returning 10 years later, Trueblood is dismayed to learn that his younger brother Donny is now running with a gang led by Masters. Trueblood soon finds himself depending on his military training & experience to protect his friends and family from the ruthless Masters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zLmhRZXjhh3IBkdCOK8psANays.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127523'),
  ('705928383399468257', 'True Bloodthirst', 2012, 'TV Movie, Science Fiction', 'Todor Chapkanov, Lorenzo Senatore', 'Rafael Jordan', 'Claudia Bassols, Neil Jackson, Ben Lambert, Andrew-Lee Potts, Heida Reed, Roark Critchlow, Yana Marinova, Ewan Bailey', null, 'Vampires and humans live in a future world where they co-exist – barely. Now, both groups find themselves under attack by a new species of super vampire. The surviving humans and vampires join forces to obliterate the vicious man-sized bat vampires which threaten to shatter the uneasy peace between the two species.', 'Vampires and humans live in a future world where they co-exist – barely. Now, both groups find themselves under attack by a new species of super vampire. The surviving humans and vampires join forces to obliterate the vicious man-sized bat vampires which threaten to shatter the uneasy peace between the two species.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hw1JyQwdTu2ReP8mSfiqgZz67wh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120092'),
  ('70572917635243219', 'True Blue', 1996, 'Drama', 'Ferdinand Fairfax, Brian Tufano', 'Rupert Walters', 'Dominic West, Bill Nighy, Johan Leysen, Ryan Bollman, Edward Atterton, Geraldine Somerville, Josh Lucas, Noah Huntley', null, 'The story of the year the Oxford and Cambridge boat race changed from a gentleman''s race to one where winning was everything.', 'The story of the year the Oxford and Cambridge boat race changed from a gentleman''s race to one where winning was everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dOHvwA7eOgeZVF2hrIjSMGm3cK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39463'),
  ('1005490428267859013', 'True Blue', 2001, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'J.S. Cardone, Darko Šuvak', 'J.S. Cardone', 'Tom Berenger, Lori Heuring, Pamela Gidley, Barry Newman, Soon-Tek Oh, Leo Lee, Richard Chevolleau, Alec McClure', 'R', 'When a dismembered hand is found in a city pond, maverick cop Rembrandt Macy is drawn into a chilling investigation. His search for answers leads him into the secret life of the victim, guided by her roommate Nikki. As Macy uncovers a web of corruption, from shadowy dealings at City Hall to a ruthless gang of Asian drug traffickers, he realizes that nothing is as it seems, and that Nikki herself may be hiding dangerous secrets.', 'When a dismembered hand is found in a city pond, maverick cop Rembrandt Macy is drawn into a chilling investigation. His search for answers leads him into the secret life of the victim, guided by her roommate Nikki. As Macy uncovers a web of corruption, from shadowy dealings at City Hall to a ruthless gang of Asian drug traffickers, he realizes that nothing is as it seems, and that Nikki herself may be hiding dangerous secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGKNSooidNSRhxx5h9ExGA926OF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72317'),
  ('948555699382719569', 'True Colors', 1991, 'Drama', 'Herbert Ross, Glen Trotiner, Andrew Stone', 'Kevin Wade', 'John Cusack, James Spader, Imogen Stubbs, Mandy Patinkin, Richard Widmark, Dina Merrill, Philip Bosco, Paul Guilfoyle', null, 'Two law school friends find themselves at odds when one becomes a Justice Department lawyer and the other goes into politics.', 'Two law school friends find themselves at odds when one becomes a Justice Department lawyer and the other goes into politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRchyRu07YagzHv9bQ7Jfz1CsAc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13571'),
  ('19849501669954455', 'True Confession', 1937, 'Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'Wesley Ruggles, Ted Tetzlaff, Boris Morros', 'Claude Binyon', 'Carole Lombard, Fred MacMurray, John Barrymore, Una Merkel, Porter Hall, Edgar Kennedy, Lynne Overman, Irving Bacon', 'NR', 'A writer takes a job as a secretary because her scrupulous husband isn''t bringing in the dough as an attorney. When her new employer is murdered, she can''t seem to make up her mind as to whether she "dunnit" or not.', 'A writer takes a job as a secretary because her scrupulous husband isn''t bringing in the dough as an attorney. When her new employer is murdered, she can''t seem to make up her mind as to whether she "dunnit" or not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t80JoyYUBJwNJxT3pgGfvTNyOwq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114638'),
  ('770434831430591278', 'True Confessions', 1981, 'Crime, Drama', 'Owen Roizman, Ulu Grosbard', 'John Gregory Dunne, Joan Didion', 'Robert De Niro, Robert Duvall, Charles Durning, Kenneth McMillan, Ed Flanders, Cyril Cusack, Burgess Meredith, Rose Gregorio', 'R', 'A cop clashes with his priest brother while investigating the brutal murder of a young prostitute.', 'A cop clashes with his priest brother while investigating the brutal murder of a young prostitute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwTwHKesH4QcvSBkS1dE89AIFst.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32077'),
  ('125552068699264282', 'True Confessions of a Go-Go Girl', 2008, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Grant Harvey, Craig Wrobleski', 'Lenore Kletter', 'Chelsea Hobbs, Sarah Carter, Corbin Bernsen, Rachel Hunter, Travis Milne, Tygh Runyan, Karen Kruper, James D. Hopkin', null, 'Jane McCoy, a recent college graduate, much to her parent''s dismay, decides to scrap her plans for law school to pursue an acting career full-time. Struggling to make ends meet, she meets a confident and persuasive friend who shows her the way to make extra money go-go dancing. What starts as just an "easy money" job, however, rapidly becomes an all-consuming activity that slowly pulls Jane from her acting classes, her relationships with her boyfriend and family, and, most importantly, from her true self.', 'Jane McCoy, a recent college graduate, much to her parent''s dismay, decides to scrap her plans for law school to pursue an acting career full-time. Struggling to make ends meet, she meets a confident and persuasive friend who shows her the way to make extra money go-go dancing. What starts as just an "easy money" job, however, rapidly becomes an all-consuming activity that slowly pulls Jane from her acting classes, her relationships with her boyfriend and family, and, most importantly, from her true self.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGOyxmSD1YiF4rwG4GTY5njG7Fs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58720'),
  ('603567950591781087', 'True Confessions of a Hollywood Starlet', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Tim Matheson, David Herrington, David Carruthers', null, 'JoJo, Valerie Bertinelli, Lynda Boyd, Shenae Grimes-Beech, Ian Nelson, Louis Ferreira, Leah Renee, Melanie Leishman', null, 'When Hollywood starlet Morgan Carter passes out from alcohol poisoning on the red carpet of her movie premiere, she is whisked away to rehab, then sent to live with an aunt to complete her recovery in rural Indiana. There, she attends high school - changing her name and look to fit in-and live the life of a typical teenager, complete with the mysteries of geography, gym class, real friendship, love and jealousy.', 'When Hollywood starlet Morgan Carter passes out from alcohol poisoning on the red carpet of her movie premiere, she is whisked away to rehab, then sent to live with an aunt to complete her recovery in rural Indiana. There, she attends high school - changing her name and look to fit in-and live the life of a typical teenager, complete with the mysteries of geography, gym class, real friendship, love and jealousy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AhcV0tblzJ1fp2rHAjW7yMqGz8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41808'),
  ('135457730919072214', 'True Crime', 1995, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Pat Verducci, Chris Squires, Bob Brown', 'Pat Verducci', 'Alicia Silverstone, Kevin Dillon, Bill Nunn, Michael Bowen, Ann Devaney, Joshua Schaefer, Marla Sokoloff, Jennifer Savidge', 'R', 'Mary Giordano is a bright, intelligent student who goes to a catholic school. She also has an addiction to mystery novels and detective magazines, which inspire her to do her own detective work. When she starts snooping around on the case of a murderer of teenage girls, it gets her in hot water with her mentor Detective Jerry Gunn. But it also starts a team up with police cadet Tony Campbell. The two work together to find the murderer. But the closer Mary gets to solving the murder, the more danger she puts herself in of being the next victim.', 'Mary Giordano is a bright, intelligent student who goes to a catholic school. She also has an addiction to mystery novels and detective magazines, which inspire her to do her own detective work. When she starts snooping around on the case of a murderer of teenage girls, it gets her in hot water with her mentor Detective Jerry Gunn. But it also starts a team up with police cadet Tony Campbell. The two work together to find the murderer. But the closer Mary gets to solving the murder, the more danger she puts herself in of being the next victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPYe83tWVSwVFRyWa6f5aaE7bbu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37144'),
  ('266999827212254582', 'True Crime', 1999, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Clint Eastwood, Jack N. Green', 'Larry Gross, Paul Brickman, Stephen Schiff', 'Clint Eastwood, Isaiah Washington, LisaGay Hamilton, James Woods, Denis Leary, Bernard Hill, Diane Venora, Michael McKean', 'R', 'Boozer, skirt chaser, careless father. You could create your own list of reporter Steve Everett''s faults but there''s no time. A San Quentin Death Row prisoner is slated to die at midnight – a man Everett has suddenly realized is innocent.', 'Boozer, skirt chaser, careless father. You could create your own list of reporter Steve Everett''s faults but there''s no time. A San Quentin Death Row prisoner is slated to die at midnight – a man Everett has suddenly realized is innocent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5usB2gQSiIsj5l2ybzoypgX55HG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10354'),
  ('798601962147918498', 'True Enough', 2007, 'Drama', 'Sam Karmann', 'Jérôme Beaujour, Sam Karmann', 'Karin Viard, André Dussollier, François Cluzet, Brigitte Catillon, Julie Delarme, Sam Karmann, Liliane Rovère', null, 'Anne is an attractive woman on the cusp of middle age trying in vain to divide her time fairly between her demanding job as a television presenter and her family. Her colleagues and friends have similar problems though.', 'Anne is an attractive woman on the cusp of middle age trying in vain to divide her time fairly between her demanding job as a television presenter and her family. Her colleagues and friends have similar problems though.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mmJjlu6zAUt6G690A5CekX6b70.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72380'),
  ('896900108470599412', 'True Fiction', 2018, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Kim Jin-mook, Kim Jong-sun', 'Kim Jin-mook', 'Ji Hyun-woo, Oh Man-seok, Lee Na-ra, Kim Hak-cheol, Cho Eun-ji', null, 'Thanks to his 3rd term congressman father-in-law, Kyung-suk is a strong candidate to become the next mayor. In order to hide his father-in-law''s slush fund, he heads toward a cottage that is under his wife’s name. He arrives there with his mistress Ji-young only to be greeted by a young man named Soon-tae who claims to be the groundskeeper of the cottage. Kyung-suk is nervous that his affair might be exposed and all he wants to do is hide the money and get out but he is framed for drunk driving and robbery, and gets into a hit-and-run accident. Out of desperation, he tries to flee but Soon-tae approaches him and mentions his congressman father-in-law and his wife, as if it was part of his plan, and drags Kyung-suk into a corner...', 'Thanks to his 3rd term congressman father-in-law, Kyung-suk is a strong candidate to become the next mayor. In order to hide his father-in-law''s slush fund, he heads toward a cottage that is under his wife’s name. He arrives there with his mistress Ji-young only to be greeted by a young man named Soon-tae who claims to be the groundskeeper of the cottage. Kyung-suk is nervous that his affair might be exposed and all he wants to do is hide the money and get out but he is framed for drunk driving and robbery, and gets into a hit-and-run accident. Out of desperation, he tries to flee but Soon-tae approaches him and mentions his congressman father-in-law and his wife, as if it was part of his plan, and drags Kyung-suk into a corner...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uknzQ4rrP2aEsvwpdybihTQEzB2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518681'),
  ('238682051771337023', 'True Friends', 1954, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Mikhail Kalatozov, Mark Magidson, Lev Brozhovskiy', 'Aleksandr Galich, Konstantin Isayev', 'Vasili Merkuryev, Boris Chirkov, Aleksandr Borisov, Aleksei Gribov, Liliya Gritsenko, Lyudmila Shagalova, Yuriy Sarantsev, Georgi Georgiu', null, 'Alexander, Boris and Vasily are old friends, who now rarely see each other as they''re busy with their professional life. They embark on long-planned voyage on a raft down the Volga river, which turns into a series of comical accidents but also strengthens their friendship.', 'Alexander, Boris and Vasily are old friends, who now rarely see each other as they''re busy with their professional life. They embark on long-planned voyage on a raft down the Volga river, which turns into a series of comical accidents but also strengthens their friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OBLAHy4X9z7wpJckibLWAqaTNN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142770'),
  ('647853723767639702', 'True Friends', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'François Prévôt-Leygonie, Stéphan Archinard, Stephan Massis', 'Marie-Pierre Huster, Stéphan Archinard, François Prévôt-Leygonie', 'Gérard Lanvin, Jean-Hugues Anglade, Wladimir Yordanoff, Ana Girardot, Zabou Breitman, Natacha Lindinger, Jean-Pierre Lorit, Jean-François Stévenin', null, 'The bonds of a 30-year friendship are tested when Walter''s 20-year-old daughter, Clemence, falls in love with his friend Paul.', 'The bonds of a 30-year friendship are tested when Walter''s 20-year-old daughter, Clemence, falls in love with his friend Paul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4eqt7ScP8T04gi1P1yI2EYJa9bv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199549'),
  ('398023521855212215', 'True Grit', 1969, 'Western', 'Lucien Ballard, Henry Hathaway, William W. Gray', 'Marguerite Roberts', 'John Wayne, Kim Darby, Glen Campbell, Jeremy Slate, Robert Duvall, Dennis Hopper, Alfred Ryder, Strother Martin', 'G', 'The murder of her father sends a teenage tomboy on a mission of ''justice'', which involves avenging her father''s death. She recruits a tough old marshal, ''Rooster'' Cogburn because he has ''true grit'', and a reputation of getting the job done.', 'The murder of her father sends a teenage tomboy on a mission of ''justice'', which involves avenging her father''s death. She recruits a tough old marshal, ''Rooster'' Cogburn because he has ''true grit'', and a reputation of getting the job done.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmexRC57l39elaIcnxhaHpcaIW2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17529'),
  ('3880515580115381', 'True Grit', 2010, 'Drama, Adventure, Western', 'Roger Deakins, Ethan Coen, Joel Coen', 'Joel Coen, Ethan Coen', 'Jeff Bridges, Hailee Steinfeld, Matt Damon, Josh Brolin, Barry Pepper, Dakin Matthews, Jarlath Conroy, Paul Rae', 'PG-13', 'Following the murder of her father by a hired hand, a 14-year-old farm girl sets out to capture the killer. To aid her, she hires the toughest U.S. Marshal she can find—a man with ''true grit''—Reuben J. ''Rooster'' Cogburn.', 'Following the murder of her father by a hired hand, a 14-year-old farm girl sets out to capture the killer. To aid her, she hires the toughest U.S. Marshal she can find—a man with ''true grit''—Reuben J. ''Rooster'' Cogburn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCrB8pcjadZjsDk7rleGJaIv78k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44264'),
  ('1049662072728642173', 'True Heart', 1999, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Catherine Cyran, Christopher Baffa', 'Catherine Cyran', 'Kirsten Dunst, Zachery Ty Bryan, August Schellenberg, Dey Young, Michael Gross, Tom McBeath, Ben Cardinal, John Novak', 'PG', 'A brother and sister are plane-wrecked in Canada, where they must rely on the help of a native and his bear.', 'A brother and sister are plane-wrecked in Canada, where they must rely on the help of a native and his bear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnOPcBc3ZHXPUDcrNP3jrtAAM7k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41831'),
  ('854567476336484579', 'True Heart Susie', 1919, 'Drama, Romance', 'D.W. Griffith, Billy Bitzer', null, 'Lillian Gish, Robert Harron, Wilbur Higby, Loyola O''Connor, George Fawcett, Clarine Seymour, Kate Bruce, Carol Dempster', null, 'Susie secretly loves her neighbor, William Jenkins, but neither, it seems, can confess their feelings for each other.', 'Susie secretly loves her neighbor, William Jenkins, but neither, it seems, can confess their feelings for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcbYqPH849tsohFoVjG3lXgbSE8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36106'),
  ('706339038295645800', 'True History of the Kelly Gang', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Western, Thriller', 'Sam Hewison, Jay Corry, Justin Kurzel', 'Shaun Grant', 'George MacKay, Nicholas Hoult, Essie Davis, Russell Crowe, Charlie Hunnam, Orlando Schwerdt, Earl Cave, Sean Keenan', 'R', 'Set against the badlands of Australia where the English rule with a bloody fist and the Irish endure, Ned Kelly discovers he comes from a line of Irish rebels — an uncompromising army of cross dressing bandits immortalised for terrorising their oppressors back in Ireland. Fuelled by the unfair arrest of his mother, Kelly recruits a wild bunch of warriors to plot one of the most audacious attacks of anarchy and rebellion the country has ever seen.', 'Set against the badlands of Australia where the English rule with a bloody fist and the Irish endure, Ned Kelly discovers he comes from a line of Irish rebels — an uncompromising army of cross dressing bandits immortalised for terrorising their oppressors back in Ireland. Fuelled by the unfair arrest of his mother, Kelly recruits a wild bunch of warriors to plot one of the most audacious attacks of anarchy and rebellion the country has ever seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVyESHnWiTY1el8DEWbYMVW3K5k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501395'),
