  ('172864345021838890', 'True Lies', 1994, 'Action, Thriller', 'James Cameron, Russell Carpenter, Charles Dwight Lee', 'James Cameron, Claude Zidi, Simon Michaël', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Jamie Lee Curtis, Tom Arnold, Bill Paxton, Tia Carrere, Art Malik, Eliza Dushku, Grant Heslov', 'R', 'A fearless, globe-trotting, terrorist-battling secret agent has his life turned upside down when he discovers his wife might be having an affair with a used car salesman while terrorists smuggle nuclear war heads into the United States.', 'A fearless, globe-trotting, terrorist-battling secret agent has his life turned upside down when he discovers his wife might be having an affair with a used car salesman while terrorists smuggle nuclear war heads into the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pweFTnzzTfGK68woSVkiTgjLzWm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36955'),
  ('519052392195070688', 'True Love', 1989, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Nancy Savoca, Lisa Rinzler', 'Richard Guay, Nancy Savoca', 'Annabella Sciorra, Ron Eldard, Aida Turturro, Roger Rignack, Star Jasper, Michael Selkirk, Kelly Cinnante, Rick Shapiro', null, 'Donna and Michael are getting married. But first, they have to plan the reception, get the tux, buy the rings, and cope with their own uncertainty about the decision. Michael fears commitment. Donna has her doubts about Michael''s immaturity. Both are getting cold feet.', 'Donna and Michael are getting married. But first, they have to plan the reception, get the tux, buy the rings, and cope with their own uncertainty about the decision. Michael fears commitment. Donna has her doubts about Michael''s immaturity. Both are getting cold feet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bb8LdVqPhJbd1WnH6yiMbjy0N0C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111605'),
