  ('317362974686612194', 'True Love Ways', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mathieu Seiler', 'Mathieu Seiler', 'Anna Hausburg, David C. Bunners, Karl-Michael Müller, Michael Greiling', null, 'Séverine is haunted by a reocurring dream that makes her doubt her relationship with her boyfriend. She decides to spent a couple of days alone at the seaside to think everthing over. But instead, she’s got to face violent criminals and her own primal fears.', 'Séverine is haunted by a reocurring dream that makes her doubt her relationship with her boyfriend. She decides to spent a couple of days alone at the seaside to think everthing over. But instead, she’s got to face violent criminals and her own primal fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLpbep7QMgB7yQhxbJbe8cEGil0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336777'),
  ('566503292635820155', 'True Memoirs of an International Assassin', 2016, 'Comedy, Action', 'Jeff Wadlow, Edna Lerebours, Kevin Black', 'Jeff Morris, Jeff Wadlow', 'Kevin James, Kim Coates, Maurice Compte, Zulay Henao, Andrew Howard, Ron Rifkin, Yul Vazquez, P.J. Byrne', 'PG-13', 'After a publisher changes a writer''s debut novel about a deadly assassin from fiction to nonfiction, the author finds himself thrust into the world of his lead character, and must take on the role of his character for his own survival.', 'After a publisher changes a writer''s debut novel about a deadly assassin from fiction to nonfiction, the author finds himself thrust into the world of his lead character, and must take on the role of his character for his own survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPoSSqDqkKSIP2l3t6pyre9u5Ze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339396'),
  ('63147634736923515', 'True Mothers', 2020, 'Drama', 'Naomi Kawase, Yuta Tsukinaga, Naoki Sakakibara', 'Izumi Takahashi', 'Hiromi Nagasaku, Arata Iura, Aju Makita, Miyoko Asada, Hiroko Nakajima, Tetsu Hirahara, Ren Komai, Reo Satou', null, 'After suffering through a long and unsuccessful series of fertility treatments, Satoko and her husband Kiyokazu make the decision to adopt a child. Six years after adopting a boy they named Asato, Satoko has quit her job to concentrate fully on her husband and son. The family lives a peaceful existence until the arrival of a stranger.', 'After suffering through a long and unsuccessful series of fertility treatments, Satoko and her husband Kiyokazu make the decision to adopt a child. Six years after adopting a boy they named Asato, Satoko has quit her job to concentrate fully on her husband and son. The family lives a peaceful existence until the arrival of a stranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DsehYX87jeDN8edQBYttcYcArm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660713'),
  ('532873580380533860', 'True Romance', 1993, 'Action, Crime, Romance', 'Jeffrey L. Kimball, Tony Scott', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Christian Slater, Patricia Arquette, Dennis Hopper, Val Kilmer, Gary Oldman, Brad Pitt, Christopher Walken, Bronson Pinchot', 'R', 'Clarence marries hooker Alabama, steals cocaine from her pimp, and tries to sell it in Hollywood, while the owners of the coke try to reclaim it.', 'Clarence marries hooker Alabama, steals cocaine from her pimp, and tries to sell it in Hollywood, while the owners of the coke try to reclaim it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39lXk6ud6KiJgGbbWI2PUKS7y2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319'),
  ('813035898235095509', 'True Spirit', 2023, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Joanne Pearce, James McGrady, Jim Millett', 'Rebecca Banner, Cathy Randall, Sarah Spillane', 'Teagan Croft, Cliff Curtis, Alyla Browne, Josh Lawson, Anna Paquin, Bridget Webb, Stacy Clausen, Todd Lasance', 'PG', 'When the tenacious young sailor Jessica Watson sets out to be the youngest person to sail solo, nonstop and unassisted around the world, many expect her to fail. With the support of her sailing coach and mentor Ben Bryant and her parents, Jessica is determined to accomplish what was thought to be impossible, navigating some of the world’s most challenging stretches of ocean over the course of 210 days.', 'When the tenacious young sailor Jessica Watson sets out to be the youngest person to sail solo, nonstop and unassisted around the world, many expect her to fail. With the support of her sailing coach and mentor Ben Bryant and her parents, Jessica is determined to accomplish what was thought to be impossible, navigating some of the world’s most challenging stretches of ocean over the course of 210 days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qntAorVEzixuYOIPMCGwDiuGkd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:739986'),
  ('4034939274104919', 'True Stories', 1986, 'Comedy, Music', 'David Byrne, Edward Lachman, Cherylanne Martin', 'Stephen Tobolowsky, David Byrne, Beth Henley', 'David Byrne, John Goodman, Annie McEnroe, Jo Harvey Allen, Spalding Gray, Alix Elias, Roebuck ''Pops'' Staples, Tito Larriva', 'PG', 'A small but growing Texas town, filled with strange and musical characters, celebrates its sesquicentennial and converge on a local parade and talent show.', 'A small but growing Texas town, filled with strange and musical characters, celebrates its sesquicentennial and converge on a local parade and talent show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sngF8cskFWz2cig7b63ZaDNaQXr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24798'),
  ('377362813213283824', 'True Story', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, History', 'Rupert Goold, G.A. Aguilar, Masanobu Takayanagi', 'David Kajganich, Rupert Goold', 'Jonah Hill, James Franco, Felicity Jones, Maria Dizzia, Ethan Suplee, Robert John Burke, Charlotte Driscoll, Kohl Sudduth', 'R', 'A drama centered on the relationship between journalist Michael Finkel and Christian Longo, an FBI Most Wanted List murderer who for years lived outside the U.S. under Finkel''s name.', 'A drama centered on the relationship between journalist Michael Finkel and Christian Longo, an FBI Most Wanted List murderer who for years lived outside the U.S. under Finkel''s name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncP8XQ0bXP0xSpJmMsRt8mUcEXd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245706'),
  ('101526648651288977', 'True Story of a Woman in Jail: Continues', 1975, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Kōyū Ohara, Akihiko Yamaki, Hideo Kumagai', 'Akira Momoi', 'Hitomi Kozue, Machiko Aoki, Arikawa Mihoko, Natsuki Kumi, Sanae Shiba, Kenji Shimamura, Akiko Yoshii, Hiroshi Chō', null, '"Jealous" man-killer Mayumi (Hitomi Kozue) is sent back into solitary confinement after being re-arrested for the murder of the doctor who fingered her for a botched surgery. After emerging from solitary confinement to find an all-new gang of bullies picking on a meek, young female prisoner, Mayumi is now a much harder soul who takes no attitude from anyone, and she turns savage when the poor girl is enslaved by Yakuza.', '"Jealous" man-killer Mayumi (Hitomi Kozue) is sent back into solitary confinement after being re-arrested for the murder of the doctor who fingered her for a botched surgery. After emerging from solitary confinement to find an all-new gang of bullies picking on a meek, young female prisoner, Mayumi is now a much harder soul who takes no attitude from anyone, and she turns savage when the poor girl is enslaved by Yakuza.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvyKtFoyxLdPYB4NjL7VlJRnNXN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155601'),
