  ('917230317073481493', 'Truly Human', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Åke Sandgren, Rie Hedegaard, Iben Snebang', 'Åke Sandgren', 'Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Peter Mygind, Susan A. Olsen, Clara Nepper Winther, Troels II Munk, Line Kruse, Klaus Bondam, Charlotte Munksgaard', null, 'P. is a little girl''s imaginary friend who lives inside the wall of her room. But one day he magically materialises and so must learn to live in the world like everyone else - a world where he is met with suspicion and hate but also with wonder and love.', 'P. is a little girl''s imaginary friend who lives inside the wall of her room. But one day he magically materialises and so must learn to live in the world like everyone else - a world where he is met with suspicion and hate but also with wonder and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lM9MA8k41wsY5VJG7d9aoNMOdFT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56314'),
  ('728261631564498401', 'Truly Madly Deeply', 1991, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Anthony Minghella, Remi Adefarasin', 'Anthony Minghella', 'Juliet Stevenson, Alan Rickman, Michael Maloney, Bill Paterson, Christopher Rozycki, David Ryall, Deborah Findlay, Jenny Howe', 'PG', 'Nina is totally heartbroken at the death of her boyfriend Jamie, but is even more unprepared for his return as a ghost. At first it''s almost as good as it used to be – hey, even the rats that infested her house have disappeared. But Jamie starts bringing ghostly friends home and behaving more and more oddly.', 'Nina is totally heartbroken at the death of her boyfriend Jamie, but is even more unprepared for his return as a ghost. At first it''s almost as good as it used to be – hey, even the rats that infested her house have disappeared. But Jamie starts bringing ghostly friends home and behaving more and more oddly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjLEXLTXfJPYtl31knRS8bjclf0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18317'),
  ('586930744178955181', 'Truman', 1995, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Frank Pierson, Paul Elliott', null, 'Gary Sinise, Diana Scarwid, Richard Dysart, Colm Feore, James Gammon, Tony Goldwyn, Pat Hingle, Harris Yulin', 'PG', 'Biographical account of America''s President for the latter part of WWII. Shows Truman''s rise from small-town nobody to leader of the USA, his decision to use the Atomic Bomb against Japan, and subsequent election as the US'' post-war President.', 'Biographical account of America''s President for the latter part of WWII. Shows Truman''s rise from small-town nobody to leader of the USA, his decision to use the Atomic Bomb against Japan, and subsequent election as the US'' post-war President.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4SW6da4XjxLGlRVS079O1ORpjqk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16901'),
  ('963698917743023853', 'Truman', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Cesc Gay, Andreu Rebés, Carlos Gras', 'Cesc Gay, Tomàs Aragay', 'Ricardo Darín, Javier Cámara, Dolores Fonzi, Eduard Fernández, Àlex Brendemühl, Pedro Casablanc, José Luis Gómez, Javier Gutiérrez', null, 'Tomás, who lives in Canada, travels to Madrid, Spain, to visit his old friend Julián. Both of them, accompanied by Truman, Julián''s faithful dog, will share many surprising and emotional little moments, triggered by the hard situation Julián is going through, for just a few days.', 'Tomás, who lives in Canada, travels to Madrid, Spain, to visit his old friend Julián. Both of them, accompanied by Truman, Julián''s faithful dog, will share many surprising and emotional little moments, triggered by the hard situation Julián is going through, for just a few days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4MFl06ePJGKMIF7zFCJhex95Vi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341744'),
  ('901118943338005432', 'Trumbo', 2007, 'Documentary, History', 'Peter Askin', 'Christopher Trumbo', 'Joan Allen, Michael Douglas, Liam Neeson, Paul Giamatti, Josh Lucas, Nathan Lane, Brian Dennehy, David Strathairn', 'PG-13', 'Through a focus on the life of Dalton Trumbo (1905-1976), this film examines the effects on individuals and families of a congressional pursuit of Hollywood Communists after World War II. Trumbo was one of several writers, directors, and actors who invoked the First Amendment in refusing to answer questions under oath. They were blacklisted and imprisoned. We follow Trumbo to prison, to exile in Mexico with his family, to poverty, to the public shunning of his children, to his writing under others'' names, and to an eventual but incomplete vindication. Actors read his letters; his children and friends remember and comment. Archive photos, newsreels and interviews add texture. Written by', 'Through a focus on the life of Dalton Trumbo (1905-1976), this film examines the effects on individuals and families of a congressional pursuit of Hollywood Communists after World War II. Trumbo was one of several writers, directors, and actors who invoked the First Amendment in refusing to answer questions under oath. They were blacklisted and imprisoned. We follow Trumbo to prison, to exile in Mexico with his family, to poverty, to the public shunning of his children, to his writing under others'' names, and to an eventual but incomplete vindication. Actors read his letters; his children and friends remember and comment. Archive photos, newsreels and interviews add texture. Written by', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27TwpK0pbkkOeuKnmgjg5cyIcPb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60230'),
  ('566524409063732806', 'Trumbo', 2015, 'Drama', 'George Parra, Scott August, Jay Roach', 'John McNamara', 'Bryan Cranston, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, Louis C.K., David James Elliott, Elle Fanning, John Goodman, Diane Lane, Michael Stuhlbarg', 'R', 'The career of screenwriter Dalton Trumbo is halted by a witch hunt in the late 1940s when he defies the anti-communist HUAC committee and is blacklisted.', 'The career of screenwriter Dalton Trumbo is halted by a witch hunt in the late 1940s when he defies the anti-communist HUAC committee and is blacklisted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RERIRnZkROSeHZAIf8PSxhzOqs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294016'),
  ('647769122515530550', 'Trump Card', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Bruce Schooley, Dinesh D''Souza', 'Dinesh D''Souza', 'Dinesh D''Souza, Donald Trump, Stephen Brodie, John Di Domenico, Kathryn Palmer', 'PG-13', 'Trump Card is an expose of the socialism, corruption and gangsterization that now define the Democratic Party. Whether it is the creeping socialism of Joe Biden or the overt socialism of Bernie Sanders, the film reveals what is unique about modern socialism, who is behind it, why it’s evil, and how we can work together with President Trump to stop it.', 'Trump Card is an expose of the socialism, corruption and gangsterization that now define the Democratic Party. Whether it is the creeping socialism of Joe Biden or the overt socialism of Bernie Sanders, the film reveals what is unique about modern socialism, who is behind it, why it’s evil, and how we can work together with President Trump to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sC0IJKJHlfXnTkBgFyXWBhbbQZk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:692250'),
  ('714509194333407325', 'Trump''s America - Power, Change, Resistance', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Gaston Saša Koren, Dietrich Duppel, Ira Beetz', 'Ira Beetz, Dietrich Duppel, Gaston Sasa Koren', null, null, 'With his ultra-conservative policies, US President Donald Trump is disrupting the world order as well as the institutional and societal balance of the United States. Filmed less than a year after the start of his second term, this documentary analyzes the concrete impact of his measures on the population.', 'With his ultra-conservative policies, US President Donald Trump is disrupting the world order as well as the institutional and societal balance of the United States. Filmed less than a year after the start of his second term, this documentary analyzes the concrete impact of his measures on the population.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FtArM6PbNYNivheCbi69fF7sK8ga.jpg', 'plex:movie:trumps-amerika-macht-wandel-widerstand-2026-1'),
  ('631749658690839497', 'Trunk - Locked In', 2023, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Marc Schießer, Lisa Stutzky, Nina Romming', 'Marc Schießer', 'Sina Martens, Artjom Gilz, Luise Helm, Poal Cairo, Charles Rettinghaus, Janina Sachau', null, '28-year-old medicine student Malina wakes up disoriented in a locked trunk and realizes, to her horror, that she is missing more than just her memory of what happened. With her phone as the only link to the outside world, the intelligent young woman wages a desperate fight for survival while the vehicle races relentlessly toward a terrible secret.', '28-year-old medicine student Malina wakes up disoriented in a locked trunk and realizes, to her horror, that she is missing more than just her memory of what happened. With her phone as the only link to the outside world, the intelligent young woman wages a desperate fight for survival while the vehicle races relentlessly toward a terrible secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znbGgoqcQB0pxoTSO5imfALWOk3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1183905'),
  ('942522588010056209', 'Trust', 1990, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Hal Hartley, Michael Spiller, Eddie Rosenstein', 'Hal Hartley', 'Adrienne Shelly, Martin Donovan, Rebecca Nelson, John MacKay, Edie Falco, Gary Sauer, Matt Malloy, Suzanne Costollos', 'R', 'After being thrown away from home, pregnant high school dropout Maria meets Matthew, a highly educated and extremely moody electronics repairman. The two begin an unusual romance built on their sense of mutual admiration and trust.', 'After being thrown away from home, pregnant high school dropout Maria meets Matthew, a highly educated and extremely moody electronics repairman. The two begin an unusual romance built on their sense of mutual admiration and trust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wE7LuIkvuPfr4Ye6fMqPXHqaiE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37291'),
  ('681406876106337834', 'Trust', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'David Schwimmer, David Obermeyer, Andrzej Sekula', 'Andy Bellin, Robert Festinger', 'Clive Owen, Catherine Keener, Liana Liberato, Jason Clarke, Viola Davis, Chris Henry Coffey, Spencer Curnutt, Aislinn DeButch', 'R', 'A suburban family is torn apart when fourteen-year-old Annie meets her first boyfriend online. After months of communicating via online chat and phone, Annie discovers her friend is not who he originally claimed to be. Shocked into disbelief, her parents are shattered by their daughter''s actions and struggle to support her as she comes to terms with what has happened to her once innocent life.', 'A suburban family is torn apart when fourteen-year-old Annie meets her first boyfriend online. After months of communicating via online chat and phone, Annie discovers her friend is not who he originally claimed to be. Shocked into disbelief, her parents are shattered by their daughter''s actions and struggle to support her as she comes to terms with what has happened to her once innocent life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXoZYWd2G7pBh8N8Cp5ZO5Sjzbl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44945'),
  ('797672394582576972', 'Trust', 2021, 'Thriller, Romance, Drama', 'Brian DeCubellis, David Tumblety, Tess Raih', 'Brian DeCubellis, Kristen Lazarian', 'Victoria Justice, Matthew Daddario, Katherine McNamara, Lucien Laviscount, Ronny Chieng, Lindsey Broad, Rosa Gilmore, Clair Catherine', null, 'Set in the glamour of the New York and Paris art scenes, gallery owner Brooke Gatwick and her newscaster husband Owen Shore, face temptation, jealousy, twists and mystery when two seductive newcomers enter their lives.', 'Set in the glamour of the New York and Paris art scenes, gallery owner Brooke Gatwick and her newscaster husband Owen Shore, face temptation, jealousy, twists and mystery when two seductive newcomers enter their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVmymE4f7QgekI0Cp59lXtERspf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795230'),
  ('338487456693852978', 'Trust', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Daniele Luchetti, Ivan Casalgrandi, Francesca Boselli', 'Francesco Piccolo, Daniele Luchetti', 'Elio Germano, Federica Rosellini, Vittoria Puccini, Pilar Fogliati, Giordano De Plano, Isabella Ferrari, Alma Noce, Luca Gallone', null, 'Pietro is a revered teacher, Teresa his brilliant and precocious student. Their affair is both illicit and tempestuous. After one fight, Teresa suggests that each tell the other a secret, one so shameful or shocking that were it to be made public, it would destroy that person’s life. Time passes, Pietro’s stature as a writer grows and his family settles into the comfort of a bourgeois life. But he is haunted by the possibility that Teresa may one day reappear and tear apart his world with the secret she knows.', 'Pietro is a revered teacher, Teresa his brilliant and precocious student. Their affair is both illicit and tempestuous. After one fight, Teresa suggests that each tell the other a secret, one so shameful or shocking that were it to be made public, it would destroy that person’s life. Time passes, Pietro’s stature as a writer grows and his family settles into the comfort of a bourgeois life. But he is haunted by the possibility that Teresa may one day reappear and tear apart his world with the secret she knows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rySdSFkVfYa3zL7jhU42PcaxIgn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1037051'),
  ('1003263987773835028', 'Trust', 2025, 'Thriller', 'Carlson Young, Alejandro Martínez, Luis Román Hernández', 'Gigi Levangie', 'Sophie Turner, Rhys Coiro, Billy Campbell, Peter Mensah, Forrest Goodluck, Gianni Paolo, Renata Vaca, Katey Sagal', 'R', 'A Hollywood starlet seeks refuge in a secluded Airbnb following a high-profile scandal, only to find herself at the mercy of hardened criminals on the hunt for a score.', 'A Hollywood starlet seeks refuge in a secluded Airbnb following a high-profile scandal, only to find herself at the mercy of hardened criminals on the hunt for a score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9GS1mUAVMiC3gBn9rb8jrDoK4D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1244953'),
  ('288040767762481871', 'Trust Me', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Clark Gregg, Terry Stacey', 'Clark Gregg', 'Clark Gregg, Amanda Peet, Saxon Sharbino, Felicity Huffman, Allison Janney, William H. Macy, Niecy Nash, Sam Rockwell', 'R', 'In an attempt to sign a Hollywood starlet, struggling talent agent and former child star Howard Holloway must contend with her volatile father, a scheming long-time rival, and a producer and casting director who despise him.', 'In an attempt to sign a Hollywood starlet, struggling talent agent and former child star Howard Holloway must contend with her volatile father, a scheming long-time rival, and a producer and casting director who despise him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/za40eaNet6AsJ8voY6AMNokhj4P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174343'),
  ('509771500308960097', 'Trust Me', 2014, 'Thriller', 'Michel Tikhomiroff, Rodrigo Monte, Rica Amabis', 'Fabio Danesi', 'Mateus Solano, Fernanda Machado, Fernanda D''Umbra, Bruno Giordano, Clarisse Abujamra, Janaina Afhonso, Patrícia Pichamone, Geraldo Rodrigues', null, 'Mari is a talented but insecure chef who dreams of running her own restaurant. She goes through a challenging professional time, taking orders from an authoritarian boss who inhibits her talent. One day she meets Caio, a charming young man who provides the conditions for her to realize her dream. Caio shows Mari that she should trust herself and open her own restaurant. However, things are not always what they seem to be.', 'Mari is a talented but insecure chef who dreams of running her own restaurant. She goes through a challenging professional time, taking orders from an authoritarian boss who inhibits her talent. One day she meets Caio, a charming young man who provides the conditions for her to realize her dream. Caio shows Mari that she should trust herself and open her own restaurant. However, things are not always what they seem to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efWJKCKVLWpE1XxHcgmNgMbThbh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228201'),
  ('486964908347603051', 'Trust No One: The Hunt for the Crypto King', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Luke Sewell', null, null, 'R', 'When the young founder of a collapsing cryptocurrency exchange dies unexpectedly, irate investors suspect there''s more to his death than meets the eye.', 'When the young founder of a collapsing cryptocurrency exchange dies unexpectedly, irate investors suspect there''s more to his death than meets the eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZzllPVrYmBn28Kc7PZaQ0PrQat.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:946327'),
  ('287015617330701721', 'Trust the Man', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Bart Freundlich, Tim Orr', 'Bart Freundlich', 'David Duchovny, Julianne Moore, Billy Crudup, Maggie Gyllenhaal, Justin Bartha, Eva Mendes, Ellen Barkin, Garry Shandling', 'R', 'Overachieving actress Rebecca must come to grips with her failing marriage to stay-at-home dad Tom. While Rebecca''s slacker brother Tobey can''t seem to commit to his aspiring-novelist girlfriend, Elaine. As both relationships spin out of control, the two couples embark on a quest to rediscover the magic and romance of falling in love in New York.', 'Overachieving actress Rebecca must come to grips with her failing marriage to stay-at-home dad Tom. While Rebecca''s slacker brother Tobey can''t seem to commit to his aspiring-novelist girlfriend, Elaine. As both relationships spin out of control, the two couples embark on a quest to rediscover the magic and romance of falling in love in New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njvBxeC3mj5XKjT9a2OdDglq9Yj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14057'),
  ('534764835204633882', 'trustWHO', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Lilian Franck', 'Lilian Franck, Anja Neraal, Robert Cibis', 'Lilian Franck, John Peterson Myers, Robert Parsons, Wolfgang Wodarg, Margaret Chan, Thomas Zeltner, Douglas Bettcher, Vera da Costa e Silva', null, 'Is the WHO sick? The filmmaker and mother Lilian Franck reveals clandestine influences by the tobacco, pharmaceutical and nuclear industries on the organization. She shows a frightening portrayal of our present society, in which governmental politics is becoming obsolete. "Of all the forms of inequality, injustice in health care is the most shocking and inhumane." - Martin Luther King', 'Is the WHO sick? The filmmaker and mother Lilian Franck reveals clandestine influences by the tobacco, pharmaceutical and nuclear industries on the organization. She shows a frightening portrayal of our present society, in which governmental politics is becoming obsolete. "Of all the forms of inequality, injustice in health care is the most shocking and inhumane." - Martin Luther King', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXFpbGrKUztSecA4iG0984TlaGx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508471'),
  ('170962694199812213', 'Truth', 2015, 'Drama', 'James Vanderbilt, Mandy Walker, Steve E. Andrews', 'James Vanderbilt', 'Cate Blanchett, Robert Redford, Dennis Quaid, Elisabeth Moss, Bruce Greenwood, Stacy Keach, John Benjamin Hickey, Topher Grace', 'R', 'As a renowned producer and close associate of Dan Rather, Mary Mapes believes she’s broken the biggest story of the 2004 election: revelations of a sitting U.S. President’s military service. But when allegations come pouring in, sources change their stories, document authenticity is questioned, and the casualties begin to mount.', 'As a renowned producer and close associate of Dan Rather, Mary Mapes believes she’s broken the biggest story of the 2004 election: revelations of a sitting U.S. President’s military service. But when allegations come pouring in, sources change their stories, document authenticity is questioned, and the casualties begin to mount.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmpMRABYbQjgtxwJ6xMPc8KskzA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300693'),
  ('1069325264497088794', 'Truth & Treason', 2025, 'History, Drama, Thriller', 'Matt Whitaker, Bianca Cline', 'Matt Whitaker, Ethan Vincent', 'Ewan Horrocks, Rupert Evans, Ferdinand McKay, Daf Thomas, Nye Occomore, Joanna Christie, Sean Mahon, Sylvie Varcoe', 'PG-13', 'When loyalty to country becomes loyalty to a lie, one teen risks everything to expose the truth. With the Gestapo closing in, he must decide what it really means to be a good German.', 'When loyalty to country becomes loyalty to a lie, one teen risks everything to expose the truth. With the Gestapo closing in, he must decide what it really means to be a good German.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArDLn658OjT3dMThIi4GDQJRuY3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1443940'),
  ('767782754592327165', 'Truth and Justice', 2019, 'Drama, History', 'Tõnis Pill, Ralf Siig, Maria Kljukina', 'Tanel Toom', 'Priit Loog, Ester Kuntu, Priit Võigemast, Maiken Pius, Simeoni Sundja, Indrek Sammul, Marika Vaarik, Maria Ehrenberg', null, 'Estonia, 1872. The uncompromising new owner of Robber''s Rise must battle with hard work, his spiteful neighbor and with his own family and beliefs to transform the poor land into a flourishing farm of his dreams.', 'Estonia, 1872. The uncompromising new owner of Robber''s Rise must battle with hard work, his spiteful neighbor and with his own family and beliefs to transform the poor land into a flourishing farm of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8HlPxCzyGz5sNXSNi6GbSKOgC9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583841'),
  ('118477301991978242', 'Truth or Consequences, N.M.', 1997, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Kiefer Sutherland, Ric Waite, Chris Howell', 'Brad Mirman', 'Vincent Gallo, Kiefer Sutherland, Max Perlich, Rod Steiger, John C. McGinley, Martin Sheen, Kevin Pollak, Mykelti Williamson', 'R', 'Raymond Lembecke is a con just out of prison after serving time for selling drugs for his mob boss Tony Vago. (Lembecke was innocent and took the rap for Vago.) Lembecke thinks Vago owes him big time so, when his former boss gets him a measly job in a warehouse, he decides on revenge and plans to steal a million dollars worth of drugs from him.', 'Raymond Lembecke is a con just out of prison after serving time for selling drugs for his mob boss Tony Vago. (Lembecke was innocent and took the rap for Vago.) Lembecke thinks Vago owes him big time so, when his former boss gets him a measly job in a warehouse, he decides on revenge and plans to steal a million dollars worth of drugs from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5SqRSTVbvBrM6s2rPa5U34Hcryu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31017'),
  ('891059199490562425', 'Truth or Dare', 1994, 'Comedy', 'François Ozon, Yorick Le Saux', 'François Ozon', 'Farida Rahmatoullah, Aylin Argun, Fabien Billet, Adrien Pastor', null, 'Two teen girls and two teen boys play a game of truth or dare. The questions and the challenges deal with sex; it''s innocent and harmless, but at each turn, each youth tries to raise the ante. Then, Paul gives a dare to Rose, and the result brings on a sudden and complete silence.', 'Two teen girls and two teen boys play a game of truth or dare. The questions and the challenges deal with sex; it''s innocent and harmless, but at each turn, each youth tries to raise the ante. Then, Paul gives a dare to Rose, and the result brings on a sudden and complete silence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OCzs8jZRmktD0RVsjx1Qngq8sP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44484'),
  ('173973186980748044', 'Truth or Dare', 1997, 'Family, Drama', 'Christina Olofson, Robert Nordström, Tobias Falk', 'Annika Thor, Christina Olofson', 'Tove Edfeldt, Anna Gabrielsson, Alexandra Dahlström, Emelina Lindberg-Filippoupoullou, Ellen Swedenmark, Katja Steinholtz Skog, Totte Steneby, Fredrik Ådén', null, 'Summer holiday is over. Nora begins sixth grade and is drawn to intrigues and doesn''t really know what side she''s on. Or wants to be on. On one hand she feels sorry for the bullied Karin, one the other hand she wants to be friends with tough Fanny and Sabina.', 'Summer holiday is over. Nora begins sixth grade and is drawn to intrigues and doesn''t really know what side she''s on. Or wants to be on. On one hand she feels sorry for the bullied Karin, one the other hand she wants to be friends with tough Fanny and Sabina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNvdlHTQ09ciKDoO1PgLndGydaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77345'),
  ('548727170362851091', 'Truth or Dare', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Robert Heath, Lance Roehrig, James Friend', 'Matthew McGuchan', 'Liam Boyle, Jack Gordon, Florence Hall, David Oakes, Jennie Jacques, Tom Kane, Jason Maza, David Sterne', 'NR', 'A group of friends are lured to an isolated cabin by a promise of heavy partying, only to find themselves in a nightmarish game of truth or dare.', 'A group of friends are lured to an isolated cabin by a promise of heavy partying, only to find themselves in a nightmarish game of truth or dare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5FcN0P7YcSJUbnosxyU4GEG4br.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101179'),
  ('413630454021774022', 'Truth or Dare', 2017, 'Horror, Fantasy, Mystery, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Kevin Duggin, Nick Simon', 'Ethan Lawrence, Thommy Hutson', 'Heather Langenkamp, Alexxis Lemire, Cassie Scerbo, Brytni Sarpy, Christina Masterson, Victoria Spencer Smith, Luke Baines, Taylor Lyons', 'R', 'Eight college friends head to a "Haunted Rental" in a remote town for Halloween weekend. There, they play the game rumored to have caused the deaths of seven teenagers decades earlier, Truth or Dare. What starts out as vodka induced fun, quickly turns serious when the dares become sickeningly dangerous and the truths threaten to tear the group apart. When players attempt to refuse the increasingly challenging tasks, they''re met with deadly consequences, quickly discovering: you must do the dare, or the dare does you. As the death toll mounts, the remaining players must race against the clock to outrun, outsmart and outlast the simple game of Truth or Dare.', 'Eight college friends head to a "Haunted Rental" in a remote town for Halloween weekend. There, they play the game rumored to have caused the deaths of seven teenagers decades earlier, Truth or Dare. What starts out as vodka induced fun, quickly turns serious when the dares become sickeningly dangerous and the truths threaten to tear the group apart. When players attempt to refuse the increasingly challenging tasks, they''re met with deadly consequences, quickly discovering: you must do the dare, or the dare does you. As the death toll mounts, the remaining players must race against the clock to outrun, outsmart and outlast the simple game of Truth or Dare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5Dyos3xViHP5ROuCi01P9Q6nZA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480210'),
  ('165977814709006324', 'Truth or Dare', 2018, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Jeff Wadlow, Jacques Jouffret, Phil DeSanti', 'Michael Reisz, Jillian Jacobs, Christopher Roach', 'Nolan Gerard Funk, Lucy Hale, Violett Beane, Tyler Posey, Hayden Szeto, Aurora Perrineau, Sophia Ali, Landon Liboiron', 'PG-13', 'A harmless game of "Truth or Dare" among friends turns deadly when someone—or something—begins to punish those who tell a lie—or refuse the dare.', 'A harmless game of "Truth or Dare" among friends turns deadly when someone—or something—begins to punish those who tell a lie—or refuse the dare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ei2waWQAG8NP244WShIFgGu9IOu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460019'),
  ('144814748305952755', 'Truth or Dare? - A Critical Madness', 1986, 'Horror', 'Tim Ritter, Christopher M. Burritt, Ned Miller', 'Tim Ritter', 'John Brace, Mary Fanaro, Bruce Gold, Raymond Carbone, Kerry Ellen Walker, AJ McLean, Anthony T. Townes, Joel D. Wynkoop', 'NR', 'Mike Strauber catches his wife Sharon in bed with his best friend Jerry. He gets mad and takes off to embark on an adventure of murder and self-mutilation in demented games of truth or dare.', 'Mike Strauber catches his wife Sharon in bed with his best friend Jerry. He gets mad and takes off to embark on an adventure of murder and self-mutilation in demented games of truth or dare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yy3OC0GOURNBjOPchdW1RchpCLJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83155'),
  ('724010615874630303', 'Try Me', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Régis Blondeau', 'Frédéric Proust, Jean-Paul Bathany, Pierre-François Martin-Laval', 'Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Pierre Richard, Marina Foïs, Julie Depardieu, Kad Merad, Wladimir Yordanoff, Isabelle Nanty, Maurice Barthélemy', null, 'When Yves-Marie, 9, asks Jacqueline, who is her age: "Marry me", she replies with a pirouette: "The day you go to the stars, I give you my hand."', 'When Yves-Marie, 9, asks Jacqueline, who is her age: "Marry me", she replies with a pirouette: "The day you go to the stars, I give you my hand."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fudWCmjB3aeafAFYeKV0MAZTMu9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55424'),
  ('88422617304995577', 'Try Seventeen', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Jeffrey Porter, Blake T. Evans', 'Charles Kephart', 'Elijah Wood, Franka Potente, Mandy Moore, Debbie Harry, Elizabeth Perkins, Chris William Martin, Aaron Pearl, Aloma Wright', 'R', 'Teenager Jones has opted not to go to college and is instead renting a room in a boarding house to work on his writing skills. Soon, Jones finds himself dividing his time between two women: a young actress named Lisa and a photographer named Jane. After Jane''s ex-boyfriend arrives to help her recover from a car accident, Jones begins to understand just how much he cares for her.', 'Teenager Jones has opted not to go to college and is instead renting a room in a boarding house to work on his writing skills. Soon, Jones finds himself dividing his time between two women: a young actress named Lisa and a photographer named Jane. After Jane''s ex-boyfriend arrives to help her recover from a car accident, Jones begins to understand just how much he cares for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNOIMMhPaBiFaDEHOODFEHg8Ef8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14874'),
  ('454725237203677456', 'Tryam! Hello!', 1980, 'Animation, Family', 'Yuriy Butyrin', 'Sergey Kozlov', 'Klara Rumyanova, Georgi Burkov, Margarita Korabelnikova', null, 'Today is the Hare’s birthday, and the Hedgehog is picking daisies as a gift for him. Meanwhile, the Bear Cub is telling the Hedgehog about a magical land called Tilimilitryamdiya, which he spent the whole night imagining.', 'Today is the Hare’s birthday, and the Hedgehog is picking daisies as a gift for him. Meanwhile, the Bear Cub is telling the Hedgehog about a magical land called Tilimilitryamdiya, which he spent the whole night imagining.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plE8I7WI5L1oGnLLyAEmCG2Vigq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383282'),
  ('576163178722204790', 'Tsar', 2009, 'Drama, History', 'Pavel Lungin, Tom Stern, Nathalia Lyashenko', 'Aleksei Ivanov, Pavel Lungin', 'Pyotr Mamonov, Oleg Yankovskiy, Alexandr Domogarov, Ivan Okhlobystin, Yuriy Kuznetsov, Aleksey Makarov, Aleksandr Ilyin Jr, Ville Haapasalo', 'PG-13', 'In 16th-century Russia in the grip of chaos, Ivan the Terrible strongly believes he is vested with a holy mission. Believing he can understand and interpret the signs, he sees the Last Judgment approaching. He establishes absolute power, cruelly destroying anyone who gets in his way. During this reign of terror, Philip, the superior of the monastery on the Solovetsky Islands, a great scholar and Ivan''s close friend, dares to oppose the sovereign''s mystical tyranny. What follows is a clash between two completely opposite visions of the world, smashing morality and justice, God and men. A grand-scale film with excellent leading roles by Mamonov and Yankovsky. An allegory of Stalinist Russia', 'In 16th-century Russia in the grip of chaos, Ivan the Terrible strongly believes he is vested with a holy mission. Believing he can understand and interpret the signs, he sees the Last Judgment approaching. He establishes absolute power, cruelly destroying anyone who gets in his way. During this reign of terror, Philip, the superior of the monastery on the Solovetsky Islands, a great scholar and Ivan''s close friend, dares to oppose the sovereign''s mystical tyranny. What follows is a clash between two completely opposite visions of the world, smashing morality and justice, God and men. A grand-scale film with excellent leading roles by Mamonov and Yankovsky. An allegory of Stalinist Russia', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fV9iAomcH9J8nuo2kjSVzo3SF8U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41545'),
  ('3648242580296187', 'Tsatsiki', 1999, 'Family, Drama', 'Ella Lemhagen', 'Ulf Stark, Ella Lemhagen', 'Samuel Haus, Alexandra Rapaport, Jacob Ericksson, Jonas Karlsson, George Nakas, Sam Kessel, Isa Engström, Marcus Hasselborg', null, 'Little Tsatsiki, son of a single mother in Sweden, has never met his father, a Greek fisherman. Tsatsiki befriends a nice but straight-laced motorcycle policeman renting one of their rooms and decices he is the right guy for his mother, an amateur rock singer in love with her band''s bass player.', 'Little Tsatsiki, son of a single mother in Sweden, has never met his father, a Greek fisherman. Tsatsiki befriends a nice but straight-laced motorcycle policeman renting one of their rooms and decices he is the right guy for his mother, an amateur rock singer in love with her band''s bass player.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yXdmoHwGp5BGRFrqh1nr7PaT7C6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27119'),
  ('195709010816138982', 'Tsotsi', 2005, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lance Gewer, Gavin Hood', 'Gavin Hood', 'Presley Chweneyagae, Jerry Mofokeng, Terry Pheto, Zenzo Ngqobe, Zola, Rapulana Seiphemo, Nambitha Mpumlwana, Percy Matsemela', 'R', 'A young South African boy from the Johannesburg ghetto named Tsotsi, meaning Gangster, leaves home as a child to get away from his helpless parents. Now a teenage thug, Tsotsi finds a baby in the back seat of a car he''s just stolen. He decides that it is his responsibility to care for the infant and in the process learns that maybe the criminal life isn’t the best way.', 'A young South African boy from the Johannesburg ghetto named Tsotsi, meaning Gangster, leaves home as a child to get away from his helpless parents. Now a teenage thug, Tsotsi finds a baby in the back seat of a car he''s just stolen. He decides that it is his responsibility to care for the infant and in the process learns that maybe the criminal life isn’t the best way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3ebTJFcDZ35GaKcuUQQe243z4f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:868'),
  ('501548182342763547', 'Tsubasa Chronicle The Movie: The Princess in the Birdcage Kingdom', 2005, 'Animation, Action, Adventure', 'Itsuro Kawasaki, Kyoji Asano, Yoko Kikuchi', 'Midori Goto', 'Miyu Irino, Yui Makino, Daisuke Namikawa, Tetsu Inada, Mika Kikuchi, Maaya Sakamoto, Sayaka Ohara', null, 'In their continuing journey to find the feathers that are the fragments of Sakura''s lost memory, Syaoran, Kurogane, Fay, and Sakura move through time and space with Mokona. Here, they visit the "Country of Birdcages," a seemingly peaceful country where people and birds live together, each person having a bird companion. After a boy named Koruri confuses Syaoran and Sakura for "bodyguards" and attacks them, they learn that the king of the country possesses a mysterious power. Princess Tomoyo, Koruri, and the other oppressed citizens, having had their birds taken from them, live in hiding within the forest. In order to take back Sakura''s feather, Syaoran and the others stand up against the scheming king.', 'In their continuing journey to find the feathers that are the fragments of Sakura''s lost memory, Syaoran, Kurogane, Fay, and Sakura move through time and space with Mokona. Here, they visit the "Country of Birdcages," a seemingly peaceful country where people and birds live together, each person having a bird companion. After a boy named Koruri confuses Syaoran and Sakura for "bodyguards" and attacks them, they learn that the king of the country possesses a mysterious power. Princess Tomoyo, Koruri, and the other oppressed citizens, having had their birds taken from them, live in hiding within the forest. In order to take back Sakura''s feather, Syaoran and the others stand up against the scheming king.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCXOtA84ev2r2PKy9uM4pTNyL26.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42180'),
  ('739132435658110775', 'Tsuda Umeko: Osatsu ni Natta Ryugakusei', 2022, 'TV Movie, Drama, History', 'Meiji Fujita', 'Atsuko Hashibe', 'Suzu Hirose, Elaiza Ikeda, Yui Sakuma, Emma Miyazawa, Kai Inowaki, Hideaki Ito, Yuki Uchida, Nozomi Inoue', null, 'Tsuda Umeko was born in December 31, 1864 and became a pioneer in women''s eductation. In 1871, Tsuda Umeko, with her father''s recommendation, went to the United States to study at the age of 6. She was the youngest of the group of females to travel there. They were the first Japanese female students to study overseas at their government''s expense. 11 years after studying in the United States, Tsuda Umeko returns to Japan. She wants to become a woman who is helpful to her culture, but she is shocked by the low status of women in Japan. (Source: AsianWiki)', 'Tsuda Umeko was born in December 31, 1864 and became a pioneer in women''s eductation. In 1871, Tsuda Umeko, with her father''s recommendation, went to the United States to study at the age of 6. She was the youngest of the group of females to travel there. They were the first Japanese female students to study overseas at their government''s expense. 11 years after studying in the United States, Tsuda Umeko returns to Japan. She wants to become a woman who is helpful to her culture, but she is shocked by the low status of women in Japan. (Source: AsianWiki)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewWwUzFjsUOuYsCDwxjAS2RyY7i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:931539'),
  ('970566838384288556', 'Tsugaru Folksong', 1973, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kōichi Saitō, Noritaka Sakamoto', 'Takehiro Nakajima, Kōichi Saitō', 'Kyōko Enami, Akira Oda, Mihoko Nakagawa, Kō Nishimura, Kōjirō Hongō, Hideo Sato, Minori Terada, Haruko Toda', null, 'A young girl is being asked about a man with whom she was keeping company, as her grandmother plays a lament on a shamisen. Then the focus changes to a couple arriving from Tokyo - the woman returning to her home, the man an escapee from the yakuza. The man doesn''t seem to mind when the woman sells her favours to tourists at the local bar, just as she seems to take his attentions to Yuki, a blind girl, with equanimity.', 'A young girl is being asked about a man with whom she was keeping company, as her grandmother plays a lament on a shamisen. Then the focus changes to a couple arriving from Tokyo - the woman returning to her home, the man an escapee from the yakuza. The man doesn''t seem to mind when the woman sells her favours to tourists at the local bar, just as she seems to take his attentions to Yuki, a blind girl, with equanimity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYVKLVFc2UjEBuacuWp8oha9ZZx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107541'),
  ('1054506578582432475', 'Tsukiji Wonderland', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Naotaro Endo', null, null, null, 'Through the lives of professionals working at Tsukĳi Fish Market in Tokyo, the film portrays how Tsukĳi has been the center of fish culinary culture and helped Japanese food culture to flourish as we know it today.', 'Through the lives of professionals working at Tsukĳi Fish Market in Tokyo, the film portrays how Tsukĳi has been the center of fish culinary culture and helped Japanese food culture to flourish as we know it today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v90Ufm9hDsLQoGTvnlyCjencXet.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396121'),
  ('178069915302258156', 'Tsumugi', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hidekazu Takahara, Katsuji Oyamada, Rei Sakamoto', 'Hidekazu Takahara', 'Sora Aoi, Satoshi Kobayashi, Takashi Naha, Shigeru Nakano, Chiyoko Sakamachi, Ren Suzuki', null, 'Tsumugi, a girl with a crush on her teacher, discovers that the teacher is having an affair with another teacher. Complications ensue after Tsumugi manages to attract her teacher, but then begins falling for a fellow student.', 'Tsumugi, a girl with a crush on her teacher, discovers that the teacher is having an affair with another teacher. Complications ensue after Tsumugi manages to attract her teacher, but then begins falling for a fellow student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dezFLYlfDc27sEXmbHBWkXUGcQ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101752'),
  ('528984470210236712', 'Tsuyukusa', 2022, 'Drama', 'Hideyuki Hirayama', 'Teruo Abe', 'Satomi Kobayashi, Yutaka Matsushige, Kami Hiraiwa, Taiyo Saito, Noriko Eguchi, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Shigeru Izumiya, Bengal', null, 'Middle-aged Fumi lives a quiet seaside life, she spends her days working at a small local factory, spending time with her neighbor’s son, and attending her sober-lifestyle group. One night while driving home her car is struck by a small meteorite, the odds of which are 100 million to 1. Seeing this as a good omen, Fumi decides she should be open to new possibilities in her life, even perhaps romance…', 'Middle-aged Fumi lives a quiet seaside life, she spends her days working at a small local factory, spending time with her neighbor’s son, and attending her sober-lifestyle group. One night while driving home her car is struck by a small meteorite, the odds of which are 100 million to 1. Seeing this as a good omen, Fumi decides she should be open to new possibilities in her life, even perhaps romance…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/coJjD23tJ1Q2e4iZAnH33xAPTlp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:954094'),
  ('112743192267083043', 'TT3D: Closer to the Edge', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Richard De Aragues, Thomas Kürzl', null, 'Jared Leto, Guy Martin, Ian Hutchinson, John McGuinness, Michael Dunlop, Keith Amor, Bruce Anstey, John Barton', null, 'By vividly recounting the TT''s legendary rivalries and the Isle of Man''s unique road racing history, this 3D feature documentary discovers why modern TT riders still risk their lives to win the world''s most dangerous race. The Isle of Man Tourist Trophy is the greatest motorcycle road race in the world, the ultimate challenge for rider and machine. It has always called for a commitment far beyond any other racing event, and many have made the ultimate sacrifice in their quest for victory. A story about freedom of choice, the strength of human spirit and the will to win. It''s also an examination of what motivates those rare few, this elite band of brothers who risk everything to win.', 'By vividly recounting the TT''s legendary rivalries and the Isle of Man''s unique road racing history, this 3D feature documentary discovers why modern TT riders still risk their lives to win the world''s most dangerous race. The Isle of Man Tourist Trophy is the greatest motorcycle road race in the world, the ultimate challenge for rider and machine. It has always called for a commitment far beyond any other racing event, and many have made the ultimate sacrifice in their quest for victory. A story about freedom of choice, the strength of human spirit and the will to win. It''s also an examination of what motivates those rare few, this elite band of brothers who risk everything to win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTpacyxa9ly5UPfgogsmf83g2zt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79628'),
  ('1050073650686417929', 'Tu Chor Main Sipahi', 1996, 'Action, Comedy', 'Guddu Dhanoa', null, 'Akshay Kumar, Saif Ali Khan, Tabu, Pratibha Sinha, Deven Verma, Amrish Puri', null, 'Thakur Gajendra Singh runs a criminal empire from a small town. The Thakur rules this town, including the police, who only cater to his interests. His town has been known to be the grave-yard of police officers who have dared to oppose him. Inspector Amar Varma accepts the assignment to serve in this town, not knowing that he is not only putting his own life, but the lives of his loved ones also, in the hands of the merciless Thakur.', 'Thakur Gajendra Singh runs a criminal empire from a small town. The Thakur rules this town, including the police, who only cater to his interests. His town has been known to be the grave-yard of police officers who have dared to oppose him. Inspector Amar Varma accepts the assignment to serve in this town, not knowing that he is not only putting his own life, but the lives of his loved ones also, in the hands of the merciless Thakur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmRoqW06eqgjSLiAuxgD3sVscJK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333583'),
  ('344473632422720708', 'Tu es mon fils', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Didier Le Pêcheur, Myriam Vinocour', null, 'Anne Marivin, Charles Berling, Paul Bartel, Thomas Jouannet, Eline Perrotin, Cécile Rebboah', null, 'The discovery of a lifeless body triggers a mother’s murder investigation in this gripping French thriller. Directed by Didier Le Pecheur.', 'The discovery of a lifeless body triggers a mother’s murder investigation in this gripping French thriller. Directed by Didier Le Pecheur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdXY1BJUdE1IgERl4N0xhPSAGtl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326476'),
  ('1081093211393204400', 'Tu Jhoothi Main Makkaar', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Vicky Sidana, Anshul Sharma, Santhana Krishnan Ravichandran', 'Luv Ranjan, Rahul Mody', 'Ranbir Kapoor, Shraddha Kapoor, Anubhav Singh Bassi, Dimple Kapadia, Boney Kapoor, Hasleen Kaur, Monica Chaudhary, Inayat Verma', 'NR', 'To earn extra cash, Mickey helps couples break up — but life gets complicated when he falls for Tinni, a career woman with an independent streak.', 'To earn extra cash, Mickey helps couples break up — but life gets complicated when he falls for Tinni, a career woman with an independent streak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHLtNP4KP0GMi6p1ACf2QvVnBvI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611359'),
  ('341935674878762945', 'Tu Meri Main Tera Main Tera Tu Meri', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Sameer Vidwans, Anil Mehta, Panchami Ghavri', 'Karan Shrikant Sharma', 'Kartik Aaryan, Ananya Panday, Neena Gupta, Jackie Shroff, Chandni Bhabhda, Tiku Talsania, Sapna Sand, Gaurav Pandey', null, 'When a carefree NRI wedding planner and a headstrong novelist collide during a wild summer in Croatia, sparks fly in ways neither expected. What begins as playful clashes soon transforms into something deeper – only to be tested when love, family, and tradition pull them in opposite directions.', 'When a carefree NRI wedding planner and a headstrong novelist collide during a wild summer in Croatia, sparks fly in ways neither expected. What begins as playful clashes soon transforms into something deeper – only to be tested when love, family, and tradition pull them in opposite directions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLO7ByOKZbRmA4r9ONEHWHZ6HIX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1407523'),
  ('773923522481794675', 'Tu mi nascondi qualcosa', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Giuseppe Lo Console, Fabio Zamarion', 'Tito Buffolini, Gianluca Ansanelli', 'Rocco Papaleo, Rocío Muñoz Morales, Giuseppe Battiston, Sarah Felberbaum, Alessandro Tiberi, Stella Egitto, Eva Robin''s, Olga Rossi', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m7rx6YxAmU7gPUVmxMGX7rN1wUu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512968'),
  ('93691593412416971', 'Tu Quoque', 2025, 'Comedy, History', 'Gianni Quinto, Antonio Scappatura', 'Maurizio Battista, Gianni Quinto', 'Maurizio Battista, Paolo Triestino, Francesca Antonelli, Giorgio Caputo, Marco Conidi, Milena Miconi, Guglielmo Poggi, Jane Alexander', null, 'Maximus''s life has officially come to a standstill, on the brink of a precipice. However, he is magically transported to ancient Rome. There, using his connections, Maximus saves Julius Caesar''s life, foiling the assassination attempt that would have killed him and becoming his most trusted advisor.', 'Maximus''s life has officially come to a standstill, on the brink of a precipice. However, he is magically transported to ancient Rome. There, using his connections, Maximus saves Julius Caesar''s life, foiling the assassination attempt that would have killed him and becoming his most trusted advisor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqQSNsWoQqg4WkmBzmv3NtbDOgk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1440684'),
  ('801294415520254197', 'Tu Yaa Main', 2026, 'Romance, Thriller', 'Bejoy Nambiar, Remy Dalai', 'Abhishek Bandekar, Himanshu Sharma, Ping Lumpraploeng', 'Shanaya Kapoor, Kshitee Jog, Parul Gulati, Ansh Chopra, Amrutha Srinivasan', null, 'A wannabe rapper from the outskirts of Mumbai and an affluent influencer elope to a coastal town, only to find themselves trapped in the pool of a derelict resort fighting for survival against the wrath of a ferocious crocodile.', 'A wannabe rapper from the outskirts of Mumbai and an affluent influencer elope to a coastal town, only to find themselves trapped in the pool of a derelict resort fighting for survival against the wrath of a ferocious crocodile.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FnUPnA0I1MTaZRVCsUQc5DS5JA8W.jpg', 'plex:movie:tu-yaa-main-2026'),
  ('1037628347105852161', 'Tubby the Tuba', 1947, 'Animation, Family, Music', 'George Pal, Clarence Wheeler, George E. Jordan', null, 'Victor Jory, Billy Bletcher', null, 'In this Puppetoon animated short film (an Academy Award Best Short Subject, Cartoons nominee), Tubby the Tuba is disappointed that his sound limits what he''s permitted to do in an orchestra of self-playing instruments that, unlike him, get to play pretty melodies. A chance meeting with a bullfrog changes everything.', 'In this Puppetoon animated short film (an Academy Award Best Short Subject, Cartoons nominee), Tubby the Tuba is disappointed that his sound limits what he''s permitted to do in an orchestra of self-playing instruments that, unlike him, get to play pretty melodies. A chance meeting with a bullfrog changes everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkN0dCjqKKsUqLYXWQcAUvc0WXB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211507'),
  ('384825408617416347', 'Tube', 2003, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Baek Woon-hak, Kim Jung-min', null, 'Kim Suk-hoon, Park Sang-min, Bae Doona, Kwon Oh-joong, Park Jeong-Woo, Han Jung-soo, Ki Joo-bong, Kim Su-hyun', null, 'Burnt-out transit cop Jay forms an unlikely alliance with pickpocket Kay to stop a terrorist hijacker from blowing up a subway car during rush hour.', 'Burnt-out transit cop Jay forms an unlikely alliance with pickpocket Kay to stop a terrorist hijacker from blowing up a subway car during rush hour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqNBp4KzUhUkyRtkN2TroN78ZLs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32238'),
  ('320424208884091091', 'Tube Tales', 1999, 'Drama', 'Charles McDougall, Amy Jenkins, Menhaj Huda', 'Atalanta Goulandris, Mark Greig, Ed Allen II', 'Tom Bell, Jim Carter, Carmen Ejogo, Leonie Elliott, Leah Fitzgerald, Jason Flemyng, Dexter Fletcher, Frank Harper', null, 'Nine short stories based on the true experiences of London Underground passengers: "Mr. Cool" (Amy Jenkins, dir.); "Horny" (Stephen Hopkins); "Grasshopper" (Menhaj Huda); "My Father the Liar" (Bob Hoskins); "Bone" (Ewan McGregor); "Mouth" (Armando Iannucci); "A Bird in the Hand" (Jude Law); "Rosebud" (Gaby Dellal); "Steal Away" (Charles McDougall)', 'Nine short stories based on the true experiences of London Underground passengers: "Mr. Cool" (Amy Jenkins, dir.); "Horny" (Stephen Hopkins); "Grasshopper" (Menhaj Huda); "My Father the Liar" (Bob Hoskins); "Bone" (Ewan McGregor); "Mouth" (Armando Iannucci); "A Bird in the Hand" (Jude Law); "Rosebud" (Gaby Dellal); "Steal Away" (Charles McDougall)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bK3zlukpnr3MGeOvBZ5vIiJ2EWE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45739'),
  ('710661310650206037', 'Tube-E Movie', 2026, 'Comedy', 'William Adams', 'William Adams, Desmond Williams, Jamar Metzler', 'Adele Givens, Damon Williams, Brandall Cole, Philana Sanders, Latesha Estes', null, 'A wild Chicago indie satire where a low-budget film crew loses control when the characters realize they''re trapped in their own movie-breaking the fourth wall and roasting today''s viral streaming culture.', 'A wild Chicago indie satire where a low-budget film crew loses control when the characters realize they''re trapped in their own movie-breaking the fourth wall and roasting today''s viral streaming culture.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fp7E1If3PRMZmUxylpZsp2A24NJ9.jpg', 'plex:movie:tube-e-movie'),
  ('1013214504227677616', 'Tubelight', 2017, 'Drama, War', 'Kabir Khan, Aseem Mishra, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Parveez Shaikh, Kabir Khan', 'Salman Khan, Sohail Khan, Om Puri, Yashpal Sharma, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub, Matin Rey Tangu, Zhu Zhu, Brijendra Kala', null, 'Laxman Singh Bisht is nicknamed tube light by his neighbours because he is feeble-minded. Despite being special, Laxman lives by one life-lesson; keep your faith alive and you can do almost anything, even stop a war.', 'Laxman Singh Bisht is nicknamed tube light by his neighbours because he is feeble-minded. Despite being special, Laxman lives by one life-lesson; keep your faith alive and you can do almost anything, even stop a war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hy7Ka19Vx2TwXA6OWZSe4XuMDlK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441881'),
  ('329810973905634867', 'Tuck Everlasting', 2002, 'Drama, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Jay Russell, Martin J. Layton, John Rusk', 'Jeffrey Lieber, James V. Hart', 'Alexis Bledel, William Hurt, Sissy Spacek, Jonathan Jackson, Scott Bairstow, Ben Kingsley, Amy Irving, Victor Garber', 'PG', 'Teenager Winnie Foster is growing up in a small rural town in 1914 with her loving but overprotective parents, but Winnie longs for a life of greater freedom and adventure.', 'Teenager Winnie Foster is growing up in a small rural town in 1914 with her loving but overprotective parents, but Winnie longs for a life of greater freedom and adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BXAC4uTHuD37hpiGOmhetqNgnO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13768'),
  ('880190896294929899', 'Tucker and Dale vs. Evil', 2010, 'Comedy, Horror', 'David Geddes, Eli Craig, Jason Furukawa', 'Eli Craig, Morgan Jurgenson', 'Tyler Labine, Alan Tudyk, Katrina Bowden, Jesse Moss, Philip Granger, Brandon Jay McLaren, Christie Laing, Chelan Simmons', 'R', 'Two hillbillies are suspected of being killers by a group of paranoid college kids camping near the duo''s West Virginian cabin. As the body count climbs, so does the fear and confusion as the college kids try to seek revenge against the pair.', 'Two hillbillies are suspected of being killers by a group of paranoid college kids camping near the duo''s West Virginian cabin. As the body count climbs, so does the fear and confusion as the college kids try to seek revenge against the pair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8shwLEDzajJGSfLgbpac8x8xn1U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46838'),
  ('377965153606041151', 'Tucker: The Man and His Dream', 1988, 'Drama', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Vittorio Storaro, Daniel R. Suhart', 'Arnold Schulman, David Seidler', 'Jeff Bridges, Joan Allen, Martin Landau, Frederic Forrest, Mako, Dean Stockwell, Christian Slater, Nina Siemaszko', 'PG', 'Ypsilanti, Michigan, 1945. Engineer Preston Tucker dreams of designing the car of future, but his innovative envision will be repeatedly sabotaged by his own unrealistic expectations and the Detroit automobile industry tycoons.', 'Ypsilanti, Michigan, 1945. Engineer Preston Tucker dreams of designing the car of future, but his innovative envision will be repeatedly sabotaged by his own unrealistic expectations and the Detroit automobile industry tycoons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uph7wz8WASLHwHyC5SYfQgqaoV7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28176'),
  ('318500079006766480', 'Tuesday', 2024, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Amir Nazempour, Daina Oniunas-Pusić, Giles Barron', 'Daina Oniunas-Pusić', 'Julia Louis-Dreyfus, Lola Petticrew, Arinzé Kene, Leah Harvey, Jay Simpson, Ellie James, Ewens Abid, Nathan Amzi', 'R', 'A mother and her teenage daughter must confront Death when it arrives in the form of an astonishing talking bird.', 'A mother and her teenage daughter must confront Death when it arrives in the form of an astonishing talking bird.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrd6blans3SqghHSxPAl7tqnaOf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:831395'),
  ('645737474628496003', 'Tuesday, After Christmas', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Radu Muntean', 'Răzvan Rădulescu, Radu Muntean, Alexandru Baciu', 'Mimi Brănescu, Maria Popistașu, Mirela Oprișor, Dragoș Bucur, Victor Rebengiuc, Ioana Blaj, Silvia Năstase, Sasa Paul-Szel', null, 'Paul Hanganu loves two women. Adriana his wife and the mother of their daughter, the woman with whom he''s shared the thrills of the past ten years, and Raluca the woman who has made him redefine himself. He has to leave one of them before Christmas.', 'Paul Hanganu loves two women. Adriana his wife and the mother of their daughter, the woman with whom he''s shared the thrills of the past ten years, and Raluca the woman who has made him redefine himself. He has to leave one of them before Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkNGrNqhbnkEiXktK00TAtaAFkW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55151'),
  ('968227524057977774', 'Tuesdays with Morrie', 1999, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Mick Jackson, Theo van de Sande', null, 'Jack Lemmon, Hank Azaria, Wendy Moniz, Caroline Aaron, Bonnie Bartlett, John Carroll Lynch, Cloud Michaels, Terri Hanauer', null, 'A journalist finds himself questioning his own life when his best friend, a dying man, offers him some very powerful wisdom and advice for coping in relationships, careers and society.', 'A journalist finds himself questioning his own life when his best friend, a dying man, offers him some very powerful wisdom and advice for coping in relationships, careers and society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agRmUjQBHVA1b0QmZDWyS5o2f4d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26133'),
  ('266006375067900114', 'Tuff Turf', 1985, 'Drama, Action, Romance', 'Fritz Kiersch, Willy Kurant, James R. Murray', 'Jette Rinck', 'James Spader, Kim Richards, Paul Mones, Matt Clark, Claudette Nevins, Olivia Barash, Robert Downey Jr., Panchito Gómez', 'R', 'The new guy in a Los Angeles high school, Morgan, does some singing and fights hotshot Nick over disco dancer Frankie.', 'The new guy in a Los Angeles high school, Morgan, does some singing and fights hotshot Nick over disco dancer Frankie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FueZsXEXNqFlmB2o2WuGQPdkv5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28410'),
  ('1017538480682021549', 'Tugboat Mickey', 1940, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Clyde Geronimi', null, 'Walt Disney, Clarence Nash, Danny Webb', 'NR', 'Mickey is performing routine maintenance on his tugboat (with interference from a pelican) when a call comes on the radio that there''s a sinking ship needing assistance. Sadly, Mickey''s crew consists of Donald and Goofy, so getting underway to help is not easy. Goofy has to fight a boiler''s door to get it stoked with coal (and when he succeeds, he overfills it) and Donald gets tangled up in the machinery. Not to mention that nobody casts off, so they drag half the dock along with them. The overworked boiler soon explodes.', 'Mickey is performing routine maintenance on his tugboat (with interference from a pelican) when a call comes on the radio that there''s a sinking ship needing assistance. Sadly, Mickey''s crew consists of Donald and Goofy, so getting underway to help is not easy. Goofy has to fight a boiler''s door to get it stoked with coal (and when he succeeds, he overfills it) and Donald gets tangled up in the machinery. Not to mention that nobody casts off, so they drag half the dock along with them. The overworked boiler soon explodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9kXL62BqoU6CbZc6LrgYDQ2KtL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67703'),
  ('520903577500612263', 'Tuklas', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Skye Gonzaga, Chino Villaluna, Denzel Cruza, Keesha Falcon, Alexa Armecin', null, 'The first Bisaya VMX Original stars true-blooded Bisaya Skye Gonzaga. When IT officer Chris Alvarado uncovers a financial scandal at work, he faces a moral dilemma: exposing the truth or giving in to Anna, a seductive sales manager promising success and intimacy.', 'The first Bisaya VMX Original stars true-blooded Bisaya Skye Gonzaga. When IT officer Chris Alvarado uncovers a financial scandal at work, he faces a moral dilemma: exposing the truth or giving in to Anna, a seductive sales manager promising success and intimacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJiNDWSEguOY8m5x2vbgnl9DPme.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1652947'),
  ('838680112786411044', 'Tulip Fever', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bill Crutcher, Carlos Fidel, Ben Quirk', 'Tom Stoppard, Deborah Moggach', 'Alicia Vikander, Dane DeHaan, Christoph Waltz, Judi Dench, Jack O''Connell, Holliday Grainger, Zach Galifianakis, Matthew Morrison', 'R', 'An artist falls for a married young woman while he''s commissioned to paint her portrait. The two invest in the risky tulip market in hopes to build a future together.', 'An artist falls for a married young woman while he''s commissioned to paint her portrait. The two invest in the risky tulip market in hopes to build a future together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGBRTDMuYDKCA9g7NTGwtMZBWd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257785'),
  ('1145552249521539592', 'Tulips', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Anna Kuznetsova, Yulia Lysova, Yuliya Uzkikh, Vladislav Ikonnikov, Yury Korobeynikov, Stepan Beshkurov, Ivan Solomatin, Daniil Tuzhenkov, Anton Mikhaylovsky, Ivan Rips', 'Elena Khanova, Irina Karpusheva, Evgeniya Bogomyakova, Dmitry Pinchukov, Maria Orlova', 'Elena Yakovleva, Aleksey Serebryakov, Yuliya Topolnitskaya', null, 'What is March 8th? It''s spring, the sun, tulips, mom''s smile and the anticipation of falling in love and happiness. There is also a fuss, congratulations, queues in shops, flowers and an endless race for gifts. Every year, on this day, there is a global collapse in which everything is dedicated to women. The most ordinary people who face extraordinary situations, and unplanned meetings radically change their lives.', 'What is March 8th? It''s spring, the sun, tulips, mom''s smile and the anticipation of falling in love and happiness. There is also a fuss, congratulations, queues in shops, flowers and an endless race for gifts. Every year, on this day, there is a global collapse in which everything is dedicated to women. The most ordinary people who face extraordinary situations, and unplanned meetings radically change their lives.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fc6Sf6k4mTfFFOzJVke1aeUf7kTM.jpg', 'plex:movie:tyulpany'),
  ('437412842918225140', 'Tulips in Spring', 2016, 'Drama, TV Movie, Romance', 'David Winning', null, 'Fiona Gubelmann, Lucas Bryant, Iris Quinn, Kevin McNulty, Kelly Rowan, Giles Panton, Aliyah O''Brien, David Santana', 'PG', 'At Payden Farms, Rose meets Tom Novak — a handsome “flower broker” who acts as a liaison between the farm and local distributors — and discovers that the farm is faltering financially and that her parents are considering selling it to a ruthless competitor. As a last-ditch effort, Tom arranges for Frank to enter his most special tulip in an upcoming flower contest with the hopes of achieving national recognition and generating business. But when Frank’s flowers are mysteriously sabotaged, Rose struggles to find a way to get them to bloom in time for the competition. Along the way, she finds herself appreciating her humble beginnings, reconciling with Frank, and falling into a blossoming romance with Tom. With time running out, Rose must rediscover her green thumb to save her family’s farm, and decide whether she’ll find true happiness — and true love — by staying in Los Angeles or returning to her folksy hometown.', 'At Payden Farms, Rose meets Tom Novak — a handsome “flower broker” who acts as a liaison between the farm and local distributors — and discovers that the farm is faltering financially and that her parents are considering selling it to a ruthless competitor. As a last-ditch effort, Tom arranges for Frank to enter his most special tulip in an upcoming flower contest with the hopes of achieving national recognition and generating business. But when Frank’s flowers are mysteriously sabotaged, Rose struggles to find a way to get them to bloom in time for the competition. Along the way, she finds herself appreciating her humble beginnings, reconciling with Frank, and falling into a blossoming romance with Tom. With time running out, Rose must rediscover her green thumb to save her family’s farm, and decide whether she’ll find true happiness — and true love — by staying in Los Angeles or returning to her folksy hometown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6pYwERCBcsxrnEgn2DQFghlXHm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393658'),
  ('906041472769580094', 'Tulips Shall Grow', 1942, 'Animation, War', 'George Pal', null, 'Victor Jory', null, 'In this Puppetoon animated short film (an Academy Award Best Short Subject, Cartoons nominee), a young Dutch couple find their idyllic countryside being overrun by unfeeling, unthinking mechanical men and machines that lay waste to everything in their path. In 1997 this film, deemed "culturally, historically, or aesthetically significant," was selected for preservation in the United States National Film Registry.', 'In this Puppetoon animated short film (an Academy Award Best Short Subject, Cartoons nominee), a young Dutch couple find their idyllic countryside being overrun by unfeeling, unthinking mechanical men and machines that lay waste to everything in their path. In 1997 this film, deemed "culturally, historically, or aesthetically significant," was selected for preservation in the United States National Film Registry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JvFXR1LHRGZqX5ZpDTcXx2CgLf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146928'),
  ('668669920373324004', 'Tully', 2002, 'Drama', 'Hilary Birmingham, John Foster, Chip Signore', 'Hilary Birmingham, Matt Drake', 'Anson Mount, Julianne Nicholson, Glenn Fitzgerald, Catherine Kellner, V. Craig Heidenreich, Natalie Canerday, John Diehl, Bob Burrus', 'R', 'Tully Jr. and Earl live on their father''s Nebraska ranch, proud and independent to a fault. While the shy, reclusive Earl spends his free time watching movies, the cockier Tully works his way through a succession of short-term affairs and an off-again, on-again relationship with April, a stripper in town. When their childhood friend Ella returns to town to start a veterinary practice, however, Tully falls for her — although the townsfolk have their doubts that he could ever commit to one woman.', 'Tully Jr. and Earl live on their father''s Nebraska ranch, proud and independent to a fault. While the shy, reclusive Earl spends his free time watching movies, the cockier Tully works his way through a succession of short-term affairs and an off-again, on-again relationship with April, a stripper in town. When their childhood friend Ella returns to town to start a veterinary practice, however, Tully falls for her — although the townsfolk have their doubts that he could ever commit to one woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vn91Vcugfmi0CBzSm32eMBiaS02.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20861'),
  ('47826658434535109', 'Tully', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jason Blumenfeld, Rhonda Taylor, Ian Seabrook', 'Diablo Cody', 'Charlize Theron, Mackenzie Davis, Ron Livingston, Mark Duplass, Asher Miles Fallica, Lia Frankland, Elaine Tan, Gameela Wright', 'R', 'Marlo, a mother of three, including a newborn, is gifted a night nanny by her brother. Hesitant at first, she quickly forms a bond with the thoughtful, surprising, and sometimes challenging nanny named Tully.', 'Marlo, a mother of three, including a newborn, is gifted a night nanny by her brother. Hesitant at first, she quickly forms a bond with the thoughtful, surprising, and sometimes challenging nanny named Tully.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDI4YXBXolMYi15Qx2kClvdSERM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400579'),
  ('182559751012371577', 'Tulpa - Demon of Desire', 2012, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Federico Zampaglione, Giuseppe Maio', 'Giacomo Gensini, Dardano Sacchetti, Federico Zampaglione', 'Claudia Gerini, Michele Placido, Nuot Arquint, Crisula Stafida, Michela Cescon, Ivan Franěk, Laurence Belgrave, Giulia Bertinelli', null, 'Lisa Boeri is at the top of her corporate career. At night she frequents the notorious Club Tulpa, owned by a mysterious Tibetan guru. Unshackled from repression and guilt, Lisa will do anything with any stranger to attain a higher consciousness. However, when her lovers start getting murdered in shocking ways, Lisa can’t go to the police because the scandal would impact her day job. Foolishly she tries to unmask the assassin herself, with truly nightmarish consequences.', 'Lisa Boeri is at the top of her corporate career. At night she frequents the notorious Club Tulpa, owned by a mysterious Tibetan guru. Unshackled from repression and guilt, Lisa will do anything with any stranger to attain a higher consciousness. However, when her lovers start getting murdered in shocking ways, Lisa can’t go to the police because the scandal would impact her day job. Foolishly she tries to unmask the assassin herself, with truly nightmarish consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9C2toUczEoSYhdWIRBPYxEY714W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128452'),
  ('835671049268933600', 'Tulpan', 2009, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Sergei Dvortsevoy, Józef Romasz, Alisher Khamidkhodzhaev', 'Sergei Dvortsevoy, Gennadiy Ostrovskiy', 'Askhat Kuchencherekov, Samal Yeslyamova, Tulepbergen Baisakalov, Bereke Turganbayev, Ondassyn Bessikbassov, Nurzhigit Zhapabayev, Mahabbat Turganbayeva, Amangeldi Nurzhanbayev', null, 'Asa, a young and cheerful dreamer, returns from his Russian naval service to his sister’s nomadic family on the desolate Hunger Steppe of central Asia, so that he can begin his own life as a shepherd. But before he can tend a flock of his own, Asa must first win the hand of the only eligible girl for miles—his mysterious neighbor, Tulpan.', 'Asa, a young and cheerful dreamer, returns from his Russian naval service to his sister’s nomadic family on the desolate Hunger Steppe of central Asia, so that he can begin his own life as a shepherd. But before he can tend a flock of his own, Asa must first win the hand of the only eligible girl for miles—his mysterious neighbor, Tulpan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6LMvGgoL5pEDJtUJuuFPt9SCDP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8939'),
  ('40363690240616581', 'Tulsa', 1949, 'Drama', 'Howard W. Koch, Winton C. Hoch, Stuart Heisler', 'Frank S. Nugent, Curtis Kenyon', 'Susan Hayward, Robert Preston, Pedro Armendáriz, Lloyd Gough, Chill Wills, Ed Begley, Jimmy Conlin, Roland Jack', null, 'It''s Tulsa, Oklahoma at the start of the oil boom and Cherokee Lansing''s rancher father is killed in a fight with the Tanner Oil Company. Cherokee plans revenge by bringing in her own wells with the help of oil expert Brad Brady and childhood friend Jim Redbird. When the oil and the money start gushing in, both Brad and Jim want to protect the land but Cherokee has different ideas. What started out as revenge for her father''s death has turned into an obsession for wealth and power.', 'It''s Tulsa, Oklahoma at the start of the oil boom and Cherokee Lansing''s rancher father is killed in a fight with the Tanner Oil Company. Cherokee plans revenge by bringing in her own wells with the help of oil expert Brad Brady and childhood friend Jim Redbird. When the oil and the money start gushing in, both Brad and Jim want to protect the land but Cherokee has different ideas. What started out as revenge for her father''s death has turned into an obsession for wealth and power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8sFzywAM75XyuydCgIabm9ZrcC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104083'),
  ('208987669147900450', 'Tulsa', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Scott Pryor, Gloria Stella', 'Ty DeMartino, Scott Pryor', 'Scott Pryor, Livi Birch, Nicole Marie Johnson, John Schneider, Cameron Arnett, Hannah Alline, Kristin Brock, Kylie Delre', 'PG-13', 'A desperate marine biker’s life is turned upside-down when he is united with the sassy 9-year-old daughter he never knew existed.', 'A desperate marine biker’s life is turned upside-down when he is united with the sassy 9-year-old daughter he never knew existed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCGcTlYllZZjNyxVUw0U6ndq2rs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717676'),
  ('891312279700595663', 'Tum Bin', 2001, 'Romance, Drama', 'Anubhav Sinha', 'Shashank Dabral', 'Priyanshu Chatterjee, Himanshu Malik, Sandali Sinha, Raqesh Bapat, Vikram Gokhale, Navneet Nishan, Rajesh Khera', null, 'Shekhar, a businessman, accidentally kills his associate Amar, and ridden with guilt, decides to watch over Amar''s company and take care of his family and friends. However, he falls in love with Amar''s fiancé Piya - who is to marry tycoon Abhi Gyan to save the company', 'Shekhar, a businessman, accidentally kills his associate Amar, and ridden with guilt, decides to watch over Amar''s company and take care of his family and friends. However, he falls in love with Amar''s fiancé Piya - who is to marry tycoon Abhi Gyan to save the company', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZTD1Vha7PyLTw9GlNKx36U7why.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64880'),
  ('675115588338293474', 'Tum Bin 2', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Peter Pedrero, Mukesh Chhabra, Anubhav Sinha', 'Anubhav Sinha', 'Neha Sharma, Aditya Seal, Aashim Gulati, Meher Vij, Kanwaljit Singh, Sonia Balani, Alishah Ahmad, Mouni Roy', null, 'The film centers around the life of Taran, who loses her fiance Amar in a skiing accident. Her life changes when she meets Shekhar, who has seen the best and worst of times. The story explores old friendship, newfound love and a difficult decision.', 'The film centers around the life of Taran, who loses her fiance Amar in a skiing accident. Her life changes when she meets Shekhar, who has seen the best and worst of times. The story explores old friendship, newfound love and a difficult decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApJyLoGxBffPwiWYe7qeLLUjObb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426785'),
  ('573045353373380361', 'Tum Mile', 2009, 'Drama', 'Kunal Deshmukh, Prakash Kutty, Yatharth Awasthi', 'Ankur Tewari', 'Emraan Hashmi, Soha Ali Khan, Mantra, Sachin Khedekar, Rituraj Singh, Atul Srivastava', null, 'Akshay and Sanjana, two estranged lovers, struggle to stay alive during the floods in Mumbai in 2005 and realise their true destiny during the calamity.', 'Akshay and Sanjana, two estranged lovers, struggle to stay alive during the floods in Mumbai in 2005 and realise their true destiny during the calamity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUp1hFwGpXy7pUYVLfgY1rgCH1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25100'),
  ('813603123008070169', 'Tumbbad', 2018, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Ankit Kothari, Sandeep Mohandas, Prakash Ganderi', 'Adesh Prasad, Anand Gandhi, Mitesh Shah', 'Sohum Shah, Mohammad Samad, Harsh K., Jyoti Malshe, Dhundiraj Prabhakar Jogalekar, Rudra Soni, Madhav Hari Joshi, Piyush Kaushik', null, 'India, 1918. On the outskirts of Tumbbad, a cursed village where it always rains, Vinayak, along with his mother and his brother, care of a mysterious old woman who keeps the secret of an ancestral treasure that Vinayak gets obsessed with.', 'India, 1918. On the outskirts of Tumbbad, a cursed village where it always rains, Vinayak, along with his mother and his brother, care of a mysterious old woman who keeps the secret of an ancestral treasure that Vinayak gets obsessed with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1xOCxw780WFJC5uCTMfCkQ4Agi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538858'),
  ('132541881960228043', 'Tumbledown', 1988, 'TV Movie, Drama, War', 'Andrew Dunn, Richard Eyre', 'Charles Wood', 'Colin Firth, Paul Rhys, David Calder, Barbara Leigh-Hunt, Rupert Baker, Jack Fortune, Sophie Thompson, Roddy Maude-Roxby', null, 'The film centers on the experiences of Robert Lawrence MC, an officer of the Scots Guards during the Falklands War of 1982. While fighting at the Battle of Mount Tumbledown, Lawrence is shot in the head by an Argentine sniper and left paralyzed on his left side. He then must learn to adjust to his new disability.', 'The film centers on the experiences of Robert Lawrence MC, an officer of the Scots Guards during the Falklands War of 1982. While fighting at the Battle of Mount Tumbledown, Lawrence is shot in the head by an Argentine sniper and left paralyzed on his left side. He then must learn to adjust to his new disability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42IVZEwWNJxR6O4dmkVklKsnzSG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121154'),
  ('829306587616285432', 'Tumbledown', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Sean Mewshaw, Seamus Tierney', 'Desiree Van Til', 'Rebecca Hall, Jason Sudeikis, Dianna Agron, Blythe Danner, Griffin Dunne, Joe Manganiello, Maggie Castle, Richard Masur', 'R', 'A young woman struggles to move on with her life after the death of her husband, an acclaimed folk singer, when a brash New York writer forces her to confront her loss and the ambiguous circumstances of his death.', 'A young woman struggles to move on with her life after the death of her husband, an acclaimed folk singer, when a brash New York writer forces her to confront her loss and the ambiguous circumstances of his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Dg1MqdqAaoia58KaXSNETn3Qya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207936'),
  ('561249183447934392', 'Tumbleweed', 1953, 'Western', 'Russell Metty, Nathan Juran, Joseph Gershenson', 'John Meredyth Lucas', 'Audie Murphy, Lori Nelson, Chill Wills, Roy Roberts, Russell Johnson, K.T. Stevens, Madge Meredith, Lee Van Cleef', 'NR', 'Jim Harvey is hired to guard a small wagon train as it makes its way west. The train is attacked by Indians and Harvey, hoping to persuade Aguila, the chief, to call off the attack due to Harvey''s having saved his son''s life, leaves the train to negotiate. He is captured and the rest of the train is wiped out except for two sisters. Escaping and showing up in town later, Harvey is nearly hanged as a deserter, but gets away. Eventually caught by the sheriff and his posse, they are attacked by Indians. This time the Indians are defeated and Aguila, captured and dying, reveals the identity of the white man who engineered the initial attack on the wagon train, just as the perpetrator rides up behind them.', 'Jim Harvey is hired to guard a small wagon train as it makes its way west. The train is attacked by Indians and Harvey, hoping to persuade Aguila, the chief, to call off the attack due to Harvey''s having saved his son''s life, leaves the train to negotiate. He is captured and the rest of the train is wiped out except for two sisters. Escaping and showing up in town later, Harvey is nearly hanged as a deserter, but gets away. Eventually caught by the sheriff and his posse, they are attacked by Indians. This time the Indians are defeated and Aguila, captured and dying, reveals the identity of the white man who engineered the initial attack on the wagon train, just as the perpetrator rides up behind them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqBBweURdZXRMQrYIMYjW7tJM3v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249134'),
  ('317411118760849529', 'Tumbleweeds', 1925, 'Western, Drama, Romance, Crime', 'King Baggot, William S. Hart', null, 'William S. Hart, Barbara Bedford, Lucien Littlefield, J. Gordon Russell, Richard Neill, Jack Murphy, James Gordon, George F. Marion', 'NR', 'William S. Hart stars in this 1925 silent film as a cowboy intent on claiming land during the 1889 land rush in the Oklahoma Territory. Though hardened from years of taming the new frontier, he falls in love with a beautiful woman. Before he settles down, however, he must contend with men who wish to bring him harm. In the prologue of the 1939 Astor Pictures revival of this film, Hart gives a moving eight-minute introduction-- the first and only time he appeared in a film accompanied by his striking voice.', 'William S. Hart stars in this 1925 silent film as a cowboy intent on claiming land during the 1889 land rush in the Oklahoma Territory. Though hardened from years of taming the new frontier, he falls in love with a beautiful woman. Before he settles down, however, he must contend with men who wish to bring him harm. In the prologue of the 1939 Astor Pictures revival of this film, Hart gives a moving eight-minute introduction-- the first and only time he appeared in a film accompanied by his striking voice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXq1OQALcCToqdf7O9c1DBA0qc3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95764'),
  ('514224325847687974', 'Tumbleweeds', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gavin O''Connor, Dan Stoloff, Nicole Morales', 'Gavin O''Connor, Angela Shelton', 'Janet McTeer, Kimberly J. Brown, Jay O. Sanders, Gavin O''Connor, Laurel Holloman, Lois Smith, Michael J. Pollard, Linda Porter', 'PG-13', 'Whenever trouble strikes in one of her relationships, single mother Mary Jo Walker and her daughter, Ava, pack up and move to another city, a routine Ava is tiring of. This time, they are helped on their move to San Diego by trucker Jack Ranson. While Ava settles in, getting a leading part in the school play, Jack starts dating Mary Jo but soon reveals himself to be controlling and aggressive. Mary Jo prepares to flee again, angering Ava.', 'Whenever trouble strikes in one of her relationships, single mother Mary Jo Walker and her daughter, Ava, pack up and move to another city, a routine Ava is tiring of. This time, they are helped on their move to San Diego by trucker Jack Ranson. While Ava settles in, getting a leading part in the school play, Jack starts dating Mary Jo but soon reveals himself to be controlling and aggressive. Mary Jo prepares to flee again, angering Ava.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2SdW45O7bPDTe0zLzNHhEcacNAk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55123'),
  ('507939566460011514', 'Tumhari Sulu', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Suresh Triveni, Saurabh Goswami, Karan Mally', 'Suresh Triveni', 'Vidya Balan, Manav Kaul, Vijay Maurya, Neha Dhupia, Abhishek Sharma, Ayushmann Khurrana, Vibhavari Deshpande, Malishka Mendonsa', null, 'A happy-go-lucky Mumbai suburban housewife Sulochana, fondly known as Sulu, lands the role of a night RJ, resulting in drastic changes to her routine life.', 'A happy-go-lucky Mumbai suburban housewife Sulochana, fondly known as Sulu, lands the role of a night RJ, resulting in drastic changes to her routine life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzj55F023h1jR2xmUjsZUqegZm6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460844'),
  ('1060795025913668379', 'Tumko Na Bhool Paayenge', 2002, 'Action, Drama, Mystery', 'Pankaj Parashar, Baldev Walia, Thomas A. Xavier', 'Rumi Jaffery, Pankaj Parashar', 'Salman Khan, Sushmita Sen, Dia Mirza, Sharat Saxena, Inder Kumar, Nishigandha Wad, Mukesh Rishi, Rajpal Yadav', null, 'Veer, a villager, becomes restless after he is haunted by the visions of his past. When he is attacked on the day of his wedding, he forces his parents to reveal the truth about his identity.', 'Veer, a villager, becomes restless after he is haunted by the visions of his past. When he is attacked on the day of his wedding, he forces his parents to reveal the truth about his identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6iPNnVGMDHbNqFdNfZhcoaDOhg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55212'),
  ('555482104372820095', 'Tummy Trouble', 1989, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Rob Minkoff, Hiro Narita, Frank Marshall', null, 'Charles Fleischer, April Winchell, Lou Hirsch, Corey Burton, Kathleen Turner, Sol Pavlovsky, William Bronder, Charles Noland', 'G', 'Roger Rabbit once again is chosen for the dangerous task of babysitting Baby Herman and everything is going to be just fine.', 'Roger Rabbit once again is chosen for the dangerous task of babysitting Baby Herman and everything is going to be just fine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLOqZNasNOUKSNCpAIeHmJWPkvW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83200'),
  ('191761038664555726', 'Tumse Na Ho Payega', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Abhishek Sinha, Navagat Prakash, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Nitesh Tiwari, Nikhil Mehrotra', 'Ishwak Singh, Mahima Makwana, Gaurav Pandey, Amala Akkineni, Gurpreet Saini, Karan Jotwani, Meghna Malik, Parmeet Sethi', null, 'When the world starts regarding Gaurav as a loser, he sets off on a journey to prove everyone (and their mothers) wrong.', 'When the world starts regarding Gaurav as a loser, he sets off on a journey to prove everyone (and their mothers) wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziz7A8NgRExxeCxmTYGE6VGuMKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1177634'),
  ('904251554388576054', 'Tune in Tomorrow...', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jon Amiel, Gregory Jacobs, Robert M. Stevens', 'Mario Vargas Llosa, William Boyd', 'Barbara Hershey, Keanu Reeves, Peter Falk, Bill McCutcheon, Patricia Clarkson, Richard Portnow, Jerome Dempsey, Richard B. Shull', 'PG-13', 'Martin works at the local radio station, which just hired a new scriptwriter with a reputation for great drama, Pedro Carmichael. Martin’s aunt Julia, not related by blood, returns home after many years away and Martin falls for her. Once Pedro finds out about this romance, he starts incorporating details of it into the script of his daily drama series. Soon, Martin and Julia are not only hearing about their fictional selves over the radio, but about what they are going to do next.', 'Martin works at the local radio station, which just hired a new scriptwriter with a reputation for great drama, Pedro Carmichael. Martin’s aunt Julia, not related by blood, returns home after many years away and Martin falls for her. Once Pedro finds out about this romance, he starts incorporating details of it into the script of his daily drama series. Soon, Martin and Julia are not only hearing about their fictional selves over the radio, but about what they are going to do next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMabi4aTi9mYs29tFS5Bh2DSEPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41927'),
  ('481932110203220311', 'Túnel de los huesos', 2011, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Nacho Garassino', 'Ricardo Ragendorfer, Daniel Martucci, Nacho Garassino', 'Raúl Taibo, Daniel Valenzuela, Luciano Cazaux, Jorge Sesán, Paco Redondo, Germán de Silva', 'PG-13', 'Based on a real event, this is the spectacular escape of seven prisoners in 1991 from the Villa Devoto prison in Buenos Aires, Argentina. In the process of digging a tunnel to escape, they make a bizarre and frightening discovery just as they are about to break through to freedom. One escapee promises to report their findings when they are all free and once out, he pays his debt to "the tunnel of bones,"sharing their macabre story with a local journalist, and ultimately the world.', 'Based on a real event, this is the spectacular escape of seven prisoners in 1991 from the Villa Devoto prison in Buenos Aires, Argentina. In the process of digging a tunnel to escape, they make a bizarre and frightening discovery just as they are about to break through to freedom. One escapee promises to report their findings when they are all free and once out, he pays his debt to "the tunnel of bones,"sharing their macabre story with a local journalist, and ultimately the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkpzBNeei8a7Ja65HBulnxJDHox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135004'),
  ('1146651759516071696', 'Tunes of Glory', 1960, 'Drama', 'Ronald Neame, Arthur Ibbetson, Michael Stevenson', 'James Kennaway', 'Alec Guinness, John Mills, Dennis Price, Kay Walsh, Susannah York, John Fraser, Gordon Jackson, Duncan Macrae', 'NR', 'Following World War II in peacetime Scotland, brigade headquarters replaces commanding officer Major Jock Sinclair, a boisterous battalion leader, with the strict, temperamental Lieutenant Colonel Basil Barrow. Resentful toward his replacement, Sinclair undermines Barrow''s authority and damages his successor''s reputation among the soldiers. Barrow faces an uphill battle in regaining the discipline and respect of his battalion.', 'Following World War II in peacetime Scotland, brigade headquarters replaces commanding officer Major Jock Sinclair, a boisterous battalion leader, with the strict, temperamental Lieutenant Colonel Basil Barrow. Resentful toward his replacement, Sinclair undermines Barrow''s authority and damages his successor''s reputation among the soldiers. Barrow faces an uphill battle in regaining the discipline and respect of his battalion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Yf5ZggEMxybXGBRVdqzdHLpZ9h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43048'),
  ('174434359460297283', 'Tungstênio', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Heitor Dhalia, Adolpho Veloso', 'Marcello Quintanilha', 'Fabrício Boliveira, Samira Carvalho, José Dumont, Wesley Guimarães, Milhem Cortaz, Pedro Wagner, Sérgio Laurentino, Heraldo de Deus', null, 'A retired army sergeant, a police officer and his wife and a drug dealer apparently have nothing in common, but they will unite for a greater good. When people start using explosives to fish on the edge of Salvador, Bahia, this group will do everything to end this environmental crime. But in the search for the paths that seem most correct, each one of them will go through more personal and moral conflicts.', 'A retired army sergeant, a police officer and his wife and a drug dealer apparently have nothing in common, but they will unite for a greater good. When people start using explosives to fish on the edge of Salvador, Bahia, this group will do everything to end this environmental crime. But in the search for the paths that seem most correct, each one of them will go through more personal and moral conflicts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4SRWlvp9gVAlwsgj2FXxNxCVfo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507084'),
  ('1011616910010692936', 'Tunisian Victory', 1944, 'Documentary, War', 'Frank Capra, John Huston, Hugh Stewart', null, 'Leo Genn, Burgess Meredith, Bernard Miles, Jacques Duchesne, George S. Patton', null, 'Documentary made by the U.S. Army Signal Corps after the North African campaign.', 'Documentary made by the U.S. Army Signal Corps after the North African campaign.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTct5XUAITQHYmoADEl4bH2BcXu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257084'),
  ('26736841133839123', 'Tunnel', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Kim Seong-hun, Kim Tae-sung, Kim Gyeong-seok', 'Kim Seong-hun', 'Ha Jung-woo, Bae Doona, Oh Dal-su, Shin Jung-keun, Nam Ji-hyun, Jeong Seok-yong, Lee Han-seo, Kim Hae-sook', 'PG-13', 'A man is on his way home when the poorly constructed tunnel he is driving through collapses, leaving him trapped leaving himself for the unexpected whilst emergency services struggle to help.', 'A man is on his way home when the poorly constructed tunnel he is driving through collapses, leaving him trapped leaving himself for the unexpected whilst emergency services struggle to help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLTYM8HeUo4YhgAlU888XEU8LMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390497'),
  ('939219695675437375', 'Tunnel Rats', 2008, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Uwe Boll, Bryan C. Knight, Mathias Neumann', 'Uwe Boll', 'Michael Paré, Wilson Bethel, Brandon Fobbs, Rocky Marquette, Nate Parker, Mitch Eakins, Erik Eidem, Jane Le', 'R', 'During the Vietnam War [1959-1975] a special US combat unit is sent out to hunt and kill the Viet Cong soldiers in a man-to-man combat in the endless tunnels underneath the jungle of Vietnam. Suicide squads of a special kind.', 'During the Vietnam War [1959-1975] a special US combat unit is sent out to hunt and kill the Viet Cong soldiers in a man-to-man combat in the endless tunnels underneath the jungle of Vietnam. Suicide squads of a special kind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cm3a0SeO6DvoMbSlsZZSfINohbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20181'),
  ('572319625792182968', 'Tunnel Vision', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Neal Israel, Bradley R. Swirnoff, Don Knight', 'Michael Mislove, Neal Israel', 'Phil Proctor, Howard Hesseman, Dan Barrows, Stephen Feinberg, Chevy Chase, John Candy, Tom Davis, Ron Silver', 'R', 'A committee investigating TV''s first uncensored network examines a typical day''s programming, which includes shows, commercials, news programs, you name it. What they discover will surely crack you up! This outrageous and irreverent spoof of television launched the careers of some of the greatest comedians of all time.', 'A committee investigating TV''s first uncensored network examines a typical day''s programming, which includes shows, commercials, news programs, you name it. What they discover will surely crack you up! This outrageous and irreverent spoof of television launched the careers of some of the greatest comedians of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hD83vq9BuQ0dmsLnLpUmOClNlPE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114255'),
  ('56550286207814310', 'Tunnel Vision', 1995, 'Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Clive Fleury, Paul Murphy', 'Clive Fleury', 'Patsy Kensit, Robert Reynolds, Rebecca Rigg, Shane Briant, David E. Woodley, Liz Burch, Anthony Phelan, Dean Nottle', null, 'A pair of cops investigate a series of art-gallery related murders.', 'A pair of cops investigate a series of art-gallery related murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVcmhdGiYGbBFC4lmVBcmLr0uWh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291690'),
  ('205247983347882422', 'Tunnel Warfare', 1965, 'War', 'Yang Guangyuan, Ren Xudong', 'Ren Xudong, Yunshan Pan', 'Guodong Han, Liu Jiang, Xiujie Liu, Wang Bingyu, Wang Xiaozhong, Xie Wanhe, Zhang Yongshou, 朱龙广', null, 'A small town defends itself from the Japanese by use of a network of tunnels during the Second Sino-Japanese War.', 'A small town defends itself from the Japanese by use of a network of tunnels during the Second Sino-Japanese War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wGLiQn213fMlmN4RBEFBbYOwnL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257562'),
  ('309492795867989208', 'Tunneling the English Channel', 1907, 'Adventure', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Fernande Albany, Georges Méliès, Jehanne d''Alcy', null, 'The plot follows King Edward VII and President Armand Fallières dreaming of building a tunnel under the English Channel.', 'The plot follows King Edward VII and President Armand Fallières dreaming of building a tunnel under the English Channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myabFkyPcS6E1GexlTIGWlqy07M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114145'),
  ('118547697367596658', 'Tup akka lakko', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Spede Pasanen, Martti Kakko', 'Spede Pasanen', 'Spede Pasanen, Vesa-Matti Loiri, Simo Salminen, Heikki Kinnunen, Olavi Ahonen, Helge Herala, Tenho Saurén, Johanna Raunio', null, '''Tup-Akka-Lakko'' is a sequel to ''Koeputkiaikuinen ja Simon enkelit'' in which doctor Jyrä invented a test-tube-adult who looked exactly like Mutikainen, a mathematician. When the test-tube-adult''s body emerged, his voice moved into Mutikainen''s body because of the doctor''s error. Problems ensue.', '''Tup-Akka-Lakko'' is a sequel to ''Koeputkiaikuinen ja Simon enkelit'' in which doctor Jyrä invented a test-tube-adult who looked exactly like Mutikainen, a mathematician. When the test-tube-adult''s body emerged, his voice moved into Mutikainen''s body because of the doctor''s error. Problems ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o08rwVjpe8dMoea7jCNNQ1XMt7E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145912'),
