  ('1016292796587020578', 'Tupac: Resurrection', 2003, 'Music, Documentary', 'Lauren Lazin', null, 'Tupac Shakur, Afeni Shakur, Snoop Dogg, Dr. Dre, 50 Cent, Eminem, Suge Knight, Jada Pinkett Smith', 'R', 'Home movies, photographs, and recited poetry illustrate the life of Tupac Shakur, one of the most beloved, revolutionary, and volatile hip-hop MCs of all time.', 'Home movies, photographs, and recited poetry illustrate the life of Tupac Shakur, one of the most beloved, revolutionary, and volatile hip-hop MCs of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGJxjq8npqFZtuAtGsyjntip7uh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21525'),
  ('19476118471066', 'Tupla-Uuno', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Hannu Seikkula, Juha Jalasti', 'Spede Pasanen', 'Vesa-Matti Loiri, Marjatta Raita, Tapio Hämäläinen, Marita Nordberg, Simo Salminen, Spede Pasanen, Elli Castrén, Caron Barnes', null, 'Uuno Turhapuro finds his doppelganger, Hugo, who happens to be a computer genius. Hugo helps Uuno save his father-in-law''s business (and Uuno''s inheritance) while Uuno helps Hugo win the heart of the love of his life.', 'Uuno Turhapuro finds his doppelganger, Hugo, who happens to be a computer genius. Hugo helps Uuno save his father-in-law''s business (and Uuno''s inheritance) while Uuno helps Hugo win the heart of the love of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BJ5UZmLj30vRkcLQTWDNwMxrNu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62900'),
  ('935321665506563787', 'Turbo', 2013, 'Animation, Family', 'David Soren, Chris Stover, Serge Sretschinsky', 'Robert D. Siegel, Darren Lemke, David Soren', 'Ryan Reynolds, Paul Giamatti, Michael Peña, Samuel L. Jackson, Luis Guzmán, Bill Hader, Snoop Dogg, Maya Rudolph', 'PG', 'The tale of an ordinary garden snail who dreams of winning the Indy 500.', 'The tale of an ordinary garden snail who dreams of winning the Indy 500.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6GdF5hcnsU5IwaRhyhnysNy5hO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77950'),
  ('810326008968866154', 'Turbo Kid', 2015, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Yoann-Karl Whissell, François Simard, Anouk Whissell', 'François Simard, Anouk Whissell, Yoann-Karl Whissell', 'Munro Chambers, Laurence Leboeuf, Michael Ironside, Aaron Jeffery, Edwin Wright, Romano Orzari, Steeve Léonard, Orphée Ladouceur-Nguyen', 'NR', 'In a post-apocalyptic wasteland, an orphaned teen must battle a ruthless warlord to save the girl of his dreams.', 'In a post-apocalyptic wasteland, an orphaned teen must battle a ruthless warlord to save the girl of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArUqADkwycYtNVuXSoSXVrdJ8iJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:310135'),
  ('861725632137661652', 'Turbo: A Power Rangers Movie', 1997, 'Action, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Shuki Levy, David Winning, Ilan Rosenberg', 'Shuki Levy, Shell Danielson', 'Johnny Yong Bosch, Nakia Burrise, Jason David Frank, Catherine Sutherland, Blake Foster, Amy Jo Johnson, Steve Cardenas, Austin St. John', 'PG', 'The legendary Power Rangers must stop the evil space pirate Divatox from releasing the powerful Maligore from his volcanic imprisonment on the island of Muranthias, where only the kindly wizard Lerigot has the key to release him. The hope of victory lies in the Ranger''s incredible new Turbo powers and powerful Turbo Zords.', 'The legendary Power Rangers must stop the evil space pirate Divatox from releasing the powerful Maligore from his volcanic imprisonment on the island of Muranthias, where only the kindly wizard Lerigot has the key to release him. The hope of victory lies in the Ranger''s incredible new Turbo powers and powerful Turbo Zords.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mau5EXQoKUTiS5wx3Wocwrh5hG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6499'),
  ('961645760930105296', 'Turbulence', 1997, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Robert Butler, Phil Robinson, Lloyd Ahern II', 'Jonathan Brett', 'Ray Liotta, Lauren Holly, Brendan Gleeson, Héctor Elizondo, Rachel Ticotin, Ben Cross, Catherine Hicks, Jeffrey DeMunn', 'R', 'On a flight transporting dangerous convicts, murderer Ryan Weaver manages to break free and cause complete chaos throughout the plane. As various people on board fall victim to Weaver, it is ultimately down to flight attendant Teri Halloran to keep the aircraft from crashing, with on-ground support from an air traffic controller. While Halloran struggles to pilot the plane, Weaver continues to terrorize the surviving members of the crew.', 'On a flight transporting dangerous convicts, murderer Ryan Weaver manages to break free and cause complete chaos throughout the plane. As various people on board fall victim to Weaver, it is ultimately down to flight attendant Teri Halloran to keep the aircraft from crashing, with on-ground support from an air traffic controller. While Halloran struggles to pilot the plane, Weaver continues to terrorize the surviving members of the crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnsxWkxWHPXMOAzXvS7aKMSKP0N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34314'),
  ('491782203420752574', 'Turbulence', 2025, 'Thriller, Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Claudio Fäh, Jaime Reynoso', 'Andy Mayson', 'Jeremy Irvine, Olga Kurylenko, Kelsey Grammer, Hera Hilmar, Lionel Robert Blanc, Stuart Whelan, Elena Bushueva, Kevin Jarvis', 'R', 'Young married couple Zach and Emmy decide to take a hot air balloon trip across the Italian Dolomites to rekindle their relationship. When they and pilot Harry are joined by a third passenger, Julia, events unfold in ways they could never imagine five thousand meters in the air.', 'Young married couple Zach and Emmy decide to take a hot air balloon trip across the Italian Dolomites to rekindle their relationship. When they and pilot Harry are joined by a third passenger, Julia, events unfold in ways they could never imagine five thousand meters in the air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRuiKL4S9UpLma2ZlM47xIu2gbe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1401778'),
  ('993029588970553641', 'Turbulence 2: Fear of Flying', 1999, 'Thriller, Action', 'Jan Glaser, Sid Kozak, Gordon Verheul', 'Rob Kerchner, Brendan Broderick, Kevin Bernhardt', 'Craig Sheffer, Jennifer Beals, Tom Berenger, Jeffrey Nordling, Jay Brazeau, Daryl Shuttleworth, Paul Jarrett, Andrew Kavadas', null, 'A passenger of a hijacked airliner who happens to be an airplane engineer works to deactivate a chemical weapons bomb after the hijackers kill the pilot and threaten to kill all the passengers on the plane.', 'A passenger of a hijacked airliner who happens to be an airplane engineer works to deactivate a chemical weapons bomb after the hijackers kill the pilot and threaten to kill all the passengers on the plane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkAdGWjKLWikItwVknA927fN00w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76171'),
  ('50624111564923815', 'Turbulence 3: Heavy Metal', 2001, 'Action, Thriller', 'Philip Linzey, Jorge Montesi, Kevin Parks', 'Wade Ferley', 'Craig Sheffer, Gabrielle Anwar, John Mann, Monika Schnarre, Mike Dopud, Hrothgar Mathews, Alex Zahara, Michelle Harrison', 'R', 'Rock superstar Slade Craven has decided to hang up his rock & roll shoes and has planned something very special for his final show -- instead of a typical concert in some sports arena, he''ll play a set aboard a 747 jumbo jet, flying from Los Angeles to Toronto, with the gig broadcast live to millions of fans over the Internet. But what Craven didn''t count on is the presence of a deranged fan with a gun who attempts to hijack the plane, throwing the show into chaos and putting the lives of everyone aboard the jet at risk.', 'Rock superstar Slade Craven has decided to hang up his rock & roll shoes and has planned something very special for his final show -- instead of a typical concert in some sports arena, he''ll play a set aboard a 747 jumbo jet, flying from Los Angeles to Toronto, with the gig broadcast live to millions of fans over the Internet. But what Craven didn''t count on is the presence of a deranged fan with a gun who attempts to hijack the plane, throwing the show into chaos and putting the lives of everyone aboard the jet at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/neMmxUQtnHdfYN9yqzt4lTKYLCm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110670'),
  ('726277115622668696', 'Turbulent Skies', 2010, 'Action, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Fred Olen Ray, Theo Angell, Bryan Boardley', 'Fred Olen Ray, Peter Sullivan', 'Casper Van Dien, Nicole Eggert, Patrick Muldoon, Ted Monte, Mark Enticknap, Gerald Webb, Cal Bartlett, Siri Baruc', 'PG', 'When a new airplane that''s equipped with a new computer that can fly the plane on its own, is about to have its first flight. But the son of the owner decides to upload more software, he doesn''t bother to check if there are any viruses with it. And he also invites some potential investors to try it. So the plane appears to be working well but suddenly it veers off course and it can''t be shut down. When the military learns of this and fears what if something happens if it''s over a populated area; decides to shoot it down along with everyone on board. The man who built the computer whose wife is among the passengers thinks if he can get on board he might be able to shut it down and regain control of the plane. So the military using a new plane gets him on board. But what he didn''t know is that both pilots are incapacitated so there''s no one who can fly the plane.', 'When a new airplane that''s equipped with a new computer that can fly the plane on its own, is about to have its first flight. But the son of the owner decides to upload more software, he doesn''t bother to check if there are any viruses with it. And he also invites some potential investors to try it. So the plane appears to be working well but suddenly it veers off course and it can''t be shut down. When the military learns of this and fears what if something happens if it''s over a populated area; decides to shoot it down along with everyone on board. The man who built the computer whose wife is among the passengers thinks if he can get on board he might be able to shut it down and regain control of the plane. So the military using a new plane gets him on board. But what he didn''t know is that both pilots are incapacitated so there''s no one who can fly the plane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5Q6MTFIg58oCjPIE20kDbi4uyQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70110'),
  ('124822057427098362', 'Turf', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Fabien Onteniente, Jérôme Robert', 'Fabien Onteniente, Philippe Guillard, Emanuel Booz', 'Alain Chabat, Édouard Baer, Philippe Duquesne, Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Vahina Giocante, Sergi López, Gérard Depardieu, Héléna Noguerra', null, 'This is the story of four French friends: the Greek (an osteopath), Fifi (who lives with his mother), Fortuné (a West Indian) and Freddy (a gambler). They meet up regularly at a Parisian bookmakers’, their favourite haunt. Tired of frittering away the little spare cash they have, they agree to give up gambling. But no sooner have they taken this pledge than Fate intervenes, in the guise of the turf king, Monsieur Paul. The latter persuades the four friends to buy a champion racehorse, not knowing that it is in fact an old nag…', 'This is the story of four French friends: the Greek (an osteopath), Fifi (who lives with his mother), Fortuné (a West Indian) and Freddy (a gambler). They meet up regularly at a Parisian bookmakers’, their favourite haunt. Tired of frittering away the little spare cash they have, they agree to give up gambling. But no sooner have they taken this pledge than Fate intervenes, in the guise of the turf king, Monsieur Paul. The latter persuades the four friends to buy a champion racehorse, not knowing that it is in fact an old nag…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Tk5DANe3SoL0hH5ngHvMf1rOD0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167364'),
  ('667828939866770372', 'Turist Ömer', 1964, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Hulki Saner, Kriton İlyadis', 'Hulki Saner, Erdoğan Tünaş', 'Sadri Alışık, Vahi Öz, Mualla Sürer, Çolpan İlhan, Yaşar Şener, Eşref Vural, Mehmet Ali Akpınar, Zeki Tüney', null, 'Tourist Ömer is a poor man who lives a carefree life without worries. He has never held down a steady job and always got fired. His closest friend is Ruknettin. Tourist Ömer eventually takes a job distributing advertising funds for a bank. When he goes to the bank to collect the advertising funds, he accidentally takes a suitcase full of real money stolen from a robbed bank.', 'Tourist Ömer is a poor man who lives a carefree life without worries. He has never held down a steady job and always got fired. His closest friend is Ruknettin. Tourist Ömer eventually takes a job distributing advertising funds for a bank. When he goes to the bank to collect the advertising funds, he accidentally takes a suitcase full of real money stolen from a robbed bank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCHSFfdiinjlYvAvVvsMMFIUuX4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319367'),
  ('236441394522412665', 'Turist Ömer Boğa Güreşçisi', 1971, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Hulki Saner', 'Oksal Pekmezoğlu', 'Sadri Alışık, Erol Büyükburç, Fatma Belgen, Feri Cansel, Mualla Sürer, Dursun Ceylan, Kudret Karadağ, Muzaffer Cıvan', null, 'Ömer goes on a trip to Spain as a reward for finding the wallet that belongs to singer Rodriguez; when he accidentally gets involved in a robbery, he disguises himself as a bullfighter.', 'Ömer goes on a trip to Spain as a reward for finding the wallet that belongs to singer Rodriguez; when he accidentally gets involved in a robbery, he disguises himself as a bullfighter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOwbZvzpJ8uJAggciAHe9eKOyyq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452586'),
  ('650904192184992792', 'Turistas', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John Stockwell, Enrique Chediak', 'Michael Arlen Ross', 'Josh Duhamel, Melissa George, Olivia Wilde, Desmond Askew, Beau Garrett, Max Brown, Agles Steib, Miguel Lunardi', 'R', 'A group of young backpackers'' vacation turns sour when a bus accident leaves them marooned in a remote Brazilian rural area that holds an ominous secret.', 'A group of young backpackers'' vacation turns sour when a bus accident leaves them marooned in a remote Brazilian rural area that holds an ominous secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvQqTMPVL8NDeHKEkzAL0ADIECS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9796'),
  ('47990762993417757', 'Turk 182!', 1985, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Bob Clark, Reginald H. Morris', 'James Gregory Kingston, Denis Hamill, John Hamill', 'Timothy Hutton, Robert Urich, Kim Cattrall, Robert Culp, Darren McGavin, Steven Keats, Paul Sorvino, Peter Boyle', 'PG-13', 'After New York City firefighter Terry Lynch is unable to receive any compensation for an injury incurred during the off-duty rescue of a young girl, he grows suicidal. Furious, his brother Jimmy attempts to have Mayor Tyler intervene, but the corrupt politician instead denounces Terry as a drunk. Determined to get justice, Jimmy begins a graffiti campaign of embarrassing slogans mocking the mayor, which soon captivates the city.', 'After New York City firefighter Terry Lynch is unable to receive any compensation for an injury incurred during the off-duty rescue of a young girl, he grows suicidal. Furious, his brother Jimmy attempts to have Mayor Tyler intervene, but the corrupt politician instead denounces Terry as a drunk. Determined to get justice, Jimmy begins a graffiti campaign of embarrassing slogans mocking the mayor, which soon captivates the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HlpFZ60MBnEChXYM4Jc4HmpNPb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27969'),
  ('1033295980031651348', 'Turk''s Head', 2010, 'Drama', 'Pascal Elbé, Jean-François Hensgens', 'Pascal Elbé', 'Roschdy Zem, Pascal Elbé, Ronit Elkabetz, Samir Makhlouf, Simon Abkarian, Florence Thomassin, Valérie Benguigui, Monique Chaumette', null, 'A 14 year old boy, an ER doctor, a cop looking for revenge, a mother fighting for her children and a man distraught by the death of his wife see their destinies come together. As the doctor spends several days in a coma, events keep on happening and all will be swept by the shock wave.', 'A 14 year old boy, an ER doctor, a cop looking for revenge, a mother fighting for her children and a man distraught by the death of his wife see their destinies come together. As the doctor spends several days in a coma, events keep on happening and all will be swept by the shock wave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ol9Yn4JbMsYkDFyeYudxAwrWbZM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37655'),
  ('883406238779046518', 'Turkey Shoot', 1982, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Brian Trenchard-Smith, John R. McLean', 'Neill D. Hicks, Jon George', 'Steve Railsback, Olivia Hussey, Michael Craig, Carmen Duncan, Noel Ferrier, Lynda Stoner, Roger Ward, Michael Petrovitch', 'R', 'In the near future, after an unspecified holocaust, survivors are herded into prison camps. There, they are hunted for sport by the leaders of the camp. Paul, one of the newest prisoners, is determined not to go down as quietly as the others.', 'In the near future, after an unspecified holocaust, survivors are herded into prison camps. There, they are hunted for sport by the leaders of the camp. Paul, one of the newest prisoners, is determined not to go down as quietly as the others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/837jSfdQYvhqToMPfAGdci6zszG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39899'),
  ('798166581985239078', 'Turkish Dance School', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Burak Aksak', 'Burak Aksak', 'Binnur Kaya, Demet Özdemir, Uraz Kaygılaroğlu, Okan Çabalar, Nergis Öztürk, Bora Cengiz, Berat Yenilmez, Meltem Gülenç', null, 'A woman recovering from an attempted suicide meets an aspiring doctor who takes a keen interest in her efforts to move forward in life through dance.', 'A woman recovering from an attempted suicide meets an aspiring doctor who takes a keen interest in her efforts to move forward in life through dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3iaaE6SUX7yWoXOSCFWR2zBanl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477297'),
  ('20967964835372174', 'Turkish Delight', 1973, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paul Verhoeven, Jan de Bont, Nouchka van Brakel', 'Gerard Soeteman', 'Monique van de Ven, Rutger Hauer, Tonny Huurdeman, Wim van den Brink, Hans Boskamp, Dolf de Vries, Manfred de Graaf, Dick Scheffer', 'R', 'Gifted but hot-headed sculptor Eric has a stormy, erotic, and star-crossed romance with a beautiful young woman named Olga.', 'Gifted but hot-headed sculptor Eric has a stormy, erotic, and star-crossed romance with a beautiful young woman named Olga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqnlXShKgQbF3prxU6XYrC53z6F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21035'),
  ('328354302191069897', 'Turkish for Beginners', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Bora Dağtekin, Benjamin Dernbecher, Torsten Breuer', 'Bora Dağtekin', 'Josefine Preuß, Elyas M''Barek, Anna Stieblich, Adnan Maral, Pegah Ferydoni, Arnel Taci, Katja Riemann, Günther Kaufmann', null, 'During an emergency landing on a deserted island suddenly traumatized by antiauthoritarian education Lena Schneider together with the Turkish Super Macho Cem Öztürk must fight for survival. After initially Cem macho repulsive acts on Lena, a jellyfish in the water and sand in a bikini, she recognizes the time the romantic core behind his cool facade. Meanwhile, meet also their parents, who obdurate psychologist Doris and Metin Öztürk to work together to find their missing children. So both generations take an involuntary Turkish Basic Course for beginners.', 'During an emergency landing on a deserted island suddenly traumatized by antiauthoritarian education Lena Schneider together with the Turkish Super Macho Cem Öztürk must fight for survival. After initially Cem macho repulsive acts on Lena, a jellyfish in the water and sand in a bikini, she recognizes the time the romantic core behind his cool facade. Meanwhile, meet also their parents, who obdurate psychologist Doris and Metin Öztürk to work together to find their missing children. So both generations take an involuntary Turkish Basic Course for beginners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/588y9E7gQdqvTUtLIFZ9oK5GudT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94562'),
  ('107582366219664478', 'Turkish Ice Cream', 2019, 'History, Drama, War', 'Can Ulkay, Alan Cossettini, Peter Steuger', 'Gürkan Tanyas', 'Erkan Kolçak Köstendil, Ali Atay, Şebnem Bozoklu, Will Thorp, James Farley, Caner Kurtaran, Marlene Matthews, Tristan Alexander', null, 'In 1915, two Turks in Australia make a living by selling ice cream. When they hear war has broken out, they decide to go to Çanakkale. Authorities don''t let them leave the island, so the two decide to put up a fight in Australia.', 'In 1915, two Turks in Australia make a living by selling ice cream. When they hear war has broken out, they decide to go to Çanakkale. Authorities don''t let them leave the island, so the two decide to put up a fight in Australia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRnHZHxzxE0hYA8YJnILc0jYtVq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588459'),
  ('620257657129133700', 'Turkish Passion', 1994, 'Drama', 'Vicente Aranda, José Luis Alcaine', 'Vicente Aranda', 'Ana Belén, Georges Corraface, Ramón Madaula, Sílvia Munt, Blanca Apilánez, Francis Lorenzo, Helio Pedregal, Loles León', null, 'A young woman’s passion forms the basis of this erotic Spanish drama adapted from a popular novel by Antonio Gala. The night before Desideria’s marriage, her girl friends give her some valuable advice on sex. The marriage takes place, and while it is generally happy, her husband Ramiro suffers from sexual dysfunction and Desideria is frustrated. The two end up on holiday in Istanbul with two friends. Desideria falls madly in love with the sensual ambiance of the ancient, teeming city. She begins a passionate affair with a handsome Turkish guide, Yaman. Upon her return home, she learns that she is pregnant. Ramiro agrees to support the child, but unfortunately it dies in infancy and the grieving Desideria flees for Istanbul to find her lover. She finds him and they renew their torrid affair. Later she learns some distressing things about Yaman, but this does not stop her from becoming his sexual slave and a call girl for wealthy carpet sellers.', 'A young woman’s passion forms the basis of this erotic Spanish drama adapted from a popular novel by Antonio Gala. The night before Desideria’s marriage, her girl friends give her some valuable advice on sex. The marriage takes place, and while it is generally happy, her husband Ramiro suffers from sexual dysfunction and Desideria is frustrated. The two end up on holiday in Istanbul with two friends. Desideria falls madly in love with the sensual ambiance of the ancient, teeming city. She begins a passionate affair with a handsome Turkish guide, Yaman. Upon her return home, she learns that she is pregnant. Ramiro agrees to support the child, but unfortunately it dies in infancy and the grieving Desideria flees for Istanbul to find her lover. She finds him and they renew their torrid affair. Later she learns some distressing things about Yaman, but this does not stop her from becoming his sexual slave and a call girl for wealthy carpet sellers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLMjCgzkS4GejHopJNpYpbOwNSw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60985'),
  ('542035786491272967', 'Turks & Caicos', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama, Action, Mystery', 'David Hare, Thomas Townend', 'David Hare', 'Bill Nighy, Christopher Walken, Winona Ryder, Ralph Fiennes, Helena Bonham Carter, Rupert Graves, Dylan Baker, Ewen Bremner', null, 'The second movie in David Hare''s Johnny Worricker trilogy. Loose-limbed spy Johnny Worricker, last seen whistleblowing at MI5 in Page Eight, has a new life. He is hiding out in Ray-Bans on the Caribbean islands of the title, eating lobster and calling himself Tom Eliot (he’s a poet at heart). We’re drawn into his world and his predicament when Christopher Walken strolls in as a shadowy American who claims to know Johnny. The encounter forces him into the company of some ambiguous American businessmen who claim to be on the islands for a conference on the global financial crisis. When one of them falls in the sea, their financial PR seems to know more than she''s letting on. Worricker soon learns the extent of their shady activities and he must act quickly to survive when links to British prime minister Alec Beasley come to light.', 'The second movie in David Hare''s Johnny Worricker trilogy. Loose-limbed spy Johnny Worricker, last seen whistleblowing at MI5 in Page Eight, has a new life. He is hiding out in Ray-Bans on the Caribbean islands of the title, eating lobster and calling himself Tom Eliot (he’s a poet at heart). We’re drawn into his world and his predicament when Christopher Walken strolls in as a shadowy American who claims to know Johnny. The encounter forces him into the company of some ambiguous American businessmen who claim to be on the islands for a conference on the global financial crisis. When one of them falls in the sea, their financial PR seems to know more than she''s letting on. Worricker soon learns the extent of their shady activities and he must act quickly to survive when links to British prime minister Alec Beasley come to light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbDqSsAhKGybpZk5vGpDRg6cSRx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260202'),
  ('272286189372809266', 'Turks in Space', 2006, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Tolga Kutlar, Kartal Tibet', 'Murat Boyacioglu', 'Cüneyt Arkın, Mehmet Ali Erbil, Deniz Seki, Sinem Kobal, Burcu Kara, Pascal Nouma, Didem Erol, Burak Hakkı', null, 'The year is 2055, and the universe is in a state of turmoil, awaiting the formation of a government that can establish universal peace. Until such a time, the Orion Union stands in its stead, an uneasy alliance made up not of planets, but of their individual states, overlorded by unruly gangs, short-sighted tyrants and hissing, domineering queens. In short, chaos reigns.', 'The year is 2055, and the universe is in a state of turmoil, awaiting the formation of a government that can establish universal peace. Until such a time, the Orion Union stands in its stead, an uneasy alliance made up not of planets, but of their individual states, overlorded by unruly gangs, short-sighted tyrants and hissing, domineering queens. In short, chaos reigns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bw3DoEAa8sIxwWuPyCaQ3qnoXX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31279'),
