  ('1118705588062547813', 'Turma da Mônica em Cine Gibi 5: Luz, Câmera, Ação!', 2010, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Mauricio de Sousa, José Marcio Nicolosi', 'Rosana Munhoz, Márcio Araújo de Sousa', 'Marli Bortoletto, Angélica Santos, Elza Gonçalves, Paulo Cavalcante, Márcio Araújo de Sousa, Sibele Toledo, Marcelo Souza, Mauricio de Sousa', null, 'In the fifth installment of the Cine Gibi series, Smudge and Jimmy Five find themselves engaged in a lively debate over the ultimate action film. Seeking a resolution, they turn to their friend Franklin, known for his inventive prowess, to organize yet another round of projected comic book film sessions using his colossal blender.', 'In the fifth installment of the Cine Gibi series, Smudge and Jimmy Five find themselves engaged in a lively debate over the ultimate action film. Seeking a resolution, they turn to their friend Franklin, known for his inventive prowess, to organize yet another round of projected comic book film sessions using his colossal blender.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3crGIDaVYgw5PeZ7NCeLUXsooD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256853'),
  ('339292736686813798', 'Turma da Mônica em Cine Gibi 6: Hora do Banho', 2013, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'José Marcio Nicolosi', null, 'Marli Bortoletto, Angélica Santos, Paulo Cavalcante, Elza Gonçalves', null, 'Cascão''s smell gets out of hand, and the gang decides to give him a good bath. So, he decides to hide in the movie theater. In the dark, Cascão uses a shadow trick to fool Franjinha and pretend to be Cebolinha.', 'Cascão''s smell gets out of hand, and the gang decides to give him a good bath. So, he decides to hide in the movie theater. In the dark, Cascão uses a shadow trick to fool Franjinha and pretend to be Cebolinha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fP50qCowZ67Ub2MXSbWvFoaOmQM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286931'),
  ('1083310345414643529', 'Turma da Mônica em Cine Gibi 7: Bagunça Animal', 2014, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'José Marcio Nicolosi', null, 'Marli Bortoletto, Angélica Santos, Elza Gonçalves, Paulo Cavalcante', null, 'Trying to escape his bath, Monicão ends up hiding in the movie theater. Mônica can''t find her pet in the dark, so she asks Franjinha to play some short films that might lure the dog out of hiding.', 'Trying to escape his bath, Monicão ends up hiding in the movie theater. Mônica can''t find her pet in the dark, so she asks Franjinha to play some short films that might lure the dog out of hiding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ngZmhOXj6zN2P4RnN0rpvzAMFS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294601'),
  ('762639082041881864', 'Turma da Mônica em Cine Gibi 8: ...Tá Brincando', 2015, 'Comedy, Animation, Family', 'José Marcio Nicolosi', null, 'Marli Bortoletto, Angélica Santos, Paulo Cavalcante, Elza Gonçalves', null, 'There are eight episodes in stories full of adventure and play in the neighborhood of Limoeiro, with a new car ride, lost treasure, art exhibition in the square, puppet theater, an unexpected escape from Cascão (again?), Characters Saltimbancos and a lot more.', 'There are eight episodes in stories full of adventure and play in the neighborhood of Limoeiro, with a new car ride, lost treasure, art exhibition in the square, puppet theater, an unexpected escape from Cascão (again?), Characters Saltimbancos and a lot more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mWt0nrWaZOrXbalPQ8ZsQ1EV52.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586901'),
  ('91562033275645508', 'Turma da Mônica em Cine Gibi 9: Vamos Fazer de Conta', 2016, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'José Marcio Nicolosi', null, 'Marli Bortoletto, Angélica Santos, Elza Gonçalves, Paulo Cavalcante', null, 'The gang got together to watch the funniest stories projected by Franjinha''s invention: Go Play Outside, Cebolinha! Mônica in Slow Motion, I Don’t Know the Name of This, But It’s Really Fun!', 'The gang got together to watch the funniest stories projected by Franjinha''s invention: Go Play Outside, Cebolinha! Mônica in Slow Motion, I Don’t Know the Name of This, But It’s Really Fun!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQMruKMfQbbMmo3scLplxuAkh52.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423118'),
  ('668691957209421066', 'Turma da Mônica Jovem: Reflexos do Medo', 2024, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Marcelo Corpanni, Arthur Chamon, Catarina Chamon', 'Regina Negrini, Rodrigo Goulart, Sabrina Garcia', 'Sophia Valverde, Xande Valois, Bianca Paiva, Theo Salomão, Carol Roberto, Yuma Ono, Giovanna Chaves, Carolina Amaral', null, 'On the first day of high school, friends Mônica, Cebola, Magali, Cascão and Milena don''t take long to realize that things at school have been strange. When they discover that the Lemon Tree Museum will be auctioned, they decide to join in a mission to try to save it. As they investigate, they come across ancient and frightening secrets of the Limoeiro neighborhood and soon realize they may be dealing with a much bigger threat.', 'On the first day of high school, friends Mônica, Cebola, Magali, Cascão and Milena don''t take long to realize that things at school have been strange. When they discover that the Lemon Tree Museum will be auctioned, they decide to join in a mission to try to save it. As they investigate, they come across ancient and frightening secrets of the Limoeiro neighborhood and soon realize they may be dealing with a much bigger threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zG1YYywzTRf791p146Ae5REh9h6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1056437'),
  ('1033121064504684634', 'Turn A Gundam I: Earth Light', 2002, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino, Yoshihito Hishinuma, Takuro Shinbo', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino', 'Akino Murata, Rieko Takahashi, Romi Park, Tetsu Inada', null, 'Loran Cehack is a spy sent from the moon to scout out Earth, whom they plan to invade. He grows to love Earth as his true home and, after discovering a giant mech from the dark ages, he begins to defend Earth in the war. The year is C.C. 2345. Growing tensions between the Earthrace and Moonrace have spiraled into an all out war. Mankind''s only hope for peace lies with a young Moonrace boy named Loran Cehack, and his mysterious Turn-A Gundam, a relic of a dark history which nearly destroyed the Earth centuries ago. As a citizen of the moon, Loran is loyal to the beautiful Queen Dianna Soreil, all the while fighting to keep the technologically superior Moonrace at bay as the pre-industrial Earthrace tries desperately to catch up.', 'Loran Cehack is a spy sent from the moon to scout out Earth, whom they plan to invade. He grows to love Earth as his true home and, after discovering a giant mech from the dark ages, he begins to defend Earth in the war. The year is C.C. 2345. Growing tensions between the Earthrace and Moonrace have spiraled into an all out war. Mankind''s only hope for peace lies with a young Moonrace boy named Loran Cehack, and his mysterious Turn-A Gundam, a relic of a dark history which nearly destroyed the Earth centuries ago. As a citizen of the moon, Loran is loyal to the beautiful Queen Dianna Soreil, all the while fighting to keep the technologically superior Moonrace at bay as the pre-industrial Earthrace tries desperately to catch up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghaJ05SzfGFhuPSaYVwcevO5kgr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75175'),
  ('31926715734209864', 'Turn A Gundam II: Moonlight Butterfly', 2002, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino, Yoshihito Hishinuma, Atsuo Tobe', 'Yoshiyuki Tomino', 'Rieko Takahashi, Romi Park, Takehito Koyasu, Tetsu Inada', null, 'Following the events of the first movie, the Militia finishes restoration work on its excavated spaceship and travels to the moon to deal with Gym Ghingnham and Agrippa Maintainer, who along with Dianna Soreil form a governing triumvirate over the Moonrace. On the moon, the political situation rapidly evolves as new deals are made, setting the stage for a decisive final battle to determine the relationship between the people of Earth and the technologically advanced Moonrace.', 'Following the events of the first movie, the Militia finishes restoration work on its excavated spaceship and travels to the moon to deal with Gym Ghingnham and Agrippa Maintainer, who along with Dianna Soreil form a governing triumvirate over the Moonrace. On the moon, the political situation rapidly evolves as new deals are made, setting the stage for a decisive final battle to determine the relationship between the people of Earth and the technologically advanced Moonrace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twWBFwZMCJgxh2zBCmlntmOkOhu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75177'),
  ('455557514126844503', 'Turn It Up', 2000, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Robert Adetuyi, Hubert Taczanowski', 'Robert Adetuyi', 'Pras Michel, Ja Rule, Jason Statham, Vondie Curtis-Hall, Tamala Jones, John Ralston, Chris Messina, Eugene Clark', 'R', 'Trying to bootstrap his way out of Brooklyn''s mean streets is Diamond, a rap musician. With his long-time pal Gage acting as his manager, he''s trying to lay down a demo tape with cut-rate studio time. To pay the bills, he and Gage run drugs for "Mr. B." Inside a week, Diamond''s beloved mother dies suddenly, his father appears after an absence of 12 years and wants a relationship, and his girlfriend Kia tells him she''s pregnant, asking him if he''s ready to be a father. Gage steals $100,000 in a multiple-felony robbery so that Diamond can record a full album, not knowing it''s Mr. B''s money he''s taken. B wants his money, Diamond wants his music, Tia wants an answer.', 'Trying to bootstrap his way out of Brooklyn''s mean streets is Diamond, a rap musician. With his long-time pal Gage acting as his manager, he''s trying to lay down a demo tape with cut-rate studio time. To pay the bills, he and Gage run drugs for "Mr. B." Inside a week, Diamond''s beloved mother dies suddenly, his father appears after an absence of 12 years and wants a relationship, and his girlfriend Kia tells him she''s pregnant, asking him if he''s ready to be a father. Gage steals $100,000 in a multiple-felony robbery so that Diamond can record a full album, not knowing it''s Mr. B''s money he''s taken. B wants his money, Diamond wants his music, Tia wants an answer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LqMTyQJnI7IfeDjjGRcDh1vv0r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9995'),
  ('394909562622681931', 'Turn It Up, It''s Rock ''n'' Roll', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tomás Portella, André Modugno', 'L.G. Bayão', 'Johnny Massaro, Marina Provenzzano, George Sauma, Orã Figueiredo, Sílvio Guindane, Flora Diegues, Joana Castro, Clarice Sauma', null, 'The film tells the story of Luiz Antônio, a clumsy radio host, who unexpectedly finds himself in charge of a bankrupt radio station. Relying only on his passion for rock''n''roll and a crazy team, he creates one of the most emblematic radio stations in the history of Brazilian rock, Fluminense FM. Among guitar solos and radio signal interferences, we follow the adventures misadventures of Luiz.', 'The film tells the story of Luiz Antônio, a clumsy radio host, who unexpectedly finds himself in charge of a bankrupt radio station. Relying only on his passion for rock''n''roll and a crazy team, he creates one of the most emblematic radio stations in the history of Brazilian rock, Fluminense FM. Among guitar solos and radio signal interferences, we follow the adventures misadventures of Luiz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qiXdbaOBROSmBQqpu3UvFnu0LtR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1019952'),
  ('412259133049863943', 'Turn Left, Turn Right', 2003, 'Romance, Drama', 'Johnnie To, Wai Ka-Fai, To Hung-Mo', 'Wai Ka-Fai, Au Kin-Yee, Yau Nai-Hoi', 'Takeshi Kaneshiro, Gigi Leung Wing-Kei, Edmund Chen, Terri Kwan, Lam Suet, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Four Tse Liu-Shut, Wang Te-Chih', null, 'An aspiring violinist and a professional translator live parallel lives and appear to be perfect for each other, but somehow fate seems to keep them apart. Living in different units of the same apartment building, they never meet, because when they leave, one turns left, and one turns right.', 'An aspiring violinist and a professional translator live parallel lives and appear to be perfect for each other, but somehow fate seems to keep them apart. Living in different units of the same apartment building, they never meet, because when they leave, one turns left, and one turns right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lr9jAfUS0C6MxBLvr3DsAvis64X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41198'),
  ('466896355561873933', 'Turn Me On', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Romance, Drama', 'Michael Tyburski, Matt Mitchell', 'Angela Bourassa', 'Bel Powley, Nick Robinson, Justin H. Min, D''Arcy Carden, Nesta Cooper, Griffin Newman, Luke Kirby, Patti Harrison', null, 'In a world where the inconvenience of human emotion has been eradicated by a single daily vitamin, one young couple skips their dose and discovers love, joy, sex, and all the baggage that comes with it.', 'In a world where the inconvenience of human emotion has been eradicated by a single daily vitamin, one young couple skips their dose and discovers love, joy, sex, and all the baggage that comes with it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tp8iokHkDfFSXwxTJ1sdhlFROsS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:937086'),
  ('794066516998268439', 'Turn Me On, Dammit!', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jannicke Systad Jacobsen, Marianne Bakke, Lene Heimlund Larsen', 'Jannicke Systad Jacobsen', 'Helene Bergsholm, Malin Bjørhovde, Beate Støfring, Matias Myren, Lars Nordtvedt Listau, Henriette Steenstrup, Jon Bleiklie Devik, Julia Bache-Wiig', 'NR', 'In Skoddeheimen, Norway, 15-year-old Alma is consumed by her hormones and fantasies that range from sweetly romantic images of Artur, the boyfriend she yearns for, to daydreams about practically everybody she lays eyes on.', 'In Skoddeheimen, Norway, 15-year-old Alma is consumed by her hormones and fantasies that range from sweetly romantic images of Artur, the boyfriend she yearns for, to daydreams about practically everybody she lays eyes on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/weBjKfREQrbexrKh2oMQ9PWbch2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62564'),
  ('776480666706175156', 'Turn of the Screw', 1985, 'Horror', 'Eloy de la Iglesia, Juan Gelpí', 'Eloy de la Iglesia, Gonzalo Goicoechea, Ángel Sastre', 'Pedro Mari Sánchez, Queta Claver, Asier Hernández, Cristina Goyanes, Ramón Reparaz, Luis Iriondo, Paco Sagarzazu, José Javier Goikoetxea', null, 'A young man is hired to take care of two orphaned siblings in a remote seaside mansion and soon realizes that someone... or something from the past is out to get the children.', 'A young man is hired to take care of two orphaned siblings in a remote seaside mansion and soon realizes that someone... or something from the past is out to get the children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rrbZXw3CfHD6H7oa2yl9ZRhFtw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115909'),
  ('775866733917742450', 'Turn of the Tide: The Surreal Story of Rabo de Peixe', 2025, 'Documentary, Crime', null, 'Marcos Nine', null, 'R', 'In June 2001, hundreds of kilos of cocaine washed up in a Portuguese village. This gripping documentary reveals the long-lasting impact on the community.', 'In June 2001, hundreds of kilos of cocaine washed up in a Portuguese village. This gripping documentary reveals the long-lasting impact on the community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sek3ZIcX9Q7CVXOv1QIYVd93qM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1557977'),
  ('1039382089459884745', 'Turn the Key Softly', 1953, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jack Lee', 'Jack Lee, Maurice Cowan', 'Yvonne Mitchell, Terence Morgan, Joan Collins, Kathleen Harrison, Thora Hird, Geoffrey Keen, Simone Silva, Dorothy Alison', 'NR', 'A bitter burglar, a prostitute and an elderly shoplifter spend their first day out of jail.', 'A bitter burglar, a prostitute and an elderly shoplifter spend their first day out of jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90CNoXL3fSPn6gn4w3aMpZaUueg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143128'),
  ('584166506807475184', 'Turn the River', 2008, 'Drama', 'Chris Eigeman, Hernán Otaño', 'Chris Eigeman', 'Famke Janssen, Rip Torn, Matt Ross, Lois Smith, Terry Kinney, Ari Graynor, Marin Hinkle, Jaymie Dornan', 'R', 'A pool shark takes the ultimate gamble when she kidnaps her own son and flees her ex-husband.', 'A pool shark takes the ultimate gamble when she kidnaps her own son and flees her ex-husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XF05cxDYCeGe9LpqfdzabGe9at.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13993'),
  ('837083021067717786', 'Turn-of-the-Century Surgery', 1900, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'George Mélies made a version of this a few years later, often titled Une Indigestion, but Guy-Blaché’s earlier film Chirurgie Fin de Siecle (1900) is more widely available. And it’s not one to watch the night before an operation. In this clinic, a sign pleads “On est prie de ne pas crier/Please do not cry”, and the doctors set about the patient with saws, cheerily hacking off limbs, and then slopping them into a bucket, all the while arguing ferociously with each other. They then reattach arms and legs from a bucket of “exchange pieces” (using glue) before re-animating their victim, I mean patient, with bellows. (from http://silentlondon.co.uk/2015/01/23/10-disgusting-moments-in-silent-cinema/)', 'George Mélies made a version of this a few years later, often titled Une Indigestion, but Guy-Blaché’s earlier film Chirurgie Fin de Siecle (1900) is more widely available. And it’s not one to watch the night before an operation. In this clinic, a sign pleads “On est prie de ne pas crier/Please do not cry”, and the doctors set about the patient with saws, cheerily hacking off limbs, and then slopping them into a bucket, all the while arguing ferociously with each other. They then reattach arms and legs from a bucket of “exchange pieces” (using glue) before re-animating their victim, I mean patient, with bellows. (from http://silentlondon.co.uk/2015/01/23/10-disgusting-moments-in-silent-cinema/)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRZELXrPkHuVvIW04Rc1GIdvWAr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119974'),
  ('362697732913126413', 'Turnabout', 1940, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Hal Roach', 'Mickell Novack, John McClain, Berne Giler', 'Adolphe Menjou, Carole Landis, John Hubbard, William Gargan, Verree Teasdale, Mary Astor, Donald Meek, Joyce Compton', null, 'Bickering husband and wife Tim and Sally Willows mutter a few angry words to a statue who grants their wish and they wind up living each other''s life.', 'Bickering husband and wife Tim and Sally Willows mutter a few angry words to a statue who grants their wish and they wind up living each other''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sp0wkg1MxgE6tF1BvgrpPf7xOer.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151105'),
  ('742981727178007649', 'Turné', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Italo Petriccione, Antonella Licata, Gabriele Salvatores', 'Francesca Marciano, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Gabriele Salvatores', 'Diego Abatantuono, Laura Morante, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Luigi Montini, Barbara Scoppa, Ugo Conti, Eva Vanicek, Leonardo Gajo', null, 'Two stage actors leave on a tournée, but there''s a matter to be settled: one has become the lover of the other''s girlfriend and since they are very good friends, cannot bring himself to tell him.', 'Two stage actors leave on a tournée, but there''s a matter to be settled: one has become the lover of the other''s girlfriend and since they are very good friends, cannot bring himself to tell him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/um9H02RgLNdVnOMUJgv6QiKu3V5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58773'),
  ('62079859169303857', 'Turner & Hooch', 1989, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller, Crime, Family', 'Roger Spottiswoode, Adam Greenberg', 'Dennis Shryack, Michael Blodgett, Daniel Petrie Jr.', 'Tom Hanks, Mare Winningham, Craig T. Nelson, Scott Paulin, John McIntire, David Knell, Reginald VelJohnson, Mary McCusker', 'PG', 'Detective Scott Turner has three days left in the local police department before he moves to a bigger city to get some ''real'' cases—not just misdemeanors. When Amos Reed is murdered, Scott sets himself on the case, but the closest thing to a witness to the murder is Reed''s dog, Hooch, which Scott has to take care of—to avoid Hooch being ''put to sleep''.', 'Detective Scott Turner has three days left in the local police department before he moves to a bigger city to get some ''real'' cases—not just misdemeanors. When Amos Reed is murdered, Scott sets himself on the case, but the closest thing to a witness to the murder is Reed''s dog, Hooch, which Scott has to take care of—to avoid Hooch being ''put to sleep''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nllMNbjgvUpw378czm5vBYzZqg1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6951'),
  ('974980537383499015', 'Turning Point', 2009, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Herman Yau, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung, Mandy Ngai Man-Yin', 'Yip Tin-Shing', 'Michael Tse Tin-Wah, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Yuen Biao, Fala Chen, Oscar Leung Lit-Wai, Singh Hartihan Bitto', null, 'Laughing is formally a police undercover. However due to a drug trafficking case, Inspector Pan is hot on his trails. Before Laughing becomes a police undercover, he works under triad leader Yi. Yi treats Laughing as his own brother, however to protect his territory and illegal businesses, Yi instructed Laughing to join the police force and act as his undercover. Laughing is a high-flyer in the police academy. However he never got a chance to join the force because he is specially picked by Inspector Xian to be an undercover in the underworld syndicate. Hence Laughing becomes a “double-undercover”. Yi is happy that Laughing is allocated to the triad of his rival. To make his situation worse, Laughing falls in love with the triad leader’s sister, Karen. Justice, brotherhood and love, what will Laughing decide on? His decision will be a turning point in his life.', 'Laughing is formally a police undercover. However due to a drug trafficking case, Inspector Pan is hot on his trails. Before Laughing becomes a police undercover, he works under triad leader Yi. Yi treats Laughing as his own brother, however to protect his territory and illegal businesses, Yi instructed Laughing to join the police force and act as his undercover. Laughing is a high-flyer in the police academy. However he never got a chance to join the force because he is specially picked by Inspector Xian to be an undercover in the underworld syndicate. Hence Laughing becomes a “double-undercover”. Yi is happy that Laughing is allocated to the triad of his rival. To make his situation worse, Laughing falls in love with the triad leader’s sister, Karen. Justice, brotherhood and love, what will Laughing decide on? His decision will be a turning point in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZgmjEWqLtAnwvMNbJDklZCBcen.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44133'),
  ('538525397964568379', 'Turning Red', 2022, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Mahyar Abousaeedi, Jonathan Pytko, Domee Shi', 'Domee Shi, Julia Cho', 'Rosalie Chiang, Sandra Oh, Ava Morse, Hyein Park, Maitreyi Ramakrishnan, Orion Lee, Wai Ching Ho, Tristan Allerick Chen', 'PG', 'Thirteen-year-old Mei is experiencing the awkwardness of being a teenager with a twist – when she gets too excited, she transforms into a giant red panda.', 'Thirteen-year-old Mei is experiencing the awkwardness of being a teenager with a twist – when she gets too excited, she transforms into a giant red panda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsdjk9oAKSQMWs0Vt5Pyfh6O4GZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508947'),
  ('647002865237402008', 'Turning Table', 1988, 'Animation', 'Paul Grimault, Jacques Demy, Raymond Picon Borel', 'Paul Grimault, Jacques Demy', 'Paul Grimault, Mathieu Demy, Anouk Aimée, Lionel Charpy, Gary Chekchak, Frank Laurent, Jean-Charles Rousseau, Pierre Tchernia', null, 'On a winter night, the author of "The King and the Mockingbird" is visited by the cartoon characters he created in his studio. Along with a little clown, he screens a selection of his favorite shorts', 'On a winter night, the author of "The King and the Mockingbird" is visited by the cartoon characters he created in his studio. Along with a little clown, he screens a selection of his favorite shorts', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6N9LL2ZRCtqXNVO2IyCFdeHoGCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64332'),
  ('1026612349082874628', 'Turning Tide', 2013, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Christophe Offenstein, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Christophe Offenstein, Jean Cottin', 'François Cluzet, Samy Seghir, Virginie Efira, Guillaume Canet, Karine Vanasse, Arly Jover, Jose Coronado, Jean-Paul Rouve', null, 'Yann Madec, long-time best mate of Frank Drevil, the star skipper of Global System Insurance, sees his dream come true when he replaces the injured Frank at the last minute for the start of the Vendée Globe. Nine days into the race and leading, Yann is forced to stop in Cape Verde to repair his broken center-board. Back in the race, Yann discovers a stowaway on board, a Senegalese teenager named Moussa. Faced with the risk of disqualification because of Moussa’s presence, Yann hesitates… Their encounter leads to the most unforgettable round-the-world race ever.', 'Yann Madec, long-time best mate of Frank Drevil, the star skipper of Global System Insurance, sees his dream come true when he replaces the injured Frank at the last minute for the start of the Vendée Globe. Nine days into the race and leading, Yann is forced to stop in Cape Verde to repair his broken center-board. Back in the race, Yann discovers a stowaway on board, a Senegalese teenager named Moussa. Faced with the risk of disqualification because of Moussa’s presence, Yann hesitates… Their encounter leads to the most unforgettable round-the-world race ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPzDsCuYmwOmIoZw9CbFFutWYoF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149087'),
  ('1084523083481360257', 'Turtle Beach', 1992, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Stephen Wallace, Russell Boyd', 'Ann Turner', 'Greta Scacchi, Victoria Longley, Jack Thompson, Art Malik, Joan Chen, Martin Jacobs, Kee Chan, Norman Kaye', null, 'Reporter Judith Wilkes leaves her husband and two sons in Sydney and goes to Malaysia to cover the story of the Vietnamese boat people. She becomes romantically involved with Kanan, and strikes up a friendship with Lady Minou Hobday, who keeps a regular vigil at "Turtle Beach" where the refugees try to secretly land, in the hope that one day her own children will arrive. Accompanying Minou one night, Judith witnesses a brutal massacre by the Malaysians, which spurs her on to expose the horrors of the internment camps at Bidong.', 'Reporter Judith Wilkes leaves her husband and two sons in Sydney and goes to Malaysia to cover the story of the Vietnamese boat people. She becomes romantically involved with Kanan, and strikes up a friendship with Lady Minou Hobday, who keeps a regular vigil at "Turtle Beach" where the refugees try to secretly land, in the hope that one day her own children will arrive. Accompanying Minou one night, Judith witnesses a brutal massacre by the Malaysians, which spurs her on to expose the horrors of the internment camps at Bidong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BbAgdae8aoq06aTDWF9sXgGUkh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272902'),
  ('7002882634527899', 'Turtle Diary', 1985, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'John Irvin, Michael Zimbrich, Susie Figgis', 'Harold Pinter', 'Glenda Jackson, Ben Kingsley, Richard Johnson, Michael Gambon, Rosemary Leach, Eleanor Bron, Harriet Walter, Jeroen Krabbé', 'PG', 'Two separate people, a man and a woman, find something very stirring about the sea turtles in their tank at the London Zoo. They meet and form an odd, but sympathetic camaraderie as they plan to steal two of the turtles and free them into the ocean.', 'Two separate people, a man and a woman, find something very stirring about the sea turtles in their tank at the London Zoo. They meet and form an odd, but sympathetic camaraderie as they plan to steal two of the turtles and free them into the ocean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tY9j8r1dVVrATeThyro02ALmWwF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123047'),
  ('495542851068610328', 'Turtles All the Way Down', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Brian Burgoyne, Mary Kerrigan, Tracey Poirier', 'Elizabeth Berger, Isaac Aptaker', 'Isabela Merced, Cree Cicchino, Judy Reyes, Felix Mallard, Maliq Johnson, Miles Ekhardt, J. Smith-Cameron, Poorna Jagannathan', 'PG-13', 'Aza confronts her potential for love, happiness, friendship, and hope while navigating an endless barrage of invasive, obsessive thoughts.', 'Aza confronts her potential for love, happiness, friendship, and hope while navigating an endless barrage of invasive, obsessive thoughts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDKlFXWCvIkP2Xl2nMdI49kzwZx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574451'),
  ('337720832028456998', 'Turtles Are Surprisingly Fast Swimmers', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Satoshi Miki, Gen Kobayashi', 'Satoshi Miki', 'Juri Ueno, Yu Aoi, Ryo Iwamatsu, Eri Fuse, Jun Kaname, Masatô Ibu, Shunsuke Matsuoka, Yutaka Matsushige', null, 'Suzume Katagura, a bored housewife, spends her days doing chores and taking care of her husband''s pet turtle. One day, she sees a wanted ad for spies. Hoping for some excitement in her life, she decides to give them a call.', 'Suzume Katagura, a bored housewife, spends her days doing chores and taking care of her husband''s pet turtle. One day, she sees a wanted ad for spies. Hoping for some excitement in her life, she decides to give them a call.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nThjwGHNHKXI7Y1oGdrWzcoAF7P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36175'),
  ('20776673280472702', 'Turtles Can Fly', 2004, 'Drama', 'Bahman Ghobadi, Jalal Saed Panah, Shahram Shah Hosseini', 'Bahman Ghobadi', 'Soran Ebrahim, Avaz Latif, Saddam Hossein Feysal, Hiresh Feysal Rahman, Abdol Rahman Karim, Ajil Zibari', null, 'Turtles Can Fly tells the story of a group of young children near the Turkey-Iraq border. They clean up mines and wait for the Saddam regime to fall.', 'Turtles Can Fly tells the story of a group of young children near the Turkey-Iraq border. They clean up mines and wait for the Saddam regime to fall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNJxHYyFpmqRjgZ4oa5qQna904i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8340'),
  ('95981379789171542', 'Turtles Forever', 2009, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Lloyd Goldfine, Roy Burdine', 'Rob David, Lloyd Goldfine, Matthew Drdek', 'Michael Sinterniklaas, Wayne Grayson, Sam Riegel, Gregory Abbey, Darren Dunstan, Marc Thompson, Veronica Taylor, Scott Rayow', 'NR', 'Whoa, dude! Worlds collide when the Turtles from one dimension meet the Turtles from another dimension! What the shell is going on? The two Turtle teams must work together to find the Technodrome and undo this multi-dimensional mess!', 'Whoa, dude! Worlds collide when the Turtles from one dimension meet the Turtles from another dimension! What the shell is going on? The two Turtle teams must work together to find the Technodrome and undo this multi-dimensional mess!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PRI4GFIbuLHaYvw1AZEt19riIO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34003'),
  ('501281032169004755', 'Turu, the Wacky Hen', 2020, 'Family, Animation, Music, Adventure', 'Víctor Monigote, Alejandro Valente, Eduardo Gondell', 'Pablo E. Bossi, Juan Pablo Buscarini, Eduardo Gondell', 'Eva Hache, José Mota, Ana Ángeles García, Álvaro de Juana Pecos, Paula Coria Portilla', null, 'Like a love song to differences, Turu, the Wacky Hen tells the story of a creature who, due to her particular appearance, becomes the object of ridicule for the rest of the henhouse. Her wiry legs and featherless back don’t startle Isabel, an ex music teacher who picks her for being so special. Turuleca doesn’t lay eggs because her hidden talent is another: she talks, she sings and she dances, giving it her all. Turu, the Wacky Hen is a full-color, animated party that invites us to move our bodies to its musical numbers, making us sing verses that have the power to turn us into children once again, if only for a little while.', 'Like a love song to differences, Turu, the Wacky Hen tells the story of a creature who, due to her particular appearance, becomes the object of ridicule for the rest of the henhouse. Her wiry legs and featherless back don’t startle Isabel, an ex music teacher who picks her for being so special. Turuleca doesn’t lay eggs because her hidden talent is another: she talks, she sings and she dances, giving it her all. Turu, the Wacky Hen is a full-color, animated party that invites us to move our bodies to its musical numbers, making us sing verses that have the power to turn us into children once again, if only for a little while.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xaG10x1C8dCHkNumSslH6jwzvpt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653247'),
  ('590324969687259162', 'Tusalava', 1929, 'Animation', 'Len Lye', null, null, null, 'With the screen split asymmetrically, one part in positive, the other negative, the film documents the evolution of simple celled organic forms into chains of cells then more complex images from tribal cultures and contemporary modernist concepts. The images react, interpenetrate, perhaps attack, absorb and separate, until a final symbiosis (or redemption?) is achieved.', 'With the screen split asymmetrically, one part in positive, the other negative, the film documents the evolution of simple celled organic forms into chains of cells then more complex images from tribal cultures and contemporary modernist concepts. The images react, interpenetrate, perhaps attack, absorb and separate, until a final symbiosis (or redemption?) is achieved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDpxtc8PvZ4QPgv3iwgA2rP572F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190081'),
  ('537927234211228472', 'Tuscan Wedding', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Johan Nijenhuis, Maarten van Keller', 'Maarten Lebens, Annelou Verboon, Tijs van Marle', 'Jan Kooijman, Lieke van Lexmond, Diederik Ebbinge, Matteo van der Grijn, Simone Kleinsma, Ruud Feltkamp, Dirk Zeelenberg, Carolien Spoor', null, 'Tuscan Wedding, the new romantic comedy from the creators of Loving Ibiza. Together with her father Tom and stepmother Marla, Sanne runs Casa Matrimonio, a luxurious villa in sunkissed Italy. The estate is located in Tuscany, a beautiful region where many couples go to have their perfect wedding. In Casa Matrimonio guests come together to celebrate love and life. A Tuscan Wedding is the apotheosis of everyone’s visit to the country side. And for some the villa is all too familiar as they return again and again: because some people only marry twice.', 'Tuscan Wedding, the new romantic comedy from the creators of Loving Ibiza. Together with her father Tom and stepmother Marla, Sanne runs Casa Matrimonio, a luxurious villa in sunkissed Italy. The estate is located in Tuscany, a beautiful region where many couples go to have their perfect wedding. In Casa Matrimonio guests come together to celebrate love and life. A Tuscan Wedding is the apotheosis of everyone’s visit to the country side. And for some the villa is all too familiar as they return again and again: because some people only marry twice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPnGLMcRtXUuE98OPnB0oWv4kC6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242257'),
  ('302757266243457058', 'Tusk', 1980, 'Drama', 'Alejandro Jodorowsky, Jean-Jacques Flori, François Mimet', 'Alejandro Jodorowsky, Nicholas Niciphor, Jeffrey O''Kelly', 'Cyrielle Clair, Anton Diffring, Serge Merlin, Christopher Mitchum, Michel Peyrelon, Sukumar Anhana, B. Chandrasherkhra, Oriole Henry', null, 'An English girl and an Indian elephant, born on the same day, share a common destiny...', 'An English girl and an Indian elephant, born on the same day, share a common destiny...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xX5zsPZkygZ8GlbSd3STHVoNOxd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86942'),
  ('1132875366806604455', 'Tusk', 2014, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Kevin Smith, James Laxton, Alisa Fredericks', 'Kevin Smith', 'Michael Parks, Justin Long, Genesis Rodriguez, Haley Joel Osment, Johnny Depp, Harley Morenstein, Ralph Garman, Jennifer Schwalbach Smith', 'R', 'When his best friend and podcast co-host goes missing in the backwoods of Canada, a young guy joins forces with his friend''s girlfriend to search for him.', 'When his best friend and podcast co-host goes missing in the backwoods of Canada, a young guy joins forces with his friend''s girlfriend to search for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pA2SgITmH0lzet9Nn5cxeinRKMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246403'),
  ('853532366400342636', 'Tutor', 2018, 'Drama', 'Anton Kolomeets, Egor Kochubey', 'Anton Kolomeets', 'Nataliya Vdovina, Aleksey Sergeev, Anastasia Kuimova', null, 'The 17-year-old Savva is getting ready to enrol at university. His parents go on vacation, conferring the responsibility for preparing the entrance exams onto the son. Savva finds a foreign literature teacher on the Internet site “Your Tutor”.', 'The 17-year-old Savva is getting ready to enrol at university. His parents go on vacation, conferring the responsibility for preparing the entrance exams onto the son. Savva finds a foreign literature teacher on the Internet site “Your Tutor”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p94gslac5PnegZvKF0rp0ns5a40.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524318'),
