  ('278393110570597455', 'Tutta colpa della musica', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Ricky Tognazzi, Fabio Cianchetti', 'Leonardo Marini, Simona Izzo, Silvia Ebreul', 'Ricky Tognazzi, Marco Messeri, Elena Sofia Ricci, Stefania Sandrelli, Monica Scattini, Debora Villa, Arisa, Diego Casale', null, 'The Tuscan Giuseppe, after a lifetime spent working in a company in Biella, reaches the well-deserved retirement; but soon he is forced to confront the boredom of retired life.', 'The Tuscan Giuseppe, after a lifetime spent working in a company in Biella, reaches the well-deserved retirement; but soon he is forced to confront the boredom of retired life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/btaO1CCl5MMjZuakxi2UUumxiqv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82542'),
  ('171942471266741436', 'Tutta colpa di Freud', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Paolo Genovese, Matteo Albano, Luca Mezzaroma', 'Paolo Genovese', 'Marco Giallini, Vittoria Puccini, Anna Foglietta, Vinicio Marchioni, Laura Adriani, Daniele Liotti, Paolo Calabresi, Antonio Manzini', null, 'Francesco is a psychoanalyst grappling with three hopeless causes: a bookseller in love with a book thief, a lesbian hell-bent on becoming straight after a heartbreak, and an 18-year-old in a relationship with a much older married man. Unfortunately, these patients are also his three beloved daughters!', 'Francesco is a psychoanalyst grappling with three hopeless causes: a bookseller in love with a book thief, a lesbian hell-bent on becoming straight after a heartbreak, and an 18-year-old in a relationship with a much older married man. Unfortunately, these patients are also his three beloved daughters!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgXUIsEHYMpV1ROSYyMO6Ixtapa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250235'),
  ('341761579932709168', 'Tutta colpa di Giuda', 2009, 'Comedy, Music', 'Dante Cecchin, Davide Ferrario', 'Davide Ferrario', 'Kasia Smutniak, Fabio Troiano, Gianluca Gobbi, Cristiano Godano, Francesco Signa, Paolo Ciarchi, Luciana Littizzetto, Linda Messerklinger', null, 'A prison-set musical about a female theater director who sets up a reinterpretation of the Crucifixion.', 'A prison-set musical about a female theater director who sets up a reinterpretation of the Crucifixion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uipLKgm2jKRGjLvNFJHkEBzjUeJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57014'),
  ('262497739870558757', 'Tuttapposto', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Gianni Costantino', 'Roberto Lipari, Paolo Pintacuda, Ignazio Rosato', 'Roberto Lipari, Luca Zingaretti, Monica Guerritore, Paolo Sassanelli, Silvana Fallisi, Antonino Bruschetta, Viktoriya Pisotska, Sergio Friscia', null, 'Roberto is a student in a corrupt university where teachers sell exams and only hire friends and relatives.', 'Roberto is a student in a corrupt university where teachers sell exams and only hire friends and relatives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGJHBJfg9xF7TLpqOAj70oBPcel.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612501'),
  ('194015497729025981', 'Tutte le donne della mia vita', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Simona Izzo, Blasco Giurato', 'Simona Izzo, Graziano Diana, Alexandra La Capria', 'Luca Zingaretti, Vanessa Incontrada, Michela Cescon, Lisa Gastoni, Rosalinda Celentano, Ricky Tognazzi, Elena Bouryka, Jane Alexander', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJOGwKRPV7bVglUdxTHwyANIdPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43292'),
  ('336526032077017497', 'Tutte le mie notti', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gianluca Palma, Manfredi Lucibello, Maria Michela De Domenico', 'Giulia Rosa d''Amico', 'Barbora Bobuľová, Alessio Boni, Benedetta Porcaroli, Carolina Rey, Gianfilippo Grasso, Maria Laura Caselli', null, 'On an autumn night, in the deserted streets of a seaside town, Sara is fleeing from a party, convinced she has witnessed a murder. He finds refuge with Veronica, but does not know that the woman is the lawyer of an important industrialist, the alleged murderer.', 'On an autumn night, in the deserted streets of a seaside town, Sara is fleeing from a party, convinced she has witnessed a murder. He finds refuge with Veronica, but does not know that the woman is the lawyer of an important industrialist, the alleged murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hz5dbBHL2TFulsbFWxvliTD0TQR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589029'),
  ('834712106404182707', 'Tutti a squola', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Pier Francesco Pingitore', 'Pier Francesco Pingitore, Mario Castellacci', 'Pippo Franco, Laura Troschel, Oreste Lionello, Bombolo, Lino Banfi, Jack La Cayenne, Sergio Leonardi, Ester Carloni', null, 'The upright prof. Filippo Bottini Said Pippo is an "old-fashioned" teacher in a Roman school. He would like a Heart book-style school but clashes with the harsh reality of modern teaching and in particular with the turmoil of the seventies: strikes, occupations, armed students, feminist colleagues. Overwhelmed by events, he will find himself more and more in the maelstrom of the post-1968 protest until he becomes a drug courier. He will be arrested and incarcerated, but thanks to the release on bail provided by his colleague Lalla, with whom he had in the meantime started a relationship, he will be able to redeem himself.', 'The upright prof. Filippo Bottini Said Pippo is an "old-fashioned" teacher in a Roman school. He would like a Heart book-style school but clashes with the harsh reality of modern teaching and in particular with the turmoil of the seventies: strikes, occupations, armed students, feminist colleagues. Overwhelmed by events, he will find himself more and more in the maelstrom of the post-1968 protest until he becomes a drug courier. He will be arrested and incarcerated, but thanks to the release on bail provided by his colleague Lalla, with whom he had in the meantime started a relationship, he will be able to redeem himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6P5Dx5bfIZNYlI5h57kCvlcCpA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121750'),
  ('774206213323457362', 'Tutti gli uomini del deficiente', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Paolo Costella, Fabrizio Lucci, Andrea Usai', 'Marco Santin, Andrea Salvadore, Paolo Costella', 'Claudia Gerini, Paolo Hendel, Marina Massironi, Giovanni Esposito, Gigio Alberti, Fabio De Luigi, Maurizio Crozza, Ugo Dighero', null, 'Nearing death, videogame genius Leone Stella holds a contest to find an heir: several people named like him will compete in a live-streamed reenactment of his most famous exploits, and the winner will inherit his billion-dollar fortune.', 'Nearing death, videogame genius Leone Stella holds a contest to find an heir: several people named like him will compete in a live-streamed reenactment of his most famous exploits, and the winner will inherit his billion-dollar fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9eYrJp5Rcsl3dtJehOpNYLuMTQJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73649'),
  ('337233800971949174', 'Tutti per 1 - 1 per tutti', 2020, 'TV Movie, Adventure, Comedy', 'Tani Canevari, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Giovanni Veronesi, Ugo Chiti, Giulio Calvani', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Valerio Mastandrea, Rocco Papaleo, Giulia Michelini, Guido Caprino, Anna Ferzetti, Federico Ielapi, Sara Ciocca', null, 'Now without Aramis, the Musketeers embark on a new mission.', 'Now without Aramis, the Musketeers embark on a new mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PBmNXkiSskH6VzJ4FcmMH06QxK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:715869'),
  ('957592085697574718', 'Tutto l''amore che c''è', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paolo Carnera, Sergio Rubini', 'Domenico Starnone, Sergio Rubini', 'Damiano Russo, Michele Venitucci, Pierluigi Ferrandini, Celeste Pisenti, Vittoria Puccini, Alessandra Roveda, Teresa Saponangelo, Margherita Buy', null, 'The story takes place in an unspecified town in Apulia. We are in the ''70s. The arrival of three beautiful and uninhibited girls from the North, the daughters of an engineer who has moved to run a factory, brings the turmoil amongst the young people of the town. Stories of love, betrayals, state money (stolen) and broken promises intertwine. All through the eyes of Carlo (alter ego of the director Sergio Rubini), the youngest.', 'The story takes place in an unspecified town in Apulia. We are in the ''70s. The arrival of three beautiful and uninhibited girls from the North, the daughters of an engineer who has moved to run a factory, brings the turmoil amongst the young people of the town. Stories of love, betrayals, state money (stolen) and broken promises intertwine. All through the eyes of Carlo (alter ego of the director Sergio Rubini), the youngest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/396PT2KUnu4jxrWWF5mRGGXOvvV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58410'),
  ('973667931445922916', 'Tutto l''amore del mondo', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Riccardo Grandi, Francesca Polic Greco, Barbara Giordani', 'Massimiliano Bruno, Andrea Bassi, Edoardo Falcone', 'Nicolas Vaporidis, Ana Caterina Morariu, Alessandro Roja, Myriam Catania, Eros Galbiati, Mannarino, Joël Zaffarano, Sara Tommasi', null, 'Four friends to the discovery of the most fun and romantic of Europe: Barcelona, Paris, Amsterdam and finally Scotland. A road trip that will bring our protagonists to know each other better and to fall in love.', 'Four friends to the discovery of the most fun and romantic of Europe: Barcelona, Paris, Amsterdam and finally Scotland. A road trip that will bring our protagonists to know each other better and to fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNE6ix0dmNoiA6N5pwCJ4TbrDPB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41174'),
  ('1073362638667999694', 'Tutto molto bello', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Paolo Ruffini, Federico Masiero, Gianluca Mazzella', 'Giovanni Bognetti, Paolo Ruffini, Guido Chiesa', 'Paolo Ruffini, Frank Matano, Gianluca Fubelli, Nina Seničar, Ahmed Hafiene, Angelo Pintus, Chiara Francini, Pupo', null, 'Antonio and Giuseppe meet at the hospital, while awaiting the birth of their respective first children. The two leave together for a quick lunch, ending up involved against their will in an odyssey of amusing setbacks and bizarre characters.', 'Antonio and Giuseppe meet at the hospital, while awaiting the birth of their respective first children. The two leave together for a quick lunch, ending up involved against their will in an odyssey of amusing setbacks and bizarre characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10z4SulW7Yo9oc0vg4dhpu8GLre.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296727'),
  ('667836655390977064', 'TuttoBenigni 95/96', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Benigni, Roberto Forges Davanzati, Roberto Benigni', 'Roberto Benigni, Vincenzo Cerami', 'Roberto Benigni', null, 'One laugh after another, a sparkle of jokes. In the live performance of the 95/96 season Benigni presents the program of his "Partito del Pinzimonio". A torrent of joy. From the Electoral Reform to the reform of the Ten Commandments until Benigni becomes God, gets angry looking at Italy and proclaims the anticipated Last Judgement. No one can miss the roll call: Berlusconi, Craxi, D''Alema, Prodi, Ferrara, Bossi, Fini, Sgarbi, Buttiglione... Benigni''s is a terrible God, except that at each of his judgements all humanity gathered in the valley of Giosafat bursts into a thunderous laughter. Justice is done!', 'One laugh after another, a sparkle of jokes. In the live performance of the 95/96 season Benigni presents the program of his "Partito del Pinzimonio". A torrent of joy. From the Electoral Reform to the reform of the Ten Commandments until Benigni becomes God, gets angry looking at Italy and proclaims the anticipated Last Judgement. No one can miss the roll call: Berlusconi, Craxi, D''Alema, Prodi, Ferrara, Bossi, Fini, Sgarbi, Buttiglione... Benigni''s is a terrible God, except that at each of his judgements all humanity gathered in the valley of Giosafat bursts into a thunderous laughter. Justice is done!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VTfmgdUAoCVoa59s9XDq7lagsO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454010'),
  ('1074611260765595019', 'Tuvalu', 1999, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy, Science Fiction, Romance, Family', 'Veit Helmer, Emil Hristow, Emil Christov', 'Veit Helmer, Lyudmila Merdzhanska', 'Denis Lavant, Philippe Clay, Terrence Gillespie, E.J. Callahan, Djoko Rosic, Cătălina Murgea, Todor Georgiev, Chulpan Khamatova', null, 'Set in a dilapidated indoor swimming pool (the Central Baths in Sofia), the film details the efforts of Anton, a clueless dreamer who yearns to sail the world, and Martha, the button obsessed cashier, to maintain the illusion for Anton''s blind father that business is thriving. Working to sabotage their efforts is Gregor - Anton''s brother - an amoral developer who is determined to raze the entire town and construct a sprawling condominium complex. Gregor engineers an accident that seems certain to doom the business and in the process steals away Eva, the beautiful woman of Anton''s dreams. Will Gregor''s dastardly plan succeed?', 'Set in a dilapidated indoor swimming pool (the Central Baths in Sofia), the film details the efforts of Anton, a clueless dreamer who yearns to sail the world, and Martha, the button obsessed cashier, to maintain the illusion for Anton''s blind father that business is thriving. Working to sabotage their efforts is Gregor - Anton''s brother - an amoral developer who is determined to raze the entire town and construct a sprawling condominium complex. Gregor engineers an accident that seems certain to doom the business and in the process steals away Eva, the beautiful woman of Anton''s dreams. Will Gregor''s dastardly plan succeed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnxJMNExjZmAdvfWOQ3L79QLb7l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8076'),
  ('1053974679350123019', 'Tuya''s Marriage', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lutz Reitemeier, Wang Quan''an', 'Wang Quan''an, Lu Wei', 'Yu Nan, Bater, Sen''ge, Zhaya', null, 'Set in Inner Mongolia, a physical setback causes a young woman to choose a suitor who can take care of her, as well as her disabled husband.', 'Set in Inner Mongolia, a physical setback causes a young woman to choose a suitor who can take care of her, as well as her disabled husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iT2bH6GmNidi5K3z65G7TnvuVWY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2694'),
  ('540269897087344001', 'Tweet Tweet Tweety', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Sylvester Cat leaves a trailer in a National Forest Camping Ground to go bird hunting and discovers an egg in a nest. Sylvester decides to sit on the egg to hatch it, and when it hatches, out crawls Tweety Bird! Sylvester chases Tweety into a geyser and down a river in a boat toward a waterfall.', 'Sylvester Cat leaves a trailer in a National Forest Camping Ground to go bird hunting and discovers an egg in a nest. Sylvester decides to sit on the egg to hatch it, and when it hatches, out crawls Tweety Bird! Sylvester chases Tweety into a geyser and down a river in a boat toward a waterfall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/voT2ZzVzKwnjshiNcS2yvOMi3IL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162303'),
  ('616178576191386959', 'Tweet Zoo', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, null, null, 'Sylvester Cat joins a tour group through the City Zoo and finds Tweety Bird among the exhibits. Sylvester chases Tweety and ends up in a bear''s den.', 'Sylvester Cat joins a tour group through the City Zoo and finds Tweety Bird among the exhibits. Sylvester chases Tweety and ends up in a bear''s den.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwrgH3cUA1N88nm11NbziC2BKMW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235022'),
  ('75056422216618891', 'Tweetie Pie', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', 'NR', 'Thomas the cat finds Tweetie in the snow, warming himself by a cigar butt. Thomas''s mistress rescues the little yellow bird before her cat can devour him, but Thomas doesn''t give up.', 'Thomas the cat finds Tweetie in the snow, warming himself by a cigar butt. Thomas''s mistress rescues the little yellow bird before her cat can devour him, but Thomas doesn''t give up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1x7zlXdPdMMUs1q7b9WNnl5fi0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88768'),
  ('527586857968993146', 'Tweety and the Beanstalk', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, June Foray', null, 'Jack''s mother throws Jack''s magic beans outside under Sylvester Cat''s sleeping box, and the cat is whisked to the world above, where he finds a huge Tweety Bird in the castle of the legendary Giant.', 'Jack''s mother throws Jack''s magic beans outside under Sylvester Cat''s sleeping box, and the cat is whisked to the world above, where he finds a huge Tweety Bird in the castle of the legendary Giant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0drS4FcRbHfCL9r04Qk2gLlTo4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235027'),
  ('2593764662397963', 'Tweety''s Circus', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng, Milt Franklyn', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Sylvester Cat pays a visit to a closed-to-business circus and finds Tweety Bird in one of the cages. Tweety escapes and a mad chase ensues. Meanwhile, Sylvester must flee from an uncaged lion he angered earlier.', 'Sylvester Cat pays a visit to a closed-to-business circus and finds Tweety Bird in one of the cages. Tweety escapes and a mad chase ensues. Meanwhile, Sylvester must flee from an uncaged lion he angered earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iiYDeTjrFLQ5rrJ33Fk8G2pLRqZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235560'),
  ('398261994569897333', 'Tweety''s High Flying Adventure', 2000, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Charles Visser, Karl Toerge, James T. Walker', 'Timothy Cahill, Julie McNally Cahill, Tom Minton', 'Joe Alaskey, Jeff Bennett, Julie Bernstein, Jim Cummings, June Foray, Stan Freberg, T''Keyah Crystal Keymáh, Elizabeth Lamers', 'NR', 'A full-length animated feature starring the little yellow bird. When Col. Rimfire announces at the Looney Club his belief that cats are the most intelligent animals, Granny, hoping to raise enough money to save a nearby children''s park, makes a wager that her Tweety can fly around the world in 80 days, collecting the pawprints of 80 cats in the process. Sylvester, still hoping to make Tweety his personal snack, is incensed at the thought of some other cat getting the little bird first and vows to follow Tweety around the world and catch the canary himself.', 'A full-length animated feature starring the little yellow bird. When Col. Rimfire announces at the Looney Club his belief that cats are the most intelligent animals, Granny, hoping to raise enough money to save a nearby children''s park, makes a wager that her Tweety can fly around the world in 80 days, collecting the pawprints of 80 cats in the process. Sylvester, still hoping to make Tweety his personal snack, is incensed at the thought of some other cat getting the little bird first and vows to follow Tweety around the world and catch the canary himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZH3zVisuVAg6Krx3V1i4JVo9rN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89473'),
  ('583924442136847680', 'Tweety''s S.O.S.', 1951, 'Animation', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', 'NR', 'Sylvester Cat stows away aboard a seagoing passenger liner to try and catch Tweety Bird, who is guarded by his mistress, Granny. Sylvester becomes seasick and runs to the sickbay for a remedy. Tweety mixes nitro into the medicine before Sylvester drinks it. When Granny hits Sylvester with her broom, he is blown sky-high.', 'Sylvester Cat stows away aboard a seagoing passenger liner to try and catch Tweety Bird, who is guarded by his mistress, Granny. Sylvester becomes seasick and runs to the sickbay for a remedy. Tweety mixes nitro into the medicine before Sylvester drinks it. When Granny hits Sylvester with her broom, he is blown sky-high.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLNxa3GHR4bIO7gg5WvolBs0FAH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100384'),
  ('235832899087822910', 'Twelfth Night', 1955, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Yan Frid, A. Abramov, Yevgeni Shapiro', 'Yan Frid', 'Klara Luchko, Alla Larionova, Vadim Medvedev, Mikhail Yanshin, Georgiy Vitsin, Vasili Merkuryev, Bruno Frejndlikh, Anna Lisyanskaya', null, 'Shakespeare''s comedy of gender confusion, in which a girl disguises herself as a man to be near the count she adores, only to be pursued by the woman he loves.', 'Shakespeare''s comedy of gender confusion, in which a girl disguises herself as a man to be near the count she adores, only to be pursued by the woman he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTzPDFxSOLTXr3SpUrTGmBnO82S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28086'),
  ('565401837232605371', 'Twelfth Night', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Trevor Nunn, Steve Tickner, Rebecca Holmes', 'Trevor Nunn', 'Helena Bonham Carter, Richard E. Grant, Nigel Hawthorne, Ben Kingsley, Mel Smith, Imelda Staunton, Toby Stephens, Imogen Stubbs', 'PG', 'Shakespeare''s comedy of gender confusion, in which a girl disguises herself as a man to be near the count she adores, only to be pursued by the woman he loves.', 'Shakespeare''s comedy of gender confusion, in which a girl disguises herself as a man to be near the count she adores, only to be pursued by the woman he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMvHIh50LqWJxUK26eYWV10epdq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44705'),
  ('1142271016255760928', 'Twelve', 2010, 'Thriller, Drama, Action, Crime', 'Joel Schumacher, Steven Fierberg, Steve Apicella', 'Jordan Melamed', 'Chace Crawford, Rory Culkin, 50 Cent, Emily Meade, Emma Roberts, Billy Magnussen, Esti Ginzburg, Jeremy Allen White', 'R', 'A young drug dealer watches as his high-rolling life is dismantled in the wake of his cousin''s murder, which sees his best friend arrested for the crime.', 'A young drug dealer watches as his high-rolling life is dismantled in the wake of his cousin''s murder, which sees his best friend arrested for the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGcoACE6AQQWekvHMr4TVd5KOpH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40720'),
  ('394322205398756419', 'Twelve Angry Men', 1954, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Franklin J. Schaffner', 'Reginald Rose', 'Robert Cummings, Franchot Tone, Edward Arnold, Paul Hartman, John Beal, Walter Abel, George Voskovec, Joseph Sweeney', null, 'Twelve Angry Men is a 1954 teleplay by Reginald Rose for the Studio One anthology television series. Initially staged as a CBS live production on 20 September 1954, the drama was later rewritten for the stage in 1955 under the same title and again for a feature film, 12 Angry Men (1957). The episode garnered three Emmy Awards for writer Rose, director Franklin Schaffner and Robert Cummings as Best Actor.', 'Twelve Angry Men is a 1954 teleplay by Reginald Rose for the Studio One anthology television series. Initially staged as a CBS live production on 20 September 1954, the drama was later rewritten for the stage in 1955 under the same title and again for a feature film, 12 Angry Men (1957). The episode garnered three Emmy Awards for writer Rose, director Franklin Schaffner and Robert Cummings as Best Actor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEeQ1RlgpbAp3rEQ9x8CQTVUKW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269981'),
  ('384462091224816241', 'Twelve Hours to Live', 1950, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Luigi Zampa, Carlo Montuori', 'Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Vitaliano Brancati, Diego Fabbri', 'Jean Gabin, Elli Parvo, Antonella Lualdi, Paola Borboni, Carlo Sposito, Elena Altieri, Maso Lotti, Bella Starace Sainati', null, 'After dying in a car accident, wealthy shoe industrialist Carlo Bacchi finds himself in the afterlife, where he is condemned to hell for having committed evil while alive. Defending himself against the accusation in an impassioned plea, however, he succeeds in obtaining to return to earth for a few hours to make reparation for the evil he committed and, above all, for the bad deed that caused Amedeo Santini''s suicide attempt. The affair will lead him to make a risky but happy choice.', 'After dying in a car accident, wealthy shoe industrialist Carlo Bacchi finds himself in the afterlife, where he is condemned to hell for having committed evil while alive. Defending himself against the accusation in an impassioned plea, however, he succeeds in obtaining to return to earth for a few hours to make reparation for the evil he committed and, above all, for the bad deed that caused Amedeo Santini''s suicide attempt. The affair will lead him to make a risky but happy choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2P4eDHIGx6KwNYT1d8OasE6QM3y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144780'),
  ('78352337111492035', 'Twelve Mile Road', 2003, 'Drama', 'Richard Friedenberg, Robin Loewen', null, 'Tom Selleck, Maggie Grace, Wendy Crewson, Anna Gunn, Patrick John Flueger, Tegan Moss', null, 'A divorced farmer takes in his troubled teenage daughter for the summer, a summer which changes the lives of the two of them, and their friends and family.', 'A divorced farmer takes in his troubled teenage daughter for the summer, a summer which changes the lives of the two of them, and their friends and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zg69vYeXIR6mNZokj2Pudt5NTVB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31078'),
  ('174247763779012666', 'Twelve Monkeys', 1995, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery', 'Terry Gilliam, Roger Pratt, Tim Galvin', 'Chris Marker', 'Bruce Willis, Madeleine Stowe, Brad Pitt, Christopher Plummer, David Morse, Jon Seda, Christopher Meloni, Joey Perillo', 'R', 'In the year 2035, convict James Cole reluctantly volunteers to be sent back in time to discover the origin of a deadly virus that wiped out nearly all of the earth''s population and forced the survivors into underground communities. But when Cole is mistakenly sent to 1990 instead of 1996, he''s arrested and locked up in a mental hospital. There he meets psychiatrist Dr. Kathryn Railly and the son of a famous virus expert who may hold the key to the Army of the 12 Monkeys; thought to be responsible for unleashing the killer disease.', 'In the year 2035, convict James Cole reluctantly volunteers to be sent back in time to discover the origin of a deadly virus that wiped out nearly all of the earth''s population and forced the survivors into underground communities. But when Cole is mistakenly sent to 1990 instead of 1996, he''s arrested and locked up in a mental hospital. There he meets psychiatrist Dr. Kathryn Railly and the son of a famous virus expert who may hold the key to the Army of the 12 Monkeys; thought to be responsible for unleashing the killer disease.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gt3iyguaCIw8DpQZI1LIN5TohM2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63'),
  ('285896552687225439', 'Twelve Months', 1980, 'Fantasy, Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Kimio Yabuki, Yugo Serikawa, Tetsuo Imazawa', 'Kimio Yabuki, Yasuko Miyazaki', 'Shinobu Otake, Ai Kanzaki, Tokuko Sugiyama, Mariko Mukai, Ichiro Nagai, Masashi Amenomori, Daisuke Ryū, Kiyoshi Kobayashi', null, 'A young queen requests a bouquet of snowdrop flowers for New Year''s Day in exchange for a reward. One greedy woman sends her stepdaughter, whom she does not like, to look for the flowers in a cold forest, knowing the task will be impossible for her. The girl almost freezes to death in the forest, but she is rescued by the spirits of the Twelve Months, who create spring around her. The girl is able to deliver the bouquet to the queen, but others want a share of the reward.', 'A young queen requests a bouquet of snowdrop flowers for New Year''s Day in exchange for a reward. One greedy woman sends her stepdaughter, whom she does not like, to look for the flowers in a cold forest, knowing the task will be impossible for her. The girl almost freezes to death in the forest, but she is rescued by the spirits of the Twelve Months, who create spring around her. The girl is able to deliver the bouquet to the queen, but others want a share of the reward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHO2YGaeBtMD1LMRdoSwNy9ibkj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80536'),
  ('520205927113270442', 'Twelve Nights', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Cheng Siu-Keung, Aubrey Lam Oi-Wah', 'Aubrey Lam Oi-Wah', 'Eason Chan Yik-Shun, Cecilia Cheung, Candy Lo Hau-Yam, Ronald Cheng Chung-Kei, Stephen Fung, Nicola Cheung Sun-Yuet, Vincci Cheuk Wan-Chi, Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung', null, 'This movie goes through 12 significant nights (not consecutive nights) in a relationship between two characters. The movie offers some insight into the repetion involved in relationship cycles from interest through various tensions to eventual disinterest.', 'This movie goes through 12 significant nights (not consecutive nights) in a relationship between two characters. The movie offers some insight into the repetion involved in relationship cycles from interest through various tensions to eventual disinterest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0lTrITLCj4JCzgQJh7yYUZYd1h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45488'),
  ('1129968045877693801', 'Twelve O''Clock High', 1949, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Henry King, Leon Shamroy', 'Beirne Lay Jr., Sy Bartlett', 'Gregory Peck, Hugh Marlowe, Gary Merrill, Millard Mitchell, Dean Jagger, Robert Arthur, Paul Stewart, John Kellogg', 'NR', 'In the early days of daylight bombing raids over Germany, General Frank Savage must take command of a ''hard luck'' bomber group. Much of the story deals with his struggle to whip his group into a disciplined fighting unit in spite of heavy losses, and withering attacks by German fighters over their targets.', 'In the early days of daylight bombing raids over Germany, General Frank Savage must take command of a ''hard luck'' bomber group. Much of the story deals with his struggle to whip his group into a disciplined fighting unit in spite of heavy losses, and withering attacks by German fighters over their targets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9VeQUobhofLwxSIbKM4ia5biAX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15497'),
  ('840387761880167886', 'Twelve Plus One', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Giuseppe Ruzzolini, Nicolas Gessner', 'Antonio Altoviti, Marc Behm, Lucia Drudi Demby', 'Sharon Tate, Vittorio Gassman, Orson Welles, Vittorio De Sica, Terry-Thomas, Ottavia Piccolo, Mylène Demongeot, William Rushton', 'R', 'Mario, a young philanderer, receives 13 antique chairs in a bad state by inheritance and decides to sell off them to get some money. Afterwards he gets to know that one of them contains documents worth a lot of money. So he begins an adventurous trip to regain possession of the chair. On the way he meets many strange people who would like to help or to swindle him.', 'Mario, a young philanderer, receives 13 antique chairs in a bad state by inheritance and decides to sell off them to get some money. Afterwards he gets to know that one of them contains documents worth a lot of money. So he begins an adventurous trip to regain possession of the chair. On the way he meets many strange people who would like to help or to swindle him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Q2A6xGWgx7l1ZcTo3HS07oRU2F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3004'),
  ('802765311731711461', 'Twelve Thousand', 2020, 'Drama', 'Nadège Trébal, Jean Christophe Beauvallet, Nicolas Aubry', 'Nadège Trébal', 'Arieh Worthalter, Nadège Trébal, Liv Henneguier, Françoise Lebrun, Florence Thomassin, Juliette Augier Crespin, Théo Cholbi, Taha Lemaizi', null, 'While he loses his clandestine work, and because he believes that Maroussia and him will no longer be able to love each other as well, Frank leaves to earn as much as she: twelve thousand, just what it takes to have a year before them. No more no less.', 'While he loses his clandestine work, and because he believes that Maroussia and him will no longer be able to love each other as well, Frank leaves to earn as much as she: twelve thousand, just what it takes to have a year before them. No more no less.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRkHgPF7FmZfSj5yuaWi9sH11PZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616214'),
  ('105530915203979925', 'Twentieth Century', 1934, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Howard Hawks, Louis Silvers, Joseph H. August', 'Preston Sturges', 'John Barrymore, Carole Lombard, Walter Connolly, Roscoe Karns, Ralph Forbes, Charles Lane, Etienne Girardot, Dale Fuller', 'NR', 'A temperamental Broadway producer trains an untutored actress, but when she becomes a star, she proves a match for him.', 'A temperamental Broadway producer trains an untutored actress, but when she becomes a star, she proves a match for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHZcuD5pEoyoNHqeTEUEyDEDVKi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31835'),
  ('458827764307710750', 'Twenty', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lee Byeong-hoon, Kim Hye-young, Lee Byeong-heon', 'Lee Byeong-heon', 'Kim Woo-bin, Lee Jun-ho, Kang Ha-neul, Jung So-min, Lee Yu-bi, Min Hyo-rin, Ahn Jae-hong, Heo Joon-seok', null, 'A story about three friends who just turned twenty; an age where you can do whatever you want, love whoever you want with opportunities abroad.', 'A story about three friends who just turned twenty; an age where you can do whatever you want, love whoever you want with opportunities abroad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gbSJNW1g4cSUJJr3SN1TFa6xZt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331251'),
  ('728790636094227985', 'Twenty 20', 2008, 'Action, Romance', 'Joshiy, P. Sukumar', 'Siby K Thomas, Uday Krishna', 'Mohanlal, Mammootty, Suresh Gopi, Jayaram, Dileep, Gopika, Indrajith Sukumaran, Bhavana', null, 'Advocate Ramesh saves Devan from a murder case. Later, he realize Devan was the actual culprit. Ramesh tries for a payback, unaware of Devan''s real intentions and the reason for the murder.', 'Advocate Ramesh saves Devan from a murder case. Later, he realize Devan was the actual culprit. Ramesh tries for a payback, unaware of Devan''s real intentions and the reason for the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHODrsDLe8lfApNndIkhLSmDqlI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84967'),
  ('636477512256560386', 'Twenty Bucks', 1993, 'Drama', 'Keva Rosenfeld, Emmanuel Lubezki', 'Leslie Bohem, Endre Bohem', 'Linda Hunt, David Rasche, George Morfogen, Sam Sorbo, Brendan Fraser, Bubba Baker, Rosemary Murphy, Concetta Tomei', 'R', 'A story about the life of a twenty dollar bill as it weaves in and out of the various lives of several people.', 'A story about the life of a twenty dollar bill as it weaves in and out of the various lives of several people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAZxoG13a8nGTQ5jrs7xzz0t59b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50536'),
  ('34205487879948520', 'Twenty Days Without War', 1976, 'War, Drama', 'Valery Fedosov, Aleksei German, Viktor Aristov', 'Konstantin Simonov', 'Yuriy Nikulin, Lyudmila Gurchenko, Aleksey Petrenko, Angelina Stepanova, Mikhail Kononov, Yekaterina Vasilyeva, Mykola Hrynko, Lyusyena Ovchinnikova', null, 'War correspondent Lopatin takes a 20-day-leave from his hard work at the front in 1942. He travels to faraway Tashkent to meet the family of the killed soldier and visit the film set of the screen adaptation of his war-time stories. Lopatin also manages to walk the streets of Tashkent, take part in a factory workers'' meeting and have a short-lived love affair. Although with no bombings and fighting, the city dwellers breathe the atmosphere of the ongoing war.', 'War correspondent Lopatin takes a 20-day-leave from his hard work at the front in 1942. He travels to faraway Tashkent to meet the family of the killed soldier and visit the film set of the screen adaptation of his war-time stories. Lopatin also manages to walk the streets of Tashkent, take part in a factory workers'' meeting and have a short-lived love affair. Although with no bombings and fighting, the city dwellers breathe the atmosphere of the ongoing war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdz202bmB7UrqwJcI5bv5IGOyoT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133008'),
  ('179311163969960100', 'Twenty Six Days in the Life of Dostoevsky', 1981, 'Romance, History', 'Vladimir Klimov, Aleksandr Zarkhi, Evgeniy Fyodorov', 'Pavel Finn, Vladimir Vaynshtok', 'Anatoliy Solonitsyn, Yevgeniya Simonova, Ewa Szykulska, Yuri Katin-Yartsev, Nikolai Denisov, Yelena Kononenko, Yuri Medvedev, Vladimir Pitsek', null, 'Twenty-Six Days in the Life of Dostoyevsky was entered on February 16th at the 1981 Berlin Film Festival to commemorate the 100th anniversary of Dostoyevsky''s death on February 9th, 1881, and won a "Best Actor" award for Anatoly Solonitsyn as Dostoyevsky. Solonitsyn was a favorite actor in Andrei Tarkovsky''s films, and this was to be his penultimate role. This brief imaginary period in the famed Russian writer''s life encapsulates one of his darker moments in 1866. At that time he was still a relatively unknown writer whose first widely acclaimed work, Crime and Punishment, was just on the horizon. His life was at a very low ebb as he struggled with debts he could not pay, and as he fought depression over the loss of his wife to tuberculosis, and the death of his brother, who was very close to him. His first literary journal had to be scrapped because of political reasons, and the second venture needed funding.', 'Twenty-Six Days in the Life of Dostoyevsky was entered on February 16th at the 1981 Berlin Film Festival to commemorate the 100th anniversary of Dostoyevsky''s death on February 9th, 1881, and won a "Best Actor" award for Anatoly Solonitsyn as Dostoyevsky. Solonitsyn was a favorite actor in Andrei Tarkovsky''s films, and this was to be his penultimate role. This brief imaginary period in the famed Russian writer''s life encapsulates one of his darker moments in 1866. At that time he was still a relatively unknown writer whose first widely acclaimed work, Crime and Punishment, was just on the horizon. His life was at a very low ebb as he struggled with debts he could not pay, and as he fought depression over the loss of his wife to tuberculosis, and the death of his brother, who was very close to him. His first literary journal had to be scrapped because of political reasons, and the second venture needed funding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFWRHCmdvCO1IdERJX9yaO8bt3B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263568'),
  ('441690335062804136', 'Twenty Something', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Aphton Corbin, Andrew Jimenez', 'Aphton Corbin', 'Kaylin Price, Ariana Brown, Aliyah Taylor, Janelle Lasalle, Napoleon Highbrou', 'PG', 'Follows Gia, who has to deal with the challenges and insecurities of "adulting" during her 21st birthday.', 'Follows Gia, who has to deal with the challenges and insecurities of "adulting" during her 21st birthday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLaGPqNxhkxkzEqPd6hb58FB8t4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852719'),
  ('597421418523514220', 'Twenty Something Taipei', 2002, 'Romance', 'Leon Dai', null, 'Stanley Huang, Cheryl Yang, Chou Heng-Yin, Jack Kao, Su Chaobin', null, 'In the Taiwanese capital of Taipei, the taboo of sex is racing through everyone''s minds: a kindergarten teacher is a party animal at night, a sex-addicted hairstylist seduces anyone she can, a cyber angel hungers for various sexual relationships, and a lesbian swears to protect the women of the world. In their lives the questions of sex, love, and the game of romance plays through their minds, but will the answers ever come?', 'In the Taiwanese capital of Taipei, the taboo of sex is racing through everyone''s minds: a kindergarten teacher is a party animal at night, a sex-addicted hairstylist seduces anyone she can, a cyber angel hungers for various sexual relationships, and a lesbian swears to protect the women of the world. In their lives the questions of sex, love, and the game of romance plays through their minds, but will the answers ever come?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A43djfTIdiphl3NHZfnESdi7vRQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254162'),
  ('312795558576924852', 'Twenty Two', 2017, 'History, Documentary', 'Cai Tao, Guo Ke', 'Su Zhiliang', 'Wei Shaolan, Luo Shanxue', 'NR', 'Follow the lives of the elderly survivors who were forced into sex slavery as “Comfort Women” by the Japanese during World War II. At the time of filming, only 22 of these women were still alive to tell their story. Through their own personal histories and perspectives, they tell a tale that should never be forgotten to generations unaware of the brutalization that occurred.', 'Follow the lives of the elderly survivors who were forced into sex slavery as “Comfort Women” by the Japanese during World War II. At the time of filming, only 22 of these women were still alive to tell their story. Through their own personal histories and perspectives, they tell a tale that should never be forgotten to generations unaware of the brutalization that occurred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ood5g0qHtWDyoGFhkuVwOQdz6ib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473267'),
  ('48022914276373378', 'Twenty Years Later', 1984, 'Documentary, History', 'Eduardo Coutinho, Vladimir Carvalho, Fernando Duarte', 'Eduardo Coutinho', 'Eduardo Coutinho, Elizabeth Teixeira, Ferreira Gullar, Tite de Lemos, Eduardo Escorel', null, 'Eduardo Coutinho was filming a movie with the same name in the Northeast of Brazil, in 1964, when there came the military coup. He had to interrupt the project, and came back to it in 1981, looking for the same places and people, showing what had ocurred since then, and trying to gather a family whose patriarch, a political leader fighting for rights of country people, had been murdered.', 'Eduardo Coutinho was filming a movie with the same name in the Northeast of Brazil, in 1964, when there came the military coup. He had to interrupt the project, and came back to it in 1981, looking for the same places and people, showing what had ocurred since then, and trying to gather a family whose patriarch, a political leader fighting for rights of country people, had been murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gqLIvOGAUQOIQh6PEbkL6yz00Ch.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86320'),
  ('61598565488027802', 'Twenty-Four Dollar Island', 1927, 'Documentary', 'Robert Flaherty, Robert Flaherty', null, null, null, 'A visual celebration of Manhattan and its waterways on the 300th anniversary of purchase from the local Native Americans.', 'A visual celebration of Manhattan and its waterways on the 300th anniversary of purchase from the local Native Americans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQ08VX39i35VvwOevNjdGxI3FAH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189473'),
  ('350183125498646496', 'Twenty-Four Eyes', 1954, 'Drama', 'Keisuke Kinoshita, Hiroshi Kusuda, Yoshiro Kawazu', 'Keisuke Kinoshita', 'Hideko Takamine, Hideki Gôko, Itsuo Watanabe, Makoto Miyagawa, Takeo Terashita, Kunio Satô, Chishū Ryū, Yumeji Tsukioka', null, 'From 1928 to 1946, the lives of 12 young people and their school teacher in a poor Japanese village are profoundly affected by historical events and personal circumstances.', 'From 1928 to 1946, the lives of 12 young people and their school teacher in a poor Japanese village are profoundly affected by historical events and personal circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHV1b64e42LCYMGUwxSZWPPcuEE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43339'),
  ('611800640232645521', 'Twenty-One', 1991, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Don Boyd, Keith Goddard', 'Zoë Heller, Don Boyd', 'Patsy Kensit, Jack Shepherd, Rufus Sewell, Sophie Thompson, Maynard Eziashi, Robert Bathurst, Patrick Ryecart', null, 'Katie is a free spirited independently minded 21-year-old. The film follows her as she reflects on the men in her life. Along the way we meet her drug addict boyfriend Bobby, her lover Jack, close friend Baldy, and her father.', 'Katie is a free spirited independently minded 21-year-old. The film follows her as she reflects on the men in her life. Along the way we meet her drug addict boyfriend Bobby, her lover Jack, close friend Baldy, and her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6uA7vcbpYHR3F4bBuXdE9uqBC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190780'),
  ('726156370383970440', 'TwentyFourSeven', 1998, 'Drama', 'Shane Meadows, Ashley Rowe', 'Shane Meadows, Paul Fraser', 'Bob Hoskins, Danny Nussbaum, Bruce Jones, Annette Badland, Frank Harper, Darren O. Campbell, Karl Collins, Justin Brady', 'R', 'In a typical English working-class town, the juveniles have nothing more to do than hang around in gangs. One day, Alan Darcy, a highly motivated man with the same kind of youth experience, starts trying to get the young people off the street and into doing something they can believe in: Boxing. Darcy opens a boxing club, aiming to bring the rival gangs together.', 'In a typical English working-class town, the juveniles have nothing more to do than hang around in gangs. One day, Alan Darcy, a highly motivated man with the same kind of youth experience, starts trying to get the young people off the street and into doing something they can believe in: Boxing. Darcy opens a boxing club, aiming to bring the rival gangs together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5rd7ljbR0VVcK7m2ogrMa4E0fE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22913'),
  ('611774452962673044', 'Twentynine Palms', 2003, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Bruno Dumont, Georges Lechaptois', 'Bruno Dumont', 'Yekaterina Golubeva, David Wissak', 'NR', 'A photographer and an unemployed woman embark on a chaotic trip to the California desert for a photo shoot, filled with passionate encounters and frequent fights. Their seemingly empty relationship takes a dark turn when a brutal incident abruptly ends their journey.', 'A photographer and an unemployed woman embark on a chaotic trip to the California desert for a photo shoot, filled with passionate encounters and frequent fights. Their seemingly empty relationship takes a dark turn when a brutal incident abruptly ends their journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5JeGg69UPpgwakBeKrA7uaAoaf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26636'),
  ('945494312242640589', 'Twice', 2018, 'Drama', 'Domenico Onorato', 'Valentina Gamna', 'Francesco Aricò, Salvatore Alfano, Cristina Cappelli', null, 'Diego is 17 and is full of life, yet fragile. His best friend Antonio knows and indulges his weaknesses, but he would also like to see him strong and masculine. One night they meet Maria, a breezy natural beauty. To show that he is a ''real man'', Diego, is ready to do anything, even to force himself to do things he would never have wanted to do.', 'Diego is 17 and is full of life, yet fragile. His best friend Antonio knows and indulges his weaknesses, but he would also like to see him strong and masculine. One night they meet Maria, a breezy natural beauty. To show that he is a ''real man'', Diego, is ready to do anything, even to force himself to do things he would never have wanted to do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOlapXvs1MW09gocKSmAAgW9Ji1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636220'),
  ('1016723424713311440', 'Twice a Judas', 1968, 'Western', 'Nando Cicero, Francisco Marín', 'Jaime Jesús Balcázar', 'Antonio Sabàto, Klaus Kinski, José Calvo, Franco Leo, Cristina Galbó, Linda Sini, Narciso Ibáñez Menta, Franco Beltramme', null, 'Luke Barrett, having lost his memory due to an accident, does not realize that Dingus had killed his wife and brother to take possession of the Barretts'' land and money. At first Luke trusts him, but while looking for his forgotten identity he discovers the truth.', 'Luke Barrett, having lost his memory due to an accident, does not realize that Dingus had killed his wife and brother to take possession of the Barretts'' land and money. At first Luke trusts him, but while looking for his forgotten identity he discovers the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7fuFmFXsqEUXTnjoCJVHcTTUIA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102953'),
  ('843105824449409460', 'Twice a Man', 1963, 'Drama', 'Gregory J. Markopoulos, Charles Levine', 'Gregory J. Markopoulos', 'Paul Kilb, Olympia Dukakis, Violet Roditi, Albert Torgessen', null, 'A reworking of the myth of Hippolytus, in which a chaste youth rejects the incestuous advances of his mother and is saved from death by a caring physician.', 'A reworking of the myth of Hippolytus, in which a chaste youth rejects the incestuous advances of his mother and is saved from death by a caring physician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZjFf1p4YGlviJ8Gsoh7RXUuyTZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126539'),
  ('643740717572818663', 'Twice a Woman', 1979, 'Drama, Romance', 'George Sluizer, Mat van Hensbergen, Jurriën Rood', 'George Sluizer, Jurriën Rood', 'Bibi Andersson, Anthony Perkins, Sandra Dumas, Kitty Courbois, Tilly Perin-Bouwmeester, Astrid Weyman, Sarah Godbold, Charles Gormley', null, 'When a divorced museum director takes a young girl as a lover things quickly become more complicated when her ex-husband also engages in a relationship with the girl.', 'When a divorced museum director takes a young girl as a lover things quickly become more complicated when her ex-husband also engages in a relationship with the girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rILTQRvzJwcLrBcCqeigstAuAJj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89366'),
  ('869822713016543879', 'Twice Born', 2012, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Sergio Castellitto, Gian Filippo Corticelli', 'Sergio Castellitto', 'Penélope Cruz, Emile Hirsch, Adnan Hasković, Saadet Işıl Aksoy, Pietro Castellitto, Mira Furlan, Jovan Divjak, Vinicio Marchioni', 'R', 'Full-throttle melodrama about an ill-starred romance set against the backdrop of the siege of Sarajevo. A mother brings her teenage son to Sarajevo, where his father died in the Bosnian conflict years ago.', 'Full-throttle melodrama about an ill-starred romance set against the backdrop of the siege of Sarajevo. A mother brings her teenage son to Sarajevo, where his father died in the Bosnian conflict years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQ0ERG8dy3kHVP8aVlDFv448Gc7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121642'),
  ('82636874060244531', 'Twice Dead', 1988, 'Horror', 'Bert L. Dragin, Zoran Hochstätter', 'Robert McDonnell, Bert L. Dragin', 'Tom Bresnahan, Jill Whitlow, Jonathan Chapin, Christopher Burgard, Sam Melville, Brooke Bundy, Todd Bridges, Shawn Player', 'R', 'The ghost of a hanged movie star helps a brother and sister rid their mansion of punks.', 'The ghost of a hanged movie star helps a brother and sister rid their mansion of punks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ki7TBjIULZZvrniDNgVBijGjwT4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71042'),
  ('483763562665503757', 'Twice in a Lifetime', 1985, 'Drama', 'Bud Yorkin, Nick McLean', 'Colin Welland', 'Gene Hackman, Ann-Margret, Ellen Burstyn, Amy Madigan, Ally Sheedy, Stephen Lang, Brian Dennehy, Darrell Larson', 'R', 'A middle-aged steelworker is content with his job and his family, but feels that something is missing in his life. On his 50th birthday, he stops in at a local bar for a drink to celebrate. He finds himself attracted to the young, very sexy barmaid--and, to his surprise, he finds that she is also very attracted to him.', 'A middle-aged steelworker is content with his job and his family, but feels that something is missing in his life. On his 50th birthday, he stops in at a local bar for a drink to celebrate. He finds himself attracted to the young, very sexy barmaid--and, to his surprise, he finds that she is also very attracted to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpPkDnPuLuFumbaJ99UdPXwMC0g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123049'),
  ('1077978461039318906', 'Twice Two', 1933, 'Comedy', 'James Parrott, Art Lloyd', 'Stan Laurel, Charlie Hall, Oliver Hardy', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Carol Tevis, May Wallace, Baldwin Cooke, Charlie Hall, Ham Kinsey', 'NR', 'A year prior to the first scene, Stan married Ollie''s sister, and Ollie married Stan''s sister in a double wedding. They all live together and Stan and Ollie work in the same office.', 'A year prior to the first scene, Stan married Ollie''s sister, and Ollie married Stan''s sister in a double wedding. They all live together and Stan and Ollie work in the same office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35BtdBbbryOQcWTyF0ZSzH7kXGY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50915'),
  ('913640976221327090', 'Twice Upon a Time', 1983, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'John Korty, Charles Swenson, John Baker', 'Charles Swenson', 'Lorenzo Music, Judith Kahan, Marshall Efron, James Cranna, Julie Payne, Hamilton Camp, Paul Frees, Gillian Gould', 'PG', 'In the world of the Murkworks where nightmares are made, the evil Synonamess Botch hatches a scheme to make non-stop nightmares. Only Ralph and Mumford, misfits from the cheery land of Frivoli where good dreams are made, can stop him.', 'In the world of the Murkworks where nightmares are made, the evil Synonamess Botch hatches a scheme to make non-stop nightmares. Only Ralph and Mumford, misfits from the cheery land of Frivoli where good dreams are made, can stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abx7BQF3O23LJGTDTmQQ0CTwc8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36751'),
  ('297037519800550839', 'Twice Upon a Time', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Antoine de Caunes, Pierre Aïm, Fanny Aubrespin', 'Antoine de Caunes', 'Jean Rochefort, Charlotte Rampling, Isabelle Nanty, Ian Richardson, James Thierrée, Charles Dance, Raymond Bouchard, Julie du Page', null, 'Alice d''Abanville and Louis Ruinard are two extraordinary personalities. They were the most strikingly glamorous couple of the 70s. But this pair haven''t seen each other in thirty years.', 'Alice d''Abanville and Louis Ruinard are two extraordinary personalities. They were the most strikingly glamorous couple of the 70s. But this pair haven''t seen each other in thirty years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qc2K4ae81I7xGmx8FnvN5wVw3SD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5881'),
  ('432801799668230739', 'Twice Upon a Time', 2012, 'Drama', 'Jean-Paul Rouve', 'Jean-Paul Rouve, Benoît Graffin', 'Jean-Paul Rouve, Benoît Poelvoorde, Miljan Chatelain, Arly Jover, Xavier Beauvois, Miou-Miou, Claude Brasseur, Lisa Martino', null, 'Mathias, aboard a ship with his wife, sees a boy with a striking resemblance to himself and is called - Mathias. He then tracks him to a town north of France to discover that the boys parents are exactly like his parents, only to know that his life is payed over again just 30 years post. He then chooses to be the guest in his own life, while he has a life to live at hand.', 'Mathias, aboard a ship with his wife, sees a boy with a striking resemblance to himself and is called - Mathias. He then tracks him to a town north of France to discover that the boys parents are exactly like his parents, only to know that his life is payed over again just 30 years post. He then chooses to be the guest in his own life, while he has a life to live at hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCdhgGgXn0v3nB9658ABnB7TG3l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139725'),
  ('1126989948144789721', 'Twice-Told Tales', 1963, 'Horror, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Sidney Salkow, Ellis W. Carter, Al Westen', 'Robert E. Kent', 'Vincent Price, Sebastian Cabot, Brett Halsey, Beverly Garland, Richard Denning, Mari Blanchard, Abraham Sofaer, Jacqueline deWit', 'NR', '3 horror stories based on the writings of Nathaniel Hawthorne. In the 1st story titled "Dr. Heidegger''s Experiment", Heidegger attempts to restore the youth of three elderly friends. In "Rappaccini''s Daughter", a demented father is innoculating his daughter with poison so she may never leave her garden of poisonous plants. In the final story "The House of the Seven Gables", The Pyncheon family suffers from a hundred year old curse and while in the midst of arguing over inheritance, a stranger arrives.', '3 horror stories based on the writings of Nathaniel Hawthorne. In the 1st story titled "Dr. Heidegger''s Experiment", Heidegger attempts to restore the youth of three elderly friends. In "Rappaccini''s Daughter", a demented father is innoculating his daughter with poison so she may never leave her garden of poisonous plants. In the final story "The House of the Seven Gables", The Pyncheon family suffers from a hundred year old curse and while in the midst of arguing over inheritance, a stranger arrives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcbS7uheEY9kC23WxMnKlEIsHKC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47553'),
  ('109213239054152905', 'Twice: The Extraordinary Life of Tsutomu Yamaguchi', 2010, 'Documentary, War', 'Shigenori Shogase, Hidetaka Inazuka, Takahiro Miura', null, 'Stuart Varnam-Atkin, Tsutomu Yamaguchi', null, 'Tsutomu Yamaguchi is a hibakusha. A survivor of both atomic bomb blasts in 1945. First at Hiroshima, then again at Nagasaki. Now nearing 90, Yamaguchi finally speaks out. Breaking taboos of shame and sorrow, he responds to a call to fight for a world without nuclear weapons by telling his story, so that no one else will ever have to tell one like it again. Twice reconstructs Yamaguchi’s experiences in 1945 Japan, interviews him on the after-effects of exposure and documents the last five years of the late-blooming activist’s life.', 'Tsutomu Yamaguchi is a hibakusha. A survivor of both atomic bomb blasts in 1945. First at Hiroshima, then again at Nagasaki. Now nearing 90, Yamaguchi finally speaks out. Breaking taboos of shame and sorrow, he responds to a call to fight for a world without nuclear weapons by telling his story, so that no one else will ever have to tell one like it again. Twice reconstructs Yamaguchi’s experiences in 1945 Japan, interviews him on the after-effects of exposure and documents the last five years of the late-blooming activist’s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8sKkScIVVbV4N8iihXD1pGBNWf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:495811'),
  ('276518975780926629', 'Twiggy', 2011, 'Drama', 'Emmanuelle Millet, Antoine Héberlé', 'Emmanuelle Millet', 'Christa Théret, Johan Libéreau, Maud Wyler, Anne Le Ny, Emilie Chesnais, Cathy Ruiz, Dimitri Mazzuchini, Myriam Bella', null, 'Sarah seems to have the world at her feet. She''s young, bright, pretty, free spirited yet hard working, with a real passion for life. Then, in just one day, she loses her job, is told she will have to move out of her apartment, and discovers she is seven months pregnant.', 'Sarah seems to have the world at her feet. She''s young, bright, pretty, free spirited yet hard working, with a real passion for life. Then, in just one day, she loses her job, is told she will have to move out of her apartment, and discovers she is seven months pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PbAqVaiRavwG4FCukW9sCDO5rx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96236'),
  ('71907530494531960', 'Twilight', 1945, 'Romance, Drama, Mystery', 'Alex Phillips, Julio Bracho, Raúl Lavista', 'Julio Bracho', 'Arturo de Córdova, Gloria Marín, Julio Villarreal, Manuel Arvide, Octavio Martínez, Felipe Montoya, Manuel Noriega, Jesús Valero', null, 'Doctor Alejandro Mangino falls in love with Lucía just before he goes on a round-the-world trip. Pining for her all the while, he returns to find that she’s married his best friend.', 'Doctor Alejandro Mangino falls in love with Lucía just before he goes on a round-the-world trip. Pining for her all the while, he returns to find that she’s married his best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHRIbV4z7uFQmMhPIyOurgDF0bh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298275'),
  ('49287711679074710', 'Twilight', 1990, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Miklós Gurbán, György Fehér', 'Friedrich Dürrenmatt, György Fehér', 'Péter Haumann, János Derzsi, Judit Pogány, Gyula Pauer, Kati Lázár, Székely B. Miklós, István Lénárt, László Németh', null, 'In the dense and murky woodlands of provincial Hungary, the search for a child murderer drags a once-respected detective into an all-consuming obsession enshrouded by irresolution and despair, even long after he has been taken off the case. What emerges is not a crime story, but a harrowing venture through the darkness of the human soul.', 'In the dense and murky woodlands of provincial Hungary, the search for a child murderer drags a once-respected detective into an all-consuming obsession enshrouded by irresolution and despair, even long after he has been taken off the case. What emerges is not a crime story, but a harrowing venture through the darkness of the human soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gwAZ38t4VXgafdq9hJfkE6BBBP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110379'),
  ('355743319733776245', 'Twilight', 1998, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Robert Benton, Piotr Sobociński', 'Robert Benton, Richard Russo', 'Paul Newman, Susan Sarandon, Gene Hackman, Reese Witherspoon, Stockard Channing, James Garner, Giancarlo Esposito, Liev Schreiber', 'R', 'A retired detective accepts a simple task, unaware that it will tear open old, forgotten, but deadly wounds.', 'A retired detective accepts a simple task, unaware that it will tear open old, forgotten, but deadly wounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydzfDVuZer0tsnesfg2ql9CR5vc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26269'),
  ('240204198625317759', 'Twilight', 2008, 'Fantasy, Drama, Romance', 'Catherine Hardwicke, Greg Hale, Jamie Marshall', 'Melissa Rosenberg', 'Kristen Stewart, Robert Pattinson, Billy Burke, Peter Facinelli, Ashley Greene, Jackson Rathbone, Nikki Reed, Kellan Lutz', 'PG-13', 'When Bella Swan moves to a small town in the Pacific Northwest, she falls in love with Edward Cullen, a mysterious classmate who reveals himself to be a 108-year-old vampire. Despite Edward''s repeated cautions, Bella can''t stay away from him, a fatal move that endangers her own life.', 'When Bella Swan moves to a small town in the Pacific Northwest, she falls in love with Edward Cullen, a mysterious classmate who reveals himself to be a 108-year-old vampire. Despite Edward''s repeated cautions, Bella can''t stay away from him, a fatal move that endangers her own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Gkb6jm6962ADUPaCBqzz9CTbn9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8966'),
  ('160996942335360997', 'Twilight', 2015, null, 'Juan Pablo Daranas Molina', null, null, null, 'Alicia, a circus clown, dreams of being an actress. When the circus arrives in a remote village she meets Abelito, a boy with a skin disorder that prevents him from going out in the sun. As Abelito looks forward to the circus, Alicia anxiously awaits news from Havana about a casting.', 'Alicia, a circus clown, dreams of being an actress. When the circus arrives in a remote village she meets Abelito, a boy with a skin disorder that prevents him from going out in the sun. As Abelito looks forward to the circus, Alicia anxiously awaits news from Havana about a casting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCoSF0K2mcTOIiPsatSrEkROg0k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359892'),
  ('559546778741959299', 'Twilight', 2019, 'Animation, Drama', 'Yutaka Yamamoto, Yutaka Yamamoto, Sunao Chikaoka', 'Yutaka Yamamoto', 'Hiyori Sakurada, Seishirou Katou, Ayane Sakura, Sora Amamiya, Kana Hanazawa, Daisuke Takahashi, Hiro Shimono, Sumi Shimamoto', null, 'Hakubo tells the story of two young people who live in rural Fukushima: Sachi Koyama, a girl who excels at playing the violin, and Yuusuke Kijinami, a boy who loves to paint. After an awkward, chance encounter, the two meet and begin to fall in love, but Yuusuke is still living in the shadow of the 2011 Tohoku earthquake and tsunami.', 'Hakubo tells the story of two young people who live in rural Fukushima: Sachi Koyama, a girl who excels at playing the violin, and Yuusuke Kijinami, a boy who loves to paint. After an awkward, chance encounter, the two meet and begin to fall in love, but Yuusuke is still living in the shadow of the 2011 Tohoku earthquake and tsunami.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iUoLTDTk5IgUJTboct2RHuuTMG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589082'),
  ('962791925003358290', 'Twilight of the Cockroaches', 1987, 'Fantasy, Drama, Science Fiction, Romance, Family, Animation', 'Tatsuhiko Urahata, Susumu Aketagawa, Hiroyuki Ebata', 'Hiroaki Yoshida', 'Kaoru Kobayashi, Ichirôta Miyakawa, Setsuko Karasuma, Eri Watanabe, Atsuko Asano, Mitsuru Hirata, Kozo Shioya, Hiroshi Yagyu', null, 'The cockroaches of Saito''s apartment live in peace with their human host, who gives them lots of space to breed and plenty of leftovers to munch on. In the midst of these high living times, Naomi and Ichiro plan to get married and start a family. But when a hard-bitten stranger roach named Hans appears with news of war with the humans across the lawn, it foretells disruption-not only of Naomi and Ichiro''s relationship, but of the hive''s entire way of life.', 'The cockroaches of Saito''s apartment live in peace with their human host, who gives them lots of space to breed and plenty of leftovers to munch on. In the midst of these high living times, Naomi and Ichiro plan to get married and start a family. But when a hard-bitten stranger roach named Hans appears with news of war with the humans across the lawn, it foretells disruption-not only of Naomi and Ichiro''s relationship, but of the hive''s entire way of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57uLoJh68cKsBKUEoe3JJvVR75N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76740'),
  ('539874522919030794', 'Twilight of the Dark Master', 1997, 'Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Akiyuki Shinbo', 'Tatsuhiko Urahata, Duane Dell''Amico', 'Toshihiko Seki, Akira Kamiya, Emi Shinohara, Atsuko Takahata, Hiroya Ishimaru, Kaneto Shiozawa, Koji Yusa, Masuo Amada', null, 'Tsunami is an ancient guardian from days long ago when the Mother Spirit created demons and guardians to aid a fledgling human race. In 2089, only a few demons and guardians remain in the city of Neo-Shinjuku. Tsunami becomes involved with a woman who has just lost her fiance and her arm and now wants to figure out why this has happened. Meanwhile, the demon leader is still alive and plotting to enslave mankind.', 'Tsunami is an ancient guardian from days long ago when the Mother Spirit created demons and guardians to aid a fledgling human race. In 2089, only a few demons and guardians remain in the city of Neo-Shinjuku. Tsunami becomes involved with a woman who has just lost her fiance and her arm and now wants to figure out why this has happened. Meanwhile, the demon leader is still alive and plotting to enslave mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7N7FIAixXFQnyrJCXI57VzAC57C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20089'),
  ('273060192951421147', 'Twilight of the Gods', 1996, 'Drama, War', 'Stewart Main, Simon Raby', 'Stewart Main', 'Greg Mayor, Marton Csokas, John Maunsell, Tony Kingi, Wayne Pivac, Joel Lund, Adam Cohen, Craig Jenkins', 'NR', 'A Maori warrior comes upon the aftermath of a battle to find that the only survivor is a wounded enemy soldier. His wishes to avenge his fallen countrymen by finishing off this helpless enemy but the gods won''t allow it (as conveyed to him through a spirit bird). Anguished that he must instead treat the soldier''s wounds, he''s further repelled by the soldier''s incessant homosexual advances. Slowly and surprisingly, a change comes over the warrior to accept the soldier''s advances, but the war all too soon intrudes upon them.', 'A Maori warrior comes upon the aftermath of a battle to find that the only survivor is a wounded enemy soldier. His wishes to avenge his fallen countrymen by finishing off this helpless enemy but the gods won''t allow it (as conveyed to him through a spirit bird). Anguished that he must instead treat the soldier''s wounds, he''s further repelled by the soldier''s incessant homosexual advances. Slowly and surprisingly, a change comes over the warrior to accept the soldier''s advances, but the war all too soon intrudes upon them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMfWb8JpyQTc6ocEF4D6RHSgYng.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47040'),
  ('1012529173633239464', 'Twilight of the Ice Nymphs', 1997, 'Fantasy, Romance, Comedy', 'Guy Maddin, Michael Marshall', 'George Toles', 'Nigel Whitmey, Pascale Bussières, Shelley Duvall, Frank Gorshin, Alice Krige, R.H. Thomson, Ross McMillan, Frank Kowalski', null, 'Set in a blazing land where the sun ceaselessly shines, this dramatic fantasy examines love’s darker aspects.', 'Set in a blazing land where the sun ceaselessly shines, this dramatic fantasy examines love’s darker aspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNAhdQe3JQDoCu18vlZBJeTdutm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94653'),
  ('912214677772285097', 'Twilight of the Warriors: Walled In', 2024, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Kenji Tanigaki, Cheang Pou-Soi, Cheng Siu-Keung', 'Jeffrey Poon', 'Raymond Lam Fung, Louis Koo, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Richie Jen, Terrance Lau Chun-Him, Kenny Wong Tak-Ban, Philip Ng Wan-Lung, Tony Wu', null, 'In 1980s Hong Kong, troubled youth Chan Lok-kwun, a mainland refugee, struggles to survive in the Kowloon Walled City by joining underground fights. Betrayed by crime boss Mr. Big while trying to buy a fake ID, he steals drugs from him and seeks refuge in the Walled City, where he encounters Cyclone, a compassionate yet authoritative crime lord.', 'In 1980s Hong Kong, troubled youth Chan Lok-kwun, a mainland refugee, struggles to survive in the Kowloon Walled City by joining underground fights. Betrayed by crime boss Mr. Big while trying to buy a fake ID, he steals drugs from him and seeks refuge in the Walled City, where he encounters Cyclone, a compassionate yet authoritative crime lord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0tunBO4tMjvKVVG7fXqHgwOr5C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:923667'),
  ('817281115924362633', 'Twilight Q', 1987, 'Animation, Crime, Fantasy, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Mamoru Oshii, Tomomi Mochizuki', 'Kazunori Ito, Mamoru Oshii', 'Masahiro Anzai, Mina Tominaga, Natsuo Tokuhiro, Kumiko Takizawa, Tetsuya Segawa, Yasuyuki Hirata, Shigeru Chiba, Mako Hyodo', null, 'Part 1: "Time Knot: Reflection" Written by Kazunori Itô, directed by Tomomi Mochizuki. Mayu finds a camera floating in the ocean while on vacation. A very unusual camera. The film, mostly intact, reveals a picture of herself with a man she has never seen before. But that isn''t the unusual part. This camera hasn''t been made yet, and won''t be made for another two years. Soon, Mayu finds herself swinging uncontrollably back and forth through time like a pendulum. Part 2: "Mystery Article File 538" Written and directed by Mamoru Oshii. This episode follows a down-on-his-luck detective who accepts the first case to come his way: Surveillance of a man and a little girl. But who are they? And why do airplanes that fly over them turn into giant imperial carp? An investigator''s normal methods don''t apply when reality itself no longer applies.', 'Part 1: "Time Knot: Reflection" Written by Kazunori Itô, directed by Tomomi Mochizuki. Mayu finds a camera floating in the ocean while on vacation. A very unusual camera. The film, mostly intact, reveals a picture of herself with a man she has never seen before. But that isn''t the unusual part. This camera hasn''t been made yet, and won''t be made for another two years. Soon, Mayu finds herself swinging uncontrollably back and forth through time like a pendulum. Part 2: "Mystery Article File 538" Written and directed by Mamoru Oshii. This episode follows a down-on-his-luck detective who accepts the first case to come his way: Surveillance of a man and a little girl. But who are they? And why do airplanes that fly over them turn into giant imperial carp? An investigator''s normal methods don''t apply when reality itself no longer applies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Ua2ATnvYiAnObWEoa9X87FAQoc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163551'),
  ('937072163283570515', 'Twilight Zone: The Movie', 1983, 'Horror, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'John Landis, Stevan Larner, Allen Daviau', 'John Landis', 'Dan Aykroyd, Albert Brooks, Scatman Crothers, John Lithgow, Vic Morrow, Kathleen Quinlan, Charles Hallahan, Doug McGrath', 'PG', 'An anthology film presenting remakes of three episodes from the "Twilight Zone" TV series—"Kick the Can", "It''s a Good Life" and "Nightmare at 20,000 Feet"—and one original story, "Time Out."', 'An anthology film presenting remakes of three episodes from the "Twilight Zone" TV series—"Kick the Can", "It''s a Good Life" and "Nightmare at 20,000 Feet"—and one original story, "Time Out."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDWARc5aYTUKE8Y2FIGVgWXuI4K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15301'),
  ('460675211139548987', 'Twilight''s Kiss', 2020, 'Drama', 'Ray Yeung, Leung Ming-kai, Joe Hu', 'Ray Yeung', 'Tai Bo, Ben Yuen Foo-Wah, Patra Au Ga-Man, Lo Chun-Yip, Kong To, Lam Yiu-Sing, Wong Hiu-Yee, Joe Hu', null, 'One day Pak, a taxi driver who refuses to retire, meets Hoi, a retired single father, in a park. Although both are secretly gay, they are proud of the families they have created through hard work and determination. Yet in that brief initial encounter, something is unleashed in them which had been suppressed for so many years. As both men recount and recall their personal histories, they also contemplate a possible future together.', 'One day Pak, a taxi driver who refuses to retire, meets Hoi, a retired single father, in a park. Although both are secretly gay, they are proud of the families they have created through hard work and determination. Yet in that brief initial encounter, something is unleashed in them which had been suppressed for so many years. As both men recount and recall their personal histories, they also contemplate a possible future together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jH9tcfk6UsJ8xwRU4ZKPMrCxhcM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630878'),
  ('573217280199454798', 'Twilight''s Last Gleaming', 1977, 'Thriller', 'Robert Aldrich, Robert B. Hauser, Wolfgang Glattes', 'Ronald M. Cohen, Edward Huebsch', 'Burt Lancaster, Roscoe Lee Browne, Charles Durning, Joseph Cotten, Melvyn Douglas, Richard Jaeckel, William Marshall, Gerald S. O''Loughlin', 'R', 'A renegade USAF general, Lawrence Dell, escapes from a military prison and takes over an ICBM silo near Montana and threatens to provoke World War 3 unless the President reveals details of a secret meeting held just after the start of the Vietnam War between Dell and the then President''s most trusted advisors.', 'A renegade USAF general, Lawrence Dell, escapes from a military prison and takes over an ICBM silo near Montana and threatens to provoke World War 3 unless the President reveals details of a secret meeting held just after the start of the Vietnam War between Dell and the then President''s most trusted advisors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qVUuzYepmj3lGyTgM43gztCH14.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75938'),
  ('355536488886582334', 'Twin', 2026, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Chris Stokes', 'Chris Stokes', 'Drew Sidora, Jensen Atwood, Chrissy Stokes, Ken Lawson, Cynthia Moten', null, 'Fresh out of prison for murder, a ruthless woman schemes to replace her twin sister and claim her flawless life by any means necessary.', 'Fresh out of prison for murder, a ruthless woman schemes to replace her twin sister and claim her flawless life by any means necessary.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F3%2Fgracenote%2F37e742410c7bd196e9497020beefc777.jpg', 'plex:movie:twin-2026'),
  ('533710162522513158', 'Twin Dragons', 1992, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Tsui Hark, Horace Wong Wing-Hang', 'Barry Wong Ping-Yiu, Joe Cheung Tung-Cho, Tsui Hark', 'Jackie Chan, Maggie Cheung, Nina Li Chi, Teddy Robin, James Wong Jim, Sylvia Chang, Kirk Wong Chi-Keung, David Chiang Da-Wei', 'PG-13', 'Identical twins are separated at birth, one becoming a streetwise mechanic, and the other an acclaimed classical concert conductor. Finally meeting in adulthood, they''re mistaken for the other and entangled in each other''s worlds.', 'Identical twins are separated at birth, one becoming a streetwise mechanic, and the other an acclaimed classical concert conductor. Finally meeting in adulthood, they''re mistaken for the other and entangled in each other''s worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tm153lMrHy6HykEYwoP0EI3dQ8k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18764'),
  ('475539402257257997', 'Twin Falls Idaho', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Polish, M. David Mullen', 'Mark Polish', 'Mark Polish, Michael Polish, Michele Hicks, Jon Gries, Patrick Bauchau, Garrett Morris, Lesley Ann Warren, William Katt', 'R', 'Francis and Blake Falls are Siamese twins who live in a neat little room in a rundown hotel. While sharing some organs, Blake is always fit and Francis is very sickly. Into their world comes a young lady, who turns their world upside down. She gets involved with Blake, and convinces the two to attend a Halloween party, where they can pass themselves off as wearing a costume. Eventually Francis becomes really ill, and they have to be separated. They then face the physical and mental strains that come from their proposed separation.', 'Francis and Blake Falls are Siamese twins who live in a neat little room in a rundown hotel. While sharing some organs, Blake is always fit and Francis is very sickly. Into their world comes a young lady, who turns their world upside down. She gets involved with Blake, and convinces the two to attend a Halloween party, where they can pass themselves off as wearing a costume. Eventually Francis becomes really ill, and they have to be separated. They then face the physical and mental strains that come from their proposed separation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boBbVY67YhGC4PWuqyQFysP3mN4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33430'),
  ('921872423607641999', 'Twin Flower', 2018, 'Drama', 'Laura Luchetti', 'Laura Luchetti', 'Giorgio Colangeli, Aniello Arena, Anastasyia Bogach, Kallil Kone, Mauro Addis, Fausto Verginelli, Alessandro Pani', null, 'In a South of Italy full of beauty and hidden dangers, two adolescents, abused and damaged by life, Anna, whose father has been murdered and Basim, an immigrant orphan, escape together towards a new start.', 'In a South of Italy full of beauty and hidden dangers, two adolescents, abused and damaged by life, Anna, whose father has been murdered and Basim, an immigrant orphan, escape together towards a new start.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKeCvmdGG4KZGG5bgDE0sAEO5Gd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543775'),
  ('344023253533742955', 'Twin Murders: The Silence of the White City', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Josep Amorós, Rosa Estévez, Sara Mazquiaran', 'Roger Danès, Alfred Pérez-Fargas', 'Belén Rueda, Javier Rey, Aura Garrido, Manolo Solo, Àlex Brendemühl, Ramón Barea, Sergio Dorado, Pedro Casablanc', 'R', 'Vitoria-Gasteiz, Basque Country, Spain, 2019. Two corpses appear in the crypt of the Old Cathedral. Police officer Unai López de Ayala, an expert in criminal profiling, must hunt down the ritual murderer who has been terrorizing the city for two decades.', 'Vitoria-Gasteiz, Basque Country, Spain, 2019. Two corpses appear in the crypt of the Old Cathedral. Police officer Unai López de Ayala, an expert in criminal profiling, must hunt down the ritual murderer who has been terrorizing the city for two decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOA4MbyJZVJHGZ38wC4LPpruBBX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542917'),
  ('781310786593466311', 'Twin Peaks: Fire Walk with Me', 1992, 'Drama, Mystery, Horror', 'David Lynch, Ronald Víctor García, Deepak Nayar', 'David Lynch, Robert Engels', 'Sheryl Lee, Ray Wise, Mädchen Amick, Dana Ashbrook, Phoebe Augustine, David Bowie, Eric DaRe, Miguel Ferrer', 'R', 'In the questionable town of Deer Meadow, Washington, FBI Agent Desmond inexplicably disappears while hunting for the man who murdered a teen girl. The killer is never apprehended, and, after experiencing dark visions and supernatural encounters, Agent Dale Cooper chillingly predicts that the culprit will claim another life. Meanwhile, in the more cozy town of Twin Peaks, hedonistic beauty Laura Palmer hangs with lowlifes and seems destined for a grisly fate.', 'In the questionable town of Deer Meadow, Washington, FBI Agent Desmond inexplicably disappears while hunting for the man who murdered a teen girl. The killer is never apprehended, and, after experiencing dark visions and supernatural encounters, Agent Dale Cooper chillingly predicts that the culprit will claim another life. Meanwhile, in the more cozy town of Twin Peaks, hedonistic beauty Laura Palmer hangs with lowlifes and seems destined for a grisly fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxsGXqetGnirf99qapYd5MMY1VL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1923'),
  ('1037793204264592678', 'Twin Sisters', 2002, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'Ben Sombogaart, Piotr Kukla', 'Marieke van der Pol', 'Sina Richardt, Julia Koopmans, Thekla Reuten, Nadja Uhl, Ellen Vogel, Gudrun Okras, Betty Schuurman, Jaap Spijkers', null, '1920s Germany. Two sisters aged six years, no sooner see their remaining parent buried when they are torn apart. Lotte goes to live with her upper middle class Dutch aunt in Holland, Anna to work as a farm hand on her German uncle''s rural farm. The World War II impacts each of their lives and finally in old age they meet again.', '1920s Germany. Two sisters aged six years, no sooner see their remaining parent buried when they are torn apart. Lotte goes to live with her upper middle class Dutch aunt in Holland, Anna to work as a farm hand on her German uncle''s rural farm. The World War II impacts each of their lives and finally in old age they meet again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYVApv3A8cbQ6cIp04Su02nCvZ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16132'),
  ('182580549008173824', 'Twin Sisters of Kyoto', 1963, 'Drama', 'Noboru Nakamura, Tōichirō Narushima', 'Toshihide Gondo', 'Shima Iwashita, Seiji Miyaguchi, Yoshiko Nakamura, Hiroyuki Nagato, Teruo Yoshida, Tamotsu Hayakawa, Eijirō Tōno, Michiyo Tamaki', null, 'In this Japanese drama, a dry goods merchant''s daughter is surprised to discover that she has a twin sister. In rural Japan it was thought that twins bring bad luck, so the sister was abandoned at birth. Later her parents tell her that her sister was kidnapped. The woman doesn''t believe this and when she eventually meets her twin, both women are involved in love affairs. The merchant''s daughter is seeing an educated fellow. Trouble ensues when she begins suspecting that he may be more interested in her sister.', 'In this Japanese drama, a dry goods merchant''s daughter is surprised to discover that she has a twin sister. In rural Japan it was thought that twins bring bad luck, so the sister was abandoned at birth. Later her parents tell her that her sister was kidnapped. The woman doesn''t believe this and when she eventually meets her twin, both women are involved in love affairs. The merchant''s daughter is seeing an educated fellow. Trouble ensues when she begins suspecting that he may be more interested in her sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSVTNNYUR9YWQTVkInWBBxSjiog.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202763'),
  ('1134746446861495599', 'Twin Sitters', 1994, 'Comedy, Family, Thriller', 'John Paragon, Irek Hartowicz', 'John Paragon', 'Peter Paul, David Paul, Christian Cousins, Joseph Cousins, Rena Sofer, Jared Martin, Barry Dennen, Mother Love', 'PG-13', 'An evil business executive is releasing dangerous toxins and the Barbarian Brothers set out to stop his evil work.', 'An evil business executive is releasing dangerous toxins and the Barbarian Brothers set out to stop his evil work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFnpQ0WaXYJszWR1P40ZF5sw0Tl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48232'),
  ('216420921281320579', 'Twin Town', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kevin Allen, John Mathieson', 'Kevin Allen', 'Rhys Ifans, Llŷr Ifans, Dougray Scott, Di Botcher, David Hayman, Dorien Thomas, Huw Ceredig, Rachel Scorgie', null, 'Jeremy and Julian Lewis, the "Lewis Twins", are two unruly brothers who terrorise the city of Swansea from the caravan park where they live with their family. When their father, Fatty, is injured while working on a roof for local kingpin Bryn Cartwright, they try in vain to claim compensation. Thus begins a campaign of terror, which local policemen Terry and Grayo are ill-equipped to prevent, involved as they are in a drugs deal with Cartwright.', 'Jeremy and Julian Lewis, the "Lewis Twins", are two unruly brothers who terrorise the city of Swansea from the caravan park where they live with their family. When their father, Fatty, is injured while working on a roof for local kingpin Bryn Cartwright, they try in vain to claim compensation. Thus begins a campaign of terror, which local policemen Terry and Grayo are ill-equipped to prevent, involved as they are in a drugs deal with Cartwright.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9rf32Mq0bQ0pJ3EZ5ghY52J4tS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15321'),
  ('974450134407059877', 'Twinkle, Twinkle Lucky Stars', 1985, 'Action, Comedy', 'Fruit Chan, Tang Chung-Kan, Chin Ka-Lok', 'Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, Stanley Fung Shui-Fan, Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Charlie Chin Chiang-Lin, Jackie Chan, Yuen Biao', 'PG-13', 'The third installment in the Lucky Stars series, following Winners and Sinners and My Lucky Stars. The team are released from prison to play detective in order to stop a ruthless gang from ruining their reputations, taking their lives, and that of a key witness in an upcoming trial. They must battle their way through and with the help of Muscles, take down the bad guys.', 'The third installment in the Lucky Stars series, following Winners and Sinners and My Lucky Stars. The team are released from prison to play detective in order to stop a ruthless gang from ruining their reputations, taking their lives, and that of a key witness in an upcoming trial. They must battle their way through and with the help of Muscles, take down the bad guys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojeCl4Qw4CmMP7jjpiJU4ZlbsV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18707'),
  ('201803833752950006', 'Twinless', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'James Sweeney, Greg Cotten, Kyle LeMire', 'James Sweeney', 'Dylan O''Brien, James Sweeney, Aisling Franciosi, Lauren Graham, Chris Perfetti, François Arnaud, Arkira Chantaratananond, Tasha Smith', 'R', 'Two men who lost their respective twin brothers develop a growing friendship after meeting in a support group. However, both harbor long-hidden secrets that threaten to tear them apart.', 'Two men who lost their respective twin brothers develop a growing friendship after meeting in a support group. However, both harbor long-hidden secrets that threaten to tear them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vaw9Az5tPLMjNLj426KgKsp0k8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1245347'),
  ('343474804638983386', 'Twins', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Andrzej Bartkowiak, Ivan Reitman, Peter Giuliano', 'William Davies, William Osborne, Timothy Harris', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Danny DeVito, Kelly Preston, Chloe Webb, Bonnie Bartlett, Marshall Bell, Trey Wilson, David Caruso', 'PG', 'Julius and Vincent Benedict are the results of an experiment that would allow for the perfect child. Julius was planned and grows to athletic proportions. Vincent is an accident and is somewhat smaller in stature. Vincent is placed in an orphanage while Julius is taken to a south seas island and raised by philosophers. Vincent becomes the ultimate low life and is about to be killed by loan sharks.', 'Julius and Vincent Benedict are the results of an experiment that would allow for the perfect child. Julius was planned and grows to athletic proportions. Vincent is an accident and is somewhat smaller in stature. Vincent is placed in an orphanage while Julius is taken to a south seas island and raised by philosophers. Vincent becomes the ultimate low life and is about to be killed by loan sharks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stJx9BQZbXrZnTGf9Erc7d2UMVc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9493'),
  ('968561405136441750', 'Twins', 1999, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Andrucha Waddington, Breno Silveira, Kátia Lund', 'Elena Soarez', 'Fernanda Torres, Isabel Guéron, Evandro Mesquita, Francisco Cuoco, Fernanda Montenegro, Matheus Nachtergaele, Caio Junqueira, Gualter Pupo', null, 'Identical twins Iara and Marilena like to play games and deceive men by pretending to be each other. But when they fall in love with the same man, a rivalry with devastating and horrifying consequences begins.', 'Identical twins Iara and Marilena like to play games and deceive men by pretending to be each other. But when they fall in love with the same man, a rivalry with devastating and horrifying consequences begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sh28nt8yGANiJsUT0LbCcCC8ld.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259812'),
  ('1047247271701934445', 'Twins Mission', 2007, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Ko Chiu-Lam, Benz Kong To-Hoi', 'Tsui Siu-Ming, Fong Sai-Keung', 'Charlene Choi Chuek-Yin, Gillian Chung, Wu Jing, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Yuen Wah, Jess Zhang Qian, Steven Cheung Chi-Hang, Shek Sau', null, 'When a precious Tibetan bead is stolen by rogue members of the mysterious Gemini Clan, the protectors of the bead enlist the help of some righteous former Gemini Clan members to retrieve the bead and bring the evil disciples to justice.', 'When a precious Tibetan bead is stolen by rogue members of the mysterious Gemini Clan, the protectors of the bead enlist the help of some righteous former Gemini Clan members to retrieve the bead and bring the evil disciples to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lsLrwsa7TNLRaJlOpuewexVN5fE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15939'),
  ('5627536252258087', 'Twins of Evil', 1971, 'Horror', 'John Hough, Dick Bush', 'Tudor Gates', 'Peter Cushing, Dennis Price, Madeleine Collinson, Mary Collinson, Isobel Black, Kathleen Byron, Shelagh Wilcocks, Damien Thomas', 'R', 'While dabbling in Satanism, Count Karstein resurrects Mircalla Karnstein who initiates him into vampirism. As a rash of deaths afflicts the village, Gustav the head of Puritan group leads his men to seek out and destroy the pestilence. One of his twin nieces has become inflicted with the witchcraft but Gustav''s zeal and venom has trapped the innocent Maria, threatening her with a tortuous execution, whilst Frieda remains free to continue her orgy of evil.', 'While dabbling in Satanism, Count Karstein resurrects Mircalla Karnstein who initiates him into vampirism. As a rash of deaths afflicts the village, Gustav the head of Puritan group leads his men to seek out and destroy the pestilence. One of his twin nieces has become inflicted with the witchcraft but Gustav''s zeal and venom has trapped the innocent Maria, threatening her with a tortuous execution, whilst Frieda remains free to continue her orgy of evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muBFwxCOV3duOMAMIYREOgsyABq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28801'),
  ('866171574735607457', 'Twinsters', 2015, 'Family, Documentary', 'Ryan Miyamoto, Samantha Futerman, Ryan Miyamoto', null, 'Anais Bordier, Samantha Futerman, Kanoa Goo', null, 'Adopted from South Korea, raised on different continents &amp; connected through social media, Samantha &amp; Anaïs believe that they are twin sisters separated at birth.', 'Adopted from South Korea, raised on different continents &amp; connected through social media, Samantha &amp; Anaïs believe that they are twin sisters separated at birth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zU6hCAaOXj55xjJR6BeSZu3iWBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324325'),
  ('431537561655374204', 'Twist', 1995, 'Crime', 'Danny Lee Sau-Yin, Paco Yiu Fung-Suen, Law Gam-Fai', 'Law Gam-Fai, Do Chi-Git', 'Danny Lee Sau-Yin, Simon Yam, Suki Kwan Sau-Mei, Michael Chow Man-Kin, Jessica Law Man-Yi, Parkman Wong Pak-Man, Emily Kwan Bo-Wai, Louis Fan Siu-Wong', null, 'An armored truck carrying $170 million is held up by a sophisticated ring of bank robbers. The police are at wit''s end.', 'An armored truck carrying $170 million is held up by a sophisticated ring of bank robbers. The police are at wit''s end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDGU6kTiiJqFJYKYWpg4c3Ald2d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320601'),
  ('1043149747747607554', 'Twist', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Håvard Helle, Luca Rocchini, Mark Morris', 'Sally Collett, Tom Grass, Kevin Lehane', 'Raff Law, Michael Caine, Lena Headey, Sophie Simnett, Rita Ora, David Walliams, Franz Drameh, Noel Clarke', 'R', 'A Dickens classic brought thrillingly up to date in the teeming heartland of modern London, where a group of street smart young hustlers plan the heist of the century for the ultimate payday.', 'A Dickens classic brought thrillingly up to date in the teeming heartland of modern London, where a group of street smart young hustlers plan the heist of the century for the ultimate payday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tw7lgyrQpEVXuwjsx94brDSRIFZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:644083'),
  ('372453817659664571', 'Twist Again in Moscow', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Marie Poiré', 'Jean-Marie Poiré, Martin Lamotte, Christian Clavier', 'Philippe Noiret, Christian Clavier, Martin Lamotte, Bernard Blier, Agnès Soral, Marina Vlady, Jacques François, France Rumilly', null, 'Igor, who manages a fancy hotel and is on the take, has to juggle several problems at once. He has a two-hour window to get his ill-got gain out of the hotel, he must misdirect and obstruct the inquiries of a Party auditor who suspects that all is not above board, and he must keep out of sight and out of trouble his interloping and troublesome young brother-in-law, who arrives unannounced with barrels of rotten herring.', 'Igor, who manages a fancy hotel and is on the take, has to juggle several problems at once. He has a two-hour window to get his ill-got gain out of the hotel, he must misdirect and obstruct the inquiries of a Party auditor who suspects that all is not above board, and he must keep out of sight and out of trouble his interloping and troublesome young brother-in-law, who arrives unannounced with barrels of rotten herring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4QOlcQGuCoGpx4Fg9MhpRRKDsn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81122'),
  ('553844558263583166', 'Twist and Shout', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bille August', 'Bjarne Reuter', 'Adam Tønsberg, Lars Simonsen, Camilla Søeberg, Ulrikke Bondo, Lone Lindorff, Arne Hansen, Aase Hansen, Bent Mejding', null, 'Danish teens come of age in 1963. Bjorn and Erik are close friends. Bjorn is pursued by Kirsten, a future Stepford wife, but he falls for Anna, who initiates him into love and sex. Erik is somber, caring for his home-bound mentally-ill mother while his strict father rules his life. He desires Kirsten, but she''s unattainable. Pregnancy, a horrific abortion, an engagement party, and a revelation about the rectitude of Erik''s father lead to a climax: Bjorn and Erik must stand up to controlling adults.', 'Danish teens come of age in 1963. Bjorn and Erik are close friends. Bjorn is pursued by Kirsten, a future Stepford wife, but he falls for Anna, who initiates him into love and sex. Erik is somber, caring for his home-bound mentally-ill mother while his strict father rules his life. He desires Kirsten, but she''s unattainable. Pregnancy, a horrific abortion, an engagement party, and a revelation about the rectitude of Erik''s father lead to a climax: Bjorn and Erik must stand up to controlling adults.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jusLVnvWOWTB1pFUFNTGpPdGWCW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20661'),
  ('1066279441503482569', 'Twisted', 1985, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Adam Holender, Alexander Gruszynski', 'Glenn Kershaw, Bruce Graham', 'Lois Smith, Christian Slater, Dina Merrill, Tandy Cronyn, Dan Ziskie, Brooke Tracy, John Cunningham, Edward Marshall', 'R', 'One evening the Collins find their maid Mrs. Murdock at the end of their steps: dead, neck broken. Obviously she had an accident. Consequently they need a new babysitter for an upcoming big party. The sensible Helen meets little Susan Collins at the discount market and likes her, so she offers to do the job. She doesn''t know Susan''s teenage brother Mark - technically skilled and good in school, but restive and cunning. As soon as the parents have left, he starts psychologically terrorizing Helen and his sister with electronic tricks.', 'One evening the Collins find their maid Mrs. Murdock at the end of their steps: dead, neck broken. Obviously she had an accident. Consequently they need a new babysitter for an upcoming big party. The sensible Helen meets little Susan Collins at the discount market and likes her, so she offers to do the job. She doesn''t know Susan''s teenage brother Mark - technically skilled and good in school, but restive and cunning. As soon as the parents have left, he starts psychologically terrorizing Helen and his sister with electronic tricks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JB7RvvTsGbtVlSs87AMamvtoXQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110175'),
  ('519929710383424763', 'Twisted', 2004, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Philip Kaufman, Peter Deming, Mike Topoozian', 'Sarah Thorp', 'Ashley Judd, Samuel L. Jackson, Andy Garcia, David Strathairn, Russell Wong, Mark Pellegrino, Camryn Manheim, Titus Welliver', 'R', 'Recently promoted and transferred to the homicide division, Inspector Jessica Shepard feels pressure to prove herself -- and what better way than by solving San Francisco''s latest murder? However, as Shepard and her partner, Mike Delmarco, soon discover, the victim shared a romantic connection to her. As more of Shepard''s ex-lovers turn up dead, her mind starts to become unstable, and she begins to wonder if she could be the very killer she''s trying to track down.', 'Recently promoted and transferred to the homicide division, Inspector Jessica Shepard feels pressure to prove herself -- and what better way than by solving San Francisco''s latest murder? However, as Shepard and her partner, Mike Delmarco, soon discover, the victim shared a romantic connection to her. As more of Shepard''s ex-lovers turn up dead, her mind starts to become unstable, and she begins to wonder if she could be the very killer she''s trying to track down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfdfU9tYsEnjlFGoY2HabFMdHLi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13572'),
  ('850400995833084291', 'Twisted', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Darren Lynn Bousman, Bella Gonzales, Van Hayden', 'Jonathan Bernstein, James Greer', 'Djimon Hounsou, Lauren LaVera, Mia Healey, Neal McDonough, Alicia Witt, Gina Philips, Prof, David Call', 'R', 'Two millennials make quick money by leasing incredible New York City apartments they don’t own to people who don’t know they are being scammed. The con works brilliantly until they run into an apartment owner with a dark secret who flips the game on them.', 'Two millennials make quick money by leasing incredible New York City apartments they don’t own to people who don’t know they are being scammed. The con works brilliantly until they run into an apartment owner with a dark secret who flips the game on them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rF6txsM6cgF9vg6Ra5sNbkvUwrw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1373198'),
  ('1101571685417714815', 'Twisted Desire', 1996, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Craig R. Baxley, João Fernandes', 'Craig R. Baxley, Chad Hayes', 'Melissa Joan Hart, Daniel Baldwin, Jeremy Jordan, David Lascher, Kurt Fuller, Meadow Sisto, Eric Laneuville, Collin Wilcox Paxton', null, 'A teenage girl convinces a young, love-struck ex-con that the only way they can be together is to do away with her domineering parents.', 'A teenage girl convinces a young, love-struck ex-con that the only way they can be together is to do away with her domineering parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5oYWIKUxSM20xKQsjG5gfX0JKq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75471'),
  ('839984818521537642', 'Twisted Justice', 2016, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Takahiro Imai, Kazuya Shiraishi, Yu Koreyasu', 'Junya Ikegami', 'Go Ayano, YOUNG DAIS, Yukio Ueno, Haruna Yabuki, Kumi Takiuchi, Ryuzo Tanaka, Minosuke, Tomoya Nakamura', null, 'Starting in 1970s Hokkaido, the film charts the moral descent of Detective Moroboshi over three decades, the young cop quickly gets a bit too cozy with the other side of the law when his senior colleague Murai teaches him the ropes and ruts of the police business. Soon, he swaggers and rants through the streets of Sapporo a lean, mean, sex‐crazy bully, indistinguishable from a yakuza.', 'Starting in 1970s Hokkaido, the film charts the moral descent of Detective Moroboshi over three decades, the young cop quickly gets a bit too cozy with the other side of the law when his senior colleague Murai teaches him the ropes and ruts of the police business. Soon, he swaggers and rants through the streets of Sapporo a lean, mean, sex‐crazy bully, indistinguishable from a yakuza.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eP5DUanjrrEjRbNzmeoLrpyJGi9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400969'),
  ('904877475038567137', 'Twisted Nerve', 1968, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Roy Boulting, Harry Waxman', 'Leo Marks, Roy Boulting', 'Hayley Mills, Hywel Bennett, Billie Whitelaw, Frank Finlay, Barry Foster, Phyllis Calvert, Salmaan Peerzada, Christian Roberts', null, 'Martin Durnley is a young man with an infantilizing mother, resentful stepfather and an institutionalized brother with Down''s syndrome. To cope, he retreats into an alternate child personality he calls Georgie. After being caught during a theft attempt at a department store, he befriends a female customer who is sympathetic to him, but his friendship soon turns into obsession.', 'Martin Durnley is a young man with an infantilizing mother, resentful stepfather and an institutionalized brother with Down''s syndrome. To cope, he retreats into an alternate child personality he calls Georgie. After being caught during a theft attempt at a department store, he befriends a female customer who is sympathetic to him, but his friendship soon turns into obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7U2pwwzvCb0XPIjDcM5Gn9dfrCu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56092'),
  ('1136933102667584477', 'Twisted Nightmare', 1987, 'Horror', 'Paul Hunt, Paul Hunt, Gary Graver', 'Paul Hunt', 'Rhonda Gray, Cleve Hall, Robert Padilla, Brad Bartram, Scott King, Devon Jenkin, Heather Sullivan, Kenneth Roper Jr.', 'R', 'A group of teenagers win a trip to a summer camp they had attended as children. However, soon after they get there they begin to disappear one by one. The survivors suspect that the disappearances may be connected to the death of a handicapped child at the camp years before.', 'A group of teenagers win a trip to a summer camp they had attended as children. However, soon after they get there they begin to disappear one by one. The survivors suspect that the disappearances may be connected to the death of a handicapped child at the camp years before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vp6dSJf01d95anXKf27RvAwaLff.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85203'),
  ('260393558962640934', 'Twisted Obsession', 1989, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Fernando Trueba, José Luis Alcaine', 'Manolo Matji, Fernando Trueba', 'Jeff Goldblum, Miranda Richardson, Anémone, Daniel Ceccaldi, Dexter Fletcher, Liza Walker, Jerome Natali, Asunción Balaguer', null, 'An American writer in Paris is hired to do a script for an edgy young director he can''t stand. When he falls in love with the director''s cold and manipulative pretty sister, his life starts to unravel and he realizes that he''s been used.', 'An American writer in Paris is hired to do a script for an edgy young director he can''t stand. When he falls in love with the director''s cold and manipulative pretty sister, his life starts to unravel and he realizes that he''s been used.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qISuU2idmInI1HoNAxy6BC3PdDT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110928'),
  ('768281975120062996', 'Twisted Romance', 2009, 'Romance, Drama', 'José Celestino Campusano', 'José Celestino Campusano', 'Nehuén Zapata, Oscar Génova, Marisa Pájaro, Javier De la Vega, Olga Perez', null, 'Roberto is a bored young man living in the suburbs of Buenos Aires who begins a relationship with an older man named Raúl. Their romance takes a disturbing turn after Raúl catches Roberto with another man and turns increasingly abusive.', 'Roberto is a bored young man living in the suburbs of Buenos Aires who begins a relationship with an older man named Raúl. Their romance takes a disturbing turn after Raúl catches Roberto with another man and turns increasingly abusive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mb5LVOb8GzREzvc4BQ9IFPapBXI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44359'),
  ('319395156070138018', 'Twisted Sister: We''re Not Gonna Take It', 1984, null, null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 'tmdb:movie:338289'),
  ('236283610524939896', 'Twister', 1989, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michael Almereyda, Renato Berta, Eric Heffron', 'Michael Almereyda', 'Harry Dean Stanton, Suzy Amis, Crispin Glover, Jenny Wright, Dylan McDermott, Charlayne Woodard, Lois Chiles, William S. Burroughs', 'PG-13', 'An oddball family on a Kansas farm are trapped in their farmhouse by an impending storm. The patriarch of the clan is a retired soda pop tycoon. He is currently dating a children''s TV evangelist. Also living at the farm is his layabout daughter and her precocious 8 year old daughter, his would-be artist son, the son''s fiancée, and the black maid. Also thrown into the mix is the daughter''s ex-husband, a ne-er-do-well who is seeking to get back in his ex-wife''s good graces.', 'An oddball family on a Kansas farm are trapped in their farmhouse by an impending storm. The patriarch of the clan is a retired soda pop tycoon. He is currently dating a children''s TV evangelist. Also living at the farm is his layabout daughter and her precocious 8 year old daughter, his would-be artist son, the son''s fiancée, and the black maid. Also thrown into the mix is the daughter''s ex-husband, a ne-er-do-well who is seeking to get back in his ex-wife''s good graces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3Wf4mR6SmqzLae7extudBfpL4b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77780'),
  ('141792798989482179', 'Twister', 1996, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Jan de Bont, Jack N. Green, Matthew Carlisle', 'Michael Crichton, Anne-Marie Martin', 'Helen Hunt, Bill Paxton, Jami Gertz, Cary Elwes, Lois Smith, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Alan Ruck, Sean Whalen', 'PG-13', 'An unprecedented series of violent tornadoes is sweeping across Oklahoma. Tornado chasers, headed by Dr. Jo Harding, attempt to release a groundbreaking device that will allow them to track them and create a more advanced warning system. They are joined by Jo''s soon to be ex-husband Bill, a former tornado chaser himself, and his girlfriend Melissa.', 'An unprecedented series of violent tornadoes is sweeping across Oklahoma. Tornado chasers, headed by Dr. Jo Harding, attempt to release a groundbreaking device that will allow them to track them and create a more advanced warning system. They are joined by Jo''s soon to be ex-husband Bill, a former tornado chaser himself, and his girlfriend Melissa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4ie3f6QTvNw40V770Uzo87SDZn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664'),
  ('546699132268347487', 'Twister''s Revenge!', 1988, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Bill Rebane, Bill Rebane', 'William Arthur, Larry Dreyfus, Bill Rebane', 'Dean West, Meredith Orr, David Alan Smith, R. Richardson Luka, Jay Gjernes, Tena Murray', 'NR', 'Three bumbling criminals have been trying to get their hands on the computerized control system of Mr. Twister, a talking monster truck with a mind of its own.', 'Three bumbling criminals have been trying to get their hands on the computerized control system of Mr. Twister, a talking monster truck with a mind of its own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EVkrZPnIg44tSDCGLjS7e1IzR9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128343'),
  ('801413372520285048', 'Twisters', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'Eric Glasser, Laura Hoyt, Casey O''Neill', 'Mark L. Smith', 'Daisy Edgar-Jones, Glen Powell, Anthony Ramos, Brandon Perea, Maura Tierney, Harry Hadden-Paton, Sasha Lane, Daryl McCormack', 'PG-13', 'As storm season intensifies, the paths of former storm chaser Kate Carter and reckless social-media superstar Tyler Owens collide when terrifying phenomena never seen before are unleashed. The pair and their competing teams find themselves squarely in the paths of multiple storm systems converging over central Oklahoma in the fight of their lives.', 'As storm season intensifies, the paths of former storm chaser Kate Carter and reckless social-media superstar Tyler Owens collide when terrifying phenomena never seen before are unleashed. The pair and their competing teams find themselves squarely in the paths of multiple storm systems converging over central Oklahoma in the fight of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjnD08FlMAIXsfOLKQbvmO0f0MD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718821'),
  ('684546265063949214', 'Twisting the Aces', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Sebastian Tabany, José María ''Pigu'' Gómez', 'Sebastian Tabany', 'Juan Grandinetti, Carolina Kopelioff, Thelma Fardin, Lautaro Delgado Tymruk, Esteban Pérez, Romina Gaetani, Chang Sung Kim, Antonia Bengoechea', null, 'Twisting the Aces is a romantic comedy set in the magic community where things are not what they seem. Martin, an amateur magician, dwells in a world filled with pickpockets, illusions and sleight of hand.', 'Twisting the Aces is a romantic comedy set in the magic community where things are not what they seem. Martin, an amateur magician, dwells in a world filled with pickpockets, illusions and sleight of hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14AqF27ndW3oze4kLmeqJ8fFxSK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:731595'),
  ('179387390117931144', 'Twists and Turns', 1987, 'Animation', 'Garri Bardin, Igor Skidan-Bosin, Vladimir Sidorov', 'Garri Bardin', 'Garri Bardin', null, 'It is a story of the wire man who carried the protection of himself against associates to the point of absurdity, having altered his wife, his dog in a barbed wire, and he fenced off himself from the outwards things.', 'It is a story of the wire man who carried the protection of himself against associates to the point of absurdity, having altered his wife, his dog in a barbed wire, and he fenced off himself from the outwards things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l26XYvXV87JwUmLl9p4pgj74KRe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211553'),
  ('147082846058452768', 'Twitches', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Stuart Gillard, Manfred Guthe', 'Melissa Gould, Dan Berendsen', 'Tia Mowry, Tamera Mowry-Housley, Kristen Wilson, Patrick Fabian, Pat Kelly, Jennifer Robertson, Jessica Greco, Jackie Rosenbaum', 'PG', 'Twins separated at birth, Camryn and Alex meet by chance for the first time on their 21st birthday and discover they''re witches with the power to save their homeland of Coventry from the evil that threatens it. But when Camryn leaves Alex to face the darkness alone, will Coventry be doomed? Or will the sisters multiply their magic by standing together?', 'Twins separated at birth, Camryn and Alex meet by chance for the first time on their 21st birthday and discover they''re witches with the power to save their homeland of Coventry from the evil that threatens it. But when Camryn leaves Alex to face the darkness alone, will Coventry be doomed? Or will the sisters multiply their magic by standing together?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ctDK5B0uR2gre2PxQSSkJZFmh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21481'),
  ('190772273605092077', 'Twitches Too', 2007, 'Drama, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Stuart Gillard, Manfred Guthe', 'Dan Berendsen', 'Tia Mowry, Tamera Mowry-Housley, Kristen Wilson, Patrick Fabian, Pat Kelly, Leslie Seiler, Karen Holness, Arnold Pinnock', 'PG', 'Reunited witch twins Camryn and Alex adjust to their new life as supernatural beings while at the same time trying to maintain a normal existence in this sequel to the magical Disney Channel original movie Twitches. But they soon find themselves going head to head with the forces of darkness that threaten to destroy their world. Luckily, their birth mother, the powerful Miranda, is on hand to help out.', 'Reunited witch twins Camryn and Alex adjust to their new life as supernatural beings while at the same time trying to maintain a normal existence in this sequel to the magical Disney Channel original movie Twitches. But they soon find themselves going head to head with the forces of darkness that threaten to destroy their world. Luckily, their birth mother, the powerful Miranda, is on hand to help out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70aurzbqFMuJnwhIVW2aXeyzBAp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46169'),
  ('741106179171881234', 'Twittering Birds Never Fly: Don''t Stay Gold', 2021, 'Animation, Drama', 'Kaori Makita, Kou Yoneda, Kisuke Koizumi', 'Hiroshi Seko', 'Hiroki Yasumoto, Yuki Ono, Tarusuke Shingaki', 'NR', 'Anime adaptation of the short story "Don''t Stay Gold", to be included in volume 7 of the manga.', 'Anime adaptation of the short story "Don''t Stay Gold", to be included in volume 7 of the manga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6d48p3JLEWtymJMZ4NWu9cfv67.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:673423'),
  ('639223208799926353', 'Twittering Birds Never Fly: The Clouds Gather', 2020, 'Animation, Drama', 'Tadashi Hiramatsu, Mitsuhiro Sato, Noriko Ito', 'Hiroshi Seko', 'Tarusuke Shingaki, Wataru Hatano, Hiroki Yasumoto, Yuki Ono, Toru Okawa, Kenta Miyake, Akimitsu Takase, Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'NR', 'In the hyper-masculine criminal underworld, a masochistic high-ranking yakuza and his newly-assigned bodyguard become increasingly drawn to each other.', 'In the hyper-masculine criminal underworld, a masochistic high-ranking yakuza and his newly-assigned bodyguard become increasingly drawn to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFfA75af7x1IVZq25IWVqvDhgN8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:650498'),
  ('28866161519783379', 'Twixt', 2011, 'Mystery, Fantasy, Horror', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Mihai Malaimare Jr., Darren M. Demetre', 'Francis Ford Coppola', 'Val Kilmer, Elle Fanning, Bruce Dern, Ben Chaplin, Joanne Whalley, David Paymer, Anthony Fusco, Alden Ehrenreich', 'R', 'A washed-up horror novelist arrives in a sleepy town on a book tour, only to stumble into a string of eerie murders. Haunted by dreams of a ghostly girl named V and guided by the spirit of Edgar Allan Poe, he’s drawn into a nightmarish world where fiction and reality blur—and the story he’s chasing leads back to his own buried guilt.', 'A washed-up horror novelist arrives in a sleepy town on a book tour, only to stumble into a string of eerie murders. Haunted by dreams of a ghostly girl named V and guided by the spirit of Edgar Allan Poe, he’s drawn into a nightmarish world where fiction and reality blur—and the story he’s chasing leads back to his own buried guilt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSn7DVovIFeTSiwwoziSYpJFaaS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78381'),
  ('602381077595868226', 'Two', 1965, 'Drama, Family', 'Satyajit Ray, Soumendu Roy', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Ravi Kiran', 'PG', 'This short film shows an encounter, through a series of games, between a street child from the shantytowns and a child of a rich family, stationed at his window. The film has no dialogue and the action moves through the attempts at one-upmanship evident in their successive display of their toys. Their rivalry (a kite shot down by a toy rifle, for example) concludes with the opposition between the world of noise (the toys inside the house) and that of music (the street child''s flute). Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2006.', 'This short film shows an encounter, through a series of games, between a street child from the shantytowns and a child of a rich family, stationed at his window. The film has no dialogue and the action moves through the attempts at one-upmanship evident in their successive display of their toys. Their rivalry (a kite shot down by a toy rifle, for example) concludes with the opposition between the world of noise (the toys inside the house) and that of music (the street child''s flute). Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1WgEyqPfY5iUI5RKGAH69dp7tf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191398'),
  ('599199958151956685', 'Two', 2021, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Mar Targarona, Rafa Lluch, Yannick Robles', 'Cuca Canals, Christian Molina, Mike Hostench', 'Pablo Derqui, Marina Gatell, Kandido Uranga, Anna Chincho Serrano, Esteban Galilea', null, 'Two people, a man and a woman, wake up naked and with their abdomens attached to each other.', 'Two people, a man and a woman, wake up naked and with their abdomens attached to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v23nJWsYGaI3ysikMBWJgIjcGwL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:811072'),
  ('1032733826764163037', 'Two Acres of Land', 1953, 'Drama', 'Bimal Roy, Kamal Bose, Moni Bhattacharjee', 'Hrishikesh Mukherjee', 'Balraj Sahni, Nirupa Roy, Nana Palsikar, Rattan Kumar, Meena Kumari, Mehmood, Murad, Jagdeep', null, 'An impoverished man and his young son travel to Calcutta and look for work, in order to make money that''ll save their ancestral land from being seized by a corporation.', 'An impoverished man and his young son travel to Calcutta and look for work, in order to make money that''ll save their ancestral land from being seized by a corporation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4blIwJ6HG9dqCSmifIhMsu4LvQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54352'),
  ('759647804644055920', 'Two Against the World', 1932, 'Drama', 'Archie Mayo, Charles Rosher', 'Sheridan Gibney', 'Constance Bennett, Neil Hamilton, Helen Vinson, Allen Vincent, Gavin Gordon, Walter Walker, Roscoe Karns, Alan Mowbray', null, 'A socialite finds herself involved in a murder trial that is prosecuted by her boyfriend.', 'A socialite finds herself involved in a murder trial that is prosecuted by her boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wloRsytGmehpsCeN4MZUCl6KKJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170533'),
  ('953011231942706470', 'Two Arabian Knights', 1927, 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'Lewis Milestone, Tony Gaudio, Nate Watt', 'Cyril Gardner, Wallace Smith', 'William Boyd, Mary Astor, Louis Wolheim, Ian Keith, Michael Vavitch, Michael Visaroff, Boris Karloff, DeWitt Jennings', null, 'During World War I, two American soldiers fight to escape the Germans while squabbling over a beautiful harem girl. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with University of Nevada, Las Vegas Foundation in 2016.', 'During World War I, two American soldiers fight to escape the Germans while squabbling over a beautiful harem girl. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with University of Nevada, Las Vegas Foundation in 2016.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SXSpSl2hVVW3rVWh3A1aUB2tYk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102384'),
  ('1147943555723143501', 'Two Arrows. Stone Age Detective', 1989, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Alla Surikova', 'Aleksandr Volodin', 'Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Nikolai Karachentsov, Leonid Yarmolnik, Natalya Gundareva, Alexander Kuznetsov, Sergey Shakurov, Olga Kabo, Mariya Vinogradova', null, 'A parable in the manner of a tragedian based on the play by A. Volodin "On the tribes of the Bison and Scorpions, who lived many thousands of years ago on a small island." The events that the film tells about take place in ancient times, in the Stone Age. In the forest, where a large tribe lives, two shots in the back killed one of the clan, nicknamed Long. His widow demands that the killer become her husband. The head of the clan is trying to find out who the killer is.', 'A parable in the manner of a tragedian based on the play by A. Volodin "On the tribes of the Bison and Scorpions, who lived many thousands of years ago on a small island." The events that the film tells about take place in ancient times, in the Stone Age. In the forest, where a large tribe lives, two shots in the back killed one of the clan, nicknamed Long. His widow demands that the killer become her husband. The head of the clan is trying to find out who the killer is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qP3g8nLDTzzOGcvXm2KGmSk4qdH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221837'),
  ('32945485282225845', 'Two Autumns in Paris', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Axel Berasain, Jose Luis Poleo, Alejandro León', 'Francisco Villarroel, Gustavo Michelena', 'María Antonieta Hidalgo, Francisco Villarroel, Slavko Sorman, Raúl Amundaray, Juan Andres Belgrave, Sonia Villamizar, Calique Pérez, Alberto Rowinsky', null, 'A striking political activist and refugee from Paraguay escapes to Paris and falls in love with a rich law student changing their lives forever. The beauty of their love is challenged by a fervent devotion to fighting for a cause. "Two Autumns in Paris" has won more than 130 awards and was the most awarded Venezuelan film of 2020. A historic examination of class, refugees, and political rebellion that subtly speaks in parallel to the world today. Its turbulent romance set with the background of the ''City of Love''.', 'A striking political activist and refugee from Paraguay escapes to Paris and falls in love with a rich law student changing their lives forever. The beauty of their love is challenged by a fervent devotion to fighting for a cause. "Two Autumns in Paris" has won more than 130 awards and was the most awarded Venezuelan film of 2020. A historic examination of class, refugees, and political rebellion that subtly speaks in parallel to the world today. Its turbulent romance set with the background of the ''City of Love''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IKQJg0CsygOb3zN7Vf6qHGeVAA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:736518'),
  ('785316409931590078', 'Two Bastards in Saint-Tropez', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Max Pécas, Jean-Claude Couty', 'Max Pécas, Marc Pécas', 'Philippe Caroit, Jean-Michel Noirey, Caroline Tresca, Denis Karvil, Claude Bruna, Lillemour Jonsson, Jean Vinci, Stéphanie Billat', null, 'A funny comedy about the adventures of two criminal friends in Saint-Tropez.', 'A funny comedy about the adventures of two criminal friends in Saint-Tropez.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGSL0YKNdKcxTJiAYi8o9tyZYqq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220474'),
  ('61829053682531508', 'Two Birds', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rúnar Rúnarsson, Sophia Olsson', 'Rúnar Rúnarsson', 'Atli Óskar Fjalarsson, Hera Hilmar, Sigurdur Jakob Helgason, Thorunn Jakobsdóttir, Gísli Örn Garðarsson, Ómar Örn Hauksson, Víkingur Kristjánsson', null, 'The story takes place during one bright summer night and follows a group of young teenagers on a journey from innocence to adulthood. The main character is a timid boy who has a typical schoolboy crush on a girl his age, who happens to be a friend of his mate.', 'The story takes place during one bright summer night and follows a group of young teenagers on a journey from innocence to adulthood. The main character is a timid boy who has a typical schoolboy crush on a girl his age, who happens to be a friend of his mate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIfj17UU5NIaabFWvddIJWVeJTe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79266'),
  ('714425328213383150', 'Two Bits', 1995, 'Drama, Family', 'James Foley, Juan Ruiz Anchía', 'Joseph Stefano', 'Jerry Barone, Al Pacino, Mary Elizabeth Mastrantonio, Joe Grifasi, Geoff Pierson, Patrick Borriello, Andy Romano, Donna Mitchell', null, 'It''s a hot summer day in 1933 in South Philly, where 12-year old Gennaro lives with his widowed mom and his ailing grandpa, who sits outside holding tight to his last quarter, which he''s promised to Gennaro and which Gennaro would like to have to buy a ticket to the plush new movie theater. But grandpa''s not ready to pass on the quarter or pass on to his final reward: he has some unfinished business with a woman from his past, and he enlists Gennaro to act as his emissary.', 'It''s a hot summer day in 1933 in South Philly, where 12-year old Gennaro lives with his widowed mom and his ailing grandpa, who sits outside holding tight to his last quarter, which he''s promised to Gennaro and which Gennaro would like to have to buy a ticket to the plush new movie theater. But grandpa''s not ready to pass on the quarter or pass on to his final reward: he has some unfinished business with a woman from his past, and he enlists Gennaro to act as his emissary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ianK4zwR5Vv4JSDm3sNDh3kH86I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40628'),
