  ('554408770607188013', 'Two Champions of Shaolin', 1980, 'Action, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Chiang Sheng, Wu Yao-Shen', 'Ni Kuang, Chang Cheh', 'Chiang Sheng, Lo Meng, Candy Man, Wong Lik, Sun Chien, Lu Feng, Chin Siu-Ho, Kwan Chung', null, 'Shaolin warrior Tung Chien-chen is injured in battle against the hated Wu Tang clan, and nursed back to health by a knife-throwing master. As he recovers, Tung learns this deadly art, and also falls in love with his teacher''s daughter. But when a Wu Tang attack disrupts the young lovers'' wedding, Tung must put his new skill to use as he seeks revenge.', 'Shaolin warrior Tung Chien-chen is injured in battle against the hated Wu Tang clan, and nursed back to health by a knife-throwing master. As he recovers, Tung learns this deadly art, and also falls in love with his teacher''s daughter. But when a Wu Tang attack disrupts the young lovers'' wedding, Tung must put his new skill to use as he seeks revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjlipXEAfONJW9YHEcKbq8Ka7we.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61037'),
