  ('1062551326045527035', 'Two Girls and a Sailor', 1944, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Thorpe, Robert Surtees', 'Richard Connell, Gladys Lehman', 'June Allyson, Gloria DeHaven, Van Johnson, Tom Drake, Henry Stephenson, Henry O''Neill, Ben Blue, Carlos Ramírez', 'NR', 'A sailor helps two sisters start up a service canteen. The sailor soon becomes taken with gorgeous sister Jean, unaware that her sibling Patsy is also in love with him.', 'A sailor helps two sisters start up a service canteen. The sailor soon becomes taken with gorgeous sister Jean, unaware that her sibling Patsy is also in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfU37p0gnRc7lipowNCIbkaE1Jz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80941'),
  ('60243017008330342', 'Two Gun Goofy', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy, Western', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Billy Bletcher', null, 'Bandit Pistol Pete enters a lawless western town and robs a bank. The town is in desperate need of a sheriff. Enter wandering cowboy Goofy who notices a pretty girl being held up in a stagecoach robbery by Pete. Lovestruck and completely oblivious to Pete, he foils the robbery while getting to know the girl better. This earns him a reputation as a great gunslinger and he is challenged to apprehend Pete. Pete tries to get his revenge on Goofy but every attempt backfires due to Goofy''s clumsiness usually directed unintentionally at Pete.', 'Bandit Pistol Pete enters a lawless western town and robs a bank. The town is in desperate need of a sheriff. Enter wandering cowboy Goofy who notices a pretty girl being held up in a stagecoach robbery by Pete. Lovestruck and completely oblivious to Pete, he foils the robbery while getting to know the girl better. This earns him a reputation as a great gunslinger and he is challenged to apprehend Pete. Pete tries to get his revenge on Goofy but every attempt backfires due to Goofy''s clumsiness usually directed unintentionally at Pete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yDq9mVRG1w7Pq8EM0ZkvzEFZKz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67706'),
