  ('563919727792524505', 'Two Hands', 1999, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Gregor Jordan, Malcolm McCulloch', 'Gregor Jordan', 'Heath Ledger, Bryan Brown, Rose Byrne, David Field, Tom Long, Tony Forrow, Mariel McClorey, Susie Porter', 'R', '19-year-old Jimmy is just scraping by in the red-light district of Sydney. When local crime lord Pando offers him a shot at working for his syndicate, Jimmy jumps at the chance to deliver a costly package. But, when Jimmy gets jacked by a couple of kids, he''s indebted to the dangerous gangster for $10,000. Running out of time, he schemes to rob a bank to save himself and a beautiful girl he desires from a gruesome demise.', '19-year-old Jimmy is just scraping by in the red-light district of Sydney. When local crime lord Pando offers him a shot at working for his syndicate, Jimmy jumps at the chance to deliver a costly package. But, when Jimmy gets jacked by a couple of kids, he''s indebted to the dangerous gangster for $10,000. Running out of time, he schemes to rob a bank to save himself and a beautiful girl he desires from a gruesome demise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5jokQZjJ8hT8FSaStbfgY7dUnC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13428'),
