  ('1059876911002806034', 'Two If by Sea', 1996, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bill Bennett, Andrew Lesnie', 'Mike Armstrong, Denis Leary', 'Sandra Bullock, Denis Leary, Yaphet Kotto, Stephen Dillane, Tracey Cherelle Jones, Julia Montgomery Brown, Jane Moffat, Mike Starr', 'R', 'Frank O''Brien, a petty thief, and his 7-year-long girlfriend Roz want to put an end to their unsteady lifestyle and just do that last job, which involves stealing a valuable painting. Frank takes Roz to an island on the coast of New England, where he wants to sell the painting and also hopes that their sagging relationship will get a positive push back up. Not everything goes as planned.', 'Frank O''Brien, a petty thief, and his 7-year-long girlfriend Roz want to put an end to their unsteady lifestyle and just do that last job, which involves stealing a valuable painting. Frank takes Roz to an island on the coast of New England, where he wants to sell the painting and also hopes that their sagging relationship will get a positive push back up. Not everything goes as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSfqAMYqrTtDeAjPtYo0S8nc5Zz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19760'),
  ('295137891689127691', 'Two in the Shadow', 1967, 'Romance, Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Shigeaki Takahashi, Yuzuru Aizawa', 'Nobuo Yamada', 'Yūzō Kayama, Yōko Tsukasa, Mitsuko Mori, Mie Hama, Mitsuko Kusabue, Daisuke Katō, Yoshio Tsuchiya, Yū Fujiki', null, 'A man is involved in a fatal car accident, and though he is blameless, his company transfers him to a remote branch in a small town. Before he leaves, he gives the man''s widow a large sum of money that she uses to move back to her hometown.', 'A man is involved in a fatal car accident, and though he is blameless, his company transfers him to a remote branch in a small town. Before he leaves, he gives the man''s widow a large sum of money that she uses to move back to her hometown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2vXkiwEgkL3HkDyohqx8K8PFhZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126432'),
  ('1040469305114741017', 'Two in the Wave', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Emmanuel Laurent, Nicholas de Pencier, Étienne Carton de Grammont', 'Antoine de Baecque', 'Jean-Luc Godard, François Truffaut, Antoine de Baecque, Isild Le Besco', null, 'An in-depth analysis of the relationship between New Wave pioneers François Truffaut and Jean-Luc Godard, as seen through rare archival footage, interviews, and film excerpts — written and narrated by former Cahiers du Cinéma editor Antoine de Baecque.', 'An in-depth analysis of the relationship between New Wave pioneers François Truffaut and Jean-Luc Godard, as seen through rare archival footage, interviews, and film excerpts — written and narrated by former Cahiers du Cinéma editor Antoine de Baecque.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Z4mSqj46WYTDjE0HP0q5RfOP7K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64074'),
