  ('1119683967638125922', 'Two Little Indians', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, null, 'NR', '"Scoutmaster" Jerry is asked to take a couple orphans with American Indian heritage on a hiking trip. But the mischievous orphans turn the hike into a real war against Tom Cat with axes, bows and rifles.', '"Scoutmaster" Jerry is asked to take a couple orphans with American Indian heritage on a hiking trip. But the mischievous orphans turn the hike into a real war against Tom Cat with axes, bows and rifles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jO2fwReWw9eTUdl7iESrPvLfpiM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97917'),
  ('185376135630071310', 'Two Little Orphans', 1947, 'Comedy', 'Mario Mattoli, Armando Grottini, Tino Santoni', 'Steno, Jean Jacques Rastier, Agenore Incrocci', 'Totò, Carlo Campanini, Isa Barzizza, Nerio Bernardi, Raymond Bussières, Franca Marzi, Ada Dondini, Guglielmo Barnabò', null, 'In 19th-century France, middle-aged orphans Gasparre and Battista, watchmen at an orphanage, find out from a soothsayer that one of them is the offspring of the Hangman of Paris and the other is the son of a count. But it is only a dream of theirs.', 'In 19th-century France, middle-aged orphans Gasparre and Battista, watchmen at an orphanage, find out from a soothsayer that one of them is the offspring of the Hangman of Paris and the other is the son of a count. But it is only a dream of theirs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIMQ4vxtDSHYyadlxl39HMYahVL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64043'),
  ('698822249948031240', 'Two Lives', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Judith Kaufmann, Georg Maas, Judith Kaufmann', 'Christoph Tölle, Georg Maas, Ståle Stein Berg', 'Juliane Köhler, Liv Ullmann, Sven Nordin, Ken Duken, Dennis Storhøi, Vicky Krieps, Rainer Bock, Ursula Werner', null, 'Europe 1990, the Berlin wall has just crumbled: Katrine, raised in East Germany, but now living in Norway for the last 20 years, is a “war child”; the result of a love relationship between a Norwegian woman and a German occupation soldier during World War II. She enjoys a happy family life with her mother, her husband, daughter and granddaughter. But when a lawyer asks her and her mother to witness in a trial against the Norwegian state on behalf of the war children, she resists. Gradually, a web of concealments and secrets is unveiled, until Katrine is finally stripped of everything, and her loved ones are forced to take a stand: What carries more weight, the life they have lived together, or the lie it is based on?', 'Europe 1990, the Berlin wall has just crumbled: Katrine, raised in East Germany, but now living in Norway for the last 20 years, is a “war child”; the result of a love relationship between a Norwegian woman and a German occupation soldier during World War II. She enjoys a happy family life with her mother, her husband, daughter and granddaughter. But when a lawyer asks her and her mother to witness in a trial against the Norwegian state on behalf of the war children, she resists. Gradually, a web of concealments and secrets is unveiled, until Katrine is finally stripped of everything, and her loved ones are forced to take a stand: What carries more weight, the life they have lived together, or the lie it is based on?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqEuWjcYhjpJnNp9FB52resPqCu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149893'),
  ('346409404022954135', 'Two Long Hoots in the Fog', 1981, 'Action, Mystery', 'Valeriy Rodchenko, M. Golubeva, S. Makarichev', 'Edgar Dubrovsky', 'Mykola Hrynko, Aleksandr Porokhovshchikov, Elena Kapitsa, Dagun Omayev, Lyubov Virolainen, Viktor Proskurin, Andrei Tolubeyev, Aleksandr Kovalenko', null, 'In a deserted tundra on the lake, a seaplane makes an emergency landing, on board of which bank collectors carry a large amount of money. A storm begins and the plane relates to the river delta. An unknown person steals money from an airplane and kills a geologist, an accidental witness. And a few days later the ship departs from the northern port for the last navigation voyage, where a recidivist hides among the motley company of passengers, and the captain begins his own investigation...', 'In a deserted tundra on the lake, a seaplane makes an emergency landing, on board of which bank collectors carry a large amount of money. A storm begins and the plane relates to the river delta. An unknown person steals money from an airplane and kills a geologist, an accidental witness. And a few days later the ship departs from the northern port for the last navigation voyage, where a recidivist hides among the motley company of passengers, and the captain begins his own investigation...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkRzDqPfWzmbFTbFdBvuxGV2936.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72622'),
