  ('36946488665562017', 'Two Lottery Tickets', 2016, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Ana Draghici, Paul Negoescu', 'Paul Negoescu', 'Dorian Boguță, Dragoș Bucur, Alexandru Papadopol, Mircea Banu, Elisa Calin, Ioana Florentina Dimitriu, Codin Maticiuc, Alexandru-Victor Nemteanu', null, '3 men from a provincial town who are in an urgent need for money so they decide to buy a lottery ticket. They win the lottery, but very soon, the ticket gets stolen.', '3 men from a provincial town who are in an urgent need for money so they decide to buy a lottery ticket. They win the lottery, but very soon, the ticket gets stolen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fI47w8XxRkJtc2NuavNXI6ngaRf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403429'),
  ('697079649122982055', 'Two Lovers', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Gray, Doug Torres, Francisco Ortiz', 'James Gray, Ric Menello', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Gwyneth Paltrow, Vinessa Shaw, Isabella Rossellini, Moni Moshonov, Elias Koteas, Bob Ari, David Ross', 'R', 'A depressed man moves back in with his parents following a recent heartbreak and finds himself with two women.', 'A depressed man moves back in with his parents following a recent heartbreak and finds himself with two women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/skwYEUcxhUub9QCSwPDMvBySphS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10362'),
  ('276205744315567106', 'Two Lovers and a Bear', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kim Nguyen, Nicolas Bolduc, Lucie Robitaille', 'Kim Nguyen', 'Dane DeHaan, Tatiana Maslany, Gordon Pinsent, John Ralston, Joel Gagne, Jeffrey R. Smith, Johnny Issaluk, Phoenix Wilson', null, 'Set in a small town near the North Pole where roads lead to nowhere, the story follows Roman and Lucy, two burning souls who come together to make a leap for life and inner peace.', 'Set in a small town near the North Pole where roads lead to nowhere, the story follows Roman and Lucy, two burning souls who come together to make a leap for life and inner peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8anLL9m6ON7kTJ4Pbcuofls4gQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325373'),
  ('1143908003172729367', 'Two Loves', 1961, 'Drama', 'William Shanks, Ronald Florance, Charles Walters', 'Ben Maddow', 'Shirley MacLaine, Laurence Harvey, Jack Hawkins, Nobu McCarthy, Ronald Long, Norah Howard, Juano Hernández, Edmund Vargas', null, 'American-born Anna Vorontosov teaches school in a remote, primitive section of northern New Zealand. Her experimental teaching methods have won her the love and affection of her pupils and their parents and the admiration of the unhappily married school inspector, Abercrombie. Her personal life, however, is less secure; frightened of love and sexually inhibited, she has always been aloof with men. Eager to break down this barrier is Englishman Paul Lathrope, a somewhat irrational and immature fellow teacher who aspires to be a singer. Though Anna is attracted to him, she refuses to submit to his advances.', 'American-born Anna Vorontosov teaches school in a remote, primitive section of northern New Zealand. Her experimental teaching methods have won her the love and affection of her pupils and their parents and the admiration of the unhappily married school inspector, Abercrombie. Her personal life, however, is less secure; frightened of love and sexually inhibited, she has always been aloof with men. Eager to break down this barrier is Englishman Paul Lathrope, a somewhat irrational and immature fellow teacher who aspires to be a singer. Though Anna is attracted to him, she refuses to submit to his advances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppi9Q2er7pFwbx2baJrYxYQyYK4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248469'),
  ('401637025223001312', 'Two Males for Alexa', 1971, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Juan Logar, Igino Florentini, Filippo Romano', 'Jesús L. Folgar, Francesco Campitelli, Juan Logar', 'Juan Luis Galiardo, Curd Jürgens, Rosalba Neri, Emma Cohen, Manolo Otero, Eduardo Calvo, Mario Della Vigna, Franco Marletta', null, 'A young girl marries the wealthy father of one of her male friends at college, but she soon finds herself falling for her new husband’s son. The husband finds out about the two, and comes up with what he believes to be a foolproof plan: he will frame his wife and his son for his own murder, then have the pair locked in a room in his remote, isolated estate–with his own dead body.', 'A young girl marries the wealthy father of one of her male friends at college, but she soon finds herself falling for her new husband’s son. The husband finds out about the two, and comes up with what he believes to be a foolproof plan: he will frame his wife and his son for his own murder, then have the pair locked in a room in his remote, isolated estate–with his own dead body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xihXQcC8XjIVRp2q5hSI6SUxTkd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105084'),
  ('463258848546435763', 'Two Many Chefs', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Joaquín Mazón, Ángel Iguacel, Cristina Liberos', 'Joaquín Oristrell', 'Karra Elejalde, Enric Auquer, Megan Montaner, Lander Otaola, Maribel Salas, Gorka Aguinagalde, Yanet Sierra, Manuel Buarque', null, 'Mikel, a young cook, meets with his father Juan, who had been missing for 30 years. While trying to keep his restaurant afloat, Mikel has to take care of crazed Juan, a former cook who suffers from a mental condition that prevents him from recognizing neither the aforementioned time gap nor his son Mikel.', 'Mikel, a young cook, meets with his father Juan, who had been missing for 30 years. While trying to keep his restaurant afloat, Mikel has to take care of crazed Juan, a former cook who suffers from a mental condition that prevents him from recognizing neither the aforementioned time gap nor his son Mikel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2RlMz7xidPUgWP1U19EsThKHAE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:855810'),
