  ('616837598633581943', 'Two Men in Town', 1973, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jean-Jacques Tarbès, José Giovanni', 'José Giovanni', 'Jean Gabin, Alain Delon, Mimsy Farmer, Michel Bouquet, Victor Lanoux, Cécile Vassort, Ilaria Occhini, Guido Alberti', 'NR', 'A former bank robber is released after 10 years in prison. He gets help from a social-worker, but gets harassed by an old cop from his past.', 'A former bank robber is released after 10 years in prison. He gets help from a social-worker, but gets harassed by an old cop from his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tG1hvv3MCeabwubKMzyHRYAfrs8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4680'),
  ('661927806503179591', 'Two Men in Town', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Rachid Bouchareb, Yves Cape', 'Daniel Boulanger, José Giovanni', 'Forest Whitaker, Harvey Keitel, Brenda Blethyn, Luis Guzmán, Dolores Heredia, Ellen Burstyn, Tim Guinee, Reg E. Cathey', 'PG-13', 'A convict is released from prison in a small town in New Mexico. 18 years ago he killed a deputy. The then-and-now sheriff seeks revenge.', 'A convict is released from prison in a small town in New Mexico. 18 years ago he killed a deputy. The then-and-now sheriff seeks revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/df8tTDXxd4wgDgaldnph2I0R2UB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254772'),
  ('171782123962536621', 'Two Monks', 1934, 'Drama, Romance, Mystery', 'Juan Bustillo Oro, Agustín Jiménez', 'Juan Bustillo Oro, José Manuel Cordero', 'Víctor Urruchúa, Carlos Villatoro, Magda Haller, Beltrán de Heredia, Emma Roldán, Alberto Miquel, Manuel Noriega, Manuel Bernaldez', 'NR', 'In a Gothic-styled monastery, a monk named Javier sees the face of another monk, Juan, and suddenly attempts to bludgeon him to death with a heavy crucifix. Both men then relate their own versions of a story of romantic rivalry between them.', 'In a Gothic-styled monastery, a monk named Javier sees the face of another monk, Juan, and suddenly attempts to bludgeon him to death with a heavy crucifix. Both men then relate their own versions of a story of romantic rivalry between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mv1gSN5Bz3Btoacx7T5flr9PWcg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170296'),
  ('1118267909801146214', 'Two Moon Junction', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'Zalman King, Mark Plummer, David Kelley', 'Zalman King', 'Sherilyn Fenn, Richard Tyson, Louise Fletcher, Burl Ives, Kristy McNichol, Don Galloway, Dabbs Greer, Martin Hewitt', 'R', 'A young Southern débutante temporarily abandons her posh lifestyle and upcoming, semi-arranged marriage to have a lustful and erotic fling with a rugged drifter who works at a local carnival.', 'A young Southern débutante temporarily abandons her posh lifestyle and upcoming, semi-arranged marriage to have a lustful and erotic fling with a rugged drifter who works at a local carnival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVYQhaYdUimvuXxWyqktTfe9qxJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5241'),
