  ('1077845726540917366', 'Two Pence Magic', 1929, 'Documentary', 'Hans Richter', 'Hans Richter, Friedrich Raff, Hans von Wolzogen', null, null, 'Two Penny Magic (Zweigroschenzauber) starting off with a little magic trick. It then presents an array of images from swimmers, bicyclers, murderers, airplanes in flight, boxers, lovers, runners, becoming in the end a collection of images in a magazine.', 'Two Penny Magic (Zweigroschenzauber) starting off with a little magic trick. It then presents an array of images from swimmers, bicyclers, murderers, airplanes in flight, boxers, lovers, runners, becoming in the end a collection of images in a magazine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zv6BtRLlY8qJVtVrdJYBOKiSuJY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190085'),
  ('562939187334822539', 'Two People', 1945, 'Drama', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer, Gunnar Fischer', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer', 'Georg Rydeberg, Wanda Rothgardt, Gabriel Alw, Stig Olin', null, 'Set entirely in one room, an innocent young man is accused of plagiarising the work of an old professor. Later, he is blamed for the professor''s murder.', 'Set entirely in one room, an innocent young man is accused of plagiarising the work of an old professor. Later, he is blamed for the professor''s murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUvRN8PlXDKCuh3QLBo7GDwpW0e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103143'),
  ('431947351261940446', 'Two People Exchanging Saliva', 2025, 'Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Alexandre Singh, Natalie Musteata, Julie Navarro', 'Alexandre Singh, Natalie Musteata', 'Zar Amir Ebrahimi, Luàna Bajrami, Aurélie Boquien, Vicky Krieps, Nicolas Bouchaud, Mitchell Jean, Mustapha Abourachid, Thibault De Lussy', null, 'In a society where kissing is punishable by death, and people pay for things by receiving slaps to the face, Angine, an unhappy woman, shops compulsively in a department store. There, she becomes fascinated by a playful salesgirl. Despite the prohibition of kissing, the two become close, raising the suspicions of a jealous colleague.', 'In a society where kissing is punishable by death, and people pay for things by receiving slaps to the face, Angine, an unhappy woman, shops compulsively in a department store. There, she becomes fascinated by a playful salesgirl. Despite the prohibition of kissing, the two become close, raising the suspicions of a jealous colleague.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LKpAyHWixkYXtjxSE0RpWljIh4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1340625'),
  ('785547617661112461', 'Two Pesos Left', 1949, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joaquín Pardavé, Víctor Herrera', 'José Fernández del Villar, Joaquín Pardavé', 'Sara García, Joaquín Pardavé, Alicia Caro, Abel Salazar, Alfredo Varela, Conchita Gentil Arcos', null, 'Comedy/melodrama: player runs out on his pregnant girlfriend, and her mother''s boyfriend steps in to set matters straight.', 'Comedy/melodrama: player runs out on his pregnant girlfriend, and her mother''s boyfriend steps in to set matters straight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AdNwjadZUsmbXXm1RhrzkPvHL5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321037'),
  ('665795966037440891', 'Two Pianos', 2025, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Arnaud Desplechin, Paul Guilhaume, Marion Dehaene', 'Kamen Velkovsky', 'François Civil, Nadia Tereszkiewicz, Charlotte Rampling, Hippolyte Girardot, Alba Gaïa Bellugi, Jeremy Lewin, Anne Kessler, Marianne Pommier', null, 'Returning to France after a long exile, pianist Mathias Vogler reunites with his mentor, Elena, to prepare a concert. In a park, an encounter with a child who looks just like him will lead him to Claude, the woman he once loved.', 'Returning to France after a long exile, pianist Mathias Vogler reunites with his mentor, Elena, to prepare a concert. In a park, an encounter with a child who looks just like him will lead him to Claude, the woman he once loved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Z27IprXzNVTZobPXW54QHlLyIf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1331349'),
  ('311868507101231057', 'Two Plus Two', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Alfonso Pineda Ulloa', null, 'Tessa Ía, Luis Ernesto Franco, Adriana Louvier, Claudio Lafarga, Arath de la Torre, Martha Claudia Moreno, Adriana Montes de Oca, Juan Carlos Remolina', null, 'Sara and Enrique''s marriage is going through a monotonous crisis he''s completely clueless about. Fortunately, Sara hears from Lucy a secret that might be the answer to saving her relationship: Lucy and Ricardo practice polygamy.', 'Sara and Enrique''s marriage is going through a monotonous crisis he''s completely clueless about. Fortunately, Sara hears from Lucy a secret that might be the answer to saving her relationship: Lucy and Ricardo practice polygamy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcjTf0tBJoGwJQbdai4GmX8d1Om.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:933886'),
  ('499778253183702318', 'Two Public Enemies', 1964, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Lucio Fulci, Giorgio Gallizio, Emilio P. Miraglia', 'Castellano, Pipolo, Lucio Fulci', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Margaret Lee, Linda Sini, Riccardo Garrone, Poldo Bendandi, Mino Doro, Gianni Dei', null, 'Two two-bit crooks get in the way of a criminal ring and cause a hold up to fail. The two flee to Paradise avoiding a reprisal and try and steal Saint Peter''s halo.', 'Two two-bit crooks get in the way of a criminal ring and cause a hold up to fail. The two flee to Paradise avoiding a reprisal and try and steal Saint Peter''s halo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtY0dQEjkFWo0kQbMPBgOwSVx6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107092'),
  ('605744293927800607', 'Two Queens and One Consort', 1981, 'Drama', 'Otto Jongerius', 'Otto Jongerius', 'Linda van Dyck, Clerckx Eric, Tim Beekman, Jan Decleir, Kitty Courbois, Huib Broos, Max Croiset, Rijk de Gooyer', null, 'At the deathbed of his used-to-be militant mother an older man looks back at his childhood, when he was in love with his sensual aunt Coleta.', 'At the deathbed of his used-to-be militant mother an older man looks back at his childhood, when he was in love with his sensual aunt Coleta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCsdJj0ActXxkjxvEvrFdbTnjQa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80992'),
  ('543348004282369457', 'Two R-R-Ringos from Texas', 1967, 'Western, Comedy', 'Marino Girolami, Carlo Moscovini, Renzo Girolami', 'Amedeo Sollazzo, Roberto Gianviti', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Ennio Girolami, Gloria Paul, Hélène Chanel, Livio Lorenzon, Enzo Andronico, Silvio Bagolini', null, 'A western comedy starring the Sicilian comedians Franco and Ciccio who produced dozens of such spoofs in the 1960s. This time, they quote mainly "The Good, the Bad And the Ugly". Ciccio is sergeant in the army and Franco volunteers to join (after too many drinks). Franco has a talking horse telling him where a treasure is buried. They have to get behind enemy lines in the civil war to get hold of it, though.', 'A western comedy starring the Sicilian comedians Franco and Ciccio who produced dozens of such spoofs in the 1960s. This time, they quote mainly "The Good, the Bad And the Ugly". Ciccio is sergeant in the army and Franco volunteers to join (after too many drinks). Franco has a talking horse telling him where a treasure is buried. They have to get behind enemy lines in the civil war to get hold of it, though.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWHmHJ96PormM9vMDQvgSxl3wrm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131492'),
  ('702837182785895571', 'Two Rabbits', 2012, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Afonso Poyart, Carlos André Zalasik', 'Izaías Almada, Afonso Poyart', 'Fernando Alves Pinto, Alessandra Negrini, Caco Ciocler, Marat Descartes, Neco Vila Lobos, Thaíde, Robson Nunes, Thogun Teixeira', null, 'Edgar is a young upper-middle class man, close to completing 30 years old, he lives a full life crisis and is in a position common to the vast majority of Brazilians. On the one hand the power, represented by a corrupt state, abusive and absent in their taxes before their obligations. On the other, crime increasingly organized violence became a constant in the lives of citizens in large cities. Edgar responds to all this as a modern vigilante. With the help of ingredients such as technology, counter-information and manipulation, Edgar concocts a brilliant plan, using the greed of their opponents as the reason for its destruction. As the plot unfolds, we know more about the dark past of each character as Edgar fit the pieces together in an intriguing puzzle that makes up the film''s plot.', 'Edgar is a young upper-middle class man, close to completing 30 years old, he lives a full life crisis and is in a position common to the vast majority of Brazilians. On the one hand the power, represented by a corrupt state, abusive and absent in their taxes before their obligations. On the other, crime increasingly organized violence became a constant in the lives of citizens in large cities. Edgar responds to all this as a modern vigilante. With the help of ingredients such as technology, counter-information and manipulation, Edgar concocts a brilliant plan, using the greed of their opponents as the reason for its destruction. As the plot unfolds, we know more about the dark past of each character as Edgar fit the pieces together in an intriguing puzzle that makes up the film''s plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a10bWLpmCSlfz2olvOprIWUdras.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102784'),
  ('743606411412456278', 'Two Rémi, Two', 2015, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Pierre Léon', 'Pierre Léon', 'Serge Bozon, Pascal Cervo, Luna Picoli-Truffaut, Bernard Eisenschitz, Jean-Christophe Bouvet, Pascale Bodet, Martial Salomon, Patricia Mazuy', null, 'Thirty years old, a nothing job, a timid love affair: Rémi is a little at sea in his life. Until the day when he must share it with his double, another him, invasive and not so nice. Which one will be the true Rémi?', 'Thirty years old, a nothing job, a timid love affair: Rémi is a little at sea in his life. Until the day when he must share it with his double, another him, invasive and not so nice. Which one will be the true Rémi?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fd4gbZktzxGqBaJV3OH42AsI9Kh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354430'),
  ('504592838297933024', 'Two Revue Girls', 1972, 'Comedy, Music', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol, Vicente Minaya Ortega', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Lina Morgan, Manolo Gómez Bur, Dyanik Zurakowska, Antonio Ozores, Ingrid Garbo, Paco Valladares, Florinda Chico, Rafaela Aparicio', null, 'A Madrid theater is looking for girls for a new company of revue shows. One of the girls presented is Catalina, very sawy and restless, daughter of a seamstress of the theater. Another candidate is an innocent girl who studies ballet abroad and is the daughter of a famous star, Cecilia Alcaraz. Soon the two girls become good friends and Catalina intends to succeed Alice. Alicia''s success also benefits her friend making them the most famous theatrical couple times. But with success comes love, which is also a major impediment to their careers.', 'A Madrid theater is looking for girls for a new company of revue shows. One of the girls presented is Catalina, very sawy and restless, daughter of a seamstress of the theater. Another candidate is an innocent girl who studies ballet abroad and is the daughter of a famous star, Cecilia Alcaraz. Soon the two girls become good friends and Catalina intends to succeed Alice. Alicia''s success also benefits her friend making them the most famous theatrical couple times. But with success comes love, which is also a major impediment to their careers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwnS09oWsSqeUQrqZ3VyPTQ2YkU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141804'),
  ('361852931733166923', 'Two Rode Together', 1961, 'Western', 'John Ford, Charles Lawton Jr., Wingate Smith', 'Frank S. Nugent', 'James Stewart, Richard Widmark, Shirley Jones, Linda Cristal, Andy Devine, John McIntire, Paul Birch, Willis Bouchey', 'NR', 'Two tough westerners bring home a group of settlers who have spent years as Comanche hostages.', 'Two tough westerners bring home a group of settlers who have spent years as Comanche hostages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAFUWIeHyaY357N36XLphDfh38u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32634'),
  ('181867728647934409', 'Two Scent''s Worth', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'A crook disguises a cat as a skunk to scare people out of a bank. Soon after, great lover Pepé Le Pew sees her and the chase is on through the French Alps.', 'A crook disguises a cat as a skunk to scare people out of a bank. Soon after, great lover Pepé Le Pew sees her and the chase is on through the French Alps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ZrJ5LxD4HOqGfD9haZmazvBe2H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226809'),
  ('745145516764705016', 'Two Seconds', 1932, 'Drama, Crime', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Sol Polito', null, 'Edward G. Robinson, Vivienne Osborne, Guy Kibbee, Preston Foster, J. Carrol Naish, Frederick Burton, Harry Beresford, Dorothea Wolbert', 'NR', 'A condemned murderer, in the process of being executed, relives the events that led to his being sentenced to die in the electric chair. Told in flashback, we witness a sleazy dancehall girl (Vivienne Osborne) dupe a high rise riveter (Edward G. Robinson) into marriage so she can live off of him. But when he loses his job and his marbles, she ends up supporting him with money from her side man--and misses no opportunity to rub it in his face that she''s now supporting him in his emasculated state. As the animosity grows and things get more and more unbearable, he is eventually driven to desperate measures.', 'A condemned murderer, in the process of being executed, relives the events that led to his being sentenced to die in the electric chair. Told in flashback, we witness a sleazy dancehall girl (Vivienne Osborne) dupe a high rise riveter (Edward G. Robinson) into marriage so she can live off of him. But when he loses his job and his marbles, she ends up supporting him with money from her side man--and misses no opportunity to rub it in his face that she''s now supporting him in his emasculated state. As the animosity grows and things get more and more unbearable, he is eventually driven to desperate measures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSsJxhXgkoqijFV5gRe2BvahJP1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26714'),
  ('713017717674062989', 'Two Ships', 2012, 'Drama', 'Justine Triet, Nicolas Boucher, Tom Harari', 'Laetitia Dosch, Thomas Lévy-Lasne', 'Thomas Lévy-Lasne, Laetitia Dosch, Serge Riaboukine, Eric Bouroukhoff, Andre Dieuaide, Chloé Lagrenade, Guillaume Saurrel, Virgil Vernier', null, 'The overexcited night of a young pinched painter and a crazy comedienne. In the impossibility to end up alone, Laetitia and Thomas cross every situation between drama and lightness, until a violent event marks their meeting of a strange complicity.', 'The overexcited night of a young pinched painter and a crazy comedienne. In the impossibility to end up alone, Laetitia and Thomas cross every situation between drama and lightness, until a violent event marks their meeting of a strange complicity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAJ4FSG5PuN92peIcUpvinEFidF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224613'),
  ('205259151611099564', 'Two Shots Fired', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Martín Rejtman, Lucio Bonelli, Federico D''Auria', 'Martín Rejtman', 'Susana Pampín, Rafael Federman, Camila Fabbri, Walter Jakob, Laura Paredes, Manuela Martelli, Fabián Arenillas, Claudia Cantero', null, 'Mariano, 16, inexplicably and without warning, shoots himself twice and improbably survives. Then, life goes on. His brother pursues a romance with a girl working at a fast-food joint, his mother takes off on a trip with a stranger, and Mariano recruits a woman to join his medieval wind ensemble.', 'Mariano, 16, inexplicably and without warning, shoots himself twice and improbably survives. Then, life goes on. His brother pursues a romance with a girl working at a fast-food joint, his mother takes off on a trip with a stranger, and Mariano recruits a woman to join his medieval wind ensemble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhhpYD8iJiSoFgvlgIK9Fnm5eaD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285463'),
  ('849146751152655382', 'Two Sinners and a Mule', 2023, 'Western, Action', 'Raliegh Wilson', 'Beau Hilliard', 'Cam Gigandet, Chantelle Albers, Hannah James, Cord Newman, Buck Taylor, Luce Rains, Mohamed Karim, Richard Gabai', 'R', 'Kicked out of a small Western town for sinful behavior, free-spirited Alice and Nora set out for Virginia City to pursue their dream of opening a restaurant. Out on the prairie, they come across an injured bounty hunter named Elden. Hoping to share in the reward, they nurse Elden back to health and help him stalk his prey, Grimes. But as Nora and Alice both develop feelings for Elden, no one notices that Grimes is now on their tail, and the hunters become the hunted…', 'Kicked out of a small Western town for sinful behavior, free-spirited Alice and Nora set out for Virginia City to pursue their dream of opening a restaurant. Out on the prairie, they come across an injured bounty hunter named Elden. Hoping to share in the reward, they nurse Elden back to health and help him stalk his prey, Grimes. But as Nora and Alice both develop feelings for Elden, no one notices that Grimes is now on their tail, and the hunters become the hunted…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icL1zn5z1L5ULIpxkuOLjeUgURY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1111140'),
  ('80360327862175552', 'Two Sisters', 1991, 'Animation', 'Caroline Leaf', 'Caroline Leaf', 'Kathleen Fee, Jane Woods, Michael Rudder', null, 'A facially disfigured author''s life with her guardian of a sister is disrupted when a stranger arrives at their door, claiming to be a fan.', 'A facially disfigured author''s life with her guardian of a sister is disrupted when a stranger arrives at their door, claiming to be a fan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dn3fxBbgTuOUesB6vNFPnvvEUYe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129631'),
  ('1141242565621261872', 'Two Smart People', 1946, 'Romance, Drama, Crime', 'Jules Dassin, Karl Freund, Sid Sidman', 'Ethel Hill, Leslie Charteris', 'Lucille Ball, John Hodiak, Lloyd Nolan, Hugo Haas, Lenore Ulric, Elisha Cook Jr., Lloyd Corrigan, Vladimir Sokoloff', 'NR', 'Con woman Ricki Woodner and detective Bob Simms follow a prison-bound swindler Ace Connors on his five-day gourmet binge.', 'Con woman Ricki Woodner and detective Bob Simms follow a prison-bound swindler Ace Connors on his five-day gourmet binge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZUI1xQJs9rTn80STvEhQjys5FT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87939'),
  ('586029481025209362', 'Two Soldiers', 1943, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Leonid Lukov, Aleksandr Gintsburg, V. Viktorov', 'Yevgeni Gabrilovich', 'Mark Bernes, Boris Andreyev, Vera Shershnyova, Yanina Zheymo, Maksim Shtraukh, Ivan Kuznetsov, Stepan Krylov, Lavrenti Masokha', null, 'A story about the friendship between two young men, two soldiers - Arkady from Odessa and Sasha from Ural.', 'A story about the friendship between two young men, two soldiers - Arkady from Odessa and Sasha from Ural.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v28KWHLStQ3ncTb5SaRlUVoHgBv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201840'),
  ('258646684158571548', 'Two Solutions to One Problem', 1975, 'Family, Drama', 'Abbas Kiarostami', 'Abbas Kiarostami', null, null, 'During breaktime, Dara and Nader have a fierce argument about a torn exercise book that the former has given back to the latter. There are two possible outcomes, which the film shows one after the other. One is that Dara wants to get his own back, and the two boys start a violent fight; the other is that they work together to mend the exercise book with a little glue.', 'During breaktime, Dara and Nader have a fierce argument about a torn exercise book that the former has given back to the latter. There are two possible outcomes, which the film shows one after the other. One is that Dara wants to get his own back, and the two boys start a violent fight; the other is that they work together to mend the exercise book with a little glue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LcjEVSRhoBblQGB49loHb8CLEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94513'),
  ('601797166709105055', 'Two Sons of Francisco', 2005, 'Drama, History, Music', 'Breno Silveira, André Horta, Calvito Leal', 'Patrícia Andrade, Carolina Kotscho', 'Ângelo Antônio, Dira Paes, Dablio Moreira, Marcos Henrique, Márcio Kieling, Palomma Duarte, Wigor Lima, Thiago Mendonça', null, 'The story of Francisco, a very simple and poor man whose dream was to see his children become country music stars, and who made all the efforts to make it happen.', 'The story of Francisco, a very simple and poor man whose dream was to see his children become country music stars, and who made all the efforts to make it happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ub8vYfI1zgW4WItWDQ5mT6q5tzQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49367'),
  ('507039954328138411', 'Two Sons of Ringo', 1966, 'Comedy, Western', 'Giorgio Simonelli, Tino Santoni, Giuliano Carnimeo', 'Marcello Ciorciolini, Roberto Gianviti, Amedeo Sollazzo', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, George Hilton, Gloria Paul, Orchidea De Santis, Ignazio Spalla, Ivano Staccioli, Mimmo Palmara', null, 'Another spoof from the Franco and Ciccio team in which the boys, who are running a scam pretending to be bounty hunters, are ''persuaded'' to help a real bounty hunter discover a treasure by claiming to be the heirs of a deceased lawman.', 'Another spoof from the Franco and Ciccio team in which the boys, who are running a scam pretending to be bounty hunters, are ''persuaded'' to help a real bounty hunter discover a treasure by claiming to be the heirs of a deceased lawman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1V4QNS3tSGfbxf6wLxia8xBJ9Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121329'),
