  ('231651033373002524', 'Two Stepmoms', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Luca Lucini, Claudio Cofrancesco, Giuseppe Curti', 'Doriana Leondeff, Francesca Manieri', 'Margherita Buy, Claudia Gerini, Giampaolo Morelli, Paolo Calabresi, Andrea Bosca, Gigio Morra, Lucia Ragni, Shi Yang', null, 'What would happen if two sworn enemies, two opposed women in temperament and lifestyle find out to share the most incredible legacy: the child of their ex-husband?', 'What would happen if two sworn enemies, two opposed women in temperament and lifestyle find out to share the most incredible legacy: the child of their ex-husband?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBhtcPan4jRqmpbraCRjv3X6Db3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392832'),
  ('454882612948205758', 'Two Summers', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jorge Furtado, Débora Peters, Alfredo Barros', 'Jorge Furtado', 'André Arteche, Ana Maria Mainieri, Pedro Furtado, Júlia Barth, Victória Mazzini, Marcelo Aquino, Janaína Kremer, Yuri Ferreira', null, 'A coming of age dramatic comedy dealing with the effect that two "summers" have on the lives of several teenagers. The main story involves an innocent teenage boy and a conniving teenage girl who meet on a beach one summer in Southern Brazil. They meet up again the following summer', 'A coming of age dramatic comedy dealing with the effect that two "summers" have on the lives of several teenagers. The main story involves an innocent teenage boy and a conniving teenage girl who meet on a beach one summer in Southern Brazil. They meet up again the following summer', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pw1Hyo2uvDOVCCdL1BtoCGSl8P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70148'),
