  ('281210250225261459', 'Two Tough Guys', 2003, 'Crime, Comedy, Action', 'Juan Martínez Moreno, Gonzalo F. Berridi', 'Juan Martínez Moreno', 'Antonio Resines, Jordi Vilches, Elena Anaya, Rosa María Sardà, Joan Crosas, Manuel Alexandre, Pedro Beitia, Fele Martínez', null, 'Two botcher killers, Paco and Alex carry out a crime caper. Later on, they are joined by Tatiana - ​a young whore, who shows great love for Alex. In pursuing its objective the losers will face a group of murderers, a butcher with dark business, a nasty gangster and a lot more...', 'Two botcher killers, Paco and Alex carry out a crime caper. Later on, they are joined by Tatiana - ​a young whore, who shows great love for Alex. In pursuing its objective the losers will face a group of murderers, a butcher with dark business, a nasty gangster and a lot more...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBl8C2meBBN0mnh3WpIztsxrn12.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29006'),
