  ('233664156991962977', 'Two Weeks in Another Town', 1962, 'Drama', 'Vincente Minnelli, Milton Krasner, Erich von Stroheim Jr.', 'Charles Schnee', 'Kirk Douglas, Edward G. Robinson, Cyd Charisse, George Hamilton, Claire Trevor, Daliah Lavi, James Gregory, Rosanna Schiaffino', 'NR', 'After spending three years in an asylum, a washed-up actor views a minor assignment from his old director in Rome as a chance for personal and professional redemption.', 'After spending three years in an asylum, a washed-up actor views a minor assignment from his old director in Rome as a chance for personal and professional redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjVuuUXNrGgekTmW5ZqL1ujG7b4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62655'),
  ('487103499165355894', 'Two Weeks in September', 1967, 'Drama, Romance', 'Serge Bourguignon, Edmond Séchan', null, 'Brigitte Bardot, Laurent Terzieff, Jean Rochefort, James Robertson Justice, Michael Sarne, Georgina Ward, Carole Lebel, Annie Nicholas', null, 'Story of a woman torn between her love for two different men.', 'Story of a woman torn between her love for two different men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ta3smR30ld8W9zxut9Ds6lTlUQD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82966'),
  ('558586765725448334', 'Two Weeks Notice', 2002, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Marc Lawrence, László Kovács, Raymond Prado', 'Marc Lawrence', 'Sandra Bullock, Hugh Grant, Dana Ivey, Robert Klein, Alicia Witt, Heather Burns, David Haig, Dorian Missick', 'PG-13', 'Dedicated environmental lawyer Lucy Kelson goes to work for billionaire George Wade as part of a deal to preserve a community center. Indecisive and weak-willed George grows dependent on Lucy''s guidance on everything from legal matters to clothing. Exasperated, Lucy gives notice and picks Harvard graduate June Carter as her replacement. As Lucy''s time at the firm nears an end, she grows jealous of June and has second thoughts about leaving George.', 'Dedicated environmental lawyer Lucy Kelson goes to work for billionaire George Wade as part of a deal to preserve a community center. Indecisive and weak-willed George grows dependent on Lucy''s guidance on everything from legal matters to clothing. Exasperated, Lucy gives notice and picks Harvard graduate June Carter as her replacement. As Lucy''s time at the firm nears an end, she grows jealous of June and has second thoughts about leaving George.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r18hSGAcxWiUysbX6nFShIZyjjP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2642'),
  ('176907104520800021', 'Two Weeks Vacation', 1952, 'Animation', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Alan Reed', null, 'After several long days at work, Goofy finally takes a much needed vacation. However, his trip never quite gets off the ground mainly because he spends most of it stuck behind a slow moving trailer. When he gets a flat tire, the mechanic inspects every part of his car except the tire. The only motel he can find is a little shack too close to a railroad track. On the road once more, he gets stuck behind said trailer again only to pass it and discover no one is driving it.', 'After several long days at work, Goofy finally takes a much needed vacation. However, his trip never quite gets off the ground mainly because he spends most of it stuck behind a slow moving trailer. When he gets a flat tire, the mechanic inspects every part of his car except the tire. The only motel he can find is a little shack too close to a railroad track. On the road once more, he gets stuck behind said trailer again only to pass it and discover no one is driving it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Jbdff3bzb89m4nQLlfPywgiZDv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67704'),
  ('169097204980121126', 'Two Weeks with Love', 1950, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Roy Rowland, Alfred Gilks, George Stoll', 'John Larkin, Dorothy Kingsley', 'Jane Powell, Ricardo Montalban, Debbie Reynolds, Ann Harding, Louis Calhern, Carleton Carpenter, Phyllis Kirk, Clinton Sundberg', 'NR', 'The Robinson family are spending two weeks of summer vacation at a resort in the Catskills. Older daughter Patti vies with her friend, Valeria, for the affections of Demi Armendez but Patti is at a disadvantage because her parents think she is too young for boys. But with Patti singing at an amateur show and a dance, her adventures in quest of Armendez ends happily.', 'The Robinson family are spending two weeks of summer vacation at a resort in the Catskills. Older daughter Patti vies with her friend, Valeria, for the affections of Demi Armendez but Patti is at a disadvantage because her parents think she is too young for boys. But with Patti singing at an amateur show and a dance, her adventures in quest of Armendez ends happily.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgyK616Z93Z0536iZhwLZbnuEG2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43395'),
  ('50377915352672056', 'Two Witches', 2023, 'Horror', 'Pierre Tsigaridis', 'Pierre Tsigaridis, Maxime Rancon', 'Rebekah Kennedy, Belle Adams, Jacob DeMonte-Finn, Tim Fox, Clint Glenn Hummel, Danielle Kennedy, Kristina Klebe, Ian Michaels', 'R', 'A matriarchal witch passes on her sinister inheritance to her grand-daughter, triggering the most horrific curses.', 'A matriarchal witch passes on her sinister inheritance to her grand-daughter, triggering the most horrific curses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6JHz23BOfbzWxL5JsrBWQHqMuh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785759'),
  ('356778498990979054', 'Two Women', 1999, 'Drama', 'Tahmine Milani', 'Tahmine Milani', 'Niki Karimi, Mohammad Reza Foroutan, Reza Khandan, Atila Pesyani, Merila Zarei, Ahmad Yavari Shad, Hassan Joharchi', null, 'A sensation when released in 1999 in Iran, Two Women charts the lives of two promising architecture students over the course of the first turbulent years of the Islamic Republic. Tahimine Milani creates this scathing portrait of those traditions - aided by official indifference - which conspire to trap women and stop them from realizing their full potential; the inclusion of frank depictions of domestic violence was hailed by many as a breakthrough in dealing with a long taboo subject.', 'A sensation when released in 1999 in Iran, Two Women charts the lives of two promising architecture students over the course of the first turbulent years of the Islamic Republic. Tahimine Milani creates this scathing portrait of those traditions - aided by official indifference - which conspire to trap women and stop them from realizing their full potential; the inclusion of frank depictions of domestic violence was hailed by many as a breakthrough in dealing with a long taboo subject.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odofuhiIv1uwEnYYKuywTxqBjPQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125550'),
  ('644448993091845481', 'Two Women', 2009, 'Drama', 'Rui Poças, João Mário Grilo', 'Tereza Coelho, Rui Cardoso Martins', 'Beatriz Batarda, Virgílio Castelo, Débora Monteiro, Marcello Urgeghe, Sofia Grillo, José Pinto, João Perry, Nicolau Breyner', null, 'Joana, 40 years old medical phychiatric, is married to Paul, an executive of a large financial company. Paul hopes that Joana fulfils her role and follows his constant social influences demonstrations. But the marriage is profoundly altered when Mónica, a young model, enters Joana´s life. Irresistibly attracted, they involved romantically, in a world of liberating experiences and feelings. But this will be a short trip, since the revelation of this affair forces Paulo to take drastic measures... ~ FICA', 'Joana, 40 years old medical phychiatric, is married to Paul, an executive of a large financial company. Paul hopes that Joana fulfils her role and follows his constant social influences demonstrations. But the marriage is profoundly altered when Mónica, a young model, enters Joana´s life. Irresistibly attracted, they involved romantically, in a world of liberating experiences and feelings. But this will be a short trip, since the revelation of this affair forces Paulo to take drastic measures... ~ FICA', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psHA5f4iv8jy6aAMFHorzfP0wY3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130105'),
  ('821701528775630978', 'Two Women', 2021, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Isabelle Doval', 'Stéphane Brisset', 'Odile Vuillemin, Agathe Bonitzer, Aurélien Recoing, Nicolas Beaucaire, Pierre Rochefort, Wallerand Denormandie, Nicolas Wanczycki, Stéphan Wojtowicz', null, 'In 1965, Monique Case, who claimed her moral freedom, was wrongly accused by misogynist cops. She will be saved from the guillotine by a shy and reserved examining magistrate who chooses to rebel against the machismo of the judicial hierarchy and of the time.', 'In 1965, Monique Case, who claimed her moral freedom, was wrongly accused by misogynist cops. She will be saved from the guillotine by a shy and reserved examining magistrate who chooses to rebel against the machismo of the judicial hierarchy and of the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3g8t7tQU6nsSz7zdpaHcqizkI8V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:865484'),
  ('196389016422760161', 'Two Women', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Chloé Robichaud, Sara Mishara, Noémie Sirois', 'Catherine Léger', 'Karine Gonthier-Hyndman, Laurence Leboeuf, Félix Moati, Mani Soleymanlou, Sophie Nélisse, Juliette Gariépy, Isabelle Brouillette, Mateo Laurent Membreño Daigle', null, 'Violette and Florence are two women with something in common, beyond being neighbours. While one finds herself on an emotional edge during her maternity leave, the other feels nothing at all, and neither can make sense of what’s happening to them. Realising that their suburban lives have left them unfulfilled, Florence begins an affair that kicks off a sexual revolution where having fun is the top priority. But between handyman hookups, chaotic misadventures, and marital strife, is reality destined to come crashing down on them?', 'Violette and Florence are two women with something in common, beyond being neighbours. While one finds herself on an emotional edge during her maternity leave, the other feels nothing at all, and neither can make sense of what’s happening to them. Realising that their suburban lives have left them unfulfilled, Florence begins an affair that kicks off a sexual revolution where having fun is the top priority. But between handyman hookups, chaotic misadventures, and marital strife, is reality destined to come crashing down on them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6DEvzbkkTRlTYqsoC4t8K6vEYg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1073588'),
  ('903061188502980365', 'Two Worlds', 2007, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Daniel Cohen, Laurent Dailland', 'Jean-Marc Culiersi, Daniel Cohen', 'Florence Loiret Caille, Benoît Poelvoorde, Natacha Lindinger, Michel Duchaussoy, Catherine Mouchet, Daniel Cohen, Pascal Elso, Arly Jover', null, 'A French tradesman travels in time and liberates an oppressed tribe in another world.', 'A French tradesman travels in time and liberates an oppressed tribe in another world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQwYEMqoNf1IfeE5NRJ5WGn4Izr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14791'),
  ('1016212320965004799', 'Two Worlds One Wish', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ketche, Serkan Yıldırım', 'Elçin Muslu', 'Hande Erçel, Metin Akdülger, Serkan Tınmaz, Eylül Su Sapan, Nazlıcan Demir, Hüseyin Avni Danyal, İdil Fırat, Didem İnselel', null, 'Twenty-one years after a magical meeting at a children''s hospital, Bilge and Can suddenly begin hearing each other''s voices telepathically. What seems like a miracle soon reveals a hidden secret, as fate-reuniting them after decades-has much more in store.', 'Twenty-one years after a magical meeting at a children''s hospital, Bilge and Can suddenly begin hearing each other''s voices telepathically. What seems like a miracle soon reveals a hidden secret, as fate-reuniting them after decades-has much more in store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZcwX1aN2RdCLwamxdkoINIhVAm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1522377'),
  ('289935138276362280', 'Two-Edged Knife', 1989, 'Crime', 'Murilo Salles', 'Murilo Salles, Leopoldo Serran, Alcione Araújo', 'Paulo José, Marieta Severo, José de Abreu, Flávio Galvão, Ursula Canto, Pedro Vasconcelos, Rai Alves, Paulo Goulart', null, 'Paulo is a rich lawyer who has a happy and comfortable family life, with his kid and very loyal to his wife. But when he finds out that the woman is cheating on him with his business partner and best friend, he decides to execute a perfect plan that involves murdering both and easily getting away with murder. However, Paulo''s plans are about to be ruined due to some unpredictable factors involving powerful people, plenty of money, the kidnap of his son and a tenacious inspector following his steps.', 'Paulo is a rich lawyer who has a happy and comfortable family life, with his kid and very loyal to his wife. But when he finds out that the woman is cheating on him with his business partner and best friend, he decides to execute a perfect plan that involves murdering both and easily getting away with murder. However, Paulo''s plans are about to be ruined due to some unpredictable factors involving powerful people, plenty of money, the kidnap of his son and a tenacious inspector following his steps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLeIJndXgMNoujNMmTHlNvVZIG9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228609'),
  ('283185150319113264', 'Two-Faced Woman', 1941, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Cukor, Joseph Ruttenberg, Edward Woehler', 'S. N. Behrman, Salka Viertel, George Oppenheimer', 'Greta Garbo, Melvyn Douglas, Constance Bennett, Roland Young, Ruth Gordon, Robert Sterling, Frances Carson, Gloria DeHaven', null, 'A woman pretends to be her own twin sister to win back her straying husband.', 'A woman pretends to be her own twin sister to win back her straying husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckur8ivaMyvn6VSP5Q5Ru7E9UJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95874'),
  ('408198563341996794', 'Two-Fisted Law', 1932, 'Romance, Western', 'D. Ross Lederman, Benjamin H. Kline', 'William Colt MacDonald', 'Tim McCoy, John Wayne, Walter Brennan, Alice Day, Wheeler Oakman, Tully Marshall, Wallace MacDonald, Richard Alexander', 'NR', 'Rancher Tim Clark borrows money from Bob Russell, who then rustles Clark''s cattle so he will be unable to repay the money. Thus Russell is able to cheat Clark out of his ranch. Clark becomes a prospector for silver and ultimately comes to settle accounts with Russell and crooked deputy Bendix.', 'Rancher Tim Clark borrows money from Bob Russell, who then rustles Clark''s cattle so he will be unable to repay the money. Thus Russell is able to cheat Clark out of his ranch. Clark becomes a prospector for silver and ultimately comes to settle accounts with Russell and crooked deputy Bendix.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2HAgDxqxY2NF9AJuHIRyFDaq93.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84902'),
  ('595555407496705058', 'Two-Fisted Tales', 1992, 'War, TV Movie, Western, Horror', 'Tom Holland, Robert Zemeckis, Richard Donner', 'Randall Jahnson, Jim Thomas, John Thomas', 'Brad Pitt, William Sadler, David Morse, Kirk Douglas, Dan Aykroyd, Eric Douglas, Lance Henriksen, Neil Giuntoli', null, 'The foul-mouthed, wheelchair-bound Mr. Rush introduces three adventure tales inspired by the EC Comics of the 1950s: "Showdown," "King of the Road," and "Yellow." This star-studded telefilm was an attempt to launch a second anthology series in the mold of "Tales from the Crypt." When the film failed to generate sufficient interest, the three tales were re-edited and shown as "Crypt" episodes.', 'The foul-mouthed, wheelchair-bound Mr. Rush introduces three adventure tales inspired by the EC Comics of the 1950s: "Showdown," "King of the Road," and "Yellow." This star-studded telefilm was an attempt to launch a second anthology series in the mold of "Tales from the Crypt." When the film failed to generate sufficient interest, the three tales were re-edited and shown as "Crypt" episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKGxUJmtJQhg16fO2UkqndpAmoO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213503'),
  ('265121042358102886', 'Two-Gun Mickey', 1934, 'Animation, Western, Comedy', 'Ben Sharpsteen', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner', 'NR', 'Minnie rides into town and takes a large sack of money out of the bank. Pegleg Pete gathers his gang to take it from her, and they chase her out of town. Lonesome cowboy Mickey, who met Minnie earlier and was told she could take care of herself, sees this chase unfolding from his high perch, and rides down to save the day.', 'Minnie rides into town and takes a large sack of money out of the bank. Pegleg Pete gathers his gang to take it from her, and they chase her out of town. Lonesome cowboy Mickey, who met Minnie earlier and was told she could take care of herself, sees this chase unfolding from his high perch, and rides down to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3RNF0fQOFCJ8MKzWoUR6PRhW9Cg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174263'),
