  ('380179124126802606', 'Two-Minute Warning', 1976, 'Action, Thriller', 'Larry Peerce, Gerald Hirschfeld', 'Edward Hume', 'Charlton Heston, John Cassavetes, Martin Balsam, Beau Bridges, Marilyn Hassett, David Janssen, Jack Klugman, Gena Rowlands', 'R', 'A psychotic sniper plans a massive killing spree in a Los Angeles football stadium during a major championship game. The police, led by Captain Peter Holly and the SWAT commander, learn of the plot and rush to the scene.', 'A psychotic sniper plans a massive killing spree in a Los Angeles football stadium during a major championship game. The police, led by Captain Peter Holly and the SWAT commander, learn of the plot and rush to the scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrQ6Y0kWmW89jvWy6I58PsbGZen.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6883'),
  ('780242697043564949', 'Two-Way Stretch', 1960, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Robert Day, Geoffrey Faithfull, Kip Gowans', 'Len Heath, John Warren', 'Peter Sellers, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Maurice Denham, Irene Handl, David Lodge, Lionel Jeffries, Liz Fraser, Bernard Cribbins', null, 'Three criminals plan to break out of prison the day before their release in order to carry out a daring jewel robbery, intending to establish the perfect alibi by returning to jail afterwards. First however they must get out, a task made more difficult by a new, stricter prison officer.', 'Three criminals plan to break out of prison the day before their release in order to carry out a daring jewel robbery, intending to establish the perfect alibi by returning to jail afterwards. First however they must get out, a task made more difficult by a new, stricter prison officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEP5AmOgJI7PLC7uqxBiWQyt87T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39948'),
