  ('1042960262330960022', 'Tykho Moon', 1996, 'Science Fiction', 'Éric Gautier, Enki Bilal', 'Don Francks', 'Johan Leysen, Michel Piccoli, Julie Delpy, Marie Laforêt, Richard Bohringer, Yann Collette, Frédéric Gorny, Olivier Achard', null, 'The McBee family has erected a government over a future ''colony'', that looks like a run-down Paris divided into sectors by the Berlin Wall. All male family members suffer from a mysterious disease and are in urgent need of organ transplants. The perfect donor, Tykho Moon, probably has been killed in a fire, but according to rumours he''s still alive. Although assassins stalk the family members, the McBees start a hunt for Tykho. Trying to escape the dragnet, Alex, a sculptor, meets Lena, a killer posing as a whore.', 'The McBee family has erected a government over a future ''colony'', that looks like a run-down Paris divided into sectors by the Berlin Wall. All male family members suffer from a mysterious disease and are in urgent need of organ transplants. The perfect donor, Tykho Moon, probably has been killed in a fire, but according to rumours he''s still alive. Although assassins stalk the family members, the McBees start a hunt for Tykho. Trying to escape the dragnet, Alex, a sculptor, meets Lena, a killer posing as a whore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xA2ioVCLAqLZIHfLwAy7Uo5dGkO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39315'),
  ('775918155661084119', 'Tyler Perry''s A Madea Homecoming', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tyler Perry, Taylor Randall', 'Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry, Cassi Davis, David Mann, Tamela Mann, Brendan O''Carroll, Jennifer Gibney, Brandon Black, Isha Blaaker', 'R', 'Madea''s back - hallelujer! And she''s not putting up with any nonsense as family drama erupts at her great-grandson''s college graduation celebration.', 'Madea''s back - hallelujer! And she''s not putting up with any nonsense as family drama erupts at her great-grandson''s college graduation celebration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWJXNc0Q0qIXU8O8hcUmH0iCYzu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:845404'),
  ('339829206745932844', 'Tyler Perry''s Divorce in the Black', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Tyler Perry, Rob Mars, Courtney Glaude', 'Tyler Perry', 'Meagan Good, Cory Hardrict, Joseph Lee Anderson, Taylor Polidore, Shannon Wallace, Richard Lawson, Debbi Morgan, Mark Elliott Brewer', 'R', 'Ava, a young bank professional is devastated when her husband Dallas abandons a marriage she is determined to fight for until fate intervenes, revealing Dallas'' wicked deeds that have trashed their marriage, and once upon a time sabotaged Ava''s destiny to be loved by her true soulmate.', 'Ava, a young bank professional is devastated when her husband Dallas abandons a marriage she is determined to fight for until fate intervenes, revealing Dallas'' wicked deeds that have trashed their marriage, and once upon a time sabotaged Ava''s destiny to be loved by her true soulmate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5X03SA51Ezd02iF9BCjWXC9X9F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1213742'),
  ('479977882219460709', 'Tyler Perry''s Duplicity', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Tyler Perry, Ezekiel Ducksworth, Cory Burmester', 'Tyler Perry', 'Kat Graham, Meagan Tandy, RonReaco Lee, Tyler Lepley, Jimi Stanton, Nick Barrotta, Joshua Adeyeye, Shannon Lanier', 'R', 'High-powered attorney Marley faces her most personal case yet when she is tasked with uncovering the truth behind the murder of her best friend Fela’s husband. With the help of her boyfriend – a former cop turned private investigator – Marley’s search for what really happened leads her down a treacherous maze of deception and betrayal.', 'High-powered attorney Marley faces her most personal case yet when she is tasked with uncovering the truth behind the murder of her best friend Fela’s husband. With the help of her boyfriend – a former cop turned private investigator – Marley’s search for what really happened leads her down a treacherous maze of deception and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pYrmTaOnMgvS59OKSxkCSrhISoL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1145725'),
  ('922990060396512737', 'Tyler Perry''s Finding Joy', 2025, 'Drama', 'Tyler Perry, Justyn Moro', 'Tyler Perry', 'Shannon Thornton, Tosin Morohunfola, Brittany S. Hall, Eric Stanton Betts, Derek Alexander Dixon, Natalie Savage, Jeffery Thomas Johnson, Whitney Goin', 'R', 'Joy, a successful designer, seeks a proposal at Christmas. In Wyoming''s mountains, she finds what she truly needs when the man she loves sees her as just a friend.', 'Joy, a successful designer, seeks a proposal at Christmas. In Wyoming''s mountains, she finds what she truly needs when the man she loves sees her as just a friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUMdbrjHhMFDY327B31ctpF9MuY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1252382'),
  ('96891931997408409', 'Tyler Perry''s Joe''s College Road Trip', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Tyler Perry, Michael Watson', 'Tyler Perry', 'Jermaine Harris, Amber Reign Smith, Bethany Anne Lind, Jeremy Gimenez, Millie Jackson', 'R', 'Madea''s brother Joe accompanies his grandson B.J. on a college road trip.', 'Madea''s brother Joe accompanies his grandson B.J. on a college road trip.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F0%2Fgracenote%2F048b6c01822142e54bd543c927efdf1b.jpg', 'plex:movie:tyler-perrys-joes-college-road-trip'),
  ('533900091680523326', 'Tyler Perry''s The Family That Preys', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tyler Perry, Toyomichi Kurita, Roger M. Bobb', 'Tyler Perry', 'Alfre Woodard, Sanaa Lathan, Rockmond Dunbar, KaDee Strickland, Cole Hauser, Taraji P. Henson, Robin Givens, Tyler Perry', 'PG-13', 'Wealthy socialite Charlotte Cartwright and her dear friend Alice Pratt, a working class woman of high ideals, have enjoyed a lasting friendship throughout several decades. Recently, their lives have become mired in turmoil as their adult children’s extramarital affairs, unethical business practices, and a dark secret threaten to derail family fortunes and unravel the lives of all involved. Charlotte and Alice decide to take a breather from it all by making a cross-country road trip in which they rediscover themselves and possibly find a way to save their families from ruin.', 'Wealthy socialite Charlotte Cartwright and her dear friend Alice Pratt, a working class woman of high ideals, have enjoyed a lasting friendship throughout several decades. Recently, their lives have become mired in turmoil as their adult children’s extramarital affairs, unethical business practices, and a dark secret threaten to derail family fortunes and unravel the lives of all involved. Charlotte and Alice decide to take a breather from it all by making a cross-country road trip in which they rediscover themselves and possibly find a way to save their families from ruin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2iztlY0BvlDa0HZkMnI4PlPrswd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15450'),
  ('269184884164232800', 'Tyll the Giant', 1980, 'Animation, Fantasy, War', 'Rein Raamat, Janno Põldma, Sigrun Alaots', 'Rein Raamat', null, null, 'Based on an Estonian folk tale about of the gigantic hero, Tõll, who lived on the island of Saaremaa (Oesel) in the Baltic Sea. Though he was king of the island, Tõll often worked as a common farmer, tending to his crops and returning to his loving wife. He was a good king, often quick to anger but always kind and willing to help his fellow man. Tõll''s greatest enemy is the god of the underworld who specializes in sly, cowardly mischief. When war comes to the island, Tõll arrives to aid his dying army, but the devil takes advantage of his absence to wreak havoc on Tõll''s home.', 'Based on an Estonian folk tale about of the gigantic hero, Tõll, who lived on the island of Saaremaa (Oesel) in the Baltic Sea. Though he was king of the island, Tõll often worked as a common farmer, tending to his crops and returning to his loving wife. He was a good king, often quick to anger but always kind and willing to help his fellow man. Tõll''s greatest enemy is the god of the underworld who specializes in sly, cowardly mischief. When war comes to the island, Tõll arrives to aid his dying army, but the devil takes advantage of his absence to wreak havoc on Tõll''s home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sNX2MXIb4rzRXBLfokBqbI3Ls6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221234'),
  ('673416879922317319', 'Typhoon', 2005, 'Action, Thriller', 'Kwak Kyung-taek, Yu Yeong-jong, Hong Kyung-pyo', 'Kwak Kyung-taek, Ahn Young-soo', 'Jang Dong-gun, Lee Jung-jae, Lee Mi-yeon, Kim Kap-soo, David Lee McInnis, Chatthapong Phantana-Angkul, Heo Wook, Shin Seong-il', null, 'A vengeful refugee-turned-pirate steals nuclear materials to attack and obliterate the Koreas in a Nuclear Typhoon. A top South Korean naval officer is assigned the task to stop his plans and execute him.', 'A vengeful refugee-turned-pirate steals nuclear materials to attack and obliterate the Koreas in a Nuclear Typhoon. A top South Korean naval officer is assigned the task to stop his plans and execute him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rk0jK1Q5LRWIdDWFrHbdilhVgA2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32168'),
  ('853837653224662070', 'Typhoon Club', 1985, 'Drama', 'Shinji Sōmai, Akihiro Itō, Koji Enokido', 'Yuji Kato', 'Youki Kudoh, Yuichi Mikami, Yuka Ônishi, Tomokazu Miura, Saburo Date, Tomiko Ishii, Kaori Kobayashi, Toshinori Omi', null, 'Offering a caustic immersion into the lives of disaffected junior high students on the cusp of adulthood, the film takes place over the 5-day period before, during, and after a ferocious, seemingly liberating typhoon, which six of the students endure while marooned in their school.', 'Offering a caustic immersion into the lives of disaffected junior high students on the cusp of adulthood, the film takes place over the 5-day period before, during, and after a ferocious, seemingly liberating typhoon, which six of the students endure while marooned in their school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsvWuaYE1l30qR62RQA4VN98HOi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108634'),
  ('321378968763779276', 'Typhoon Noruda', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Animation', 'Namiko Ishidate, Satoshi Motoyama, Hiroyasu Ishida', null, 'Shuhei Nomura, Daichi Kaneko, Kaya Kiyohara, Hideki Kojima, Lynn, Yasuyuki Takase, Mariko Honda, Masahide Yamaguchi', null, 'As an unexpected typhoon bears down on a small tropical island, a group of students trapped at school find themselves forced to put aside their personal issues and work together. Not only to save themselves, but possibly the lives of everyone on the planet!', 'As an unexpected typhoon bears down on a small tropical island, a group of students trapped at school find themselves forced to put aside their personal issues and work together. Not only to save themselves, but possibly the lives of everyone on the planet!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15z0JrLFFAP39V7WYiOHeZktkPL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358632'),
  ('101271109971623471', 'Typhoon Over Nagasaki', 1957, 'Drama', 'Yves Ciampi, Henri Alekan', 'Zenzō Matsuyama, Jean-Charles Tacchella, Yves Ciampi', 'Danielle Darrieux, Jean Marais, Gert Fröbe, Keiko Kishi, So Yamamura, Hitomi Nozoe, Kumeko Urabe', null, 'Pierre Marsac, a French engineer working for the Nagasaki shipbuilding yards, has fallen in love both with Japan and a charming Japanese girl named Noriko. But Françoise Fabre, a French journalist and Pierre''s former lover, contacts him while visiting the Land of the Rising Sun. They meet again, find out their love might not be dead. Meanwhile, Pierre gradually becomes estranged from sweet, humble Noriko. One day, a typhoon strikes Nagasaki...', 'Pierre Marsac, a French engineer working for the Nagasaki shipbuilding yards, has fallen in love both with Japan and a charming Japanese girl named Noriko. But Françoise Fabre, a French journalist and Pierre''s former lover, contacts him while visiting the Land of the Rising Sun. They meet again, find out their love might not be dead. Meanwhile, Pierre gradually becomes estranged from sweet, humble Noriko. One day, a typhoon strikes Nagasaki...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIMfedcJeRvjyPGc4r3rwBvr1Ho.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311040'),
  ('641566887388016304', 'Tyrannosaur', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paddy Considine, Dan Winch, Des Hamilton', 'Paddy Considine', 'Peter Mullan, Olivia Colman, Eddie Marsan, Ned Dennehy, Samuel Bottomley, Paul Popplewell, Sally Carman, Sian Breckin', 'NR', 'The story of Joseph, a man plagued by violence and a rage that is driving him to self-destruction. As Joseph''s life spirals into turmoil a chance of redemption appears in the form of Hannah, a Christian charity shop worker. Their relationship develops to reveal that Hannah is hiding a secret of her own with devastating results on both of their lives.', 'The story of Joseph, a man plagued by violence and a rage that is driving him to self-destruction. As Joseph''s life spirals into turmoil a chance of redemption appears in the form of Hannah, a Christian charity shop worker. Their relationship develops to reveal that Hannah is hiding a secret of her own with devastating results on both of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6PJGuO6K94YylUcAsTTn7Q4cQn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76543'),
  ('832562338244364685', 'Tyrannosaurus Azteca', 2007, 'Adventure, Action', 'Brian Trenchard-Smith, Paul Atkins, Richard A. Cooper', 'Richard Manning', 'Ian Ziering, Jack McGee, Dichen Lachman, James Locke, William Snow, Marco Sanchez, George Allen Gumapac', 'PG-13', 'The Aztecs summoned a Tyrannosaurus Rex to keep Cortes and his army out of Mexico. Now they need the Conquistadors'' help to stop the T-Rex from killing them all.', 'The Aztecs summoned a Tyrannosaurus Rex to keep Cortes and his army out of Mexico. Now they need the Conquistadors'' help to stop the T-Rex from killing them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFdEkhljyVJfjSqbf7qTGqdpyKO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30771'),
  ('533291359429822243', 'Tyson', 1995, 'Drama', 'Uli Edel, Jack Conroy', 'Robert Johnson', 'Michael Jai White, George C. Scott, Paul Winfield, James B. Sikking, Malcolm-Jamal Warner, Tony Lo Bianco, Clark Gregg, Holt McCallany', 'NR', 'The story of Mike Tyson. From his early days as a 12 year old amateur with a powerful punch, to the undisputed title of "Heavyweight Champion of the World", and ultimately to his conviction for rape. The story of his turbulent life moves quickly, never focusing for long on anything in particular.', 'The story of Mike Tyson. From his early days as a 12 year old amateur with a powerful punch, to the undisputed title of "Heavyweight Champion of the World", and ultimately to his conviction for rape. The story of his turbulent life moves quickly, never focusing for long on anything in particular.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cE0V6JaKVK1T8wTfVkzPkGfISyK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50114'),
  ('719399022427695039', 'Tyson', 2008, 'Documentary, Drama', 'James Toback, Larry McConkey', 'James Toback', 'Mike Tyson, Cus D''Amato, Don King, Robin Givens, Mills Lane, Evander Holyfield, Lennox Lewis, Trevor Berbick', 'R', 'Director James Toback takes an unflinching, uncompromising look at the life of Mike Tyson--almost solely from the perspective of the man himself. TYSON alternates between the controversial boxer addressing the camera and shots of the champion''s fights to create an arresting picture of the man.', 'Director James Toback takes an unflinching, uncompromising look at the life of Mike Tyson--almost solely from the perspective of the man himself. TYSON alternates between the controversial boxer addressing the camera and shots of the champion''s fights to create an arresting picture of the man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ektR7eqmndjaYlYPciy4tJfrgh7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8940'),
  ('686003725232638445', 'Tyson''s Run', 2022, 'Drama', 'Kim Bass, Bruce Lane', 'Kim Bass', 'Major Dodson, Amy Smart, Rory Cochrane, Barkhad Abdi, Layla Felder, Jody Thompson, Isaiah Asher Hanley, Forrest Deal', 'PG', 'When fifteen-year-old Tyson attends public school for the first time, his life is changed forever. While helping his father clean up after the football team, Tyson befriends champion marathon runner Aklilu. Never letting his autism hold him back, Tyson becomes determined to run his first marathon in hopes of winning his father''s approval. With the help of an unlikely friend and his parents, Tyson learns that with faith in yourself and the courage to take the first step, anything is possible.', 'When fifteen-year-old Tyson attends public school for the first time, his life is changed forever. While helping his father clean up after the football team, Tyson befriends champion marathon runner Aklilu. Never letting his autism hold him back, Tyson becomes determined to run his first marathon in hopes of winning his father''s approval. With the help of an unlikely friend and his parents, Tyson learns that with faith in yourself and the courage to take the first step, anything is possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1YApVTO1gHudv7avTRSSvUqIDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860852'),
  ('237343182789385822', 'U', 2006, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Serge Élissalde', 'Grégoire Solotareff', 'Vahina Giocante, Isild Le Besco, Marie-Christine Orry, Maud Forget, Bernadette Lafont, Bernard Alane, Artus de Penguern, Sanseverino', null, 'Since her parents passed away, Princess Mona lives by herself in a castle with two hideous, ghastly characters, Goomi and His Lordship. One day her sobs draw the attention of a unicorn, called U, who wants to comfort and protect Mona for as long as she needs. U becomes Mona''s companion, her confidant and her inseparable friend. While Mona grows into a beautiful princess, a group of charming, peaceful and fanciful Yeah-Yeah’s settles in the neighboring forest. They have no particular special powers, yet they soon bring about major changes in everyone''s lives, especially in Kulka, the dreamy musician.', 'Since her parents passed away, Princess Mona lives by herself in a castle with two hideous, ghastly characters, Goomi and His Lordship. One day her sobs draw the attention of a unicorn, called U, who wants to comfort and protect Mona for as long as she needs. U becomes Mona''s companion, her confidant and her inseparable friend. While Mona grows into a beautiful princess, a group of charming, peaceful and fanciful Yeah-Yeah’s settles in the neighboring forest. They have no particular special powers, yet they soon bring about major changes in everyone''s lives, especially in Kulka, the dreamy musician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPyDf7cl4NrtjSn5jnmODDF70kS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39405'),
  ('934461314551305692', 'U Are the Universe', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Comedy', 'Pavlo Ostrikov, Oleksandra Nikitina, Mykyta Kuzmenko', 'Pavlo Ostrikov', 'Volodymyr Kravchuk, Alexia Depicker, Leonid Popadko, Darya Plakhtiy, Maksym Maksymiuk, Kostiantyn Osovskyi, Ihor Nikolayev, Mariia Yunatska', null, 'After the explosion of the Earth, the Ukrainian space trucker Andriy becomes the only human in the Universe until French woman Catherine calls him from the faraway space station. Andriy decides to see her despite all the obstacles.', 'After the explosion of the Earth, the Ukrainian space trucker Andriy becomes the only human in the Universe until French woman Catherine calls him from the faraway space station. Andriy decides to see her despite all the obstacles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJpjWajfSGHIbenzqyeKoQuYfem.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1013052'),
  ('965312292322549234', 'U Me Aur Hum', 2008, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Ajay Devgn', 'Ashwni Dhir', 'Ajay Devgn, Kajol, Divya Dutta, Isha Sharvani, Karan Khanna, Sumeet Raghvan', 'PG', 'While on a cruise, Ajay Mehra falls in love with Piya and soon marries her. However, their marital bliss is shattered when Piya is diagnosed with Alzheimer''s disease.', 'While on a cruise, Ajay Mehra falls in love with Piya and soon marries her. However, their marital bliss is shattered when Piya is diagnosed with Alzheimer''s disease.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4bqpI1SyauVMyGCzZKjs4HR0pj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31897'),
  ('716796430219119764', 'U Turn', 1997, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Oliver Stone, Robert Richardson, Jerry G. Callaway', 'John Ridley', 'Sean Penn, Nick Nolte, Jennifer Lopez, Joaquin Phoenix, Claire Danes, Powers Boothe, Billy Bob Thornton, Jon Voight', 'R', 'When a desperate man’s car breaks down in a bizarre desert town while evading vengeful bookies, he becomes entangled in a dangerous love triangle. Caught between a married couple, he’s faced with deadly contracts to kill them both.', 'When a desperate man’s car breaks down in a bizarre desert town while evading vengeful bookies, he becomes entangled in a dangerous love triangle. Caught between a married couple, he’s faced with deadly contracts to kill them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBPTj1ApIDWo04M14rXFwLPdtr2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10155'),
  ('1011282805738657943', 'U Turn', 2018, 'Thriller, Horror, Crime', 'Pawan Kumar, Niketh Bommi, Kavin Bala', 'Pawan Kumar', 'Samantha Ruth Prabhu, Aadhi Pinisetty, Rahul Ravindran, Bhumika Chawla, Narain, Aadukalam Naren, Siddhiksha, Ravi Prakash', null, 'When a flyover in the city becomes the hotbed of accidents, a young reporter decides to investigate the issue. Her quest for an answer would lead her into a web of intrigue, murder and mystery.', 'When a flyover in the city becomes the hotbed of accidents, a young reporter decides to investigate the issue. Her quest for an answer would lead her into a web of intrigue, murder and mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5wL2axBtieecnAD6X4HMgrkXGp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535657'),
  ('1114658229925262431', 'U-571', 2000, 'War, Action, Adventure', 'Oliver Wood, Jonathan Mostow, Rexford L. Metz', 'David Ayer, Sam Montgomery', 'Matthew McConaughey, Bill Paxton, Harvey Keitel, Jon Bon Jovi, David Keith, Thomas Kretschmann, Jake Weber, Jack Noseworthy', 'PG-13', 'In the midst of World War II, the battle under the sea rages and the Nazis have the upper hand as the Allies are unable to crack their war codes. However, after a wrecked U-boat sends out an SOS signal, the Allies realise this is their chance to seize the ''enigma coding machine''.', 'In the midst of World War II, the battle under the sea rages and the Nazis have the upper hand as the Allies are unable to crack their war codes. However, after a wrecked U-boat sends out an SOS signal, the Allies realise this is their chance to seize the ''enigma coding machine''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lc7jXmjQmITnfUBX7nN4kxKKbI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3536'),
  ('1062700400320486532', 'U-900', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Sven Unterwaldt Jr.', 'Michael Gantenberg, Oliver Ziegenbalg', 'Atze Schröder, Oliver Wnuk, Yvonne Catterfeld, Christian Kahrmann, Götz Otto, Maxim Mehmet, Dustin Semmelrogge, Jan Fedder', null, 'The year is 1944, Atze and Samuel occasionally operate on the black market, but mostly keep quiet and wait for the Americans to come. When the last German submarine, the U-900, is sent on a final mission, Atze foolishly messes with the general of this mission and has to go undercover. Together with his friend Samuel and the actress Maria, who disguises herself as a man for this purpose, he therefore smuggles himself onto the U-900 and pretends to be the captain. Since he has no idea about seafaring and gives increasingly strange orders, the crew soon becomes suspicious.', 'The year is 1944, Atze and Samuel occasionally operate on the black market, but mostly keep quiet and wait for the Americans to come. When the last German submarine, the U-900, is sent on a final mission, Atze foolishly messes with the general of this mission and has to go undercover. Together with his friend Samuel and the actress Maria, who disguises herself as a man for this purpose, he therefore smuggles himself onto the U-900 and pretends to be the captain. Since he has no idea about seafaring and gives increasingly strange orders, the crew soon becomes suspicious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/639868nZo9O7ymzJnx055zcjLKv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16193'),
  ('630322998243830108', 'U.F.O.', 2012, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Dominic Burns, Luke Bryant', 'Dominic Burns', 'Bianca Bree, Sean Brosnan, Simon Phillips, Jean-Claude Van Damme, Peter Barrett, Joey Ansah, Sean Pertwee, Julian Glover', 'R', 'A group of friends awake one morning to find all electricity and power shut off and an immense alien aircraft hovering in the air above their heads. Suddenly this regular group of friends is battling to survive as the entire human race is threatened by the alien army hovering ominously above.', 'A group of friends awake one morning to find all electricity and power shut off and an immense alien aircraft hovering in the air above their heads. Suddenly this regular group of friends is battling to survive as the entire human race is threatened by the alien army hovering ominously above.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6YRCDCiauJFYltBklD1X8m6OQm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146631'),
  ('160292069520680228', 'U.S. Go Home', 1995, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Claire Denis, Agnès Godard, Michaël Weill', 'Claire Denis, Anne Wiazemsky', 'Alice Houri, Jessica Tharaud, Grégoire Colin, Martine Gautier, Vincent Gallo, François Jandin, Antoine Chappey, Lionel Goldstein', null, 'In the sixties, in a suburb near Paris, Martine wants to lose her virginity.', 'In the sixties, in a suburb near Paris, Martine wants to lose her virginity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AuWNalmeqVir9keQPlJkfKOD6cT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124491'),
  ('211475379580393965', 'U.S. Marshals', 1998, 'Thriller, Crime, Action', 'Stuart Baird, Andrzej Bartkowiak, David W. Krummel', 'John Pogue', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Wesley Snipes, Robert Downey Jr., Joe Pantoliano, Kate Nelligan, Daniel Roebuck, Tom Wood, LaTanya Richardson Jackson', 'PG-13', 'U.S. Marshal Sam Gerard is accompanying a plane load of convicts from Chicago to New York. The plane crashes spectacularly, and Mark Sheridan escapes. But when Diplomatic Security Agent John Royce is assigned to help Gerard recapture Sheridan, it becomes clear that Sheridan is more than just another murderer.', 'U.S. Marshal Sam Gerard is accompanying a plane load of convicts from Chicago to New York. The plane crashes spectacularly, and Mark Sheridan escapes. But when Diplomatic Security Agent John Royce is assigned to help Gerard recapture Sheridan, it becomes clear that Sheridan is more than just another murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ST0BydDSXtW5AtfDDhTVS13pTt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11808'),
  ('589116332768894793', 'U.S. Palmese', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Marco Manetti, Antonio Manetti, Angelo Sorrentino', 'Marco Manetti, Antonio Manetti, Emiliano Rubbi', 'Rocco Papaleo, Blaise Afonso, Giulia Maenza, Claudia Gerini, Lisa Do Couto Texeira, Max Mazzotta, Gianfelice Imparato, Massimiliano Bruno', null, 'In Palmi, a small town in Calabria, Don Vincenzo, a genial retired farmer, has a crazy idea to revive the local soccer team by organizing a bizarre fundraiser hiring the Italian major league Serie A, soccer player Etienne Morville, a bad-tempered guy but among the strongest in the world. Albeit unwillingly, Morville leaves Milan to move to Palmi and try to save his image. In the small town he will come up against a reality of sincerity, which will lead everyone on an unforgettable experience.', 'In Palmi, a small town in Calabria, Don Vincenzo, a genial retired farmer, has a crazy idea to revive the local soccer team by organizing a bizarre fundraiser hiring the Italian major league Serie A, soccer player Etienne Morville, a bad-tempered guy but among the strongest in the world. Albeit unwillingly, Morville leaves Milan to move to Palmi and try to save his image. In the small town he will come up against a reality of sincerity, which will lead everyone on an unforgettable experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WCa4fcd8RqA9v3qTsRqnifKsE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1130056'),
  ('166127447099796096', 'U2 3D', 2008, 'Music, Documentary', 'Mark Pellington, Tom Krueger, Peter Anderson', null, 'Bono, The Edge, Adam Clayton, Larry Mullen Jr.', 'G', 'A 3-D presentation of U2''s global "Vertigo" tour. Shot at seven different shows, this production employs the greatest number of 3-D cameras ever used for a single project.', 'A 3-D presentation of U2''s global "Vertigo" tour. Shot at seven different shows, this production employs the greatest number of 3-D cameras ever used for a single project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OT1s7NOpnJ5IVlpe5hGC7dYGoK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37003'),
  ('347376995366583551', 'U2: Popmart - Live from Mexico City', 1997, 'Music, Documentary', 'David Mallet, Bruce Ramus', null, 'Bono, The Edge, Adam Clayton, Larry Mullen Jr.', null, 'U2 performs live in Mexico City in support of their 1997 album, "Pop," featuring lavish special effects, cutting edge sound and spectacular multimedia enhancement. /// Tracklist: 1. Pop Muzik 2. Mofo 3. I Will Follow 4. Gone 5. Even Better Than The Real Thing 6. Last Night On Earth 7. Until The End Of The World 8. New Year''s Day 9. Pride (In The Name Of Love) 10. I Still Haven''t Found What I''m Looking For 11. All I Want Is You 12. Desire/La Bamba 13. Staring At The Sun 14. Sunday Bloody Sunday 15. Bullet The Blue Sky 16. Please 17. Where The Streets Have No Name 18. Lemon (Perfecto Mix) 19. Discothèque/Love To Love You Baby/Life During Wartime 20. If You Wear That Velvet Dress 21. With Or Without You 22. Hold Me, Thrill Me, Kiss Me, Kill Me 23. Mysterious Ways 24. One 25. Wake Up Dead Man', 'U2 performs live in Mexico City in support of their 1997 album, "Pop," featuring lavish special effects, cutting edge sound and spectacular multimedia enhancement. /// Tracklist: 1. Pop Muzik 2. Mofo 3. I Will Follow 4. Gone 5. Even Better Than The Real Thing 6. Last Night On Earth 7. Until The End Of The World 8. New Year''s Day 9. Pride (In The Name Of Love) 10. I Still Haven''t Found What I''m Looking For 11. All I Want Is You 12. Desire/La Bamba 13. Staring At The Sun 14. Sunday Bloody Sunday 15. Bullet The Blue Sky 16. Please 17. Where The Streets Have No Name 18. Lemon (Perfecto Mix) 19. Discothèque/Love To Love You Baby/Life During Wartime 20. If You Wear That Velvet Dress 21. With Or Without You 22. Hold Me, Thrill Me, Kiss Me, Kill Me 23. Mysterious Ways 24. One 25. Wake Up Dead Man', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2ojB1GGYzwKnUP6idmAYOPFgva.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34992'),
  ('417775837550164382', 'U2: Rattle and Hum', 1988, 'Music, Documentary', 'Phil Joanou, Robert Brinkmann, Jordan Cronenweth', null, 'Bono, The Edge, Larry Mullen Jr., Adam Clayton, B.B. King, Phil Joanou, Dennis Bell, Adam Gussow', 'PG-13', 'A concert movie on an unprecedented scale, Rattle And Hum captures U2 - on and off the stage - during their triumphant Joshua Tree tour. From the giant technicolour stadium celebrations to the black-and-white intensity of the indoor shows, this is U2 at their best. Follow the group across America, exploring new influences, playing with the legendary B.B. King from Dublin to Graceland.', 'A concert movie on an unprecedented scale, Rattle And Hum captures U2 - on and off the stage - during their triumphant Joshua Tree tour. From the giant technicolour stadium celebrations to the black-and-white intensity of the indoor shows, this is U2 at their best. Follow the group across America, exploring new influences, playing with the legendary B.B. King from Dublin to Graceland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wCNobX8pPdHF4zyzhuDKIem9Gx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18161'),
  ('739105707359291014', 'U2: Vertigo 2005 - Live from Chicago', 2005, 'Music', 'Hamish Hamilton, Erica Forstadt', null, 'Bono, The Edge, Adam Clayton, Larry Mullen Jr., Gavin Friday', null, '23 electric performances, with songs drawn from across the bands entire career - from first album fan favorites such as "Electric Co," through U2 classics such as "Pride...," "New Years Day" and "Where the Streets Have No Name" and right up to date with "Vertigo" the smash hit that launched this years #1 studio album "How To Dismantle An Atomic Bomb."', '23 electric performances, with songs drawn from across the bands entire career - from first album fan favorites such as "Electric Co," through U2 classics such as "Pride...," "New Years Day" and "Where the Streets Have No Name" and right up to date with "Vertigo" the smash hit that launched this years #1 studio album "How To Dismantle An Atomic Bomb."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3VVcnPSp54IZQGy9nzzSb7SQkL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17868'),
  ('376309175151935839', 'U2: Zoo TV - Live from Sydney', 1994, 'Music, Documentary', 'David Mallet', null, 'Bono, The Edge, Adam Clayton, Larry Mullen Jr.', 'NR', '1. Show Opening 2. Zoo Station 3. The Fly 4. Even Better Than The Real Thing 5. Mysterious Ways 6. One 7. Unchained Melody 8. Until The End Of The World 9. New Year''s Day 10. Numb 11. Angel Of Harlem 12. Stay (Faraway, So Close!) 13. Satellite Of Love 14. Dirty Day 15. Bullet The Blue Sky 16. Running To Stand Still 17. Where The Streets Have No Name 18. Pride (In The Name Of Love) 19. Daddy''s Gonna Pay For Your Crashed Car 20. Lemon 21. With Or Without You 22. Love Is Blindness 23. Can''t Help Falling In Love U2 had been a major entity in the rock music world for many years by the time they released the ACHTUNG BABY album. Yet, it was this album that brought the band from popular rock act to multimedia force as their concerts began to include the video screen as an important part of the show. Following ACHTUNG BABY was the ZOOROPA album and one of U2''s most successful tours, the Zoo TV Tour, in which the multimedia experience was expanded upon.', '1. Show Opening 2. Zoo Station 3. The Fly 4. Even Better Than The Real Thing 5. Mysterious Ways 6. One 7. Unchained Melody 8. Until The End Of The World 9. New Year''s Day 10. Numb 11. Angel Of Harlem 12. Stay (Faraway, So Close!) 13. Satellite Of Love 14. Dirty Day 15. Bullet The Blue Sky 16. Running To Stand Still 17. Where The Streets Have No Name 18. Pride (In The Name Of Love) 19. Daddy''s Gonna Pay For Your Crashed Car 20. Lemon 21. With Or Without You 22. Love Is Blindness 23. Can''t Help Falling In Love U2 had been a major entity in the rock music world for many years by the time they released the ACHTUNG BABY album. Yet, it was this album that brought the band from popular rock act to multimedia force as their concerts began to include the video screen as an important part of the show. Following ACHTUNG BABY was the ZOOROPA album and one of U2''s most successful tours, the Zoo TV Tour, in which the multimedia experience was expanded upon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DI29EF5m5eqU6ukjlJIeeecdFZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75772'),
  ('155519510769657092', 'U311 Cherkasy', 2020, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Yurii Dunai, Timur Yashchenko', 'Timur Yashchenko, Robert Kwilman', 'Dmytro Sova, Yevhen Lamakh, Evgeny Avdeenko, Vitalina Bibliv, Serhii Detiuk, Orest Harda, Vadim Lyalko, Ruslan Koval', null, 'The crew of Ukrainian NAVY minesweeper U311 "Cherkasy" is resisting seizure of the vessel by Russian army in Crimea in 2014.', 'The crew of Ukrainian NAVY minesweeper U311 "Cherkasy" is resisting seizure of the vessel by Russian army in Crimea in 2014.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSO7CoTOwPhWliBkkxbqr54p0vq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617499'),
  ('339621657606511509', 'Ubalda, All Naked and Warm', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Laurenti, Tino Santoni', 'Tito Carpi, Luciano Martino', 'Edwige Fenech, Pippo Franco, Karin Schubert, Umberto D''Orsi, Pino Ferrara, Gino Pagnani, Alberto Sorrentino, Renato Malavasi', null, 'During the Middle Ages, a clumsy knight returns home where his wife awaits him. Sensuous and beautiful, she has attracted several male admirers during his absence, but her chastity belt has maintained her faithfulness. Now is her chance to wrest the key from him and enjoy herself. The knight’s portly friend has a similar problem with his equally gorgeous wife. And to top it off, both men have designs on the other’s wife — leading them to devise painful methods to discourage the other from trespassing.', 'During the Middle Ages, a clumsy knight returns home where his wife awaits him. Sensuous and beautiful, she has attracted several male admirers during his absence, but her chastity belt has maintained her faithfulness. Now is her chance to wrest the key from him and enjoy herself. The knight’s portly friend has a similar problem with his equally gorgeous wife. And to top it off, both men have designs on the other’s wife — leading them to devise painful methods to discourage the other from trespassing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpap0mPIHc2GWqkuBgq6lEN73Zl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121743'),
  ('158030765341867800', 'Ubaldo Terzani Horror Show', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Gabriele Albanesi, Guillermo Gonzalez Diez, Emanuele Milasi', 'Gabriele Albanesi', 'Giuseppe Soleri, Paolo Sassanelli, Laura Gigante, Antonino Iuorio, Zsuzsanna Ripli, Francesco Mastrorilli, Stefano Fregni, Vera Dragone', 'NR', 'Alessio Rinaldi, a 25-year-old director, gets the charge from a producer to write the script of his first movie with Ubaldo Terzani, a well-known writer of horror novels. Alessio moves into Terzani''s house to start this collaboration, and a strange relationship of psychological dependence grows between them: Ubaldo Terzani unveils his dark side, and Alessio fall in a desperate depth of craziness and nightmares. There is a reason why Terzani''s bestsellers are so frightening ... Alessio will discover that reality can be unexpectedly more terrifying than every brainchild, and he will have to fight hard to escape Ubaldo Terzani''s jaws.', 'Alessio Rinaldi, a 25-year-old director, gets the charge from a producer to write the script of his first movie with Ubaldo Terzani, a well-known writer of horror novels. Alessio moves into Terzani''s house to start this collaboration, and a strange relationship of psychological dependence grows between them: Ubaldo Terzani unveils his dark side, and Alessio fall in a desperate depth of craziness and nightmares. There is a reason why Terzani''s bestsellers are so frightening ... Alessio will discover that reality can be unexpectedly more terrifying than every brainchild, and he will have to fight hard to escape Ubaldo Terzani''s jaws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/im0320WaG8BGfVXaktJw0UdKqRc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67903'),
  ('871765391749973193', 'Uchu Sentai Kyuranger vs. Space Squad', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Koichi Sakamoto, Koichi Sakamoto, Shu G. Momose', 'Nobuhiro Mouri', 'Takumi Kizu, Yosuke Kishi, Kazuya Nakai, Yuki Ono, Akio Otsuka, Taiki Yamazaki, Sakurako Okubo, Mao Ichimichi', null, 'Taking place 4 years after the events of the Uchu Sentai Kyuranger TV series, the universe is at peace. But that changes when Hammie (Chameleon Green) attacks the Rebellion and steals the newly developed Neo Kyutama! Fearing its possible misuse once it falls into the wrong hands, Space Federation President Tsurugi Ohtori (Houou Soldier) declares Hammie wanted all across the universe. Lucky (Shishi Red) and some of the Kyurangers believe in Hammie, fighting against Tsurugi''s decision, causing a rift amongst the Kyurangers. And where do Space Sheriff Gavan and Space Sheriff Shaider fit onto all this?', 'Taking place 4 years after the events of the Uchu Sentai Kyuranger TV series, the universe is at peace. But that changes when Hammie (Chameleon Green) attacks the Rebellion and steals the newly developed Neo Kyutama! Fearing its possible misuse once it falls into the wrong hands, Space Federation President Tsurugi Ohtori (Houou Soldier) declares Hammie wanted all across the universe. Lucky (Shishi Red) and some of the Kyurangers believe in Hammie, fighting against Tsurugi''s decision, causing a rift amongst the Kyurangers. And where do Space Sheriff Gavan and Space Sheriff Shaider fit onto all this?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kRlerFhYNFSWDzG5NSO8oUEwvq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504897'),
  ('728626922488732188', 'Udaan', 2010, 'Drama', 'Vikramaditya Motwane, Jogi Malang, Rukhshida David', 'Vikramaditya Motwane, Anurag Kashyap', 'Ronit Roy, Rajat Barmecha, Aayan Boradia, Ram Kapoor, Manjot Singh, Anand Tiwari, Suman Mastkar, Aarhan Roychowdhry', 'R', 'Upon returning to his industrial hometown, a young man must decide whether to follow his own dreams or acquiesce to his father''s plans for his future.', 'Upon returning to his industrial hometown, a young man must decide whether to follow his own dreams or acquiesce to his father''s plans for his future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dQmrGk0WRPiCwiiGdIxnY5s8Pc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45316'),
  ('954005504453344557', 'Udayananu Tharam', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Rosshan Andrrews, S. Kumar', 'Sreenivasan', 'Mohanlal, Meena, Sreenivasan, Mukesh, Jagathy Sreekumar, Salim Kumar, Cochin Haneefa, Janardhanan', null, 'Udayabhanu is an assistant director and scriptwriter, who dreams of making it big in the film industry. His attempt is thwarted by his roommate, a junior artiste, Rajappan Thengamoodu who steals his script to become superstar Saroj Kumar', 'Udayabhanu is an assistant director and scriptwriter, who dreams of making it big in the film industry. His attempt is thwarted by his roommate, a junior artiste, Rajappan Thengamoodu who steals his script to become superstar Saroj Kumar', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XwwwgzOcYkhRaueT2kSaMA1p7N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240541'),
  ('1049883829068535692', 'Udon', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Katsuyuki Motohiro, Akira Sako', 'Masashi Todayama', 'Yusuke Santamaria, Manami Konishi, Tortoise Matsumoto, Kyoka Suzuki, Takeshi Masu, Jin Katagiri, Jun Kaname, Fumiyo Kohinata', null, 'Kosuke is 31, and tired of his hometown where nothing happens. On a whim, he departs for New York with dreams of making it big. 6 months later, he straggles home... defeated, and saddled with debt. Awaiting him are his old friends, a caring sister, a disgruntled father ...and a bowl of noodles. Namely, "udon" noodles. The town is built around udon, sustained by udon, nationally famous for udon.', 'Kosuke is 31, and tired of his hometown where nothing happens. On a whim, he departs for New York with dreams of making it big. 6 months later, he straggles home... defeated, and saddled with debt. Awaiting him are his old friends, a caring sister, a disgruntled father ...and a bowl of noodles. Namely, "udon" noodles. The town is built around udon, sustained by udon, nationally famous for udon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slbm5ontU6HfL9kiaARSijAe3Qx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15284'),
  ('986000235983862260', 'Udta Punjab', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', 'Abhishek Chaubey, Rajeev Ravi, Ishaan Khatter', 'Sudip Sharma, Abhishek Chaubey', 'Shahid Kapoor, Alia Bhatt, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Diljit Dosanjh, Satish Kaushik, Manav Vij, Vansh Bhardwaj, Suhail Nayyar', 'R', 'Drug abuse and the darker side of Punjab rear their heads in the intense, interwoven tales of a policeman, a doctor, a migrant worker, and a rockstar.', 'Drug abuse and the darker side of Punjab rear their heads in the intense, interwoven tales of a policeman, a doctor, a migrant worker, and a rockstar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7BXGhHwvK1AfDCmfPTtw5LsuIU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398535'),
  ('391527368627398667', 'UFC 312: Du Plessis vs. Strickland 2', 2025, 'Action', null, null, 'Dricus Du Plessis, Sean Strickland, Zhang Weili, Tatiana Suarez, Tallison Teixeira, Justin Tafa, Jimmy Crute, Rodolfo Bellato', null, 'UFC 312: du Plessis vs. Strickland 2 was a mixed martial arts event produced by the Ultimate Fighting Championship that took place on February 9, 2025, at the Qudos Bank Arena in Sydney, Australia. A UFC Middleweight Championship rematch between current champion Dricus du Plessis (also former KSW Welterweight Champion) and former champion Sean Strickland headlined the event.', 'UFC 312: du Plessis vs. Strickland 2 was a mixed martial arts event produced by the Ultimate Fighting Championship that took place on February 9, 2025, at the Qudos Bank Arena in Sydney, Australia. A UFC Middleweight Championship rematch between current champion Dricus du Plessis (also former KSW Welterweight Champion) and former champion Sean Strickland headlined the event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2z4tLCbLwFSu9KU44tIZGdpuOs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1403040'),
