  ('237035183669951231', 'UFO', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery', 'Ryan Eslinger, Ryan Samul', 'Ryan Eslinger', 'Alex Sharp, Gillian Anderson, Ella Purnell, David Strathairn, Brian ''Wolfman Black'' Bowman, Katie Eichler, Benjamin Beatty, Marcus B. Jackson', 'PG-13', 'A college student, who sees a UFO, uses his exceptional math skills to investigate the sighting with his friends while the FBI follows closely behind.', 'A college student, who sees a UFO, uses his exceptional math skills to investigate the sighting with his friends while the FBI follows closely behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdy1GTdaAXqhsCVOpIXokifYdCh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426865'),
  ('973350871866046588', 'UFO', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Onur Bilgetay', 'Meryem Gültabak', 'İpek Filiz Yazıcı, Mert Ramazan Demir, Ferit Aktuğ, Kerem Alp Kabul, Mekin Sezer, Enes Külahçı, Elif Çakman, Cemile Canyurt', null, 'When aspiring musician and student Deniz falls for a rough-hewn motorbike racer, tragedy and family opposition obstruct their path to love.', 'When aspiring musician and student Deniz falls for a rough-hewn motorbike racer, tragedy and family opposition obstruct their path to love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMtKov3q8stWGcy7UFuRzpMliUy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:933357'),
  ('822730405697535709', 'UFO Abduction', 1989, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Dean Alioto, Craig Patterson, Barbara Gerard', 'Dean Alioto', 'Tommy Giavocchini, Patrick Kelley, Shirly McCalla, Stacey Shulman, Christine Staples, Laura Tomas, Dean Alioto, Kay Parten', 'NR', 'On October 8th, 1983, the Van Heese family gathered together to celebrate the 5th birthday of Michelle, the littlest member of their household. Everything was captured on VHS by Michael McPherson and his new camcorder — including the alien invasion.', 'On October 8th, 1983, the Van Heese family gathered together to celebrate the 5th birthday of Michelle, the littlest member of their household. Everything was captured on VHS by Michael McPherson and his new camcorder — including the alien invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ap6zknBoIHaioieVfOLd5qaWd4X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204611'),
  ('764350480529854265', 'UFO Robot Grendizer vs. Great Mazinger', 1976, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Osamu Kasai, Johei Matsuura', 'Keisuke Fujikawa', 'Kei Tomiyama, Joji Yanami, Hiroya Ishimaru, Chiyoko Kawashima, Kazuko Sawada, Kenichi Ogata, Kosei Tomita, Keiichi Noda', null, 'Alien invaders take over Great Mazinger who is at the entrance of a museum next to Mazinger Z as symbols of peace. Grendizer fights the evil invaders and Great Mazinger is recovered. When the Vegan empire dispatches a new general to oversee the takeover of Earth, he quickly manages to capture Koji Kabuto and, learning of Great Mazinger through interrogation, quickly commandeers it from a museum where it was kept as a symbol of peace. It is now up to Duke Fleed aboard Grendizer to stop humanity''s former defender from becoming its destroyer.', 'Alien invaders take over Great Mazinger who is at the entrance of a museum next to Mazinger Z as symbols of peace. Grendizer fights the evil invaders and Great Mazinger is recovered. When the Vegan empire dispatches a new general to oversee the takeover of Earth, he quickly manages to capture Koji Kabuto and, learning of Great Mazinger through interrogation, quickly commandeers it from a museum where it was kept as a symbol of peace. It is now up to Duke Fleed aboard Grendizer to stop humanity''s former defender from becoming its destroyer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmFzkzaD4PG0MbP45KdopYMnzff.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85311'),
  ('933139729891248899', 'UFO: It Is Here', 2016, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Daniele Grieco', 'Daniele Grieco', 'Laura Berlin, Leonard Hohm, Fabio Cimpeanu, Olga von Luckwald, Dennis Mojen, Nika Cimpeanu, Hacky Rumpel, Jessica Hawich', null, 'Five film students are producing a documentary about the local zoo when suddenly the animals go berserk: The reason is a light ball flying by in the sky and crashing at the horizon. Convinced that they''ve just witnessed a meteor landing the students follow the trajectory to document the event with their camera. In a forest area they discover a burned crater. Since it''s too dark to film they decide to spend the night in their van. The next morning one of them is missing. The remaining students find first a trail of blood and then the torn up pieces of what used to be their friend. Soon they realize that something is hunting them - something that''s not from this world.', 'Five film students are producing a documentary about the local zoo when suddenly the animals go berserk: The reason is a light ball flying by in the sky and crashing at the horizon. Convinced that they''ve just witnessed a meteor landing the students follow the trajectory to document the event with their camera. In a forest area they discover a burned crater. Since it''s too dark to film they decide to spend the night in their van. The next morning one of them is missing. The remaining students find first a trail of blood and then the torn up pieces of what used to be their friend. Soon they realize that something is hunting them - something that''s not from this world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2GnEKeMaO4nwv9y5ijLgoHkCYIq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424222'),
  ('391886364147906226', 'UFO: Target Earth', 1974, 'Science Fiction', 'Michael A. DeGaetano, Jerry Crowder, Alessandro de Gaetano', 'Michael A. DeGaetano, Alessandro de Gaetano', 'Nick Plakias, Cynthia Cline, LaVerne Light, Tom Arcuragi, Phil Erickson, Brooks Clift, Martha Corrigan, Kathleen Long', 'G', 'An electronics expert searching for evidence of aliens picks up signals that he believes are from an alien spacecraft--and they are coming from a lake near town.', 'An electronics expert searching for evidence of aliens picks up signals that he believes are from an alien spacecraft--and they are coming from a lake near town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWxuvMT3RwV8eusWPJJcgLeOnsK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113824'),
  ('297914979511873105', 'UFOs', 1971, 'Animation', 'Lillian Schwartz', null, null, null, 'Blasting off into cosmic visual abstraction, pioneering computer artist Lillian Schwartz’s UFOs is a kinetic tour-de-force whose innovative pixel pigmentation showcased advanced stereoscopic technology as art.', 'Blasting off into cosmic visual abstraction, pioneering computer artist Lillian Schwartz’s UFOs is a kinetic tour-de-force whose innovative pixel pigmentation showcased advanced stereoscopic technology as art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzsJIs99wzsdize6fQmW8WLpUwx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147603'),
  ('397296153523093166', 'Uglies', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Kevin Houlihan, Xiaolong Liu, McG', 'Jacob Forman, Vanessa Taylor, Whit Anderson', 'Joey King, Brianne Tju, Keith Powers, Chase Stokes, Laverne Cox, Charmin Lee, Jay DeVon Johnson, Jan Luis Castellanos', 'PG-13', 'In a futuristic dystopia with enforced beauty standards, a teen awaiting mandatory cosmetic surgery embarks on a journey to find her missing friend.', 'In a futuristic dystopia with enforced beauty standards, a teen awaiting mandatory cosmetic surgery embarks on a journey to find her missing friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaUu9zHtbcFwrB5Y1DNYE09HMex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:748167'),
  ('266102011124913163', 'Ugly', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Anurag Kashyap, Saqib Pandor, Nikos Andritsakis', null, 'Ronit Roy, Rahul Bhat, Vineet Kumar Singh, Tejaswini Kolhapure, Girish Kulkarni, Surveen Chawla, Siddhanth Kapoor, Abir Goswami', null, 'When a 10-year old girl goes missing, her stepfather races against time to investigate the kidnapping. Can he find her before it''s too late?', 'When a 10-year old girl goes missing, her stepfather races against time to investigate the kidnapping. Can he find her before it''s too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hsSumOuh6OO7PgsH7A58I46j8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191726'),
  ('568144426545341444', 'Ugly Me', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Claudio Dabed, Masanobu Takayanagi, Waldo Salgado', 'Franklin McDonald, Claudio Dabed', 'Bárbara Mori, Marcelo Mazzarello, Amaya Forch, Gonzalo Robles, Paz Bascuñan, Rodrigo Muñoz, Jaime Azócar, Alejandro Cohen', 'R', 'A beautiful woman decides to transform into an ugly duckling in an attempt to ward off men and avoid more romantic disappointments.', 'A beautiful woman decides to transform into an ugly duckling in an attempt to ward off men and avoid more romantic disappointments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTmDUoyupBdFrCoo6D9LfAzHHL2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54190'),
  ('88342902079279978', 'Ugly Melanie', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Allan Mauduit, Régis Blondeau', 'Allan Mauduit, Jean-Patrick Benes', 'Marilou Berry, Frédérique Bel, Chantal Lauby, Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Joséphine de Meaux, Liliane Rovère, Eric Laugérias, Gil Alma', null, 'This is the story of too nice girl who one day decides to become evil. And who will find out it is not so easy to do wrong when you have always been nice.', 'This is the story of too nice girl who one day decides to become evil. And who will find out it is not so easy to do wrong when you have always been nice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snCBBlbvDzGqC4cdOlRCK7yXWmM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17630'),
  ('306066565079739761', 'Ugly Nasty People', 2017, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Stéphane Bidault, Vittorio Omodei Zorini, Giuseppe Bonito', 'Luca Infascelli, Cosimo Gomez', 'Claudio Santamaria, Marco D''Amore, Sara Serraiocco, Simone Martucci, Narcisse Mame, Aline Belibi, Giorgio Colangeli, Filippo Dini', null, 'Four physically disabled lowlifes plot the perfect heist, but things go south when each reveals an agenda of their own.', 'Four physically disabled lowlifes plot the perfect heist, but things go south when each reveals an agenda of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3iRFGaYnVzxe32bb5XWJjHxUflX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468292'),
  ('499566367773747783', 'Ugly, Dirty and Bad', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ettore Scola, Dario Di Palma', 'Ruggero Maccari, Ettore Scola', 'Nino Manfredi, Francesco Anniballi, Maria Bosco, Giselda Castrini, Alfredo D''Ippolito, Giancarlo Fanelli, Marina Fasoli, Ettore Garofolo', null, 'Giacinto lives with his wife, their ten children and various other family members in a shack on the hills of Rome. Some time ago he has lost his left eye while at work, and got a consistent sum of money from the insurance company, which he keeps hidden from the rest of the family. His whole life is now based on defending the money he sees as his own, while the rest of the family tries to kill him.', 'Giacinto lives with his wife, their ten children and various other family members in a shack on the hills of Rome. Some time ago he has lost his left eye while at work, and got a consistent sum of money from the insurance company, which he keeps hidden from the rest of the family. His whole life is now based on defending the money he sees as his own, while the rest of the family tries to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cn2OXjLPL6m5aj2W26hkkc1GyXm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19413'),
  ('651450576135109972', 'UglyDolls', 2019, 'Animation, Music, Family, Comedy', 'Kelly Asbury', 'Alison Peck', 'Kelly Clarkson, Janelle Monáe, Blake Shelton, Wanda Sykes, Gabriel Iglesias, Leehom Wang, Bebe Rexha, Charli xcx', 'PG', 'In the adorably different town of Uglyville, weirdness is celebrated, strangeness is special and beauty is embraced as more than meets the eye. After traveling to the other side of a mountain, Moxy and her UglyDoll friends discover Perfection -- a town where more conventional dolls receive training before entering the real world to find the love of a child.', 'In the adorably different town of Uglyville, weirdness is celebrated, strangeness is special and beauty is embraced as more than meets the eye. After traveling to the other side of a mountain, Moxy and her UglyDoll friends discover Perfection -- a town where more conventional dolls receive training before entering the real world to find the love of a child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p97LQ1TL95mptVL2AS8Rz1cJCQg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454458'),
  ('21925826252022521', 'UHF', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Jay Levey, Richard Kilroy, Ron Yates', 'Jay Levey, ''Weird Al'' Yankovic', '''Weird Al'' Yankovic, Kevin McCarthy, Michael Richards, David Bowe, Stanley Brock, Anthony Geary, Trinidad Silva, Gedde Watanabe', 'PG-13', 'The eccentric new manager of a UHF television channel tries to save the station from financial ruin with an odd array of programming.', 'The eccentric new manager of a UHF television channel tries to save the station from financial ruin with an odd array of programming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxx5YQLKVH1WMSRXQAUnC76r4iY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11959'),
  ('124887522436682378', 'Uhudler-Verschwörung - Ein Stinatz-Krimi', 2025, 'Crime', 'Daniel Prochaska', 'Stefan Hafner, Thomas Weingartner', 'Thomas Stipsits, Erika Deutinger, Linde Prelog, Erika Mottl, Sabrina Reiter, Christoph Krutzler, Clemens Berndorff, Julia Edtmeier', null, 'The death of a winemaker leaves Sifkovits unmoved – what with a fermentation gas accident, there''s something going on, or in this case, something in the vine! Of course, the "Burgenland Columbo" isn''t deterred by trivialities like his boss''s order not to investigate under any circumstances.', 'The death of a winemaker leaves Sifkovits unmoved – what with a fermentation gas accident, there''s something going on, or in this case, something in the vine! Of course, the "Burgenland Columbo" isn''t deterred by trivialities like his boss''s order not to investigate under any circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcl7Jk6ClaUzjXJicXYmusBplI1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1428425'),
  ('817302000495682235', 'Ujda Chaman', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Abhishek Pathak, Gourov Roshin, Guru Randhawa', 'Danish J Singh', 'Sunny Singh, Maanvi Gagroo, Saurabh Shukla, Atul Kumar, Aishwarya Sakhuja, Sharib Hashmi, Grusha Kapoor, Gagan Arora', null, 'A balding 30-year-old bachelor in search of a beautiful wife is given a deadline to find one or remain celibate forever.', 'A balding 30-year-old bachelor in search of a beautiful wife is given a deadline to find one or remain celibate forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hybSFEHZcehPN8oRdb5YjaxRk2u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636449'),
  ('63698642378905295', 'Ukraine in Flames', 1943, 'Documentary', 'Oleksandr Dovzhenko, Yuliya Solntseva, Yakov Avdeyenko', 'Oleksandr Dovzhenko', null, null, 'A 1943 Soviet war propaganda film by Ukrainian director Oleksandr Dovzhenko and Yuliya Solntseva. It is Dovzhenko''s second World War II documentary, and dealt with the Battle of Kharkiv. The film incorporates German footage of the invasion of Ukraine, which was later captured by the Soviets.', 'A 1943 Soviet war propaganda film by Ukrainian director Oleksandr Dovzhenko and Yuliya Solntseva. It is Dovzhenko''s second World War II documentary, and dealt with the Battle of Kharkiv. The film incorporates German footage of the invasion of Ukraine, which was later captured by the Soviets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nREThjFrCmtauH6HA5L7571VQDX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268671'),
  ('404692961549366685', 'Ukraine on Fire', 2016, 'Documentary, History', 'Igor Lopatonok', 'Vanessa Dean', 'Oliver Stone, Vladimir Putin, Victor Yanukovich, Vitaliy Zakharchenko, Robert Parry, Fanny Sage, Lotus Bech, Lex Lang', null, 'Ukraine. Across its eastern border is Russia and to its west-Europe. For centuries, it has been at the center of a tug-of-war between powers seeking to control its rich lands and access to the Black Sea. 2014''s Maidan Massacre triggered a bloody uprising that ousted president Viktor Yanukovych and painted Russia as the perpetrator by Western media. But was it? "Ukraine on Fire" by Igor Lopatonok provides a historical perspective for the deep divisions in the region which lead to the 2004 Orange Revolution, 2014 uprisings, and the violent overthrow of democratically elected Yanukovych.', 'Ukraine. Across its eastern border is Russia and to its west-Europe. For centuries, it has been at the center of a tug-of-war between powers seeking to control its rich lands and access to the Black Sea. 2014''s Maidan Massacre triggered a bloody uprising that ousted president Viktor Yanukovych and painted Russia as the perpetrator by Western media. But was it? "Ukraine on Fire" by Igor Lopatonok provides a historical perspective for the deep divisions in the region which lead to the 2004 Orange Revolution, 2014 uprisings, and the violent overthrow of democratically elected Yanukovych.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRlYu1SRsDzFOnwLvpdUreeHBBu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402558'),
  ('548249516907157402', 'Ukrainian Rhapsody', 1961, 'Drama, Romance, War, Music', 'Sergei Parajanov, Andrey Bocharov, G. Goncharenko', 'Aleksandr Levada', 'Olga Reus-Petrenko, Eduard Koshman, Yuriy Gulyayev, Nataliia Uzhvii, Oleksandr Hai, Valeriy Vitter, Anatoli Chemodurov, Stepan Shkurat', null, 'World War II separates lovers Oksana and Anton. The young man is taken prisoner by the Germans, while his beloved abandons her studies at the conservatory to become a frontline nurse. Despite all the hardships, their paths cross again.', 'World War II separates lovers Oksana and Anton. The young man is taken prisoner by the Germans, while his beloved abandons her studies at the conservatory to become a frontline nurse. Despite all the hardships, their paths cross again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tySMc8prDW2Ea31u8EfMLJVThmg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182723'),
  ('87221724647653365', 'Ulajh', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Sudhanshu Saria, Shreya Dev Dube, Jogi Malang', 'Parveez Shaikh, Sudhanshu Saria', 'Janhvi Kapoor, Gulshan Devaiah, Roshan Mathew, Meiyang Chang, Adil Hussain, Rajesh Tailang, Jitendra Joshi, Jaimini Pathak', null, 'The journey of a young IFS officer, belonging to a prominent family of patriots, who gets embroiled in a dangerous personal conspiracy while far from her home turf, at a career-defining post.', 'The journey of a young IFS officer, belonging to a prominent family of patriots, who gets embroiled in a dangerous personal conspiracy while far from her home turf, at a career-defining post.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRTaE89m8As6G6aqgYjCBmm6MKN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1124876'),
  ('768867166036273166', 'Ulee''s Gold', 1997, 'Drama', 'Victor Nuñez, Aloura Melissa Charles, Tim Lewis', 'Victor Nuñez', 'Peter Fonda, Patricia Richardson, Christine Dunford, Tom Wood, Jessica Biel, Vanessa Zima, Steven Flynn, Dewey Weber', 'R', 'Third-generation Florida beekeeper Ulee Jackson may have gotten out of Vietnam alive, but he left a part of himself behind. Now he methodically tends his bees, carefully provides for his two grandchildren and keeps his emotions at bay. But when a long-buried secret threatens Ulee''s business and family, he is forced to break through his emotional walls and confront the terror of his wounded spirit.', 'Third-generation Florida beekeeper Ulee Jackson may have gotten out of Vietnam alive, but he left a part of himself behind. Now he methodically tends his bees, carefully provides for his two grandchildren and keeps his emotions at bay. But when a long-buried secret threatens Ulee''s business and family, he is forced to break through his emotional walls and confront the terror of his wounded spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMpZ7U7A0QHJptR9L573V3Y7SI0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55306'),
  ('917560951744255590', 'Ultimate Avengers 2', 2006, 'Adventure, Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Will Meugniot, Dick Sebast, Bob Richardson', 'Greg Johnson', 'Justin Gross, Jeffrey D. Sams, Grey DeLisle, Nolan North, Olivia D''Abo, Marc Worden, Michael Massee, David Boat', 'PG-13', 'Mysterious Wakanda lies in the darkest heart of Africa, unknown to most of the world. An isolated land hidden behind closed borders, fiercely protected by its young king: Black Panther. But when brutal alien invaders attack, the threat leaves Black Panther with no option but to go against the sacred decrees of his people and ask for help from outsiders.', 'Mysterious Wakanda lies in the darkest heart of Africa, unknown to most of the world. An isolated land hidden behind closed borders, fiercely protected by its young king: Black Panther. But when brutal alien invaders attack, the threat leaves Black Panther with no option but to go against the sacred decrees of his people and ask for help from outsiders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMFyYZR9krqcQC99G6jnb10Zv4P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14611'),
  ('646466858257723342', 'Ultimate Avengers: The Movie', 2006, 'Action, Animation, Family, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Steven E. Gordon, Curt Geda, Tae-Ho Han', 'Greg Johnson', 'Justin Gross, Grey DeLisle, Nolan North, Olivia D''Abo, Marc Worden, Michael Massee, David Boat, Andre Ware', 'PG-13', 'When a nuclear missile was fired at Washington in 1945, Captain America managed to detonate it in the upper atmosphere. But then he fell miles into the icy depths of the North Atlantic, where he remained lost for over sixty years. But now, with the world facing the very same evil, Captain America must rise again as our last hope for survival.', 'When a nuclear missile was fired at Washington in 1945, Captain America managed to detonate it in the upper atmosphere. But then he fell miles into the icy depths of the North Atlantic, where he remained lost for over sixty years. But now, with the world facing the very same evil, Captain America must rise again as our last hope for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMCkGHVrYRdqKROPRPmVaJVSlg3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14609'),
  ('526852612668084900', 'Ultimate Fights from the Movies', 2002, 'Documentary, Action', null, null, 'LisaRaye McCoy, Chrystale Wilson, Jason Scott Lee, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong, Pak Ho-Sung, Billy Chow Bei-Lei, Michelle Yeoh, Roddy Piper', null, 'In their second film compilation following their ''Boogeymen:The Killer Compilation'' series, FlixMix takes you into the history of action movies from Hollywood to Hong Kong cinema that spans a 20-year period. This one features action scenes from 16 action-packed movies featuring action gurus, Jet Li, Michelle Yeoh, Chow Yun-Fat, Jackie Chan, Jean-Claude Van Damme and many more.', 'In their second film compilation following their ''Boogeymen:The Killer Compilation'' series, FlixMix takes you into the history of action movies from Hollywood to Hong Kong cinema that spans a 20-year period. This one features action scenes from 16 action-packed movies featuring action gurus, Jet Li, Michelle Yeoh, Chow Yun-Fat, Jackie Chan, Jean-Claude Van Damme and many more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMGmnxe7Lap6Ek1ZxIzdAdbuJeJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68996'),
  ('158545133716160048', 'Ultimate Heist', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Laurent Tuel, Laurent Machuel', 'Simon Moutaïrou, Laurent Tuel, Laurent Turner', 'Jean Reno, Gaspard Ulliel, Vahina Giocante, Sami Bouajila, Isaac Sharry, Gisèle Casadesus, Alberto Gimignani, Eric Challier', 'R', 'The Malakian clan, a family of ruthless gangsters, controls the underworld of Southern France. At its head, the violent godfather Milo Malakian rules his world with an iron fist. His son and heir, Anton, dreams of breaking free and making his own choices. But the gang''s inner circle is engraved in blood. To escape, not only does Anton have to counter his own destiny, but also the man who has sworn to bring his father down.', 'The Malakian clan, a family of ruthless gangsters, controls the underworld of Southern France. At its head, the violent godfather Milo Malakian rules his world with an iron fist. His son and heir, Anton, dreams of breaking free and making his own choices. But the gang''s inner circle is engraved in blood. To escape, not only does Anton have to counter his own destiny, but also the man who has sworn to bring his father down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YFYG4vwxrviT3PKS0VJ8JcwyI7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15638'),
  ('428134522469564999', 'Ultimate Revenge', 2026, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Terry Ng Ka-Wai, German Cheung Man-Kit, Karl Tam Ka-Ho', 'Ronald Chan Kin-Hung', 'Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Carlos Chan Ka-Lok, Louis Cheung, Andy On Chi-Kit, Ray Lui, Chin Ka-Lok, German Cheung Man-Kit, Power Chan Kwok-Pong', null, 'The Yau Tsim Mong area, the core commercial area of Hong Kong, has recently experienced a series of robberies. Many jewelry stores in the area have been ransacked by gangsters. Police unit is given the mission to take the gangsters into a custody, but the operation is not so easy.', 'The Yau Tsim Mong area, the core commercial area of Hong Kong, has recently experienced a series of robberies. Many jewelry stores in the area have been ransacked by gangsters. Police unit is given the mission to take the gangsters into a custody, but the operation is not so easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqu6u29ToxZos0PojcgXy2hEx9b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1071640'),
  ('801488532904121307', 'Ultimate Teacher', 1988, 'Animation, Action', 'Toyoo Ashida', 'Toyoo Ashida, Monta Ibu', 'Hiroko Kasahara, Naoto Takenaka, Yusaku Yara, Naoki Tatsuta, Ichiro Nagai, Keiichi Nanba, Shinya Ôtaki', null, 'At a run down school the "Ultimate Teacher" Ganpachi is sent to get things back on track and prepare the delinquent students for the real world. But the students don''t want Ganpachi ruining the gang they got going so their boss, Hinako, fights back Ganpachi aided by her secret power...her lucky kitty underwear. Things get more interesting when we findout Ganpachi is the result of genetic experiments.', 'At a run down school the "Ultimate Teacher" Ganpachi is sent to get things back on track and prepare the delinquent students for the real world. But the students don''t want Ganpachi ruining the gang they got going so their boss, Hinako, fights back Ganpachi aided by her secret power...her lucky kitty underwear. Things get more interesting when we findout Ganpachi is the result of genetic experiments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUrx9cWLiAsvfWA9yQmQlzUeO6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60777'),
  ('912242321545450682', 'Ultimo - Vivo coi sogni appesi', 2023, 'Documentary, Music', 'Max Brigante', null, 'Ultimo, Max Brigante', null, 'A documentary about Italian singer Ultimo.', 'A documentary about Italian singer Ultimo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjcj7I3HM4lEhbEOYsv4NwcWWkS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1131131'),
  ('1039236695956796013', 'Ultrà', 1991, 'Drama', 'Ricky Tognazzi, Alessio Gelsini Torresi, Ferzan Özpetek', 'Simona Izzo, Graziano Diana, Giuseppe Manfridi', 'Claudio Amendola, Ricky Memphis, Gianmarco Tognazzi, Giuppy Izzo, Alessandro Tiberi, Fabrizio Vidale, Krum De Nicola, Antonello Morroni', null, 'The "Brigatte Veneno" is a fan group from the soccer club "AS Roma". The next match is against "Juventus Turin", the classic prestige duel. Principe, the former leader of the group, has been dismissed from jail a few days before. He has to realize that his best friend Red has not only taken over control of the group, but also has started an affair with his girlfriend. The rivalry between the hot-blooded Principe and the sensible Red causes an anxious mood within the group. When Smilzo, a member of the group, dies during a street fight with another fan group, Red knows that Principe is to be blamed for this catastrophe.', 'The "Brigatte Veneno" is a fan group from the soccer club "AS Roma". The next match is against "Juventus Turin", the classic prestige duel. Principe, the former leader of the group, has been dismissed from jail a few days before. He has to realize that his best friend Red has not only taken over control of the group, but also has started an affair with his girlfriend. The rivalry between the hot-blooded Principe and the sensible Red causes an anxious mood within the group. When Smilzo, a member of the group, dies during a street fight with another fan group, Red knows that Principe is to be blamed for this catastrophe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPXTyNFaj4hjC7VcRy5kTHzoXlc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59241'),
  ('20131357194362429', 'Ultraman Cosmos vs. Ultraman Justice: The Final Battle', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'Shin''ichi Ôoka, Tsugumi Kitaura, Noma Shorei', 'Keiichi Hasegawa, Hideyuki Kawakami', 'Taiyo Sugiura, Kounosuke Tokai, Kazue Fukiishi, Hidekazu Ichinose, Kei Shimizu, Yurika Asada, Masaki Nishina, Dai Tōjō', null, 'Once again, Musashi has encounter Ultraman Cosmos. Now Ultraman Cosmos has gained some new modes to defeat Scropis. Musashi has joined Team Sea to save the Blue Area. But there is mysterious evil monster, Sandros, who wants to destroy the Earth. Now it is up Musashi and Ultraman Cosmos to defeat Sandros and who’s the other Ultraman?', 'Once again, Musashi has encounter Ultraman Cosmos. Now Ultraman Cosmos has gained some new modes to defeat Scropis. Musashi has joined Team Sea to save the Blue Area. But there is mysterious evil monster, Sandros, who wants to destroy the Earth. Now it is up Musashi and Ultraman Cosmos to defeat Sandros and who’s the other Ultraman?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4oNijcKakcIQkG6J0D4W5yUTTP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44045'),
  ('1087319321285128870', 'Ultraman Decker Finale: Journey to Beyond', 2023, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Masayoshi Takesue, Atsushi Ogasawara, Satoshi Murakawa', 'Toshizo Nemoto', 'Hiroki Matsumoto, Yūka Murayama, Nobunaga Daichi, Sae Miyazawa, Masaya Kikawada, Kayano Nakamura, Hiroshi Tsuchida, Ryusei Nakao', null, 'When GUTS-Select investigate mysterious disappearances, they learn it is work of an evil alien who intends to invade the Earth, called Professor Gibellus. However, just in time, a mysterious woman appears to help GUTS-Select.', 'When GUTS-Select investigate mysterious disappearances, they learn it is work of an evil alien who intends to invade the Earth, called Professor Gibellus. However, just in time, a mysterious woman appears to help GUTS-Select.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWxbx5SeN089UyDaIwaFulG6Zvs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1053626'),
  ('16033446488366581', 'Ultraman Geed the Movie: Connect! The Wishes!!', 2018, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Koichi Sakamoto', 'Toshizo Nemoto, Otsuichi', 'Tatsuomi Hamada, Chihiro Yamamoto, Shintaro Asanuma, Megumi Han, Mamoru Miyano, Suzuko Mimori, Mayu Hasegawa, Hideyoshi Iwata', null, 'The Giant Artificial Brain Gilbaris is trying to eliminate all intellectual life forms throughout the universe. Ultraman Geed confronts the harsh fate against a mighty enemy who withstands the power of Ultra Warriors'' light. Ultraman Orb, Jugglus Juggler, and Ultraman Zero rush to the crisis! And the heated feelings inside Riku awakens Geed''s Ultimate form - Ultimate Final!', 'The Giant Artificial Brain Gilbaris is trying to eliminate all intellectual life forms throughout the universe. Ultraman Geed confronts the harsh fate against a mighty enemy who withstands the power of Ultra Warriors'' light. Ultraman Orb, Jugglus Juggler, and Ultraman Zero rush to the crisis! And the heated feelings inside Riku awakens Geed''s Ultimate form - Ultimate Final!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BeeMq1Ul6ic7gjGOCr2lcmJVXZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:545582'),
  ('262285407274566274', 'Ultraman Ginga S the Movie: Showdown! The 10 Ultra Warriors!', 2015, 'Fantasy, Action, Science Fiction', 'Koichi Sakamoto', 'Yuji Kobayashi, Takao Nakano', 'Takuya Negishi, Kiyotaka Uji, Takuya Kusakawa, Yukari Taki, Takahiro Katou, Ryuichi Ohura, Moga Mogami, Rina Koike', null, 'The Super Dimensional Demon Etelgar forces a beautiful young alien princess to use her magic to trap Ultraman all across the galaxy! In order to stop Etelgar and save their fellow Ultra Heroes, two brave young men named Hikaru and Sho must transform into Ultraman Ginga and Ultraman Victory. But will even their combined powers be enough to defeat Etelgar and his army?', 'The Super Dimensional Demon Etelgar forces a beautiful young alien princess to use her magic to trap Ultraman all across the galaxy! In order to stop Etelgar and save their fellow Ultra Heroes, two brave young men named Hikaru and Sho must transform into Ultraman Ginga and Ultraman Victory. But will even their combined powers be enough to defeat Etelgar and his army?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Z0itOlWg958vluJFwh54kk459c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373723'),
  ('812615765323703240', 'Ultraman Mebius & Ultra Brothers', 2006, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Kazuya Konaka, Hajime Takahashi, Kazuo Kumada', 'Keiichi Hasegawa', 'Shunji Igarashi, Susumu Kurobe, Kohji Moritsugu, Jiro Dan, Keiji Takamine, Ohga Tanaka, Aiko Ito, Masaki Nishina', null, 'In the beginning of the movie, 20 years ago, on the moon, the 4 Ultra brothers, Ultraman, Seven, Jack, and Ace were fighting a deadly foe known as Yapool, a monster that was several times their size. As they fought, Yapool had a clear advantage and used his several claws to grasp the brothers, although, they managed to clear from the claws through there powers and used a combined Specium Ray to no avail. The monster then flies off to Earth to dodge the attack and the brothers follow. The brothers were barely able to defeat Yapool but the monster still needed to be sealed. However, to seal Yapool away they were forced to give up the ability to transform, and took up jobs to be in the area of Kobe in case the monster ever returned.', 'In the beginning of the movie, 20 years ago, on the moon, the 4 Ultra brothers, Ultraman, Seven, Jack, and Ace were fighting a deadly foe known as Yapool, a monster that was several times their size. As they fought, Yapool had a clear advantage and used his several claws to grasp the brothers, although, they managed to clear from the claws through there powers and used a combined Specium Ray to no avail. The monster then flies off to Earth to dodge the attack and the brothers follow. The brothers were barely able to defeat Yapool but the monster still needed to be sealed. However, to seal Yapool away they were forced to give up the ability to transform, and took up jobs to be in the area of Kobe in case the monster ever returned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHZQMxAyFUfCU8kHF50GcO2NHVB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118717'),
  ('86867056255296433', 'Ultraman R/B The Movie: Select! The Crystal of Bond', 2019, 'Action, Family, Science Fiction', 'Masayoshi Takesue, Takeshi Arai', 'Takao Nakano', 'Yuya Hirata, Ryosuke Koike, Arisa Sonohara, Tatsuomi Hamada, Yuma Uchida, Kaori Manabe, Ginnojo Yamazaki, Megumi Han', null, 'The mysterious Ultraman, Tregear, has suddenly appeared in Ayaka City. Tregear asks what one would do to make their dreams come true, prompting Katsumi to search for his own dream. As a monster appears for the first time in a year, Ultraman Blu and Ultraman Rosso are joined by Ultraman Geed to face off against this new threat. Walking towards their dream with the heart of the Minato family in hand, Ultraman Gruebe is born.', 'The mysterious Ultraman, Tregear, has suddenly appeared in Ayaka City. Tregear asks what one would do to make their dreams come true, prompting Katsumi to search for his own dream. As a monster appears for the first time in a year, Ultraman Blu and Ultraman Rosso are joined by Ultraman Geed to face off against this new threat. Walking towards their dream with the heart of the Minato family in hand, Ultraman Gruebe is born.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGvtKClq2x4DvvinmNnYwYeKups.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587806'),
  ('544005464918217566', 'Ultraman Saga', 2012, 'Action, Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'Hideki Oka, Sô Takahashi', 'Keiichi Hasegawa', 'Takeshi Tsuruno, DAIGO, Sayaka Akimoto, Ayaka Umeda, Taiyo Sugiura, Yuka Masuda, Sae Miyazawa, Sumire Sato', null, 'Ultraman Saga opens with a powerful apocalyptic vision of Tokyo, buildings destroyed and the city seemingly devoid of life. We are soon introduced to the Earth Defense Force (EDF), Team U (played by members of the female idol group AKB48). They and a group of young children and the last survivors on planet Earth after the world was invaded by the evil Alien Bat, the rest of the human population having been abducted.', 'Ultraman Saga opens with a powerful apocalyptic vision of Tokyo, buildings destroyed and the city seemingly devoid of life. We are soon introduced to the Earth Defense Force (EDF), Team U (played by members of the female idol group AKB48). They and a group of young children and the last survivors on planet Earth after the world was invaded by the evil Alien Bat, the rest of the human population having been abducted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGI8n07wKs9oEj26havBGPlBapG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139717'),
  ('773329184850195384', 'Ultraman Tiga & Ultraman Dyna & Ultraman Gaia: The Battle in Hyperspace', 1999, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Kazuya Konaka, Shin''ichi Ôoka, Noma Shorei', 'Keiichi Hasegawa', 'Takeshi Yoshioka, Gaku Hamada, Hiroyuki Watanabe, Sei Hiraizumi, Mai Saito, Maria Theresa Gow', null, 'A young boy discovers a magical rock that can make any wish come true. But the rock is stolen by a school bully who uses it to create a powerful and dangerous monster. The only way to stop the beast is to enlist the help of superhero Ultraman Gaia. The boy does everything he can to help the XIG Team, a brave group of humans who have direct contact with Ultraman Gaia as well as Ultraman Dyna and Ultraman Tiga.', 'A young boy discovers a magical rock that can make any wish come true. But the rock is stolen by a school bully who uses it to create a powerful and dangerous monster. The only way to stop the beast is to enlist the help of superhero Ultraman Gaia. The boy does everything he can to help the XIG Team, a brave group of humans who have direct contact with Ultraman Gaia as well as Ultraman Dyna and Ultraman Tiga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFP43W7cqUvINxky2Nu9WcxgSNT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318718'),
  ('952530428105593595', 'Ultraman Tiga & Ultraman Dyna: Warriors of the Star of Light', 1998, 'Action, Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'Kazuya Konaka', 'Keiichi Hasegawa', 'Takeshi Tsuruno, Ryô Kinomoto, Toshikazu Fukawa, Risa Saito, Nobuyuki Kase, Joe Onodera, Mariya Yamada, Toshiaki Amada', null, 'The members of the Super GUTS force, one of whom is secretly Ultraman Dyna, are in the middle of a losing battle against an enormous monster on the surface of the moon, when suddenly a spaceship appears and saves them by zapping the beast. The crew of the ship claim to members of the world peace force that originally created the Super GUTS force, and they invite the GUTS members to enter their brainwave patterns into the ship''s battle computer so it can be a more effective fighting system. It sounds like a good idea, but could they have some other plan up their sleeves?', 'The members of the Super GUTS force, one of whom is secretly Ultraman Dyna, are in the middle of a losing battle against an enormous monster on the surface of the moon, when suddenly a spaceship appears and saves them by zapping the beast. The crew of the ship claim to members of the world peace force that originally created the Super GUTS force, and they invite the GUTS members to enter their brainwave patterns into the ship''s battle computer so it can be a more effective fighting system. It sounds like a good idea, but could they have some other plan up their sleeves?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i60jgBf5ZLCCyhI0FJ0GtuTeSJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30597'),
  ('287839898902354612', 'Ultraman Tiga: The Final Odyssey', 2000, 'Action, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Hirochika Muraishi, Toshiyuki Takano', 'Keiichi Hasegawa', 'Hiroshi Nagano, Takami Yoshimoto, Mio Takaki, Shigeki Kagemaru, Akitoshi Ohtaki, Masuda Yukio, Yoichi Furuya, Tamio Kawachi', null, 'Ultraman Tiga: The Final Oddysey was sort of an epilogue of the Ultraman Tiga series. Just when we thought that the world is safe, it''s under attack again! A TPC excursion (including GUTS'' Captain Megumi Iruma) headed to an old ruins and unintentionally woke up three evil ancient giants whom Daigo, later on, has visions of. What''s so haunting about his visions is that they''re not only three but four evil giants, including Ultraman Tiga in a very dark physique and a very evil aura. After a series of visions, Daigo was able to meet the three evils who beat him up and left the Black Spark Lens to him. Later on, the ultimate battle begins in the ancient ruins. Daigo as Ultraman Tiga, who is supposed to be the warrior of light, must use his powers, however dark, in order to defeat the three evils.', 'Ultraman Tiga: The Final Oddysey was sort of an epilogue of the Ultraman Tiga series. Just when we thought that the world is safe, it''s under attack again! A TPC excursion (including GUTS'' Captain Megumi Iruma) headed to an old ruins and unintentionally woke up three evil ancient giants whom Daigo, later on, has visions of. What''s so haunting about his visions is that they''re not only three but four evil giants, including Ultraman Tiga in a very dark physique and a very evil aura. After a series of visions, Daigo was able to meet the three evils who beat him up and left the Black Spark Lens to him. Later on, the ultimate battle begins in the ancient ruins. Daigo as Ultraman Tiga, who is supposed to be the warrior of light, must use his powers, however dark, in order to defeat the three evils.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/papDk5x8wmkamSpEm70Ssc6SqQG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113094'),
  ('95062341884511554', 'Ultraman X The Movie: Here He Comes! Our Ultraman', 2016, 'Fantasy, Action, Science Fiction', 'Kiyotaka Taguchi, Sô Takahashi', 'Takao Nakano, Hirotoshi Kobayashi, Yuji Kobayashi', 'Kensuke Takahashi, Akane Sakanoue, Yoshihiko Hosoda, Ukyo Matsumoto, Hayato Harada, Haruka Momokawa, Chiaki Seshimo, Sarara Tsukifune', null, 'When realty TV host Carlos Kurozaki breaks into a mysterious underground pyramid for a television event, he removes a special gem. . . and unwittingly releases a diabolical monster called Zaigorg! The evil creature wants Kurozaki''s gem, so it spawns an army of giant kaijus to get it! It''s up to the famous superheroes Ultraman X, Ultraman Tiga, and the one and only original Ultraman to stop the worldwide monster war!', 'When realty TV host Carlos Kurozaki breaks into a mysterious underground pyramid for a television event, he removes a special gem. . . and unwittingly releases a diabolical monster called Zaigorg! The evil creature wants Kurozaki''s gem, so it spawns an army of giant kaijus to get it! It''s up to the famous superheroes Ultraman X, Ultraman Tiga, and the one and only original Ultraman to stop the worldwide monster war!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKfK9A99jbahGArESsK4qGROxgd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408579'),
  ('1034742519910207280', 'Ultraman Zearth', 1996, 'Action, Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'Shinya Nakajima, Shin''ichi Ôoka, Shun MIYASHITA', 'Shūkei Nagasaka', 'Masaharu Sekiguchi, Takaaki Ishibashi, Noritake Kinashi, Yuka Takaoka, Hiromoto Okubo, Susumu Kurobe, Akiji Kobayashi, Masaya Nihei', null, 'Ultraman Zearth hails from The Land of Pikari in Nebula Z95. He has a big red face and dislikes dirt, and will go to great lengths to wash it off his hands. His goal is to clean the polluted Earth. He transforms with an electric toothbrush, which is consistent with his hygiene fixation. He''s not quite adept at being a superhero, but at least he tries his best.', 'Ultraman Zearth hails from The Land of Pikari in Nebula Z95. He has a big red face and dislikes dirt, and will go to great lengths to wash it off his hands. His goal is to clean the polluted Earth. He transforms with an electric toothbrush, which is consistent with his hygiene fixation. He''s not quite adept at being a superhero, but at least he tries his best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGjmM1qYzDdYcCqFwjzBstRI8HI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336396'),
  ('652265082973649893', 'Ultraman Zero: The Revenge of Belial', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'Yūichi Abe, Hiroshi Mikuriya, Kômei Kondô', 'Yūichi Abe, Toshizo Nemoto', 'Mamoru Miyano, Tatsuomi Hamada, Yu Koyanagi, Tao Tsuchiya, Tamotsu Ishibashi, Yasue Sato, Kaito Nitta, Kaito Kobayashi', null, 'Ultraman Zero, the rookie Ultraman from Tsuburaya Productions’ 2009 theatrical movie returns, and getting full-fledged. However, he is confronted with the empowered Kaiser Belial, back from the evil Ultraman Belial whom he and other Ultraman warriors battled so hard on the m-78 Planet. Can Ultraman Zero live to the expectations of his legendary father Ultra Seven? Check it out in the latest Tsuburaya Productions’ action packed movie.', 'Ultraman Zero, the rookie Ultraman from Tsuburaya Productions’ 2009 theatrical movie returns, and getting full-fledged. However, he is confronted with the empowered Kaiser Belial, back from the evil Ultraman Belial whom he and other Ultraman warriors battled so hard on the m-78 Planet. Can Ultraman Zero live to the expectations of his legendary father Ultra Seven? Check it out in the latest Tsuburaya Productions’ action packed movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sm2hvflBrIt73PZP6ODrpWvfyrI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103510'),
  ('237192965292647452', 'Ultraman: The Adventure Begins', 1987, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Mitsuo Kusakabe, Ray Patterson, Kazuo Iimura', 'John Eric Seward', 'Adrienne Barbeau, Chad Everett, Michael Lembeck, Charlie Adler, Ronnie Schell, William Callaway, Stacy Keach, Sr., Lorna Patterson', null, 'The lives of three stunt pilots (Scott, Chuck, and Beth) are changed when they gain the ability to transform into three new Ultra-beings, and form the Ultra Force, to battle four giant Sorkin Monsters.', 'The lives of three stunt pilots (Scott, Chuck, and Beth) are changed when they gain the ability to transform into three new Ultra-beings, and form the Ultra Force, to battle four giant Sorkin Monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LX8yzGWZhEnOIhBdROzU0eAs0J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135305'),
  ('1104863506049277779', 'Ultraman: The Next', 2004, 'Family, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Kazuya Konaka, Shin''ichi Ôoka, Hideki Tanabiki', 'Keiichi Hasegawa', 'Tetsuya Bessho, Kyooko Tooyama, Kenya Osumi, Ryohei Hirota, Nae Yuuki, Toshiya Nagasawa, Daisuke Ryū, Masao Kusakari', null, 'First Lieutenant Shun''ichi Maki of the Japan Air Self-Defense Force is a prestigious F-15 Eagle jet pilot (or "driver" as he is called in the film). A lifelong fan of flying since he was a child, being a pilot is his ultimate dream. Unfortunately, his duties distance himself from his wife, Yoko, who always ends up being neglected, and his son, Tsugumu, who has a congenital blood disease and has a high risk of dying at a young age.Maki decides to quit the Air Force to devote more time to his family and to spend whatever is left for his son. He takes a part-time job as a commercial tour guide run by a kindly group of people who allow him time to work and to also take care of his family.', 'First Lieutenant Shun''ichi Maki of the Japan Air Self-Defense Force is a prestigious F-15 Eagle jet pilot (or "driver" as he is called in the film). A lifelong fan of flying since he was a child, being a pilot is his ultimate dream. Unfortunately, his duties distance himself from his wife, Yoko, who always ends up being neglected, and his son, Tsugumu, who has a congenital blood disease and has a high risk of dying at a young age.Maki decides to quit the Air Force to devote more time to his family and to spend whatever is left for his son. He takes a part-time job as a commercial tour guide run by a kindly group of people who allow him time to work and to also take care of his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZP3TaxNM1bxyzWhYxhrpulLXQq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29764'),
  ('487779134929867402', 'Ultramarines: A Warhammer 40,000 Movie', 2010, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Martyn Pick, Brendan McNamara, Greg Provan', 'Dan Abnett', 'Terence Stamp, John Hurt, Sean Pertwee, Steven Waddington, Donald Sumpter, Johnny Harris, Ben Bishop, Chris Finney', 'R', 'A squad of Ultramarines answer a distress call from an Imperial Shrine World. A full Company of Imperial Fists was stationed there, but there is no answer from them. The squad investigates to find out what has happened there.', 'A squad of Ultramarines answer a distress call from an Imperial Shrine World. A full Company of Imperial Fists was stationed there, but there is no answer from them. The squad investigates to find out what has happened there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFfkF9uVqOhAxIKEyNCHfRRdGgj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52010'),
  ('1102720903857730581', 'Ultras', 2020, 'Drama', 'Gianluca Palma, Giulia Emiliani, Mario Ricci', 'Peppe Fiore, Francesco Lettieri', 'Aniello Arena, Ciro Nacca, Daniele Vicorito, Salvatore Pelliccia, Antonia Truppo, Angelo Caianiello, Giuseppe Cirillo, Grimaldi Teodoro', null, 'An aging soccer fanatic faces down the reality of his past while struggling to give himself and a young follower very different futures.', 'An aging soccer fanatic faces down the reality of his past while struggling to give himself and a young follower very different futures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHqpFuguBugZZfXIyjsb4tOAXve.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:668195'),
  ('788444318124283689', 'Ultrasound', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Mystery', 'Rob Schroeder, Mathew Rudenberg', 'Conor Stechschulte', 'Vincent Kartheiser, Chelsea Lopez, Breeda Wool, Tunde Adebimpe, Rainey Qualley, Chris Gartin, Bob Stephenson', null, 'After his car breaks down, Glen spends one hell of an odd night with a married couple, setting into motion a chain of events that alter their lives plus those of several random strangers.', 'After his car breaks down, Glen spends one hell of an odd night with a married couple, setting into motion a chain of events that alter their lives plus those of several random strangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xef7fVF5vhDPQk7yQ0dJwKHIev2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821510'),
  ('758958028322622531', 'Ultraviolet', 2006, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Kurt Wimmer, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Phil Jones', 'Kurt Wimmer', 'Milla Jovovich, Cameron Bright, Nick Chinlund, Sebastien Andrieu, Ida Martin, William Fichtner, David E. Collier, Kieran O''Rorke', 'PG-13', 'In the late 21st century, a subculture of humans have emerged who have been modified genetically by a vampire-like disease, giving them enhanced speed, incredible stamina and acute intelligence. As they are set apart from "normal" and "healthy" humans, the world is pushed to the brink of worldwide civil war aimed at the destruction of the "diseased" population. In the middle of this crossed-fire is - an infected woman - Ultraviolet, who finds herself protecting a nine-year-old boy who has been marked for death by the human government as he is believed to be a threat to humans.', 'In the late 21st century, a subculture of humans have emerged who have been modified genetically by a vampire-like disease, giving them enhanced speed, incredible stamina and acute intelligence. As they are set apart from "normal" and "healthy" humans, the world is pushed to the brink of worldwide civil war aimed at the destruction of the "diseased" population. In the middle of this crossed-fire is - an infected woman - Ultraviolet, who finds herself protecting a nine-year-old boy who has been marked for death by the human government as he is believed to be a threat to humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27OzQ2BBahQHYPiPEAXRXMbhnPQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9920'),
  ('735868086125977961', 'Ulvova mylläri', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jaakko Pakkasvirta, Esa Vuorinen, Matti Penttilä', 'Jaakko Pakkasvirta, Arto Paasilinna', 'Vesa-Matti Loiri, Eija Ahvo, Yrjö Järvinen, Harri Tirkkonen, Ahti Kuoppala, Juha Muje, Olavi Ahonen, Aarre Karén', null, 'The main character is a miller, who sometimes acts strangely but is otherwise a goodhearted hardworking honest man. He sometimes keeps the villagers up all night by howling. Finally the villagers decide that the miller has to be committed into a mental hospital, where the hero does not have to spend too much time until he escapes. The miller takes to the woods near his home but there he is constantly harassed by the chief of the police with his posse.', 'The main character is a miller, who sometimes acts strangely but is otherwise a goodhearted hardworking honest man. He sometimes keeps the villagers up all night by howling. Finally the villagers decide that the miller has to be committed into a mental hospital, where the hero does not have to spend too much time until he escapes. The miller takes to the woods near his home but there he is constantly harassed by the chief of the police with his posse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6M6vJ1mOL8YI0FysNVst7HHVOOh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320293'),
  ('15429839167711472', 'Ulysse', 1986, 'Documentary', 'Agnès Varda, Pascal Rabaud, Jean-Yves Escoffier', 'Agnès Varda', 'Agnès Varda, Ulysse Llorca, Fouli Elia', 'NR', 'At the sea shore, a goat, a child, and a naked man. This is a photograph taken in 1954 by Agnès Varda. The goat was dead, the child was named Ulysses, and the man was naked. Starting from this frozen image, the film explores the real and the imaginary.', 'At the sea shore, a goat, a child, and a naked man. This is a photograph taken in 1954 by Agnès Varda. The goat was dead, the child was named Ulysses, and the man was naked. Starting from this frozen image, the film explores the real and the imaginary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tZT9I1LIdHgARZpnaMHVS57ISq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257524'),
  ('82358792764282255', 'Ulysse & Mona', 2018, 'Drama', 'Sébastien Betbeder, Romain Le Bonniec', 'Sébastien Betbeder', 'Manal Issa, Éric Cantona, Quentin Dolmaire, Marie Vialle, Micha Lescot, Jean-Luc Vincent, Sofian Khammes, Jonathan Capdevielle', null, 'Ulysses, a secluded artist who mysteriously retired a few years ago, meets Mona, a young art student full of life. The encounter will change them both.', 'Ulysses, a secluded artist who mysteriously retired a few years ago, meets Mona, a young art student full of life. The encounter will change them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xf1ZpeJAGaCAibkC8PriPd50eI9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542424'),
  ('173570585214478', 'Ulysses', 1954, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Mario Camerini, Guidarino Guidi, Otto Pellegrini', 'Mario Camerini, Ivo Perilli, Ennio De Concini', 'Kirk Douglas, Silvana Mangano, Anthony Quinn, Rossana Podestà, Jacques Dumesnil, Daniel Ivernel, Sylvie, Franco Interlenghi', null, 'A movie adaptation of Homer''s second epic, that talks about Ulysses'' efforts to return to his home after the end of ten years of war.', 'A movie adaptation of Homer''s second epic, that talks about Ulysses'' efforts to return to his home after the end of ten years of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HwrZ6SVRcUiPWSx3ecc7DFqey0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43194'),
  ('958184444915626488', 'Ulysses', 1967, 'Drama', 'Joseph Strick, Wolfgang Suschitzky, Ariel Levy', 'Fred Haines, Joseph Strick', 'Milo O''Shea, Barbara Jefford, Maurice Roëves, T. P. McKenna, Anna Manahan, Chris Curran, Fionnula Flanagan, Geoffrey Golden', null, 'Dublin; June 16, 1904. Stephen Dedalus, who fancies himself as a poet, embarks on a day of wandering about the city during which he finds friendship and a father figure in Leopold Bloom, a middle-aged Jew. Meanwhile, Bloom''s day, illuminated by a funeral and an evening of drinking and revelry that stirs paternal feelings toward Stephen, ends with a rapprochement with Molly, his earthy wife.', 'Dublin; June 16, 1904. Stephen Dedalus, who fancies himself as a poet, embarks on a day of wandering about the city during which he finds friendship and a father figure in Leopold Bloom, a middle-aged Jew. Meanwhile, Bloom''s day, illuminated by a funeral and an evening of drinking and revelry that stirs paternal feelings toward Stephen, ends with a rapprochement with Molly, his earthy wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x74xBYJEjJIW9xlapEjt8CdrqNt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119183'),
  ('842494248880963566', 'Ulysses and the Giant Polyphemus', 1905, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'An early horror treatment of the hero''s encounter with the one-eyed man-eating Cyclops.', 'An early horror treatment of the hero''s encounter with the one-eyed man-eating Cyclops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBEBw7NPKw7I7yw68H8eKhBfvLF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196286'),
  ('469983177541870291', 'Ulysses'' Gaze', 1995, 'Drama, History, War', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Alexandros Lambridis, Dinko Tucaković', 'Tonino Guerra, Petros Markaris, Giorgio Silvagni', 'Harvey Keitel, Erland Josephson, Maia Morgenstern, Thanasis Veggos, Giorgos Mihalakopoulos, Dora Volanaki, Mania Papadimitriou, Giorgos Konstas', null, 'An exiled filmmaker finally returns to his home country where former mysteries and afflictions of his early life come back to haunt him once more.', 'An exiled filmmaker finally returns to his home country where former mysteries and afflictions of his early life come back to haunt him once more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmRdjyd5nVBd06FzJT8xoTS43ct.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22549'),
  ('1142919520361600212', 'Ulzana', 1974, 'Western, Adventure', 'Gottfried Kolditz', 'Gottfried Kolditz, Gojko Mitić', 'Gojko Mitić, Renate Blume, Rolf Hoppe, Colea Răutu, Paul Berndt, Amza Pellea, Fred Delmare, Alfred Struwe', null, 'This rather unconventional Western movie is set in the middle of the 19th century in Arizona. The film portrays an Indian tribe, the Mimbreno Appacheans, who are celebrating their Thanksgiving, building an irrigation plant, carrying on commerce, and trying to settle down in a rather constricted territory. But the confrontation with the white Americans changes their situation as the mercantile "gentlemen" want to prevent the Indian tribe to become independent from the white men′s business practices. Thus, they destroy the irrigation plant and chase the Indian tribe in an inhospitable territory where they cannot survive. Led by their chief Ulzana, the Appacheans thus start a bitter fight to preserve their habitat.', 'This rather unconventional Western movie is set in the middle of the 19th century in Arizona. The film portrays an Indian tribe, the Mimbreno Appacheans, who are celebrating their Thanksgiving, building an irrigation plant, carrying on commerce, and trying to settle down in a rather constricted territory. But the confrontation with the white Americans changes their situation as the mercantile "gentlemen" want to prevent the Indian tribe to become independent from the white men′s business practices. Thus, they destroy the irrigation plant and chase the Indian tribe in an inhospitable territory where they cannot survive. Led by their chief Ulzana, the Appacheans thus start a bitter fight to preserve their habitat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIDaYIxxJq87EJRUQUJcQQW0yqR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197401'),
  ('479997420523761490', 'Ulzana''s Raid', 1972, 'Western', 'Robert Aldrich, Joseph F. Biroc, Malcolm R. Harding', 'Alan Sharp', 'Burt Lancaster, Bruce Davison, Jorge Luke, Richard Jaeckel, Joaquín Martínez, Lloyd Bochner, Karl Swenson, Douglass Watson', 'R', 'After fierce war chief Ulzana and a small war party jump the reservation bent on murder and terror, an inexperienced young lieutenant is assigned to track him down.', 'After fierce war chief Ulzana and a small war party jump the reservation bent on murder and terror, an inexperienced young lieutenant is assigned to track him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mftnQcqDDFEIOLc8M4rA626MaEC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42491'),
  ('971983231934849913', 'Ulzhan', 2007, 'Drama', 'Volker Schlöndorff, Tom Fährmann', 'Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Philippe Torreton, Ayanat Ksenbai, David Bennent, Maximilien Muller, Olga Landina, Serguey Urimtchev, Andrei Passagenikov, Zhaina Abdieva', null, 'Somewhere in the endless steppes of Central Asia lies a treasure. Frenchman Charles holds the key, a fragment of an ancient map. But in his restless quest, Charles seeks neither fame nor glory, but for a way to heal his wounded soul. He''s looking for love. Ulzhan felt it the first time she laid eyes on him.', 'Somewhere in the endless steppes of Central Asia lies a treasure. Frenchman Charles holds the key, a fragment of an ancient map. But in his restless quest, Charles seeks neither fame nor glory, but for a way to heal his wounded soul. He''s looking for love. Ulzhan felt it the first time she laid eyes on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kH62yrD0l8Br8zns4yz8tkeQAor.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68453'),
  ('390427706684142987', 'Um 8 Uhr kommen die Schweine wieder', 1959, null, 'Hansjürgen Pohland', null, null, null, 'A short film from Hans Jürgen Pohland.', 'A short film from Hans Jürgen Pohland.', null, 'tmdb:movie:234764'),
  ('285313057560857388', 'Um Corpo Inconveniente', 2026, 'Short, Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Icles Rodrigues', 'Icles Rodrigues', 'Mônica Moraes, Luanna Jales, PH Santos, Laura Marise, Cristiano Botafogo', null, 'Um Corpo Inconveniente (2026) released on March 11, 2026 starring Icles Rodrigues, Matheus Gomes Coelho, Mônica Moraes and directed by Icles Rodrigues. Get notified when Um Corpo Inconveniente is available to stream!', 'Um Corpo Inconveniente (2026) released on March 11, 2026 starring Icles Rodrigues, Matheus Gomes Coelho, Mônica Moraes and directed by Icles Rodrigues. Get notified when Um Corpo Inconveniente is available to stream!', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FoGMAEO9aTTRml3dMuolSoJU3xSr.jpg', 'plex:movie:um-corpo-inconveniente'),
  ('138239144628870910', 'Um Dia Extraordinário', 2026, 'Drama', 'Cíntia Domit Bittar, Leonardo Gatti, Stefano Lopes', 'Cíntia Domit Bittar, Maria Augusta V. Nunes', 'Alana Bortolini, Margarida Baird, Paula Braun, Valdir Grillo, Sarah Motta', null, 'A small-scale farmer, the only daughter caring for her aging mother and the family land, has her quiet life upended when a mysterious crop circle appears in her field. The phenomenon brings her estranged sister and brother back into her world, forcing them to confront the emotional distance that has grown between them.', 'A small-scale farmer, the only daughter caring for her aging mother and the family land, has her quiet life upended when a mysterious crop circle appears in her field. The phenomenon brings her estranged sister and brother back into her world, forcing them to confront the emotional distance that has grown between them.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FAuRamBsUf8AqRzHmWMjb2jg5vVZ.jpg', 'plex:movie:um-dia-extraordinario-2026'),
  ('829178315851576626', 'Um Show de Verão', 2004, 'Romance', 'Moacyr Góes, Cris D''amato, Hsu Chien', 'Flávio de Souza', 'Angélica, Luciano Huck, Thiago Fragoso, Ingrid Guimarães, Tonico Pereira, Márcia Cabrita, José Mojica Marins, Tony Tornado', null, 'Andréa, a poor telemarketing salesgirl, dreams of being a singer. Her rich boyfriend Fred hires a musical producer, Marcelo, to turn her into a star. But she and Marcelo end up falling in love.', 'Andréa, a poor telemarketing salesgirl, dreams of being a singer. Her rich boyfriend Fred hires a musical producer, Marcelo, to turn her into a star. But she and Marcelo end up falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KTTx8ooFqozHYDk25ZTo63krih.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240069'),
  ('954555961936917793', 'Um Suburbano Sortudo', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Marina Watson-Wood, Roberto Santucci, Cacala Carvana', 'Paulo Cursino, Rodrigo Sant''anna, L.G. Bayão', 'Rodrigo Sant''anna, Carol Castro, Stepan Nercessian, Victor Leal, Guida Vianna, Cláudia Alencar, Cinnara Leal, Fábio Rabin', null, 'Street vendor Denilson''s life changes when his father dies and leaves him his entire legacy. Along with the fortune, however, Denilson also inherits the family that will do everything to get their hands on this inheritance.', 'Street vendor Denilson''s life changes when his father dies and leaves him his entire legacy. Along with the fortune, however, Denilson also inherits the family that will do everything to get their hands on this inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tTCqf8xjgnoiYEOi62bIDHC5zr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379284'),
  ('1000600398627504760', 'Um Tio Quase Perfeito', 2017, 'Comedy, Family', 'Pedro Antônio, Julio Costantini', 'Leandro Muniz, Rodrigo Goulart, Sabrina Garcia', 'Marcus Majella, Ana Lúcia Torre, Letícia Isnard, Júlia Svacinna, João Barreto, Sofia Barros, Eduardo Galvão, Osvaldo Mil', null, 'After receiving a job promotion that forces her to spend time traveling, Angela decides to leave her three children under the care of Uncle Tony - which will lead to many confusions.', 'After receiving a job promotion that forces her to spend time traveling, Angela decides to leave her three children under the care of Uncle Tony - which will lead to many confusions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxBG1DIwfnNTzq6BIHIkWIXdR4t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448949'),
  ('637341591873036203', 'Um Tio Quase Perfeito 2', 2021, 'Comedy, Family', 'Carolina Durão, Rodrigo Graciosa, Samantha Queiroz', 'Leandro Muniz, Pedro Antônio, Rodrigo Goulart', 'Marcus Majella, João Barreto, Sofia Barros, Júlia Svacinna, Ana Lúcia Torre, Letícia Isnard, Danton Mello, Fhelipe Gomes', null, 'Everything is going well in the relationship between Tony and his nephews until his sister''s new suitor appears and becomes the trio''s new favorite, making Tony jealous.', 'Everything is going well in the relationship between Tony and his nephews until his sister''s new suitor appears and becomes the trio''s new favorite, making Tony jealous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tsMon5xC1pJI8dbJ2NpWCq3CnC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784117'),
  ('690536152036507026', 'Uma Fada Veio Me Visitar', 2023, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Leo Vascocellos, Arthur Chamon, Vivianne Jundi', 'Thalita Rebouças, Patrícia Andrade, Thalita Rebouças', 'Xuxa Meneghel, Tontom Périssé, Zezeh Barbosa, Dani Calabresa, Lívia Inhudes, Thalita Rebouças, Fernanda de Freitas, Tatsu Carvalho', null, 'Luna was worried about her future. The days weren''t being easy for this girl, but she couldn''t imagine what awaited her that night was interrupted by the unusual visit of a lively little fairy. With a lot of effort, a few doses of magic, the friendly Armadillo wins Luna''s trust. And a world of incredible discoveries begins.', 'Luna was worried about her future. The days weren''t being easy for this girl, but she couldn''t imagine what awaited her that night was interrupted by the unusual visit of a lively little fairy. With a lot of effort, a few doses of magic, the friendly Armadillo wins Luna''s trust. And a world of incredible discoveries begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atxRkJD5gvBDl8m02UZtoA6jwNr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1046813'),
  ('212982244907900307', 'Uma Quase Dupla', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Marcus Baldini, Leonardo Rocha, Tiago Marinho', 'Ana Reber', 'Tatá Werneck, Cauã Reymond, Louise Cardoso, Ary França, Alejandro Claveaux, Daniel Furlan, Augusto Madeira, Luciana Paes', null, 'Keyla the police officer and the unprepared detective Claudio could not be more incompatible. However they are forced to form a duo to solve the series of mysterious murders that are happening in the quiet city of Joinlândia.', 'Keyla the police officer and the unprepared detective Claudio could not be more incompatible. However they are forced to form a duo to solve the series of mysterious murders that are happening in the quiet city of Joinlândia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRAOj1G4YWEmK3zDN4JlYFqaeWA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488689'),
  ('589196715520857367', 'Umami', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Denis Louis, Slony Sow', 'Slony Sow', 'Gérard Depardieu, Sandrine Bonnaire, Kyōzō Nagatsuka, Rod Paradot, Bastien Bouillon, Eriko Takeda, Sumire, Akira Emoto', null, 'Following a near-death experience France''s leading chef throws himself into a quest seeking the flavor that has confounded his life since he was defeated by a Japanese chef''s bowl of noodles as a young man.', 'Following a near-death experience France''s leading chef throws himself into a quest seeking the flavor that has confounded his life since he was defeated by a Japanese chef''s bowl of noodles as a young man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gVRCyUKEXuN6jmoUqS11HwzZ9r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788030'),
  ('221670511833920824', 'Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Beginning of a New Era', 2024, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jun Yamazaki, Ken Yamamoto, Shuto Yamamoto', 'Tetsuya Kobari', 'Yuri Fujimoto, Sumire Uesaka, Yui Ogura, Haruna Fukushima, Sora Tokui, Eriko Matsui, Kanna Nakamura, Misaki Watada', null, 'Jungle Pocket, an Umamusume who has been racing tirelessly in pursuit of becoming the greatest, is ready to take on the once-in-a-lifetime Classic Triple Crown series. However, standing in her way are rivals from the same generation, whose talent may even surpass her own.', 'Jungle Pocket, an Umamusume who has been racing tirelessly in pursuit of becoming the greatest, is ready to take on the once-in-a-lifetime Classic Triple Crown series. However, standing in her way are rivals from the same generation, whose talent may even surpass her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4SM2hP63vMaPuAox6UuwVybHo4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1223178'),
  ('218983417888403965', 'Uman – The Perfect Man', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Gilles Porte, Clément Comet, Maëlle Le Coadic', 'Xavier Durringer, Karen Alyanakian, Miller Duvall', 'Didier Bourdon, Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Valérie Karsenti, Frédérique Bel, Philippe Duquesne, Sylvain Charbonneau, Martin Gillis, Juliette Gillis', null, 'Florence, a lawyer overwhelmed by her family life, decides to buy a humanoid robot with a perfect physique. The robot meets all her expectations: maintain the house, take care of the children, and more... By maliciously disrupting their daily routine, the robot also arouses the jealousy of her self-centered careless husband, Franck, a second-class actor who suddenly realizes he must make some efforts not to lose the love of his wife.', 'Florence, a lawyer overwhelmed by her family life, decides to buy a humanoid robot with a perfect physique. The robot meets all her expectations: maintain the house, take care of the children, and more... By maliciously disrupting their daily routine, the robot also arouses the jealousy of her self-centered careless husband, Franck, a second-class actor who suddenly realizes he must make some efforts not to lose the love of his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXwULXlRrj3B0uYGcMN1lAUGARx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785200'),
  ('917141113225383961', 'Umberto Eco: A Library of the World', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Andrea Zanoli, Davide Ferrario, Andrea Zambelli', 'Davide Ferrario', 'Giuseppe Cederna, Niccolò Ferrero, Paolo Giangrasso, Walter Leonardi, Zoe Tavarelli, Mariella Valentini, Umberto Eco', null, 'A walk through the immense private library of Italian writer and thinker Umberto Eco (1932-2016).', 'A walk through the immense private library of Italian writer and thinker Umberto Eco (1932-2016).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihppTZaY5FggAggn3IvmSjzawMM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1089512'),
  ('281857171790951722', 'Umbracle', 1972, 'Documentary', 'Pere Portabella', 'Pere Portabella, Joan Brossa', 'Christopher Lee, Jeannine Mestre, Miguel Bilbatúa, Román Gubern, Joan Enric Lahosa, Joan Miró', null, 'This film turns on two basic axes: the inquiry into ways of cinematographic representation and a critical image of official Spain at the time of the Franco dictatorship. “Montage of attractions” and Brechtianism in strong doses. Umbracle is made up of fragments (some are archive footage) that resound rather than progress by unusual links, with dejá vu scenes that promise us more but remain tensely unfinished. Jonathan Rosembaun said: “few directors since Resnais have played so ruthlessly with the unconscious narrative expectations to bug us”. Learning from the feeling of strangeness caused by Rossellini as he threw well known actors into savage scenery in southern Europe. Portabella makes Christopher Lee wander around a dream-like Barcelona. Without a doubt Portabella’s most structurally complex and most profoundly political film, that is ferociously poetic.', 'This film turns on two basic axes: the inquiry into ways of cinematographic representation and a critical image of official Spain at the time of the Franco dictatorship. “Montage of attractions” and Brechtianism in strong doses. Umbracle is made up of fragments (some are archive footage) that resound rather than progress by unusual links, with dejá vu scenes that promise us more but remain tensely unfinished. Jonathan Rosembaun said: “few directors since Resnais have played so ruthlessly with the unconscious narrative expectations to bug us”. Learning from the feeling of strangeness caused by Rossellini as he threw well known actors into savage scenery in southern Europe. Portabella makes Christopher Lee wander around a dream-like Barcelona. Without a doubt Portabella’s most structurally complex and most profoundly political film, that is ferociously poetic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMAl2Rxz0k77Idn7dBFWis30GAY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137619'),
  ('816696779389436794', 'Umbrella', 1967, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Drama, Romance', 'Mikheil Kobakhidze, Nikoloz Sukhishvili', 'Mikheil Kobakhidze', 'Gia Avalishvili, Jana Petraitite, Ramaz Giorgobiani, Baadur Tsuladze', null, 'A railway controller and his sweetheart live in peace next to the railway tracks. Out of nowhere, an umbrella flies into their life.', 'A railway controller and his sweetheart live in peace next to the railway tracks. Out of nowhere, an umbrella flies into their life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wNMeSpd1Jg588KJsjTeYGOvkWY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385647'),
  ('1062795906570855001', 'Umbrella', 2020, 'Animation, Drama', 'Alan Prado, Mario Pece, Helena Hilario', 'Helena Hilario, Mario Pece', null, null, 'While visiting a home for children, a little girl meets Joseph, a boy whose only dream is to have a yellow umbrella. This unexpected encounter awakens his memories of the past.', 'While visiting a home for children, a little girl meets Joseph, a boy whose only dream is to have a yellow umbrella. This unexpected encounter awakens his memories of the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cB7ezflIP0ZZtylLNHfp2EBj3Yc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746274'),
  ('33987906156383088', 'Umbrella Coup', 1980, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Gérard Oury, Henri Decaë', 'Danièle Thompson, Gérard Oury', 'Pierre Richard, Valérie Mairesse, Christine Murillo, Gérard Jugnot, Gordon Mitchell, Roger Carel, Gert Fröbe, Maurice Risch', null, 'Grégoire Lecomte, the unlucky actor anxious to find a "real job", goes to take a screen test for a role of a killer, but gets to mafiosi by mistake. He takes their don for a producer, and they mistake him for a hitman with whom they had an appointment. Deluded Lecomte signs contract with them. He is supposed to kill gun dealer Otto Krampe at his birthday party in Saint-Tropez by piercing him with a cap of the umbrella with a built-in syringe with potassium cyanide. Lecomte is not aware that it has to be a real murder.', 'Grégoire Lecomte, the unlucky actor anxious to find a "real job", goes to take a screen test for a role of a killer, but gets to mafiosi by mistake. He takes their don for a producer, and they mistake him for a hitman with whom they had an appointment. Deluded Lecomte signs contract with them. He is supposed to kill gun dealer Otto Krampe at his birthday party in Saint-Tropez by piercing him with a cap of the umbrella with a built-in syringe with potassium cyanide. Lecomte is not aware that it has to be a real murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3f7UNkeynETv3Pzvy5IQDEkSVQC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60194'),
  ('472653695617554345', 'Umjolo: The Gone Girl', 2024, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Fikile Mogodi, Tiyane Nyembe', 'Thuli Zuma', 'Shezi Sibongiseni, Tyson Mathonsi, Thobeka Shangase, Gugu Gumede, Ntando Menzi Mncube, Nirvana Mokwe, Nkansiyo Makhanya, Baby Cele', 'R', 'A couple''s seemingly perfect relationship falters when one of them learns about the other''s infidelity — but who said that relationships were easy?', 'A couple''s seemingly perfect relationship falters when one of them learns about the other''s infidelity — but who said that relationships were easy?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3h6SyezeKyT7VpEHyLqckbBZuoM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1371540'),
