  ('726486168819220611', 'Un novio para dos hermanas', 1967, 'Comedy, Music', 'Luis César Amadori', 'Roberto Gómez Bolaños, Jesús María de Arozamena, Luis César Amadori', 'Pilar Bayona, Aurora Bayona, Joaquín Cordero, Ángel Garasa, Fernando Luján, Sara García, Carlos Riquelme, Mónica Serna', null, 'Pili and uncle Angel travel to Mexico to see Mili dancing at her debut in a theater in the capital. When Mili finds out the bad economic situation of her uncle, she decides to seek work. Meanwhile, Pili works in a department store and meets Rodolfo, the grandson of Mrs. Caceres, owner of the store, which she takes for the chauffeur of the lady. In turn, Ms. Caceres hires Mili to dance at her party, where she meets and falls for Rodolfo. Rodolfo, who does not know of the existence of a twin sister, is convinced that the girl in the party is Pili. And the sisters do not know they are in love with the same man, which will lead to an unexpected conflict.', 'Pili and uncle Angel travel to Mexico to see Mili dancing at her debut in a theater in the capital. When Mili finds out the bad economic situation of her uncle, she decides to seek work. Meanwhile, Pili works in a department store and meets Rodolfo, the grandson of Mrs. Caceres, owner of the store, which she takes for the chauffeur of the lady. In turn, Ms. Caceres hires Mili to dance at her party, where she meets and falls for Rodolfo. Rodolfo, who does not know of the existence of a twin sister, is convinced that the girl in the party is Pili. And the sisters do not know they are in love with the same man, which will lead to an unexpected conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zK033Ihlh5xbGfLqSa99ZSLqukf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115694'),
  ('128259699139033238', 'Un novio para mi mujer', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Laura Mañá, Albert Espel, Falele Ygueravide', 'Laura Mañá, Pol Cortecans', 'Belén Cuesta, Hugo Silva, Diego Martín, Joaquín Reyes, Eric Masip, Ángela Cervantes, Andreu Castro, Laura Minguell', null, 'Diego wants to separate from his wife, Lucía, but he doesn''t know how to tell her. He is fed up with her neuroses and constant complaints about him, and he has long since lost the spark that made him fall in love. Unable to say it to her face, he turns to Cuervo Flores, a famous seducer "from before", who will try to make Lucía fall in love so that she will be the one to end her marriage.', 'Diego wants to separate from his wife, Lucía, but he doesn''t know how to tell her. He is fed up with her neuroses and constant complaints about him, and he has long since lost the spark that made him fall in love. Unable to say it to her face, he turns to Cuervo Flores, a famous seducer "from before", who will try to make Lucía fall in love so that she will be the one to end her marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbgXT9glk2O0ELr5JPTikRJtt9Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:932339'),
