  ('800152931114237525', 'Un petit miracle', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Sophie Boudre, David Quesemand, Mathieu Schiffman', 'Sophie Boudre, Sarah Kaminsky, Julie Manoukian', 'Alice Pol, Jonathan Zaccaï, Eddy Mitchell, Grégory Di Meglio, Émilie Gavois-Kahn, Fabrice Adde, Michel Crémadès, Anne-Marie Ponsot', null, 'Nothing goes well for Juliette! The school where she used to teach has burned down, and her unique class will have to be dispatched to the four corners of the department. To avoid this, she proposes a surprising solution: to install her class at the Poppies, the local old people''s home, the only place that can accommodate them for the time of the work. For the children as well as for the residents, the cohabitation will not be easy, but will transform them forever. Inspired by a true story.', 'Nothing goes well for Juliette! The school where she used to teach has burned down, and her unique class will have to be dispatched to the four corners of the department. To avoid this, she proposes a surprising solution: to install her class at the Poppies, the local old people''s home, the only place that can accommodate them for the time of the work. For the children as well as for the residents, the cohabitation will not be easy, but will transform them forever. Inspired by a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htSAdE5h2owQTcu8yMQO6V4qYwI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964898'),
  ('895481396378894210', 'Un posto sicuro', 2015, 'Drama', 'Guido Michelotti, Francesco Ghiaccio', 'Francesco Ghiaccio, Marco D''Amore', 'Marco D''Amore, Matilde Gioli, Giorgio Colangeli', null, 'Casale Monferrato, 2011. The town is excited because of the impending verdict of the trial against Eternit, the factory which produced asbestos: the company''s managers are in the dock, responding to the harmful effects which have been proved with thousand of deaths. One of the employees who got sick for asbestos is Eduardo: he has been working in the plant for a life and now he is gravely ill. He has little time to repair the relationship with his son Luca, ruined during the past years. And Luca, also thanks to the love for his girlfriend Raffaella, is ready to reconcile.', 'Casale Monferrato, 2011. The town is excited because of the impending verdict of the trial against Eternit, the factory which produced asbestos: the company''s managers are in the dock, responding to the harmful effects which have been proved with thousand of deaths. One of the employees who got sick for asbestos is Eduardo: he has been working in the plant for a life and now he is gravely ill. He has little time to repair the relationship with his son Luca, ruined during the past years. And Luca, also thanks to the love for his girlfriend Raffaella, is ready to reconcile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2Z575edqny67vfOShTFFzARG1v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370982'),
