  ('860792135971115021', 'Un''altra vita', 1992, 'Drama', 'Alessandro Pesci, Carlo Mazzacurati', 'Carlo Mazzacurati, Franco Bernini', 'Silvio Orlando, Adrianna Biedrzyńska, Monica Scattini, Antonella Ponziani, Antonello Fassari, Giorgio Tirabassi, Pasquale Anselmo, Valentina Lainati', null, 'Saverio, a dentist, comes out as naive as usual while he falls in love with Alia, a Russian immigrant he met in Rome. He must now deal with issues a guy like him would never have thought to come across.', 'Saverio, a dentist, comes out as naive as usual while he falls in love with Alia, a Russian immigrant he met in Rome. He must now deal with issues a guy like him would never have thought to come across.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhzW97bdgqYLdgF6Fnlb7bvjW7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261024'),
