  ('863669548870965872', 'Unauthorized Love', 2026, 'Thriller', 'Delinda Kay', 'Delinda Kay', 'Joseline Thomas, Izaiah Wimbush, Sherman Howard, Cynthia Velasquez, Chris "Boogie" Falcon', 'PG-13', 'A grieving woman finds a second chance at love with a charming stranger, only to realize she hasn''t been rescued, she''s been targeted. We''ve all heard that "love comes when you least expect it." For her its when she''s vulnerable.', 'A grieving woman finds a second chance at love with a charming stranger, only to realize she hasn''t been rescued, she''s been targeted. We''ve all heard that "love comes when you least expect it." For her its when she''s vulnerable.', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:unauthorized-love'),
  ('732301351650073498', 'Unbeatable', 2013, 'Drama, Action', 'Dante Lam Chiu-Yin, Kenny Tse Chung-To, Lei Zhao', 'Nick Cheuk Yik-Him, He Liang-Yu', 'Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, Mei Ting, Wang Baoqiang, Andy On Chi-Kit, Jack Kao, Philip Keung Ho-Man, Crystal Lee', null, 'Fai, once a world champion in boxing, escapes to Macau from the loan sharks and unexpectedly encounters Qi, a young chap who is determined to win a boxing match. Fai becomes Qi''s mentor and rediscovers his passion to fight not only in the ring but for his life and the cares.', 'Fai, once a world champion in boxing, escapes to Macau from the loan sharks and unexpectedly encounters Qi, a young chap who is determined to win a boxing match. Fai becomes Qi''s mentor and rediscovers his passion to fight not only in the ring but for his life and the cares.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oH1RCNz7EPXVJeNwVULCKdrqDrD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213015'),
  ('345742375330682130', 'Unbelievable Adventures of Italians in Russia', 1974, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Gábor Pogány, Mikhail Bits', 'Emil Braginskiy, Pipolo, Castellano', 'Andrey Mironov, Ninetto Davoli, Antonia Santilli, Alighiero Noschese, Tano Cimarosa, Evgeniy Evstigneev, Gigi Ballista, Olga Aroseva', null, 'In Italy, a dying woman tells her granddaughter that she hid her treasure many years ago in Russia, in the city of Leningrad. As more people learn about it, they head to Leningrad to find the lion where it is rumoured to be buried.', 'In Italy, a dying woman tells her granddaughter that she hid her treasure many years ago in Russia, in the city of Leningrad. As more people learn about it, they head to Leningrad to find the lion where it is rumoured to be buried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51iIpaPeoVj8yCo92GpWzUnPIiM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57778'),
  ('570729060775955638', 'Unborn But Forgotten', 2002, 'Horror', 'Lim Chang-jae', 'Han Hyeon-geun', 'Lee Eun-ju, Jung Jun-ho, Lee So-yeon, Lee Kan-hee', null, 'A website is seemingly killing every woman who views it within fifteen days. While investigating the phenomenon, a female reporter begins an investigation that leads to the discovery of the site known only as The White Room.', 'A website is seemingly killing every woman who views it within fifteen days. While investigating the phenomenon, a female reporter begins an investigation that leads to the discovery of the site known only as The White Room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZBseclQi4SZLb4n0eZjfxZEOK0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71480'),
  ('349420510309520837', 'Unbowed', 2011, 'Drama, Crime', 'Chung Ji-young, Kim Hyung-koo, Jung Young-min', 'Chung Ji-young, Han Hyeon-geun', 'Ahn Sung-ki, Park Won-sang, Na Young-hee, Kim Ji-ho, Moon Sung-keun, Lee Kyung-young, Kim Eung-soo, Jin Kyung', null, 'Inspired by the true story of Kim Kyung-ho, a math professor who was arrested for shooting a crossbow at the presiding judge of his appeal against unfair dismissal.', 'Inspired by the true story of Kim Kyung-ho, a math professor who was arrested for shooting a crossbow at the presiding judge of his appeal against unfair dismissal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XL5p5XNin3JHGh0iBzYWDvjXvc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116323'),
  ('85861334472856302', 'Unbreakable', 2000, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Eduardo Serra, M. Night Shyamalan, James C. Feng', 'M. Night Shyamalan', 'Bruce Willis, Samuel L. Jackson, Robin Wright, Spencer Treat Clark, Charlayne Woodard, Eamonn Walker, Leslie Stefanson, Johnny Hiram Jamison', 'PG-13', 'An ordinary man makes an extraordinary discovery when a train accident leaves his fellow passengers dead — and him unscathed. The answer to this mystery could lie with the mysterious Elijah Price, a man who suffers from a disease that renders his bones as fragile as glass.', 'An ordinary man makes an extraordinary discovery when a train accident leaves his fellow passengers dead — and him unscathed. The answer to this mystery could lie with the mysterious Elijah Price, a man who suffers from a disease that renders his bones as fragile as glass.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLuehrGLiK5zFCyRmDDOH6gbfPf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9741'),
  ('366098055846527455', 'Unbreakable Kimmy Schmidt: Kimmy vs. the Reverend', 2020, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'John Inwood, Claire Scanlon, Soren Miltich', 'Robert Carlock, Tina Fey, Sam Means', 'Ellie Kemper, Jane Krakowski, Tituss Burgess, Carol Kane, Daniel Radcliffe, Jon Hamm, Lauren Adams, Sara Chase', 'PG-13', 'It''s an interactive Kimmy special! Kimmy''s getting married, but first she has to foil the Reverend''s evil plot. It''s your move: What should she do next?', 'It''s an interactive Kimmy special! Kimmy''s getting married, but first she has to foil the Reverend''s evil plot. It''s your move: What should she do next?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lOYicrgvA6982iVUpD9860qf7X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:683287'),
  ('144951189363171512', 'Unbridled', 2018, 'Thriller', 'Jota Linares, Junior Díaz', 'Jota Linares', 'Natalia de Molina, Daniel Grao, Natalia Mateo, Ignacio Mateos, Borja Luna, Mario Tardón, Mariana Cordero, Adrián Fonseca', null, 'Desperate to keep her husband’s secret, a devoted politician’s wife struggles to stave off threats that could ruin their promising new life.', 'Desperate to keep her husband’s secret, a devoted politician’s wife struggles to stave off threats that could ruin their promising new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPBIRjrPdyqXQHG33nSQxgQMmER.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517327'),
  ('130437661327920391', 'Unbroken', 2014, 'Drama, War', 'Angelina Jolie, Roger Deakins, Charlie Revai', 'Ethan Coen, Richard LaGravenese, Joel Coen', 'Jack O''Connell, Alex Russell, Domhnall Gleeson, Garrett Hedlund, MIYAVI, Finn Wittrock, Jai Courtney, Maddalena Ischiale', 'PG-13', 'A chronicle of the life of Louis Zamperini, an Olympic runner who was taken prisoner by Japanese forces during World War II.', 'A chronicle of the life of Louis Zamperini, an Olympic runner who was taken prisoner by Japanese forces during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAlHUjHwLWMV5mg4epGR9WSIfiy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227306'),
  ('472322142240989532', 'Unbroken: Path to Redemption', 2018, 'Drama', 'Harold Cronk, Zoran Popović', 'Richard Friedenberg, Ken Hixon', 'Samuel Hunt, Merritt Patterson, Bob Gunton, Will Graham, David Sakurai, Vanessa Bell Calloway, Bobby Campo, Andrew Lewis Caldwell', 'PG-13', 'Zamperini returns to California where he wound up marrying Cynthia Applewhite while wrestling with untreated PTSD, suffering constant nightmares, angry, bitter and deeply depressed, his wife convinces Zamperini to attend the 1949 Billy Graham Crusade.', 'Zamperini returns to California where he wound up marrying Cynthia Applewhite while wrestling with untreated PTSD, suffering constant nightmares, angry, bitter and deeply depressed, his wife convinces Zamperini to attend the 1949 Billy Graham Crusade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oD5RxDJGdJgpX8X61QMX0qNyYYu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506680'),
  ('732985706773489249', 'Uncanny', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Matthew Leutwyler, Ross Richardson, Thomas Burke', 'Shahin Chandrasoma', 'Mark Webber, Lucy Griffiths, David Clayton Rogers, Rainn Wilson', null, 'For ten years, inventor David Kressen has lived in seclusion with his inventions, including Adam, a robot with incredible lifelike human qualities. When reporter Joy Andrews is given access to their unconventional facility, she is alternately repelled and attracted to the scientist and his creation. But as Adam exhibits emergent behavior of anger and jealousy towards her, she finds herself increasingly entangled in a web of deception where no one’s motives are easily decipherable.', 'For ten years, inventor David Kressen has lived in seclusion with his inventions, including Adam, a robot with incredible lifelike human qualities. When reporter Joy Andrews is given access to their unconventional facility, she is alternately repelled and attracted to the scientist and his creation. But as Adam exhibits emergent behavior of anger and jealousy towards her, she finds herself increasingly entangled in a web of deception where no one’s motives are easily decipherable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9bUDD6uT3Fhs8L34nfMj18uqcR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137333'),
  ('956179212721919596', 'Uncanny Annie', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'James Kniest, Paul Davis', 'Alan Bachelor, James Bachelor', 'Adelaide Kane, Georgie Flores, Paige McGhee, Jacques Colimon, Dylan Arnold, Evan Bittencourt, Karlisha Hurley, Avery Bagenstos', 'NR', 'On Halloween night a group of college students get trapped in a mysterious board game that brings their darkest secrets and fears to life, where they must play to escape…and win to survive.', 'On Halloween night a group of college students get trapped in a mysterious board game that brings their darkest secrets and fears to life, where they must play to escape…and win to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofJTmVJb3Wz55xkkGeEcIYWQlgS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:634336'),
  ('422728986100827252', 'Uncertain Glory', 1944, 'War, Drama, Thriller, Crime, Romance', 'Raoul Walsh, Leo F. Forbstein, Sidney Hickox', 'Max Brand, László Vadnay', 'Errol Flynn, Paul Lukas, Jean Sullivan, Lucile Watson, Dennis Hoey, Albert Van Antwerp, Wallis Clark, Victor Kilian', 'NR', 'In occupied France, a convicted thief and murderer escapes the guillotine when a bombing raid strikes the prison, but is quickly re-captured by the inspector of the Surete responsible for his original arrest. Fearing the guillotine more than his actual death, the convict inveigles the inspector to help him with a plan to rescue 100 Frenchmen taken by the Gestapo following an act of sabotage: he will confess to being the saboteur and allow himself to be executed by firing squad, the Gestapo''s method of execution, thus freeing the 100 men.', 'In occupied France, a convicted thief and murderer escapes the guillotine when a bombing raid strikes the prison, but is quickly re-captured by the inspector of the Surete responsible for his original arrest. Fearing the guillotine more than his actual death, the convict inveigles the inspector to help him with a plan to rescue 100 Frenchmen taken by the Gestapo following an act of sabotage: he will confess to being the saboteur and allow himself to be executed by firing squad, the Gestapo''s method of execution, thus freeing the 100 men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCGksCMaDEqacHEnsn2zNvpquQY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55240'),
  ('626992885647694087', 'Uncertain Verification', 1965, 'Documentary', 'Gianfranco Baruchello, Alberto Grifi', null, 'Rossano Brazzi, Marcel Duchamp, Clark Gable, Daniel Gélin, Susan Hayward, Charlton Heston, Rock Hudson, Jennifer Jones', null, 'A short film containing a collection of clips from various Hollywood movies.', 'A short film containing a collection of clips from various Hollywood movies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sUELU2RuRuZHqcqW2coYRCrz7x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151472'),
  ('729525263661532901', 'Uncertainty', 2009, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Scott McGehee, David Siegel, Rain Li', 'David Siegel, Scott McGehee', 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Lynn Collins, Assumpta Serna, Nelson Landrieu, Manoel Felciano, Jenn Colella, Giana Luca, Sofia Luca', 'NR', 'Every choice has a consequence. But what if the flip of a coin could trigger two separate but parallel destinies? Bobby and Kate are a young New York couple at a crossroads whose lives are about to take very different directions. A seemingly ordinary July 4th is cleaved in two by the flip of a coin. One path leads them to gentle discoveries about family, loss and each other on a visit to Brooklyn, and the other plunges them into an urban nightmare of pursuit, suspense and murder in Manhattan.', 'Every choice has a consequence. But what if the flip of a coin could trigger two separate but parallel destinies? Bobby and Kate are a young New York couple at a crossroads whose lives are about to take very different directions. A seemingly ordinary July 4th is cleaved in two by the flip of a coin. One path leads them to gentle discoveries about family, loss and each other on a visit to Brooklyn, and the other plunges them into an urban nightmare of pursuit, suspense and murder in Manhattan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ExRSYW80CZhhFI3DQaiweTlAGs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28520'),
  ('299856510904049479', 'Uncharted', 2022, 'Action, Adventure', 'Brad Shield, David Ingram, Mathias Datow', 'Rafe Judkins, Art Marcum, Matt Holloway', 'Tom Holland, Mark Wahlberg, Sophia Ali, Tati Gabrielle, Antonio Banderas, Steven Waddington, Rudy Pankow, Tiernan Jones', 'PG-13', 'A young street-smart, Nathan Drake and his wisecracking partner Victor “Sully” Sullivan embark on a dangerous pursuit of “the greatest treasure never found” while also tracking clues that may lead to Nathan’s long-lost brother.', 'A young street-smart, Nathan Drake and his wisecracking partner Victor “Sully” Sullivan embark on a dangerous pursuit of “the greatest treasure never found” while also tracking clues that may lead to Nathan’s long-lost brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJHC1RUORuUhtfNb4Npclx0xnOf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335787'),
  ('873324857449709258', 'Uncivil Warriors', 1935, 'Comedy, War', 'Del Lord', 'Felix Adler', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Lou Archer, Heinie Conklin, Phyllis Crane, Charles Cross, Lew Davis', 'NR', 'Set in the civil war, the stooges are spies for the north. They impersonate southern officers and infiltrate the enemy ranks to get valuable information. On the run when they are discovered, they hide in a cannon and are blown back to their northern headquarters.', 'Set in the civil war, the stooges are spies for the north. They impersonate southern officers and infiltrate the enemy ranks to get valuable information. On the run when they are discovered, they hide in a cannon and are blown back to their northern headquarters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7DiOXfqnqgQw1YChnt8TCMpqqY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115803'),
