  ('254381640141801111', 'Uncle Boonmee Who Can Recall His Past Lives', 2010, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Apichatpong Weerasethakul, Sayombhu Mukdeeprom, Thanachart Siripatrachai', 'Apichatpong Weerasethakul', 'Thanapat Saisaymar, Jenjira Pongpas, Sakda Kaewbuadee, Natthakarn Aphaiwonk, Geerasak Kulhong, Wallapa Mongkolprasert, Kanokporn Tongaram, Samud Kugasang', 'NR', 'Suffering from acute kidney failure, Boonmee has chosen to spend his final days surrounded by his loved ones in the countryside. Surprisingly, the ghost of his deceased wife appears to care for him, and his long lost son returns home in a non-human form. Contemplating the reasons for his illness, Boonmee treks through the jungle with his family to a mysterious hilltop cave—the birthplace of his first life.', 'Suffering from acute kidney failure, Boonmee has chosen to spend his final days surrounded by his loved ones in the countryside. Surprisingly, the ghost of his deceased wife appears to care for him, and his long lost son returns home in a non-human form. Contemplating the reasons for his illness, Boonmee treks through the jungle with his family to a mysterious hilltop cave—the birthplace of his first life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPFkC9EBvllCIuDTR7A0DSEK6gJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38368'),
  ('827788182142168737', 'Uncle Buck', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'John Hughes, Ralf D. Bode, Thomas J. Mack', 'John Hughes', 'John Candy, Jean Louisa Kelly, Gaby Hoffmann, Macaulay Culkin, Amy Madigan, Elaine Bromka, Garrett M. Brown, Laurie Metcalf', 'PG', 'Buck Russell, a lovable but slovenly bachelor, suddenly becomes the temporary caretaker of his nephew and nieces after a family emergency. His freewheeling attitude soon causes tension with his older niece Tia, loyal girlfriend Chanice, and just about everyone else who crosses his path.', 'Buck Russell, a lovable but slovenly bachelor, suddenly becomes the temporary caretaker of his nephew and nieces after a family emergency. His freewheeling attitude soon causes tension with his older niece Tia, loyal girlfriend Chanice, and just about everyone else who crosses his path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euWPWqpujKQg2KnfBUVkBSZ6kf4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2616'),
  ('510915824500343242', 'Uncle Charles', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Étienne Chatiliez, Yves Angelo', 'Florence Quentin', 'Eddy Mitchell, Valérie Bonneton, Alexandra Lamy, Arnaud Ducret, Sophie de Fürst, Thomas Solivérès, Cléo Revel, Joe Sheridan', null, 'Diagnosed with an incurable illness, Charles, a rugby tycoon who has made a fortune in New Zealand prints an ad in his hometown looking for his sister that he''s not seen in fifty years. A notary clerk, believing that Charles has a terminal illness responds to Charles'' search for heirs claiming to be his sister. Charles finds that he was misdiagnosed and returns to France to meet his long lost sister.', 'Diagnosed with an incurable illness, Charles, a rugby tycoon who has made a fortune in New Zealand prints an ad in his hometown looking for his sister that he''s not seen in fifty years. A notary clerk, believing that Charles has a terminal illness responds to Charles'' search for heirs claiming to be his sister. Charles finds that he was misdiagnosed and returns to France to meet his long lost sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uT88YpSwDvK1VDZkU3mjJv4tEjp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119281'),
  ('773623359662943239', 'Uncle Donald''s Ants', 1952, 'Animation', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Donald spills some sugar on his sidewalk, and soon the ants are in complete control of his home, stealing the cake he was baking, building a pipeline from his maple syrup to their hill, and causing general mayhem.', 'Donald spills some sugar on his sidewalk, and soon the ants are in complete control of his home, stealing the cake he was baking, building a pipeline from his maple syrup to their hill, and causing general mayhem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bljhq9dexgaWfnOM64F4rmbRqFr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67708'),
