  ('617084956752959778', 'Uncle Hyacynth', 1956, 'Drama', 'Ladislao Vajda, Fernando Palacios, Heinrich Gärtner', 'Max Körner, Andrés Laszlo, Ladislao Vajda', 'Pablito Calvo, Antonio Vico, José Marco Davó, Juan Calvo, Mariano Azaña, Pastora Peña, Julio Sanjuán, Miguel Gila', null, 'Hyacinth, a former matador who lives miserably with his nephew Pepote, receives a letter reminding him that, as agreed a few days before, he must participate in a bullfight to be held that same afternoon.', 'Hyacinth, a former matador who lives miserably with his nephew Pepote, receives a letter reminding him that, as agreed a few days before, he must participate in a bullfight to be held that same afternoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yO7JBjz4QHls7O8PfYQ7h8uhSv5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117169'),
  ('325895809335005724', 'Uncle Marin, the Billionaire', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Sergiu Nicolaescu, Dan Paduraru, Mariana Petculescu', 'Amza Pellea, Vintilă Corbul, Eugen Barbu', 'Amza Pellea, Sebastian Papaiani, Mircea Albulescu, Colea Răutu, Puiu Călinescu, Ștefan Bănică, Hamdi Cerchez, Jean Constantin', null, 'At a swanky hotel in a Black Sea resort, Gogu, one of the hotel employees, meets his uncle Marin, an Oltenian peasant who has come to visit. Gogu says he can sneak Marin into the hotel, as one of the rooms is empty awaiting the arrival of an American billionaire, Mr. Juvett. Marin is amazed by the revealing clothing worn by women at the resort, while the hotel guests are fascinated by his quaint peasant costume. In the hotel room, Marin is perplexed by the various gadgets. Meanwhile, the gangsters learn that Juvett has arrived at the hotel. Juvett is the father of the kidnapped girl, and is coming to pass over a million dollar ransom. A rival gang, who know about the kidnapping, plan to take the ransom for themselves. They follow Marin, believing him to be Juvett.', 'At a swanky hotel in a Black Sea resort, Gogu, one of the hotel employees, meets his uncle Marin, an Oltenian peasant who has come to visit. Gogu says he can sneak Marin into the hotel, as one of the rooms is empty awaiting the arrival of an American billionaire, Mr. Juvett. Marin is amazed by the revealing clothing worn by women at the resort, while the hotel guests are fascinated by his quaint peasant costume. In the hotel room, Marin is perplexed by the various gadgets. Meanwhile, the gangsters learn that Juvett has arrived at the hotel. Juvett is the father of the kidnapped girl, and is coming to pass over a million dollar ransom. A rival gang, who know about the kidnapping, plan to take the ransom for themselves. They follow Marin, believing him to be Juvett.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNDEN4D7UaIWjnvP1mNvWCkASAR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179519'),
  ('377896531856806471', 'Uncle Peckerhead', 2020, 'Horror, Comedy, Music', 'Matthew John Lawrence', 'Matthew John Lawrence', 'David Bluvband, Chet Siegel, Chloe Roe, Lucy McMichael, Greg Maness, David Littleton, Ryan Conrath, Shannon O''Neill', null, 'When a punk band scores their first tour, life on the road proves tough when they are joined by a man-eating demon as a roadie.', 'When a punk band scores their first tour, life on the road proves tough when they are joined by a man-eating demon as a roadie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lsK7fvFXtCREiiIUF6Kvr5PDAzY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:667154'),
  ('123996060634760384', 'Uncle Sam', 1996, 'Comedy, Horror', 'William Lustig, James A. Lebovitz, Spiro Razatos', 'Larry Cohen', 'William Smith, David "Shark" Fralick, Christopher Ogden, Leslie Neale, Bo Hopkins, Matthew Flint, Anne Tremko, Isaac Hayes', 'R', 'It''s Fourth of July Weekend, and the recently discovered corpse of Sgt. Sam Harper rises from the dead to punish the unpatriotic.', 'It''s Fourth of July Weekend, and the recently discovered corpse of Sgt. Sam Harper rises from the dead to punish the unpatriotic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fp1agcfQwsOepWIVNgS09MyPLXz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9680'),
  ('1026363652667700335', 'Uncle Silas', 1947, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Peter Bolton, Robert Krasker, Charles Frank', 'Ben Travers', 'Jean Simmons, Katina Paxinou, Derrick De Marney, Derek Bond, Sophie Stewart, Esmond Knight, Marjorie Rhodes, Guy Rolfe', null, 'Following her father''s death, a teenage heiress moves in with her guardian uncle who is broke and schemes to murder his niece for her vast inheritance.', 'Following her father''s death, a teenage heiress moves in with her guardian uncle who is broke and schemes to murder his niece for her vast inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayg9xacapp7ZFsxXTQ45bHb4EKQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52940'),
  ('683987570894917730', 'Uncle Thomas: Accounting for the Days', 2019, 'Animation', 'Regina Pessoa', 'Regina Pessoa', 'Regina Pessoa, Abi Feijó', null, 'From Regina''s personal and visual memories, a tribute to her uncle Thomas, who was an artistic inspiration and played a key role in her becoming a filmmaker. A moving tribute to a poet of the everyday.', 'From Regina''s personal and visual memories, a tribute to her uncle Thomas, who was an artistic inspiration and played a key role in her becoming a filmmaker. A moving tribute to a poet of the everyday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVovXwMia7Wed7Ka1T0CitpTbNU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608143'),
  ('320485657365121277', 'Uncle Tom', 2020, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Justin Malone', 'Justin Malone, Larry Elder, Ryder Ansell', 'Allen West, Candace Owens, Robert Woodson, Brandon Tatum, Carol Swain, Chad Jackson, Larry Elder, Herman Cain', 'NR', 'In a collection of intimate interviews with some of America''s most provocative black conservative thinkers, Uncle Tom takes a different look at being black in America.', 'In a collection of intimate interviews with some of America''s most provocative black conservative thinkers, Uncle Tom takes a different look at being black in America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXdRMmheHdPd8MKl7NntOdl6iro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:711340'),
  ('124236262403966270', 'Uncle Tom''s Bungalow', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Mel Blanc, Tex Avery, Billy Bletcher, Tedd Pierce, Bernice Hansen, Lillian Randolph', null, 'Warner Bros. cartoon parody of Uncle Tom''s Cabin. One of the “Censored 11” banned from TV syndication by United Artists in 1968 for racist stereotyping.', 'Warner Bros. cartoon parody of Uncle Tom''s Cabin. One of the “Censored 11” banned from TV syndication by United Artists in 1968 for racist stereotyping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9obvUXkJShFNx9CuyCTOrkRQWME.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190077'),
  ('209978059837589581', 'Uncle Tom''s Cabana', 1947, 'Animation', 'Tex Avery', 'Heck Allen', 'Paul Frees, Will Wright, Imogene Lynn, Ruby Dandridge', 'NR', 'Uncle Tom tells the blood curdling story of how the evil Simon Legree tried to foreclose on Tom''s simple log cabin. (Uncle Tom''s Cabaña is a 1947 American animated short film directed by Tex Avery. The short is a parody of Uncle Tom''s Cabin, and is Avery''s second parody of the novel, the first being Uncle Tom''s Bungalow in 1937 while at Warner Bros. Cartoons)', 'Uncle Tom tells the blood curdling story of how the evil Simon Legree tried to foreclose on Tom''s simple log cabin. (Uncle Tom''s Cabaña is a 1947 American animated short film directed by Tex Avery. The short is a parody of Uncle Tom''s Cabin, and is Avery''s second parody of the novel, the first being Uncle Tom''s Bungalow in 1937 while at Warner Bros. Cartoons)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naEfwbJwkcwodgy0X6CSxL0o1VT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87219'),
  ('95230473992156853', 'Uncle Tom''s Cabin', 1927, 'Drama', 'Harry A. Pollard, Charles J. Stumar, Jacob Kull', null, 'Margarita Fischer, James B. Lowe, Arthur Edmund Carewe, George Siegmann, Eulalie Jensen, Mona Ray, Virginia Grey, Lassie Lou Ahern', null, 'In 1856, slave Eliza plans to marry George with the consent of the Shelbys, her masters, but George''s owner prevents the wedding. A few years later, Eliza flees with her son, Harry, after learning the Shelbys plan to hand them over to a crooked creditor to prevent foreclosure. George also escapes and goes on the run while Eliza and Harry are captured and brought back home. Mother and son are separated as George tries to find them both.', 'In 1856, slave Eliza plans to marry George with the consent of the Shelbys, her masters, but George''s owner prevents the wedding. A few years later, Eliza flees with her son, Harry, after learning the Shelbys plan to hand them over to a crooked creditor to prevent foreclosure. George also escapes and goes on the run while Eliza and Harry are captured and brought back home. Mother and son are separated as George tries to find them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hmwM8sj4rxpKbtvBEIh7qYThbW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185329'),
  ('220908318754446605', 'Uncle Tom''s Cabin', 1965, 'Drama', 'Géza von Radványi, Heinz Hölscher', 'Fred Denger', 'John Kitzmiller, Herbert Lom, O.W. Fischer, Michaela May, Mylène Demongeot, Thomas Fritsch, Juliette Gréco, Vilma Degischer', 'R', 'In the pre-Civil War South, a sadistic plantation owner brutalizes his slaves to the point of rebellion. Always obedient, peaceful and honest old slave Tom plays a central role in this tragedy.', 'In the pre-Civil War South, a sadistic plantation owner brutalizes his slaves to the point of rebellion. Always obedient, peaceful and honest old slave Tom plays a central role in this tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEFxlyBPK1chZsKTKIFsXwth4AR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134338'),
