  ('433902250800026780', 'Uncle Tom''s Cabin', 1987, 'History, Drama, TV Movie', 'Stan Lathan, Stephen W. Gray', 'John Gay', 'Avery Brooks, Kate Burton, Bruce Dern, Paula Kelly, Phylicia Rashād, Kathryn Walker, Edward Woodward, George Coe', 'NR', 'The life of an aging black slave, Tom, and the people he interacts with.', 'The life of an aging black slave, Tom, and the people he interacts with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iyr2lfNz0pWMbkvcmWwAdmrTJU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331472'),
  ('545539341724736545', 'Uncle Vanya', 1970, 'Drama', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Georgi Rerberg, Evgeniy Guslinskiy', 'Andrei Konchalovsky', 'Innokentiy Smoktunovskiy, Sergey Bondarchuk, Irina Kupchenko, Irina Miroshnichenko, Vladimir Zeldin, Irina Anisimova-Wulf, Nikolai Pastukhov, Yekaterina Mazurova', null, 'Serebryakov, a retired professor and his beautiful, much younger second wife, Yeléna, visit their country estate, which funds their urban lifestyle. Vanya, brother of the Professor''s first wife, who manages the farm estate, and the local Doctor Astrov, both fall under Yelena''s spell, while complaining of the endless ennui of their provincial existence. Astrov is an experienced physician who performs his job conscientiously, but has lost all idealism and spends much of his time drinking. Sofya, the Professor''s daughter by his first wife, who works to keep the estate going with her uncle Vanya, meanwhile suffers from lack of esteem over what she sees as her own lack of beauty, and from an unrequited love for Dr. Astrov. Matters are brought to a head when the Professor announces his intention to sell the estate, Vanya and Sofya''s home, to achieve a higher income for himself and his wife.', 'Serebryakov, a retired professor and his beautiful, much younger second wife, Yeléna, visit their country estate, which funds their urban lifestyle. Vanya, brother of the Professor''s first wife, who manages the farm estate, and the local Doctor Astrov, both fall under Yelena''s spell, while complaining of the endless ennui of their provincial existence. Astrov is an experienced physician who performs his job conscientiously, but has lost all idealism and spends much of his time drinking. Sofya, the Professor''s daughter by his first wife, who works to keep the estate going with her uncle Vanya, meanwhile suffers from lack of esteem over what she sees as her own lack of beauty, and from an unrequited love for Dr. Astrov. Matters are brought to a head when the Professor announces his intention to sell the estate, Vanya and Sofya''s home, to achieve a higher income for himself and his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pCTp7cNkB1ArFBfjgHsg4Ls0NTK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143887'),
  ('62014226709098826', 'Uncle Was a Vampire', 1959, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Steno, Marco Scarpelli, Armando Trovajoli', 'Dino Verde, Steno, Edoardo Anton', 'Renato Rascel, Christopher Lee, Sylva Koscina, Lia Zoppelli, Kai Fischer, Franco Scandurra, Carl Wery, Antje Geerk', null, 'Baron Osvaldo Lambertenghi is forced to sell his ancestral castle, staying on as a bellboy when it''s converted into a hotel. However he becomes vampirized when his mysterious uncle comes to stay.', 'Baron Osvaldo Lambertenghi is forced to sell his ancestral castle, staying on as a bellboy when it''s converted into a hotel. However he becomes vampirized when his mysterious uncle comes to stay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZv41iJfTgH0uACmOYHMWJ8dS2g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136695'),
  ('1075911907695119023', 'Uncle Yanco', 1967, 'Documentary', 'Agnès Varda, Jean Hamon, David Myers', 'Agnès Varda', 'Jean Varda, Tom Luddy, Agnès Varda, Rosalie Varda', null, 'While in San Francisco for the promotion of her last film in October 1967, Agnès Varda, tipped by her friend Tom Luddy, gets to know a relative she had never heard of before, Jean Varda, nicknamed "Yanco". This hitherto unknown uncle lives on a boat in Sausalito, is a painter, has adopted a hippie lifestyle and loves life. The meeting is a very happy one.', 'While in San Francisco for the promotion of her last film in October 1967, Agnès Varda, tipped by her friend Tom Luddy, gets to know a relative she had never heard of before, Jean Varda, nicknamed "Yanco". This hitherto unknown uncle lives on a boat in Sausalito, is a painter, has adopted a hippie lifestyle and loves life. The meeting is a very happy one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffZpsbJGuRoMKBQ1ZZ14v06NK7Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277677'),
  ('730217628016806501', 'Uncle, Are You Really Coming From Paris?', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol, Manuel Merino', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Alfredo Landa, África Pratt, Antonio Ozores, Inma de Santis, Rafaela Aparicio, Montserrat Julió, Alejandro de Enciso, José María Caffarel', null, 'Alberto comes to the capital to take care of her nine nephews. Intrigued by the question of sex, children will ask questions to Uncle Albert ... it uses the help of a neighbor.', 'Alberto comes to the capital to take care of her nine nephews. Intrigued by the question of sex, children will ask questions to Uncle Albert ... it uses the help of a neighbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hY4BpBlIhv7bxh6DuweaP7mb64v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217192'),
  ('1004883684826552116', 'Uncle: The Story of a Man', 2021, 'Drama, Adventure, Romance', 'Uğur Bayraktar, Türksoy Gölebeyi, Hatip Karabudak', 'Uğur Bayraktar', 'Ufuk Bayraktar, Gizem Karaca, Ahmet Varlı, Beste Bereket, Turgut Tunçalp, Timur Ölkebaş, Ümit Çırak, Murat Akkoyunlu', null, 'Sent away by his exasperated family to work for the village coffeehouse owner Seyfi in Istanbul, the brave, compassionate, and justice-driven young hero is drawn into the city’s underworld of toughs.', 'Sent away by his exasperated family to work for the village coffeehouse owner Seyfi in Istanbul, the brave, compassionate, and justice-driven young hero is drawn into the city’s underworld of toughs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OnMKxVftp5KKOHCNMvp5bUsB0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718488'),
  ('526223307071404276', 'Uncle''s Paradise', 2006, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Shinji Imaoka, Kazuhiro Suzuki', 'Fumio Moriya', 'Minami Aoyama, Mutsuo Yoshioka, Shirō Shimomoto, Masataka Matsubara, Rinako Hirasawa, Harumi Ogawa, Daisuke Iijima, Mari Yamaguchi', null, 'This surrealistic comedy follows the life of Haruo Maekawa, a young man who makes a living catching squid. Haruo is obsessed with catching a legendary giant squid rumored to live in Tokyo Bay. Haruo''s uncle Takashi, fallen on hard times, comes to stay with his nephew until he can get back on his feet. Uncle Takashi is addicted to energy drinks, and seduces any woman in sight, including Haruo''s girlfriend Rika. While praying at a Shintō shrine, Uncle Takashi is bitten in the scrotum by a poisonous snake and dies. The uncle is destined to spend the afterlife in Hell unless his nephew and girlfriend can rescue him from the King of Hell.', 'This surrealistic comedy follows the life of Haruo Maekawa, a young man who makes a living catching squid. Haruo is obsessed with catching a legendary giant squid rumored to live in Tokyo Bay. Haruo''s uncle Takashi, fallen on hard times, comes to stay with his nephew until he can get back on his feet. Uncle Takashi is addicted to energy drinks, and seduces any woman in sight, including Haruo''s girlfriend Rika. While praying at a Shintō shrine, Uncle Takashi is bitten in the scrotum by a poisonous snake and dies. The uncle is destined to spend the afterlife in Hell unless his nephew and girlfriend can rescue him from the King of Hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMz0xuaqJcobbQw0JShYxxJFRlo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132868'),
  ('701279862617089821', 'Unclenching the Fists', 2021, 'Drama', 'Pavel Fomintsev, Ilya Stepanischev-Decado, Karina Besolova', 'Lyubov Mulmenko', 'Milana Aguzarova, Alik Karaev, Soslan Khugaev, Khetag Bibilov, Arsen Khetagurov, Milana Pagieva, Rostislav Alimov', null, 'In a former mining town in North Ossetia, a young woman struggles to escape the stifling hold of the family she loves as much as she rejects.', 'In a former mining town in North Ossetia, a young woman struggles to escape the stifling hold of the family she loves as much as she rejects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zGCnb5wKHuhtc0ndtGMD5ZlEaf7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583198'),
  ('981154284482720209', 'Uncommon Valor', 1983, 'Drama, War, Action', 'Stephen H. Burum, Ted Kotcheff, Ric Waite', 'Joe Gayton', 'Gene Hackman, Fred Ward, Robert Stack, Patrick Swayze, Harold Sylvester, Randall ''Tex'' Cobb, Tim Thomerson, Lau Nga-Lai', 'R', 'A group of Vietnam War veterans re-unite to rescue one of their own left behind and taken prisoner by the Vietnamese.', 'A group of Vietnam War veterans re-unite to rescue one of their own left behind and taken prisoner by the Vietnamese.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdppSF9wv07bvt9UYv3yGydTpZt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9967'),
  ('104513078258402002', 'Unconditional', 2012, 'Drama', 'Brent McCorkle, Michael Regalbuto', 'Brent McCorkle', 'Lynn Collins, Michael Ealy, Bruce McGill, Kwesi Boakye, Diego Klattenhoff, Cedric Pendleton, Emily Rollins, Danielle Lewis', 'PG-13', 'Samantha Crawford is living a storybook life: she’s happily married, she lives on a ranch where she keeps her beloved horse, and the stories she’s told and illustrated since childhood have become published books. When her husband Billy is killed in a senseless act of violence, Sam loses her faith and her will to live. But a death-defying encounter with two children leads to a reunion with Joe, her oldest friend. As Sam watches “Papa” Joe care for and love the kids in his under-resourced neighborhood, she begins to realize that no matter life’s circumstances, the love of God is always reaching out to us.', 'Samantha Crawford is living a storybook life: she’s happily married, she lives on a ranch where she keeps her beloved horse, and the stories she’s told and illustrated since childhood have become published books. When her husband Billy is killed in a senseless act of violence, Sam loses her faith and her will to live. But a death-defying encounter with two children leads to a reunion with Joe, her oldest friend. As Sam watches “Papa” Joe care for and love the kids in his under-resourced neighborhood, she begins to realize that no matter life’s circumstances, the love of God is always reaching out to us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utD4YdrlyktHAAM7Qt7hq4UppLX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126337'),
  ('752313818947737349', 'Unconditional Love', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy, Thriller', 'P.J. Hogan, Remi Adefarasin', 'P.J. Hogan, Jocelyn Moorhouse', 'Kathy Bates, Rupert Everett, Meredith Eaton, Lynn Redgrave, Dan Aykroyd, Jonathan Pryce, Peter Sarsgaard, Richard Briers', 'PG-13', 'After her husband leaves her, a woman travels to London for the funeral of the pop star, Victor Fox, she''s adored all her life. There, she meets the lover of the dead pop star, and convinces him to come back to Chicago with her to figure out who killed the singer.', 'After her husband leaves her, a woman travels to London for the funeral of the pop star, Victor Fox, she''s adored all her life. There, she meets the lover of the dead pop star, and convinces him to come back to Chicago with her to figure out who killed the singer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhSnhxf4OjYeyyvxFPPPpeae7LU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37922'),
  ('581842280978590513', 'Unconquered', 1947, 'Drama, Adventure, History', 'Cecil B. DeMille, Ray Rennahan, Arthur Rosson', 'Charles Bennett, Fredric M. Frank, Jesse Lasky Jr.', 'Gary Cooper, Paulette Goddard, Howard Da Silva, Boris Karloff, Cecil Kellaway, Ward Bond, Katherine DeMille, Henry Wilcoxon', 'NR', 'England, 1763. After being convicted of a crime, the young and beautiful Abigail Hale agrees, to escape the gallows, to serve fourteen years as a slave in the colony of Virginia, whose inhabitants begin to hear and fear the sinister song of the threatening drums of war that resound in the wild Ohio valley.', 'England, 1763. After being convicted of a crime, the young and beautiful Abigail Hale agrees, to escape the gallows, to serve fourteen years as a slave in the colony of Virginia, whose inhabitants begin to hear and fear the sinister song of the threatening drums of war that resound in the wild Ohio valley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOsESBjWExyOulekJJMc9o5Q5BX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72241'),
