  ('1097890537054673604', 'Uncorked', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Elliot Davis, Prentice Penny, Florian Thomas', 'Prentice Penny', 'Mamoudou Athie, Courtney B. Vance, Niecy Nash, Matt McGorry, Sasha Compère, Gil Ozeri, Kelly Jenrette, Bernard David Jones', null, 'Elijah must balance his dream of becoming a master sommelier with his father''s expectations that he carry on the family''s Memphis BBQ joint.', 'Elijah must balance his dream of becoming a master sommelier with his father''s expectations that he carry on the family''s Memphis BBQ joint.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/neUgCuBhafxYQyXTKxwjQejqqa7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660609'),
  ('358731624764424979', 'Uncovered', 1995, 'Thriller', 'Jim McBride, Affonso Beato', 'Michael Hirst, Jim McBride, Jack Baran', 'Kate Beckinsale, John Wood, Sinéad Cusack, Paudge Behan, Art Malik, Helen McCrory, Peter Wingfield, Michael Gough', null, 'While restoring a fifteenth-century painting Julia reveals a hidden Latin phrase. A series of murders begin to rock her small world of art experts, patrons and restorers, and she finds that the mystery of the painting is interwoven with the mystery of the deaths around her.', 'While restoring a fifteenth-century painting Julia reveals a hidden Latin phrase. A series of murders begin to rock her small world of art experts, patrons and restorers, and she finds that the mystery of the painting is interwoven with the mystery of the deaths around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1JZ5ZLMAR8YpmCJrNVizUO1bnB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18591'),
  ('405466567159966609', 'Uncut Gems', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Amy Lauritsen, Nick Notte, Marquis Sheppard', 'Josh Safdie, Ronald Bronstein, Benny Safdie', 'Adam Sandler, LaKeith Stanfield, Julia Fox, Kevin Garnett, Idina Menzel, Eric Bogosian, Judd Hirsch, Keith William Richards', 'R', 'A charismatic New York City jeweler always on the lookout for the next big score makes a series of high-stakes bets that could lead to the windfall of a lifetime. Howard must perform a precarious high-wire act, balancing business, family, and encroaching adversaries on all sides in his relentless pursuit of the ultimate win.', 'A charismatic New York City jeweler always on the lookout for the next big score makes a series of high-stakes bets that could lead to the windfall of a lifetime. Howard must perform a precarious high-wire act, balancing business, family, and encroaching adversaries on all sides in his relentless pursuit of the ultimate win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XN1vxHc7kUSqNWtaQKN45J5x2v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473033'),
  ('902826569880361447', 'Und wer nimmt den Hund?', 2019, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Rainer Kaufmann, Klaus Eichhammer', 'Martin Rauhaus', 'Martina Gedeck, Ulrich Tukur, Giulia Goldammer, Lucie Heinze, Marcel Hensema, Julika Jenkins, Peter Jordan, Angelika Thomas', null, 'After 26 years of marriage there is a divorce on the way between Georg and Doris. While Georg is having some fun with a much younger co-worker, Doris want the divorce be silenced. Thats why the couple is taking a separation therapy and there will be some rough sessions.', 'After 26 years of marriage there is a divorce on the way between Georg and Doris. While Georg is having some fun with a much younger co-worker, Doris want the divorce be silenced. Thats why the couple is taking a separation therapy and there will be some rough sessions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e03lySJJHB6vzDeo68I0Lgc7voy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606786'),
  ('722947285242413873', 'Undead', 2003, 'Horror, Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Andrew Strahorn, Peter Spierig, Michael Spierig', null, 'Felicity Mason, Mungo McKay, Rob Jenkins, Lisa Cunningham, Dirk Hunter, Emma Randall, Robert Jozinović, Robyn Moore', 'R', 'A quaint Australian fishing village is overcome by meteorites that turn its residents into the ravenous undead, leaving a small group of those unharmed to find a way out.', 'A quaint Australian fishing village is overcome by meteorites that turn its residents into the ravenous undead, leaving a small group of those unharmed to find a way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwXrKFO20FTvA7mHqnTvMXSznDS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8991'),
  ('168766257337715890', 'Undead or Alive: A Zombedy', 2007, 'Horror, Western, Comedy', 'Glasgow Phillips, Thomas L. Callaway', 'Glasgow Phillips', 'Chris Kattan, James Denton, Navi Rawat, Lew Alexander, Leslie Jordan, Chris Coppola, Matt Besser, Todd Anderson', 'R', 'Elmer Winslow is a soldier on the run from the Union Army, and Luke Budd is a cowboy with a broken heart. When the two misfits rob the corrupt sheriff of an old west town, they have no idea that a plague of zombies is sweeping the country, or that Geronimo''s sexy niece may be their only hope of survival.', 'Elmer Winslow is a soldier on the run from the Union Army, and Luke Budd is a cowboy with a broken heart. When the two misfits rob the corrupt sheriff of an old west town, they have no idea that a plague of zombies is sweeping the country, or that Geronimo''s sexy niece may be their only hope of survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xH4WnW0QVOYIePdM1hmN9aiLV9j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25533'),
  ('421951613890073660', 'Undeclared War', 1990, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Chris Lee Kin-Sang, Lau Hung-Chuen', 'Timothy Lung, Nam Yin, Deborah Grant', 'Peter Liapis, Danny Lee Sau-Yin, Tommy Wong, Vernon Wells, Olivia Hussey, Louis Roth, Rosamund Kwan Chi-Lam, Mars', null, 'A Hong Kong Special Branch cop and a CIA agent reluctantly team up to bring down a major international terrorist.', 'A Hong Kong Special Branch cop and a CIA agent reluctantly team up to bring down a major international terrorist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oF5h30RNHvbP2n3srPxZ5WYytRN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119340'),
  ('112617782297235211', 'Undefeatable', 1993, 'Action, Thriller', 'Godfrey Ho, Philip J. Cook, Tom Schnaidt', 'Steve Harper, Robert Vassar', 'Cynthia Rothrock, Don Niam, John Miller, Donna Jason, Sunny David, Emille Davazac, Hang Yip Yim, Richard Yuen', null, 'The film follows Kristi Jones who, along with her gang, take part in Mafia-run street fights to earn money for her sister''s college education. Kristi''s sister hopes to become a doctor and pay for Kristi''s education.', 'The film follows Kristi Jones who, along with her gang, take part in Mafia-run street fights to earn money for her sister''s college education. Kristi''s sister hopes to become a doctor and pay for Kristi''s education.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zGueu0lvOJGgJBUj2G8RKeNeLZi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24527'),
  ('1074163399399733453', 'Undefeated', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Daniel Lindsay, T.J. Martin', null, 'O.C. Brown, Bill Courtney, Chavis Daniels, Montrail ''Money'' Brown', 'PG-13', 'Set against the backdrop of a high school football season, Dan Lindsay and T.J. Martin’s documentary UNDEFEATED is an intimate chronicle of three underprivileged student-athletes from inner-city Memphis and the volunteer coach trying to help them beat the odds on and off the field. For players and coaches alike, the season will be not only about winning games — it will be about how they grapple with the unforeseeable events that are part of football and part of life.', 'Set against the backdrop of a high school football season, Dan Lindsay and T.J. Martin’s documentary UNDEFEATED is an intimate chronicle of three underprivileged student-athletes from inner-city Memphis and the volunteer coach trying to help them beat the odds on and off the field. For players and coaches alike, the season will be not only about winning games — it will be about how they grapple with the unforeseeable events that are part of football and part of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MF2TC6s9Q6onyWgVWJ9YC689oc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82620'),
  ('310773354236620658', 'Undefined Things', 2023, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Ezequiel Salinas, María Aparicio, Octavio Bertone', 'María Aparicio', 'Eva Bianco, Ramiro Sonzini, Pablo Limarzi, Vera Aparicio, Paula Lussi, Malena León, Guadalupe Gómez', null, 'Eva, a film editor, and her assistant Rami are working on a film about blind people. A melancholy reflection on cinema and images.', 'Eva, a film editor, and her assistant Rami are working on a film about blind people. A melancholy reflection on cinema and images.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlHIBQIFBwCjZqVxOVA74r9RLzv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1137094'),
  ('294914732207016668', 'Under a False Name', 2004, 'Romance, Drama, Mystery', 'Roberto Andò, Gianluca Mazzella, Maurizio Calvesi', 'Roberto Andò, Salvatore Marcarelli', 'Daniel Auteuil, Anna Mouglalis, Greta Scacchi, Giorgio Lupano, Serge Merlin, Magdalena Mielcarz, Michael Lonsdale, Joëlle Mnouchkine', null, 'A mysterious writer is involved in a love affair with his stepson''s wife, leading to a web of intrigue and desire.', 'A mysterious writer is involved in a love affair with his stepson''s wife, leading to a web of intrigue and desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRgedj6F6lrGjIWjjSiU43D0jZK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64840'),
  ('273815655119426805', 'Under a Spell', 1999, 'Romance, Drama', 'Carlos Carrera, Rodrigo Prieto', 'Martín Salinas, Carlos Carrera', 'Blanca Guerra, Mario Zaragoza, Daniel Acuña, Luis Fernando Peña, Vanessa Bauche, Rodolfo Arias, Ricardo Rentería, Luisa Huertas', null, 'In the Yucatan coast of the thirties , Elisha, a boy of 13, is initiated into the art of love by Felipa , his schoolteacher. After discovering the relationship, Felipa runs away from the village , leaving Elisha mired in nostalgia. Forced to marry another woman and lead a routine life , recalling the years passed Eliseo romance with Felipa until ten years later, the woman returns , removing his wounds and changing forever the life of Elisha , his family and the whole town', 'In the Yucatan coast of the thirties , Elisha, a boy of 13, is initiated into the art of love by Felipa , his schoolteacher. After discovering the relationship, Felipa runs away from the village , leaving Elisha mired in nostalgia. Forced to marry another woman and lead a routine life , recalling the years passed Eliseo romance with Felipa until ten years later, the woman returns , removing his wounds and changing forever the life of Elisha , his family and the whole town', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cb4VAtZm5cVFZf7bjhkVQ8iyyuB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322943'),
  ('830819876583097537', 'Under a Volcano', 2025, 'Romance, Drama, Adventure', 'Hugo Martín Cuervo', 'Hugo Martín Cuervo, Irene Niubó', 'William Levy, Maggie Civantos, Adriana Torrebejano, Fabiola Guajardo, Elia Galera, Pino Montesdeoca, Antón Lofer', null, 'As a volcano threatens northern Tenerife, the spark between a headstrong scientist and a disciplined pilot tests their ability to resolve the crisis.', 'As a volcano threatens northern Tenerife, the spark between a headstrong scientist and a disciplined pilot tests their ability to resolve the crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8joWkrzM7ss1t8JZlBffavbg4hg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1310879'),
  ('551472310302309512', 'Under California Stars', 1948, 'Western', 'William Witney, Jack A. Marta, Jack Lacey', 'Sloan Nibley, Paul Gangelin', 'Roy Rogers, Jane Frazee, Michael Chapin, Andy Devine, George Lloyd, Wade Crosby, House Peters Jr., Bob Nolan', 'NR', 'On vacation at his ranch, western actor Roy quickly finds himself involved with a horse rustling operation and a boy ward of one of the rustlers, leading to the kidnapping of Roy''s trick horse Trigger by the gang with a demand for ransom.', 'On vacation at his ranch, western actor Roy quickly finds himself involved with a horse rustling operation and a boy ward of one of the rustlers, leading to the kidnapping of Roy''s trick horse Trigger by the gang with a demand for ransom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBZdmWq4XdHeEIlfAOMRWzjzPkj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18648'),
  ('703307156787289799', 'Under California: The Limit of Time', 1998, 'Drama', 'Carlos Bolado', null, 'Jesús Ochoa, Fernando Torre Laphan, Claudette Maillé, Damián Alcázar, Gabriel Retes, José Manuel Poncelis', null, 'Damian is a married artist living in Los Angeles with his wife. After Damian accidentally hits a woman with his car and flees the scene, he seeks atonement and travels alone to Mexico, both to find peace and to reconnect with his family roots. Assisted by local guide Arce, Damian locates his grandmother''s resting place and searches for redemption through a long trek in the arid wilderness of his ancestral land.', 'Damian is a married artist living in Los Angeles with his wife. After Damian accidentally hits a woman with his car and flees the scene, he seeks atonement and travels alone to Mexico, both to find peace and to reconnect with his family roots. Assisted by local guide Arce, Damian locates his grandmother''s resting place and searches for redemption through a long trek in the arid wilderness of his ancestral land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wPLRt9s95UdMcCA2KEyPbbTssb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249376'),
  ('155710562820585902', 'Under Capricorn', 1949, 'Drama, History', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Jack Cardiff', 'John Colton, Margaret Linden', 'Ingrid Bergman, Joseph Cotten, Michael Wilding, Margaret Leighton, Cecil Parker, Denis O''Dea, Jack Watling, Harcourt Williams', 'NR', 'A British ex-convict in colonial Australia and his fragile wife, haunted by the past crime that binds them, struggle to rebuild their lives when a young newcomer stirs long-buried passions and secrets.', 'A British ex-convict in colonial Australia and his fragile wife, haunted by the past crime that binds them, struggle to rebuild their lives when a young newcomer stirs long-buried passions and secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90wKMRxhGFrWXt4rJvVfqVEjpQ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4175'),
  ('336079418109421091', 'Under Construction', 2003, 'Comedy, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Ömer Vargı, Ferenc Pap, Tolgay Ziyal', 'Serdar Tantekin, Ömer Vargı', 'Emre Kınay, Şevket Çoruh, Suna Pekuysal, Yeşim Büber, Binnur Kaya, Tuncay Beyazıt, Şehsuvar Aktaş, Ali Yaylı', null, 'Two construction workers from Istanbul yearn to escape to sunny Italy and find better jobs. In an attempt to save enough money to move, they unwittingly become involved in their boss''s shady criminal dealings. With a little twist of unexpected events their lives turns out to be far from anything they have dreamed of.', 'Two construction workers from Istanbul yearn to escape to sunny Italy and find better jobs. In an attempt to save enough money to move, they unwittingly become involved in their boss''s shady criminal dealings. With a little twist of unexpected events their lives turns out to be far from anything they have dreamed of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWobaL2rCplwQz0QAbs97lhYlgx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63237'),
  ('983914764766248548', 'Under Construction 2', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ömer Vargı', 'Erol Hızarcı, Ömer Vargı', 'Emre Kınay, Şevket Çoruh, Şehsuvar Aktaş, Anastasia Beloborodova, Tuncay Beyazıt, Zeki Bıçakcı, Yeşim Büber, Natalia Chubenko', null, 'Ali and Sudi, who received a 10-year imprisonment for embedding many bodies in the backyard of a construction they had previously worked on, were now free after completing their sentences. After the past events, both friends are determined not to get involved in this kind of crime again. Two friends start working as a night watchman at an entertainment venue on the Aegean coast, which does not have a business permit. Captain Remzi, who owns the entertainment venue, also runs human trafficking with his boat. While both friends dream of going abroad with the women they love, these plans will fall through with the two bodies wash ashore. Although Ali and Sudi bury these two bodies in order not to get into trouble, they will not be able to escape the complex situation they fell into.', 'Ali and Sudi, who received a 10-year imprisonment for embedding many bodies in the backyard of a construction they had previously worked on, were now free after completing their sentences. After the past events, both friends are determined not to get involved in this kind of crime again. Two friends start working as a night watchman at an entertainment venue on the Aegean coast, which does not have a business permit. Captain Remzi, who owns the entertainment venue, also runs human trafficking with his boat. While both friends dream of going abroad with the women they love, these plans will fall through with the two bodies wash ashore. Although Ali and Sudi bury these two bodies in order not to get into trouble, they will not be able to escape the complex situation they fell into.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXG4vldl2EmV6vD2ZbCioiOhfVJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328845'),
  ('532265588830632800', 'Under Control', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Volker Sattel', null, null, null, 'Within the closed world of the nuclear power industry one of humanity''s most compelling struggles has taken place. Germany was at the vanguard of the nuclear power industry but now the walls are coming down. It was the country''s greatest scientific endeavour but now all are due to be decommissioned, thanks to popular fear and the power of democracy.', 'Within the closed world of the nuclear power industry one of humanity''s most compelling struggles has taken place. Germany was at the vanguard of the nuclear power industry but now the walls are coming down. It was the country''s greatest scientific endeavour but now all are due to be decommissioned, thanks to popular fear and the power of democracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kAMOhlnaljczorZfPfo7iIoLp9l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109495'),
  ('700921913773249540', 'Under ConTroll', 2019, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Christian Böning, Nicolas Miebach, Christian Böning', 'Simon Hauschild, Alexander König', 'Eva Habermann, Helmut Krauss, Katy Karrenbauer, Jiří Lábus, George Hardy, Désirée Nick, Ceciiia Pillado, Billie Zöckler', null, 'During building work in the city of Baden-Baden in 2015, an evil troll who was transformed into stone in the 15th century, is accidentally brought back to life. To prevent being unmasked, the Troll slips into the body of Vanessa and enslaves her. Vanessa Troll then goes looking for Charlie, the virgin boyfriend of Vanessa''s daughter, as The Troll needs his blood to evoke a portal to a magical prison. Will the Troll''s plans find success?', 'During building work in the city of Baden-Baden in 2015, an evil troll who was transformed into stone in the 15th century, is accidentally brought back to life. To prevent being unmasked, the Troll slips into the body of Vanessa and enslaves her. Vanessa Troll then goes looking for Charlie, the virgin boyfriend of Vanessa''s daughter, as The Troll needs his blood to evoke a portal to a magical prison. Will the Troll''s plans find success?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXuYlwT5Dnzt1yoriZoTcsrl8eb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:748621'),
  ('843342277300417311', 'Under Eighteen', 1932, 'Drama, Romance', 'Archie Mayo, Barney McGill', 'Charles Kenyon', 'Marian Marsh, Anita Page, Regis Toomey, Warren William, Norman Foster, Joyce Compton, J. Farrell MacDonald, Claire Dodd', 'NR', 'Working girl Margie Evans has decided there are two kinds of opportunities for a slum kid during the Depression: Those you make and those you take. Determined to help her family out of its financial bind, she is ready to do both after she shows up at the penthouse pool bash of a wealthy playboy.', 'Working girl Margie Evans has decided there are two kinds of opportunities for a slum kid during the Depression: Those you make and those you take. Determined to help her family out of its financial bind, she is ready to do both after she shows up at the penthouse pool bash of a wealthy playboy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xPvogTZpk7cPMxcBKgOwQCDuTe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97586'),
  ('442213958129306592', 'Under Fire', 1983, 'Drama, War', 'Roger Spottiswoode, John Alcott', 'Ron Shelton, Clayton Frohman', 'Nick Nolte, Gene Hackman, Joanna Cassidy, Ed Harris, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Richard Masur, Alma Martinez, René Enríquez', 'R', 'Three U.S. journalists get too close to one another and their work in 1979 Nicaragua.', 'Three U.S. journalists get too close to one another and their work in 1979 Nicaragua.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yw73rD95RDqm6cMXi5Gw87KffId.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12503'),
  ('340274663200858493', 'Under Fire', 2025, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller, Drama', 'Steven C. Miller, Jonathan Hall', 'Cory Todd Hughes, Adrian Speckert', 'Dylan Sprouse, Mason Gooding, Odette Annable, Bayardo De Murguia, Emilio Rivera, Declan Michael Laird, Austin North, Lorena Abreu', 'R', 'Story unfolds in the scorching heat of the Mexico border, where rival drug dealers Griff and Abbott arrive at a remote drop point for a routine drug deal. But when the exchange goes down, both reveal undercover badges — Griff is FBI, Abbott is DEA — and neither knew they were working the same case.', 'Story unfolds in the scorching heat of the Mexico border, where rival drug dealers Griff and Abbott arrive at a remote drop point for a routine drug deal. But when the exchange goes down, both reveal undercover badges — Griff is FBI, Abbott is DEA — and neither knew they were working the same case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dIQcDDuDPewwELfhmYMnt25AyZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1511556'),
  ('965091550261736580', 'Under Her Control', 2022, 'Drama', 'Fran Torres, Ángel Iguacel', 'Laura Sarmiento', 'Aitana Sánchez-Gijón, Cumelén Sanz, Younes Bachir, Pedro Casablanc, Salomé Jiménez, María Fernández Prat, Vanesa Rasero, Álex Pastrana', null, 'When a fashion employee thinks she will have to end her promising career after getting pregnant, her boss offers to adopt the child.', 'When a fashion employee thinks she will have to end her promising career after getting pregnant, her boss offers to adopt the child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6AuWxKhfxDltvKMpXG4TblyBGNy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:946703'),
