  ('1085230338522945162', 'Under Milk Wood', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andrew Sinclair, Robert Huke', 'Andrew Sinclair, Dylan Thomas', 'Richard Burton, Elizabeth Taylor, Peter O''Toole, Glynis Johns, Vivien Merchant, Siân Phillips, Victor Spinetti, Angharad Rees', 'PG', 'The delightful if peculiar story of a day in the life of a small, Welsh fishing village called "Llareggub" in which we meet a host of curious characters (and ghosts) through the ''eyes'' of Blind Captain Cat.', 'The delightful if peculiar story of a day in the life of a small, Welsh fishing village called "Llareggub" in which we meet a host of curious characters (and ghosts) through the ''eyes'' of Blind Captain Cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isohcI3ZWD3VxLSMW4GvCrDUAJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61766'),
  ('1113345952718667330', 'Under Ninja', 2025, 'Action', 'Yuichi Fukuda, Keiya Tabuchi', 'Yuichi Fukuda', 'Kento Yamazaki, Minami Hamabe, Amane Okayama, Chihiro Yamamoto, Ryubi Miyase, Ryotaro Sakaguchi, Mitsuru Hirata, Shinobu Hasegawa', null, 'The once-proud Japanese Ninja disappeared after the war when GHQ disbanded their organization.However, in reality ninjas still exist secretly and it is said that there are 200 thousand of them.And some elite ninjas are secretly operating behind the scenes in national-level struggles.On the other hand, grassroots ninjas often cannot find jobs, and one of them, Yun Yin Jiu Lang, also lives a life similar to that of the NEET generation.However, there is finally a major "endurance" around Ninomaru!', 'The once-proud Japanese Ninja disappeared after the war when GHQ disbanded their organization.However, in reality ninjas still exist secretly and it is said that there are 200 thousand of them.And some elite ninjas are secretly operating behind the scenes in national-level struggles.On the other hand, grassroots ninjas often cannot find jobs, and one of them, Yun Yin Jiu Lang, also lives a life similar to that of the NEET generation.However, there is finally a major "endurance" around Ninomaru!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gONIQR41CveZehtUa25YuFUcj9G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1340355'),
  ('78894306909281524', 'Under Paris', 2024, 'Action, Horror', 'Xavier Gens, Thomine de Pins, Benjamin Gens', 'Maud Heywang, Yannick Dahan, Xavier Gens', 'Bérénice Bejo, Nassim Lyes, Léa Léviant, Sandra Parfait, Aksel Üstün, Aurélia Petit, Marvin Dubart, Daouda Keita', 'R', 'In order to save Paris from an international bloodbath, a grieving scientist is forced to face her tragic past when a giant shark appears in the Seine.', 'In order to save Paris from an international bloodbath, a grieving scientist is forced to face her tragic past when a giant shark appears in the Seine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZPLK5ktRKa3CL4sKRZtj8UlPYc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001311'),
  ('584465638194926482', 'Under Pressure', 1997, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Craig R. Baxley, David Connell', 'Betsy Giffen Nowrasteh', 'Charlie Sheen, Mare Winningham, David Andrews, Noah Fleiss, Chelsea Russo, John Ratzenberger, Dawnn Lewis, Keone Young', 'R', 'When decorated firefighter Lyle Wilder is restrained from seeing his wife and child after abuse allegations, he turns his attention to his neighbours. During a heatwave, what starts as a neighbourly feud turns into outright assault.', 'When decorated firefighter Lyle Wilder is restrained from seeing his wife and child after abuse allegations, he turns his attention to his neighbours. During a heatwave, what starts as a neighbourly feud turns into outright assault.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXBxNAsu1lPp3ijj55qYDxOayYR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71456'),
  ('749265261053401354', 'Under Pressure', 2016, 'Drama', 'Andrucha Waddington, Fernando Young', 'Leandro Assis, Renato Fagundes', 'Júlio Andrade, Marjorie Estiano, Andréa Beltrão, Ícaro Silva, Stepan Nercessian, Thelmo Fernandes, Josie Antello, Álamo Facó', null, 'Over a tense day in the emergency hospital, we follow the surgeon''s work Evandro and staff in three cases that require risk surgery: a drug dealer, a military police officer and a rich family child, all injured during a shootout in a slum next to the hospital.', 'Over a tense day in the emergency hospital, we follow the surgeon''s work Evandro and staff in three cases that require risk surgery: a drug dealer, a military police officer and a rich family child, all injured during a shootout in a slum next to the hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSibFrGTDaXy96lDZnUdtEDMYaw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417587'),
  ('371515013961283895', 'Under Pressure: Making ''The Abyss''', 1993, 'Documentary', 'Ed W. Marsh', 'Ed W. Marsh', 'James Cameron, Gale Anne Hurd, Al Giddings, Ron Cobb, Michael Biehn, Pierce Oliver Brewer, Jr., Leo Burmester, Ed Harris', null, 'Documentary about the challenging making of the sci-fi film "The Abyss" , with commentary by various actors and crew, outtakes and behind-the-scenes footage of the actual shooting of the film.', 'Documentary about the challenging making of the sci-fi film "The Abyss" , with commentary by various actors and crew, outtakes and behind-the-scenes footage of the actual shooting of the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpAEg2HGT4u2ToKCMx6oSA3qVMA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66748'),
  ('93577493309771512', 'Under Siege', 1992, 'Action, Thriller', 'Andrew Davis, Thomas J. Mack, David Kelley', 'J.F. Lawton', 'Steven Seagal, Tommy Lee Jones, Gary Busey, Erika Eleniak, Colm Meaney, Damian Chapa, Andy Romano, Patrick O''Neal', 'R', 'A disgruntled ex-CIA operative, his assistant and their assembled group of terrorists seize a battleship with nuclear blackmail in mind. They''ve planned for every contingency but ignore the ship''s cook, former Navy SEAL Casey Ryback—an error that could be fatal.', 'A disgruntled ex-CIA operative, his assistant and their assembled group of terrorists seize a battleship with nuclear blackmail in mind. They''ve planned for every contingency but ignore the ship''s cook, former Navy SEAL Casey Ryback—an error that could be fatal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myHxm9p8fhEsXyaLO6DawYJKolg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8845'),
  ('1143620577419187708', 'Under Siege 2: Dark Territory', 1995, 'Action, Thriller', 'Robbie Greenberg, Geoff Murphy, Carol Winstead Wood', 'Matt Reeves, Richard Hatem', 'Steven Seagal, Eric Bogosian, Katherine Heigl, Morris Chestnut, Everett McGill, Brenda Bakke, Peter Greene, Andy Romano', 'R', 'A passenger train has been hijacked by an electronics expert and turned into an untraceable command center for a weapons satellite. He has planned to blow up Washington DC and only one man can stop him, former Navy SEAL Casey Ryback.', 'A passenger train has been hijacked by an electronics expert and turned into an untraceable command center for a weapons satellite. He has planned to blow up Washington DC and only one man can stop him, former Navy SEAL Casey Ryback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gElwFCQTbSK5hdK0PVyia547nst.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3512'),
  ('398844165889098599', 'Under Suspicion', 1991, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Simon Moore, Vernon Layton, David Carrigan', 'Simon Moore', 'Liam Neeson, Laura San Giacomo, Kenneth Cranham, Alphonsia Emmanuel, Maggie O''Neill, Stephen Moore, Malcolm Storry, Richard Graham', 'R', 'In the late 1950s, British police officer Tony Aaron resigns from the force after sleeping with Hazel, wife of the man whose house he was supposed to guard. In his new job as a fake private investigator, he helps couples get divorces by photographing Hazel having "affairs" with the husband. When she is murdered during a job, Tony begins having an affair with the dead man''s mistress, Angeline, while trying to prove his innocence.', 'In the late 1950s, British police officer Tony Aaron resigns from the force after sleeping with Hazel, wife of the man whose house he was supposed to guard. In his new job as a fake private investigator, he helps couples get divorces by photographing Hazel having "affairs" with the husband. When she is murdered during a job, Tony begins having an affair with the dead man''s mistress, Angeline, while trying to prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnAcBVWvcQzHQEqS8SXXX3YyHbA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26850'),
  ('948972955638313938', 'Under Suspicion', 2000, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Stephen Hopkins, Cliff Lanning, Luis Rosario Albert', 'Claude Miller, Jean Herman, Michel Audiard', 'Gene Hackman, Morgan Freeman, Thomas Jane, Monica Bellucci, Nydia Caro, Miguel Ángel Suárez, Pablo Cunqueiro, Isabel Algaze', 'R', 'A lawyer is asked to come to the police station to clear up a few loose ends in his witness report of a foul murder. "This will only take ten minutes", they say, but it turns out to be one loose end after another, and the ten minutes he is away from his speech become longer and longer.', 'A lawyer is asked to come to the police station to clear up a few loose ends in his witness report of a foul murder. "This will only take ten minutes", they say, but it turns out to be one loose end after another, and the ten minutes he is away from his speech become longer and longer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2snkCKKthT5S8Ua0aMZkeaXkmBi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10562'),
  ('1029836949299157740', 'Under Ten Flags', 1960, 'History, War', 'Duilio Coletti', 'Vittoriano Petrilli', 'Van Heflin, Charles Laughton, Mylène Demongeot, John Ericson, Cecil Parker, Folco Lulli, Alex Nicol, Liam Redmond', null, '"Under Ten Flags" is a WWII movie loosely based on the true story of the German navy commerce raider Atlantis, a converted Auxilliary Cruiser, and her Captain Bernhard Rogge. Atlantis, camouflaged as a merchant ship, cruised the South Seas ( Atlantic, Indian &amp; Pacific) and sank or captured 22 merchant ships from May 1940 through November 22, 1941 when she was sunk by the British Cruiser HMS Devonshire. Rogge was one of the few German officers of flag rank who were not arrested by the Allies after the war ended. This was due to the very proper and ethical way he exercised his command of Atlantis. After the war he advanced to Rear Admiral in the West German Navy and became a high-ranking NATO commander.', '"Under Ten Flags" is a WWII movie loosely based on the true story of the German navy commerce raider Atlantis, a converted Auxilliary Cruiser, and her Captain Bernhard Rogge. Atlantis, camouflaged as a merchant ship, cruised the South Seas ( Atlantic, Indian &amp; Pacific) and sank or captured 22 merchant ships from May 1940 through November 22, 1941 when she was sunk by the British Cruiser HMS Devonshire. Rogge was one of the few German officers of flag rank who were not arrested by the Allies after the war ended. This was due to the very proper and ethical way he exercised his command of Atlantis. After the war he advanced to Rear Admiral in the West German Navy and became a high-ranking NATO commander.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryeCq3sapLS1YT11WGN8XFnSUJd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146563'),
  ('185750749658434334', 'Under the Amalfi Sun', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Edoardo Carlo Bolli, Martina Pastori, Federico Nuti', 'Enrico Vanzina, Caterina Salvadori, Ciro Zecca', 'Lorenzo Zurzolo, Ludovica Martino, Isabella Ferrari, Luca Ward, Davide Calgaro, Kyshan Wilson, Nicolas Maupas, Elena Funari', 'PG-13', 'A year after their romance began in Riccione, Vincenzo and Camilla reunite for a vacation on the picturesque Amalfi Coast and put their love to the test.', 'A year after their romance began in Riccione, Vincenzo and Camilla reunite for a vacation on the picturesque Amalfi Coast and put their love to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vufsfqtJHDjbBFtti8F1ZeSRm4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:873127'),
  ('19568894162377115', 'Under the Autumn Moon', 2018, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Paul Suderman, Elizabeth Farrer, Cody McCullough', 'Tracy Andreen, Nicole Avril', 'Lindy Booth, Wes Brown, Natalie Lisinska, Dean Redman, Erik Athavale, Cherion Drakes, Morgan Holmstrom, Nolan Grantham', null, 'While visiting a dude ranch that is a potential acquisition for the outdoor adventure company she works for, Alex, an eager candidate for a big promotion discovers what matters most when she reignites her passion for the great outdoors; and becomes smitten with the ranch’s owner in the process.', 'While visiting a dude ranch that is a potential acquisition for the outdoor adventure company she works for, Alex, an eager candidate for a big promotion discovers what matters most when she reignites her passion for the great outdoors; and becomes smitten with the ranch’s owner in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svRZLiJZxs6vfTHN14UJuAMLEsZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547242'),
  ('491224022454457324', 'Under the Bed', 2012, 'Horror', 'Joseph White, Steven C. Miller, Joshua Lou Friedman', 'Eric Stolze', 'Jonny Weston, Gattlin Griffith, Musetta Vander, Kelcie Stranahan, Bryan Rasmussen, Nikki Griffin, Tyler Steelman, Sam Kindseth', 'R', 'Two brothers team up to battle a creature under the bed, in what is being described as a "suburban nightmare" tale.', 'Two brothers team up to battle a creature under the bed, in what is being described as a "suburban nightmare" tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgD3QUvhCIJAMem0LNQrvrYMo1H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128311'),
  ('383561151850427576', 'Under the Blossoming Cherry Trees', 1975, 'Drama, Horror, Fantasy, Romance', 'Masahiro Shinoda, Tatsuo Suzuki', 'Taeko Tomioka, Masahiro Shinoda', 'Tomisaburō Wakayama, Shima Iwashita, Hiroko Isayama, Kō Nishimura, Hideo Kanze, Yūsuke Takita, Yoshi Katō, Nikaku Shōfukutei', null, 'A mountain man beheads his many wives to prove his love to an alluring woman he meets in an enchanted forest.', 'A mountain man beheads his many wives to prove his love to an alluring woman he meets in an enchanted forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yMImDRa7x2DXPRCX3uhEhf5AMD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108808'),
  ('701063560445476065', 'Under the Boardwalk', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Romance', 'David Soren', 'Lorene Scafaria, David Soren', 'Michael Cera, Keke Palmer, Bobby Cannavale, John Magaro, Jon Rudnitsky, Steven Van Zandt, Vanessa Bell Calloway, Shoshannah Stern', 'PG', 'Two crabs embark on an epic journey to get home after a storm sweeps them away. Their courage soon unites their families, paving the way for great summers to come.', 'Two crabs embark on an epic journey to get home after a storm sweeps them away. Their courage soon unites their families, paving the way for great summers to come.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJzk88QM8USoEY6VWAEQFoubkFd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:609271'),
  ('1040581699924845599', 'Under the Bombs', 2007, 'Romance, Drama, History, War', 'Philippe Aractingi, Nidal Abdul Khalek', 'Philippe Aractingi, Michel Léviant', 'Nada Abou Farhat, Georges Khabbaz, Rawia Elchab, Bshara Atallah, Zaynab Balhas, Hadi Medhi, Ali Maerouf Amer, Kamal Balhas', null, 'In the wake of Israel''s 2006 bombardment of Lebanon, a determined woman finds her way into the country convincing a taxi driver to take a risky journey around the scarred region in search of her sister and her son.', 'In the wake of Israel''s 2006 bombardment of Lebanon, a determined woman finds her way into the country convincing a taxi driver to take a risky journey around the scarred region in search of her sister and her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcTkuOiFQv8gBVxkE4nXuTFrxMo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32092'),
  ('1098481506139185775', 'Under the Bridges', 1946, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Helmut Käutner, Rudolf Jugert, Wolfgang Wehrum', 'Leo de Laforgue, Helmut Käutner, Walter Ulbrich', 'Hannelore Schroth, Carl Raddatz, Gustav Knuth, Margarete Haagen, Ursula Grabley, Hildegard Knef, Walter Gross, Klaus Pohl', null, 'Two barge skippers fall in love with the same woman.', 'Two barge skippers fall in love with the same woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3uRwoZgD46cyiEGbrCSyWmVavRy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114790'),
  ('265787942644052148', 'Under the Cherry Moon', 1986, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Prince, Michael Ballhaus, Michel Ferry', 'Becky Johnston', 'Prince, Kristin Scott Thomas, Jerome Benton, Steven Berkoff, Emmanuelle Sallet, Alexandra Stewart, Francesca Annis, Pamela Ludwig', 'PG-13', 'Two friends from Miami are in the French Riviera enjoying life by scamming money off of rich women. One day, they read about a young woman set to inherit $50 million from her father. At first, Tricky has Christopher Tracy talked into romancing her for her money, but in getting to know her, Christopher falls in love with her. This love comes between the brothers, and Tricky tells about the plan.', 'Two friends from Miami are in the French Riviera enjoying life by scamming money off of rich women. One day, they read about a young woman set to inherit $50 million from her father. At first, Tricky has Christopher Tracy talked into romancing her for her money, but in getting to know her, Christopher falls in love with her. This love comes between the brothers, and Tricky tells about the plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82EvqDBW6CCQLt0hRyOQ7UI3ua3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33345'),
  ('956203736171351429', 'Under the Chinese Restaurant', 1987, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Bruno Bozzetto', 'Fabio Comana', 'Claudio Botosso, Amanda Sandrelli, Nancy Brilli, Claudia Lawrence, Bernard Blier, Giuseppe Cederna, Cinzia Monreale, Oreste Castagna', null, 'A young man captures the fancy of an inventor''s daughter when he passes through a basement door into another dimension.', 'A young man captures the fancy of an inventor''s daughter when he passes through a basement door into another dimension.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84OtfYVyhRHcSqXkgEgW28Koq0P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251805'),
  ('1093499511255770562', 'Under the Christmas Tree', 2021, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Lisa Rose Snow, Gayle Ye, Shawna Steele', 'Michael J. Murray', 'Elise Bauman, Tattiawna Jones, Ricki Lake, Wendy Crewson, Enrico Colantoni, Shawn Ahmed, Sonia Dhillon Tully, Connie Manfredi', null, 'Marketing whiz Alma Beltran and Christmas tree whisperer Charlie Freemont cross paths when Charlie finds the perfect tree for the Maine Governor''s Holiday Celebration — right in Alma''s back yard. While they initially spar, romantic sparks soon begin to fly between the two women as the enchanting tree and some Christmas fairy dust from the town''s pâtissière extraordinaire bring out the best in them and spark each other to take leaps of faith and fight for love and Christmas magic.', 'Marketing whiz Alma Beltran and Christmas tree whisperer Charlie Freemont cross paths when Charlie finds the perfect tree for the Maine Governor''s Holiday Celebration — right in Alma''s back yard. While they initially spar, romantic sparks soon begin to fly between the two women as the enchanting tree and some Christmas fairy dust from the town''s pâtissière extraordinaire bring out the best in them and spark each other to take leaps of faith and fight for love and Christmas magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMCZT3MmF3S993SuNAvMBbchQON.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:883936'),
  ('250273069680307521', 'Under the Counter Spy', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Don Patterson', null, 'Daws Butler, Dal McKennon, Dick Nelson, Grace Stafford', null, 'This cartoon is a parody of the then current TV show, "Dragnet". Police are warned of an escaped criminal, "The Bat", who possesses a super strength tonic.', 'This cartoon is a parody of the then current TV show, "Dragnet". Police are warned of an escaped criminal, "The Bat", who possesses a super strength tonic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbuj8bcDKmNKwQgjecSfsjTvwXm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317692'),
  ('760842532133599989', 'Under the Dog', 2016, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Masahiro Sato, Keiichi Momose, Masahiro Ando', 'Yukinori Kitajima, Jiro Ishii, Keigo Koyanagi', 'Asami Seto, Rumi Okubo, Koki Uchiyama, Naomi Ohzora, Haruka Takahashi, Hiroshi Tsuchida, Hiroyuki Kinoshita, Sayaka Ohara', null, 'The story takes place within Neo Tokyo in the year 2025, five years after a severe terrorist attack at the 2020 Tokyo Olympics. Students possessing special abilities are forced into serving an elite anti-terrorist unit created by the United Nations, fighting against threats including other ability users. If these agents fail their mission, they will be killed along with their families, who have bombs planted within their heads. One member of this covert ops unit, a Swedish girl by the name of Anthea Kallenberg, seeks to find who she really is.', 'The story takes place within Neo Tokyo in the year 2025, five years after a severe terrorist attack at the 2020 Tokyo Olympics. Students possessing special abilities are forced into serving an elite anti-terrorist unit created by the United Nations, fighting against threats including other ability users. If these agents fail their mission, they will be killed along with their families, who have bombs planted within their heads. One member of this covert ops unit, a Swedish girl by the name of Anthea Kallenberg, seeks to find who she really is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7edDmy8fSuBFZNJakJwlBoHBgE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291015'),
  ('96515358549182175', 'Under the Flag of the Rising Sun', 1972, 'Drama, Mystery, War', 'Kinji Fukasaku', 'Norio Osada, Kinji Fukasaku', 'Sachiko Hidari, Tetsuro Tamba, Noboru Mitani, Sanae Nakahara, Yumiko Fujita, Shinjirō Ehara, Taketoshi Naitō, Kôichi Yamamoto', null, 'A war widow determined to clear the name of her disgraced husband, who was court-martialed for desertion and executed. Official records have been destroyed, and the ministry that distributes benefits continues to deny her a pension. Twenty-six years after the war, she seeks out four survivors of her husband''s garrison. Each tells a dramatically different story about her husband''s conduct, but she is determined to learn the truth.', 'A war widow determined to clear the name of her disgraced husband, who was court-martialed for desertion and executed. Official records have been destroyed, and the ministry that distributes benefits continues to deny her a pension. Twenty-six years after the war, she seeks out four survivors of her husband''s garrison. Each tells a dramatically different story about her husband''s conduct, but she is determined to learn the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBBZNl477SNsAORNjnHyFvprxAd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62851'),
  ('568842909331597817', 'Under The Greenwood Tree', 2005, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Nicholas Laughland', 'Ashley Pharoah', 'Keeley Hawes, James Murray, Terry Mortimer, Richard Leaf, Tony Haygarth, Tom Georgeson, Ben Miles, Steve Pemberton', null, 'Set in a rustic English village in the mid 19th century, Under The Greenwood Tree tells the story of a poor young man who falls for a middle-class schoolteacher and attempts to win her over.', 'Set in a rustic English village in the mid 19th century, Under The Greenwood Tree tells the story of a poor young man who falls for a middle-class schoolteacher and attempts to win her over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnlGljwFgEM8y76rgVy90XuKpWm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18091'),
  ('725318720141621013', 'Under the Hawthorn Tree', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Zhang Yimou, Zhao Xiaoding, Zang Xichuan', 'Yin Lichuan, Gu Xiaobai, A Mei', 'Zhou Dongyu, Shawn Dou, Xi Meijuan, Li Xuejian, Cheng Taishen, Sa Rina, Lü Liping, Jiang Ruijia', null, 'The daughter of a right-winger, schoolgirl Jing Qiu is sent to the countryside for reeducation, and tasked to help write a textbook. There she meets Lao San, a young soldier with a bright future ahead. Despite the class divide and parental disapproval, romance blooms against turbulent times.', 'The daughter of a right-winger, schoolgirl Jing Qiu is sent to the countryside for reeducation, and tasked to help write a textbook. There she meets Lao San, a young soldier with a bright future ahead. Despite the class divide and parental disapproval, romance blooms against turbulent times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWMGWlhRVVKd666QaBR7D7Hd7og.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50542'),
