  ('671501906406549970', 'Under the Hood', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Eric Matthies, Glenn Taylor, Chris Oben', 'Hans Rodionoff', 'Ted Friend, Stephen McHattie, Glenn Ennis, Matt Frewer, Jay Brazeau, Frank Cassini, Carla Gugino, Jeffrey Dean Morgan', 'PG', 'Stars from the Watchmen movie team up in the amazing live-action/CGI Under the Hood, based on Nite Owl''s powerful firsthand account of how the hooded adventurers came into existence.', 'Stars from the Watchmen movie team up in the amazing live-action/CGI Under the Hood, based on Nite Owl''s powerful firsthand account of how the hooded adventurers came into existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1d7s4eC0RX8s4mhVrGW5lgnOpi8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41207'),
  ('664198083944607693', 'Under the Light', 2023, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Zhao Xiaoding, Zhang Yimou, Luo Pan', 'Chen Yu', 'Lei Jiayin, Yu Hewei, Zhang Guoli, Zhou Dongyu, Sun Yizhou, Li Naiwen, Xu Yajun, Tian Yu', null, 'Officers Su Jianming and Li Huilin investigate a crime involving wealthy businessman Li Zhitian. As clues emerge, the investigation becomes more and more like a game of chess.', 'Officers Su Jianming and Li Huilin investigate a crime involving wealthy businessman Li Zhitian. As clues emerge, the investigation becomes more and more like a game of chess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gESv9WPvbmbOwO50vT6yF2OuWwF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661579'),
  ('248187577043135241', 'Under the Mountain', 2009, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Drama', 'Jonathan King', 'Matthew Grainger, Jonathan King', 'Sam Neill, Tom Cameron, Oliver Driver, Sophie McBride, Matthew Chamberlain, Bruce Hopkins, Gareth Reeves, Colin Moy', 'PG-13', 'Teenage twins battle dark forces hidden beneath Auckland''s volcanoes.', 'Teenage twins battle dark forces hidden beneath Auckland''s volcanoes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94g3Mt3qJxh6CmQ3J38CHUiMnJe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32932'),
  ('844915703357144294', 'Under the Olive Tree', 1950, 'Drama', 'Giuseppe De Santis, Basilio Franchina, Gianni Puccini', 'Giuseppe De Santis, Gianni Puccini, Carlo Lizzani', 'Raf Vallone, Lucia Bosè, Folco Lulli, Maria Grazia Francia, Dante Maggio, Michele Riccardini, Vincenzo Talarico, Pietro Tordi', null, 'A young shepherd returns home after the Second World War having been held in a prisoner of war camp. He finds that the local landowner has stolen his sheep and his girlfriend. When he also assaults and murders his sister, the shepherd takes revenge.', 'A young shepherd returns home after the Second World War having been held in a prisoner of war camp. He finds that the local landowner has stolen his sheep and his girlfriend. When he also assaults and murders his sister, the shepherd takes revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfUas3Y8dK3cGKrk8XzlaWYRsxl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151194'),
  ('31172477855570273', 'Under the Open Sky', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Miwa Nishikawa, Norimichi Kasamatsu, Yoichi Nakzato', 'Miwa Nishikawa', 'Koji Yakusho, Taiga Nakano, Masami Nagasawa, Isao Hashizume, Rokkaku Seiji, Yukiya Kitamura, Narumi Yasuda, Meiko Kaji', null, 'Mikami, an ex-yakuza of middle age with most of his life in prison, gets released after serving 13 years of sentence for murder. Hoping to find his long lost mother, from whom he was separated as a child, he applies for a TV show and meets a young TV director Tsunoda. Meanwhile, he struggles to get a proper job and fit into society. His impulsive, adamant nature and ingrained beliefs cause friction in his relationship with Tsunoda and those who want to help him.', 'Mikami, an ex-yakuza of middle age with most of his life in prison, gets released after serving 13 years of sentence for murder. Hoping to find his long lost mother, from whom he was separated as a child, he applies for a TV show and meets a young TV director Tsunoda. Meanwhile, he struggles to get a proper job and fit into society. His impulsive, adamant nature and ingrained beliefs cause friction in his relationship with Tsunoda and those who want to help him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niXZ7He4YQywfFMVdo6uI6GeaOD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728882'),
  ('252768445935753170', 'Under the Rainbow', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Steve Rash, Frank Stanley', 'Pat Bradley, Pat McCormick, Fred Bauer', 'Chevy Chase, Carrie Fisher, Eve Arden, Joseph Maher, Robert Donner, Billy Barty, Mako, Cork Hubbert', 'PG', 'In World War II era Los Angeles, the manager of the Culver Hotel leaves his nephew in charge for a weekend. The nephew changes the name to the Hotel Rainbow and overbooks with royalty, assassins, secret agents, Japanese tourists, and munchkins. Secret Service agent Bruce Thorpe and casting director Annie Clark find romance amidst the intrigue and confusion.', 'In World War II era Los Angeles, the manager of the Culver Hotel leaves his nephew in charge for a weekend. The nephew changes the name to the Hotel Rainbow and overbooks with royalty, assassins, secret agents, Japanese tourists, and munchkins. Secret Service agent Bruce Thorpe and casting director Annie Clark find romance amidst the intrigue and confusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCdXzpghn4tPz6hbQcvS2UwOh1C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47941'),
  ('757714254574054466', 'Under the Rainbow', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Agnès Jaoui, Lubomir Bakchev', 'Jean-Pierre Bacri, Agnès Jaoui', 'Agnès Jaoui, Jean-Pierre Bacri, Agathe Bonitzer, Arthur Dupont, Valérie Crouzet, Dominique Valadié, Benjamin Biolay, Laurent Poitrenaux', null, 'Laura is still waiting for Prince Charming at the age of 24. So when Sandro appears at a party, exactly like her Prince would in her dreams, she thinks she''s found the right one. But then again, when she meets Maxime, Laura starts to wonder if some Princes could be more charming than others? Of course Sandro has problems of his own : his father, Pierre, just bumped into Madam Irma at his father''s funeral and this reminded him of the date of his own death which Madame Irma had predicted ages ago. Now Pierre is unable to make any plans, not with his new partner Eleonore, nor with Sandro. And Maxime has his own problems, and so does Eleonore, Marianne, Jacqueline and many others. But don''t worry, in the end, they''ll all live happily ever after.', 'Laura is still waiting for Prince Charming at the age of 24. So when Sandro appears at a party, exactly like her Prince would in her dreams, she thinks she''s found the right one. But then again, when she meets Maxime, Laura starts to wonder if some Princes could be more charming than others? Of course Sandro has problems of his own : his father, Pierre, just bumped into Madam Irma at his father''s funeral and this reminded him of the date of his own death which Madame Irma had predicted ages ago. Now Pierre is unable to make any plans, not with his new partner Eleonore, nor with Sandro. And Maxime has his own problems, and so does Eleonore, Marianne, Jacqueline and many others. But don''t worry, in the end, they''ll all live happily ever after.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lB1kVizjYAT1x44JdDZMWCR9Kkb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160564'),
  ('69224353360806650', 'Under the Rainbow', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bryan Marciano, Manon Dubois-Muret, Pauline Delabroy-Allard', 'Bryan Marciano, Noé Debré', 'Valérie Lemercier, Finnegan Oldfield, Elsa Guedj, Olivier Claverie, Victor Mermaz, Eli Letourneur, Fehdi Bendjima, Mahamat Amine Benrachid', null, 'An association takes in young LGBT people made homeless by their families. Behind the apparent comedy, the excesses, the desire to assert themselves, lie shattered lives. They all have this furious desire to exist, to find their place in society. Here, they have six months to find a job, a place to live and accept themselves as they are. It''s a race against time, during which Noëlle, who runs the association, and Alex, who helps her in her mission, are also forced to face up to their own failings and question their motivation for helping others.', 'An association takes in young LGBT people made homeless by their families. Behind the apparent comedy, the excesses, the desire to assert themselves, lie shattered lives. They all have this furious desire to exist, to find their place in society. Here, they have six months to find a job, a place to live and accept themselves as they are. It''s a race against time, during which Noëlle, who runs the association, and Alex, who helps her in her mission, are also forced to face up to their own failings and question their motivation for helping others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMMtEPA0zDVIy5sekNWzvZ3wGUL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:989592'),
  ('934533464285934816', 'Under the Riccione Sun', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Marcello Calvesi, Emiliano Composta, Biancalisa Basti', 'Enrico Vanzina, Caterina Salvadori, Ciro Zecca', 'Cristiano Caccamo, Saul Nanni, Andrea Roncato, Lorenzo Zurzolo, Ludovica Martino, Isabella Ferrari, Luca Ward, Davide Calgaro', null, 'While vacationing on the crowded beaches of Riccione, a group of teenagers becomes fast friends as they grapple with relationship issues and romance.', 'While vacationing on the crowded beaches of Riccione, a group of teenagers becomes fast friends as they grapple with relationship issues and romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swxumQljyst2dzun8k1gaLu85mz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:694234'),
  ('677910173364463720', 'Under the Roofs of Paris', 1930, 'Drama, Romance', 'René Clair, Georges Raulet, Georges Lacombe', 'René Clair', 'Albert Préjean, Pola Illéry, Edmond T. Gréville, Bill Bocket, Gaston Modot, Paul Ollivier, Raymond Aimos, Thomy Bourdelle', null, 'In the tenement slums of Paris between the world wars, impoverished street singer Albert yearns for beautiful Romanian immigrant Pola. Pola''s boyfriend, local hoodlum Fred, grows jealous of Albert''s constant attention to his woman and frames the hapless musician for one of his own petty crimes. But while Albert is in prison for Fred''s misdeed, Pola ends up falling for Albert''s faithful best friend, Louis.', 'In the tenement slums of Paris between the world wars, impoverished street singer Albert yearns for beautiful Romanian immigrant Pola. Pola''s boyfriend, local hoodlum Fred, grows jealous of Albert''s constant attention to his woman and frames the hapless musician for one of his own petty crimes. But while Albert is in prison for Fred''s misdeed, Pola ends up falling for Albert''s faithful best friend, Louis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvpsXolyLwcSIoCMdeWbRZjaBbU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54419'),
  ('1094506181935586318', 'Under the Rose', 2017, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Josué Ramos, Josué Ramos', 'Josué Ramos', 'Pedro Casablanc, Elisabet Gelabert, Zack Gómez, Ramiro Blas, Eva Llorach, Miquel Insúa, Piero Olmedo', null, 'Sara, the daughter of Oliver and Julia suddenly disappears. Days pass by without any news about the girl. But one morning, the family receives a letter from someone who claims to have retained Sara and wants to talk with them that night.', 'Sara, the daughter of Oliver and Julia suddenly disappears. Days pass by without any news about the girl. But one morning, the family receives a letter from someone who claims to have retained Sara and wants to talk with them that night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4ELqJSvUTXFyEkZrzQL7WpO41c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475660'),
  ('1146090141487073034', 'Under the Salt', 2008, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Mario Muñoz', 'Ángel Pulido, Mario Muñoz', 'Ricardo Polanco, Humberto Zurita, Irene Azuela, Plutarco Haza, Juan Carlos Barreto, Emilio Guerrero, Moisés Arizmendi, Julio Bracho', null, 'A series of murders leads Commander Trujillo to Santa Rosa de la Sal a town close to a salt mine, where he meets Victor Zepeda - a lonely teenager who works in his father''s funeral home and spends his free time making crude animated horror films - who''s strange behavior seems to point at him as the culprit of the crimes.', 'A series of murders leads Commander Trujillo to Santa Rosa de la Sal a town close to a salt mine, where he meets Victor Zepeda - a lonely teenager who works in his father''s funeral home and spends his free time making crude animated horror films - who''s strange behavior seems to point at him as the culprit of the crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bqTC90SWHyoPvbO7OU01pNhKI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25272'),
  ('893877953658883453', 'Under the Same Roof', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Guillermo Sempere, Juana Macías', 'Daniel Corpas, Juan Moreno, Anna R. Costa', 'Jordi Sánchez, Silvia Abril, Daniel Guzmán, Malena Alterio, Álvaro Cervantes, Cristina Castaño, Ana Morgade, Clara Chacón', null, 'Nadia and Adrián starts their particular world war when she files to divorce him.', 'Nadia and Adrián starts their particular world war when she files to divorce him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24VMAJjGFwtCbdGuFITklELqQuQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555657'),
  ('1007777748732269117', 'Under the Sand', 2001, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jeanne Lapoirie, Antoine Héberlé, François Ozon', 'Marina de Van, Emmanuèle Bernheim, Marcia Romano', 'Charlotte Rampling, Bruno Cremer, Jacques Nolot, Alexandra Stewart, Pierre Vernier, Andrée Tainsy, Maya Gaugler, Pierre Soubestre', 'NR', 'When her husband goes missing at the beach, a female professor begins to mentally disintegrate as her denial of his disappearance becomes delusional.', 'When her husband goes missing at the beach, a female professor begins to mentally disintegrate as her denial of his disappearance becomes delusional.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phJFN5d5qtphQoz3QzP7Z7GLAMM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4973'),
  ('670362800436805800', 'Under the Sea 3D', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Howard Hall, Howard Hall', 'Howard Hall, Toni Myers, Graeme Ferguson', 'Jim Carrey', 'G', 'Imagine a world of incredible color and beauty. Of crabs wearing jellyfish for hats. Of fish disguised as frogs, stones and shag carpets. Of a kaleidoscope of life dancing and weaving, floating and darting in an underwater wonderland. Now, go explore it! Howard Hall and his filmmaking team, who brought you Deep Sea and Into the Deep, take you into tropical waters alive with adventure: the Great Barrier Reef and other South Pacific realms. Narrated by Jim Carrey and featuring astonishing camerawork, this amazing film brings you face to fin with Nature''s marvels, from the terrible grandeur (and terrible teeth) of a Great White to the comic antics of a lovestruck cuttlefish. Excitement and fun run deep Under the Sea!', 'Imagine a world of incredible color and beauty. Of crabs wearing jellyfish for hats. Of fish disguised as frogs, stones and shag carpets. Of a kaleidoscope of life dancing and weaving, floating and darting in an underwater wonderland. Now, go explore it! Howard Hall and his filmmaking team, who brought you Deep Sea and Into the Deep, take you into tropical waters alive with adventure: the Great Barrier Reef and other South Pacific realms. Narrated by Jim Carrey and featuring astonishing camerawork, this amazing film brings you face to fin with Nature''s marvels, from the terrible grandeur (and terrible teeth) of a Great White to the comic antics of a lovestruck cuttlefish. Excitement and fun run deep Under the Sea!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCJiNkqlETnmdbL5wLKHqqXvD7E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36123'),
  ('607089607656127462', 'Under the Sea: A Descendants Story', 2018, 'Music, TV Movie, Fantasy', 'Hasraf Dulull', 'Ali Scher, Jonathan Langager', 'Dove Cameron, Anna Cathcart, Thomas Doherty, Dylan Playfair, China Anne McClain', 'PG', 'Mal emerges from the shadows of a mystical forest onto a dark coastline where she crosses paths with Dizzy.', 'Mal emerges from the shadows of a mystical forest onto a dark coastline where she crosses paths with Dizzy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jIJL0VJ8McvJcdaRgi8AwVbdxwU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551298'),
  ('904698026741901998', 'Under the Shadow', 2016, 'Drama, Horror, War', 'Babak Anvari', 'Babak Anvari', 'Narges Rashidi, Avin Manshadi, Bobby Naderi, Ray Haratian, Hamid Djavadan, Bijan Daneshmand, Behi Djanati Atai, Aram Ghasemy', 'PG-13', 'After Shideh''s building is hit by a missile during the Iran-Iraq War, a superstitious neighbor suggests that the missile was cursed and might be carrying malevolent Middle-Eastern spirits. She becomes convinced a supernatural force within the building is attempting to possess her daughter Dorsa, and she has no choice but to confront these forces if she is to save her daughter and herself.', 'After Shideh''s building is hit by a missile during the Iran-Iraq War, a superstitious neighbor suggests that the missile was cursed and might be carrying malevolent Middle-Eastern spirits. She becomes convinced a supernatural force within the building is attempting to possess her daughter Dorsa, and she has no choice but to confront these forces if she is to save her daughter and herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hxT9XviA3VzUtelHBk2xA6I9FY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375012'),
  ('62515737911809624', 'Under the Sign of Scorpio', 1969, 'Drama', 'Vittorio Taviani, Paolo Taviani, Luciano Odorisio', 'Vittorio Taviani, Paolo Taviani', 'Gian Maria Volonté, Lucia Bosè, Giulio Brogi, Samy Pavel, Daniele Dublino, Steffen Zacharias, Piera Degli Esposti, Alessandro Haber', null, 'An island has been decimated by a volcanic eruption and the few survivors escape to a nearby island. Led by Rutolo, they know that their new home is equally susceptible to such a catastrophe via its own volcano, but they are unable to convince the current inhabitants of Island #2 to flee with them to a mainland.', 'An island has been decimated by a volcanic eruption and the few survivors escape to a nearby island. Led by Rutolo, they know that their new home is equally susceptible to such a catastrophe via its own volcano, but they are unable to convince the current inhabitants of Island #2 to flee with them to a mainland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJs6lDZTuin9FYE3JUWYmUvObxA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214041'),
  ('83672485646354967', 'Under the Sign of the Bull', 1969, 'Drama', 'Gilles Grangier', 'Michel Audiard, François Boyer, Gilles Grangier', 'Jean Gabin, Suzanne Flon, Colette Deréal, Raymond Gérôme, Michel Auclair, Alfred Adam, Jacques Monod, France Valéry', null, 'Albert is an eccentric inventor of missiles who comes under fire from his investors when his first prototype explodes. Even his sympathetic mistress has her doubts, as Albert lashes out in a verbal tirade condemning those of little faith in his genius.', 'Albert is an eccentric inventor of missiles who comes under fire from his investors when his first prototype explodes. Even his sympathetic mistress has her doubts, as Albert lashes out in a verbal tirade condemning those of little faith in his genius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wio7DjsJYzvglk9VYWZbRWV08Qf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95659'),
  ('850537441007605540', 'Under the Silver Lake', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'David Robert Mitchell, Mike Gioulakis, James Terry Welden', 'David Robert Mitchell', 'Andrew Garfield, Riley Keough, Topher Grace, Callie Hernandez, Don McManus, Jeremy Bobb, Riki Lindhome, Patrick Fischler', 'R', 'Young and disenchanted Sam meets a mysterious and beautiful woman who''s swimming in his building''s pool one night. When she suddenly vanishes the next morning, Sam embarks on a surreal quest across Los Angeles to decode the secret behind her disappearance, leading him into the murkiest depths of mystery, scandal and conspiracy.', 'Young and disenchanted Sam meets a mysterious and beautiful woman who''s swimming in his building''s pool one night. When she suddenly vanishes the next morning, Sam embarks on a surreal quest across Los Angeles to decode the secret behind her disappearance, leading him into the murkiest depths of mystery, scandal and conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/771Ey73LqsE9ORJhQCI25rgMXS2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396461'),
  ('779218508002920390', 'Under the Skin', 1997, 'Drama', 'Carine Adler, Karen McConnell, Gus Maclean', 'Carine Adler', 'Samantha Morton, Claire Rushbrook, Rita Tushingham, Christine Tremarco, Stuart Townsend, Mark Womack, Matthew Delamere, Clare Francis', null, 'Although married and pregnant Rose has always been mother''s favorite, it is younger sister Iris whose life is shaken up by mother''s death. Suffocating, Iris spirals out of control and copes by losing herself in sexual oblivion.', 'Although married and pregnant Rose has always been mother''s favorite, it is younger sister Iris whose life is shaken up by mother''s death. Suffocating, Iris spirals out of control and copes by losing herself in sexual oblivion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zE2EAofyZq33fWViMB6bwwHQDHw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77955'),
  ('711004208382290072', 'Under the Skin', 2013, 'Drama', 'Pedro Sotero, Daniel Bandeira', 'Pedro Sotero, Daniel Bandeira', 'Rita Carelli, Mariano Mattos Martins', null, 'Man and Woman are reunited after a long time. Sorrow and desire cannot break the silence. But that''s okay: when words don''t come, it''s the body that speaks.', 'Man and Woman are reunited after a long time. Sorrow and desire cannot break the silence. But that''s okay: when words don''t come, it''s the body that speaks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kX41SU4XFBbeXvVzEb0vbzpkGgO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:698232'),
  ('784058190776350917', 'Under the Skin', 2014, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Jonathan Glazer, Daniel Landin, Nick Heckstall-Smith', 'Milo Addica', 'Scarlett Johansson, Jeremy McWilliams, Lynsey Taylor Mackay, Dougie McConnell, Kevin McAlinden, D. Meade, Andrew Gorman, Joe Szula', 'R', 'A seductive stranger prowls the streets of Glasgow in search of prey: unsuspecting men who fall under her spell.', 'A seductive stranger prowls the streets of Glasgow in search of prey: unsuspecting men who fall under her spell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55wmcXJIDYITr7JDijJTdvwSaAv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97370'),
  ('867088611629378744', 'Under the Stars', 2007, 'Drama', 'Félix Viscarret', 'Félix Viscarret', 'Alberto San Juan, Emma Suárez, Julián Villagrán, Luz Valdenebro, Violeta Rodríguez', null, 'Selfish, opportunistic Benito returns to his home in Navarre when he learns that his father is dying. There, he reconnects with his younger brother Lalo, a metal sculptor who is emotionally needy. Benito also develops a surprising bond with Ainara, the young daughter of his brother''s girlfriend, Nines.', 'Selfish, opportunistic Benito returns to his home in Navarre when he learns that his father is dying. There, he reconnects with his younger brother Lalo, a metal sculptor who is emotionally needy. Benito also develops a surprising bond with Ainara, the young daughter of his brother''s girlfriend, Nines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpNDAqWKa41sSvZP1qqLLqJxr8f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63611'),
  ('678329606827248916', 'Under the Stars of Paris', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Claus Drexel', 'Olivier Brunhes, Claus Drexel', 'Catherine Frot, Mahamadou Yaffa, Dominique Frot, Jean-Henri Compère, Richna Louvet, Raphaël Thiéry, Baptiste Amann, Farida Rahouadj', null, 'Christine’s life has not been easy lately. Her lonely routine is divided between free food banks distributions and wandering the streets. On a cold winter night she founds Suli, an 8-year-old Eritrean boy, sobbing in front of her shelter. Christine understands that he is lost and has been separated from his mother. Bounded by their marginal condition, they embark together on an emotional journey to find Suli’s mother in the underground world of Paris...', 'Christine’s life has not been easy lately. Her lonely routine is divided between free food banks distributions and wandering the streets. On a cold winter night she founds Suli, an 8-year-old Eritrean boy, sobbing in front of her shelter. Christine understands that he is lost and has been separated from his mother. Bounded by their marginal condition, they embark together on an emotional journey to find Suli’s mother in the underground world of Paris...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obziP53V5cVNTQpi9JffGiIfggn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575293'),
  ('425275133729446904', 'Under the Sun', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Colin Nutley, Jens Fischer, Anna Persson', 'Colin Nutley, Johanna Hald, David Neal', 'Rolf Lassgård, Helena Bergström, Johan Widerberg, Gunilla Röör, Jonas Falk, Linda Ulvaeus, Bergljót Arnadóttir, Per Sandberg', null, 'Olof lives alone on his family''s farm after the death of his mother. Unable to read and write, he is dependent on his younger friend, Erik, who helps him in the afternoons. Once a sailor, Erik brags of having known hundreds of women. Out of the blue, Olof advertises in the local paper for a young lady housekeeper, and Ellen, a middle-class city woman, arrives to take over the house and, as the summer goes on, Olof''s heart and Erik''s desire as well.', 'Olof lives alone on his family''s farm after the death of his mother. Unable to read and write, he is dependent on his younger friend, Erik, who helps him in the afternoons. Once a sailor, Erik brags of having known hundreds of women. Out of the blue, Olof advertises in the local paper for a young lady housekeeper, and Ellen, a middle-class city woman, arrives to take over the house and, as the summer goes on, Olof''s heart and Erik''s desire as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlYP62dQzItQnbxM46Kn8LesuPX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52673'),
  ('470158579382419196', 'Under the Sun', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Vitaly Mansky, Alexandra Ivanova', 'Vitaly Mansky', 'Lee Zin-mi, Yu-yong, Hye-yong, Oh-gyong, Lim Soo-yong, Choi Song-min, Su-yong, Kim Jong-un', null, 'Over the course of one year, this film follows the life of an ordinary Pyongyang family whose daughter was chosen to take part in Day of the Shining Star (Kim Jong-il''s birthday) celebration. While North Korean government wanted a propaganda film, the director kept on filming between the scripted scenes. The ritualized explosions of color and joy contrast sharply with pale everyday reality, which is not particularly terrible, but rather quite surreal.', 'Over the course of one year, this film follows the life of an ordinary Pyongyang family whose daughter was chosen to take part in Day of the Shining Star (Kim Jong-il''s birthday) celebration. While North Korean government wanted a propaganda film, the director kept on filming between the scripted scenes. The ritualized explosions of color and joy contrast sharply with pale everyday reality, which is not particularly terrible, but rather quite surreal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ijxeCOlQHRvG3KA9oPxGGRi39s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369769'),
  ('1092640286239028359', 'Under the Sun of Rome', 1948, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marino Girolami, Franco Brusati, Domenico Scala', 'Renato Castellani, Emilio Cecchi, Fausto Tozzi', 'Oscar Blando, Liliana Mancini, Francesco Golisano, Ennio Fabeni, Alfredo Locatelli, Gaetano Chiurazzi, Anselmo Di Biagio, Ferruccio Tozzi', null, 'A lovely, incisive portrait of adolescents in the crowded San Giovanni quarter of Rome during the last years of WWII.', 'A lovely, incisive portrait of adolescents in the crowded San Giovanni quarter of Rome during the last years of WWII.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fM2Y5aceLiey1QDHAEPFeRSbb5P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82813'),
  ('191579092982713613', 'Under the Sun of Satan', 1987, 'Drama', 'Maurice Pialat, Willy Kurant', 'Sylvie Pialat, Maurice Pialat', 'Gérard Depardieu, Sandrine Bonnaire, Maurice Pialat, Brigitte Legendre, Alain Artur, Yann Dedet, Jean-Claude Bourlat, Jean-Christophe Bouvet', null, 'Satan tempts Father Dossignan, who is trying to save the soul of a young girl who killed one of her lovers.', 'Satan tempts Father Dossignan, who is trying to save the soul of a young girl who killed one of her lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBnO3FLBY00Do29B4i7F54I492D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31300'),
  ('212853306059951793', 'Under the Tree', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hafsteinn Gunnar Sigurðsson, Monika Lenczewska, Snorri Freyr Hilmarsson', 'Huldar Breiðfjörð, Hafsteinn Gunnar Sigurðsson', 'Steinþór Hróar Steinþórsson, Edda Björgvinsdóttir, Sigurður Sigurjónsson, Þorsteinn Bachmann, Selma Björnsdóttir, Lára Jóhanna Jónsdóttir, Dóra Jóhannsdóttir, Sigrídur Sigurpálsdóttir Scheving', 'NR', 'When Baldvin and Inga''s next door neighbours complain that a tree in their backyard casts a shadow over their sundeck, what starts off as a typical spat between neighbours in the suburbs unexpectedly and violently spirals out of control.', 'When Baldvin and Inga''s next door neighbours complain that a tree in their backyard casts a shadow over their sundeck, what starts off as a typical spat between neighbours in the suburbs unexpectedly and violently spirals out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hiIYGMGAb5TrP8WnG2XsCjcmVKN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472640'),
  ('91551608279983194', 'Under the Tuscan Sun', 2003, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Audrey Wells, Geoffrey Simpson, Alberto Mangiante', 'Audrey Wells', 'Diane Lane, Lindsay Duncan, Vincent Riotta, Giulia Louise Steigerwalt, Raoul Bova, Sandra Oh, Pawel Szajda, Roberto Nobile', 'PG-13', 'Frances Mayes, a 35-year-old professor and writer from San Francisco, decides to take a tour of Tuscany following a difficult divorce. After impulsively buying a run-down villa in the Italian countryside, she begins to piece her life back together in unexpected ways.', 'Frances Mayes, a 35-year-old professor and writer from San Francisco, decides to take a tour of Tuscany following a difficult divorce. After impulsively buying a run-down villa in the Italian countryside, she begins to piece her life back together in unexpected ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vQUQwdtfPt1Sl2GZrIECWWA0dk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10934'),
  ('1001204262842114605', 'Under the Volcano', 1984, 'Drama', 'John Huston, Dennis Shaw, Manuel Muñoz', 'Guy Gallo', 'Albert Finney, Jacqueline Bisset, Anthony Andrews, Ignacio López Tarso, Katy Jurado, James Villiers, Dawson Bray, Carlos Riquelme', 'R', 'Against a background of war breaking out in Europe and the Mexican fiesta Day of Death, we are taken through one day in the life of Geoffrey Firmin, a British consul living in alcoholic disrepair and obscurity in a small southern Mexican town in 1939. The consul''s self-destructive behaviour, perhaps a metaphor for a menaced civilization, is a source of perplexity and sadness to his nomadic, idealistic half-brother, Hugh, and his ex-wife, Yvonne, who has returned with hopes of healing Geoffrey and their broken marriage.', 'Against a background of war breaking out in Europe and the Mexican fiesta Day of Death, we are taken through one day in the life of Geoffrey Firmin, a British consul living in alcoholic disrepair and obscurity in a small southern Mexican town in 1939. The consul''s self-destructive behaviour, perhaps a metaphor for a menaced civilization, is a source of perplexity and sadness to his nomadic, idealistic half-brother, Hugh, and his ex-wife, Yvonne, who has returned with hopes of healing Geoffrey and their broken marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/414VrLFf8gffMUNTGm0zlg2UuHh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41089'),
  ('996710388621642814', 'Under the Yum-Yum Tree', 1963, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Swift, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Lawrence Roman, David Swift', 'Jack Lemmon, Carol Lynley, Edie Adams, Imogene Coca, Paul Lynde, Dean Jones, Robert Lansing, Jane Wald', null, 'A love-struck landlord tries to convince a pretty tenant to dump her fiancé and give him a chance.', 'A love-struck landlord tries to convince a pretty tenant to dump her fiancé and give him a chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20oQRYfHaSfGGCOKBEh1M1CpgCc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43750'),
  ('1019247811270075458', 'Under Therapy', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Gerardo Herrero, Juan Carlos Gómez', null, 'Malena Alterio, Alexandra Jiménez, Fele Martínez, Antonio Pagudo, Eva Ugarte, Juan Carlos Vellido', null, 'Three married couples undergoing therapy are summoned by their female psychologist to a meeting. The psychologist won’t be attending the reunion herself, but she will give to them instructions about what they must do. Thus, to the sound of a horn (literally), the six protagonists will gradually air their dirty laundry concerning their relationships and bring up issues like taking care of the kids, the different home tasks, money, jealousy and sex, until it all leads to a most unexpected and equally shocking end.', 'Three married couples undergoing therapy are summoned by their female psychologist to a meeting. The psychologist won’t be attending the reunion herself, but she will give to them instructions about what they must do. Thus, to the sound of a horn (literally), the six protagonists will gradually air their dirty laundry concerning their relationships and bring up issues like taking care of the kids, the different home tasks, money, jealousy and sex, until it all leads to a most unexpected and equally shocking end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pRMoVhT93qElOLPy7N4Lt1lyCG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1008003'),
  ('233616106719571042', 'Under Western Eyes', 1936, 'Drama', 'Marc Allégret, Yves Allégret, Françoise Giroud', 'Hans Wilhelm, Jan Lustig, Jacques Viot', 'Pierre Fresnay, Michel Simon, Danièle Parola, Jacques Copeau, Pierre Renoir, Jean-Louis Barrault, Raymond Segard, Vladimir Sokoloff', null, 'Political turmoil convulses 19th-century Russia as Razumov, a young student preparing for a career in the czarist bureaucracy, unwittingly becomes embroiled in the assassination of a public official.', 'Political turmoil convulses 19th-century Russia as Razumov, a young student preparing for a career in the czarist bureaucracy, unwittingly becomes embroiled in the assassination of a public official.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3h7RcBTifVQ3W1yDXWQcnDRLq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161878'),
  ('69347763832143915', 'Under Western Stars', 1938, 'Western, Action, Music', 'Jack A. Marta, Joseph Kane', 'Stuart E. McGowan, Dorrell McGowan, Betty Burbridge', 'Roy Rogers, Carol Hughes, Guy Usher, Smiley Burnette, Stephen Chase, Earl Dwire, Tom Chatterton, Al Rice', 'NR', 'In his starring debut, Roy gets elected to Congress in order to bring water to the ranchers in his district. In Washington, he learns he needs the backing of a key congressman and gets that man to go west for an inspection trip. When the congressman is initially unimpressed, Roy gets the inspection party stranded without water to show the true conditions.', 'In his starring debut, Roy gets elected to Congress in order to bring water to the ranchers in his district. In Washington, he learns he needs the backing of a key congressman and gets that man to go west for an inspection trip. When the congressman is initially unimpressed, Roy gets the inspection party stranded without water to show the true conditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dD1JQAQXhSP6vVZmAbKZ9LuJzOg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85678'),
  ('3483966010981159', 'Under Wraps', 1997, 'Comedy, Family, Horror, TV Movie', 'Mark W. Gray, Greg Beeman', 'Don Rhymer', 'Mario Yedidia, Adam Wylie, Clara Bryant, Ken Hudson Campbell, Corinne Bohrer, Penny Peyser, Ed Lauter, Bill Fagerbakke', 'G', 'A comedy-adventure in which three twelve-year-olds have a close encounter with a 3,000-year-old mummy. Marshall, Gilbert and Amy accidentally set the mummy free, but if they don''t get him back to his resting place by midnight on Halloween, he''ll turn into dust and lose his only chance of being reunited with his long-lost love.', 'A comedy-adventure in which three twelve-year-olds have a close encounter with a 3,000-year-old mummy. Marshall, Gilbert and Amy accidentally set the mummy free, but if they don''t get him back to his resting place by midnight on Halloween, he''ll turn into dust and lose his only chance of being reunited with his long-lost love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgq6xA57hLo6c7vCDClUKs8kpQk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76212'),
  ('532077207642805693', 'Under Wraps', 2021, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Robert Lam, Alex Zamm', 'Don Rhymer', 'Malachi Barton, Christian J. Simon, Sophia Hammons, Phil Wright, Melanie Brook, Brent Stait, Jordana Largy, Jaime M. Callica', null, 'Three friends try to save their mummified friend, Harold, from greedy criminals by returning him to his resting place before midnight on Halloween.', 'Three friends try to save their mummified friend, Harold, from greedy criminals by returning him to his resting place before midnight on Halloween.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RbSSHD0MqQ4SmopPQBRBO0xuix.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763873'),
  ('688570999573341910', 'Under Wraps 2', 2022, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Alex Zamm', 'Josh A. Cagan', 'Malachi Barton, Christian J. Simon, Sophia Hammons, Phil Wright, Melanie Brook, T.J. Storm, Rryla McIntosh, Jordan Conley', 'G', 'As Marshall, Gilbert and Amy are preparing for her father’s Spooktacular Halloween-themed wedding to his fiancé Carl, plans go awry when they discover that their mummy friend Harold and his beloved Rose may be in danger.', 'As Marshall, Gilbert and Amy are preparing for her father’s Spooktacular Halloween-themed wedding to his fiancé Carl, plans go awry when they discover that their mummy friend Harold and his beloved Rose may be in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5HIC0ZdKYYp50frsFXPLG9hGEc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936061'),
  ('173518028970252516', 'Under Your Bed', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Mari Asato, Yoichi Kamakari, Keisuke Shibuya', 'Mari Asato', 'Kengo Kora, Kanako Nishikawa, Kenichi Abe, Yugo Mikawa, Ryosuke Miyake', null, 'Naoto was ignored by other people. During his school days, Chihiro was the first person who called his name. Naoto dreams of seeing her again and tries to find her. Finally, after 11 years, he locates her, but she is a totally different person now. Naoto becomes obsessed with her. Naoto sneaks into her house and stays under her bed.', 'Naoto was ignored by other people. During his school days, Chihiro was the first person who called his name. Naoto dreams of seeing her again and tries to find her. Finally, after 11 years, he locates her, but she is a totally different person now. Naoto becomes obsessed with her. Naoto sneaks into her house and stays under her bed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZrhyb35VYDMCoHcM9BhuEgqT0B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:640090'),
  ('860873847468361463', 'Underclassman', 2005, 'Comedy, Action', 'Marcos Siega, David Hennings, Jeff Dashnaw', 'Brent Goldberg, David Wagner', 'Nick Cannon, Roselyn Sánchez, Shawn Ashmore, Kaylee DeFer, Hugh Bonneville, Nicole Garza, Cheech Marin, Ian Gomez', 'PG-13', 'A young detective goes undercover at an elite private school to destroy an international stolen car ring.', 'A young detective goes undercover at an elite private school to destroy an international stolen car ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOpQ5doAbDaxKyGq91PugsCTOYO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19803'),
  ('913345512982090155', 'Undercover', 1995, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Gregory Dark, Robin Solo, Philip Hurn', 'Oola Bloome, Lalo Wolf', 'Athena Massey, Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Meg Foster, Tom Tayback, Rena Riffel, Anthony Guidera, Mark Kiely, Mari Morrow', 'R', 'A female cop goes undercover in a high price whorehouse to find a murderer and discovers she likes the assignment more than she should.', 'A female cop goes undercover in a high price whorehouse to find a murderer and discovers she likes the assignment more than she should.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKyE0zJNi5TuabHZ0F9AJMH7TtW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45050'),
  ('855772458031561062', 'Undercover', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Claire Mathon, Julie Allione, Jules Souveton Flamme', 'Jeanne Aptekman, Thierry de Peretti', 'Roschdy Zem, Pio Marmaï, Vincent Lindon, Julie Moulier, Alexis Manenti, Antonia Buresi, Mylène Jampanoï, Lucie Gallo', null, 'October 2015. French customs seize seven tonnes of cannabis in the heart of the capital. The same day, Hubert Antoine, a former mole with a shady past, contacts Stéphane Vilner, a journalist at Libération. He claims to be able to demonstrate the existence of State drug trafficking led by Jacques Billard, prominent media figure and high-ranking French police officer. Suspicious at first, the young journalist finally dives into an investigation that will lead him to the darkest corners of the Republic.', 'October 2015. French customs seize seven tonnes of cannabis in the heart of the capital. The same day, Hubert Antoine, a former mole with a shady past, contacts Stéphane Vilner, a journalist at Libération. He claims to be able to demonstrate the existence of State drug trafficking led by Jacques Billard, prominent media figure and high-ranking French police officer. Suspicious at first, the young journalist finally dives into an investigation that will lead him to the darkest corners of the Republic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXGWSH09gLpRKdKloeHXuVAuBaU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661605'),
  ('68870867546749317', 'Undercover', 2024, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Arantxa Echevarría, Javier Salmones', 'Amèlia Mora, Arantxa Echevarría', 'Carolina Yuste, Luis Tosar, Víctor Clavijo, Nausicaa Bonnín, Iñigo Gastesi, Diego Anido, Pedro Casablanc, Pepe Ocio', null, 'Basque Country, Spain, late nineties. A young policewoman manages to infiltrate the ruthless terrorist gang ETA.', 'Basque Country, Spain, late nineties. A young policewoman manages to infiltrate the ruthless terrorist gang ETA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jsHLfJARHuvhEGosGt1zmHQXwd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1215185'),
  ('577210913474497081', 'Undercover Angel', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Romance', 'Bryan Michael Stoller, Bruce Alan Greene', null, 'Yasmine Bleeth, Dean Winters, Emily Mae Young, Lorraine Ansell, Richard Eden, Casey Kasem, James Earl Jones', null, 'With his landlord breathing down his neck and his writing career stagnant, the last thing Harrison Tyler (Dean Winters) needs is a kid hanging around. But he''s in for a surprise when his ex-girlfriend (Lorraine Ansell) leaves her precocious 6-year-old (Emily Mae Young) in his care for a few weeks. It turns out the girl possesses remarkable matchmaking skills, and soon Tyler''s professional and romantic fortunes begin to turn around.', 'With his landlord breathing down his neck and his writing career stagnant, the last thing Harrison Tyler (Dean Winters) needs is a kid hanging around. But he''s in for a surprise when his ex-girlfriend (Lorraine Ansell) leaves her precocious 6-year-old (Emily Mae Young) in his care for a few weeks. It turns out the girl possesses remarkable matchmaking skills, and soon Tyler''s professional and romantic fortunes begin to turn around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/809XqWfUQl73oJjgk00tOMriule.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42769'),
  ('385200360791035720', 'Undercover Blues', 1993, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Donald E. Thorin, Herbert Ross, Barry K. Thomas', 'Ian Abrams', 'Kathleen Turner, Dennis Quaid, Fiona Shaw, Stanley Tucci, Obba Babatundé, Larry Miller, Tom Arnold, Park Overall', 'PG-13', 'When fun-loving American agents Jeff and Jane Blue are called back from maternity leave for a special assignment in New Orleans, the spy parents decide to skip the sitter and give their bouncing baby girl the adventure of a lifetime.', 'When fun-loving American agents Jeff and Jane Blue are called back from maternity leave for a special assignment in New Orleans, the spy parents decide to skip the sitter and give their bouncing baby girl the adventure of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9yKccGLLzpPwRCyfCMjG2oNcbF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12661'),
  ('1106688933438622613', 'Undercover Bridesmaid', 2012, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Matthew Diamond', 'Gregg Rossen, Brian Sawyer', 'Brooke Burns, Nicole Paggi, Justin Baldoni, Gregory Harrison, Kayla Mae Maloney, Martha Madison, Jay Kenneth Johnson, Nadege August', 'PG', 'A bodyguard must go undercover to protect, a tycoon''s daughter from death threats before her big wedding day.', 'A bodyguard must go undercover to protect, a tycoon''s daughter from death threats before her big wedding day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGtJYQZiXI9gP06BeeapvOsK4y4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153133'),
  ('938468305744433112', 'Undercover Brother', 2002, 'Action, Comedy', 'Tom Priestley Jr., Malcolm D. Lee, H.H. Cooper', 'Michael McCullers, John Ridley', 'Eddie Griffin, Chris Kattan, Denise Richards, Aunjanue Ellis-Taylor, Chi McBride, Neil Patrick Harris, Dave Chappelle, Gary Anthony Williams', 'PG-13', 'An Afro-American organization, the B.R.O.T.H.E.R.H.O.O.D., is in permanent fight against a white organization "The Man" defending the values of the black people in North America. When the Afro-American candidate Gen. Warren Boutwell behaves strangely in his presidential campaign, Undercover Brother is hired to work undercover for "The Man" and find what happened with the potential candidate.', 'An Afro-American organization, the B.R.O.T.H.E.R.H.O.O.D., is in permanent fight against a white organization "The Man" defending the values of the black people in North America. When the Afro-American candidate Gen. Warren Boutwell behaves strangely in his presidential campaign, Undercover Brother is hired to work undercover for "The Man" and find what happened with the potential candidate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkPm29sqtEjoekOhXbqxTcgpJ4y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12277'),
  ('894069993874621162', 'Undercover Christmas', 2003, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Nadia Tass', 'Darrah Cloud', 'Jami Gertz, Shawn Christian, Tyne Daly, Winston Rekert, Tom Rooney, Rainer Kahl, Cameron Bancroft', null, 'Jake Cunningham is an uptight,workaholic FBI agent from a wealthy family. Jake is assigned to protect Brandi O''Neill, cocktail waitress, after she turns in her billionaire boyfriend for tax fraud.Jake is called home unexpectedly during the holidays,and must take Brandi with him.They pose as couple to his family, who are for the most part unhappy with their son''s new "girlfriend"', 'Jake Cunningham is an uptight,workaholic FBI agent from a wealthy family. Jake is assigned to protect Brandi O''Neill, cocktail waitress, after she turns in her billionaire boyfriend for tax fraud.Jake is called home unexpectedly during the holidays,and must take Brandi with him.They pose as couple to his family, who are for the most part unhappy with their son''s new "girlfriend"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1KLXUM4C7f7AFylt17GPp7ez62.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145327'),
  ('649284192866801289', 'Undercover Grandpa', 2017, 'Family, Comedy', 'Érik Canuel, Pierre Gill', 'Jeff Schechter', 'James Caan, Jessica Walter, Louis Gossett Jr., Kenneth Welsh, Paul Sorvino, Dylan Everett, Jennifer Robertson, Greta Onieogou', null, 'When the girl he likes goes missing, Jake enlists the help of his grandpa and Grandpa''s former special ops buddies.', 'When the girl he likes goes missing, Jake enlists the help of his grandpa and Grandpa''s former special ops buddies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxAFzoJTUG2KPe4n8WnHYkugq20.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464331'),
  ('255658651876643636', 'Undercover Party Crasher', 2025, 'Comedy, Action', 'Cris D''amato, Felipe Reinheimer, Hélcio Alemão Nagamine', 'Leandro Soares, Vitor Brandt, Denis Nielsen', 'Giovanna Lancellotti, Ademara Barros, Sophia Valverde, Raphael Vicente, Letícia Pedro, Igor Jansen, Miguel Falabella, Érico Brás', null, 'In order to get evidence for her case and dismantle a criminal organization, an uptight undercover cop crashes a high school graduation trip to a party-heavy beach in Brazil.', 'In order to get evidence for her case and dismantle a criminal organization, an uptight undercover cop crashes a high school graduation trip to a party-heavy beach in Brazil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dcoc4C57lCpAzBr2qojFjRCKO9E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1179051'),
  ('1022123403086416814', 'Undercover Wedding Crashers', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Therón, Sergi Gallardo', 'Manuel Burque, Josep Gatell', 'Julián López, Natalia de Molina, Carlos Librado "Nene", Miren Ibarguren, Canco Rodríguez, Julián Villagrán, Antonio Dechent, Paco Tous', 'R', 'Geeky-looking Sebas is a surprisingly good classical musician. He’s also a complete unknown in the criminal underworld, and as a new newbie on the police force, that makes him the perfect man for a dangerous mission: to go undercover as a keyboard player for “Los Lolos”, a cheesy flamenco-trap band, who have been hired to play at the wedding of a local mafia boss’ daughter that a major drug trafficker will be attending. Sebas is keen to take on the mission, blissfully unaware that he will turn out to be even cheesier than Lolo, the band’s lead singer, and fall in love with his sister, Luci. Now Sebas will face a tough choice: remain loyal to his new friends or complete his police mission.', 'Geeky-looking Sebas is a surprisingly good classical musician. He’s also a complete unknown in the criminal underworld, and as a new newbie on the police force, that makes him the perfect man for a dangerous mission: to go undercover as a keyboard player for “Los Lolos”, a cheesy flamenco-trap band, who have been hired to play at the wedding of a local mafia boss’ daughter that a major drug trafficker will be attending. Sebas is keen to take on the mission, blissfully unaware that he will turn out to be even cheesier than Lolo, the band’s lead singer, and fall in love with his sister, Luci. Now Sebas will face a tough choice: remain loyal to his new friends or complete his police mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZBA6UFI9KTS5kZdEtGmw9PqdWZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613098'),
  ('757794663498235907', 'Undercover: How to Operate Behind Enemy Lines', 1943, 'Documentary, War', 'John Ford', null, 'John Ford, Eddie Foster, Martín Garralaga, Cyril Ring, Pierre Watkin, Max Wagner, Osa Massen, Tom Quinn', null, 'A training film for OSS agents who are to be dropped behind enemy lines.', 'A training film for OSS agents who are to be dropped behind enemy lines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kSD3kd1fNsJcv0rO8bEo6CMNtW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360187'),
  ('932168625300141307', 'Undercover. Inside the Bunker', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Pablo de la Chica', 'Pablo de la Chica', 'Goize Blanco, Arya Stark, Juan Portillo, Marta Romero, Teresa Soria Ruano, Carlos Guerrero, Santiago Cardelús, Silvia Hernández', null, 'Bringing to light real images recorded during the greatest undercover operation in an animal experimentation laboratory in the world, Carlota Saorsa, now a protected witness, sacrifices everything and puts her life on the line to show the world the harsh reality she experienced for 18 months inside what she calls "The Bunker."', 'Bringing to light real images recorded during the greatest undercover operation in an animal experimentation laboratory in the world, Carlota Saorsa, now a protected witness, sacrifices everything and puts her life on the line to show the world the harsh reality she experienced for 18 months inside what she calls "The Bunker."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hmZfIhKl84b4z40Vl9F06p4eWd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1317931'),
  ('122478565784540827', 'Undercurrent', 1946, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Vincente Minnelli, Karl Freund, Douglas Shearer', 'Edward Chodorov', 'Katharine Hepburn, Robert Taylor, Robert Mitchum, Edmund Gwenn, Marjorie Main, Jayne Meadows, Clinton Sundberg, Dan Tobin', 'NR', 'After a rapid engagement, a dowdy daughter of a chemist weds an industrialist, knowing little of his family or past. He transforms her into an elegant society wife, but becomes enraged whenever she asks about Michael, his mysterious long-lost brother.', 'After a rapid engagement, a dowdy daughter of a chemist weds an industrialist, knowing little of his family or past. He transforms her into an elegant society wife, but becomes enraged whenever she asks about Michael, his mysterious long-lost brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IyNoYoHcV5a52FhWj6QPxR8cBV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44098'),
