  ('864701165145595250', 'Underdog', 2007, 'Family, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Frederik Du Chau, David Eggby, Gail Goldberg', 'Joe Piscatella, Craig A. Williams, Adam Rifkin', 'Jason Lee, Peter Dinklage, Jim Belushi, Patrick Warburton, Alex Neuberger, Taylor Momsen, John Slattery, Amy Adams', 'PG', 'A lab accident gives a beagle named Shoeshine some serious superpowers -- a secret that the dog eventually shares with the young boy who becomes his owner and friend.', 'A lab accident gives a beagle named Shoeshine some serious superpowers -- a secret that the dog eventually shares with the young boy who becomes his owner and friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5yoIlzQ3m7b3a0zLCf3NjsOvB8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6589'),
  ('726713223132222924', 'Underdog', 2024, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Gerardo Dorantes', 'Fabián Archondo, Gerardo Dorantes', 'Vladimir Rivera, Manuel Cruz Vivas, Osvaldo Sánchez, Eligio Meléndez, Mayra Sérbulo, Martijn Kuiper, Emma Malacara, Tomihuatzi Xelhuantzi', null, 'Two Tarahumara brothers, with a deep spiritual connection and a fervent desire to become the best ultramarathon runners in the world, will see their dreams shattered when they are violently recruited by a dangerous cartel as drug runners, putting their family at risk and forcing them to join forces to finally take control of their own destiny.', 'Two Tarahumara brothers, with a deep spiritual connection and a fervent desire to become the best ultramarathon runners in the world, will see their dreams shattered when they are violently recruited by a dangerous cartel as drug runners, putting their family at risk and forcing them to join forces to finally take control of their own destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXTlI8tWGmB2CL8OQZsjMZvj1cb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1272228'),
  ('861426761440491723', 'Underdog Knight 2', 2011, 'Action, Crime', 'Ding Sheng', 'Ding Sheng', 'Liu Ye, Steve Yoo, Zhang Zilin, Vincent Chiao En-chun, Liu Hailong, Xu Dongmei, Alan Ng Wing-Lun, Du Yuming', null, 'Lao San, is a retired Marine veteran who lives in his world of innocence and optimism due to a brain injury. He assumes the role of a dedicated vigilante and fights people whom he considers bad.', 'Lao San, is a retired Marine veteran who lives in his world of innocence and optimism due to a brain injury. He assumes the role of a dedicated vigilante and fights people whom he considers bad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjlATE3YDhzFertPWToju97F0c4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73897'),
  ('116267479190211754', 'Underdogs', 2013, 'Animation, Adventure, Romance', 'Michel Alencar, Mariano Epelbaum, Paolo Cavalieri', 'Victor Glynn, David Burgess', 'David Masajnik, Juan José Campanella, Diego Ramos, Pablo Rago, Gabriel Almirón, Axel Kuschevatzky, Mariana Otero, Diego Mesaglío', 'PG', 'All seems well for Amadeo, a shy but talented foosball player who''s in love with the free-spirited Laura. Trouble strikes when Grosso, the world''s best soccer player, returns home with plans to destroy the village and turn it into a new sports stadium. When Grosso kidnaps Laura, Amadeo receives the ultimate surprise when the figurines from his foosball table spring to life to help him save his beloved and reclaim the town.', 'All seems well for Amadeo, a shy but talented foosball player who''s in love with the free-spirited Laura. Trouble strikes when Grosso, the world''s best soccer player, returns home with plans to destroy the village and turn it into a new sports stadium. When Grosso kidnaps Laura, Amadeo receives the ultimate surprise when the figurines from his foosball table spring to life to help him save his beloved and reclaim the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJL0oyVmrwSpULCAGaTqs9VMTdM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153158'),
  ('597906237848739570', 'Undergods', 2021, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Anna-Liisa Liiver, David Raedeker, Ina Lüders', 'Chino Moya', 'Johann Myers, Géza Röhrig, Michael Gould, Hayley Carmichael, Ned Dennehy, Simon Manyonda, Khalid Abdalla, Maddison Whelan', null, 'An otherworldly journey through a Europe in decline - a collection of darkly humorous, fantasy tales about ill-fated characters and doomed fortune.', 'An otherworldly journey through a Europe in decline - a collection of darkly humorous, fantasy tales about ill-fated characters and doomed fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AW2J0D0mpXczJKsvboEkIfFeXf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714273'),
  ('12035111993476242', 'Underground', 1928, 'Drama, Romance', 'Anthony Asquith, Stanley Rodwell', 'Anthony Asquith', 'Brian Aherne, Elissa Landi, Cyril McLaglen, Norah Baring', null, 'A working-class love story set in and around the London Underground of the 1920s. Two men – gentle Bill and brash Bert – meet and are attracted to the same woman on the same day at the same Underground station. But the lady chooses Bill, and Bert isn''t the type to take rejection lightly...', 'A working-class love story set in and around the London Underground of the 1920s. Two men – gentle Bill and brash Bert – meet and are attracted to the same woman on the same day at the same Underground station. But the lady chooses Bill, and Bert isn''t the type to take rejection lightly...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RK3O2MMvu7bJWpnauwJDyDDaoO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3565'),
  ('648506735067225791', 'Underground', 2011, 'Horror', 'Zoran Popović, Rafael Eisenman', 'Charles Morris Jr.', 'Sofia Pernas, Jeff D''Agostino, Christine Evangelista, Adrian R''Mante, Megan Hensley, Adam Meirick, Hayley Goldstein, Inbar Lavi', null, 'A group of friends fight for their lives against bloodthirsty creatures lurking in an underground military base.', 'A group of friends fight for their lives against bloodthirsty creatures lurking in an underground military base.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dCCM0kTNpipDzSHdYfsRBlvwH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80195'),
  ('1042831432444648954', 'Underground', 2021, 'Drama', 'Mathieu Laverdière, Sophie Dupuis, Marjolaine Lachance', 'Sophie Dupuis', 'Joakim Robillard, Théodore Pellerin, Guillaume Cyr, Catherine Trudeau, Jean L''Italien, James Hyndman, Lauren Hartley, Mickaël Gouin', null, 'Maxime is a young Valdorian who works in a gold mine. As he experiences several difficulties as he goes through life, he will question his definition of masculinity. It''s with the help of the tightly knit brotherhood of colleagues in the mine that he will find the necessary support to overcome a feeling of stubborn guilt which prevents him from achieving happiness. Until the day an explosion breaks out underground. As part of the rescue mission, Maxime descends into the mine lair with the firm intention of bringing each of his colleagues back to the surface alive.', 'Maxime is a young Valdorian who works in a gold mine. As he experiences several difficulties as he goes through life, he will question his definition of masculinity. It''s with the help of the tightly knit brotherhood of colleagues in the mine that he will find the necessary support to overcome a feeling of stubborn guilt which prevents him from achieving happiness. Until the day an explosion breaks out underground. As part of the rescue mission, Maxime descends into the mine lair with the firm intention of bringing each of his colleagues back to the surface alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7bBE135gG4Zcy2zoP0Mr4wNafg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661927'),
  ('1115413652373416027', 'Underground Monster', 2023, 'Fantasy, Adventure', 'Huang He', 'Huan Niu', 'Wei Wei, Wei Lu, Zhang Chunzhong, Yue Dongfeng, Li Ruoxi, Tang Xin, Zhang Shuangli, Li Da Chuan', null, 'Near a remote town, the repeated dumping of toxic waste causes an underground cave dweller to mutate into a hideous monster. A construction team that is digging a tunnel accidentally disturb the creature''s habitat causing it to attack.', 'Near a remote town, the repeated dumping of toxic waste causes an underground cave dweller to mutate into a hideous monster. A construction team that is digging a tunnel accidentally disturb the creature''s habitat causing it to attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWVwWRLqpS1OaNg7KT0ZecSW0PK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:943344'),
  ('796469109458028281', 'Underground Rendezvous', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Kim Jong-jin, Moon Yong-shik', 'Lee Hyeon-cheol', 'Im Chang-jung, Park Jin-hee, Im Hyun-sik, Lee Dae-ro, Lee Han-wi, Shim Won-cheol, Lee Sang-hun, Kim Na-woon', null, 'During the 1980s, Jang-geun, the new teacher at Cheongsol Village, runs into problems during his travels. The village folk mistake Kong Young-tan, a former inmate at the government''s re-education camp, as the missing teacher.', 'During the 1980s, Jang-geun, the new teacher at Cheongsol Village, runs into problems during his travels. The village folk mistake Kong Young-tan, a former inmate at the government''s re-education camp, as the missing teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlgzNZzGhfxWp2hIZzP1RWwi18M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178743'),
  ('945079655678408055', 'Underground Time', 2015, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Philippe Harel, Matthieu Poirot-Delpech, Rodolphe Kriegel', null, 'Marie-Sophie Ferdane, Mehdi Nebbou, Marina Cristalle, Éric Savin, Sandrine Le Berre, Carolina Jurczak, Aurélia Petit, Laurent Borel', null, 'After eight years of close collaboration with her supervisor, Mathilde suddenly finds herself inexplicably victim of moral harassment by him. In parallel, Thibault has just split up with his girlfriend after a frustrating two-year relationship where they exchanged very little. Mathilde and Thibault have never met, they are just two figures among millions of others. Two people who may bump into each other or who may merely pass each other by. But one day in September, their paths meet.', 'After eight years of close collaboration with her supervisor, Mathilde suddenly finds herself inexplicably victim of moral harassment by him. In parallel, Thibault has just split up with his girlfriend after a frustrating two-year relationship where they exchanged very little. Mathilde and Thibault have never met, they are just two figures among millions of others. Two people who may bump into each other or who may merely pass each other by. But one day in September, their paths meet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hEP4HiXMjKWrL92PgPPV6zhhcq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375503'),
  ('1080028609379685993', 'Underland', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Rob Petit', 'Rob Petit, Robert Macfarlane', 'Sandra Hüller', null, 'Based on Robert Macfarlane''s bestseller, UNDERLAND is a cinematic voyage beneath the surface of the earth.', 'Based on Robert Macfarlane''s bestseller, UNDERLAND is a cinematic voyage beneath the surface of the earth.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FlbzzMee5gVt3yPdL9qExyuZtxGe.jpg', 'plex:movie:underland-2026'),
  ('697425151570122317', 'Undertaking Betty', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'James Welland, Nick Hurran, Fraser Fennell-Ball', 'Fred Ponzlov', 'Brenda Blethyn, Alfred Molina, Christopher Walken, Naomi Watts, Robert Pugh, Hannah Higgins, Joshua Jenkins, Shaun Phillips', 'PG-13', 'A politician''s wife and the mortician who has secretly loved her for years plan to fake her death so they can run away together.', 'A politician''s wife and the mortician who has secretly loved her for years plan to fake her death so they can run away together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAXWOj1qznqWWVcXpZ0JZOgvSp2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10918'),
  ('250295557263238792', 'Undertone', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Ian Tuason, Graham Beasley', 'Ian Tuason', 'Nina Kiri, Adam DiMarco, Michèle Duquet, Keana Bastidas, Jeff Yung', 'R', 'The host of a popular paranormal podcast is sent hidden messages within anonymous recordings, unleashing a demonic presence that is impossible to escape in this nerve-shredding nightmare that haunts long after the last echo fades.', 'The host of a popular paranormal podcast is sent hidden messages within anonymous recordings, unleashing a demonic presence that is impossible to escape in this nerve-shredding nightmare that haunts long after the last echo fades.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F4%2Fplex%2F432cad6f-3739-4390-849d-89c8ea54a97b.jpg', 'plex:movie:undertone-2026'),
  ('108400436359764213', 'Undertow', 1949, 'Thriller, Crime', 'William Castle, Irving Glassberg, Milton Schwarzwald', 'Arthur T. Horman, Lee Loeb', 'Scott Brady, John Russell, Dorothy Hart, Peggy Dow, Bruce Bennett, Gregg Martell, Robert Anderson, Dan Ferniel', 'NR', 'Undertow stars Scott Brady as a gambler just out of wartime military service. No longer interested in wagers and speculations, Brady wants only to open up a mountain vacation lodge. Before this can take place, Brady is framed for murder, and forced to hide out in the home of Peggy Dow. With the help of Dow and a policeman friend, Brady searches for the real murderer. Watch carefully in Undertow and you''ll spot new Universal contractee "Roc" Hudson as a plainclothes detective.', 'Undertow stars Scott Brady as a gambler just out of wartime military service. No longer interested in wagers and speculations, Brady wants only to open up a mountain vacation lodge. Before this can take place, Brady is framed for murder, and forced to hide out in the home of Peggy Dow. With the help of Dow and a policeman friend, Brady searches for the real murderer. Watch carefully in Undertow and you''ll spot new Universal contractee "Roc" Hudson as a plainclothes detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOKzQ9MNQFM36ebVzdp2Wha4rYr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85346'),
  ('468558956315250026', 'Undertow', 1996, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Eric Red, Geza Sinkovics', 'Kathryn Bigelow, Eric Red', 'Lou Diamond Phillips, Mia Sara, Charles Dance', null, 'After his car breaks down, Jack seeks shelter, lost in a thunderstorm in a remote shack in the woods. He finds himself held at gunpoint by a deranged mountain man who lives there with his young wife. As the storm rages on, tension mounts in the small cabin. Matters reach a climax when Jack falls for the beautiful woman and tries persuading her to escape with him. Soon, the situation escalates into deadly violence...', 'After his car breaks down, Jack seeks shelter, lost in a thunderstorm in a remote shack in the woods. He finds himself held at gunpoint by a deranged mountain man who lives there with his young wife. As the storm rages on, tension mounts in the small cabin. Matters reach a climax when Jack falls for the beautiful woman and tries persuading her to escape with him. Soon, the situation escalates into deadly violence...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvagaw02JjXTrf2a2IEEWE8cPK6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290112'),
  ('488917136657333747', 'Undertow', 2004, 'Drama, Thriller', 'David Gordon Green, Tim Orr', 'David Gordon Green, Joe Conway', 'Jamie Bell, Josh Lucas, Dermot Mulroney, Devon Alan, Kristen Stewart, Robert Longstreet, Terry Loughlin, Eddie Rouse', 'R', 'The Munns, father John and sons Chris and Tim, recede to the woods of rural Georgia. Their life together is forever changed with the arrival of Uncle Deel, though the tragedy that follows forces troubled Chris to become a man.', 'The Munns, father John and sons Chris and Tim, recede to the woods of rural Georgia. Their life together is forever changed with the arrival of Uncle Deel, though the tragedy that follows forces troubled Chris to become a man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWjsI848P3kPT0wbVYZ8huydJPW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16131'),
  ('554226040811597955', 'Undertow', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Javier Fuentes-León, Mauricio Vidal', 'Javier Fuentes-León', 'Cristian Mercado, Manolo Cardona, Tatiana Astengo, José Chacaltana, Attilia Boschetti, María Edelmira Palomino, Julio Humberto Cavero, Haydeé Cáceres', null, 'A married fisherman struggles to reconcile his devotion to his male lover within his town''s rigid traditions.', 'A married fisherman struggles to reconcile his devotion to his male lover within his town''s rigid traditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykqPTRWMD046SuNTAXyZnhwDPN1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52799'),
  ('1101423989692272781', 'Underwater', 2020, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'William Eubank, Mark Rayner, Bojan Bazelli', 'Brian Duffield, Adam Cozad', 'Kristen Stewart, Vincent Cassel, Mamoudou Athie, T.J. Miller, John Gallagher Jr., Jessica Henwick, Gunner Wright, Fiona Rene', 'PG-13', 'After an earthquake destroys their underwater station, six researchers must navigate two miles along the dangerous, unknown depths of the ocean floor to make it to safety in a race against time.', 'After an earthquake destroys their underwater station, six researchers must navigate two miles along the dangerous, unknown depths of the ocean floor to make it to safety in a race against time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzlbb3yeVISpQ3REd3Ga1scWGTU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443791'),
  ('730359102042771165', 'Underwater Love', 2011, 'Fantasy, Romance, Comedy', 'Christopher Doyle, Shinji Imaoka, Rei Sakamoto', 'Shinji Imaoka, Fumio Moriya', 'Sawa Masaki, Yoshirô Umezawa, Ai Narita, Mutsuo Yoshioka, Fumio Moriya, Hiroshi Sato, Emi Nishimura', null, '35-year-old Asuka works in a lakeside fish factory. She’s about to be married to her boss, Taki, but one day, she encounters a kappa – a water sprite found in Japanese folklore – and learns that the creature is in fact the reborn form of Aoki, an old crush who’d drowned when they were 17.', '35-year-old Asuka works in a lakeside fish factory. She’s about to be married to her boss, Taki, but one day, she encounters a kappa – a water sprite found in Japanese folklore – and learns that the creature is in fact the reborn form of Aoki, an old crush who’d drowned when they were 17.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXFiV8H24WZxNefyy0bNUkrEPlZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83907'),
  ('881550026532107393', 'Underwater!', 1955, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'John Sturges, William Dorfman, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Walter Newman', 'Jane Russell, Gilbert Roland, Richard Egan, Lori Nelson, Robert Keith, Joseph Calleia, Eugene Iglesias, Ric Roman', null, 'Two scuba divers find a shipwreck which may contain undiscovered treasure, however, their attempt to salvage it is threatened by scavengers.', 'Two scuba divers find a shipwreck which may contain undiscovered treasure, however, their attempt to salvage it is threatened by scavengers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DZtI8eUVJkODVS3VXgu4ewYFMO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102295'),
  ('993796537669212212', 'Underworld', 1927, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'Bert Glennon, Josef von Sternberg', 'Robert N. Lee', 'George Bancroft, Evelyn Brent, Clive Brook, Fred Kohler, Helen Lynch, Larry Semon, Jerry Mandy, Alfred Allen', 'NR', 'Boisterous gangster kingpin Bull Weed rehabilitates his former lawyer from his alcoholic haze, but complications arise when he falls for Weed''s girlfriend.', 'Boisterous gangster kingpin Bull Weed rehabilitates his former lawyer from his alcoholic haze, but complications arise when he falls for Weed''s girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZjgbeCwS7sipil1J221lbjaqGG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42565'),
  ('319865879874525690', 'Underworld', 1996, 'Drama, Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Roger Christian, Steven Bernstein', 'Larry Bishop', 'Denis Leary, Joe Mantegna, Annabella Sciorra, Larry Bishop, Abe Vigoda, Traci Lords, Robert Costanzo, Jimmie F. Skaggs', 'R', 'A crook sets out to get revenge on the thugs who hurt his father in this bloody noir-style crime drama. After being released from prison, Johnny Crown goes after Frank, one of the mobsters involved in a series of Father''s Day killings. But Johnny isn''t certain Frank is responsible for his father''s injuries and seeks help from a sex therapist to make sure he''s got the right man.', 'A crook sets out to get revenge on the thugs who hurt his father in this bloody noir-style crime drama. After being released from prison, Johnny Crown goes after Frank, one of the mobsters involved in a series of Father''s Day killings. But Johnny isn''t certain Frank is responsible for his father''s injuries and seeks help from a sex therapist to make sure he''s got the right man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kPjFZaGrxalI21CeFUNpNqjXpH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85242'),
  ('284466675349614633', 'Underworld', 2003, 'Fantasy, Action, Thriller', 'Len Wiseman, Tony Pierce-Roberts, Christopher Warren', 'Danny McBride', 'Kate Beckinsale, Scott Speedman, Michael Sheen, Shane Brolly, Bill Nighy, Erwin Leder, Sophia Myles, Robbie Gee', 'R', 'Vampires and werewolves have waged a nocturnal war against each other for centuries. But all bets are off when a female vampire warrior named Selene, who''s famous for her strength and werewolf-hunting prowess, becomes smitten with a peace-loving male werewolf, Michael, who wants to end the war.', 'Vampires and werewolves have waged a nocturnal war against each other for centuries. But all bets are off when a female vampire warrior named Selene, who''s famous for her strength and werewolf-hunting prowess, becomes smitten with a peace-loving male werewolf, Michael, who wants to end the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsnQ41UZ3jo1wEeemF0eA9cAIU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277'),
  ('782562604006400343', 'Underworld Beauty', 1958, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Seijun Suzuki, Toshitaro Nakao, Kazunari Takeda', 'Susumu Saji', 'Michitarō Mizushima, Mari Shiraki, Hideaki Nitani, Shinsuke Ashida, Hiroshi Kondō, Kaku Takashina, Tōru Abe, Bumon Kahara', null, 'The moment he''s released from prison, the honorable gangster Miyamoto recovers the stolen diamonds he had stashed before getting pinched. When he returns to his haunt to make good by friend who took a bullet for him, he is diverted by the greedy boss Oyane and his insatiable taste for Miyamoto''s precious stones.', 'The moment he''s released from prison, the honorable gangster Miyamoto recovers the stolen diamonds he had stashed before getting pinched. When he returns to his haunt to make good by friend who took a bullet for him, he is diverted by the greedy boss Oyane and his insatiable taste for Miyamoto''s precious stones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnNofYf7oDDUzF1f1XzDLe6gxQi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60971'),
  ('530678934250543780', 'Underworld U.S.A.', 1961, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Samuel Fuller, Hal Mohr, Floyd Joyer', 'Samuel Fuller', 'Cliff Robertson, Dolores Dorn, Beatrice Kay, Richard Rust, Paul Dubov, Robert Emhardt, Larry Gates, Gerald Milton', 'NR', 'A bitter young man sets out to get back at the gangsters who murdered his father.', 'A bitter young man sets out to get back at the gangsters who murdered his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPlQikmoHV1Rt1n0lwVYXkbWR0I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28699'),
  ('144067854392524518', 'Underworld: Awakening', 2012, 'Fantasy, Action, Horror', 'Björn Stein, Scott Kevan, Måns Mårlind', 'Len Wiseman, J. Michael Straczynski, John Hlavin', 'Kate Beckinsale, Stephen Rea, Michael Ealy, Theo James, India Eisley, Charles Dance, Sandrine Holt, Sanny van Heteren', 'R', 'Having escaped years of imprisonment, vampire warrioress Selene finds herself in a changed world where humans have discovered the existence of both Vampire and Lycan clans and are conducting an all-out war to eradicate both immortal species. Now Selene must battle the humans and a frightening new breed of super Lycans to ensure the death dealers'' survival.', 'Having escaped years of imprisonment, vampire warrioress Selene finds herself in a changed world where humans have discovered the existence of both Vampire and Lycan clans and are conducting an all-out war to eradicate both immortal species. Now Selene must battle the humans and a frightening new breed of super Lycans to ensure the death dealers'' survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jN0uuc8U6M3sTg9zEaliJV60Stf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52520'),
  ('444236802614653049', 'Underworld: Blood Wars', 2016, 'Fantasy, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Anna Foerster, Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Martin Vačkář', 'Cory Goodman', 'Kate Beckinsale, Theo James, Tobias Menzies, Lara Pulver, Bradley James, Peter Andersson, James Faulkner, Clementine Nicholson', 'R', 'Vampire death dealer Selene fends off brutal attacks from both the Lycan clan and the Vampire faction that betrayed her. With her only allies, David and his father Thomas, she must stop the eternal war between Lycans and Vampires, even if it means she has to make the ultimate sacrifice.', 'Vampire death dealer Selene fends off brutal attacks from both the Lycan clan and the Vampire faction that betrayed her. With her only allies, David and his father Thomas, she must stop the eternal war between Lycans and Vampires, even if it means she has to make the ultimate sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1ciDCWMG47gdT4kMyjyQbnLQQn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346672'),
  ('58218867301380791', 'Underworld: Evolution', 2006, 'Fantasy, Action, Thriller', 'Len Wiseman, Simon Duggan, Paolo G. Venturi', 'Danny McBride', 'Kate Beckinsale, Scott Speedman, Tony Curran, Shane Brolly, Derek Jacobi, Bill Nighy, Steven Mackintosh, Zita Görög', 'R', 'As the war between the vampires and the Lycans rages on, Selene, a former member of the Death Dealers (an elite vampire special forces unit that hunts werewolves), and Michael, the werewolf hybrid, work together in an effort to unlock the secrets of their respective bloodlines.', 'As the war between the vampires and the Lycans rages on, Selene, a former member of the Death Dealers (an elite vampire special forces unit that hunts werewolves), and Michael, the werewolf hybrid, work together in an effort to unlock the secrets of their respective bloodlines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJaQG353uOzOqffQ5K2hg03k4Vp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:834'),
  ('842738743732690094', 'Underworld: Rise of the Lycans', 2009, 'Fantasy, Action, Thriller', 'Patrick Tatopoulos, Ross Emery, Christopher Warren', 'Danny McBride, Dirk Blackman, Howard McCain', 'Rhona Mitra, Bill Nighy, Michael Sheen, Shane Brolly, Steven Mackintosh, Kevin Grevioux, David Aston, Geraldine Brophy', 'R', 'A prequel to the first two Underworld films, this fantasy explains the origins of the feud between the Vampires and the Lycans. Aided by his secret love, Sonja, courageous Lucian leads the Lycans in battle against brutal Vampire king Viktor. Determined to break the king''s enslavement of his people, Lucian faces off against the Death Dealer army in a bid for Lycan independence.', 'A prequel to the first two Underworld films, this fantasy explains the origins of the feud between the Vampires and the Lycans. Aided by his secret love, Sonja, courageous Lucian leads the Lycans in battle against brutal Vampire king Viktor. Determined to break the king''s enslavement of his people, Lucian faces off against the Death Dealer army in a bid for Lycan independence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yW9gF7rGn8EoV8B8rxOx1xjxVZf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12437'),
  ('86207275170931694', 'Undine', 2020, 'Fantasy, Drama, Romance', 'Christian Petzold, Hans Fromm, Ires Jung', 'Christian Petzold', 'Paula Beer, Franz Rogowski, Maryam Zaree, Jacob Matschenz, Anne Ratte-Polle, Rafael Stachowiak, Julia Franz Richter, Gloria de Oliveira', 'NR', 'Undine is a historian and tour guide at the Berlin City Museum specializing in urban development, while Christoph is an industrial diver. Linked by a love of the water, the two form an intense bond, which can only do so much to help Undine overcome the considerable baggage of her former affair.', 'Undine is a historian and tour guide at the Berlin City Museum specializing in urban development, while Christoph is an industrial diver. Linked by a love of the water, the two form an intense bond, which can only do so much to help Undine overcome the considerable baggage of her former affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PeaXj2EKef84zEZazxiGL8bXRH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615761'),
  ('440015463662716035', 'Undiscovered', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Meiert Avis, Danny Hiele', 'John Galt', 'Steven Strait, Pell James, Kip Pardue, Shannyn Sossamon, Ashlee Simpson, Carrie Fisher, Stephen Moyer, Fisher Stevens', 'PG-13', 'A group of aspiring entertainers try to establish careers for themselves in the city of Los Angeles.', 'A group of aspiring entertainers try to establish careers for themselves in the city of Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7G9HOjUBcq1NDwff7Mc5GFhINSB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17926'),
  ('855842575067224850', 'Undisputed', 2002, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Walter Hill, Lloyd Ahern II', 'David Giler, Walter Hill', 'Wesley Snipes, Ving Rhames, Peter Falk, Michael Rooker, Jon Seda, Wes Studi, Fisher Stevens, Dayton Callie', 'R', 'Monroe Hutchens is the heavyweight champion of Sweetwater, a maximum security prison. He was convicted to a life sentence due to a passionate crime. Iceman Chambers is the heavyweight champion, who lost his title due to a rape conviction to ten years in Sweetwater. When these two giants collide in the same prison, they fight against each other disputing who is the real champion.', 'Monroe Hutchens is the heavyweight champion of Sweetwater, a maximum security prison. He was convicted to a life sentence due to a passionate crime. Iceman Chambers is the heavyweight champion, who lost his title due to a rape conviction to ten years in Sweetwater. When these two giants collide in the same prison, they fight against each other disputing who is the real champion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8smM97IBBEWmkaUCmkPqysh7k7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15070'),
  ('908039818040537498', 'Undisputed II: Last Man Standing', 2006, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Isaac Florentine, Ross W. Clarkson, J.J. Perry', 'David N. White, James Townsend', 'Michael Jai White, Scott Adkins, Ben Cross, Eli Danker, Mark Ivanir, Ken Lerner, Silvio Simac, Ivaylo Geraskov', 'R', 'Heavyweight Champ George "Iceman" Chambers is sent to a Russian jail on trumped-up drug charges. In order to win his freedom he must fight against the jailhouse fighting champ Uri Boyka in a battle to the death. This time he is not fighting for a title, he is fighting for his life!', 'Heavyweight Champ George "Iceman" Chambers is sent to a Russian jail on trumped-up drug charges. In order to win his freedom he must fight against the jailhouse fighting champ Uri Boyka in a battle to the death. This time he is not fighting for a title, he is fighting for his life!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gMCokqpIJoh6u5o06LlOZWsI3k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15255'),
  ('251181977105331691', 'Undisputed III: Redemption', 2010, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Isaac Florentine, Ross W. Clarkson, Mark Roper', 'David N. White', 'Scott Adkins, Mykel Shannon Jenkins, Mark Ivanir, Hristo Shopov, Marko Zaror, Michael Baral, Ilram Choi, Robert Costanzo', 'R', 'Russian inmate Boyka, now severely hobbled by the knee injury suffered at the end of Undisputed 2. No longer the feared prison fighter he was, he has declined so far that he is now good only for cleaning toilets. But when a new prison fight tournament begins - an international affair, matching the best fighters from prisons around the globe, enticing them with the promise of freedom for the winner - Boyka must reclaim his dignity and fight for his position in the tournament.', 'Russian inmate Boyka, now severely hobbled by the knee injury suffered at the end of Undisputed 2. No longer the feared prison fighter he was, he has declined so far that he is now good only for cleaning toilets. But when a new prison fight tournament begins - an international affair, matching the best fighters from prisons around the globe, enticing them with the promise of freedom for the winner - Boyka must reclaim his dignity and fight for his position in the tournament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8KB77SPA7SyU8eid6TAEpt9skU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38234'),
  ('746735465258422552', 'Undo', 1994, 'Drama, Romance', 'Shunji Iwai, Noboru Shinoda', 'Shunji Iwai', 'Etsushi Toyokawa, Tomoko Yamaguchi, Tomorowo Taguchi', null, 'Moemi is not overly pleased when Yukio brings home a couple of turtles to keep her company. Although Yukio works at home as a writer, Moemi feels neglected and desired a dog or a cat, but neither is allowed in their apartment.', 'Moemi is not overly pleased when Yukio brings home a couple of turtles to keep her company. Although Yukio works at home as a writer, Moemi feels neglected and desired a dog or a cat, but neither is allowed in their apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbTEfjwalBLO13jMxS38208ZHux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101965'),
  ('971320070297177012', 'Undulant Fever', 2014, 'Drama', 'Hiroshi Ando', 'Haruhiko Arai', 'Yui Ichikawa, Sosuke Ikematsu, Madoka Sakai, Sakiko Takao, Masaki Miura, Kumi Nakamura', null, 'A female student falls for a senior, but the senior not really for her. He is willing to go to bed with her, but doesn’t feel love. The couple embark on a painful yet passionate experiment. Based on the legendary book by Kei Nakazawa.', 'A female student falls for a senior, but the senior not really for her. He is willing to go to bed with her, but doesn’t feel love. The couple embark on a painful yet passionate experiment. Based on the legendary book by Kei Nakazawa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtXIODJ0URQp4cHPTNGntGO6WZf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321509'),
  ('460406699629976581', 'Une bonne leçon', 2013, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Samuel Dravet, Bruno Garcia', 'Claude-Michel Rome, Luc Chaumar', 'Ingrid Chauvin, Frédéric Diefenthal, Jean-Michel Dupuis, Blanche Ravalec, Stéphanie Pasterkamp, Sören Prévost, Nadil El Mansouri, Fouad Saadallah', null, 'Sidonie returns from Morocco with a broken heart because of a man called Diego.Then her sister,Marion, a lawyer of Paris,decides to travel to Morocco to give him a lesson.', 'Sidonie returns from Morocco with a broken heart because of a man called Diego.Then her sister,Marion, a lawyer of Paris,decides to travel to Morocco to give him a lesson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zcvocYtrX3rZagn8eITGPdZJxo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365676'),
  ('133313048959971639', 'Une époque formidable', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Gérard de Battista, Gérard Jugnot', 'Gérard Jugnot, Philippe Lopes-Curval', 'Gérard Jugnot, Richard Bohringer, Victoria Abril, Ticky Holgado, Roland Blanche, Chick Ortega, Eric Prat, Charlotte de Turckheim', null, 'Michel Berthier, a senior executive at a mattress manufacturing company, has just been fired. As he does not dare to tell the truth to Juliette, his partner, he goes into debt to maintain the family’s standard of living, showering them with gifts. But soon he can no longer lie, and he decides to leave the house. After losing his money, his car, and his shoes, he meets Toubib, Mimosa, and Crayon, three “homeless” people who wash themselves in the restrooms at the Gare de l’Est. They take him under their wing and lead him to break into his former company in order to get sleeping bags and beds.', 'Michel Berthier, a senior executive at a mattress manufacturing company, has just been fired. As he does not dare to tell the truth to Juliette, his partner, he goes into debt to maintain the family’s standard of living, showering them with gifts. But soon he can no longer lie, and he decides to leave the house. After losing his money, his car, and his shoes, he meets Toubib, Mimosa, and Crayon, three “homeless” people who wash themselves in the restrooms at the Gare de l’Est. They take him under their wing and lead him to break into his former company in order to get sleeping bags and beds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTiuOpaDA3NPxc5bVYdnZIY4awR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50213'),
  ('1049757421939202749', 'Une journée de merde !', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Miguel Courtois', 'Pierre Colin-Thibert, Jean-Claude Islert', 'Anne Brochet, Richard Berry, Moonha, Christian Charmetant, Gilbert Melki, François Perrot, Guilaine Londez, Julie Debazac', null, 'This is an important day for Marc Chanois, an insurance advisor heading toward middle age: it''s his fiancée Sabine''s birthday, her parents arrive in Paris and Marc will meet them for dinner to announce the engagement (her father can''t stand him), he''s bought Sabine a Spitfire, and his most important client is to sign a policy. But, as the day wears on, he''s vexed by an incompetent secretary, the unexpected return of a girlfriend he hasn''t seen in five years, squatters who use his office at night, the jealous former lover of a flight attendant who lives in the building, and his boss''s unexpected return from a Swiss clinic. Will he reach Sabine in one piece?', 'This is an important day for Marc Chanois, an insurance advisor heading toward middle age: it''s his fiancée Sabine''s birthday, her parents arrive in Paris and Marc will meet them for dinner to announce the engagement (her father can''t stand him), he''s bought Sabine a Spitfire, and his most important client is to sign a policy. But, as the day wears on, he''s vexed by an incompetent secretary, the unexpected return of a girlfriend he hasn''t seen in five years, squatters who use his office at night, the jealous former lover of a flight attendant who lives in the building, and his boss''s unexpected return from a Swiss clinic. Will he reach Sabine in one piece?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAVkaUOMIxt7QQPVdJ8khj3WqOF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105499'),
  ('117082944074883788', 'Une mort sans importance', 2019, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Yves Dahan, Christian Bonnet', 'Nicolas Kieffer', 'Bruno Salomone, Caroline Proust, Théo Augier, Amir el Kacem, Anne-Elisabeth Blateau', null, 'Claire Lepecq-Quémeneur investigates the murder of a drop out, found on a piece of wasteland. Very quickly Alain, her ex-husband, realises that their 17 year-old son Basile, is guilty and does everything possible to avoid Claire suspecting him. But the clues she discovers lead her to the same conclusion.', 'Claire Lepecq-Quémeneur investigates the murder of a drop out, found on a piece of wasteland. Very quickly Alain, her ex-husband, realises that their 17 year-old son Basile, is guilty and does everything possible to avoid Claire suspecting him. But the clues she discovers lead her to the same conclusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7J4IhSUIE3niWwtTz9kNBaZrRBk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588990'),
  ('1035683825352987689', 'Une vie après', 2018, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Marc Falchier, Jean-Marc Brondolo', 'Jean-Marc Brondolo, Pierre Javaux, Emmanuel Mauro', 'Émilie Dequenne, Frédéric Pierrot, Wim Willaert, Laurent Bateau, François Loriquet, Florence Huige, Daniel Berlioux, Franck Desmaroux', null, 'Marion does not love her husband anymore. She decides to leave him to live fully, not to be locked in the reassuring comfort of a family life. Dominique lives with his wife an identical situation but he can not take the plunge.', 'Marion does not love her husband anymore. She decides to leave him to live fully, not to be locked in the reassuring comfort of a family life. Dominique lives with his wife an identical situation but he can not take the plunge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LEj3MJnQSZ29XyXYA2K2fVde0C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589435'),
  ('407393170425790645', 'Unearth', 2020, 'Horror', 'Jesse Olszewski, Eun-ah Lee, Rob Frank', 'John C. Lyons, Kelsey Goldberg', 'Adrienne Barbeau, Marc Blucas, PJ Marshall, Allison McAtee, Rachel McKeon, Brooke Sorenson, Monica Wyche, Benjamin Sheeler', null, 'The relationship between two neighboring farm families are strained when one of them chooses to lease their land to an oil and gas company. In the midst of growing tension, the land is drilled, and something long dormant and terrifying, deep beneath the earth''s surface is released. "Unearth" is about the horrifying repercussions sown by short-sighted decisions, and what our children reap from our actions.', 'The relationship between two neighboring farm families are strained when one of them chooses to lease their land to an oil and gas company. In the midst of growing tension, the land is drilled, and something long dormant and terrifying, deep beneath the earth''s surface is released. "Unearth" is about the horrifying repercussions sown by short-sighted decisions, and what our children reap from our actions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nu9tWRJOR9Vgr6nHbBRLHnF3u94.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:678945'),
  ('835246517761266229', 'Unearthed', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Matthew Leutwyler, Ross Richardson', 'Matthew Leutwyler', 'Emmanuelle Vaugier, Luke Goss, Charlie Murphy, Beau Garrett, M.C. Gainey, Whitney Able, Miranda Bailey, Tonantzin Carmelo', 'R', 'In the desert area of Hat Creek, cows are found partially devoured and the farmers believe that a wolf is attacking the cattle. The alcoholic Sheriff Annie Flynn is called by the local farmer Rob Horn to witness the remains of an animal to request reimbursement from the government and for an accident with a tank truck that is blocking the road.', 'In the desert area of Hat Creek, cows are found partially devoured and the farmers believe that a wolf is attacking the cattle. The alcoholic Sheriff Annie Flynn is called by the local farmer Rob Horn to witness the remains of an animal to request reimbursement from the government and for an accident with a tank truck that is blocking the road.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oc0LUTfhDnYIVZRF5AlDZF4tbQE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15426'),
  ('280481458407313191', 'Unearthly Stranger', 1963, 'Science Fiction, Mystery, Horror', 'John Krish, Reginald H. Wyer', 'Rex Carlton', 'John Neville, Philip Stone, Gabriella Licudi, Patrick Newell, Jean Marsh, Warren Mitchell', null, 'A series of scientists working on a new techology to facilitate man''s conquest of space are killed in mysterious circumstances. Suspicion falls on the wife of another scientist on the project, who may not be what she seems.', 'A series of scientists working on a new techology to facilitate man''s conquest of space are killed in mysterious circumstances. Suspicion falls on the wife of another scientist on the project, who may not be what she seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnhW4rBAvPnEb4CDaWOf5zzmVeK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136467'),
  ('331618978490766991', 'Unedited Footage of a Bear', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Ben O''Brien, Alan Resnick, Noah Collier', 'Alan Resnick, Dina Kelberman, Robby Rackleff', 'Kerry Donelli, Jacqueline Donelli, Jackson Manning, Jamie Norcross, Ben O''Brien, Robby Rackleff, Cricket Arrison, Stavros Halkias', null, 'This is unedited raw footage of a bear I filmed with my cell phone. I''m not sure what kind of bear this is.', 'This is unedited raw footage of a bear I filmed with my cell phone. I''m not sure what kind of bear this is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBE8V51zojucBMzTN3DdN9H4Ct9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:312174'),
  ('1092463851652746226', 'Unen canto con humor', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Núñez Cortés, Carlos López Puccio, Marcos Mundstock', null, 'Jorge Maronna, Marcos Mundstock, Daniel Rabinovich, Carlos López Puccio, Carlos Núñez Cortés', null, 'Premiered on June 9, 1994 at the Astengo Theater, in Rosario, Argentina. Last performance on January 31, 1999, at the Auditorium Theater, in Mar del Plata, Argentina. PROGRAM: 1 - El regreso del indio 2 - Manuel Darío 3 - Así hablaba Sali Baba 4 - El negro quiere bailar 5 - San Ictícola de los peces 6 - A la playa con Mariana 7 - Perdónala 8 - Fronteras de la ciencia 9 - Vote a Ortega Instruments premiered on this show: Bajo Barríltono Ferrocalíope. Recorded at the Auditorium Theater, Mar del Plata, Argentina, January 30, 1999.', 'Premiered on June 9, 1994 at the Astengo Theater, in Rosario, Argentina. Last performance on January 31, 1999, at the Auditorium Theater, in Mar del Plata, Argentina. PROGRAM: 1 - El regreso del indio 2 - Manuel Darío 3 - Así hablaba Sali Baba 4 - El negro quiere bailar 5 - San Ictícola de los peces 6 - A la playa con Mariana 7 - Perdónala 8 - Fronteras de la ciencia 9 - Vote a Ortega Instruments premiered on this show: Bajo Barríltono Ferrocalíope. Recorded at the Auditorium Theater, Mar del Plata, Argentina, January 30, 1999.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBp2VnVM8jZqPzWgJJBk5kopVho.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55124'),
  ('216860892991670850', 'Unethical Behaviour', 1970, 'Drama', 'Enrique Rodríguez, Jaime Contreras, Rosalío Solano', null, 'Ana Martín, Alberto Vázquez, Juan Miranda, Evita Muñoz ''Chachita'', Cuitláhuac Rodríguez, Ismael Rodríguez Jr., Marinda Isolda, Patricia de Morelos', null, 'A family in extreme poverty is forced to make a series of sacrifices in order to survive.', 'A family in extreme poverty is forced to make a series of sacrifices in order to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxWyahMrRE90wOqSzjecpNdhfRu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330280'),
  ('199187671079654508', 'Unexpected', 2014, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Rainer Kaufmann, Klaus Eichhammer', 'Kathrin Richter, Jürgen Schlagenhof', 'Ina Weisse, Marozsán Erika, Ulrich Noethen, Marc Hosemann, Petra Schmidt-Schaller, Matti Schmidt-Schaller, Gina Stiebitz, Aljosha Horvat', null, 'Marie is a successful designer and has a loving husband and two children. But fate offers more. When she meets the fiancée of their friend Dom, the two women fall for each other. This comes out and life gets out of control. Can there be a long-term solution?', 'Marie is a successful designer and has a loving husband and two children. But fate offers more. When she meets the fiancée of their friend Dom, the two women fall for each other. This comes out and life gets out of control. Can there be a long-term solution?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ktZgkqpGjbB80wrxrEBZuT3RHYg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325496'),
  ('636622311718375842', 'Unexpected', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dagmar Weaver-Madsen, Kris Rey', 'Kris Rey, Megan Mercier', 'Cobie Smulders, Gail Bean, Anders Holm, Elizabeth McGovern, Robyn Coffin, Heidi Johanningmeier, Daniel Kyri', 'R', 'An inner-city high school teacher discovers she is pregnant at the same time as one of her most promising students and the two develop an unlikely friendship while struggling to navigate their unexpected pregnancies.', 'An inner-city high school teacher discovers she is pregnant at the same time as one of her most promising students and the two develop an unlikely friendship while struggling to navigate their unexpected pregnancies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTLFVY6egfTRhMNAI71LyT0tVGj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306197'),
  ('430720545842711490', 'Unexpected Family', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Li Taiyan, Fan Chao, Lü Shijia', 'Li Taiyan, Lv Zhuo, Dai Yue', 'Jackie Chan, Peng Yuchang, Karlina Zhang, Pan Binlong, Li Ping, Liu Mintao, Danny Ray, Niu Ben', null, 'When an aging local starts to lose his memory, those around him decide to recreate an important family moment in his life for him to relive. What they discover isn''t what they expect — about both themselves and about the mysterious man''s past.', 'When an aging local starts to lose his memory, those around him decide to recreate an important family moment in his life for him to relive. What they discover isn''t what they expect — about both themselves and about the mysterious man''s past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3tNxvZ0eGfVtWRxr0GAX9FmYhD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1305715'),
  ('898225679897985937', 'Unexpected Treasures', 2026, 'Science Fiction', 'John Paul Ungaretti', 'John Paul Ungaretti, Christina Heller', 'Mike C. Manning, Olivia Blue, Michael Dunn, AnnaMaria Demara, Lauren Han', null, 'Struggling to scrape by in the desert, Hartley''s world is thrown into chaos when she meets Sam, a mysterious alien on the run. As they navigate the vast Mojave Desert, Hartley must rely on local legends and an eccentric group of allies to survive. Unexpected Treasures is a comedic, heartfelt adventure about survival, trust, and discovery that true connections often come from the most unexpected places.', 'Struggling to scrape by in the desert, Hartley''s world is thrown into chaos when she meets Sam, a mysterious alien on the run. As they navigate the vast Mojave Desert, Hartley must rely on local legends and an eccentric group of allies to survive. Unexpected Treasures is a comedic, heartfelt adventure about survival, trust, and discovery that true connections often come from the most unexpected places.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F2e5J9i1GDVDuW8E6Q6fmfJ9ZrPl.jpg', 'plex:movie:unexpected-treasures'),
  ('680136048483240242', 'Unfair Competition', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ettore Scola, Franco Di Giacomo, Dino Giarrusso', 'Ettore Scola, Furio Scarpelli, Silvia Scola', 'Diego Abatantuono, Sergio Castellitto, Gérard Depardieu, Antonella Attili, Claudio Bigagli, Sandra Collodel, Augusto Fornari, Elio Germano', null, 'Two linen fabric dealers with their shops close to one another, battle against each other for more and more costumers. Umberto constantly loses clients because of the tough competition brought by Leone, who offers the best prices in the neighborhood. But they leave differences aside when the rise of Fascism places Anti-Semitic politics which rigidly control business like the one conducted by the Jewish Leone, and those new regulations are viewed by Umberto as completely unfair. The long rivalry soon becomes a great friendship.', 'Two linen fabric dealers with their shops close to one another, battle against each other for more and more costumers. Umberto constantly loses clients because of the tough competition brought by Leone, who offers the best prices in the neighborhood. But they leave differences aside when the rise of Fascism places Anti-Semitic politics which rigidly control business like the one conducted by the Jewish Leone, and those new regulations are viewed by Umberto as completely unfair. The long rivalry soon becomes a great friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opLzBKoGIxfGEpZXsBxRtiWqyrU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58509'),
  ('1005961861115186988', 'Unfair: Code Breaking', 2006, 'Action, Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Yasushi Ueda', 'Shimako Sato', 'Ryoko Shinohara, Eita Nagayama, Sadao Abe, Yosuke Eguchi, Mari Hamada, Teruyuki Kagawa, Masaya Katō, Mion Mukaichi', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mE0zSlEpVkFF9OSIEY9Hq11JrqC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:866481'),
  ('1057480853565312363', 'UNFAIR: the answer', 2011, 'Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Shimako Sato, Akira Sako, Toru Yamamoto', 'Shimako Sato', 'Ryoko Shinohara, Koichi Sato, Takayuki Yamada, Sadao Abe, Masaya Katō, Nao Omori, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Susumu Terajima', null, 'After detective Natsumi Yukihira brings an end to the police hospital terrorist case, Natsumi is transferred to the Nishimonbetsu Police Station in Hokkaido. Meanwhile, a series of grotesque murders occurs in downtown Tokyo involving nails placed in the body of the victims. The fingerprint of Natsumi''s ex-husband, freelancer journalist Kazuo Sato, is found on the the body of a victim and Kazuo is placed on the most wanted list. Soon after, Kazuo finds Natsumi and hands her a USB memory stick. The device contains information on a secret organization within the police department. Kazuo tells Natsumi that the series of murders are warnings and suspects become the next victims. Natsumi is then arrested as a suspect. Tokyo prosecutor Katsuaki Murakami appears at the Nishimonbetsu Police Station to investigate.', 'After detective Natsumi Yukihira brings an end to the police hospital terrorist case, Natsumi is transferred to the Nishimonbetsu Police Station in Hokkaido. Meanwhile, a series of grotesque murders occurs in downtown Tokyo involving nails placed in the body of the victims. The fingerprint of Natsumi''s ex-husband, freelancer journalist Kazuo Sato, is found on the the body of a victim and Kazuo is placed on the most wanted list. Soon after, Kazuo finds Natsumi and hands her a USB memory stick. The device contains information on a secret organization within the police department. Kazuo tells Natsumi that the series of murders are warnings and suspects become the next victims. Natsumi is then arrested as a suspect. Tokyo prosecutor Katsuaki Murakami appears at the Nishimonbetsu Police Station to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plSjoUVGLGlCucFalp9DJxL9B6b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104797'),
  ('944425410836827219', 'Unfaithful', 2002, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Adrian Lyne, Peter Biziou, David Stein', 'Claude Chabrol', 'Richard Gere, Diane Lane, Olivier Martinez, Erik Per Sullivan, Željko Ivanek, Gary Basaraba, Kate Burton, Margaret Colin', 'R', 'A New York suburban couple''s marriage goes dangerously awry when the wife indulges in an adulterous fling.', 'A New York suburban couple''s marriage goes dangerously awry when the wife indulges in an adulterous fling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjiHEhuiwhIygzjczbTPAA07cGc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2251'),
  ('305482353636787891', 'Unfaithfully Yours', 1948, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Preston Sturges, Victor Milner, Gaston Glass', 'Preston Sturges', 'Rex Harrison, Linda Darnell, Rudy Vallee, Barbara Lawrence, Kurt Kreuger, Lionel Stander, Laurette Luez, Edgar Kennedy', 'NR', 'Before he left for a brief European visit, symphony conductor Sir Alfred De Carter casually asked his staid brother-in-law August to look out for his young wife, Daphne, during his absence. August has hired a private detective to keep tabs on her. But when the private eye''s report suggests Daphne might have been canoodling with his secretary, Sir Alfred begins to imagine how he might take his revenge.', 'Before he left for a brief European visit, symphony conductor Sir Alfred De Carter casually asked his staid brother-in-law August to look out for his young wife, Daphne, during his absence. August has hired a private detective to keep tabs on her. But when the private eye''s report suggests Daphne might have been canoodling with his secretary, Sir Alfred begins to imagine how he might take his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJ5lV3SuD1yHgBPOfKQaJcoR09z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33115'),
  ('787793177663729630', 'Unfaithfully Yours', 1984, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Hope R. Goodwin, Glen Sanford, Lewis Gould', 'Preston Sturges', 'Dudley Moore, Nastassja Kinski, Armand Assante, Albert Brooks, Cassie Yates, Richard Libertini, Richard B. Shull, Jan Tříska', 'PG', 'A composer—who suspects his wife of cheating—plots to kill her and frame it on her lover, but things don''t turn out as planned.', 'A composer—who suspects his wife of cheating—plots to kill her and frame it on her lover, but things don''t turn out as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYP2jXHbjEshvCYhEhODH7kqevs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50812'),
  ('679996761219969293', 'Unfinished Affairs', 2022, 'Thriller, Adventure', 'Juan Miguel del Castillo', 'Juan Miguel del Castillo', 'Fred Adenis, Natalia de Molina, Mona Martínez, Ignacio Mateos, Gerardo de Pablos, Alejandro Vergara', null, 'Inspector Manuel Bianquetti is forced to accept a transfer to a police precinct in Cádiz. His initially peaceful move will soon be shattered with the discovery of the body of a young girl who reminds him of a terrible past. Despite the opposition of his superiors, Bianquetti will embark on a solo crusade to find the culprit, following clues that might be no more than figments of his imagination. The only person who seems to be on his side is his neighbour, a fragile nurse harassed by her former partner.', 'Inspector Manuel Bianquetti is forced to accept a transfer to a police precinct in Cádiz. His initially peaceful move will soon be shattered with the discovery of the body of a young girl who reminds him of a terrible past. Despite the opposition of his superiors, Bianquetti will embark on a solo crusade to find the culprit, following clues that might be no more than figments of his imagination. The only person who seems to be on his side is his neighbour, a fragile nurse harassed by her former partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WtPRtnlNh3DhKVL231NgO07cUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820427'),
  ('260784114057754652', 'Unfinished Business', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Ken Scott, Doug Torres, Justin Ritson', 'Steven Conrad', 'Vince Vaughn, Dave Franco, Sienna Miller, Tom Wilkinson, James Marsden, June Diane Raphael, Nick Frost, Ella Anderson', 'R', 'A hard-working small business owner and his two associates travel to Europe to close the most important deal of their lives. But what began as a routine business trip goes off the rails in every imaginable – and unimaginable – way, including unplanned stops at a massive sex fetish event and a global economic summit.', 'A hard-working small business owner and his two associates travel to Europe to close the most important deal of their lives. But what began as a routine business trip goes off the rails in every imaginable – and unimaginable – way, including unplanned stops at a massive sex fetish event and a global economic summit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVWVZf3fkx9eNqbHyn9xNlmC2h4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239573'),
