  ('218014096548515813', 'Unicorn Wars', 2022, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy, Horror, War', 'Khris Cembe, Alberto Vázquez', 'Alberto Vázquez', 'Jon Goiri, Jaione Insausti, Ramón Barea, Txema Regalado, Manu Heras, Gaizka Soria, Iker Diaz, Estívaliz Lizárraga', 'NR', 'An army of bear cubs train and indoctrinate young recruits for the war against the unicorns, which threatens the safety of the cubs. Brothers Bluey and Tubby, along with a group of inexperienced cadets, are sent on a dangerous mission to save the Magic Forest, where the unicorns live, and start a terrible battle.', 'An army of bear cubs train and indoctrinate young recruits for the war against the unicorns, which threatens the safety of the cubs. Brothers Bluey and Tubby, along with a group of inexperienced cadets, are sent on a dangerous mission to save the Magic Forest, where the unicorns live, and start a terrible battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEEFo2CpBP1m7zjZzIHG0P6v6ma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587092'),
  ('262751439139217437', 'Unicorni', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Michela Andreozzi, Stefano Salemme', 'Michela Andreozzi, Alessia Crocini, Tommaso Triolo', 'Edoardo Pesce, Valentina Lodovini, Daniele Scardini, Lino Musella, Thony, Donatella Finocchiaro, Paola Tiziana Cruciani, Michela Andreozzi', null, 'Lucio, the host of a popular radio show, is confident, charismatic, and holds progressive views. He is married to the beautiful Elena, who is insecure and emotionally dependent on her husband. Together, they form a harmonious blended family (which includes Lucio’s first wife and daughter) and have one child together: Blu, a 9-year-old who loves dressing in girls’ clothes and is allowed to do so—by both mom and dad—but only at home. When the school play comes around, however, Blu is determined to wear a Little Mermaid costume on stage. His parents, caught between their desire to support him and their instinct to protect him, find themselves confronting the limits of their open-mindedness. They embark on a journey of self-awareness and acceptance, joined by a diverse group of “Unicorn Parents” led by a compassionate psychologist.', 'Lucio, the host of a popular radio show, is confident, charismatic, and holds progressive views. He is married to the beautiful Elena, who is insecure and emotionally dependent on her husband. Together, they form a harmonious blended family (which includes Lucio’s first wife and daughter) and have one child together: Blu, a 9-year-old who loves dressing in girls’ clothes and is allowed to do so—by both mom and dad—but only at home. When the school play comes around, however, Blu is determined to wear a Little Mermaid costume on stage. His parents, caught between their desire to support him and their instinct to protect him, find themselves confronting the limits of their open-mindedness. They embark on a journey of self-awareness and acceptance, joined by a diverse group of “Unicorn Parents” led by a compassionate psychologist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBUtKoEWqrtFWD0vyldo1p96a0Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1438969'),
  ('1142474043576053004', 'Unicorns', 2023, 'Drama', 'Thais Català, Àlex Lora Cercos', 'María Mínguez, Àlex Lora Cercos, Pilar Palomero', 'Greta Fernández, Pablo Molinero, Nora Navas, Elena Martín Gimeno, Eudald Font, Lídia Casanova, Emma Arquillué, Christian López Lamelas', null, 'Isa is a feminist, bisexual, and polyamorous posh girl, she passionately defends her life. When Guillem proposes to be a monogamous couple, Isa is not sure if he wants to change her life and, given her lack of decision, Guillem decides to break the relationship. Living in a world of appearances and comforts, her contradictions come to light and her universe is crumbling at the blow of likes and moral judgments in this web that social networks have become.', 'Isa is a feminist, bisexual, and polyamorous posh girl, she passionately defends her life. When Guillem proposes to be a monogamous couple, Isa is not sure if he wants to change her life and, given her lack of decision, Guillem decides to break the relationship. Living in a world of appearances and comforts, her contradictions come to light and her universe is crumbling at the blow of likes and moral judgments in this web that social networks have become.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dEE5RMTobQ0SnJPrX5ZYG9dXI4y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1078920'),
  ('815995037159846330', 'Unidentified', 2021, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Oleg Mutu, Bogdan George Apetri', 'Bogdan George Apetri, Iulian Postelnicu', 'Bogdan Farcaș, Vasile Muraru, Ana Popescu, Olimpia Mălai, Andrei Aradits, Emanuel Pârvu', null, 'An unsolved case. An unknown criminal. An obsessed cop. His investigation plunges him into a world of darkness and violence, pulling everyone around him into a web of destructive passion and revenge.', 'An unsolved case. An unknown criminal. An obsessed cop. His investigation plunges him into a world of darkness and violence, pulling everyone around him into a web of destructive passion and revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xz3xLY6qh9vkgzXcJVVG5Wmyje0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776781'),
  ('168110849788803477', 'Unidentified', 2025, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Haifaa al-Mansour, Haifaa Al Mansour', 'Haifaa al-Mansour, Brad Niemann, Haifaa Al Mansour', 'Mila Alzahrani, Aziz Gharbawi, Shafi Al Harthy', 'PG-13', 'The body of a teenage girl is found in the heart of the desert, he raised many questions about the girl''s personality, the lady decides to search for the circumstances of the crime and collect information about the unknown body, and solves the mystery surrounded by the crime.', 'The body of a teenage girl is found in the heart of the desert, he raised many questions about the girl''s personality, the lady decides to search for the circumstances of the crime and collect information about the unknown body, and solves the mystery surrounded by the crime.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F95Ip0LhNnclwsTBypGXxsFKXXxf.jpg', 'plex:movie:unidentified-2025'),
  ('1070189246808582421', 'Unidentified Flying Mater', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'John Lasseter, Rob Gibbs', 'John Lasseter, Rob Gibbs, Matthew Luhn', 'Larry the Cable Guy, Keith Ferguson, George Carlin, Guido Quaroni, Lindsey Collins, Elissa Knight, Steve Purcell, Bob Scott', null, 'Mater finds a small UFO called Mator and they have a night out. Later, when Mator is captured by military forces, Mater sneaks up and saves him with the help of Lightning McQueen and the UFO''s mother.', 'Mater finds a small UFO called Mator and they have a night out. Later, when Mator is captured by military forces, Mater sneaks up and saves him with the help of Lightning McQueen and the UFO''s mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6To4oegSvLEW9CTsrCANgko1Gj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171536'),
  ('535090823630785700', 'Unidentified Flying Oddball', 1979, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Family', 'Russ Mayberry', 'Don Tait', 'Jim Dale, Kenneth More, Ron Moody, John Le Mesurier, Rodney Bewes, Dennis Dugan, Pat Roach, Sheila White', 'G', 'A NASA spacecraft proves Einstein right when, traveling faster than light, it ends up near King Arthur''s Camelot. On board are big-hearted Tom Trimble and Hermes, the look-alike robot he built. Tom immediately makes friends with pretty Alisande while becoming enemies with the evil knight Sir Mordred. It seems Mordred has joined up with the Sorcerer Merlin and they are both up to no good. It is now up to Tom to try and use 20th century technology to foil their plans.', 'A NASA spacecraft proves Einstein right when, traveling faster than light, it ends up near King Arthur''s Camelot. On board are big-hearted Tom Trimble and Hermes, the look-alike robot he built. Tom immediately makes friends with pretty Alisande while becoming enemies with the evil knight Sir Mordred. It seems Mordred has joined up with the Sorcerer Merlin and they are both up to no good. It is now up to Tom to try and use 20th century technology to foil their plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkYpoGtdO2Igr1JzAXcoveUldBZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65596'),
  ('1051908819039840368', 'Unification Of Japan 8', 2014, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Yoshihisa Yamamoto', 'Yoshihisa Yamamoto, Keiichirō Murata, Hôyû Yamamoto', 'Yasukaze Motomiya, Yoshiyuki Yamaguchi, Hitoshi Ozawa, Shunsaku Kudo, Masahiro Noguchi, Hakuryu, Show Aikawa, Rika Kawamura', null, 'The Osaka war ended in a complete victory for the Kyowakai, finally bringing the city under their control. Yamazaki-gumi’s head, Kawatani (Hitoshi Ozawa), with Himuro (Yasukaze Motomiya) and Tamura (Yoshiyuki Yamaguchi) at his side, was recognized for his achievements and appointed as the Kyowakai’s main family Wakagashira. As Yamazaki-gumi steadily gained power, Himuro worked to expand the organization further, focusing on internal reform and establishing legitimate business operations. Meanwhile, a minor clash between Tamura’s young members and the Yanagase Rengokai sparked a new conflict, spreading across all of Gifu—another war erupting in the wake of the Osaka battle!', 'The Osaka war ended in a complete victory for the Kyowakai, finally bringing the city under their control. Yamazaki-gumi’s head, Kawatani (Hitoshi Ozawa), with Himuro (Yasukaze Motomiya) and Tamura (Yoshiyuki Yamaguchi) at his side, was recognized for his achievements and appointed as the Kyowakai’s main family Wakagashira. As Yamazaki-gumi steadily gained power, Himuro worked to expand the organization further, focusing on internal reform and establishing legitimate business operations. Meanwhile, a minor clash between Tamura’s young members and the Yanagase Rengokai sparked a new conflict, spreading across all of Gifu—another war erupting in the wake of the Osaka battle!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFA9ZJOmrLsONTKsEJQtnJu827G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1037178'),
  ('206764403960901131', 'Uniform', 2003, 'Drama, Crime', 'Diao Yinan, Dong Jinsong', 'Diao Yinan', 'Hongli Liang, Xueqiong Zeng, Kai Han, Hua Qin', null, 'A struggling, recently unemployed young factory worker returns to his family''s laundrette, where he ''borrows'' a police officer''s shirt and begins successfully impersonating an officer of the law.', 'A struggling, recently unemployed young factory worker returns to his family''s laundrette, where he ''borrows'' a police officer''s shirt and begins successfully impersonating an officer of the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5djMJCzMhRKc3KT3hsGlTJjh2s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33329'),
  ('363795655890085419', 'Uninhabited', 2010, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Bill Bennett, Lachlan Milne', 'Bill Bennett', 'Geraldine Hakewill, Bob Baines, Tasia Zalar, Henry James, Billy Milionis, Terry Siourounis', null, 'Harry and Beth wanted a different kind of holiday so they chartered a boat to drop them off on a remote coral island on the Great Barrier Reef. The island was idyllic, surrounded by a wide reef, covered in palms and full of birds and other wildlife. It was small and totally deserted or so they thought. But when things go missing from their camp site and they discover someone else''s footprints in the sand this quickly becomes disturbing as they realize the island has a ghost! Inspired by actual events.', 'Harry and Beth wanted a different kind of holiday so they chartered a boat to drop them off on a remote coral island on the Great Barrier Reef. The island was idyllic, surrounded by a wide reef, covered in palms and full of birds and other wildlife. It was small and totally deserted or so they thought. But when things go missing from their camp site and they discover someone else''s footprints in the sand this quickly becomes disturbing as they realize the island has a ghost! Inspired by actual events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ai2rCDszwVSJbco0UBzCiOyMbAw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45017'),
  ('755198740565194219', 'Uninvited', 1988, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Greydon Clark, Whitney R. Hunter, Nicholas Josef von Sternberg', 'Greydon Clark', 'Toni Hudson, Rob Estes, Alex Cord, George Kennedy, Eric Larson, Clu Gulager, Clare Carey, Shari Shattuck', 'PG-13', 'A sinister corporation loses control of a house cat infected with a genetically-engineered virus. The death-toll rises during the mutant feline''s rampage, and eventually, it finds its way on board a ship of a criminal king-pin.', 'A sinister corporation loses control of a house cat infected with a genetically-engineered virus. The death-toll rises during the mutant feline''s rampage, and eventually, it finds its way on board a ship of a criminal king-pin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLaXbZi8ZKRhWVTZC2HqBQGEqsZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45937'),
  ('233436477931936330', 'Uninvited Guest', 1999, 'Thriller', 'Timothy Wayne Folsome, Wayne Sells', 'Timothy Wayne Folsome', 'Mekhi Phifer, Mari Morrow, Malinda Williams, Mel Jackson, Wanya Morris, William-Christopher Stephens, Kim Fields', 'R', 'During a small gathering, a smooth, seductive stranger is invited into a couple''s house party and falls in love with the wife. Turns out the stranger is an escaped convict who demands that the wife leave the country with him and threatens to kill anyone who stands in his way.', 'During a small gathering, a smooth, seductive stranger is invited into a couple''s house party and falls in love with the wife. Turns out the stranger is an escaped convict who demands that the wife leave the country with him and threatens to kill anyone who stands in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldPhkZtyKfmUBwOjVzS32ZLBNtU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27665'),
  ('403886885957675901', 'Union City', 1980, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Edward Lachman, Marcus Reichert, Jane Hallaren', 'Marcus Reichert', 'Debbie Harry, Dennis Lipscomb, Irina Maleeva, Everett McGill, Pat Benatar, Tony Azito, Sam McMurray, Terry Walsh', null, 'A 1950s accountant with a restless wife grows paranoid after hiding a milk thief''s corpse next door.', 'A 1950s accountant with a restless wife grows paranoid after hiding a milk thief''s corpse next door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhZ4O5ujhnfeGEfGJZpHTyZysIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89098'),
  ('789350288807555185', 'Union County', 2026, 'Drama', 'Adam Meeks, Stefan Weinberger, Cameron K. Morton, Nicole Carne', 'Adam Meeks', 'Elise Kibler, Emily Meade, Danny Wolohan, Kevin P. Braig, Annette Deao', null, 'Assigned to a county-mandated drug court program, Cody Parsons embarks on the tenuous journey toward recovery amidst the opioid epidemic in rural Ohio.', 'Assigned to a county-mandated drug court program, Cody Parsons embarks on the tenuous journey toward recovery amidst the opioid epidemic in rural Ohio.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F1qqOUFhE5DO12O2MFLdUIOlcxNT.jpg', 'plex:movie:union-county-2026'),
  ('124177222178168061', 'Union Depot', 1932, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Alfred E. Green, Al Alleborn, Sol Polito', 'Kenyon Nicholson, Walter DeLeon', 'Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Joan Blondell, Guy Kibbee, Alan Hale, David Landau, George Rosener, Earle Foxe, Frank McHugh', 'NR', 'Among the travelers of varied backgrounds that meet and interact on one night at Union Depot, a metropolitan train station, are Chick and his friend Scrap Iron, both newly released from prison after serving time for vagrancy. Hungry and desperate for a break, Chick fortuitously comes across across a valise abandoned by a drunken traveler. In it he finds a shaving kit and a suit of clothes with a bankroll, which help transform the affable tramp into a dashing gent. After buying himself a meal, Chick seeks some female companionship among the many hustlers who walk the station. He propositions Ruth Collins, a stranded, out-of-work showgirl and takes her to the station''s hotel.', 'Among the travelers of varied backgrounds that meet and interact on one night at Union Depot, a metropolitan train station, are Chick and his friend Scrap Iron, both newly released from prison after serving time for vagrancy. Hungry and desperate for a break, Chick fortuitously comes across across a valise abandoned by a drunken traveler. In it he finds a shaving kit and a suit of clothes with a bankroll, which help transform the affable tramp into a dashing gent. After buying himself a meal, Chick seeks some female companionship among the many hustlers who walk the station. He propositions Ruth Collins, a stranded, out-of-work showgirl and takes her to the station''s hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9ujw92xMRPQ7dFH6rzKzbenuhs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111307'),
  ('601104314542863267', 'Union Pacific', 1939, 'Drama, Western', 'Cecil B. DeMille, Victor Milner, Arthur Rosson', 'C. Gardner Sullivan, Walter DeLeon, Jesse Lasky Jr.', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Joel McCrea, Akim Tamiroff, Robert Preston, Lynne Overman, Brian Donlevy, Robert Barrat, Anthony Quinn', 'NR', 'One of the last bills signed by President Lincoln authorizes pushing the Union Pacific Railroad across the wilderness to California. But financial opportunist Asa Barrows hopes to profit from obstructing it. Chief troubleshooter Jeff Butler has his hands full fighting Barrows'' agent, gambler Sid Campeau; Campeau''s partner Dick Allen is Jeff''s war buddy and rival suitor for engineer''s daughter Molly Monahan. Who will survive the effort to push the railroad through at any cost?', 'One of the last bills signed by President Lincoln authorizes pushing the Union Pacific Railroad across the wilderness to California. But financial opportunist Asa Barrows hopes to profit from obstructing it. Chief troubleshooter Jeff Butler has his hands full fighting Barrows'' agent, gambler Sid Campeau; Campeau''s partner Dick Allen is Jeff''s war buddy and rival suitor for engineer''s daughter Molly Monahan. Who will survive the effort to push the railroad through at any cost?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSk1CWl7EaHKBNMPaDWGnhRO598.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43837'),
  ('951453102907412202', 'Union Station', 1950, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Daniel L. Fapp, Rudolph Maté', 'Sydney Boehm', 'William Holden, Nancy Olson, Barry Fitzgerald, Lyle Bettger, Jan Sterling, Allene Roberts, Herbert Heyes, James Seay', 'NR', 'Police catch a break when suspected kidnappers are spotted on a train heading towards Union Station. Police, train station security and a witness try to piece together the crime and get back the blind daughter of a rich business man.', 'Police catch a break when suspected kidnappers are spotted on a train heading towards Union Station. Police, train station security and a witness try to piece together the crime and get back the blind daughter of a rich business man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oF9dN6RO2sgAQj1uANJR8ZOTS4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43396'),
  ('856961803444948953', 'Unique Brothers', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Alessio Maria Federici, Fabrizio Lucci', 'Elena Bucaccio, Luca Miniero', 'Luca Argentero, Raoul Bova, Carolina Crescentini, Miriam Leone, Giusy Buscemi, Sergio Assisi, Massimo De Lorenzo, Michela Andreozzi', null, 'A funny story about two brothers, Pietro and Francesco, and what happens with them and their families after Petro loses his memory.', 'A funny story about two brothers, Pietro and Francesco, and what happens with them and their families after Petro loses his memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXKqml7CaEpUQT7dlia5rXNilfA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295832'),
  ('467173536576405633', 'Unit 234', 2024, 'Thriller', 'Andy Tennant, John Pardue, Scott August', 'Derek Steiner', 'Don Johnson, Isabelle Fuhrman, Jack Huston, James DuMont, Christopher James Baker, Manny Galan, Juvian Marquez, Anirudh Pisharody', null, 'While working the night shift alone, Laurie Saltair discovers a comatose man, Clayton, in Unit 234 of her family’s storage facility. What transpires is a thrill ride of a cat-and-mouse game for Laurie and Clayton to survive the night.', 'While working the night shift alone, Laurie Saltair discovers a comatose man, Clayton, in Unit 234 of her family’s storage facility. What transpires is a thrill ride of a cat-and-mouse game for Laurie and Clayton to survive the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8uolIihwip3a0OtQ5gLhjSh8URA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:966822'),
  ('248568609326957212', 'Unit 7', 2012, 'Drama, Action', 'Alberto Rodríguez, Álex Catalán, Cayetana Pascual', 'Rafael Cobos', 'Antonio de la Torre, Mario Casas, Julián Villagrán, José Manuel Poga, Inma Cuesta, Joaquín Núñez, Estefanía de los Santos, Alfonso Sánchez', null, 'Angel, a young intelligent and kind, aims to be a police inspector. Rafael instead is an expeditious, forceful and arrogant policeman. Meanwhile, Miguel and Mateo are part of Group 7, a group of rogue cops ready to do anything to achieve their goals.', 'Angel, a young intelligent and kind, aims to be a police inspector. Rafael instead is an expeditious, forceful and arrogant policeman. Meanwhile, Miguel and Mateo are part of Group 7, a group of rogue cops ready to do anything to achieve their goals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6YLnLaX1jPCw62ICVI5GdkXDkB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98582'),
  ('147717536365670313', 'United', 2011, 'Drama, History', 'James Strong, Christopher Ross', 'Chris Chibnall', 'David Tennant, Jack O''Connell, Sam Claflin, Dougray Scott, Dean Andrews, Kate Ashfield, David Calder, Neil Dudgeon', 'PG-13', 'United is based on the true story of Manchester United''s legendary "Busby Babes", the youngest side ever to win the Football League and the 1958 Munich Air Crash that claimed eight of the their number. The film draws on first-hand interviews with the survivors and their families to tell the inspirational story of a team and community overcoming terrible tragedy.', 'United is based on the true story of Manchester United''s legendary "Busby Babes", the youngest side ever to win the Football League and the 1958 Munich Air Crash that claimed eight of the their number. The film draws on first-hand interviews with the survivors and their families to tell the inspirational story of a team and community overcoming terrible tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWWa20kIjk4B6OtRHqWj41HHmiN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62441'),
  ('248451620197805767', 'United 93', 2006, 'Drama, History, Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Barry Ackroyd, Paul Greengrass, Alan Gilmore', 'Paul Greengrass', 'J.J. Johnson, Gary Commock, Polly Adams, Opal Alladin, Starla Benford, Trish Gates, Nancy McDoniel, David Alan Basche', 'R', 'A real-time account of the events on United Flight 93, one of the planes hijacked on 9/11 that crashed near Shanksville, Pennsylvania when passengers foiled the terrorist plot.', 'A real-time account of the events on United Flight 93, one of the planes hijacked on 9/11 that crashed near Shanksville, Pennsylvania when passengers foiled the terrorist plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3mdSgsnpoi4UiUufdybhjha68t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9829'),
  ('269677241122341270', 'United Red Army', 2007, 'Drama, Thriller, History', 'Kōji Wakamatsu, Tomohiko Tsuji, Yoshihisa Toda', 'Masayuki Kakegawa, Kōji Wakamatsu', 'Maki Sakai, Arata Iura, Akie Namiki, Go Jibiki, Shima Onishi, Keigo Kasuya, Akiko Monou, Yuki Fujii', null, 'Two of the most radical student groups form the United Red Army (URA) and head into the mountains to conduct a training camp. Ideology devolves into despotism, and the URA''s leaders begin to arbitrarily persecute their followers, a harrowing ordeal that culminates in violence and murder.', 'Two of the most radical student groups form the United Red Army (URA) and head into the mountains to conduct a training camp. Ideology devolves into despotism, and the URA''s leaders begin to arbitrarily persecute their followers, a harrowing ordeal that culminates in violence and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isCKuGp0M3FmxAhDGgV8YW0i46H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46101'),
  ('701394104317914993', 'United Trash', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Christoph Schlingensief', 'Christoph Schlingensief, Oskar Roehler', 'Udo Kier, Kitten Natividad, Joachim Tomaschewsky, Wellington Jonga, Beauty Chvunga, Alexia Nkomo, Justina Paraiwa, Pretty Xaba', null, 'In Africa - Land of the ever shining sun, German soldiers fulfill a UN mission. For homosexual General Brenner its a dream comes true: Here, where the people are still native and simple, the German can prove his abilities. But then the virgin wife of Brenner gives birth to her first child. Is it the new Messiah? But what is a Messiah good for, if the UN is already there?', 'In Africa - Land of the ever shining sun, German soldiers fulfill a UN mission. For homosexual General Brenner its a dream comes true: Here, where the people are still native and simple, the German can prove his abilities. But then the virgin wife of Brenner gives birth to her first child. Is it the new Messiah? But what is a Messiah good for, if the UN is already there?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AfA0xZT7nTFnV6YrwQQXpjwGgA2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94903'),
  ('879436318995189368', 'Universal', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Stephen Portland, Akina Van De Velde', 'Stephen Portland', 'Joe Thomas, Rosa Robson, Kelley Mack', null, 'A couple of academics enjoying a romantic break in a remote log cabin find their stay interrupted by someone who has tracked them down, seeking their help with what could be the biggest discovery in history...', 'A couple of academics enjoying a romantic break in a remote log cabin find their stay interrupted by someone who has tracked them down, seeking their help with what could be the biggest discovery in history...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWv3d3J5M53IaeGCkiuRG307GeN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1496815'),
  ('920744784033764370', 'Universal Horror', 1998, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Gerald Saldo, Kevin Brownlow', null, 'Kenneth Branagh, Ray Bradbury, Nina Foch, James Karen, Carla Laemmle, Sara Karloff, Forrest J. Ackerman, Gloria Stuart', 'NR', 'A documentary about the era of classic monster movies that were made at Universal Studios during the 1930s and 1940s.', 'A documentary about the era of classic monster movies that were made at Universal Studios during the 1930s and 1940s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Rz0s0OThL3xOUwDx1sDXbC4UiH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144517'),
  ('869874987968558161', 'Universal Language', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Matthew Rankin, Isabelle Stachtchenko, Florelle Del Burgo', 'Pirouz Nemati, Ila Firouzabadi', 'Rojina Esmaeili, Saba Vahedyousefi, Matthew Rankin, Pirouz Nemati, Mani Soleymanlou, Ila Firouzabadi, Sobhan Javadi, Danielle Fichaud', 'NR', 'Winter. Somewhere between Tehran and Winnipeg. Negin and Nazgol find a sum of money frozen deep within the sidewalk ice and try to find a way to get it out. Massoud leads a group of befuddled tourists upon an increasingly-strange walking tour of Winnipeg historic sites. Matthew leaves his job at the Québec government and embarks upon a mysterious journey to visit his estranged mother.', 'Winter. Somewhere between Tehran and Winnipeg. Negin and Nazgol find a sum of money frozen deep within the sidewalk ice and try to find a way to get it out. Massoud leads a group of befuddled tourists upon an increasingly-strange walking tour of Winnipeg historic sites. Matthew leaves his job at the Québec government and embarks upon a mysterious journey to visit his estranged mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wS5pdSFLjzFzBCwa8kTE368jb4U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:988397'),
  ('396432515448690357', 'Universal Soldier', 1992, 'Thriller, Action, Science Fiction', 'Roland Emmerich, Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Vic Armstrong', 'Richard Rothstein, Christopher Leitch, Dean Devlin', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Dolph Lundgren, Ally Walker, Ed O''Ross, Ralf Moeller, Jerry Orbach, Leon Rippy, Tico Wells', 'R', 'An American soldier who had been killed during the Vietnam War is revived 25 years later by the military as a semi-android, UniSols, a high-tech soldier of the future. After the failure of the initiative to erase all the soldier''s memories, he begins to experience flashbacks that are forcing him to recall his past.', 'An American soldier who had been killed during the Vietnam War is revived 25 years later by the military as a semi-android, UniSols, a high-tech soldier of the future. After the failure of the initiative to erase all the soldier''s memories, he begins to experience flashbacks that are forcing him to recall his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fp0mWrHl1SW9PhP8QcsgYPoVYFc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9349'),
  ('446748774353799878', 'Universal Soldier II: Brothers in Arms', 1998, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Russ Goozee, Jeff Woolnough', 'Peter M. Lenkov', 'Matt Battaglia, Andrew Jackson, Eric Bryson, Kevin Rushton, Desmond Campbell, Michael Copeman, Gary Busey, Burt Reynolds', 'R', 'With the UniSol program budget cut by the government, a gang of mercenaries takes control of the new line of Universal Soldiers for their own nefarious ends. In doing so, they clash with Luc Deveraux, survivor of the first incident with the UniSols, alongside his long-lost and newly-resurrected brother Eric and reporter Veronica Roberts.', 'With the UniSol program budget cut by the government, a gang of mercenaries takes control of the new line of Universal Soldiers for their own nefarious ends. In doing so, they clash with Luc Deveraux, survivor of the first incident with the UniSols, alongside his long-lost and newly-resurrected brother Eric and reporter Veronica Roberts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOI7BWFf16QXViDOXnT2h5BCBW5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10704'),
  ('770726999695595346', 'Universal Soldier III: Unfinished Business', 1998, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Jeff Woolnough, Russ Goozee', 'Peter M. Lenkov', 'Matt Battaglia, Chandra West, Roger Periard, Richard McMillan, Burt Reynolds, Juan Chioran, Claudette Roche, Jeff Wincott', null, 'When reporter Veronica Roberts unwillingly gets involved in a hostage situation and is forced to escape, she and Luc Devereaux go into hiding. Meanwhile, Dr. Walker and Mentor get set with a powerful new Universal Soldier and a lethal plan.', 'When reporter Veronica Roberts unwillingly gets involved in a hostage situation and is forced to escape, she and Luc Devereaux go into hiding. Meanwhile, Dr. Walker and Mentor get set with a powerful new Universal Soldier and a lethal plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAmN4ROrFlOipyccNdiltUAz0f2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27847'),
  ('432326030533999131', 'Universal Soldier: Day of Reckoning', 2012, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'John Hyams, Yaron Levy, Andy Steinman', 'John Hyams, Doug Magnuson, Jon Greenhalgh', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Scott Adkins, Dolph Lundgren, Andrei Arlovski, Mariah Bonner, Audrey P. Scott, Rus Blackwell, James DuMont', 'R', 'After his wife and daughter are murdered in a home invasion, a widower named John now finds himself up against an army of Universal Soldiers in relentless pursuit, led by a mysterious leader who promises to set UniSols free from their conditioning.', 'After his wife and daughter are murdered in a home invasion, a widower named John now finds himself up against an army of Universal Soldiers in relentless pursuit, led by a mysterious leader who promises to set UniSols free from their conditioning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pefZa0U5h0avmdvRwWB4xjMFl6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122857'),
  ('36161537693639986', 'Universal Soldier: Regeneration', 2010, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'John Hyams, Peter Hyams, Franklin A. Vallette', 'Victor Ostrovsky', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Dolph Lundgren, Andrei Arlovski, Mike Pyle, Corey Johnson, Garry Cooper, Emily Joyce, Zahari Baharov', 'R', 'When terrorists threaten nuclear catastrophe at Chernobyl, the world''s only hope is to reactivate decommissioned Universal Soldier Luc Deveraux. Rearmed and reprogrammed, Deveraux must take on his nemesis from the original Universal Soldier and a next-generation "UniSol" that seems almost unstoppable.', 'When terrorists threaten nuclear catastrophe at Chernobyl, the world''s only hope is to reactivate decommissioned Universal Soldier Luc Deveraux. Rearmed and reprogrammed, Deveraux must take on his nemesis from the original Universal Soldier and a next-generation "UniSol" that seems almost unstoppable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYLzRwCcCyTVKGBRAiHEW7NOEni.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28510'),
  ('853923434915676981', 'Universal Soldier: The Return', 1999, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Mic Rodgers, Mike Benson, Rebecca Strickland', 'William Malone, John Fasano', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Kiana Tom, Bill Goldberg, Michael Jai White, Heidi Schanz, Xander Berkeley, Justin Lazard, Daniel von Bargen', 'R', 'Luc Deveraux, the heroic former Universal Soldier, is about to be thrown into action once again. When SETH, the supercomputer-controlled ultra-warrior, decides to take revenge and destroy its creators, only Luc can stop it. All hell breaks loose as Luc battles SETH and a deadly team of perfect soldiers in a struggle that pits man against machine and good against evil.', 'Luc Deveraux, the heroic former Universal Soldier, is about to be thrown into action once again. When SETH, the supercomputer-controlled ultra-warrior, decides to take revenge and destroy its creators, only Luc can stop it. All hell breaks loose as Luc battles SETH and a deadly team of perfect soldiers in a struggle that pits man against machine and good against evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlcPJK0Me8aUtDPwk3TqN2RdKH4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10366'),
  ('714613130457591713', 'Universal Soldiers', 2007, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Griff Furst, Justin Jones', 'Geoff Meed', 'Kristen Quintrall, Dario Deak, Jason S. Gray, Rick Malambri, Angela Vitale, Kevin Kazakoff, Randy Mulkey, Cameron Gordon', null, 'Set on an island in an undisclosed location, a top secret U.S. government program to create genetically modified super soldiers goes awry when the unstable test subjects escape from their holding cells and wreak havoc.', 'Set on an island in an undisclosed location, a top secret U.S. government program to create genetically modified super soldiers goes awry when the unstable test subjects escape from their holding cells and wreak havoc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1sLNCOW7kTYE6FBME49gWiBI7Nq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89609'),
  ('37003958465780114', 'Universe', 1960, 'Documentary', 'Roman Kroitor, Colin Low', 'Colin Low, Roman Kroitor', 'Douglas Rain, Donald MacRae', null, 'A triumph of film art, creating on the screen a vast, awe-inspiring picture of the universe as it would appear to a voyager through space, this film was among the sources of inspiration used by Stanley Kubrick for his 2001: A Space Odyssey. Realistic animation takes you into far regions of space, beyond the reach of the strongest telescope, past Moon, Sun, and Milky Way, into galaxies yet unfathomed.', 'A triumph of film art, creating on the screen a vast, awe-inspiring picture of the universe as it would appear to a voyager through space, this film was among the sources of inspiration used by Stanley Kubrick for his 2001: A Space Odyssey. Realistic animation takes you into far regions of space, beyond the reach of the strongest telescope, past Moon, Sun, and Milky Way, into galaxies yet unfathomed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTMAMasgOF5wz9LXbvF9qiRGQuc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178729'),
  ('745830582881570882', 'Universe K23', 2023, null, 'FLAKKA', null, 'Kenia Os', null, 'Six girls who take her through different versions of herself, Kenia Os will have to face her emotions while trying to maintain the balance between the real and the virtual.', 'Six girls who take her through different versions of herself, Kenia Os will have to face her emotions while trying to maintain the balance between the real and the virtual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kK8hdelbE4Z63Slhq4dkJtNEbaY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1131512'),
  ('1078709455675441682', 'Universitari - Molto più che amici', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Federico Moccia, Daniele Poli', 'Federico Moccia, Ilaria Carlino', 'Simone Riccioni, Brice Martinet, Primo Reggiani, Nadir Caselli, Sara Cardinaletti, Maria Chiara Centorami, Enrico Silvestrin, Barbara De Rossi', null, 'Living among boys is easy, each of them with their own mess, unregimented lifestyle, and unique "method of study." The male universe in which they live, however, is about to be invaded by women. Giorgia is independent and receives little attention from her parents; Francesca is in a doomed relationship with an older professor, while Emma wants to be a famous performer. In this new mixed arrangement house, each character finds their place as they establish a confusing, but fun and tumultuous extended family - a family which none of them has ever truly had.', 'Living among boys is easy, each of them with their own mess, unregimented lifestyle, and unique "method of study." The male universe in which they live, however, is about to be invaded by women. Giorgia is independent and receives little attention from her parents; Francesca is in a doomed relationship with an older professor, while Emma wants to be a famous performer. In this new mixed arrangement house, each character finds their place as they establish a confusing, but fun and tumultuous extended family - a family which none of them has ever truly had.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VdIbcjNcF5suMJWvCWZdc788O7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224178'),
  ('594980126162892900', 'University of Laughs', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mamoru Hoshi, Hiroshi Takase', 'Koki Mitani', 'Koji Yakusho, Goro Inagaki, Masaya Takahashi, Masao Komatsu, Tae Kimura, Ai Kato', null, 'In pre-war Japan, a government censor tries to make the writer for a theater troupe alter his comedic script. As they work with and against each other, the script ends up developing in unexpected ways.', 'In pre-war Japan, a government censor tries to make the writer for a theater troupe alter his comedic script. As they work with and against each other, the script ends up developing in unexpected ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWxgDZMkX8xrZEqQcA9H3ik4Fwh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63086'),
