  ('813206697042109112', 'Unknown Dimension: The Story of Paranormal Activity', 2021, 'Documentary, Horror', 'Joe Bandelli', 'Joe Bandelli', 'Lauren Bittner, Oren Peli, Brit Shaw, Katie Featherston, Jason Blum, Akiva Goldsman, Christopher Landon, Ashley Brucks', null, 'A deep dive into the making of the Paranormal Activity films with first time ever interviews with cast and crew, never-before-seen footage from the movies, and a preview of the seventh installment in the franchise.', 'A deep dive into the making of the Paranormal Activity films with first time ever interviews with cast and crew, never-before-seen footage from the movies, and a preview of the seventh installment in the franchise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10a5miRZ8FMNCiPC8PIc0sAdBlk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869434'),
