  ('20224549718484084', 'Unknown Number: The High School Catfish', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Skye Borgman, Bryan Gosline', null, 'Lauryn Licari, Owen McKenny, Sophie Weber, Macy Johnston, Shawn Licari, Kendra Licari, Dave McKenny, Jill McKenny', 'R', 'Vulgar, taunting texts blow up the phones of a teen and her boyfriend. Who''s sending them — and why? This twisty documentary reveals the shocking answer.', 'Vulgar, taunting texts blow up the phones of a teen and her boyfriend. Who''s sending them — and why? This twisty documentary reveals the shocking answer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nu3LtgefE2lsgYw1hxHZFoBXk9U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1517772'),
  ('923849673472990132', 'Unknown Origins', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'David Galán Galindo, Rafael Carmona, Christian Jorge ''Krykry'' García', 'David Galán Galindo, Fernando Navarro', 'Javier Rey, Verónica Echegui, Brays Efe, Antonio Resines, Álex García, Carlos Areces, Ernesto Alterio, Leonardo Sbaraglia', null, 'In Madrid, Spain, a mysterious serial killer ruthlessly murders his victims by recreating the first appearance of several comic book superheroes. Cosme, a veteran police inspector who is about to retire, works on the case along with the tormented inspector David Valentín and his own son Jorge Elías, a nerdy young man who owns a comic book store.', 'In Madrid, Spain, a mysterious serial killer ruthlessly murders his victims by recreating the first appearance of several comic book superheroes. Cosme, a veteran police inspector who is about to retire, works on the case along with the tormented inspector David Valentín and his own son Jorge Elías, a nerdy young man who owns a comic book store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJHSParlylICnI7DuuI54nfTPRR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438396'),
