  ('328775684282679200', 'Unknown Soldier', 2017, 'War, Drama', 'Aku Louhimies, Iiris Orasmaa, Tuula Nikkola', 'Aku Louhimies, Jari Rantala', 'Eero Aho, Johannes Holopainen, Jussi Vatanen, Aku Hirviniemi, Hannes Suominen, Arttu Kapulainen, Paula Vesala, Samuli Vauramo', null, 'The film follows Finnish army machine gun company in Continuation War against Soviet Union, 1941–1944. Based on Väinö Linna''s best selling novel Tuntematon Sotilas (The Unknown Soldier) and the novel''s uncensored version, Sotaromaani (A War Novel).', 'The film follows Finnish army machine gun company in Continuation War against Soviet Union, 1941–1944. Based on Väinö Linna''s best selling novel Tuntematon Sotilas (The Unknown Soldier) and the novel''s uncensored version, Sotaromaani (A War Novel).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dR37hrF6YDMSJCT4r30tOYzVath.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400728'),
