  ('1103942655944025054', 'Unknown: Cosmic Time Machine', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Shai Gal', null, 'Joe Biden, Amber Straughn, Thomas Zurbuchen, Becky Smethurst, Scarlin Hernandez, Alyssa Pagan, Javier Alvarez Marquez, Mike Wenz', 'PG-13', 'The James Webb Telescope stirs imaginations with vivid photos of distant galaxies. This documentary tracks its historic journey from inception to launch.', 'The James Webb Telescope stirs imaginations with vivid photos of distant galaxies. This documentary tracks its historic journey from inception to launch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZxroOwIaD6JGCYraNEJKddOUWp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1128719'),
