  ('822888914245891567', 'Unlawful Entry', 1992, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Jonathan Kaplan, Jamie Anderson', 'Lewis Colick', 'Kurt Russell, Ray Liotta, Madeleine Stowe, Roger E. Mosley, Ken Lerner, Deborah Offner, Johnny Ray McGhee, Carmen Argenziano', 'R', 'Happily married Michael and Karen Carr call the police after Karen is held at knife point during a failed robbery attempt in their home. Before long, one of the responding officers, Officer Pete Davis, helps arrange the installation of a new security system, taking extra interest in the couple''s case. As a result, the grateful Carrs invite him to stay for dinner and they strike up an unexpected friendship. However, as the lonely policeman develops an intense fixation on Karen, his take on friendship develops into a dangerous obsession soon becoming the Carrs'' worst nightmare.', 'Happily married Michael and Karen Carr call the police after Karen is held at knife point during a failed robbery attempt in their home. Before long, one of the responding officers, Officer Pete Davis, helps arrange the installation of a new security system, taking extra interest in the couple''s case. As a result, the grateful Carrs invite him to stay for dinner and they strike up an unexpected friendship. However, as the lonely policeman develops an intense fixation on Karen, his take on friendship develops into a dangerous obsession soon becoming the Carrs'' worst nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dvw1Pkt0tk8tvXy61cMwOaPgkyb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17494'),
  ('912826361597188862', 'Unleashed', 2005, 'Action, Crime', 'Pierre Morel, Louis Leterrier', null, 'Jet Li, Morgan Freeman, Bob Hoskins, Kerry Condon, Vincent Regan, Dylan Brown, Tamer Hassan, Phyllida Law', 'R', 'Raised as a slave, Danny is used to fighting for his survival. In fact, his "master," Bart, thinks of him as a pet and goes as far as leashing him with a collar so they can make money in fight clubs, where Danny is the main contender. When Bart''s crew is in a car accident, Danny escapes and meets a blind, kindhearted piano tuner who takes him in and uses music to free the fighter''s long-buried heart.', 'Raised as a slave, Danny is used to fighting for his survival. In fact, his "master," Bart, thinks of him as a pet and goes as far as leashing him with a collar so they can make money in fight clubs, where Danny is the main contender. When Bart''s crew is in a car accident, Danny escapes and meets a blind, kindhearted piano tuner who takes him in and uses music to free the fighter''s long-buried heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gghvmS3UxtOw1UHIgYjpeZNxHil.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10027'),
  ('438422765591793389', 'Unleashed', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Finn Taylor, John Morse, Brendon Breese', 'Finn Taylor', 'Kate Micucci, Justin Chatwin, Steve Howey, Hana Mae Lee, Josh Brener, Illeana Douglas, Sean Astin, Mark Strano', null, 'When a cosmic event turns Emma''s dog and cat into two perfect guys, Emma reconsiders her outlook on dating, hilariously works out her trust issues, and ultimately learns to love herself.', 'When a cosmic event turns Emma''s dog and cat into two perfect guys, Emma reconsiders her outlook on dating, hilariously works out her trust issues, and ultimately learns to love herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpTg32caIadhYln2cLRKHWDkGHQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345937'),
  ('225741897038289741', 'Unleashing Mr. Darcy', 2016, 'Romance, TV Movie, Comedy', 'David Winning, Paul Turner, David Heimbecker', 'Teena Booth', 'Cindy Busby, Ryan Paevey, Frances Fisher, Elizabeth McLaughlin, Ryan Kennedy, Tammy Gillis, Sarah Desjardins, Ty Wood', null, 'Fishing for direction in life, Elizabeth gets the opportunity of showing her dog in a fancy New York dog show. The judge, Donovan Darcy, comes across as aristocratic and rude, and a chain of misunderstandings unfold during the competition, complicating their attraction to one another.', 'Fishing for direction in life, Elizabeth gets the opportunity of showing her dog in a fancy New York dog show. The judge, Donovan Darcy, comes across as aristocratic and rude, and a chain of misunderstandings unfold during the competition, complicating their attraction to one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sm6ifWF8XBIu2BhQ39VdJflS4t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374609'),
  ('107159430451634885', 'Unlikely Angel', 1996, 'TV Movie, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Michael Switzer, Robert Draper', null, 'Dolly Parton, Roddy McDowall, Allison Mack, Eli Marienthal, Brian Kerwin, Maria del Mar', null, 'A country singer dies prematurely, but cannot enter heaven until she performs a good deed back on earth.', 'A country singer dies prematurely, but cannot enter heaven until she performs a good deed back on earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUjTs3Ubcj6QXL67wLWh3tvTWsS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103409'),
  ('370067002233396117', 'Unlikely Revolutionaries', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Lucio Pellegrini, Alessandro Casale, Gian Enrico Bianchi', 'Lucio Pellegrini, Michele Pellegrini, Francesco Cenni', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Fabio Volo, Giuseppe Battiston, Claudia Pandolfi, Paolo Sassanelli, Giorgio Tirabassi, Teco Celio, Fausto Maria Sciarappa', null, 'Five ordinary people disillusioned with politics—a perennial temp, a docker, a university professor, a TV reporter, and a convict—decide to kidnap a politician, to dispense justice and use the ransom money to compensate the family of a blue-collar worker who died in workplace accident.', 'Five ordinary people disillusioned with politics—a perennial temp, a docker, a university professor, a TV reporter, and a convict—decide to kidnap a politician, to dispense justice and use the ransom money to compensate the family of a blue-collar worker who died in workplace accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nD0LlRLKq2VMhCENKaX6FIczu4N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56041'),
  ('1076184456954221750', 'Unlock Your Heart', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hiroshi Iwanaga, Rin Shuto', 'Rin Shuto', 'Anna Yamada, Haruka Imou, Ryūto Sakuma, Miu Suzuki, Yuka Itaya, Misako Tanaka, Taketo Tanaka, Masato Hagiwara', null, 'Ai has had a crush forever on her classmate Tatoe. When she finds out that Tatoe is in a secret relationship with another girl, she sets out to sabotage their plans for the future.', 'Ai has had a crush forever on her classmate Tatoe. When she finds out that Tatoe is in a secret relationship with another girl, she sets out to sabotage their plans for the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AsGnZpJKqPqayWaFPEJLneefWkP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796234'),
  ('107867107620194230', 'Unlocked', 2017, 'Action, Thriller', 'Greg Powell, Michael Apted, George Richmond', 'Peter O''Brien', 'Noomi Rapace, Orlando Bloom, Michael Douglas, John Malkovich, Toni Collette, Matthew Marsh, Makram J. Khoury, Brian Caspe', 'R', 'After failing to apprehend the terrorist behind a Paris attack that claimed dozens of lives, CIA agent Alice Racine is forced to live in London as a caseworker. Her mentor unexpectedly calls her back into action when the CIA discovers that another attack is imminent. Alice soon learns that the classified information she''s uncovered has been compromised...', 'After failing to apprehend the terrorist behind a Paris attack that claimed dozens of lives, CIA agent Alice Racine is forced to live in London as a caseworker. Her mentor unexpectedly calls her back into action when the CIA discovers that another attack is imminent. Alice soon learns that the classified information she''s uncovered has been compromised...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBDLdEraxCBKGmOPb6pJPYiDQh1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291276'),
  ('1033097667273396182', 'Unlocked', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Kim Tae-joon, Bae Il-hyuck, Kim Yong-seong', 'Kim Tae-joon', 'Chun Woo-hee, Yim Si-wan, Kim Hie-won, Park Ho-san, Kim Ye-won, Jeon Jin-oh, Oh Hyun-kyung, Ryu Sung-hyun', null, 'A woman''s life is turned upside-down when a dangerous man gets a hold of her lost cell phone and uses it to track her every move.', 'A woman''s life is turned upside-down when a dangerous man gets a hold of her lost cell phone and uses it to track her every move.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yW43JgoYPnSois2V0bIpFQFuDWl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:740441'),
  ('1054795631096854630', 'Unlocking Christmas', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Don McBrearty, Peter Benison', 'Joey Elkins, Blake Silver', 'Taylor Cole, Steve Lund, Elena Juatco, Darryl Hinds, Kathryn Greenwood, Ron Lea, Jennifer de Lucia, Jinny Wong', null, 'When a mysterious key and a holiday riddle arrive on their doorsteps, Kate and Kevin embark on a Christmas romance adventure they’ll never forget.', 'When a mysterious key and a holiday riddle arrive on their doorsteps, Kate and Kevin embark on a Christmas romance adventure they’ll never forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFhoJx9JJBea5ADYqCAC1WkMBlD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746476'),
  ('478362897429296468', 'Unlocking Sherlock', 2014, 'TV Movie, Documentary', 'Susannah Ward', null, 'Benedict Cumberbatch, Martin Freeman, Steven Moffat, Mark Gatiss, Andrew Scott, Lara Pulver', null, 'Explore how writers Steven Moffat and Mark Gatiss created the hit television sensation. Take a personal voyage through the versions of Holmes that have served as inspirations for the new series - the original stories, their factual origins, hundreds of film adaptations - to arrive at their thoroughly modern Sherlock. Moffat and Gatiss explain the challenges they encountered adapting the original adventures of the iconic super-sleuth. Go behind the scenes on the set of the hit television series, including interviews with actors Benedict Cumberbatch, Martin Freeman and Lara Pulver, who talk about the reinvention of their fictional characters.', 'Explore how writers Steven Moffat and Mark Gatiss created the hit television sensation. Take a personal voyage through the versions of Holmes that have served as inspirations for the new series - the original stories, their factual origins, hundreds of film adaptations - to arrive at their thoroughly modern Sherlock. Moffat and Gatiss explain the challenges they encountered adapting the original adventures of the iconic super-sleuth. Go behind the scenes on the set of the hit television series, including interviews with actors Benedict Cumberbatch, Martin Freeman and Lara Pulver, who talk about the reinvention of their fictional characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4EhHf6nktDotI9zfQzpfRNP2D3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253675'),
  ('1086506092458171496', 'Unlucky Monkey', 1998, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Michizô Kitô, SABU', 'SABU', 'Shinichi Tsutsumi, Hiroshi Shimizu, Akira Yamamoto, Ikko Suzuki, Kimika Yoshino, Susumu Terajima, Naomasa Musaka, Toshie Negishi', null, 'A dark and strange comedy about a bank robber with bad luck. Bungling a bank robbery turns out to be a profitable mistake for Yamazaki, an amateur crook who ends up with 80 million yen after a string of improbable accidents. But having so much cash doesn''t make his life is any easier. In fact, it gets much more complicated when Yamazaki stabs a hairdresser by mistake and instantly becomes a hunted fugitive. He''s just one unlucky monkey but can he turn his luck around?', 'A dark and strange comedy about a bank robber with bad luck. Bungling a bank robbery turns out to be a profitable mistake for Yamazaki, an amateur crook who ends up with 80 million yen after a string of improbable accidents. But having so much cash doesn''t make his life is any easier. In fact, it gets much more complicated when Yamazaki stabs a hairdresser by mistake and instantly becomes a hunted fugitive. He''s just one unlucky monkey but can he turn his luck around?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfoJpw5L9A5LAfYlXlrsLOTWsRX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104362'),
  ('803520629596507453', 'Unmade Beds', 2009, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Alexis Dos Santos, Rachel Dargavel, Mark Hedges', 'Alexis Dos Santos', 'Déborah François, Fernando Tielve, Michiel Huisman, Iddo Goldberg, Richard Lintern, Katia Winter, Alexis Dos Santos, Leonardo Brzezicki', 'NR', 'Axl wants to find his long-lost father and rediscover his past. Vera just wants to forget hers as she tries to move on from heartbreak. Their stories come together in the melting-pot of 21st century London.', 'Axl wants to find his long-lost father and rediscover his past. Vera just wants to forget hers as she tries to move on from heartbreak. Their stories come together in the melting-pot of 21st century London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gx7nLNLSgCJOvPhjP9bRLVEB8ma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36115'),
  ('371579527792777199', 'Unman, Wittering and Zigo', 1971, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama, Action', 'John Mackenzie, Geoffrey Unsworth', 'Simon Raven', 'David Hemmings, Douglas Wilmer, Tony Haygarth, Carolyn Seymour, Donald Gee, Hamilton Dyce, Barbara Lott, David Jackson', null, 'A new schoolteacher learns that the previous teacher was killed by his students, and he fears the same fate will befall him.', 'A new schoolteacher learns that the previous teacher was killed by his students, and he fears the same fate will befall him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xm9FjpAAFQXp38bBcnYWD2C9J9U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110419'),
  ('678523597119456599', 'Unmarried and Mother in Life', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Javier Aguirre, Manuel Rojas', 'José Luis Dibildos, Antonio Mingote', 'Lina Morgan, Alfredo Landa, Manolo Gómez Bur, Laly Soldevila, Soledad Miranda, José Sacristán, Gonzalo Cañas, Gloria Cámara', null, 'The frog test confirms Julita is pregnant. This is usually a great news. In this case, no. She is a victim of premarital sex, and he, Paco, a mechanic who, according to some theories of French biologist, explained by a podiatrist friend, will not be liable. Don Ramiro, the father of Julia, is a liberal-minded man, but when his daughter tells him that she will have a son who will not parent, seeking the solution of fatherhood in his gun regulation.', 'The frog test confirms Julita is pregnant. This is usually a great news. In this case, no. She is a victim of premarital sex, and he, Paco, a mechanic who, according to some theories of French biologist, explained by a podiatrist friend, will not be liable. Don Ramiro, the father of Julia, is a liberal-minded man, but when his daughter tells him that she will have a son who will not parent, seeking the solution of fatherhood in his gun regulation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkZZSVsXsobV6eB6tSWjiTfaUlH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132093'),
  ('18153482787595113', 'Unmarried Couples: A Comedy That Will Break You Up', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Peter Dalle, Esa Vuorinen', 'Peter Dalle', 'Lena Endre, Suzanne Reuter, Peter Dalle, Johan Ulveson, Gösta Ekman, Kicki Bramberg, Hans Henriksson, Ulf Kvensler', null, 'Marie and David are always arguing while their friends Sara and Samuel always seem to be happy together. Or are they? This year they decide to spend Christmas in the mountains together.', 'Marie and David are always arguing while their friends Sara and Samuel always seem to be happy together. Or are they? This year they decide to spend Christmas in the mountains together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlJlp7MZBTnIJzc3ZuHoxLAnGeP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53106'),
  ('734837064497550481', 'Unmasked', 1950, 'Crime', 'George Blair, Ellis W. Carter, Herbert E. Mendelson', 'Albert DeMond, Norman S. Hall', 'Robert Rockwell, Barbra Fuller, Raymond Burr, Hillary Brooke, Paul Harvey, Norman Budd, John Eldredge, Emory Parnell', 'NR', 'The editor of a sleazy tabloid newspaper has been borrowing money from his lover, the wife of a rich theatrical producer, and promises to marry her when she gets a divorce. However, the husband refuses to grant her a divorce, and takes back all the money and jewelry he has given her. The editor sees her husband leaving her apartment and, seeing his opportunity, kills her, takes all his IOUs (and the jewelry) and frames the husband for the murder.', 'The editor of a sleazy tabloid newspaper has been borrowing money from his lover, the wife of a rich theatrical producer, and promises to marry her when she gets a divorce. However, the husband refuses to grant her a divorce, and takes back all the money and jewelry he has given her. The editor sees her husband leaving her apartment and, seeing his opportunity, kills her, takes all his IOUs (and the jewelry) and frames the husband for the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/weGmEd6ZBOMFzJyJC6aCVqK3xtK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61032'),
  ('428409722581982125', 'Unmasked Part 25', 1989, 'Comedy, Horror, Romance', 'Anders Palm, John de Borman', 'Mark Cutforth', 'Gregory Cox, Edward Brayshaw, Fiona Evans, Debbie Lee London, Kim Fenton, Anna Conrich, Robin Welch, Gary Brown', null, 'Jackson is a lonely serial killer who is really beginning to question the point of all his killing. He is losing focus on why he started to kill in the first place. The future looks bleak until he meets a blind girl, Shelly, who begins to show him that life isn''t so bad. It is all up to Jackson to decide if he''s going to stop killing and start learning responsibility and think about finding a real job and starting a family.', 'Jackson is a lonely serial killer who is really beginning to question the point of all his killing. He is losing focus on why he started to kill in the first place. The future looks bleak until he meets a blind girl, Shelly, who begins to show him that life isn''t so bad. It is all up to Jackson to decide if he''s going to stop killing and start learning responsibility and think about finding a real job and starting a family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akJBc7wjbVECME7IveSzhPWJDQF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108878'),
  ('762507047933638943', 'Unmasking the Idol', 1986, 'Action, Adventure', 'Worth Keeter, Steven Shaw', 'Phil Behrens', 'Ian Hunter, Typhoon, C.K. Bibby, Ronald Campbell, Shakti Chen, Ed Grady, David Hagar, William T. Hicks', null, 'Duncan Jax must stop the evil terrorist Scarlet Leader from acquiring nuclear bombs that could start WW3. Together with the trusty baboon, Boon, he takes on the almost impossible mission! He must steal the gold that Scarlet leader plans to use to purchase the weapons of destruction.', 'Duncan Jax must stop the evil terrorist Scarlet Leader from acquiring nuclear bombs that could start WW3. Together with the trusty baboon, Boon, he takes on the almost impossible mission! He must steal the gold that Scarlet leader plans to use to purchase the weapons of destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgE7jcWcMNy9kseorIB6FzdOSrh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85385'),
  ('743269387166064562', 'Unnaipol Oruvan', 2009, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Chakri Toleti, Manoj Soni, Raaj Nadar', 'Kamal Haasan', 'Kamal Haasan, Mohanlal, Lakshmi, Ganesh Venkatraman, Bharath Reddy, Anuja Iyer, Poonam Kaur, Santhana Bharathi', null, 'A common man tries to fight terrorism by making anonymous calls to cops. Will he succeed ?', 'A common man tries to fight terrorism by making anonymous calls to cops. Will he succeed ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35GMJaA9VeW6gQY5jlruEu6WEF4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25121'),
  ('353016982345834187', 'Unnatural', 1952, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Romance, Horror', 'Arthur Maria Rabenalt, Heinz Terworth, Friedl Behn-Grund', 'Kurt Heuser', 'Hildegard Knef, Erich von Stroheim, Karlheinz Böhm, Harry Halm, Hans Cossy, Harry Meyen, Trude Hesterberg, Julia Koschka', null, 'In the 1800s, a stormy love relationship develops quickly between a young medical student and a woman believing herself to be the daughter of his scientist uncle, the student having never heard of her before their chance encounter and both unaware that she is the result of the scientist''s illegal experiments with artificial insemination..', 'In the 1800s, a stormy love relationship develops quickly between a young medical student and a woman believing herself to be the daughter of his scientist uncle, the student having never heard of her before their chance encounter and both unaware that she is the result of the scientist''s illegal experiments with artificial insemination..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9T8yyIROsNmggyeM4qAcoCBit0Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2971'),
  ('504280259871947570', 'Unnatural', 2015, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Hank Braxtan', 'Arch Stanton', 'James Remar, Sherilyn Fenn, Ron Carlson, Graham Greene, Allegra Carpenter, Ray Wise, Ivana Korab, Q''orianka Kilcher', null, 'Global climate change prompts a scientific corporation to genetically modify Alaskan polar bears with horrific and deadly results.', 'Global climate change prompts a scientific corporation to genetically modify Alaskan polar bears with horrific and deadly results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUPOptmk5dQE8LZBhn8u9qfTwfx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356483'),
  ('110703681452708164', 'Uno', 2004, 'Drama', 'Aksel Hennie, John Andreas Andersen, John Andreas Andersen', 'Aksel Hennie', 'Aksel Hennie, Nicolai Cleve Broch, Bjørn Floberg, Espen Juul Kristiansen, Ahmed Zeyan, Martin Skaug, Liv Bernhoft Osa, Khawar Gomi Sadiq', null, 'Best friends David and Morten work as gym instructors at Jarle''s gym. Jarle is a sadistic small-time criminal whom, together with his son Lars, purchase and distribute anabolic steroids.', 'Best friends David and Morten work as gym instructors at Jarle''s gym. Jarle is a sadistic small-time criminal whom, together with his son Lars, purchase and distribute anabolic steroids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DAmSxmj9ezpLN2xwKzl1WdOL3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18508'),
  ('697754074470232898', 'Uno bianca', 2001, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Michele Soavi', null, 'Kim Rossi Stuart, Dino Abbrescia, Valeria Milillo, Dario D''Ambrosi, Bruno Armando, Giorgio Crisafi, Massimo De Rossi, Claudio Botosso', null, 'Rimini, 1991. For more than a year, the uno bianca gang - they always use a white Fiat Uno - has plagued the area. Their crimes are violent, sometimes killing carabineri, and there''s no particular pattern: a bank one day, a petrol station the next, extortion of a small business the next. Are they terrorists? A foreign gang? Tied to the Mafia? After a particularly bloody shootout, two detectives are assigned to start fresh: they go through the notebooks of previous investigators and they interview a few witnesses again. They find a pattern in the crimes and predict the next assault, but the special task force in Bologna is dismissive. Can they carry on alone; how far will they get?', 'Rimini, 1991. For more than a year, the uno bianca gang - they always use a white Fiat Uno - has plagued the area. Their crimes are violent, sometimes killing carabineri, and there''s no particular pattern: a bank one day, a petrol station the next, extortion of a small business the next. Are they terrorists? A foreign gang? Tied to the Mafia? After a particularly bloody shootout, two detectives are assigned to start fresh: they go through the notebooks of previous investigators and they interview a few witnesses again. They find a pattern in the crimes and predict the next assault, but the special task force in Bologna is dismissive. Can they carry on alone; how far will they get?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOH8DzZIieH9NOJxF5LXxBe0HaZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130492');
